    "homepage_text": "Haoliang Li\nHaoliang Li\nI am an assistant professor at\nDepartment of Electrical Engineering\n, City University of Hong Kong. Before that, I was a Wallenberg-NTU Presidential Postdoc Fellow in the  Rapid-Rich Object Search Lab\nof Nanyang Technological University\n. I obtained my Ph.D. degree from NTU Singapore supervised by\nProf. Alex C. Kot.\nI am currently serving as an Associate Editor for IEEE Transactions on Information Forensics and Security, and IEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology, as well as an Action editor for Transactions on Machine Learning Research. Meanwhile, I am serving as Area Chair for some conferences such as NeurIPS, ICLR, ICML, CVPR, ICASSP.\nhaoliang.li[at]cityu.edu.hk\n[Google Scholar Profile]\nResearch\nI am broadly interested in AI security, multimedia forensics, and machine learning. My current research focuses on fake news detection, trustworthiness of LLM, transfer learning as well as its application in  AI4S, healthcare, circuit design, etc.\nSelected Publications\nBeyond Heuristic Prompting: A Concept-Guided Bayesian Framework for Zero-Shot Image Recognition\nHui Liu, Kecheng Chen, Jialiang Wang, Xianming Liu, Wenya Wang and\nHaoliang Li\nCVPR, 2026\nGeneralizable Dynamic Representation Learning for Source Identification in Sequential Data\nBo Ding, Tiexin Qin, Renjie Wan and\nHaoliang Li\nIEEE Transactions on  Knowledge and Data Engineering, 2026\nDynamically Perceived Forgery Conditional Diffusion Model for Scientific Image Tampering Localization\nJialing Xu, Peisong He,\nHaoliang Li\n, Shiqi Wang, Yi Zhang, and Xinghao Jiang\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology, 2026\nVariation-Bounded Loss for Noise-Tolerant Learning\nJialiang Wang, Xiong Zhou, Xianming Liu, Gangfeng Hu, Deming Zhai, Junjun Jiang,  and\nHaoliang Li\nAAAI, 2026\nLearning Dynamic Graph Embeddings with Neural Controlled Differential Equations\nTiexin Qin, Benjamin Walker, Terry Lyons, Hong Yan and\nHaoliang Li\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence, 2025\nLarge Language Models for Lossless Image Compression: Next-Pixel Prediction in Language Space is All You Need\nKecheng Chen, Pingping Zhang, Hui Liu, Jie Liu, Yibing Liu, Jiaxin Huang, Shiqi Wang, Hong Yan, and\nHaoliang Li\nNeurIPS, 2025\nSPACE: SPike-Aware Consistency Enhancement for Test-Time Adaptation in Spiking Neural Networks\nXinyu Luo, Kecheng Chen, Pao-Sheng Vincent Sun, Chris Xing Tian, Arindam Basu, and\nHaoliang Li\nNeurIPS, 2025\nMedChain: Bridging the Gap Between LLM Agents and Clinical Practice with Interactive Sequence\nJie Liu, Wenxuan Wang, Zizhan Ma, Guolin Huang, Yihang Su, Kao-Jung Chang, Wenting Chen,\nHaoliang Li\n, Linlin Shen, and Michael Lyu\nNeurIPS, 2025 (Spotlight)\nMoE-FFD: Mixture of Experts for Generalized and Parameter-Efficient Face Forgery Detection\nChenqi Kong, Anwei Luo, Peijun Bao, Yi Yu,\nHaoliang Li\n, Zengwei Zheng, Shiqi Wang, Alex C. Kot\nIEEE Transactions on Dependable and Secure Computing, 2025\nTest-time Adaptation for Foundation Medical Segmentation Model Without Parametric Updates\nKecheng Chen, Xinyu Luo, Tiexin Qin, Jie Liu, Hui Liu, Victor Ho Fun Lee, Hong Yan,\nHaoliang Li\nICCV, 2025 (Highlight)\nProject Page\nTemporal Unlearnable Examples: Preventing Personal Video Data from Unauthorized Exploitation by Object Tracking\nQiangqiang Wu, Yi Yu, Chenqi Kong, Ziquan Liu, Jia Wan,\nHaoliang Li\n, Alex C. Kot, Antoni B. Chan\nICCV, 2025\nGeneralizing to New Dynamical Systems via Frequency Domain Adaptation\nTiexin Qin, Hong Yan and\nHaoliang Li\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence, 2025\nUnraveling the Mechanics of Learning-Based Demonstration Selection for In-Context Learning\nHui Liu, Wenya Wang, Hao Sun, Chris Xing Tian, Chenqi Kong, Xin Dong, and\nHaoliang Li\nACL, 2025 (Oral)\nImage Provenance Analysis via Graph Encoding with Vision Transformer\nKeyang Zhang, Chenqi Kong, Shiqi Wang, Anderson Roc