    "homepage_text": "Weizhu Chen in Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nWeizhu Chen\nTechnical Fellow and CVP, Microsoft GenAI\nAbout\nI currently lead a modeling team in Microsoft GenAI. We are a product team working on large-scale (OpenAI and Microsoft) model training, including post-training, pre-training, and data.  We also publish some of our works, such as\nLoRA\n(opens in new tab)\n,\nDeBERTa\n(opens in new tab)\n,\nPhi\n(opens in new tab)\n,\nRho-1\n(opens in new tab)\n(best paper runner-up award in Neurips-2024).  Please check:\n‪Weizhu Chen‬ – ‪Google Scholar‬\n(opens in new tab)\nfor our recent works.\nOpens in a new tab\nResearch areas\nArtificial intelligence\nHuman language technologies\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on Instagram\nSubscribe to our RSS feed\nShare this page:\nShare on X\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nShare on Reddit\n\n---\n\nWeizhu Chen in Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nWeizhu Chen\nTechnical Fellow and CVP, Microsoft GenAI\nOther\nOpens in a new tab\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on Instagram\nSubscribe to our RSS feed\nShare this page:\nShare on X\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nShare on Reddit\n\n---\n\nWeizhu Chen in Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nWeizhu Chen\nTechnical Fellow and CVP, Microsoft GenAI\nOther\nOpens in a new tab\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on Instagram\nSubscribe to our RSS feed\nShare this page:\nShare on X\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nShare on Reddit\n\n---\n\nWeizhu Chen in Microsoft Research