    "homepage_text": "About - Yijun Tian\nYijun Tian\nResearcher @ AWS AI Lab\nFollow\nBay Area, United States\nmeetyijun@gmail.com\nGoogle Scholar\nLinkedIn\nGithub\nAbout\nI am currently an AI Researcher at Amazon AWS AI Lab. My research focuses on Large Language Models, Generative AI, and Graph ML. I have published 40+ papers featured with awards at leading conferences in machine learning (ICLR, ICML, NeurIPS), artificial intelligence (AAAI, IJCAI), natural language processing (ACL, EMNLP), and data mining (WWW, KDD). I actively contribute to the research community by organizing numerous tutorials and serving as a session chair for various conferences.\nI obtained my Ph.D. in Computer Science from the University of Notre Dame, advised by Nitesh Chawla, AAAI/ACM/IEEE/AAAS Fellow. Before that, I earned my Master’s at New York University and my Bachelor’s at Shandong University, both in Computer Science.\nFeel free to connect with me on\nLinkedIn\nand check my papers on\nGoogle Scholar\n.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected."
  },
  "deep_homepage::Chuxu Zhang::https://chuxuzhang.github.io/": {
    "homepage": "https://chuxuzhang.github.io/",
