    "homepage_text": "Tong Zhang's Homepage\nTong Zhang\nå¼ æ½¼\nAbout Me\nResearch\nPublications\nBook\nGroup\nTeaching\nCopyright Tong Zhang\nTong Zhang\nShort Bio:\nTong Zhang is a professor of\nComputer\n\t\t\t\t      Science\nat\nUniversity of Illinois Urbana-Champaign\n. \n\t\t\t\t      Previously, he was a professor\n\t\t\t\t      at the Hong Kong University of Science and Technology, Rutgers university, and\n\t\t\t\t      worked at IBM, Yahoo, Google, Baidu, and Tencent.\nTong Zhang's research interests include\n\t\t\t\t      machine learning algorithms and\n\t\t\t\t      theory, statistical methods for\n\t\t\t\t      big data and their applications.\n\t\t\t\t      \n\t\t\t\t      He is a fellow of ASA, IEEE,\n\t\t\t\t      and IMS, and he has been in the\n\t\t\t\t      editorial boards of leading\n\t\t\t\t      machine learning journals and\n\t\t\t\t      program committees of top\n\t\t\t\t      machine learning\n\t\t\t\t      conferences.\nTong Zhang received a B.A. in mathematics and computer science from Cornell University and a Ph.D. in Computer Science from Stanford University.\nContact:\n2118 Siebel Center\n201 N Goodwin Ave\nUrbana, IL 61801, USA\n(217)244-6449\nEmail: tongzhang AT tongzhang-ml DOT org\nPositions\n2024-current\nProfessor\nUniversity of Illinois Urbana-Champaign\nPreviously\nProfessor\nThe Hong Kong University of Science and Technology\nRutgers University\nDirector of Research\nTencent , Baidu Inc\nResearch Scientist\nYahoo Inc , IBM\nEducation\nPh.D.\n1999\nPh.D. in Computer Science\nStanford University\nM.S.\n1996\nM.S. in Computer Science\nStanford University\nB.A.\n1994\nM.A. in Computer Science and Mathematics\nCornell University"
  },
