    "homepage_text": "Kuan Li Homepage - Kuan Li / 李宽\nKuan Li / 李宽\nSimplicity is the ultimate sophistication\nFollow\nHong Kong, China\nEmail\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nKuan Li Homepage\nAbout Me\nI am currently a second-year PhD student at CSE HKUST under the supervision of Prof.\nMinhao Cheng\nand Prof.\nShuai Wang\n. I obtained my M.E. degree from Institute of Computing Technology, Chinese Academy of Sciences (ICT, CAS) supervised by Prof.\nXiang Ao\n, and completed my B.E. degree in Electrical Engineering and Automation at Beihang University.\nDoing post-training (especially data synthesis and RL) in\nTongyi DeepResearch\nContact information\nEmail: likuan.ppd@gmail.com\nResearch interests\nMy research interests lie in agent learning and machine learning on graphs. Currently, my work focuses on LLM agents, particularly on developing efficient methods to enable LLMs to leverage external tools for solving tasks that they cannot complete autonomously.\nPublications\nWebSailor-V2: Bridging the Chasm to Proprietary Agents via Synthetic Data and Scalable Reinforcement Learning\nKuan Li*\n, Zhongwang Zhang*, Huifeng Yin*, Rui Ye*, Yida Zhao*, Liwen Zhang*, Litu Ou, Dingchu Zhang, Xixi Wu, Jialong Wu, Xinyu Wang, Zile Qiao, Zhen Zhang, Yong Jiang, Pengjun Xie, Fei Huang, Zhi-Qin John Xu, Shuai Wang, Minhao Cheng, Jingren Zhou\".\nIn\narXiv\n2025.\n[Download paper]\n[code]\nReSum: Unlocking Long-Horizon Search Intelligence via Context Summarization\nXixi Wu*,\nKuan Li*\n, Yida Zhao, Liwen Zhang, Litu Ou, Huifeng Yin, Zhongwang Zhang, Yong Jiang, Pengjun Xie, Fei Huang, Minhao Cheng, Shuai Wang, Hong Cheng, Jingren Zhou\".\nIn\narXiv\n2025.\n[Download paper]\n[code]\nScaling Agents via Continual Pre-training\nLiangcai Su, Zhen Zhang, Guangyu Li, Zhuo Chen, Chenxi Wang, Maojia Song, Xinyu Wang,\nKuan Li\n, Jialong Wu, Xuanzhong Chen, Zile Qiao, Zhongwang Zhang, Huifeng Yin, Shihao Cai, Runnan Fang, Zhengwei Tao, Wenbiao Yin, Chenxiong Qian, Yong Jiang, Pengjun Xie, Fei Huang, Jingren Zhou.\nIn\narXiv\n2025.\n[Download paper]\n[code]\nWebResearcher: Unleashing unbounded reasoning capability in Long-Horizon Agents\nZile Qiao, Guoxin Chen, Xuanzhong Chen, Donglei Yu, Wenbiao Yin, Xinyu Wang, Zhen Zhang, Baixuan Li, Huifeng Yin,\nKuan Li\n, Rui Min, Minpeng Liao, Yong Jiang, Pengjun Xie, Fei Huang, Jingren Zhou.\nIn\narXiv\n2025.\n[Download paper]\n[code]\nWebShaper: Agentically Data Synthesizing via Information-Seeking Formalization\nZhengwei Tao, Jialong Wu, Wenbiao Yin, Liwen Zhang, Xinyu Wang, Junkai Zhang, Baixuan Li, Haiyang Shen,\nKuan Li\n, Yong Jiang, Pengjun Xie, Fei Huang, Jingren Zhou.\nIn\narXiv\n2025.\n[Download paper]\n[code]\nWebSailor: Navigating Super-human Reasoning for Web Agent\nKuan Li*\n, Zhongwang Zhang*, Huifeng Yin*, Liwen Zhang*, Litu Ou*, Jialong Wu, Wenbiao Yin, Baixuan Li, Zhengwei Tao, Xinyu Wang, Weizhou Shen, Junkai Zhang, Dingchu Zhang, Xixi Wu, Yong Jiang, Ming Yan, Pengjun Xie, Fei Huang, Zhi-Qin John Xu, Shuai Wang, Minhao Cheng, Jingren Zhou.\nIn\narXiv\n2025.\n[Download paper]\n[code]\nLaRA: Benchmarking Retrieval-Augmented Generation and Long-Context LLMs – No Silver Bullet for LC or RAG Routing\nKuan Li\n, Liwen Zhang, Yong Jiang, Pengjun Xie, Fei Huang, Shuai Wang, Minhao Cheng.\nIn\nICML\n2025.\n[Download paper]\n[code]\nBoosting the Adversarial Robustness of Graph Neural Networks: An OOD Perspective\nKuan Li\n, YiWen Chen, Yang Liu, Jin Wang, Qing He, Minhao Cheng, Xiang Ao.\nIn\nICLR\n2024.\n[Download paper]\n[code]\nFLOOD: A Flexible Invariant Learning Framework for Out-of-Distribution Generalization on Graphs\nYang Liu, Xiang Ao, Fuli Feng, Yunshan Ma,\nKuan Li\n, Tat-Seng Chua, Qing He.\nIn\nKDD\n2023.\n[Download paper]\nRevisiting Graph Adversarial Attack and Defense From a Data Distribution Perspective\nKuan Li\n, Yang Liu, Qing He, Xiang Ao.\nIn\nICLR\n2023.\n[Download paper]\n[code]\nReliable Representations Make A Stronger Defender: Unsupervised Structure Refinement for Robust GNN\nKuan Li\n, Yang Liu, Xiang Ao, Jianfeng Chi, Jinghua Feng, Hao Yang, Qing He.\nIn\nKDD\n2022.\n[Download paper]\n[code]\nAUC-oriented Graph Neural Network for Fraud Detection\nMengda Huang, Yang Liu, Xiang Ao,\nKuan Li\n, Jianfeng Chi, Jinghua Feng, Yang Hao and Qing He.\nIn\nWWW\n2022.\n[Download paper]\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected."
