    "homepage_text": "Qing He\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nQing He\nWelcome to my page !\nI am an early career\nresearcher at River and Environmental Engineering Laboratory, The University of Tokyo.\nI am enthusiastic to explore unresolved questions about the natural hydrological processes and their relevance to human society.\nMy research topics include remote sensing of soil moisture, land surface modeling, groundwater modeling, and human-water interactions.\nContact me:\nheqing@g.ecc.u-tokyo.ac.jp\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
  },
