    "homepage_text": "Jingjing Liu\nJingjing Liu\nResearch Scientist\nMIT CSAIL (Computer Science and Artificial Intelligence Laboratory)\nSpoken Language Systems Group\nResearch Interests: spoken language systems, natural language processing, information retrieval\nReceived the Ph.D. degree in Computer Science from MIT in 2011\nAddress: The Stata Center, 32 Vassar Street, Cambridge, MA 02139, U.S.A.\nE-mail:\njingl@csail.mit.edu\nPublications:\nJingjing Liu, Panupong Pasupat, Yining Wang, Scott Cyphers, and Jim Glass,\nQuery Understanding Enhanced by Hierarchical Parsing Structures\n, ASRU 2013.\nJingjing Liu, Panupong Pasupat, Scott Cyphers, and Jim Glass,\nASGARD: a Portable Architecture for Multilingual Dialogue Systems\n, ICASSP 2013.\nJingjing Liu, Stephanie Seneff, and Victor Zue,\nHarvesting and Summarizing User-Generated Content for Advanced Speech-Based Human-Computer Interaction\n, Special Issue on Advances in Spoken Dialogue Systems and Mobile Interfaces -- Theory and Applications: IEEE Journal of Selected Topics in Signal Processing (JSTSP) 2012.\nJingjing Liu, Scott Cyphers, Panupong Pasupat, Ian Mcgraw, and Jim Glass,\nA Conversational Movie Search System Based on Conditional Random Fields\n, Interspeech, 2012.\nJingjing Liu,\nHarvesting and Summarizing User-Generated Content for Advanced Speech-Based Human-Computer Interaction\n,  Ph.D. thesis, MIT Department of Electrical Engineering and Computer Science, February 2012.\nJingjing Liu and Stephanie Seneff,\nA Dialogue System for Accessing Drug Reviews\n, ASRU, 2011.\nJingjing Liu, Alice Li, and Stephanie Seneff,\nAutomatic Drug Side Effect Discovery from Online Patient-Submitted Reviews: Focus on Statin Drugs\n, IMMM, 2011.\nJingjing Liu, Xiao Li, Alex Acero, and Ye-Yi Wang,\nLexicon Modeling for Query Understanding\n, ICASSP, 2011.\nJingjing Liu, Stephanie Seneff, and Victor Zue,\nUtilizing Review Summarization in a Spoken Recommendation System\n, SIGDIAL, 2010.\nJingjing Liu, Stephanie Seneff, and Victor Zue,\nDialogue-Oriented Review Summary Generation for Spoken Dialogue Recommendation Systems\n, NAACL-HLT, 2010.\nJingjing Liu and Stephanie Seneff,\nReview Sentiment Scoring via a Parse-and-Paraphrase Paradigm\n, EMNLP, 2009.\nJingjing Liu, Yushi Xu, Stephanie Seneff, and Victor Zue,\nCityBrowser II: A Multimodal Restaurant Guide in Mandarin\n, ISCSLP, 2008.\nJingjing Liu, Wei Lai, Xian-Sheng Hua, Yalou Huang, Shipeng Li,\nVideo Search Re-ranking via Multi-Graph Propagation\n, ACM Multimedia, 2007.\nJingjing Liu, Xian-Sheng Hua, Shipeng Li,\nObject-Sensitive Query Analysis for Video Search\n, MMSP, 2007.\nJingjing Liu, Yalou Huang, Dong Li, Fanghao Wu, Bin Li,\nDJ DreamFactory\n, ACM Multimedia, 2007.\nJingjing Liu, Yalou Huang, Dong Li, Fanghao Wu, Bin Li,\nA Web-Based Aggregated Platform for User-Contributed Interactive Media Broadcasting\n, ACM Multimedia, 2007.\nJingjing Liu, Yunbo Cao, Chin-Yew Lin, Yalou Huang, Ming Zhou,\nLow-Quality Product Review Detection in Opinion Summarization\n, EMNLP, 2007.\nJingjing Liu, Yunbo Cao, Yalou Huang,\nEffective Entity Resolution in Product Review Domain\n, ICMLC, 2007.\nStephanie Seneff, Robert M. Davidson, and Jingjing Liu,\nEmpirical Data Confirm Autism Symptoms Related to Aluminum and Acetaminophen Exposure\n, Entropy 2012.\nStephanie Seneff, Robert M. Davidson, and Jingjing Liu,\nIs Cholesterol Sulfate Deficiency a Common Factor in Preeclampsia, Autism, and Pernicious Anemia?\n, Entropy 2012.\nIan Mcgraw, Scott Cyphers, Panupong Pasupat, Jingjing Liu, and Jim Glass,\nAutomating Crowd-supervised Learning for Spoken Language Systems\n, Interspeech, 2012.\nYushi Xu, Jingjing Liu, Stephanie Seneff,\nMandarin Language Understanding in Dialogue Context\n, ISCSLP, 2008.\nYunbo Cao, Jingjing Liu, Shenghua Bao, Hang Li, Nick Craswell,\nA Two-Stage Model for Expert Search\n, no. MSR-TR-2008-143, pp. 16, Microsoft Research, Oct. 2008\nT. Mei , X. Hua , W. Lai , L. Yang, Z. Zha, Y. Liu, Z. Gu, G. Qi, M. Wang, J. Tang, X. Yuan, Z. Lu, and J. Liu,\nMSRA-USTC-SJTU at TRECVID 2007: High-Level Feature Extraction and Search\n, Proceeding of TRECVID, 2007.\nGuoping Hu, Jingjing Liu, Hang Li, Yunbo Cao, Jian-Yun Nie and Jianfeng Gao,\nA Supervised Learning Approach to Entity Search\n, AIRS, 2006.\nYunbo Cao, Jingjing Liu, Shenghua Bao, Hang Li,\nResearch on Expert Search at Enterprise Track of TREC 2005\n, Proceeding of TREC, 2005.\nTechnical Reviewer & Program Committee:\nIEEE Transactions on Audio, Speech and Language Processing 2013\nInterspeech 2013 Session Chair\nThe 9th Asia Information Retrieval Societies Conference (AIRS) 2013\nThe 14th Annual Conference of the International Speech Communication Association (Interspeech) 2013\nThe 51st Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (ACL) 2013\nMultimedia Tools and Applications 2013\nInterspeech 2012 Session Chair\nComputer Speech and Language 2012\nIEEE Transactions on Audio, Speech and Language Processing 2012\nJournal of Computer Science and Technology 2012\nMultimedia Tools and Applications 2012\nEURASIP Journal on Audio, Speech, and Music Processing 2012\nThe 8th Asia Information Retrieval Societies Conference (AIRS) 2012\nThe 13th Annual Conference of the International Speech Communication Association (Interspeech) 2012\nMultimedia Tools and Applications 2011\nACM Transactions on Intelligent Systems and Technology 2011\nThe 49th Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics: Human Language Technologies (ACL-HLT) 2011\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology 2010\nMultimedia Tools and Applications 2010\nThe 15th Conference on Empirical Methods on Natural Language Processing (EMNLP) 2010\nIEEE Intelligent Systems 2009"
