    "homepage_text": "Shuang Li's (李爽) Homepage\nHomepage\nHome\nPublications\nActivities\nStudents\nmore...\nShuang Li (\n李爽\n)\nAssociate\r\n                                                            Professor (Tenure Track), PhD Supervisor\nSchool of Artificial Intelligence\nBeihang University\nRoom 1104, Block C of New Main Building, Beijing, China\nEmail:\nshuangliai@buaa.edu.cn\n[\nGitHub\n]\r\n                                                         \r\n                                                        [\nGoogle Scholar\n]  \r\n                                                        [\nResearchGate\n]  \r\n                                                        [\ndblp\n]\nResearch Interests\nDeep Learning, Transfer Learning, Multimodal Learning, Analysis and Application of LLM.\nResearch Experience\nIntern, Microsoft Research Asia (MSRA), 11/2016 - 02/2017\nVisiting Scholar, Cornell University, 11/2015 - 06/2016\nAdvisor: Prof.\nKilian Weinberger\nAssistant Professor, Beijing Institute of Technology (BIT), 07/2018 - 07/2022\nAssociate Professor, Beijing Institute of Technology (BIT), 07/2022 - 07/2024\nAssociate Professor, Beihang University (BUAA), 07/2024 - Now\nEducation Background\nPh.D., Tsinghua University, Sep.\r\n                                                                    2012 - Jun. 2018\nDepartment of\r\n                                                                Automation, Tsinghua University\nAdvisor:\r\n                                                                    Prof.\nShiji\r\n                                                                        Song\n(宋士吉)\nB.E., Northeastern University, Sep.\r\n                                                                    2008 - Jun. 2012\nAutomation,\r\n                                                                Northeastern University\nPublications\n(* denotes corresponding author)\n2026\n[C1] Mingxuan Zhou,\nShuang Li*\n, Yutang Zhang, Jing Geng, Yirui Shen, Jingxuan Kang, Fuzhen Zhuang, Shuigen Wang.\r\n\r\n         \"Thermal Diffusion Matters: Infrared Spatial-Temporal Video Super-Resolution through Heat Conduction Priors\",\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR)\n, 2026,\nCCF-A\n.\n[C2] Wei Chen, Xingyu Guo,\nShuang Li*\n, Zhao Zhang, Yan Zhong, Fuzhen Zhuang, Deqing wang.\r\n                                                            \r\n        \"Learning Adaptive Distribution Alignment with Neural Characteristic Function for Graph Domain Adaptation\",\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR)\n, 2026,\nTHCPL-A\n.\n[C3] Wei Chen, Xingyu Guo,\nShuang Li\n, Yan Zhong, Zhao Zhang, Fuzhen Zhuang, Hongrui Liu, Libang Zhang, Guo Ye, Huimei He.\r\n                                                            \r\n        \"Learning Structure-Semantic Evolution Trajectories for Graph Domain Adaptation\",\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR)\n, 2026,\nTHCPL-A\n.\n[C4] Mingxuan Zhou, Yirui Shen,\nShuang Li*\n, Jing Geng, Yutang Zhang, Shuigen Wang. \r\n        \r\n        “Thermal-Physics Guided Infrared Image Super-Resolution with Dynamic High-Frequency Amplification”,\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI)\n, 2026,\nCCF-A\n.\n[C5] Qingju Guo,\nShuang Li*\n, Binhui Xie, Jing Geng, Wei Li. \r\n     \r\n     “SPSC: Sparse and Scalable Multi-model 3D Occupancy Prediction for Autonomous Driving”,\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI)\n, 2026,\nCCF-A\n.\n[C6] Qingju Guo,\nShuang Li*\n, Jing Geng, Binhui Xie, Jiawei Shan, Wei Li. \r\n     \r\n     “Cluster-based Pseudo-labeling for Semi-Supervised LiDAR Semantic Segmentation”,\nWinter Conference on Applications of Computer Vision (WACV)\n, 2026.\n[J1] Zecheng Hao, Wenxuan Ma, Yufeng Cui,\nShuang Li\n, Xinlong Wang, Tiejun Huang. \r\n     \r\n     “MIRA: Multi-view Information Retrieval with Adaptive Routing for Test-time Long-video Comprehension”,\nTransactions on Machine Learning Research (TMLR)\n, 2026.\n2025\n[C1] Zhuo He,\nShuang Li*\n, Wenze Song, Longhui Yuan, Jian Liang, Han Li, Kun Gai. \r\n            \r\n            “Learning Time-Aware Causal Representation for Model Generalization in Evolving Domains”,\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (ICML)\n, 2025,\nCCF-A\n.\r\n               [\npaper\n]\n[C2] Lincan Cai, Jingxuan Kang,\nShuang Li*\n, Wenxuan Ma, Binhui Xie, Zhida Qin, Jian Liang. \r\n            \r\n            “From Local Details to Global Context: Advancing Vision-Language Models with Attention-Based Selection”,\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (ICML)\n, 2025,\nCCF-A\n.\r\n                [\npaper\n]\n[C3] Xufeng Liang, Zhida Qin, Pengzhan Zhou,\nShuang Li\n, Tianyu Huang. \r\n            \r\n            “Dual-GT: Dual-scale Spatial Dependency for Grid-Based Traffic Flow Prediction”,\nIEEE Conference on Computer Communications (INFOCOM)\n, 2025,\nCCF-A\n.\r\n                [\npaper\n]\n[C4] Haoyan Fu, Zhida Qin, Shixiao Yang, Zhang Haoyao, Bin Lu,\nShuang Li\n, Tianyu Huang, John C.S. Lui. \r\n            \r\n            “Time Matters: Enhancing Sequential Recommendations with Time-Guided Graph Neural ODEs”,\nSIGKDD Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining (KDD)\n, 2025,\nCCF-A\n.\r\n                [\npaper\n]\n[J1] Jun Fu, Xianrui Ji, Dexiong Chen, Guosheng Hu,\nShuang Li\n, Xiating Feng. \r\n            \r\n            “AdvMixup: Adversarial Mixup Regularization for Deep Learning”,\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (TNNLS)\n, 2025,\nSCI 1区\n.\r\n     \r\n            [\npaper\n]\n[J2] Haoyao Zhang, Zhida Qin, Xufeng Liang, Jing Guo,\nShuang Li\n, Tianyu Huang, John C.S. Lui. \r\n            \r\n            “Beyond Texts: Incorporating Co-occurrences into the Review-based Conversation Recommendation Systems”,\nACM Transactions on Information Systems (TOIS)\n, 2025,\nCCF-A\n.\n[J3] Jun Fu, Xuanhao Xu, Xiaojuan Zhang,\nShuang Li\n, Dali Chen. \r\n            \r\n            “Variational Disentangled Graph Auto-Encoders for Link Prediction”,\nIEEE Transactions on Network Science and Engineering (TNSE)\n, 2025,\nSCI 1区\n.\r\n          \r\n            [\npaper\n]\n2024\n[C1] Mingjia Li,\nShuang Li*\n, Tongrui Su, Longhui Yuan, Jian Liang, Wei Li.  “Exploring Structured Semantic Priors Underlying Diffusion Score for Test-time Adaptation”,\nNeural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS)\n, 2024,\nCCF-A\n.\r\n                                            [\npaper\n]\n[\ncode\n]\n[C2] Mixue Xie,\nShuang Li*\n, Binhui Xie, Chi Harold Liu, Jian Liang, Zixun Sun, Ke Feng, Chengwei Zhu. “Weight Diffusion for Future: Learn to Generalize in Non-Stationary Environments”,\nNeural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS)\n, 2024,\nCCF-A\n.\r\n                                            [\npaper\n]\n[\ncode\n]\n[C3] Lincan Cai,\nShuang Li*\n, Wenxuan Ma, Jingxuan Kang, Binhui Xie, Zixun Sun, Chengwei Zhu. “Enhancing Cross-Modal Fine-Tuning with Gradually Intermediate Modality Generation”,\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (ICML)\n, 2024,\nCCF-A\n.\r\n                            [\npaper\n]\n[\ncode\n]\n[C4] Wenxuan Ma,\nShuang Li*\n, Lincan Cai, Jingxuan Kang. “Learning Modality Knowledge Alignment for Cross-Modality Transfer”,\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (ICML)\n, 2024,\nCCF-A\n.\r\n                            [\npaper\n]\n[J1] Shugang Li, Renhu Bu,\nShuang Li*\n, Chi Harold Liu, Keke Huang. “Principal Properties Attention Matching for Partial Domain Adaptation in Fault Diagnosis”,\nIEEE Transactions on Instrumentation and Measurement (TIM)\n, 2024,\nSCI 2区\n.                     \r\n                     [\npaper\n]\n[J2] Weibo Gao, Hang Li*, Jingxian Yang, Jinming Zhang, Rongxin Fu, Jiaxi Peng, Yechen Hu, Yitong Liu, Yingshi Wang,\nShuang Li*\n, Shuailong Zhang*. “Machine Learning Assisted MALDI Mass Spectrometry for Rapid Antimicrobial Resistance Prediction in Clinicals”,\nAnalytical Chemistry\n, 2024\n.                     \r\n                     [\npaper\n]\n2023\n[C1] Binhui Xie,\nShuang Li*\n, Qingju Guo, Chi Harold Liu, Xinjing Cheng. \r\n                                                                \r\n                                                                \"Annotator: A Generic Active Learning Baseline for LiDAR Semantic Segmentation\",\nNeural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS)\n, 2023,\nCCF-A\n.\r\n                                                                \r\n                                                                [\npaper\n]\n[\ncode\n]\n[C2] Mixue Xie,\nShuang Li*\n, Longhui Yuan, Chi Harold Liu, Zehui Dai. \r\n                                                             \r\n                                                             \"Evolving Standardization for Continual Domain Generalization over Temporal Drift\",\nNeural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS)\n, 2023,\nCCF-A\n.\r\n                                                             \r\n                                                             [\npaper\n]\n[\ncode\n]\n[C3] Wenxuan Ma,\nShuang Li*\n, Lincan Cai, Jingxuan Kang. \r\n                                                          \r\n                                                          \"Language Semantic Graph Guided Data-Efficient Learning\",\nNeural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS)\n, 2023,\nCCF-A\n.\r\n                                                          \r\n                                                          [\npaper\n]\n[\ncode\n]\n[C4] Yirui Shen, Jingxuan Kang,\nShuang Li*\n, Zhenjie Yu, Shuigen Wang.\r\n\r\n                                                                \"Style Transfer Meets Super-Resolution: Advancing Unpaired  Infrared-to-Visible Image Translation with Detail Enhancement\",\nACM Multimedia (ACM MM)\n, 2023,\nCCF-A\n.\r\n\r\n                                                                [\npaper\n]\n[\ncode\n]\n[C5] Wenxuan Ma,\nShuang Li*\n, Jinming Zhang, Chi Harold Liu, Jingxuan Kang, Yulin Wang, Gao Huang.\r\n\r\n                                                                \"Borrowing Knowledge From Pre-trained Language Model: A New Data-efficient Visual Learning Paradigm\",\nInternational Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV)\n, 2023,\nCCF-A\n.\r\n\r\n                                                                [\npaper\n]\n[\ncode\n]\n[C6] Zhenjie Yu,\nShuang Li*\n, Yirui Shen, Chi Harold Liu, Shuigen Wang.\r\n\r\n                                                                 \"On the Difficulty of Unpaired Infrared-to-Visible Video Translation: Fine-Grained Content-Rich Patches Transfer\",\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR)\n, 2023,\nCCF-A\n.\r\n\r\n                                                                [\npaper\n]\n[\ncode\n]\n[C7] Fangrui Lv, Jian Liang,\nShuang Li*\n, Jinming Zhang, Di Liu.\r\n\r\n                                                                \"Improving Generalization with Domain Convex Game\",\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR)\n, 2023,\nCCF-A\n.\r\n\r\n                                                                [\npaper\n]\n[\ncode\n]\n[C8] Longhui Yuan, Binhui Xie,\nShuang Li*\n.\r\n                                                              \r\n                                                            \"Robust Test-Time Adaptation in Dynamic Scenarios\",\nIEEE  Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR)\n, 2023,\nCCF-A\n.\r\n                                                            \r\n                                                            [\npaper\n]\n[\ncode\n]\n[C9] Mixue Xie,\nShuang Li*\n, Rui Zhang, Chi Harold Liu. \r\n                                                            \r\n                                                            \"Dirichlet-based Uncertainty Calibration for Active Domain Adaptation\",\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR)\n, 2023, (\nSpotlight\n),\nTHCPL-A\n.\r\n\r\n                                                            [\npaper\n] \r\n                                                            \r\n                                                            [\ncode\n]\n[C10] Mingjia Li, Binhui Xie,\nShuang Li*\n, Chi Harold Liu, Xinjing Cheng. \r\n                                                            \r\n                                                            \"VBLC: Visibility Boosting and Logit-Constraint Learning for Domain Adaptive Semantic Segmentation under Adverse Conditions\",\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI)\n, 2023, (\nOral Presentation\n),\nCCF-A\n.\r\n                                                            \r\n                                                            [\npaper\n] \r\n                                                            \r\n                                                            [\ncode\n]\n[J1] Binhui Xie,\nShuang Li*\n, Mingjia Li, Chi Harold Liu, Gao Huang, Guoren Wang.\r\n\r\n                                                            “SePiCo: Semantic-Guided Pixel Contrast for Domain Adaptive Semantic Segmentation”,\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (TPAMI)\n, 2023, (\nESI Highly Cited Paper\n),\nSCI 1区,\nCCF-A\n.\r\n                                                            \r\n                                                            [\npaper\n]\r\n                                                                        \r\n                                                            [\ncode\n]\n[J2] Mixue Xie,\nShuang Li*\n, Kaixiong Gong, Yulin Wang, Gao Huang.\r\n\r\n                                                        “Adapting Across Domains via Target-oriented Transferable Semantic Augmentation under Prototype Constraint”,\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision (IJCV)\n, 2023,\nSCI 1区,\nCCF-A\n.\n[J3]\nShuang Li\n, Rui Zhang, Kaixiong Gong, Mixue Xie, Wenxuan Ma, an