Zimmermann\n,\nLi Cheng\n(2019).\nTowards Natural and Accurate Future Motion Prediction of Humans and Animals\n.\nIn\nCVPR\n.\nPDF\nCode\nQi Liu\n,\nMiltiadis Allamanis\n,\nMarc Brockschmidt\n,\nAlexander L. Gaunt\n(2018).\nConstrained Graph Variational Autoencoders for Molecule Design\n.\nIn\nNeurIPS\n.\nPDF\nCode\nYue Zhang\n,\nQi Liu\n,\nLinfeng Song\n(2018).\nSentence-State LSTM for Text Representation\n.\nIn\nACL\n.\nPDF\nCode\nQi Liu\n,\nYue Zhang\n(2018).\nMining Evidences for Concept Stock Recommendation\n.\nIn\nNAACL\n.\nPDF\nCode\nQi Liu\n,\nYue Zhang\n,\nJiangming Liu\n(2018).\nLearning Domain-specific Representations for Multi-Domain Sentiment Classification\n.\nIn\nNAACL\n.\nPDF\nCode\nQi Liu\n,\nYue Zhang\n,\nZhenguang Liu\n,\nYe Yuan\n,\nLi Cheng\n,\nRoger Zimmermann\n(2018).\nMulti-modal Multi-task Learning for Automatic Dietary Assessment\n.\nIn\nAAAI\n.\nPDF\nYixuan Tang\n,\nWeilong Huang\n,\nQi Liu\n,\nAnthony K.H. Tung\n,\nXiaoli Wang\n,\nJisong Yang\n,\nBeibei Zhang\n(2017).\nQALink: Enrich Text Documents with Relevant Q&A Site Contents\n.\nIn\nCIKM\n.\nPDF\nYang Li\n,\nKai Zheng\n,\nYing Yan\n,\nQi Liu\n,\nXiaofang Zhou\n(2017).\nEtherQL: A Query Layer for Blockchain\n.\nIn\nDASFAA\n.\nPDF\nCode\nZhenguang Liu\n,\nYingjie Xia\n,\nQi Liu\n,\nQinming He\n,\nYanxiang Chen\n,\nRoger Zimmermann\n(2017).\nTowards Personalized Activity Level Prediction in Community Question Answering Websites\n.\nIn\nTOMM\n.\nPDF\nButian Huang\n,\nZhenguang Liu\n,\nJianhai Chen\n,\nAnan Liu\n,\nQi Liu\n,\nQinming He\n(2017).\nBehavior Pattern Clustering in Blockchain Networks\n.\nIn\nMTAP\n.\nPDF\nZhenguang Liu\n,\nLuming Zhang\n,\nQi Liu\n,\nYifang Yin\n,\nLi Cheng\n,\nRoger Zimmermann\n(2016).\nFusion of Magnetic and Visual Sensors for Indoor Localization: Infrastructure-free and More Effective\n.\nIn\nTMM\n.\nPDF\nShubham Goyal\n,\nQi Liu\n,\nKhairina Tajul-Arifin\n,\nWaqas Awan\n,\nBimlesh Wadhwa\n,\nZhenguang Liu\n(2016).\nI Ate This: A Photo-based Food Journalin