    "homepage_text": "Cheng Tan | Home\nCheng Tan\nResearcher, Shanghai AI Laboratory\nchengtan9907 [AT] gmail.com\nBio\nI am a researcher in\nOpenDataLab\nat Shanghai AI Laboratory. I obtained my PhD degree from Zhejiang University & Westlake University in 2025, advised by\nStan Z. Li\n. My research focuses on AI for Science and scientific reasoning model.\nLooking forward to any academic communications and feel free to contact me!\nNews\n[2026/02] Three corresponding author papers on\nMultimodal reasoning\n, are accepted by\nCVPR 2026\n.\n[2026/01] One corresponding author paper on\nLLM + Protein\n, is accepted by\nICLR 2026\n.\n[2026/01] One co-first author paper on\nSingle cell foundation model\n, is accepted by\nNature Communications\n.\n[2025/09] One first author paper on\nAlphaFold database\n, is accepted by\nNeurIPS 2025\n.\n[2025/07] I have joined in Shanghai AI Laboratory as a Researcher.\n[2025/07] One paper on\nScientific reasoning\n, is accepted by\nACM Multimedia\n.\n[2025/04] One co-first author paper on,\nCryo-EM structure determination\n, is accepted by\nNature Machine Intelligence\n.\n[2025/04] One first author paper on,\nSpatiotemporal predictive learning\n, is accepted by\nTPAMI\n.\n[2025/04] One first author paper on,\nMultimodal reasoning\n, is accepted by\nIJCAI 2025\n.\n[2025/01] One co-first author paper on,\nMultimodal reasoning\n, is accepted by\nCVPR 2025 (Highlight)\n.\n[2025/01] One first author paper on,\nPost-translational modification prediction\n, is accepted by\nICLR 2025\n.\n[2024/12] One first author paper on,\nAntibody design\n, is accepted by\nAAAI 2025 (Oral)\n.\n[2024/12] One first author paper on,\nSpatiotemporal predictive learning\n, is accepted by\nTMM\n.\n[2024/09] Three co-first papers on,\nProtein function prediction\n, are accepted by\nNeurIPS 2024\n.\n[2024/07] One first author paper on,\nMultimodal Chain-of-Thought\n, is accepted by\nECCV 2024\n.\n[2024/05] One first author paper on,\nRNA secondary structure prediction\n, is accepted by\nICML 2024\n.\n[2024/01] One co-first author paper on,\nDiffusion model\n, is accepted by\nTKDE\n.\n[2024/01] Two first/co-first author papers on,\nRNA design and protein design\n, are accepted by\nICLR 2024\n.\n[2023/12] One first author paper on,\nAntibody design\n, is accepted by\nAAAI 2024\n.\n[2023/10] I have been honored with the\nNational Scholarship\n.\n[2023/09] Two first/co-first author papers on,\nVideo prediction/protein design\n, are accepted by\nNeurIPS 2023\n.\n[2023/02] One first author paper on,\nVideo prediction\n, is accepted by\nCVPR 2023\n.\n[2023/01] One co-first paper is on,\nProtein design\n, accepted by\nICLR 2023\n.\n[2022/03] Two first/co-first author papers on,\nVideo prediction and SSL\n, are accepted by\nCVPR 2022\n.\n[2021/08] One first author paper on,\nNoisy label learning\n, is accepted by\nACM MM 2021\n.\nPublications\nMost recent publications on\nGoogle Scholar\n.\n‡\nindicates equal contribution.\n* indicates the corresponding author.\nSelected\nAll\nIlluminating Cell States by A Comprehensive and Interpretable Single Cell Foundation Model\nJue Wang\n‡\n,\nCheng Tan\n‡\n, Zhangyang Gao\n‡\n, Sida Shao, Shiping Liu, Stan Z. Li*\nNature Communications, 2026.\nCode\nEnd-to-end Cryo-EM Complex Structure Determination with High Accuracy and Ultra-fast Speed\nJue Wang\n‡\n,\nCheng Tan\n‡\n, Zhangyang Gao\n‡\n, GuiJun Zhang, Yang Zhang, Stan Z. Li*\nNature Machine Intelligence, 2025.\nPaper\nCode\nDecouple to Generalize: Context-First Self-Evolving Learning for Data-Scarce Vision-Language Reasoning\nTingyu Li, Zheng Sun, Jingxuan Wei, Siyuan Li, Conghui He, Lijun Wu,\nCheng Tan*\nCVPR, 2026.\nPaper\nCode\nGGBench: A Geometric Generative Reasoning Benchmark for Unified Multimodal Models\nJingxuan Wei, Caijun Jia, Xi Bai, Xinglong Xu, Siyuan Li, Linzhuang Sun, Bihui Yu, Conghui He, Lijun Wu,\nCheng Tan*\nCVPR, 2026.\nPaper\nCode\nGeoint-R1: Formalizing Multimodal Geometric Reasoning with Dynamic Auxiliary Constructions\nJingxuan Wei, Caijun Jia, Qi Chen, Honghao He, Linzhuang Sun, Conghui He, Lijun Wu, Bihui Yu,\nCheng Tan*\nCVPR, 2026.\nPaper\nCode\nLost in Tokenization: Context as the Key to Unlocking Biomolecular Understanding in Scientific LLMs\nKai Zhuang, Jiawei Zhang, Yumou Liu, Hanqun Cao, Chunbin Gu, Mengdi Liu, Zhangyang Gao, Zitong Jerry Wang, Xuanhe Zhou, Pheng-Ann Heng, Lijun Wu, Conghui He,\nCheng Tan*\nICLR, 2026.\nPaper\nCode\nAlphaFold Database Debiasing for Robust Inverse Folding\nCheng Tan\n‡\n, Zhenxiao Cao\n‡\n, Zhangyang Gao, Siyuan Li, Yufei Huang, Stan Z. Li\nNeurIPS, 2025.\nPaper\nResearchPulse: Building Method-Experiment Chains through Multi-Document Scientific Inference\nQi Chen, Jingxuan Wei, Zhuoya Yao, Haiguang Wang, Gaowei Wu, Bihui Yu, Siyuan Li,\nCheng Tan*\nACM Multimedia, 2025.\nPaper\nCode\nUSTEP: Spatio-Temporal Predictive Learning under A Unified View\nCheng Tan\n‡\n, Jue Wang\n‡\n, Zhangyang Gao\n‡\n, Siyuan Li, Stan Z. Li*\nTPAMI, 2025.\nPaper\nCode\nSketchAgent: Generating Structured Diagrams from Hand-Drawn Sketches\nCheng Tan\n‡\n, Qi Chen\n‡\n, Jingxuan Wei\n‡\n, Gaowei Wu, Zhangyang Gao, Siyuan Li, Bihui Yu, Ruifeng Guo, Stan Z. Li*\nIJCAI, 2025.\nPaper\nCode\nMultimodal Regression for Enzyme Turnover Rates Prediction\nBozhen Hu\n‡\n,\nCheng Tan\n‡\n, Siyuan Li, Jiangbin Zheng, Jun Xia, Stan Z. Li*\nIJCAI, 2025.\nPaper\nCode\nFrom Words to Structured Visuals: A Benchmark and Framework for Text-to-Diagram Generation and Editing\nJingxuan Wei\n‡\n,\nCheng Tan\n‡\n, Qi Chen, Gaowei Wu, Siyuan Li, Zhangyang Gao, Linzhuang Sun, Bihui Yu, Ruifeng Guo*\nCVPR, 2025 (\nHighlight\n).\nPaper\nCode\nMeToken: Uniform Micro-environment Token Boosts Post-Translational Modification Prediction\nCheng Tan\n, Zhenxiao Cao, Zhangyang Gao, Lirong Wu, Siyuan Li, Yufei Huang, Jun Xia, Bozhen Hu, Stan Z. Li*\nICLR, 2025.\nPaper\nCode\ndyAb: Flow Matching for Flexible Antibody Design with AlphaFold-driven Pre-binding Antigen\nCheng Tan\n‡\n, Yijie Zhang\n‡\n