 Chen\n, Kuanlun Liao, Yanwen Fang, Danny Ziyi Chen, Jian Wu$^\\dagger$,\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations\n,\n2023\n[ICLR]\nCross-layer retrospective retrieving via layer attention\n, Yanwen Fang, Yuxi Cai,\nJintai Chen\n, Jingyu Zhao, Guangjian Tian, Guodong Li$^\\dagger$,\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations\n,\n2023\n[ICML]\nA receptor skeleton for capsule neural networks\n,\nJintai Chen\n, Hongyun Yu, Chengde Qian, Danny Z. Chen, Jian Wu$^\\dagger$,\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning\n,\n2021\n[KDD|Oral]\nTeam up GBDTs and DNNs: Advancing Efficient and Effective Tabular Prediction with Tree-hybrid MLPs\n, Jiahuan Yan,\nJintai Chen\n$^\\dagger$, Qianxing Wang, Danny Chen, Jian Wu,\nACM SIGKDD Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining\n,\n2024\n[ICCV]\nOrderChain: A General Prompting Paradigm to Improve Ordinal Understanding Ability of MLLM\n, Jinhong Wang$^*$, Shuo Tong$^*$, Jian Liu, Dongqi Tang, Weiqiang Wang, Wentong Li, Hongxia Xu, Danny Chen,\nJintai Chen\n$^\\dagger$, Jian Wu$^\\dagger$,\nIEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision\n,\n2025\n[ICCV]\nPGFormer: Proxy-bridged game transformer for multi-person extremely interactive motion prediction\n, Yanwen Fang, Wenqi Jia, Xu Cao, Peng-Tao Jiang, Guodong Li,\nJintai Chen\n$^\\dagger$,\nIEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision\n,\n2025\nCross-Table Pretraining towards a Universal Function Space for Heterogeneous Tabular Data\n,\nJintai Chen\n, Zhen Lin, Qiyuan Chen, Jimeng Sun, Preprint,\n2024\n🎖 Awards\n2025.11\n, Outstanding Special Tutorial Award (优秀专题论坛), CNCC 2025\n2025.11\n, Awardee of the Youth S&T Talent Support Programme of GDSTA\n2025.08\n, Nomination Award for the Brilliant Star of the WAIC Yunfan Awards\n2023.04\n, Excellent Doctoral Graduates of Zhejiang Province, China (Top 1%)\n2023.04\n, Excellent Doctoral Graduates of Zhejiang University (Top 1%)\n2023.04\n, 产学研合作创新成果奖，浙江省产学研合作创新与促进奖\n2023.02\n, 医学影像智能处理关键技术创新与应用, 产