  "deep_homepage::Jianbo Yuan::https://sites.google.com/view/jiangbo-yuan/": {
    "homepage": "https://sites.google.com/view/jiangbo-yuan/",
    "all_emails": [
      "yuanjiangbo@gmail.com"
    ],
    "matched_email": null,
    "github": null,
    "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/jiangbo-yuan-a37b8725/",
    "homepage_text": "Jiangbo's Homepage\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nJiangbo's Homepage\nJiangbo Yuan\nEmail\n:yuanjiangbo AT gmail DOT com\n[\nLinkedIn\n]  [\nGoogle Scholar\n]\nI am an\nAI researcher and engineer with a proven track record of translating cutting-edge research into real-world, high-impact AI products. I specialize in multimodal AI, large-scale embeddings and retrieval systems, and agentic AI\n, delivering innovations from prototype to production. Recently, I’ve been building multimodal AI systems\nat Meta\nthat combine\nvision-language models, agentic capabilities, and efficient inference\nto create video-based\nalways-on, seamless user experiences\non wearable devices.\nPreviously, at\neBay\n, I led the computer vision team and\nrebuilt the entire visual search engine\n—from large-scale training data collection, golden dataset curation and annotation, distributed training and inference system creation, to backfill pipelines and real-time indexing, enabling world-class\nvisual search, recommendations, and magical listing systems at scale. My work directly impacted product discovery, personalization, and inventory management.\nOver the past decade, I’ve led projects in image, video, and text indexing, foundation models, object recognition, segmentation, image generation, and AI-driven products, always bridging research and production to deliver tangible impact.\nOutside of AI, I enjoy\npainting\nas a creative outlet and\nsoccer\n, which fuels my passion for teamwork and collaboration—skills I bring to cross-functional engineering teams every day\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
  },
