    "homepage_text": "Song-Chun Zhu - Homepage\nSong-Chun Zhu\nFounding Director, Â\nBeijing Institute for General Artificial Intelligence (BIGAI)\nDean, Â\nInstitute for Artificial Intelligence & School of Intelligence Science and Technology, Peking University\nChair Professor, Â\nPeking University & Tsinghua University\nResearch Areas\nComputer Vision\nStatistical Modeling & Computing\nCognition\nMachine Learning\nNatural Language and Dialogue\nAI\nRobot Autonomy\nStatistical Modeling & Computing\nComputer Vision\nMachine Learning\nRobot Autonomy\nAI\nCognition\nNatural Language and Dialogue\nTextbooks to build a framework\nThe Tong Test: Evaluating Artificial General Intelligence Through Dynamic Embodied Physical and Social Interactions\nSong-Chun Zhu, Yujia Peng, Yizhou Wang, Zhenliang Zhang, Jiaheng Han\nPosts & Telecommunications Press,2025\nAGI Path based on Chinese Philosophy\nSong-Chun Zhu\nCheers Publishing, 2024\nScientific Models in Chinese Thoughts\nSong-Chun Zhu\nCheers Publishing, 2024\nTalent Cultivation Progarm for General AI\nSong-Chun Zhu, Wenxin Li, Zhouchen Lin, Yuxi Ma\nPeking University Press, 2024\nMonte Carlo Methods\nAdrian Barbu and Song-Chun Zhu\nSpringer, 2020.\nComputer Vision: Statistical Models for Marr's Paradigm\nSong-Chun Zhu and Yingnian Wu\nSpringer, 2021\nComputer Vision: Stochastic Grammars for Parsing Objects, Scenes, and Events\nSong-Chun Zhu and Siyuan Huang\nSpringer, 2021\nCognitive Models for Visual Commonsense Reasoning\nSong-Chun Zhu and Yixin Zhu\nSpringer, 2021\nThe Tong Test: Evaluating Artificial General Intelligence Through Dynamic Embodied Physical and Social Interactions\nSong-Chun Zhu, Yujia Peng, Yizhou Wang, Zhenliang Zhang, Jiaheng Han\nPosts & Telecommunications Press,2025\nAGI Path based on Chinese Philosophy\nSong-Chun Zhu\nCheers Publishing, 2024\nScientific Models in Chinese Thoughts\nSong-Chun Zhu\nCheers Publishing, 2024\nTalent Cultivation Progarm for General AI\nSong-Chun Zhu, Wenxin Li, Zhouchen Lin