    "homepage_text": "Home\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nQiang Wang\nWelcome!\nI am an Assistant Professor o\nf Finance at the\nHaskayne School of Business\n, University of Calgary\n. My research interests lie in Fintech and household finance.\n[SSRN]\n[Google Scholar]\n[\nGithub\n]\nContact:\nScurfield Hall\n156\n2500 University Drive NW\nCalgary Alberta T2N 1N4\nPhone: +1-202-817-6886\nE-mail:\nqiang.wang3@ucalgary.ca\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nReport abuse\n\n---\n\nCV\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nCV\nCV_Qiang_Wang.pdf\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nReport abuse"
