    "homepage_text": "Jiaqi Yang's Homepage\nJiaqi Yang (\n杨佳琪\n)\nEmail: jiaqi.yang@wisc.edu, jqyang@whu.edu.cn\nPostdoctoral Research Associate\nUniversity of Wisconsin–Madison\nGlobal Change Research Laboratory\n[\nGitHub\n]\n[\nGoogleScholar\n]\n[\ndblp\n]\n[\nResearchGate\n]\n[\nORCID\n]\nLocation: 1630 Linden Drive, Madison, WI, US.\nNews\n|\nResearch Interest\n|\nEducation\n|\nPublications\n|\nAwards and Honors\n|\nNews\n[2026.01]\nPlease feel free to contribute to our special issue\nMulti-Modal Data Analysis\n(\nlink\n) at [Electronics] (IF: 2.6)!\n[2025.09]\nAppointed as Co-Lead of the\nWorking Group on Machine/Deep Learning for Image Analysis (WG-MIA)\n– IEEE GRSS IADF! (\nlink\n)!\n[2025.04]\n\"HyperSIGMA: Hyperspectral Intelligence Comprehension Foundation Model\" is acceptted by\nIEEE TPAMI\n(\nlink\n)!\n[2024.10]\nPlease feel free to contribute to our special issue\nAdvancement of Multi-Source Remote Sensing Data Fusion in Environmental Monitoring\n(\nlink\n) at [Remote Sensing] (IF: 4.2)!\n[2023.10]\nOne paper is acceptted by\nIEEE TIP\n(\nlink\n)!\n[2023.05]\nOne paper is acceptted by\nIEEE TNNLS\n(\nlink\n,\ncode\n)!\n[2023.04]\nOne paper is acceptted as a\nOral\npresentation by\nIGARSS 2023\n(\nlink\n)!\n[2023.02]\nOne paper is acceptted by\nIEEE TIP\n(\nlink\n,\ncode\n)!\n[2023.01]\nOne paper is acceptted by\nISPRS JP&RS\n(\nlink\n,\ncode\n)!\nResearch Interest\nI am working in AI for Earth Observation. Currently, I focus on the following research topics:\nHyperspectral image interpretation\nMulti-modal data analysis\nWeakly-supervised learning\nMy research aims to design creative machine learning and computer vision approaches to better contribute to geoscientific fields such as land cover/crop mapping, agricultural monitoring, and environmental sustainability.\nEducation\n2021.09-2024.06         Ph.D of Photogrammetry and Remote Sensing in\nLIESMARS\n,\nWuhan University\n.\nSupervisor: Prof.\nLiangpei Zhang\n& Prof.\nBo Du\n2019.09-2021.06         M.E. of Geomatics Engineering in\nLIESMARS\n,\nWuhan University\n.\nSupervisor: Prof.\nLiangpei Zhang\n& Prof.\nBo Du\n2015.09-2019.06         B.E. of Geographic Information Science in\nNavigation college\n,\nDalian Maritime University\n.\nPublications\nJournals\n:\n[6] ITER: Image-to-pixel Representation for Weakly Supervised HSI Classification\nJiaqi Yang\n, Bo Du, Di Wang, and Liangpei Zhang\nIEEE Transactions on Image Processing (\nTIP\n)\n, 2023. (\nCCF A, SCI Q1 TOP, IF=10.6\n)\n[\nNews\n]\n[\nPaper\n]\n[5] Overcoming the Barrier of Incompleteness: A Hyperspectral Image Classification Full Model\nJiaqi Yang\n, Bo Du, and Liangpei Zhang\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (\nTNNLS\n)\n, 2023. (\nSCI Q1 TOP, IF=10.4\n)\n[\nPaper\n][\nCode\n]\n[4] Can Spectral Information Work While Extracting Spatial Distribution?—An Online Spectral Information Compensation Network for HSI Classification\nJiaqi Yang\n, Bo Du, Yonghao Xu, and Liangpei Zhang\nIEEE Transactions on Image Processing (\nTIP\n)\n, 2023. (\nCCF A, SCI Q1 TOP, IF=10.6\n)\n[\nPaper\n][\nCode\n]\n[3] From center to surrounding: An interactive learning framework for hyperspectral image classification\nJiaqi Yang\n, Bo Du, and Liangpei Zhang\nISPRS Journal of Photogrammetry and Remote Sensing (\nISPRS JP&RS\n)\n, 2023. (\nSCI Q1 TOP, IF=12.7\n)\n[\nPaper\n][\nCode\n]\n[2] Enhanced Multi-scale Feature Fusion Network for HSI Classification\nJiaqi Yang\n, Chen Wu, Bo Du, and Liangpei Zhang\nIEEE Transactions on Geoscience and Remote Sensing (\nTGRS\n)\n, 2021. (\nSCI Q1 TOP, IF=8.2\n)\n[\nPaper\n]\n[1] Traffic Density Reduction Caused by City Lockdowns Across the World During the COVID-19 Epidemic: From the View of High-Resolution Remote Sensing Imagery\nChen Wu, Sihan Zhu,\nJiaqi Yang\n, Meiqi Hu, Bo Du, Liangpei Zhang, Lefei Zhang, Chengxi Han, and Meng Lan\nIEEE Journal of Selected Topics in Applied Earth Observations and Remote Sensing (\nIEEE JSTARS\n)\n, 2021. (\nSCI Q3, IF=5.5\n)\n[\nPaper\n]\nConferences\n:\n[3] LGFORMER: LOCAL-TO-GLOBAL TRANSFORMER FOR HYPERSPECTRAL IMAGE CLASSIFICATION\nJiaqi Yang\n, Bo Du and Chen Wu,\nProceeding of the IEEE International Geoscience and Remote Sensing Symposium (\nIGARSS 2023\n)\n, 2023. (\nEI\n)\n[\nPaper\n]\n[2] HYBRID VISION TRANSFORMER MODEL FOR HYPERSPECTRAL IMAGE CLASSIFICATION\nJiaqi Yang\n, Bo Du and Chen Wu,\nProceeding of the IEEE International Geoscience and Remote Sensing Symposium (\nIGARSS 2022\n)\n, 2022. (\nEI\n)\n[\nPaper\n]\n[1] AUTOMATICALLY ADJUSTABLE MULTI-SCALE FEATURE EXTRACTION FRAMEWORK FOR HYPERSPECTRAL IMAGE CLASSIFICATION\nJiaqi Yang\n, Bo Du, Chen Wu and Liangpei Zhang\nProceeding of the IEEE International Geoscience and Remote Sensing Symposium (\nIGARSS 2021\n)\n, 2021. (\nEI\n)\n[\nPaper\n]\nSelected Patents\n:\n[3]\nMethod for classifying hyperspectral images on basis of adaptive multi-scale feature extraction model\nBo Du,\nJiaqi Yang\n, Liangpei Zhang and Chen Wu\n[2]\nHyperspectral image classification method and system based on center-surrounding interactive learning\nBo Du,\nJiaqi Yang\nand Liangpei Zhang\n[1]\nHyperspectral image classification method, device, equipment and storage medium\nBo Du,\nJiaqi Yang\n, Liangpei Zhang and Chen Wu\nMembership\n:\nGeo-Spatial Information Science\n, Editorial Intern\nIEEE, Student Member\nIEEE Geoscience and Remote Sensing Society (GRSS), Student Member\nACM, Student Member\nCommittee\n:\nPrgramme Committee: ICCNC2026 (International Conference on Cloud and Network Computing 2026)\nPrgramme Committee: The 3rd Computer Vision for Earth Observation workshop at WACV conference (\nlink\n)\nCo-Lead: Working Group on Machine/Deep Learning for Image Analysis (WG-MIA) – IEEE GRSS IADF (\nlink\n)\n...\nEditorial Activity\n:\nGuest Editor: Multi-Source Remote Sensing Data Fusion in Environmental Monitoring at [Remote Sensing] (IF: 4.2) (\nlink\n)\nGuest Editor: Multi-Modal Data Analysis at [Electronics] (IF: 2.6) (\nlink\n)\n...\nReview