    "homepage_text": "Nanning Zheng\n      -  Xi'an Jiaotong University\nXi'an Jiaotong University Home\nEnglish\n中文\nSearch content at Xi'an Jiaotong University\nView Scopus Profile\nNanning Zheng\nCollege of Artificial Intelligence and Robotics\nh-index\n32944\nCitations\n75\nh-index\nCalculated based on number of publications stored in Pure and citations from Scopus\n1983                 …\n2026\nResearch activity per year\nPersonal profile\nExpertise related to UN Sustainable Development Goals\nIn 2015, UN member states agreed to 17 global\nSustainable Development Goals (SDGs)\nto end poverty, protect the planet and ensure prosperity for all. This person’s work contributes towards the following SDG(s):\nSDG 2\nZero Hunger\nSDG 3\nGood Health and Well-being\nSDG 7\nAffordable and Clean Energy\nSDG 11\nSustainable Cities and Communities\nSDG 13\nClimate Action\nSDG 16\nPeace, Justice and Strong Institutions\nFingerprint\nDive into the research topics where Nanning Zheng is active. These topic labels come from the works of this person. Together they form a unique fingerprint.\n12\nSimilar Profiles\nExperimental Result\nComputer Science\n100%\nAutonomous Driving\nComputer Science\n40%\nNeural Network\nComputer Science\n29%\nConvolutional Neural Network\nComputer Science\n27%\nDeep Neural Network\nComputer Science\n24%\nImage Segmentation\nComputer Science\n23%\nAutonomous Vehicle\nComputer Science\n20%\nDeep Learning Method\nComputer Science\n19%\nView full fingerprint\nCollaborations and top research areas from the last five years\nRecent external collaboration on country/territory level. Dive into details by clicking on the dots or\nSelect a country/territory from the list\nDive into details\nSelect a country/territory to view shared publications and projects\nClose\nSelect a country/territory from the list\nExplore network further\nResearch output\n548\nArticle\n536\nConference contribution\n48\nConference article\n42\nPaper\n42\nMore\n17\nEditorial\n16\nReview article\n4\nChapter\n2\nBook\n2\nComment/debate\n1\nLetter\nQuery-enhanced motion transformer with dilated static query and bridged dynamic query\nKang, M., Shi, L., Ye, K.,\nZhou, S.\n&\nZheng, N.\n,\nJan 2026\n,\nIn:\nPattern Recognition.\n169\n, 111847.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nDirect Connection\n100%\nA Novel Dense Object Detector With Scale Balanced Sample Assignment and Refinement\nDong, J., Yao, D., Hu, Y.,\nZhou, S.\n&\nZheng, N.\n,\n2025\n,\nIn:\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology.\n35\n,\n9\n,\np. 9337-9350\n14 p.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nObject Detector\n100%\nReceptive Field\n100%\nMultiscale\n100%\nBalanced Sample\n100%\nDetectors\n100%\n4\nScopus \n citations\nAugDETR: Improving Multi-scale Learning for Detection Transformer\nDong, J., Lin, Y., Li, C.,\nZhou, S.\n&\nZheng, N.\n,\n2025\n,\nComputer Vision – ECCV 2024 - 18th European Conference, Proceedings.\nLeonardis, A., Ricci, E., Roth, S., Russakovsky, O., Sattler, T. & Varol, G. (eds.).\nSpringer Science and Business Media Deutschland GmbH\n,\np. 238-255\n18 p.\n(Lecture Notes in Computer Science (including subseries Lecture Notes in Artificial Intelligence and Lecture Notes in Bioinformatics); vol. 15082 LNCS).\nResearch output\n:\nChapter in Book/Report/Conference proceeding\n›\nConference contribution\n›\npeer-review\nReceptive Field\n100%\nMultiscale\n100%\nlocal feature\n50%\nResidual Neural Network\n50%\nFast Convergence\n50%\n5\nScopus \n citations\nB-AVIBench: Toward Evaluating the Robustness of Large Vision-Language Model on Black-Box Adversarial Visual-Instructions\nZhang, H., Shao, W., Liu, H., Ma, Y., Luo, P., Qiao, Y.,\nZheng, N.\n& Zhang, K.,\n2025\n,\nIn:\nIEEE Transactions on Information Forensics and Security.\n20\n,\np. 1434-1446\n13 p.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nBlack Box\n100%\nLanguage Modeling\n100%\nExperim