    "homepage_text": "Dongyang's Homepage - Homepage\nDongyang Liu\nPh.D. Candidate\nMMLab CUHK\nHong Kong, China\nEmail\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\n🫠 About Me\nI am currently a second-year Ph.D. student at\nMMLab\n, CUHK, supervised by Prof.\nHongsheng Li\n. Before that, I obtained my master’s degree from\nVIPL\n, where I was supervised by Prof.\nShiguang Shan\nand Prof.\nMeina Kan\n.\nMy current research focus is multimodal understanding and generation\n.\n⚙️ Projects\nZ-Image\nPowerful and highly efficient image generation model with 6B parameters.\nLLaMA2-Accessory\nYour One-Stop Open-source Toolkit for LLM Development 🚀\n📝 Publications\nICLR 2026\nDecoupled DMD: CFG Augmentation as the Spear, Distribution Matching as the Shield\nDongyang Liu\n, Peng Gao, David Liu, Ruoyi Du, Zhen Li, Qilong Wu, Xin Jin, Sihan Cao, Shifeng Zhang, Hongsheng Li, Steven Hoi\nTech Report\nLumina-Video: Efficient and Flexible Video Generation with Multi-scale Next-DiT\nDongyang Liu\n, Shicheng Li, Yutong Liu, Zhen Li, Kai Wang, Xinyue Li, Qi Qin, Yufei Liu, Yi Xin, Zhong-Yu Li, Bin Fu, Chenyang Si, Yuewen Cao, Conghui He, Ziwei Liu, Yu Qiao, Qibin Hou, Hongsheng Li, Peng Gao\nIJCV\nLumina-mGPT: Illuminate flexible photorealistic text-to-image generation with multimodal generative pretraining\nDongyang Liu*\n, Shitian Zhao*, Le Zhuo*, Weifeng Lin*, Yu Qiao, Hongsheng Li, Peng Gao\nNeurIPS 2024\nLumina-Next: Making Lumina-T2X Stronger and Faster with Next-DiT\nLe Zhuo*, Ruoyi Du*, Han Xiao*, Yangguang Li*,\nDongyang Li*\n, Rongjie Huang*, Wenze Liu*, Lirui Zhao, Fu-Yun Wang, Zhanyu Ma, Xu Luo, Zehan Wang, Kaipeng Zhang, Xiangyang Zhu, Si Liu, Xiangyu Yue, Dingning Liu, Wanli Ouyang, Ziwei Liu, Yu Qiao, Hongsheng Li, Peng Gao\nICLR 2025\nLumina-T2X: Transforming Text into Any Modality, Resolution, and Duration via Flow-based Large Diffusion Transformers\nPeng Gao*, Le Zhuo*,\nDongyang Liu*\n, Ruoyi Du*, Xu Luo*, Longtian Qiu*, Yuhang Zhang, Chen Lin, Rongjie Huang, Shijie Geng, Renrui Zhang, Junlin Xi, Wenqi Shao, Zhengkai Jiang, Tianshuo Yang, Weicai Ye, He Tong, Jingwen He, Yu Qiao, Hongsheng Li\nICML 2024\nSPHINX-X: Scaling Data and Parameters for a Family of Multi-modal Large Language Models\nDongyang Liu*\n, Renrui Zhang*, Longtian Qiu*, Siyuan Huang*, Weifeng Lin*, Shitian Zhao, Shijie Geng, Ziyi Lin, Peng Jin, Kaipeng Zhang, Wenqi Shao, Chao Xu, Conghui He, Junjun He, Hao Shao, Pan Lu, Hongsheng Li, Yu Qiao, Peng Gao\nECCV 2024\nSPHINX: The Joint Mixing of Weights, Tasks, and Visual Embeddings for Multi-modal Large Language Models\nZiyi Lin*,\nChris Liu*\n, Renrui Zhang*, Peng Gao*, Longtian Qiu*, Han Xiao, Han Qiu, Chen Lin, Wenqi Shao, Keqin Chen, Jiaming Han, Siyuan Huang, Yichi Zhang, Xuming He, Hongsheng Li, Yu Qiao\nICLR 2024\nLLaMA-Adapter: Efficient Fine-tuning of Language Models with Zero-init Attention\nRenrui Zhang*, Jiaming Han*,\nChris Liu*\n, Aojun Zhou, Xiangfei Hu, Shilin Yan, Pan Lu, Hongsheng Li, Yu Qiao, Peng Gao\nICLR 2024\nA Simple Romance Between Multi-Exit Vision Transformer and Token Reduction\nDongyang Liu\n, Meina Kan, Shiguang Shan, CHEN Xilin\nICLR 2023\nFunction-Consistent Feature Distillation\nDongyang Liu\n, Meina Kan, Shiguang Shan, CHEN Xilin\n📖 Educations\n2024.09 - now\n: MMLab, The Chinese University of Hongkong (Ph.D.)\n2021.09 - 2024.06\n: VIPL Lab, Institute of Computing Technology, Chinese Academy of Sciences (Master)\n2017.09 - 2021.06\n: School of Software Engineering, Tongji University. (Bachelor)\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected."
