nformation Systems (TOIS), 2023.\nZezhi Shao, Yongjun Xu, Wei Wei, Fei Wang,\nZhao Zhang\n, Feida Zhu. Heterogeneous Graph Neural Network with Multi-view Representation Learning. IEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering (TKDE), 2023.\nYongjun Xu, Fei Wang, Zhulin An, Qi Wang,\nZhao Zhang\n. Artificial intelligence for science - bridging data to wisdom. The Innovation, 2023.\nFei Wang, Di Yao, Yong Li, Tao Sun,\nZhao Zhang\n. AI-enhanced Spatial-Temporal Data Mining Technology: New Chance for Next-generation Urban Computing. The Innovation, 2023.\n2022\nZhao Zhang\n, Fuzhen Zhuang, Hengshu Zhu, Chao Li, Hui Xiong, Qing He, Yongjun Xu. Towards Robust Knowledge Graph Embedding via Multi-task Reinforcement Learning. IEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering (TKDE), 2022.\nFuwei Zhang,\nZhao Zhang\n, Xiang Ao, Dehong Gao, Fuzhen Zhuang, Yi Wei, Qing He. Mind the Gap: Cross-Lingual Information Retrieval with Hierarchical Knowledge Enhancement. The Thirty-Sixth AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI), 2022.\nZhenwei Tang, Shichao Pei,\nZhao Zhang\n, Yongchun Zhu, Fuzhen Zhuang, Robert Hoehndorf, Xiangliang Zhang. Positive-Unlabeled Learning with Adversarial Data Augmentation for Knowledge Graph Completion. The 31st International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI), 2022.\nZezhi Shao,\nZhao Zhang\n, Fei Wang, Yongjun Xu. Pre-training Enhanced Spatial-temporal Graph Neural Network for Multivariate Time Series Forecasting. 28th ACM SIGKDD Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining (KDD), 2022.\nZezhi Shao,\nZhao Zhang\n, Wei Wei, Fei Wang, Yongjun Xu, Xin Cao, Christian S Jensen. Decoupled Dynamic Spatial-Temporal Graph Neural Network for Traffic Forecasting. 48th International Conference on Very Large Databases (VLDB), 2022.\nTangwen Qian, Yongjun Xu,\nZhao Zhang\n, Fei Wang. Trajectory Prediction from Hierarchical Perspective. 30th ACM International Conference on Multimedia (MM), 2022.\nTao Sun, Fei Wang,\nZhao Zhang\n, 