    "homepage_text": "About Me - Yizhou Wang’s Homepage\nYizhou Wang 王亦周\nAI Ph.D. candidate at NEU\nFollow\nBoston, U.S.\nEmail\nX\nLinkedIn\nInstagram\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nORCID\nWeChat\nScan to add me\nAbout Me\nI am a Research Scientist/Engineer at Adobe, working on AI technologies for\nPhotoshop\n. I am a 6th-year Ph.D. candidate in Computer Engineering at Northeastern Unversity, supervised by Prof.\nYun Raymond Fu\n. I am working on AI, and my research mainly focuses on LLM and Computer Vision.\nMy ultimate goal is to reach super-intelligence and AI consciousness safely, which might help human beings escape Earth and explore the universe. I believe that bio-intelligence (us human beings) is designed to unlock the super digital intelligence to find the ultimate answer: the potential higher civilization that created everything.\n💡 Mottos\n“Don’t aspire to glory, aspire to work.”\n“I want to know what is real, even if the answer is total obliteration of my consciousness.”\n“If you need inspiring words, don’t do it.”\n—\nElon Musk\nEducation\nNortheastern University (NEU)\n|  2020 - Present\nPh.D. in Computer Engineering\nSupervisor: Prof.\nYun Raymond Fu\nNortheastern University (NEU)\n|  2020 - 2023\nM.S. in Electrical Engineering\nConcentration: Computer Vision, Machine Learning & Algorithms\nXi'an Jiaotong University (XJTU)\n|  2016 - 2020\nB.S. in\nMathematics and Applied Mathematics (National Honors Program)\nContact\n📧\nEmail:\nwyzjack990122 (at) gmail (dot) com / wang.yizhou (at) northeastern (dot) edu\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nCurriculum Vitae - Yizhou Wang’s Homepage\nYizhou Wang 王亦周\nAI Ph.D. candidate at NEU\nFollow\nBoston, U.S.\nEmail\nX\nLinkedIn\nInstagram\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nORCID\nWeChat\nScan to add me\nCurriculum Vitae\nYour browser does not support embedded PDFs. Please\ndownload the CV\nto view it.\n📄 Download CV (PDF)"
