    "homepage_text": "Zhi Zheng\nMenu\nHome\nProjects\nTutorial & Workshop\nHonors\nService\nZhi Zheng （郑值）\nPostdoc Researcher\nState Key Laboratory of Cognitive Intelligence\n,\nSchool of Computer Science and Technology\n,\nUniversity of Science and Technology of China (USTC)\n,\nUSTC Hi-Tech Zone Camp.\nE-mail: zhengzhi97@ustc.edu.cn\nAbout me\nZhi Zheng is a postdoc researcher in the State Key Laboratory of Cognitive Intelligence, School of Computer Science and Technology, USTC, under the supervision of\nProf. Enhong Chen\n.\nHe received his Ph.D. degree in 2024 from School of Artificial Intelligence and Data Science, USTC, under the supervision of\nProf. Hui Xiong\nand\nProf. Tong Xu\n. Here is his\nGoogle Scholar\n.\nFrom Jun. 2021 to Jul. 2022, he was a research intern in\nTencent Jarvis Lab\n, under the supervision of\nDr. Xian Wu\nand\nZhaopeng Qiu\n.\nFrom Jul. 2022 to Apr. 2024, he was a research intern in\nBaidu TIC\n(Jul. 2022 to Dec. 2022) and\nBOSS Zhipin CSL\n(Dec. 2022 to Apr. 2024), under the supervision of\nDr. Hengshu Zhu\n.\nPreviously, he received the B.S. degree in Computer Science from USTC in 2019.\nHis research interests include Artificial Intelligence and Data Mining, especially LLM-based reasoning and agents.\nSelected Honors & Awards\n2025年度博士后创新人才支持计划\n（博新计划，人力资源和社会保障部、全国博士后管委会设立的国家青年人才计划，全国计算机学科仅20人入选）\n2025年度中国中文信息学会博士学位论文激励计划\n（CIPS优博，仅10人入选）\nCOLING 2025 Outstanding Paper Award\n（自然语言处理顶会杰出论文奖，仅5篇论文入选）\n2025年度小米青年学者\n2025年度中国科学技术大学墨子杰出青年特资津贴（一等）\n2021年度腾讯犀牛鸟精英人才计划奖学金\n（年度第四名）\nPublications\nConference Papers\nFake Lin, Binbin Hu,\nZhi Zheng*\n, Xi Zhu, Ziqi Liu, Zhiqiang Zhang, Jun Zhou and Tong Xu*,\nToken-level Collaborative Alignment for LLM-based Generative Recommendation\n,\nIn Proceedings of The Web Conference 2026\n(WWW'26)\n, Dubai, United Arab Emirates.\nZenan Ying, Jinke Wang,\nZhi Zheng*\n, Tong Xu, Wei Chen, Qi Liu, Huijun Hou,\nSGN: Shifted Window-Based Hierarchical Variable Grouping for Multivariate Time Series Classification\n,\nIn Proceedings of The Thirty-ninth Annual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems\n(NeurIPS'25)\n, San Diego.\nWei Chen,\nZhi Zheng*\n, Lili Zhao, Huijun Hou, Tong Xu,\nFollowing Occam’s Razor: Dynamic Combination of Structured Knowledge for Multi-Hop Question Answering using LLMs\n,\nIn Proceedings of The 2025 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing\n(EMNLP'25)\n, Suzhou, China.\nJinke Wang, Zenan Ying, Qi Liu, Wei Chen, Tong Xu*, Huijun Hou,\nZhi Zheng*\n,\nThink and Recall: Layer-Level Prompting for Lifelong Model Editing\n,\nIn Proceedings of The 2025 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing\n(EMNLP'25)\n, Suzhou, China.\nQi Liu, Jingqing Ruan, Hao Li, Haodong Zhao, Desheng Wang, Jiansong Chen, Guanglu Wan, Xunliang Cai,\nZhi Zheng\n, Tong Xu,\nAMoPO: Adaptive Multi-objective Preference Optimization without Reward Models and Reference Models\n,\nIn Proceedings of the 63th Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics\n(ACL'25)\n, Vienna, Austria.\nTianhui Ma, Shuyao Wang,\nZhi Zheng*\n, Hui Xiong*,\nEnhancing Long-Tail Bundle Recommendations Utilizing Composition Pattern Modeling\n,\nIn Proceedings of the 34th International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n(IJCAI'25)\n, Montreal, Canada.\nShuyao Wang,\nZhi Zheng*\n, Yongduo Sui, Hui Xiong*,\nUnleashing the Power of Large Language Model for Denoising Recommendation\n,\nIn Proceedings of The Web Conference 2025\n(WWW'25)\n, Sydney, Australia.\nZipeng Gao, Qingrong Xia, Tong Xu*, Xinyu Duan,\nZhi Zheng*\n, Zhefeng Wang*, Enhong Chen,\nMulti-branch Self-Drafting for LLM Inference Acceleration\n,\nIn Proceedings of The 39th Annual AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n(AAAI'25)\n, Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, USA.\nYuyang Ye,\nZhi Zheng\n, Yishan Shen, Tianshu Wang, Hengruo Zhang, Peijun Zhu, Runlong Yu, Kai Zhang, Hui Xiong,\nHarnessing Multimodal Large Language Models for Multimodal Sequential Recommendation\n,\nIn Proceedings of The 39th Annual AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n(AAAI'25)\n, Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, USA.\nDerong Xu, Xinhang Li, Ziheng Zhang, Zhenxi Lin, Zhihong Zhu,\nZhi Zheng\n, Xian Wu, Xiangyu Zhao, Tong Xu, Enhong Chen,\nHarnessing Large Language Models for Knowledge Graph Question Answering via Adaptive Multi-Aspect Retrieval-Augmentation\n,\nIn Proceedings of The 39th Annual AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n(AAAI'25)\n, Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, USA.\nTong Bao, Che Liu, Derong Xu,\nZhi Zheng*\n, Tong Xu*,\nMLLM-I2W: Harnessing Multimodal Large Language Model for Zero-Shot Composed Image Retrieval\n,\nIn Proceedings of The 31st International Conference on Computational Linguistics\n(COLING'25)\n, Abu Dhabi, UAE.\n(Outstanding Paper Award, 5/1922)\nShengming Zhang, Le Zhang, Jingbo Zhou,\nZhi Zheng\n, Hui Xiong,\nLLM-Eraser: Optimizing Large Language Model Unlearning through Selective Pruning\n,\nIn Proceedings of The 31st ACM SIGKDD International Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining\n(KDD'25)\n, Toronto, ON, Canada.\nZiqi Wang, Chen Zhu*,\nZhi Zheng*\n, Xinhang Li, Tong Xu*, Yongyi He, Qi Liu, Ying Yu, and Enhong Chen*,\nGranular Entity Mapper: Advancing Fine-grained Multimodal Named Entity Recognition and Grounding\n,\nIn Proceedings of The 2024 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing\n(EMNLP'24)\n, Miami, Florida, USA.\nWei Chen, Lili Zhao,\nZhi Zheng*\n, Tong Xu*, Yang Wang, and Enhong Chen,\nDouble-Checker: Large Language Model as a Checker for Few-shot Named Entity Recognition\n,\nIn Proceedings of The 2024 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing\n(EMNLP'24)\n, Miami, Florida, USA.\nWenShuo Chao,\nZhi Zheng\n, Hengshu Zhu*, and Hao Liu*,\nMake Large Language Model a Better Ranker\n,\nIn Proceedings of The 2024 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing\n(EMNLP'24)\n, Miami, Florida, USA.\nQi Liu, Yongyi He, Tong Xu, Defu Lian*, Che Liu,\nZhi Zheng*\nand Enhong Chen,\nUniMEL: A Unified Framework for Multimodal Entity Linking with Large Language Models\n,\nIn Proceedings of The 33rd ACM International Conference on Information and Knowledge Management\n(CIKM'24)\n, Boise, Idaho, USA.\nTong Bao, Tong Xu*, Derong Xu,\nZhi Zheng*\n,\nModal Complementarity based on Multimodal Large Language Model for Text-based Person Retrieval\n,\nIn Proceedings of The 8th APWeb-WAIM joint international conference on Web and Big Data\n(APWeb-WAIM'24)\n, Jinhua, China.\nChe Liu, Tong Xu, Qi Liu,\nZhi Zheng*\n, Jingyu Peng, Enhong Chen*,\nMERGE: Multi-View Relationship Graph Network for Event-Driven Stock Movement Prediction\n,\nIn Proceedings of The 8th APWeb-WAIM joint international conference on Web and Big Data\n(APWeb-WAIM'24)\n, Jinhua, China.\nZhi Zheng\n, Xiao Hu, Shanshan Gao, Hengshu Zhu*, Hui Xiong*,\nMIRROR: A Multi-View Reciprocal Recommender System for Online Recruitment\n,\nIn Proceedings of The 47th International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research and Development in Information Retrieval\n(SIGIR'24)\n, Washington D.C., USA.\nZhi Zheng\n, Wenshuo Chao, Zhaopeng Qiu, Hengshu Zhu*, Hui Xiong*,\nHarnessing Large Language Models for Text-Rich Sequential Recommendation\n,\nIn Proceedings of The Web Conference 2024\n(WWW'24)\n, Singapore, 2024.\nWenshuo Chao, Zhaopeng Qiu, Likang Wu, Zhuoning Guo,\nZhi Zheng\n, Hengshu Zhu*, Hao Liu*,\nA Cross-View Hierarchical Graph Learning Hypernetwork for Skill Demand-Supply Joint Prediction\n,\nIn Proceedings of The 38th Annual AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n(AAAI'24)\n, Vancouver, Canada, 2024.\nLikang Wu, Zhaopeng Qiu,\nZhi Zheng\n, Hengshu Zhu*, Enhong Chen*,\nExploring Large Language Model for Graph Data Understanding in Online Job Recommendations\n,\nIn Proceedings of The 38th Annual AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n(AAAI'24)\n, Vancouver, Canada, 2024.\nShuyao Wang, Yongduo Sui, Jiancan Wu,\nZhi Zheng\n, Hui Xiong*,\nDynamic Sparse Learning: A Novel Paradigm for Efficient Recommendation\n,\nIn Proceedings of the 17th ACM International Conference on Web Search and Data Mining\n(WSDM'24)\n, Mérida, Yucatán, Mexico, 2024.\nZhi Zheng\n, Ying Sun, Xin Song, Hengshu Zhu*, Hui Xiong*,\nGenerative Learning Plan Recommendation for Employees: A Work Performance-aware Reinforcement Learning Approach\n,\nIn Proceedings of the 17th ACM Conference on Recommender Systems\n(Recsys'23)\n, Singapore, 2023.\nXiao Hu, Yuan Cheng,\nZhi Zheng\n, Yue Wang, Xinxin Chi, Hengshu Zhu*,\nBOSS: A Bilateral Occupational-Suitability-Aware Recommender System for Online Recruitment\n,\nIn Proceedings of the 29th ACM SIGKDD International Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining\n(KDD'23)\n, Long Beach, CA, 2023.\nYejing Wang, Shen Ge, Xiangyu Zhao*, Xian Wu*, Tong Xu, Chen Ma,\nZhi Zheng\n,\nDoctor Specific Tag Recommendation for Online Medical Record Management\n,\nIn Proceedings of the 29th ACM SIGKDD International Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining\n(KDD'23)\n, Long Beach, CA, 2023.\nCong Wang,\nZhi Zheng\n, Tong Xu*, Zikai Yin, Enhong Chen,\nInteraction-aware Temporal Prescription Generation via Message Passing Neural Network\n,\nIn Proceedings of the 2022 CAAI International Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n(CICAI'22)\n, Beijing, China, 2022.\nZhi Zheng\n, Zhaopeng Qiu, Hui Xiong*, Xian Wu*, Tong Xu*, Xiangyu Zhao, Enhong Chen,\nDDR: Dialogue based Doctor Recommendation for Online Medical Service\n,\nIn Proceedings of the 28th ACM SIGKDD Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining\n(KDD'22)\n, Washington DC, USA, 2022.\nZhi Zheng\n, Zhaopeng Qiu, Tong Xu*, Xian Wu*, Xiangyu Zhao, Enhong Chen, Hui Xiong,\nCBR: Context Bias aware Recommendation for Debiasing User Modeling and Click Prediction\n,\nIn Proceedings of The Web Conference 2022\n(WWW'22)\n, Lyon, France, 2022.\nZhi Zheng\n, Chao Wang, Tong Xu*, Dazhong Shen, Penggang Qin, Baoxing Huai, Tongzhu Liu, Enhong Chen,\nDrug Package Recommendation via Interaction-aware Graph Induction\n,\nIn Proceedings of The Web Conference 2021\n(WWW'21)\n, Ljubljana, Slovenia, 2021.\n[PDF]\nJournal Papers\nZiwei Zhao, Fake Lin, Xi Zhu,\nZhi Zheng*\n, Tong Xu*, Shitian Shen, Xueying Li, Zikai Yin, Enhong Chen*,\nDynLLM: When Large Language Models Meet Dynamic Graph-based Recommendation\n,\nIn ACM Transactions on Information Systems\n(TOIS)\n, 2025.\nJiayue Chen, Zikai Yin, Ziwei Zhao, Fake Lin,\nZhi Zheng\n, Suojuan Zhang, Tong Xu, Yang Wang, Enhong Chen,\nRoll Call Vote Prediction with Graph Reconstruction and Attention-based Pruning\n,\nIn IEEE Transactions on Computational Social Systems\n(TCSS)\n, 2025.\nFake Lin, Xi Zhu, Ziwei Zhao, Deqiang Huang,  Yu Yu, Xueying Li,\nZhi Zheng*\n, Tong Xu*, Enhnog Chen*,\nKnowledge Graph Pruning for Recommendation\n,\nIn ACM Transactions on Information Systems\n(TOIS)\n, 2025.\nHui Xiong*,\nZhi Zheng*\n, Zhaopeng Qiu, Xian Wu*, Tong Xu, Enhong Chen,\nPrescription Generation via Multi-source Context-aware Hierarchical Transformer\n,\nSCIENCE CHINA Information Sciences\n(SCIS)\n, 2025.\nZhi Zheng\n†, Zhaopeng Qiu† Chen Zhu, Xiao Hu, Likang Wu, Yang Song, Hengshu Zhu*, Hui Xiong*,\nExploiting Large Language Model with Reinforcement Learning for Generative Job Recommendations\n,\nIn Frontiers of Computer Science\n(FCS)\n, 2025.\nYingpeng Du, Hongzhi Liu, Hengshu Zhu, Yang Song,\nZhi Zheng\n, Zhonghai Wu,\nQuasi-Metric Learning for Bilateral Person-Job Fit\n,\nIn IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence\n(TPAMI)\n, 2025.\nLikang Wu†,\nZhi Zheng\n†, Zhaopeng Qiu†, Hao Wang*, Hongchao Gu, Tingjia Shen, Chuan Qin, Chen Zhu, Hengshu Zhu*, Qi Liu, Hui Xiong*, Enhong Chen*,\nA Survey on Large Language Models for Recommendation\n,\nIn World Wide Web\n(WWWJ)\n, 2024.\nZhi Zheng\n, Xiao Hu, Zhaopeng Qiu, Yuan Cheng, Shanshan Gao, Yang Song, Hengshu Zhu*, Hui Xiong*,\nBilateral Multi-Behavior Modeling for Reciprocal Recommendation in Online Recruitment\n,\nIn IEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering\n(TKDE)\n, 2024.\nZhi Zheng\n, Chao Wang, Tong Xu*, Dazhong Shen, Penggang Qin, Xiangyu Zhao, Baoxing Huai, Xian Wu, Enhong Chen,\nInteraction-aware Drug Package Recommendation via Policy Gradient\n,\nIn ACM Transactions on Information Systems\n(TOIS)\n, 2022.\n[Code]\nZhi Zheng\n, Tong Xu*, Chuan Qin, Xiangwen Liao, Yi Zheng, Tongzhu Liu, Guixian Tong,\nMulti-source Contextual Collaborative Recommendation for Medicine\n,\nIn Journal of Computer Research and Development (in Chinese)\n, 2020, 57(8), 1741-1754.\n[PDF]"
