    "homepage_text": "Yang You's Homepage\nWelcome to Yang You's homepage!\nI am looking for PhD students, postdocs, and visiting scholars, please email your CV to me if you are interested.\nResearch Interests:\nMachine Learning\nHigh Performance Computing\nFoundation Models and MultiModal AI\nParallel and Distributed Systems\nPre-Training, SFT, RL\nAbout:\nQuestions\nAnswers\nInstitute\nNational University of Singapore (Computer Science)\nPosition\nPresidential Young Professor\nEducation\nPhD in Computer Science (UC Berkeley, 2015-2020)\nPhD Advisor\nProf. James Demmel\n[dissertation]\nIndustry Experience\nGoogle Brain; IBM; Intel; Microsoft; NVIDIA; HPC-AI Tech\nGoogle Scholar\nLink\nCV (pdf)\nLink\nCV\nLink\nAcademic Family Tree\nLink\nHomepage of my lab\nLink\nTwitter\nFollow @YangYou1991\nPress\nlink\nEmail\nyangyou (at) nus (dot) edu (dot) sg\nBackup Email\nchinayouyang1991 (at) gmail (dot) com\nOffice Phone\n(+65) 66-017-698\nPhone\n(+65) 86-488-197"
