-MOTS Dataset: Boost the Autonomous Driving\r\n                                    Perception\nYiming Cui, Zhiwen Cao, Yixin Xie, Xingyu Jiang, Feng Tao, Victor Chen, Lin Li,\r\n                                    and\nDongfang Liu*\n.\nWACV 2022\n2021\nTF-Blender: Temporal Feature Blender for Video Object Detection\nYiming Cui, Liqi Yan, Zhiwen Cao, and\nDongfang Liu*\n.\nICCV 2021\nSG-Net: Spatial Granularity Network for One-Stage Video Instance Segmentation\nDongfang Liu\n, Yiming Cui, and Yingjie Chen.\nCVPR 2021\nDenserNet: Weakly Supervised Visual Localization Using Multi-scale\r\n                                    Features\nDongfang Liu\n, Yiming Cui, Baijian Yang, and Yingjie Chen.\nAAAI 2021\nA Vector-Based Representation to Enhance Head Pose Estimation\nZhiwen Cao, Zongcheng Chu,\nDongfang Liu\n, and Yingjie Chen.\nWACV 2021\nHierarchical Attention Fusion for Geo-Localization\nLiqi Yan, Yiming Cui, Yingjie Chen, and\nDongfang Liu\n.\nICASSP 2021\n2020\nMultimodal Aggregation Approach for Memory Vision-Voice Indoor Navigation with\r\n                                    Meta-Learning\nLiqi Yan#,\nDongfang Liu#\n, and Changbin Yu. (# first coauthor).\nIROS 2020\nThe template of this website is designed by\ntemplatemo\n."
