    "homepage_text": "Yinghao Xu (Justin) - Stanford University\nYinghao Xu (Justin)\nIncoming Assistant Professor, HKUST CSE\nHi, I'm Yinghao!\nI am leading a research group in the\nRobbyAnt\n, and a staff research scientist at Ant Research.\n          I am also an incomming assistant professor in the Department of Computer Science and Engineering at the\nHKUST\n.\n          Previously, I was a postdoctoral researcher at Stanford University working with\nProf.\n          Gordon Wetzstein\n.\nMy current research focuses on 3D computer vision, generative AI and embodied AI. I am\n          particularly interested in developing powerful generative models to perceive and generate compact\n          representations of environments and leverage them to understand, interact with, and reason about the  physical world.\nEmail\nScholar\nGitHub\nTwitter\nI'm looking for\nfull-time research scientists/engineers\nand\nresearch interns\nat\nRobbyAnt\nto work on world models and embodied AI.\nI'm also looking for\nresearch assistants\nat\nHKUST\nstarting summer 2026, who are interested in\n3DV/Gen AI/Embodied AI\n. Please feel free to drop me an email with your CV.\nRecent News\n2026. 01:\nWe release\nLingBot-VA\n, the first autoregressive video-action world modeling for robot control.\n2026. 01:\nWe release\nLingBot-World\nto advance open-source world models.\n2026. 01:\nWe release\nLingBot-Depth\non masked depth modeling for general spatial perception.\n2025. 06:\nI leave Stanford and start a new journey at\nRobbyAnt\n!\n2025. 04:\nThree papers were accepted to CVPR 2025.\n2025. 01:\nCameraCtrl and 3DitScene are accepted by ICLR 2025!\n2024. 09:\nOne paper is accepted by CoRL 2024! It's my first robotics paper, Cheers!\n2024. 09:\nTwo papers are accepted by NeurIPS 2024.\n2024. 08:\nTGH is accepted by SIGGRAPH ASIA Journal.\n2024. 05:\nTwo papers are accepted by ECCV 2024.\n2024. 01:\nThree papers are accepted by ICLR 2024! DMV3D and PF-LRM are awared as spotlight presentation!\n2023. 12:\nTwo papers got accepted by NeurIPS 2023 and one paper is accepted by 3DV 2024 as spotlight presentation.\n2023. 07:\nThe extension of IDinvert and NeuralBody are accepted by TPAMI!\n2023. 06:\nGenda is finally accepted by ICCV 2023.\n2023. 06:\nDefended Ph.D. thesis successfully!\n2023. 03:\nDiscoScene gets three strong accept and is selected as the Highlight paper!\n2023. 02:\nThree papers are accepted by CVPR 2023!\n2023. 01:\nTwo papers with one oral (3DGP), are accepted by ICLR 2023!\n[Show more]\nInterns\nYiming Luo\nShangzhan Zhang\nLinzhuo Chen\nYudong Jin\nMingrui Yu\nJian Gao\nJingrui Xing\nPublications\n(\nshow recent\n/\nshow\n              selected\n/\nshow all by date\n/\nshow all by topic\n)\nYear:\n2026\n/\n2025\n/\n2024\n/\n2023\n/\n2022\n/\n2021\n/\n2020\n/\n2019\nCurrent Research Topics:\nVideo World Modeling\n/\nEmbodied AI\n/\n3D Foundation Model\nPast Research Topic:\n3D\n                Generative Models\n/\nNeural\n                Scene Representation\n/\nImage\n                Generation & Editing\n/\nVisual Understanding\n2026\n2025\n2024\n2023\n2022\n2021\n2020\n2019\nVideo World Modeling\nEmbodied AI\n3D Foundation Model\n3D Generative Models\nNeural Scene Representation\nImage Generation & Editing\nVisual Understanding\nInvited Talks\n[02/2026]\nTsinghua University, Host by\nProf. Hao Zhao\n[02/2026]\nPeking University, Host by\nProf. Baoquan\n              Chen\n[11/2025]\nUniversity of Chinese Academy of Sciences, Host by\nProf. Lin Gao\n,\nProf. Shiguang Shan\n[08/2025]\nSouthern University of Science and Technology, Host by\nProf. Boyu Zhou\n[08/2025]\nHefei University of Technology, Host by\nProf. Lechao Cheng\n[06/2025]\nZhejiang University, Host by\nProf. Yiyi\n              Liao\n[06/2025]\nZhejiang University, Host by\nProf. Sida\n              Peng\n[06/2025]\nZhejiang University, Host by\nProf.\n              Jiming Chen\n,\nProf. Qi Ye\n[05/2025]\nStanford SCIEN Seminar, Host by\nProf.\n              Gordon Wetzstein\n[04/2025]\nChina 3DV, Host by\nProf. Yebin\n              Liu\n[04/2025]\nUniversity of Chicago, Host by\nProf. Michael Maire\n[03/2025]\nUNC, Host by\nProf. Mingyu\n              Ding\n[01/2025]\nHKUST, Host by\nProf. Qifeng Chen\n[11/2024]\nMax Planck Institute for Informatics, Host by\nProf. Christian\n              Theobalt\n[11/2024]\nMIT, Host by\nProf. Vincent\n              Sitzmann\n[10/2024]\nCornell Tech, Host by\nProf. Noah\n              Snavely\n[10/2024]\n3D AICC Workshop at ECCV 2024, Host by\nProf. Georgios Pavlakos\n[05/2024]\nUniversity of Pennsylvania, Host by\nProf.\n              Lingjie Liu\n[04/2024]\nUniversity of Tübingen, Host by\nProf. Andreas\n              Geiger\n[02/2024]\nNvidia Research, Host by\nDr. Zian\n              Wang\n[01/2024]\nPeking University, Host by\nProf. Baoquan\n              Chen\n[04/2024]\nGAMES, Host by\nProf. Sida Peng\n[04/2024]\nChina 3DV, Host by\nProf. Baoquan\n              Chen\n[12/2023]\nTsinghua University, Host by\nProf. Yebin\n              Liu\n[12/2023]\nTsinghua University, Host by\nProf. Songhai Zhang\n[Show more]\nExperiences\nResearch Intern, Adobe Research\nJun. 2023 - Sep. 2023\nHost by\nKai Zhang\nVisiting Research Scholar, Stanford University\nJan. 2023 - Apr. 2023\nHost by\nGordon Wetzstein\nResearch Intern, Snap Inc.\nJul. 2022 - Oct. 2022\nHost by\nMenglei Chai\nResearch Intern, Ant Research\nJan. 2022 - May. 2022\nHost by\nDeli Zhao\nand\nYujun Shen\nResearch Intern, ByteDance Inc.\nJul. 2021 - Feb. 2021\nHost by\nYujun Shen\nStudent Researcher, MSRA\nMar. 2021 - Jun. 2021\nHost by\nStephen Lin\nResearch Intern, MSRA\nNov. 2018 - May. 2019\nHost by\nJifeng Dai\n,\nHan Hu\nand\nStephen Lin\nResearch Assistant, UCSD\nJul. 2018 - Oct. 2018\nHost by\nHao Su\nProfessional Activities\nArea Chair for CVPR 2026, 3DV 2026, SIGGRAPH ASIA 2025, SIGGRAPH 2026\nReviewer for CVPR, ECCV, AAAI, ICCV, NeurIPS, ICLR, ICML, SIGGRAPH, TVCG, SIGGRAPH ASIA\nMentored Students\nZifan Shi\nResearch\n      