    "homepage_text": "Yuzhe Yang\nYuzhe (Toby) Yang\nLearning to Learn\nHi, I am a final-year undergraduate student at the\nChinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen\n, where I work with\nProf. Benyou Wang\n. I am also a visiting student at the\nUC Santa Barbara NLP Group\n, where I work with\nProf. Xin Eric Wang\n.\nMy research focuses on building (multimodal) language models and agents that think and behave more like humans, especially in scalable and interactive social environments.\n[Read More]\ne.g., Social Simulation (\nNeurIPS25'\n), Human-AI Interaction (\nNAACL25'\n), Multimodal (\nICLR26'\n,\nCVPR26'\n).\nCurrently, I am seeking a PhD position (2026 Fall) and internship opportunities.\nIf you are interested in my work or would like to discuss potential collaborations, please feel free to reach out and\nschedule time\nwith me.\nEmail:\ntobyyang7[at]outlook[dot]com\n(preferred)\nyuzheyang[at]ucsb[dot]edu\nLearning to Learn\nNews\nSelected Publications\nOnly (co-)first author papers are listed. See more on the\nPublications\npage or\nGoogle Scholar\n.\n(* indicates equal contribution)\nExperiences\nUC Santa Barbara NLP Group\n2025.07 – Present\nVisiting Student\nAdvised by\nProf. Xin Eric Wang\nCUHK-Shenzhen NLP Group\n2024.06 – Present\nUndergraduate Research Assistant\nAdvised by\nProf. Benyou Wang\nand Dr. Yan Hu\nBest Paper Award & Travel Grant Award (ICLR 2025 Workshop)\nSchool of Management & Engineering, Nanjing University\n2024.08 – 2025.01\nUndergraduate Research Assistant\nAdvised by\nProf. Honghai Yu\nTheFinAI\n2024.06 – 2024.10\nResearcher\nSchool of Data Science, CUHK-Shenzhen\n2023.08 – 2024.06\nUndergraduate Research Assistant\nAdvised by\nProf. Jianfeng Mao\nUndergraduate Research Award (2024, 2025)\nMiscellaneous\n📸 I am an amateur photographer with an interest in\n                      digital, film, and aerial photography, with a special\n                      passion for landscape photography 🏔️. You can find my\n                      photos on\nUnsplash\n🎞️.\n                      Also, you can visit my\nHDR photo gallery\n.\n2024-2026 ©️ Yuzhe Yang"
  },
