    "homepage_text": "Zitao Liu | Home\nZitao Liu\nFather of Two\nProfessor, Guangdong Institute of Smart Education\nJinan University, Guangzhou, China\nliuzitao [AT] jnu.edu.cn\nBio\nMy research is in the area of machine learning, and includes contributions in the areas of\nartificial intelligence in education\nand\neducational data mining\n. I have published 100+ papers in highly ranked conference proceedings and my applied research has resulted in 50+ technology transfer and patents.\nI conduct\nreproducible\nresearch. Trained models, datasets and scripts of data preprocessing and model training can be found at\npykt.org\n,\nai4ed@GitHub\n,\ntal-ai@GitHub\n, and\ntal-tech@GitHub\n.\nBefore joining\nJNU\n, I was the CTO of\nThinkAcademy\n, CTO of\nXueersi 1 on 1\nand Head of AI Lab at\nTAL Education Group\n(NYSE: TAL).\nNews\n01/2026:  One paper was accepted by AISTATS'2026.\n01/2026:  Two papers were accepted by ICLR'2026.\n01/2026:  Two papers were accepted by WWW'2026.\n01/2026:  Invited to serve as a Senior PC member of AIED'2026.\nPublications\nMost recent publications on\nGoogle Scholar\n.\nSelected\nML/DM\nAIED\nAll\nDual-attentional time-aware fusion networks for knowledge tracing\nS. Huang,\nZ. Liu\n, Q. Liu, J. Chen, Y. Huang\nInformation Fusion 2026\nA Frequency-Aware Mixture of Heterogeneous Experts Framework for Knowledge Tracing\nY. Bai, M. Hou, T. Guo,\nZ. Liu\n, W. Luo\nWWW 2026\nCOMA: A Collaborative Multi-Role Agent Framework for Automated Lesson Plan Generation\nX. Zeng, Y. Zheng, S. Huang,\nZ. Liu\n, M. Tian, M. Hou, J. Zheng, W. Dou\nWWW 2026\nA Compress-Expand Framework for Automatic Lesson Plan Generation\nS. Huang, Y. Zheng, X. Zeng,\nZ. Liu\nAAAI 2026\nLearning from Scoring Disagreements: Contrastive Error Mining for Efficient and Robust LLM-based Assessment\nL. Chen, T. Cheng, B. Gao,\nZ. Liu\n, W. Luo\nAAAI 2026\nA Synergistic Multi-Agent Framework for Camouflage Attack on Large Language Models\nX. Li, Z. Zhou,\nZ. Liu\n, Y. Wu,  W. Luo\