    "homepage_text": "RESEARCH – Weiran Yao's Homepage\nRESEARCH\nAutonomous Unmanned Systems\nTask Allocation\nSearch\nGame\nContact\nDepartment of Control Science and Engineering, School of Astronautics, Harbin Institute of Technology, China\nKey Laboratory of Autonomous Intelligent Unmanned Systems, MIIT, China\nAddress:\nRoom 3029, Mechanical Building, #92 West Dazhi Street, Harbin 150001, China\nE-mail:\nyaoweiran@hit.edu.cn\nRelated Links\nKey Laboratory of AIUS:\nhttp://aius.hit.edu.cn/\nPersonal Links\nHomepage@HIT:\nhttp://homepage.hit.edu.cn/WeiranYao\nWeb of Science ResearcherID:\nhttps://www.webofscience.com/wos/author/record/N-2543-2019\nORCID:\nhttps://orcid.org/0000-0002-6570-3888\nGoogle Scholar:\nhttps://scholar.google.com.hk/citations?user=4urvR3YAAAAJ\nResearchGate:\nhttps://www.researchgate.net/profile/Weiran-Yao\n© 2026 Weiran Yao's Homepage.\n黑ICP备19007236号-1\nEnglish\nEnglish\n简体中文"
