    "homepage_text": "Furu Wei at Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nFuru Wei\nDistinguished Scientist, Chief Scientist of Microsoft Research Asia\nAbout\nDr.\nFuru Wei\n(opens in new tab)\nis a Distinguished Scientist and Vice President at Microsoft Research, where he serves as the Chief Scientist of Microsoft Research Asia. He leads the\nGeneral Artificial Intelligence (GenAI) Group\nat\nMicrosoft Research Asia\n, Beijing, China.\nAdvancing AI for Humanity\n(opens in new tab)\nLarge-scale Self-supervised Pre-training Across Tasks, Languages, and Modalities\n(opens in new tab)\nFuru’s Homepage\n(opens in new tab)\nOpens in a new tab\nResearch areas\nArtificial intelligence\nHuman language technologies\nResearch groups\nGeneral Artificial Intelligence\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on Instagram\nSubscribe to our RSS feed\nShare this page:\nShare on X\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nShare on Reddit\n\n---\n\nFuru Wei at Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nFuru Wei\nDistinguished Scientist, Chief Scientist of Microsoft Research Asia\nResearch Activities and Other Publications\nOpens in a new tab\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on Instagram\nSubscribe to our RSS feed\nShare this page:\nShare on X\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nShare on Reddit\n\n---\n\nFuru Wei at Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nFuru Wei\nDistinguished Scientist, Chief Scientist of Microsoft Research Asia\nResearch Activities and Other Publications\nOpens in a new tab\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on