    "homepage_text": "XUE WANG GROUP @ CityU\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nXUE WANG GROUP @ CityU\nTowards sustainable low-carbon energy source\ns\nfor decarbonization\nWelcome to the Xue Wang Group!\nAbout the\nXue Wang Group\nWe are a research group led by\nProf. Xue WANG\nat the\nCity University of Hong Kong\n. Our\nresearch focuses on science and engineering for decarbonization of the energy sector using electrocatalysis approach. We aim to develop efficient CO\n2\nelectrochemical conversion technologies to address challenging in renewable energy storage & conversion, electrosynthesis of chemicals/fuels, and climate change mitigation, as well as unravel the physical and chemical events at the molecular level during the electrocatalysis processes.\nLearn more...\nResearch Gallery\nElectrocatalytic system\nConfined Catalyst for Enhanced Ethanol Electrosyntheis from CO2\nEfficient Methane Electrosynthesis Enabled by Tuning Local CO2 availability\nAtomic-Level Catalyst Design\nSurface Structure-Property Relationship\nOpenings\nWe have openings for graduate students,\nresearch assistants,\npostdocs, and undergraduate students!\nLearn more...\nContact\nProf. Xue Wang\nEmail: xue.wang@cityu.edu.hk\nSchool of Energy and Environment,\nCity University of Hong Kong,\nKowloon Tong, Hong Kong\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\n\n---\n\nXUE WANG GROUP @ CityU - Contact\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nXUE WANG GROUP @ CityU\nContact\nProf.\nXue Wang\nMailing Address:\nOffice:\nYEUNG-B5424; lab:\nYEUNG-\nP6807\nYeung Kin Man Academic Building,\nSchool of Energy and Environment,\nCity University of Hong Kong,\n83 Tat Chee Avenue,\nKowloon Tong, Kowloon, Hong Kong\nEmail：\nxue.wang@cityu.edu.hk\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\n\n---\n\nXUE WANG GROUP @ CityU - Contact\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nXUE WANG GROUP @ CityU\nContact\nProf.\nXue Wang\nMailing Address:\nOffice:\nYEUNG-B5424; lab:\nYEUNG-\nP6807\nYeung Kin Man Academic Building,\nSchool of Energy and Environment,\nCity University of Hong Kong,\n83 Tat Chee Avenue,\nKowloon Tong, Kowloon, Hong Kong\nEmail：\nxue.wang@cityu.edu.hk\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
  },
