    "homepage_text": "Home | yshi\ntop of page\nThis website was built on Wix. Create yours today.\nGet Started\nDr. Yujun Shi's Group\nUniversity of Calgary\nAdvFunctMater-Frontipiece-1906742\nAdvFunctMater-Frontipiece-1906742\n1/10\nGroup News\nCongratulations to Mohammad on publication in Advanced Functional Materials!\nDecember 12, 2019\nMohammad's paper entitled \"Highly Efficient Quantum Dot Light-emitting Diodes by Inserting Multiple Poly(methyl methacrylate) as Electron-blocking Layers\" has been published as a Frontispiece in Adv. Funct. Mater. Congratulations, Mohammad!\nCongratulations to Alison on winning AGES!\nNovember 29, 2019\nAlison has won the Alberta Graduate Excellence Scholarship (AGES) for 2019. Congratulations!\nWelcome to Dr. Asha Yadav, Eyes High postdoctoral Fellow\nSeptember 24, 2019\nWelcome to Dr. Asha Yadav, our new Eyes High Postdoctoral fellow joining us from the Indian Institute of Technology\nWelcome to our new graduate student and Farewell to the summer students\nAugust 29, 2019\nThe group had a pizza party to welcome our new graduate student, James Stevenson (MSc program) and to say goodbye to our two summer students, Linh Ly and Antoine Stellio. Best wishes to all of them!\nbottom of page\n\n---\n\nContact | yshi\ntop of page\nThis website was built on Wix. Create yours today.\nGet Started\nDr. Yujun Shi's Group\nUniversity of Calgary\nContact Information\nDr. Yujun Shi\nDepartment of Chemistry\nUniversity of Calgary\nCalgary, Alberta, T2N 1N4\nPhone: (403)210-8674\nFax: (403)289-9488\nE-mail:\nshiy@ucalgary.ca\nbottom of page\n\n---\n\nContact | yshi\ntop of page\nThis website was built on Wix. Create yours today.\nGet Started\nDr. Yujun Shi's Group\nUniversity of Calgary\nContact Information\nDr. Yujun Shi\nDepartment of Chemistry\nUniversity of Calgary\nCalgary, Alberta, T2N 1N4\nPhone: (403)210-8674\nFax: (403)289-9488\nE-mail:\nshiy@ucalgary.ca\nbottom of page"
