    "homepage_text": "Jingzhao's homepage\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nJingzhao's homepage\nJingzhao Zhang  张景昭\njingzhaoz at mail.tsinghua.edu.cn\n,\nGoogle scholar\nCV\nShort Bio\nAssistant Professor\n@\nTsinghua,\nIIIS\nJointly Affiliated as PI\n@\nShanghai\nQizhi Institute\nWhat's new\n:\nA\npresentation\non data selection for LLM training based on three recent works.\nUpdated the project on complexity for min-max and bilevel problems\nResearch Projects\nby Lesi (COLT 2025 best student paper award!)\n.\nPlease check our ICLR2024\nworkshop\non Bridging the Gap between Theory and Practice for Learning\n.\nIf you want to join as an intern, please prepare a 15min presentation on a recent DL / ML / AI paper and then send me an email.\nIf you are interested in joining as a PhD student, please refer to my post\nhere\n.\nResearch interests:\nI am interested in theoretical explanations of practical optimization algorithms.\nI am working on developing faster training algorithms.\nComplexity lower bounds,\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
