mation\nThe 3rd Award of CVPR 2023 UG2+ Challenge on Single Image Deraining\nNational Gold Award of China International College Students' Innovation Competition (2024)\nNational First Prize of China iCAN Innovation Competition (2021)\n(\nTop-5 winners in China\n)\nFundings\nChina Association for Science and Technology Youth Talent Support Engineering Doctoral Program\n[首批中国科协青年人才托举工程博士生专项计划]\nInvited Talks\n2025.10.28 Talk at ECNU\n[IIC青年学者交流报告 | 迈向通用底层视觉的基座大模型]\n2024.10.20 Talk at PRCV 2024\n[优秀博士生论坛 | 恶劣环境下的视觉增强与计算]\n2024.09.19 Talk at TechBeat\n[面向雨天场景的视觉重建算法与基准探索]\n2024.07.10 Talk at Extreme Vision\n[雨天环境下的视觉增强：趋势与挑战]\n2023.11.19 Talk at Traffic Video Special Committee of China Society of Image and Graphics (CSIG)\n[CSIG交通视频专委会“学术新星”]\n2023.03.31 Talk at Student Forum of China Society of Image and Graphics (CSIG)\n[面向恶劣环境下的视觉增强方法]\nProfessional Services\nArea Chair:\nACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACM MM 2025)\nInternational Conference on Acoustics, Speech, and Signal Processing (ICASSP 2026)\nInternational Joint Conference on Neural Networks (IJCNN 2025)\nOrganizer:\nCVPR 2026 | NTIRE Challenge on 3D Restoration and Reconstruction\nCVPR 2026 | LoViF Challenge on Real-World All-in-One Image Restoration\nMMAsia 2025 Workshop on Imaging, Processing, Perception, and Reasoning for High-Dimensional Visual Data\nJournal Reviewer:\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (TPAMI)\nIEEE Transactions on Image Processing (TIP)\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (TNNLS)\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia (TMM)\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology (TCSVT)\nIEEE Transactions on Geoscience and Remote Sensing (TGRS)\nIEEE Transactions on Intelligent Transportation Systems (ITS)\nIEEE Transactions on Industrial Informatics (TII)\nIEEE Journal of Selected Topics in Signal Processing (JSTSP)\nIEEE/CAA Journal of Automatica Sinica (JAS)\nPattern Recognition (PR)\nEngineering Applications of Artific