    "homepage_text": "Chiyuan Zhang\nChiyuan Zhang\nI'm a research scientist at\nGoogle Research\n.\n      Before that, I got my PhD from\nCSAIL\n,\nMIT\n,\n      working with\nProf. Tomaso Poggio\nin the\nCenter for Brains, Minds and Machines (CBMM)\n.\nI work on machine learning, deep learning and computational neuroscience. I'm especially\n      interested in understanding the generalization and memorization in machine and human learning,\n      as well as implications in related areas like privacy.\nContact\nfoo@bar.com\n- for personal notes\nfoo@bar.com\n- for work / research"
  },
