    "homepage_text": "Tong Wu's Homepage\nSearch\nTong WU 吴桐\nPostDoc @ Stanford\nBiography\nTong Wu is a postdoctoral researcher at\nStanford University\n, working with Prof.\nGordon Wetzstein\n. She obtained her PhD degree in 2024 from\nMulti-Media Lab(MMLab)\nat\nCUHK\n, under the supervision of Prof.\nDahua Lin\n. She also works closely with Prof.\nZiwei Liu\nat\nNTU\nand previously served as a visiting student researcher at\nStanford University\nwith Prof.\nGordon Wetzstein\n.\nShe received her bachelor’s degree from the\nEE Department\nat\nTsinghua University\nin 2020, where she worked with Prof.\nYu Wang\nand Prof.\nJiansheng Chen\n. Her research interests include 3D Vision and AIGC.\nNews\n[2025-03] Four papers accepted to\nICCV 2025\n.\n[2025-03] One papers accepted to\nSIGGRAPH 2025\n.\n[2025-02] Two papers accepted to\nCVPR 2025\n(\n1 Highlight\n).\n[2025-01] Three papers accepted to\nICLR 2025\n(\n1 Highlight\n).\n[2024-09] Two papers accepted to\nNeurIPS 2024\n(1 Main Track & 1 D&B Track).\n[2024-07] Two papers accepted to\nECCV 2024\n.\n[2024-03] Three papers accepted to\nCVPR 2024\n(\n1 Highlight\n).\n[2024-01] One paper accepted to\nICLR 2024\n.\n[2023-08] One paper accepted to\nSIGGRAPH Asia 2023\n.\n[2023-07] We are organizing\nOmniObject3D Challenge\n, hosted by\nAI for 3D Content Creation Workshop\non\nICCV 2023\n.\n[2023-07] One paper accepted to\nICCV 2023\n(\nas Oral\n).\n[2023-06] Invited talk at\n3D Scene Understanding Workshop\non\nCVPR 2023\n.\n[2023-02] One paper accepted to\nCVPR 2023\n(\nas Award Candidate, Top 12/9155\n).\n[2023-01] One paper accepted to\nICLR 2023\n(\nas Spotlight\n).\n[2021-09] Two papers accepted to\nNeurIPS 2021\n.\n[2021-07] We are organizing\nICCV 2021 SenseHuman Workshop\nand\nMVP Challenge\n.\n[2021-06] Invited talks at\nRCV Workshop in CVPR 2021\nand\nTechbeat\n.\n[2021-03] Two papers accepted to\nCVPR 2021\n(\nboth as Orals\n).\n[2020-07] Two papers accepted to\nECCV 2020\n(\n1 Spotlight\n).\n[2020-06] Happy graduation!!\n[2020-04] Awarded Hong Kong PhD Fellowship Scheme (\nHKPFS\n).\nExperience\nPostDoc\nStanford University\nJan 2025 –\n                \n                  Present\nCalifornia, US\nVisiting Student Researcher\nStanford University\nJan 2024 –\n                \n                  Apr 2024\nCalifornia, US\nPh.D. Student at MMLab@CUHK\nThe Chinese University of Hong Kong\nAug 2020 –\n                \n                  Oct 2024\nHong Kong, China\nBachelor Degree in Engineering\nTsinghua University\nAug 2016 –\n                \n                  Jun 2020\nBeijing, China\nPublications\nVideo World Models with Long-term Spatial Memory\narxiv, 2025\nTong Wu\n*,\nShuai Yang\n*,\nRyan Po\n,\nYinghao Xu\n,\nZiwei Liu\n,\nDahua Lin\n,\nGordon Wetzstein\nPDF\nCite\nProject\nHiFlow: Training-free High-Resolution Image Generation with Flow-Aligned Guidance\narxiv, 2025\nJiazi Bu\n,\nPengyang Ling\n,\nYujie Zhou\n,\nPan Zhang\n,\nTong Wu\n,\nXiaoyi Dong\n,\nYuhang Zang\n,\nYuhang Cao\n,\nDahua Lin\n,\nJiaqi Wang\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nProject\nGenDoP: Auto-regressive Camera Trajectory Generation as a Director of Photography\nICCV, 2025\nMengchen Zhang\n,\nTong Wu\n,\nJing Tan\n,\nZiwei Liu\n,\nGordon Wetzstein\n,\nDahua Lin\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nProject\nLight-A-Video: Training-free Video Relighting via Progressive Light Fusion\nICCV, 2025\nYujie Zhou\n,\nJiazi Bu\n,\nPengyang Ling\n,\nPan Zhang\n,\nTong Wu\n,\nQidong Huang\n,\nJinsong Li\n,\nXiaoyi Dong\n,\nYuhang Zang\n,\nYuhang Cao\n,\nAnyi Rao\n,\nJiaqi Wang\n,\nLi Niu\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nProject\nRelightVid: Temporal-Consistent Diffusion Model for Video Relighting\narxiv, 2025\nYe Fang\n*,\nZeyi Sun\n*,\nShangzhan Zhang\n,\nTong Wu\n,\nYinghao Xu\n,\nPan Zhang\n,\nJiaqi Wang\n,\nGordon Wetzstein\n,\nDahua Lin\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nProject\nImagine360: Immersive 360 Video Generation from Perspective Anchor\narXiv, 2024\nJing Tan\n*,\nShuai Yang\n*,\nTong Wu\n,\nJingwen He\n,\nYuwei Guo\n,\nZiwei Liu\n,\nDahua Lin\nCite\nCode\nProject\nFiVA: Fine-grained Visual Attribute Dataset for Text-to-Image Diffusion Models\nNeurIPS, 2024 (Datasets and Benchmarks Track)\nTong Wu\n,\nYinghao Xu\n,\nRyan Po\n,\nMengchen Zhang\n,\nGuandao Yang\n,\nJiaqi Wang\n,\nZiwei Liu\n,\nDahua Lin\n,\nGordon Wetzstein\nCite\nCode\nProject\nLOKI: A Comprehensive Synthetic Data Detection Benchmark using Large Multimodal Models\nICLR, 2025\nHighlight\nJunyan Ye\n*,\nBaichuan Zhou\n*,\nZilong Huang\n,\nJunan Zhang\n*,\nTianyi Bai\n,\nHengrui Kang\n,\nJun He\n,\nHonglin Lin\n,\nZihao Wang\n,\nTong Wu\n,\nZhizheng Wu\n,\nYiping Chen\n,\nDahua Lin\n,\nConghui He\n,\nWeijia Li\n*\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nProject\nBroadWay: Boost Your Text-to-Video Generation Model in a Training-free Way\nCVPR, 2025\nJiazi Bu\n*,\nPengyang Ling\n*,\nPan Zhang\n,\nTong Wu\n,\nXiaoyi Dong\n,\nYuhang Zang\n,\nYuhang Cao\n,\nDahua Lin\n,\nJiaqi Wang\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nProject\n3DTopia-XL: Scaling High-quality 3D Asset Generation via Primitive Diffusion\nCVPR, 2025\nHighlight\nZhaoxi Chen\n,\nJiaxiang Tang\n,\nYuhao Dong\n,\nZiang Cao\n,\nFangzhou Hong\n,\nYushi Lan\n,\nTengfei Wang\n,\nHaozhe Xie\n,\nTong Wu\n,\nShunsuke Saito\n,\nLiang Pan\n,\nDahua Lin\n,\nZiwei Liu\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nProject\nLayerPano3D: Layered 3D Panorama for Hyper-Immersive Scene Generation\nSIGGRAPH, 2025\n*\nShuai Yang\n*,\nJing Tan\n*,\nMengchen Zhang\n,\nTong Wu\n,\nYixuan Li\n,\nGordon Wetzstein\n,\nZiwei Liu\n,\nDahua Lin\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nProject\nTailor3D: Customized 3D Assets Editing and Generation with Dual-Side Images\narXiv, 2024\nZhangyang Qi\n,\nYunhan Yang\n,\nMengchen Zhang\n,\nLong Xing\n,\nXiaoyang Wu\n,\nTong Wu\n,\nDahua Lin\n5,\nXihui Liu\n,\nJiaqi Wang\n,\nHengshuang Zhao\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nProject\nBootstrap3D: Improving Multi-view Diffusion Model with Synthetic Data\narXiv, 2024\nZeyi Sun\n,\nTong Wu\n,\nPan Zhang\n,\nYuhang Zang\n,\nXiaoyi Dong\n,\nYuanjun Xiong\n,\nDahua Lin\n,\nJiaqi Wang\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nProject\nMotionClone: Training-Free Motion Cloning