nt Generation and Editing from a Single Image\nSIGGRAPH Asia, 2023, conference track\nTong Wu\n*,\nZhibing Li\n*,\nShuai Yang\n*,\nPan Zhang\n,\nXingang Pan\n,\nJiaqi Wang\n,\nZiwei Liu\n,\nDahua Lin\nCite\nProject\nOmniObject3D: Large-Vocabulary 3D Object Dataset for Realistic Perception, Reconstruction and Generation\nCVPR, 2023\nBest Paper Award Candidate, Top 12/9155\nTong Wu\n, Jiarui Zhang,\nXiao Fu\n, Yuxin Wang,\nJiawei Ren\n,\nLiang Pan\n,\nWayne Wu\n,\nLei Yang\n,\nJiaqi Wang\n,\nChen Qian\n,\nDahua Lin\n,\nZiwei Liu\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nProject\nV3Det: Vast Vocabulary Visual Detection Dataset\nICCV, 2023\nOral presentation\nJiaqi Wang*\n,\nPan Zhang*\n,\nTao Chu*\n,\nYuhang Cao*\n, Yujie Zhou,\nTong Wu\n, Bin Wang,\nConghui He\n,\nDahua Lin\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nProject\nVoxurf: Voxel-based Efficient and Accurate Neural Surface Reconstruction\nICLR, 2023\nSpotlight\nTong Wu\n,\nJiaqi Wang\n,\nXingang Pan\n,\nXudong Xu\n,\nChristian Theobalt\n,\nZiwei Liu\n,\nDahua Lin\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nDensity-aware Chamfer Distance as a Comprehensive Metric for Point Cloud Completion\nNeurIPS, 2021\nTong Wu\n,\nLiang Pan\n,\nJunzhe Zhang\n,\nTai Wang\n,\nZiwei Liu\n,\nDahua Lin\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nFew-Shot Object Detection via Association and DIscrimination\nNeurIPS, 2021\nYuhang Cao\n,\nJiaqi Wang\n,\nYing Jin\n,\nTong Wu\n,\nKai Chen\n,\nZiwei Liu\n,\nDahua Lin\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nAdversarial Robustness under Long-Tailed Distribution\nCVPR, 2021\nOral presentation\nTong Wu\n,\nZiwei Liu\n,\nQingqiu Huang\n,\nYu Wang\n,\nDahua Lin\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nTowards Evaluating and Training Verifiably Robust Neural Networks\nCVPR, 2021\nOral presentation\nZhaoyang Lyu\n,\nMinghao Guo\n,\nTong Wu\n,\nGuodong Xu\n,\nDahua Lin\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nShaping Deep Feature Space towards Gaussian Mixture for Visual Classification\nTPAMI, 2022\nWeitao Wan\n,\nJiansheng Chen\n, Cheng Yu,\nTong Wu\n, Yuanyi Zhong,\nMing-Hsuan Yang\nPDF\nCite\nDistribution-Balanced Loss for Multi-Label Classification in Long-Tailed Datasets\nECCV, 2020\nSpotlight\nTong Wu\n,\nQingqiu Huang\n,\nZiwei Liu\n,\nYu Wang\n,\nDahua Lin\nPDF\nCite\nCode\nCaption-Supervised Face Recognition: Training a State-of-the-Art Face Model without Manual Annotation\nECCV, 2020\nQingqiu Huang\n,\nLei Yang\n,\nHuaiyi Huang\n,\nTong Wu\n,\nDahua Lin\nPDF\nCite\nProject\nPhysical Adversarial Attack on Vehicle Detector in the Carla Simulator\nTechnique report, 2020\nTong Wu\n,\nXuefei Ning\n,\nWenshuo Li\n,\nRanran Huang\n,\nHuazhong Yang\n,\nYu Wang\nPDF\nCite\nVisual-friendly Aesthetic QR Code Generation using Image Style Transfer\nTechnique report, 2019\nTong Wu\n,\nJiansheng Chen\n,\nYiqing Huang\n,\nYu Wang\nPDF\nCite\nHonors and Awards\nECCV 2024 Outstanding Reviewer\n, 2024\nCVPR 2023 Award Candidate\n, 2023\nHong Kong PhD Fellowship Scheme (HKPFS)\nof Hong Kong, 2020\nOutstanding Graduate\nof Beijing, 2020\nOutstanding Graduate\nof Tsinghua University, 2020\nOutstanding Graduation Paper\nof Tsinghua University, 2020\nNational Scholarship\n, 2018\nThree times Annual Scholarship for Academic Excellence\nby Tsinghua University, 2017-2019\nFirst Prize\nfor National Physical Competition for College Students in China, 2017\nCite\n×\nCopy\nDownload"
