  "deep_homepage::Ziwei Liu::https://liuziwei7.github.io/": {
    "homepage": "https://liuziwei7.github.io/",
    "all_emails": [
      "ziwei.liu@ntu.edu.sg"
    ],
    "matched_email": null,
    "github": "https://github.com/liuziwei7",
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Ziwei Liu - Homepage\nHome\n·\nResearch\n·\nPublications\n·\nSoftwares\n·\nTeam\n·\nServices\n·\nAwards\nZiwei Liu\n刘子纬\nAssociate Professor\nCollege of Computing and Data Science\nNanyang Technological University\nEmail: ziwei.liu at ntu.edu.sg\nGoogle Scholar\nGitHub\nTwitter\nShort Bio\nProf. Ziwei Liu is an Associate Professor at\nMMLab@NTU\n,\nCollege of Computing and Data Science\nin\nNanyang Technological University, Singapore\n.\n            Previously, he was a research fellow in\nChinese University of Hong Kong\nwith Prof.\nDahua Lin\nand a post-doc researcher in\nUniversity of California, Berkeley\nwith Prof.\nStella Yu\n. His research interests include computer vision, machine learning and computer graphics.\nZiwei received his Ph.D. (2013-2017) from\nMultimedia Lab\n,\nCUHK\n, advised by Prof.\nXiaoou Tang\nand Prof.\nXiaogang Wang\n. He is fortunate to have internships at\nMicrosoft Research\nand\nGoogle Research\n.\nZiwei is the recipient of\nPAMI Mark Everingham Prize\n,\nMIT TR Innovators under 35 Asia Pacific\n,\nICBS Frontiers of Science Award\n,\nCVPR Best Paper Award Candidate\n,\nAsian Young Scientist Fellowship\nand\nSingapore President's Young Scientist Award\n.\nHis works have been transferred to products, including\nMicrosoft Pix\n,\nSenseGo\nand\nGoogle Clips\n.\nNews\n[Twitter]\n[2026-01] NTU CCDS Research Award\n[2026-01] NTU CCDS Most Popular Teacher Award\n[2025-12]\nLMMs-Lab\nis selected as\nTop-10 Chinese Open Source Heatmap in 2025\n.\n[2025-11]\nPenghao\nis awarded\nByteDance PhD Fellowship 2025\n.\n[2025-10] Invited talk (\nslides\n) at ACM MM 2025 Workshop on\nLarge Generative Models\n.\n[2025-10]\nZiang\nis awarded\nGoogle PhD Fellowship 2025\n.\n[2025-10] Invited talk (\nslides\n) at ICCV 2025 Workshop on\nEgocentric Body Motion Tracking, Synthesis\n.\n[2025-10] Invited talk (\nslides\n) at ICCV 2025 Workshop on\nInteractive Human-centric Foundation Models\n.\n[2025-10] Invited talk (\nslides\n) at ICCV 2025 Workshop on\nMultimodal Continual Learning\n.\n[2025-10] Invited talk (\nslides\n) at ICCV 2025 Tutorial on\nReasoning in Vision-Language Models\n.\n[2025-10]\nVChain\nis selected as\nICCV 2025 KnowledgeMR Workshop Outstanding Paper Award\n.\n[2025-10]\nCelebA\nis awarded CCF-CV Test of Time Award\n.\n[2025-10]\nSingapore President's Young Scientist Award\n.\n[2025-10] Invited talk (\nslides\n) at Mini3DV 2025.\n[2025-09] We are hosting ICCV 2025\nVideo-TT\nChallenge.\n[2025-09]\nWeichen\nand\nMutian\nare recognized as\nICCV 2025 Outstanding Reviewers\n.\n[2025-09]\nYuming\nis awarded CCDS Outstanding PhD Thesis Award (Honourable Mention).\n[2025-08]\nVideo-MMMU\nis covered in\nOpenAI GPT-5 Public Release\n.\n[2025-07]\nEvaluation Agent\nis selected as\nACL 2025 SAC Highlights Award\n.\n[2025-07]\nCoOp\nis selected as\nWAIC 2025 Youth Outstanding Paper Award\n.\n[2025-06] Invited talk (\nslides\n) at CVPR 2025 Workshop on\nEfficient and On-Device Generation\n.\n[2025-06] Invited talk (\nslides\n) at CVPR 2025 Workshop on\nHuman Motion Generation\n.\n[2025-06] We are organizing CVPR 2025 Tutorial on\nFrom Video Generation to World Model\n.\n[2025-06] Invited talk (\nslides\n) at\nVALSE 2025\n.\n[2025-06] We are hosting IROS 2025\nRoboSense\nChallenge."
  },
  "deep_homepage::Dahua Lin::https://www.ie.cuhk.edu.hk/faculty/lin-dahua/": {
