    "homepage_text": "SihaoDing (丁斯昊)'s Homepage\nSihao Ding 丁斯昊\nRecommendation Algorithm Engineer at ByteDance\n(TikTok)\n.\nPh.D. at University of Science and Technology of China\n(USTC)\n.\nAdvisor:\nXiangnan He (何向南)\n&\nFuli Feng (冯福利)\n.\nResearch Interests:\nData mining, Recommender system,\nCausal inference, and Graph learning.\ndnumberfour4@gmail.com\ndsihao@mail.ustc.edu.cn\nHefei, China\nResearch\nInterpolative Distillation for Unifying Biased and Debiased Recommendation\nSihao Ding\n, Fuli Feng, Xiangnan He, Jinqiu Jin, Wenjie Wang, Yong Liao, Yongdong Zhang\nSIGIR '22\nDownload:\r\n                        [\nPDF\n]\nAddressing Unmeasured Confounder for Recommendation with Sensitivity Analysis\nSihao Ding\n, Peng Wu, Fuli Feng, Yitong Wang, Xiangnan He, Yong Liao, Yongdong Zhang\nKDD '22\nDownload:\r\n                        [\nPDF\n]\nCausal Incremental Graph Convolution for Recommender System Retraining\nSihao Ding\n, Fuli Feng, Xiangnan He, Yong Liao, Jun Shi, Yongdong Zhang\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (TNNLS)\nDownload:\r\n                        [\nPDF\n]\nUnderstanding and Counteracting Feature-Level Bias in Click-Through Rate Prediction\nJinqiu Jin,\nSihao Ding\n, Wenjie Wang, Fuli Feng\nWWW '24\nDownload:\r\n                        [\nPDF\n]\nBe Aware of the Neighborhood Effect: Modeling Selection Bias under Interference for Recommendation\nHaoxuan Li, Chunyuan Zheng,\nSihao Ding\n, Fuli Feng, Xiangnan He, Zhi Geng, Peng Wu\nICLR '24\nDownload:\r\n                        [\nPDF\n]\nFairly Recommending with Social Attributes: A Flexible and Controllable Optimization Approach\nJinqiu Jin, Haoxuan Li, Fuli Feng,\nSihao Ding\n, Peng Wu, Xiangnan\nNeurIPS '23\nDownload:\r\n                        [\nPDF\n]\nEducation\nUniversity of Science and Technology of China (USTC)\n2018.09 - 2023.06\nSchool of Information Science and Technology & School of Cyber Science and Technology.\nAdvisor:\nXiangnan He (何向南)\n&\nFuli Feng (冯福利)\n.\nMentor:\nManqing Wu (吴曼青)\n&\nYongdong Zhang (张勇东)\n.\nResearch topics: Recommender systems, Causal inference, Graph learning.\nThesis: 因果增强的去偏推荐方法研究\nXIDIAN University (XIDIAN)\n2014.09 - 2018.07\nB.Eng.\nin School of Electronic Engineering. GPA: 4.0 (92/100), Ranking: Top-5% tire\nThesis: Micro-expression recognition based on deep learning.\nAwards & Honors\n2023\nWeiLai Special Scholarship\nin University of Science and Technology of China.\n18-23\nFirst Class Scholarship\nin University of Science and Technology of China.\n2018\nOutstanding Award\nin Mathematical Contest In Modeling.\n2018\nOutstanding Bachelor's Thesis Award\nin XiDian University.\n2017\nChina National Scholarship\n."
