rnal of Biological Chemistry.\n301\n,\n5\n, 108458.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nEnzalutamide\n100%\nProstate Cancer\n100%\nArtesunate\n100%\nAndrogen Receptor\n28%\nDrug Screening\n14%\nCancer-associated fibroblast secreted DKK1 promotes the immunosuppressive tumor microenvironment and colorectal cancer resistance to chemotherapy\nYin, Z., Zhou, Y., Zhu, X., Goettl, R. A.,\nWang, C.\n,\nWeiss, H. L.\n,\nEvers, B. M.\n&\nWang, Q.\n,\nDec 1 2025\n,\nIn:\nCancer Letters.\n634\n, 218060.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nTumor Microenvironment\n100%\nColorectal Carcinoma\n100%\nCancer Resistance\n100%\nCancer Associated Fibroblast\n100%\nImmunosuppressive Drug\n100%\nFocal Adhesion Kinase Intersects With the BRD4-MYC Axis and YAP1 to Drive Tumor Cell Growth, Phenotypic Plasticity, Stemness, and Metastatic Potential in Colorectal Cancer\nHan, R., Shi, J., Cheng, K., Wang, Z., Chen, Y., Spellecy, O., Faisal, A. S. M., Aryal, I., Chen, J.,\nCraven, R.\n,\nThibault, O.\n,\nBaldwin, L.\n, Brewer, L. D., Erfani, S.,\nWang, C.\n,\nGuo, Z.\n, Chen, E., Yang, B.,\nUeland, F.\n& Guo, R.\n& 1 others\n,\nYang, X.\n,\nSep 2025\n,\nIn:\nCancer Medicine.\n14\n,\n18\n, e71227.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nBRD4\n100%\nYAP1\n100%\nPhenotypic Plasticity\n100%\nTumor Progression\n100%\nJanus Kinase 1\n100%\n2\nScopus \n citations\nView all 193 Research outputs\nYour message has successfully been sent.\nYour message was not sent due to an error.\nx\nContact Chi Wang, Ph.D.\nSubject\n*\nMessage\n*\nYour name:\n*\nYour email:\n*\nSend me a copy of this message\n*required field\nCancel\nSend"
