    "homepage_text": "Jianhong Bai (白健弘) / Academics Page\nJianhong Bai (白健弘)\n4th-year Ph.D. candidate\nFollow\nZhejiang University, China\nEmail\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nAbout Me\nHi there! I’m Jianhong Bai. I am a 5th-year Ph.D. candidate at Zhejiang University, advised by Prof. Haoji Hu. Currently, I’m a research intern with the Kling Team, focusing on video generation. I was fortunate to intern at MSRA, working with many fantastic researchers. Feel free to reach out to me at\ncpurgicn@gmail.com\n.\nI will be graduating in the summer of 2026 and am currently seeking job opportunities. Please feel free to contact me via email.\nRecent News\n2025/10\n: Our work ReCamMaster is selected as ICCV'25 Best Paper Finalist.\n2025/08\n: 2 paper accepted by SIGGRAPH ASIA'25.\n2025/07\n: 1 paper accepted by ICCV'25.\n2025/01\n: 1 paper accepted by ICLR'25.\n2024/12\n: 1 paper accepted by AAAI'25.\n2024/05\n: Start a research internship at Kling Team, advised by Prof.\nMenghan Xia\nand Prof.\nXintao Wang\n.\n2023/12\n: 1 paper accepted by AAAI'24.\n2023/09\n: 2 paper accepted by NeurIPS'23.\n2023/08\n: Start a research internship at Microsoft Research Asia (MSRA), advised by Prof.\nTianyu He\nand Prof.\nXu Tan\n.\n2023/01\n: 1 paper accepted by ICLR'23.\n2021/09\n: Join Prof.\nHu\n's lab at Zhejiang University.\nSelected Publications\nJianhong Bai\n, Menghan Xia, Xintao Wang et al. \"ReCamMaster: Camera-Controlled Generative Rendering from A Single Video\". In\nICCV\n2025,\nBest Paper Finalist\n.\nArxiv\nProject page\nJianhong Bai\n, Menghan Xia, Xintao Wang et al. \"SynCamMaster: Synchronizing Multi-Camera Video Generation from Diverse Viewpoints\". In\nICLR\n2025.\nArxiv\nProject page\nYawen Luo,\nJianhong Bai\n, Xiaoyu Shi et al. \"CamCloneMaster: Enabling Reference-based Camera Control for Video Generation\". In\nSIGGRAPH ASIA\n2025.\nArxiv\nProject page\nJiwen Yu,\nJianhong Bai\n, Yiran Qin et al. \"Context as Memory: Scene-Consistent Interactive Long Video Generation with Memory Retrieval\". In\nSIGGRAPH ASIA\n2025.\nArxiv\nProject page\nJianhong Bai\n, Tianyu He, Yuchi Wang et al. \"UniEdit: A Unified Tuning-Free Framework for Video Motion and Appearance Editing\". In\nACM MM\n2025.\nArxiv\nCode\nProject page\nXiao Fu, Xintao Wang, Xian Liu,\nJianhong Bai\net al. \"Learning Video Generation for Robotic Manipulation with Collaborative Trajectory Control\".\nPreprint\n2025.\nArxiv\nCode\nProject page\nYuchi Wang, Junliang Guo,\nJianhong Bai\net al. \"InstructAvatar: Text-Guided Emotion and Motion Control for Avatar Generation\". In\nAAAI\n2024.\nArxiv\nProject page\nJianhong Bai\n, Zuozhu Liu, Hualiang Wang et al. \"Towards Distribution-Agnostic Generalized Category Discovery\". In\nNeurIPS\n2023.\nArxiv\nCode\nJianhong Bai\n, Zuozhu Liu, Hualiang Wang et al. \"On The Effectiveness of Out-of-Distribution Data in Self-Supervised Long-Tail Learning\". In\nICLR\n2023.\nArxiv\nCode\nJianhong Bai\n, Yuchen Yang, Huanpeng Chu et al. \"Robustness-Guided Image Synthesis for Data-Free Quantization\". In\nAAAI\n2024.\nArxiv\nLianrui Mu*,\nJianhong Bai*\n, Xiaoxuan He et al. \"TeG-DG: Textually Guided Domain Generalization for Face Anti-Spoofing\".\nPreprint\n.\nArxiv\nExperience\nResearch Intern, Kling, Kuaishou\nMay. 2024 - Present\nAdvisor:\nMenghan Xia\n,\nXintao Wang\nInterests: Controllable Video Generation\nResearch Intern, Machine Learning Group, Microsoft Research Asia\nAug. 2023 - May. 2024\nAdvisor:\nTianyu He\n,\nXu Tan\nInterests: Video Editing\nPh. D. Candidate, Zhejiang University\nSep. 2021 - Present\nAdvisor:\nHaoji Hu\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected."
  },
