    "homepage_text": "Zuozhu LIU | 浙江大学ZJUI（ZJU-UIUC Institute）\nMenu\nStudent\nFaculty&Staff\nParents\nVisitors\nCN\nSearch\nSearch\n简体中文\nEnglish\nCN\nZJUI\nHome\nAbout\nAbout\nOverview\nLeadership\nOrganization Chart\nServices Guide\nNotices\nPeople\nPeople\nFaculty\nPostdoc\nStaff\nAcademics\nAcademics\nAcademic Calendar\nUndergraduate Programs\nGraduate Programs\nTeaching Labs\nStudent Handbook\nStudents\nStudents\nStudent Handbook\nStudent Community\nAchievements\nInternship\nCareer & Entrepreneurship\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch Overview\nCollaborating Institutions\nResearch Programs\nInternational Collaboration\nResearch Achievements\nAcademic Exchange\nAdmissions\nAdmissions\nUndergraduate Admissions\nGraduate Admissions\nCampus Life\nCampus Life\nExploring Haining\nVisiting Guide\nStudent Community\nDiversified Cultures\nCampus Scenery\nContact US\nSupport US\nVisiting US\nJoin Us\nStudent\nTeacher\nParents\nVisitors\nHome\n/\nTeam\n/\nDetails\nZuozhu LIU\nPosition：\nAssistant Professor\nEmail：\nzuozhuliu@intl.zju.edu.cn\nHome Page：\nIntroduction：\nPrior to joining ZJUI, Dr.Zuozhu was a research fellow from the Department of Statistics and Applied Probability in National University of Singapore. Prior to joining NUS, he completed his PhD at Singapore University of Technology and Design in 2019 under the guidance of Prof. Tony Q.S. Quek and Prof. LIN Shaowei and B.Eng at Zhejiang University in 2015.  During his PhD study, he was intern at  Preferred Networks Inc in Tokyo, working on deep reinforcement learning.  His research mainly focuses on Big Data Analytics in Wireless Networks, Generative Models and Representation Learning.\nDirection：\nBig Data Analytics in Wireless Networks, Generative Models and Representation Learning\n©2021 Zhejiang University\n浙ICP备05074421号-1\n浙公网安备33010602010295\nLinks\nMaps\nDownload\nJoin Us\nContact US\nFeedback\nZhejiang University\nInternational Campus\nInternational College\nUIUC\nGrainger College of Engineering\n回到顶部"
  },
