    "homepage_text": "Derek Lim\nAbout\nPapers\nPosts\nOther\nContact\nI can be reached by email at dereklim(at)mit[dot]edu.\n\n---\n\nDerek Lim\nAbout\nPapers\nPosts\nOther\nContact\nI can be reached by email at dereklim(at)mit[dot]edu.\n\n---\n\nAbout\nDerek Lim\nAbout\nPapers\nPosts\nOther\nAbout\nCurrent:\n4th year EECS PhD (started in 2021) student at MIT\nCSAIL\nAdvised by\nStefanie Jegelka\n, and also working closely with\nHaggai Maron\nSupported by a National Science Foundation Graduate Fellowship (NSF GRFP)\nPart-time ML scientist at\nLiquid AI\nMostly working on post-training, but involved in many parts of the LLM pipeline.\nOrganizer of the\nBoston Symmetry Group\nPrevious:\nResearch intern at NVIDIA, Summer 2023\nOrganizer of the first Learning on Graphs Conference:\nLoG 2022\nResearch intern at Meta AI, Summer 2022\nUndergrad in Math and CS at Cornell University\nResearch Interests:\nI like working with neural network parameter spaces / loss landscapes, symmetries in machine learning, and various types of structure in machine learning.\nCV:\nMy academic CV can be found\nhere\n.\nContact:\nMy contact information can be found\nhere\n.\n\n---\n\nAbout\nDerek Lim\nAbout\nPapers\nPosts\nOther\nAbout\nCurrent:\n4th year EECS PhD (started in 2021) student at MIT\nCSAIL\nAdvised by\nStefanie Jegelka\n, and also working closely with\nHaggai Maron\nSupported by a National Science Foundation Graduate Fellowship (NSF GRFP)\nPart-time ML scientist at\nLiquid AI\nMostly working on post-training, but involved in many parts of the LLM pipeline.\nOrganizer of the\nBoston Symmetry Group\nPrevious:\nResearch intern at NVIDIA, Summer 2023\nOrganizer of the first Learning on Graphs Conference:\nLoG 2022\nResearch intern at Meta AI, Summer 2022\nUndergrad in Math and CS at Cornell University\nResearch Interests:\nI like working with neural network parameter spaces / loss landscapes, symmetries in machine learning, and various types of structure in machine learning.\nCV:\nMy academic CV can be found\nhere\n.\nContact:\nMy contact information can be found\nhere\n."
