    "homepage_text": "Wenjia Wang's Personal Site\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nWenjia Wang's Personal Site\nHome\nWenjia Wang\nPresidential Young Professor\nDepartment of Industrial Systems Engineering and Management, National University of Singapore.\nEmail: wenjiawang@nus.edu.sg\nResearch Interests\nUncertainty Quantification\nStochastic Simulation\nMachine Learning\nNonparametric Statistics\nComputer Experiments\nI am looking for\nPhD Students and p\nostdocs to join my research group.\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
