    "homepage_text": "Yanan Zheng - Agricultural and Resource Economics, UC Davis\nSkip to main content\nLog In\nCluster 5\nUC Davis\nUC Davis Agricultural and Resource Economics\nYanan Zheng\nCurriculum Vitae\nCurriculum Vitae\nPublications\n's\nJob Market Paper\nContact Information\n2145 Social Sciences and Humanities\nPostdoctoral Scholar\nAgricultural and Resource Economics\n2145 Social Sciences and Humanities\nUniversity of California, Davis\nDissertation Committee\nRachael Goodhue\nEducation\nPh.D., 2025\nUniversity of California, Davis\nContact Us\n2116 Social Sciences and Humanities\nUniversity of California, Davis\nOne Shields Avenue\nDavis, CA 95616\nMain Office: 530-752-1515\nStudent Advising Services: 530-754-9536\nFollow Us\nPrinciples of Community\nSite Map\nSearch\nDonate"
