  "deep_homepage::Ming Zhang::https://mzhang367.github.io/": {
    "homepage": "https://mzhang367.github.io/",
    "all_emails": [
      "mzhang367-c@my.cityu"
    ],
    "matched_email": null,
    "github": "https://github.com/mzhang367",
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Ming ZHANG's homepage\nMing Zhang\n章銘\nPh.D.\nHuawei Hong Kong Research Center,\nBuilding 2W, Hong Kong Science Park, N.T.,\nHong Kong.\nEmail:\nmzhang367-c (at) my (dot) cityu (dot) edu (dot) hk\nAbout\nI am currently a senior algorithm engineer in the Celia Team (Huawei's AI virtual assistant), at Huawei Hong Kong Research Center, located in Pak Shek Kok, Hong Kong Science Park. Previously, I worked as a senior machine learning engineer at Hong Kong Applied Science and Technology Research Institute (ASTRI), and before that, I was a postdoctoral researcher at\nCIMDA\n.\nI earned my Ph.D. in\nElectrical Engineering (EE)\n, from\nCity University of Hong Kong (CityU)\nin 2021, where I was supervised by\nProf. Hong Yan\n. Earlier, I obtained my MSc in Electronic Information Engineering (with Distinction), also from the EE department, CityU. I completed my B.Eng. in Automation from Nanjing Normal University in 2017.\nI am now working on Multimodal LLM projects. Specifically, I am interested in unified multimodal models for understanding, generation and image editing. I am also interested in Continual/Lifelong Learning for MLLMs, which aims to preserve original knowledge of MLLMs when acquiring new multimodal capabilities.\nSelected Publications\n[\nGoogle Scholar\n]\nCURSOR: Scalable Mixed-Order Hypergraph Matching with CUR Decomposition\nQixuan Zheng,\nMing Zhang\n, Hong Yan.\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(CVPR), 2024\n[\npaper\n][\nsupp.\n]\nOrthonormal Product Quantization Network for Scalable Face Image Retrieval\nMing Zhang\n, Xuefei Zhe, Hong Yan.\nPattern Recognition\n, 2023\n[\npaper\n][\ncode\n]\nDeep Center-Based Dual-Constrained Hashing for Discriminative Face Image Retrieval\nMing Zhang\n, Xuefei Zhe, Shifeng Chen, Hong Yan.\nPattern Recognition\n, 2021\n[\npaper\n][\ncode\n]\nImproved Deep Classwise Hashing With Centers Similarity Learning for Image Retrieval\nMing Zhang\n, Hong Yan.\nInternational Conference on Pattern Recognition\n(ICPR), 2021\n[\npaper\n]\nDeep Eigen-Filters for Face Recognition: Feature Representation via Unsupervised Multi-Structure Filter Learning\nMing Zhang\n, Sheheryar Khan, Hong Yan.\nPattern Recognition\n, 2020.\n[\npaper\n]\nProfessional Activities\nPaper Reviewer\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision\nPattern Recognition\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology\nNeurocomputing\nExpert Systems with Applications\n© Ming Zhang | Last updated: Sep. 2025"
  },
