    "homepage_text": "Yunzhi Zhang\nYunzhi Zhang\nI am a Ph.D. student in the Computer Science Department at Stanford University,\r\n                        advised by\nJiajun Wu\n.\r\n                        I am affiliated with the\nStanford Artificial Intelligence Laboratory\nand\r\n                        the\nStanford Vision and Learning Lab\n.\nPreviously, I received B.A. in computer science and pure mathematics from UC Berkeley.\r\n                        I am grateful to receive advice from\nPieter Abbeel\nand\nLerrel Pinto\nwhen I did research as part of\r\n                        the\nBerkeley Artificial Intelligence Lab\n.\nEmail: yzzhang at cs dot stanford dot edu  /\nGoogle Scholar\n/\nGithub\n/\nTwitter\nResearch\nControllable Video Synthesis via Variational Inference\nHaoyi Duan\n*,\r\n                                    Yunzhi Zhang*,\nYilun Du\n,\nJiajun Wu\n(*equal contribution)\n[arXiv]\n[Webpage]\narXiv Preprint 2025\nProduct of Experts for Visual Generation\nYunzhi Zhang,\r\n                                    Carson Murtuza-Lanier,\nZizhang Li\n,\nYilun Du\n,\nJiajun Wu\n[arXiv]\n[Webpage]\narXiv Preprint 2025\nModel-Based Policy Adaptation for Closed-Loop End-to-end Autonomous Driving\nHaohong Lin\n,\r\n                                    Yunzhi Zhang,\nWenhao Ding\n,\nJiajun Wu\n,\nDing Zhao\nNeurIPS 2025\nThe Scene Language: Representing Scenes with Programs, Words, and Embeddings\nYunzhi Zhang,\nZizhang Li\n,\r\n                                    Matt Zhou,\nShangzhe Wu\n,\nJiajun Wu\n[arXiv]\n[Webpage]\n[Code]\nCVPR 2025 (Highlight)\nBirth and Death of a Rose\nChen Geng\n,\r\n                                    Yunzhi Zhang,\nShangzhe Wu\n,\nJiajun Wu\n[arXiv]\n[Webpage]\nCVPR 2025 (Oral)\nDigital Twin Catalog: A Large-Scale Photorealistic 3D Object Digital Twin Dataset\nZhao Dong\n,\nKa Chen*\n,\nZhaoyang Lv\n*\n,\nHong-Xing Yu\n*\n,\r\n                                    Yunzhi Zhang*,\nCheng Zhang\n*\n,\nYufeng Zhu\n*\n,\nStephen Tian\n,\nZhengqin Li\n,\r\n                                    Geordie Moffatt,\r\n                                    Sean Christofferson, \r\n                                    James Fort, \r\n                                    Xiaqing Pan, \r\n                                    Mingfei Yan,\nJiajun Wu\nCarl Yufeng Ren, \r\n                                    Richard Newcombe\r\n                                    (*equal contribution, alphabetical order)\n[arXiv]\n[Webpage]\n[Code]\nCVPR 2025 (Highlight)\nDiffusion Self-Distillation for Zero-Shot Customized Image Generation\nShengqu Cai\n,\nEric Ryan Chan\n,\r\n                                    Yunzhi Zhang,\nLeonidas Guibas\n,\nJiajun Wu\n,\nGordon Wetzstein\n[arXiv]\n[Webpage]\nCVPR 2025\n3D Congealing: 3D-Aware Image Alignment in the Wild\nYunzhi Zhang,\nZizhang Li\n,\nAmit Raj\n,\nAndreas Engelhardt\n,\nYuanzhen Li\n,\nTingbo Hou\n,\nJiajun Wu\n,\nVarun Jampani\n[arXiv]\n[Webpage]\nECCV 2024\nPonymation: Learning 3D Animal Motions from Unlabeled Online Videos\nKeqiang Sun\n*,\nDor Litvak\n*,\r\n                                    Yunzhi Zhang,\nHongsheng Li\n,\nJiajun Wu\n†,\nShangzhe Wu\n†\r\n                                    (*equal contribution, &#8224equal advising)\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-attribute\">\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.13604\">[arXiv]</a>\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://keqiangsun.github.io/projects/ponymation/\">[Webpage]</a>\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://github.com/3DAnimals/3DAnimals\">[Code]</a>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-venue\">ECCV 2024</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <!--======== Paper 10 =========-->\r\n                    <div class=\"services__content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"research__content\">\r\n                            <div class=\"research__content-teaser\">\r\n                                <img src='assets/img/fauna.gif' alt=\"Fauna\">\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"research__content-info\">\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-title\">Learning the 3D Fauna of the Web</div>\r\n                                <br>\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-author\">\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://kyleleey.github.io/\">Zizhang Li*</a>,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://dorlitvak.github.io/\">Dor Litvak*</a>,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://ruiningli.com/\">Ruining Li</a>,\r\n                                    Yunzhi Zhang,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.robots.ox.ac.uk/~tomj/\">Tomas Jakab</a>,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://chrirupp.github.io/\">Christian Rupprecht</a>,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://elliottwu.com/\">Shangzhe Wu</a>&#8224,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.robots.ox.ac.uk/~vedaldi/\">Andrea Vedaldi</a>&#8224,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://jiajunwu.com/\">Jiajun Wu</a>&#8224\r\n                                    (*equal contribution, &#8224equal advising)\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-attribute\">\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2401.02400\">[arXiv]</a>\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://kyleleey.github.io/3DFauna/\">[Webpage]</a>\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Kyle-Liz/3DFauna_demo\">[Demo]</a>\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://github.com/3DAnimals/3DAnimals\">[Code]</a>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-venue\">CVPR 2024</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <!--======== Paper 10 =========-->\r\n                    <div class=\"services__content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"research__content\">\r\n                            <div class=\"research__content-teaser\">\r\n                                <img src='assets/img/zeronvs.gif' alt=\"ZeroNVS\">\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"research__content-info\">\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-title\">ZeroNVS: Zero-Shot 360-Degree View Synthesis from a Single Real Image</div>\r\n                                <br>\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-author\">\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://kylesargent.github.io/\">Kyle Sargent</a>,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://kyleleey.github.io/\">Zizhang Li</a>,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tashah/\">Tanmay Shah</a>,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=LQvi5XAAAAAJ&hl=en%22\">Charles Herrmann</a>,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://kovenyu.com/\">Hong-Xing Yu</a>,\r\n                                    Yunzhi Zhang,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://ericryanchan.github.io/\">Eric Ryan Chan</a>,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=sY8lt7AAAAAJ&hl=en\">Dmitry Lagun</a>,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://profiles.stanford.edu/fei-fei-li\">Li Fei-Fei</a>,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://deqings.github.io/\">Deqing Sun</a>,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://jiajunwu.com\">Jiajun Wu</a>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-attribute\">\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.17994\">[arXiv]</a>\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://kylesargent.github.io/zeronvs/\">[Webpage]</a>\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://github.com/kylesargent/zeronvs\">[Code]</a>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-venue\">CVPR 2024</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <!--======== Paper =========-->\r\n                    <div class=\"services__content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"research__content\">\r\n                            <div class=\"research__content-teaser\">\r\n                                <img src='assets/img/shinobi.gif' alt=\"SHINOBI\">\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"research__content-info\">\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-title\">SHINOBI: Shape and Illumination using Neural Object Decomposition via BRDF Optimization In-the-wild</div>\r\n                                <br>\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-author\">\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://scholar.google.de/citations?user=ZQUFcqAAAAAJ&hl=de\">Andreas Engelhardt</a>,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://amitraj93.github.io/\">Amit Raj</a>,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://markboss.me/\">Mark Boss</a>,\r\n                                    Yunzhi Zhang,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://abhishekkar.info/\">Abhishek Kar</a>, \r\n                                    <a href=\"http://people.csail.mit.edu/yzli/\">Yuanzhen Li</a>, \r\n                                    <a href=\"http://ricardomartinbrualla.com/\">Ricardo Martin Brualla</a>, \r\n                                    <a href=\"https://deqings.github.io/\">Deqing Sun</a>, \r\n                                    <a href=\"https://jonbarron.info/\">Jonathan T. Barron</a>, \r\n                                    <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=2R22h84AAAAJ&hl=en\">Hendrik P. A. Lensch</a>, \r\n                                    <a href=\"https://varunjampani.github.io/\">Varun Jampani</a><br>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-attribute\">\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2401.10171\">[arXiv]</a>\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://shinobi.aengelhardt.com/\">[Webpage]</a>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-venue\">CVPR 2024</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <!--======== Paper 11 =========-->\r\n                    <div class=\"services__content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"research__content\">\r\n                            <div class=\"research__content-teaser\">\r\n                                <img src='assets/img/language_informed.gif' alt=\"Language-Informed-Concept\">\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"research__content-info\">\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-title\">Language-Informed Visual Concept Learning</div>\r\n                                <br>\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-author\">\r\n                                    Sharon Lee*,\r\n                                    Yunzhi Zhang*,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://elliottwu.com/\">Shangzhe Wu</a>,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://jiajunwu.com\">Jiajun Wu</a>\r\n                                    (*equal contribution, alphabetical order)\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-attribute\">\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.03587\">[arXiv]</a>\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://ai.stanford.edu/~yzzhang/projects/concept-axes/\">[Webpage]</a>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-venue\">ICLR 2024</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <!--======== Paper 9 =========-->\r\n                    <div class=\"services__content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"research__content\">\r\n                            <div class=\"research__content-teaser\">\r\n                                <img src='assets/img/orb.gif' alt=\"orb\">\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"research__content-info\">\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-title\">Stanford-ORB: A Real-World 3D Object Inverse Rendering Benchmark</div>\r\n                                <br>\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-author\">\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://zhengfeikuang.com/\">Zhengfei Kuang</a>*,\r\n                                    Yunzhi Zhang*,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://kovenyu.com/\">Hong-Xing Yu</a>,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://samiragarwala.github.io/\">Samir Agarwala</a>,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://elliottwu.com/\">Shangzhe Wu</a>,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://jiajunwu.com\">Jiajun Wu</a> (*equal contribution)\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-attribute\">\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.16044\">[arXiv]</a>\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://stanfordorb.github.io/\">[Webpage]</a>\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://github.com/StanfordORB/Stanford-ORB\">[Code]</a>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-venue\">NeurIPS 2023 Datasets and Benchmarks Track</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <!--======== Paper 8 =========-->\r\n                    <div class=\"services__content\">\r\n                        <div class=\"research__content\">\r\n                            <div class=\"research__content-teaser\">\r\n                                <img src='assets/img/heim.png' alt=\"HEIM\">\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"research__content-info\">\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-title\">Holistic Evaluation of Text-to-Image Models</div>\r\n                                <br>\r\n                                <div class=\"research__content-info-author\">\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=OYNdx48AAAAJ\">Tony Lee</a>*,\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://cs.stanford.edu/~myasu/\">Michihiro Yasunaga</a>*,\r\n    ...[truncated]"
