    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Yitong Deng\nYitong Deng\nYitong Deng 邓宜桐\nI am a second-year Ph.D. student in CS at Stanford advised by Prof.\nRon Fedkiw\n. My research interest lies in computer graphics, computational physics, and machine learning. \n        I strive to design numerical methods grounded in physical and mathematical principles to faithfully and efficiently simulate the motion of real-world objects.  \n        Before joining Stanford, I received my M.S. from Dartmouth College, where I was very fortunate to work with Prof.\nBo Zhu\n. \n        I received my B.A.\nsumma cum laude\nfrom Colby College.\nEmail: yitongd [at] stanford (dot) edu\nPublications\nGo-with-the-Flow: Motion-Controllable Video Diffusion Models Using Real-Time Warped Noise\nCVPR 2025 (Oral)\nRyan Burgert, Yuancheng Xu, Wenqi Xian, Oliver Pilarski, Pascal Clausen, Mingming He, Li Ma,\nYitong Deng\n, Lingxiao Li, Mohsen Mousavi, Michael Ryoo, Paul Debevec, Ning Yu\n[\npaper\n] [\nwebpage\n] [\nvideo\n]\nInfinite-Resolution Integral Noise Warping for Diffusion Models\nICLR 2025\nYitong Deng\n, Winnie Lin, Lingxiao Li, Dmitriy Smirnov, Ryan Burgert, Ning Yu, Vincent Dedun, and Mohammad H. Taghavi\n[\npaper\n] [\nwebpage\n] [\nvideo\n]\nAn Eulerian Vortex Method on Flow Maps\nACM Transactions on Graphics (SIGGRAPH Asia 2024)\nSinan Wang,\nYitong Deng\n, Molin Deng, Hong-Xing Yu, Junwei Zhou, Duowen Chen, Taku Komura, Jiajun Wu, and Bo Zhu\n[\npaper\n] [\nwebpage\n] [\nvideo\n]\nEulerian-Lagrangian Fluid Simulation on Particle Flow Maps\nACM Transactions on Graphics (SIGGRAPH 2024)\nJunwei Zhou, Duowen Chen, Molin Deng,\nYitong Deng\n, Yuchen Sun, Sinan Wang, Shiying Xiong, Bo Zhu\n[\npaper\n] [\nwebpage\n] [\nvideo\n]\nA Vortex Particle-on-Mesh Method for Soap Film Simulation\nACM Transactions on Graphics (SIGGRAPH 2024)\nNingxiao Tao, Liangwang Ruan,\nYitong Deng\n, Bo Zhu, Bin Wang, Baoquan Chen\n[\npaper\n] [\nwebpage\n] [\nvideo\n]\nFluid Simulation on Neural Flow Maps\nACM Transactions on Graphics (SIGGRAPH Asia 2023)\nBest Paper Award\nYitong Deng\n, Hong-Xing \"Koven\" Yu, Diyang Zhang, Jiajun Wu, and Bo Zhu\n[\npaper\n] [\nwebpage\n] [\nvideo\n]\nSecond-Order Finite Elements for Deformable Surfaces\nSIGGRAPH Asia 2023\nQiqin Le,\nYitong Deng\n, Jiamu Bu, Bo Zhu, and Tao Du\n[\npaper\n] [\nwebpage\n] [\nvideo\n]\nInferring Hybrid Fluid Fields from Videos\nNeurIPS 2023\nHong-Xing \"Koven\" Yu*, Yang Zheng*, Yuan Gao,\nYitong Deng\n, Bo Zhu, Jiajun Wu\n[\npaper\n] [\nwebpage\n] [\nvideo\n]\nLearning Vortex Dynamics For Fluid Inference and Prediction\nICLR 2023\nYitong Deng\n, Hong-Xing \"Koven\" Yu, Jiajun Wu, and Bo Zhu\n[\npaper\n] [\nwebpage\n] [\nvideo\n]\nA Moving Eulerian-Lagrangian Particle Method for Thin Film and Foam Simulation\nACM Transactions on Graphics (SIGGRAPH 2022)\nYitong Deng\n, Mengdi Wang, Xiangxin Kong, Shiying Xiong, Zangyueyang Xian, and Bo Zhu\n[\npaper\n] [\nwebpage\n] [\nvideo\n]\nNeural Vortex Method: from Finite Lagrangian Particles to Infinite Dimensional Eulerian Dynamics\nComputers and Fluids\nShiying Xiong, Xingzhe He, Yunjin Tong,\nYitong Deng\n, and Bo Zhu\n[\npaper\n]\nThin-Film Smoothed Particle Hydrodynamics Fluid\nACM Transactions on Graphics (SIGGRAPH 2021)\nMengdi Wang,\nYitong Deng\n, Xiangxin Kong, Aditya Prasad, Shiying Xiong, and Bo Zhu\n[\npaper\n] [\nwebpage\n] [\nvideo\n]\nSoft Multicopter Control Using Neural Dynamics Identification\nCoRL 2020\nYitong Deng\n, Yaorui Zhang, Xingzhe He, Shuqi Yang, Yunjin Tong, Michael Zhang, Daniel DiPietro, and Bo Zhu\n[\npaper\n] [\nvideo\n] [\npresentation\n]"
  },
  "deep_homepage::Hong-Xing Yu::https://kovenyu.com/": {
