    "homepage_text": "Yoo, Chang D. - KAIST 전기 및 전자공학부\nKorean\nEnglish\nINTRANET\nSITEMAP\nLOGOUT\nMenu\nKorean\nEnglish\nINTRANET\nLOGOUT\nMenu\nINTRANET\nKorean\nEnglish\nINTRANET\nLOGOUT\nMenu\nPeople & Life\nProfessor\nHome\nPeople & Life\nFaculty\nYoo, Chang D.\nYoo, Chang D.\nResearch Areas\nAI & Machine Learning, Multimedia Signal Processing, Robotics & Control, Human Computer Interaction\nResearch\nDeep Learning, Machine Learning, Computer Vision, Audio/Speech Processing\nLaboratory\nArtificial Intelligence & Machine Learning Lab. (AIM)\nBuilding\nLG Innovation Hall (N24)\n2111\nExtension\n#3470\nEmail\ncd_yoo@kaist.ac.kr\nWebsite\nhttp://sanctusfactory.com/\nResearch Group\nSignal\ndivision\nDegree\nPh.D. (2006) MIT\nAchievements\nT. Vu, H. Jang, T. X. Pham and C. D. Yoo, “Cascade RPN: Delving into High-Quality Region Proposal Network with Adaptive Convolution”, In Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NIPS) spotlight, 2019.\nJ. Kim, T. Kim, S. Kim and C. D. Yoo, “Edge-Labeling Graph Neural Network for Few-shot Learning”, In International Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR) oral, 2019.\nJ. Kim, M. Ma, K. Kim, S. Kim and C. D. Yoo, “Progressive Attention Memory Network for Movie Story Question Answering”, In International Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2019.\nS. Kang, J. Kim, H. Choi, S. Kim and C. D. Yoo, “Pivot Correlational Neural Network for Multimodal Video Categorization”, In European Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV), 2018.\nV. Thang, T. M. Luu, C. D. Yoo, “Perception-enhanced image super-resolution via relativistic generative adversarial networks”, In PIRM workshop, European Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV), 2018.\nNext\nKim, Choong-Ki\nShow List\nAbout Us\nOverview\nWelcome Message\nHistory\nOrganization Chart\nEE Division\nEE Visual Identity\nEE Publication\nEE Facilities\nMaps & Directions\nVirtual Campus Tour\nResearch\nResearch Areas\nResearch Centers\nResearch Highli