    "homepage_text": "Lin Chen\nLin Chen - 陈麟\nI'm an assistant professor of\nYMSC\nat\nTsinghua University\n. I work in geometric Langlands program.\nEmail: kylinjchen[at]gmail\nOffice: Shuangqing 508\nResearch\nProof of global geometric Langlands conjecture\nThis is a joint project of proving the de Rham version of the categorical, unramified, global geometric Langlands conjecture.\nwebpage\nmaintained by\nDennis Gaitsgory\n.\nPapers\nTeaching\nFall 2023: Introduction to Geometric Langlands Theory\n:\nhere\nSpring 2024: Geometric Representation Theory I\n:\nhere\nFall 2024: Infinite Category Theory\n:\nhere\nFall 2025: Algebraic Geometry 1\n:\nhere\nSpring 2026: Geometric Representation Theory I\n:\nhere"
  },
  "deep_homepage::Yue Wu::https://ywuchina.github.io/": {
    "homepage": "https://ywuchina.github.io/",
    "all_emails": [
      "ywu@xidian.edu.cn",
      "ywu0912@outlook.com"
    ],
    "matched_email": null,
    "github": "https://github.com/ywuchina",
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Yue Wu's Homepage\nBiography Yue Wu’s Homepage\nYue Wu(武越)\nProfessor\nSenior Member, IEEE\nTo:\nywu[at]xidian.edu.cn\nCc:\nywu0912[at]outlook.com\nFollow\nXidian University\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nBiography\nYue Wu, Professor, Ph.D. Supervisor at the School of Computer Science and Technology, Xidian University, Shaanxi Youth Science and Technology New Star, IEEE/CCF/CAAI Senior Member, Secretary-General of the CAAI Youth Committee, Executive Member of CCF Xi’an, Chair of CCF YOCSEF Xi’an, Secretary-General of CCF Xi’an Branch. His research interests include computational intelligence and 3D computer vision.\nHe received the B.Eng. and Ph.D. degrees from Xidian University, Xi’an, China, in 2011 and 2016, respectively. He is currently a Professor with Xidian University and the deputy director of the Key Laboratory of Collaborative Intelligent Systems of the Ministry of Education. He has published over 50 papers as the first/corresponding author in SCI A1 or CCF-A journals/conference, and 12 papers have been selected as ESI highly cited papers, which have been cited over 5,300 times. He is selected for Stanford University Top 2% Scientists List (2022-2025). He has applied and authorized over 50 patents. He is leading or has completed more than 20 projects as the principal investigator, including National Natural Science Foundation of China (Key Program, General Program, Youth Program), Natural Science Basic Research Program of Shaanxi (General Program, Youth Program), China Postdoctoral Foundation (Special Foundation, General Program), SAST Fund, and the CAAI-Huawei MindSpore Academic Fund. He has won over 10 academic awards as the first principal investigator, including Second Prize for Science and Technology Award of Shaanxi Province, Outstanding Youth Award of Wu Wenjun AI Science & Technology, Youth Science and Technology Star of Shaanxi Province, and Huawei Spark Award. He serves as the Secretary-General of the Youth Committee of the CAAI, the Chair of CCF YOCSEF Xi’an, and the Secretary-General of the CCF Xi’an Branch. He is also the Associate Editor for IEEE Transactions on Evolutionary Computation, Expert Systems with Applications, IEEE Transactions on Emerging Topics in Computational Intelligence, and the Editorial Board Member for CAAI Transactions on Intelligence Technology and Frontiers of Computer Science.\nEducation Experience:\n2007.09-2011.06\nBachelor, School of Electronic Engineering, Xidian University\n2011.08-2016.06\nPh.D (advised by Professor Maoguo Gong), School of Electronic Engineering, Xidian University\nWorking Experience:\n2016.09-2019.06\nLecturer, School of Computer Science and Technology, Xidian University\n2019.06-2024.11\nAssociate Professor, School of Computer Science and Technology, Xidian University\n2024.11-Present\nProfessor, School of Computer Science and Technology, Xidian University\nResearch Interests\nComputational Intelligence Theory and Applications (Evolutionary computation, Machine Learning, Neural Networks etc.)\n3D Computer Vision (Point Cloud Understanding, Registration, Detection, Tracking, Reconstruction etc.)\nImage Processing and Pattern Recognition\nAwards\nScience and Technology Award of Shaanxi Province, Second Prize, 2023（1/6）\nAward of Wu Wenjun AI Science & Technology, Outstanding Youth, 2023（1/1）\nYouth Science and Technology Star of Shaanxi Province, 2023（1/1）\nACM China (Xi’an), Rising Star Award, 2020. （1/1）\nAAAI2024 Outstanding Paper Award, 2024（5/6）\nHuawei Spark Award, 2022（1/1）\nShaanxi Provincial Institute of Electronics Science and Technology Award for Natural Science, Second Prize, 2022（1/4）\nThe 7th National Youth Artificial Intelligence Innovation and Entrepreneurship Conference, First prize, 2022（1/6）\nShaanxi Innovation and Entrepreneurship Competition For Scientific and Technical Professionals, Gold Award, 2018（2/6）\nThe 6th Asian Conference on Artificial Intelligence Technology, Best paper, 2022（1/6）\nThe 15th International Conference on Computational Intelligence and Security, Best student paper, 2019（4/5）\nThe 5th China High Resolution Earth Observation Conference, Best paper, 2018（2/5）\nHuawei MindSpore Open Source Community Excellence, Mentorship Award, 2023（1/1）\nOutstanding Association Worker of the CAAI, 2020（1/1）\nPublications\nJiaming Liu,\nYue Wu*\n, Qiguang Miao, Maoguo Gong, Linghe Kong, Revisiting Siamese-Based 3D Single Object Tracking with a Versatile Transformer,\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (\nTPAMI\n)\n, 2025.(\nCCF A\n) [\nPaper\n]\nMaoguo Gong, Yuan Gao,\nYue Wu\n, Yuanqiao Zhang, A. K. Qin, Yew Soon Ong, Heterogeneous Multi-Party Learning with Data-Driven Network Sampling,\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (\nTPAMI\n)\n, 2023.(\nCCF A, IF=18.6\n) [\nPaper\n]\nYongzhe Yuan,\nYue Wu\n*\n, Maoguo Gong, Qiguang Miao, A. K. Qin, One-Nearest Neighborhood Guides Inlier Estimation for Unsupervised Point Cloud Registration,\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (\nTNNLS\n)\n, 2025. (\nIF=8.9\n) [\nPaper\n]\nYue Wu\n, Yue Zhang, Wenping Ma, Maoguo Gong, Xiaolong Fan, Mingyang Zhang, A. K. Qin, Qiguang Miao, RORNet: Partial-to-Partial Registration Network with Reliable Overlapping Representations,\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (\nTNNLS\n)\n, 2023.(\nIF=8.9\n) [\nPaper\n] [\nCode\n]\nWenping Ma, Mingyu Yue,\nYue Wu\n*\n, Yongzhe Yuan, Hao Zhu, Biao Hou, Licheng Jiao, Explore the Influence of Shallow Information on Point Cloud Registration,\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (\nTNNLS\n)\n, 2023.(\nIF=8.9\n) [\nPaper\n]\nYue Wu\n, Jiaheng Li, Yongzhe Yuan, A. K. Qin, Qiguang Miao, Maoguo Gong Commonality Autoencoder: Learning Common Features for Change Detection from Heterogeneous Images,\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (\nTNNLS\n)\n, 2022. (\nIF=8.9\n) [\nPaper\n] [\nCode\n]\nYue Wu\n, Chuang Luo, Maoguo Gong, Hangqi Ding, Jinlong Sheng, Qiguang Miao, Hao Li, Wenping Ma, Hao He, Multi-Task Multi-Scale Feature Selection for Point Cloud Registration Evolution,\nIEEE Transactions on Evolutionary Computation (\nTEVC\n)\n, 2025. (\nIF=12\n) [\nPaper\n] [\nCode\n]\nYue Wu\n, Jinlong Sheng, Hangqi Ding, Peiran Gong, Hao Li, Maoguo Gong, Wenping Ma, Qiguang Miao, Evolutionary Multitasking Descriptor Optimization for Point Cloud Registration,\nIEEE Transactions on Evolutionary Computation (\nTEVC\n)\n, 2024.(\nIF=12\n) [\nPaper\n] [\nCode\n]\nYue Wu\n, Hangqi Ding, Maoguo Gong, A. K. Qin, Wenping Ma, Qiguang Miao, Kay Chen Tan, Evolutionary Multiform Optimization with Two-Stage Bidirectional Knowledge Transfer Strategy for Point Cloud Registration,\nIEEE Transactions on Evolutionary Computation (\nTEVC\n)\n, 2024.(\nIF=12\n) [\nPaper\n] [\nCode\n]\nZedong Tang, Maoguo Gong,\nYue Wu\n, Wenfeng Liu, Yu Xie, Regularized Evolutionary Multitask Optimization: Learning to Intertask Transfer in Aligned Subspace,\nIEEE Transactions on Evolutionary Computation (\nTEVC\n)\n, 2021.(\nIF=12\n) [\nPaper\n]\nYongzhe Yuan,\nYue Wu\n*\n, Xiaolong Fan, Maoguo Gong, Wenping Ma, Qiguang Miao, EGST: Enhanced Geometric Structure Transformer for Point Cloud Registration,\nIEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics (\nTVCG\n)\n, 2023.(\nCCF A\n) [\nPaper\n]\nZedong Tang, Maoguo Gong,\nYue Wu\n, A. K. Qin, Kay Chen Tan, A Multifactorial Optimization Framework Based on Adaptive Intertask Coordinate System,\nIEEE Transactions on Cybernetics (\nTCYB\n)\n, 2022.(\nIF=10.5\n) [\nPaper\n]\nYue Wu\n, Jiaming Liu, Maoguo Gong, Qiguang Miao, Wenping Ma, Cai Xu, Joint Semantic Segmentation Using Representations of LiDAR Point Clouds and Camera Images,\nInformation Fusion (\nINFFUS\n)\n, 2024.(\nIF=15.5\n) [\nPaper\n]\nXiaolong Fan, Maoguo Gong,\nYue Wu\n, Hao Li, Maximizing Mutual Information Across Feature and Topology Views for Representing Graphs,\nIEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering (\nTKDE\n)\n, 2023.(\nCCF A\n) [\nPaper\n]\nXiaolong Fan, Maoguo Gong,\nYue Wu\n, A. K. Qin, Yu Xie, Propagation Enhanced Neural Message Passing for Graph Representation Learning,\nIEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering (\nTKDE\n)\n, 2023.(\nCCF A\n) [\nPaper\n]\n武越\n, 苑咏哲, 岳铭煜, 公茂果, 李豪, 张明阳, 马文萍, 苗启广, 点云配准中多维度信息融合的特征挖掘方法,\n计算机研究与发展\n, 2022. [\nPaper\n]\n武越\n, 白壮飞, 公茂果, 曲博艺婷, 李豪, 张明阳, 马文萍, 苗启广, 遥感图像配准中的群智汇聚方法,\n中国科学\n, 2023. [\nPaper\n]\nYue Wu\n, Jun Jiang, Yongzhe Yuan, Maoguo Gong, Qiguang Miao, Hao Li, Mingyang Zhang, PointTruss: K-Truss for Point Cloud Registration,\nAnnual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n)\n, 2025.(\nCCF A\n) [\nPaper\n]\nYue Wu\n, Xidao Hu, Yongzhe Yuan, Xiaolong Fan, Maoguo Gong, Hao Li, Mingyang Zhang, Qiguang Miao, Wenping Ma, PointMC: Multi-instance Point Cloud Registration Based on Maximal Cliques,\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (\nICML\n)\n, 2024.(\nCCF A\n) [\nPaper\n]\nTengfei Xiao,\nYue Wu\n*\n, Yuelong Li, Can Qin, Maoguo Gong, Qiguang Miao, Wenping Ma, Disentangled Pose and Appearance Guidance for Multi-Pose Generation,\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (\nCVPR\n)\n, 2025.(\nCCF A\n) [\nPaper\n]\nYongzhe Yuan,\nYue Wu\n*\n, Xiaolong Fan, Maoguo Gong, Qiguang Miao, Wenping Ma, Inlier Confidence Calibration for Point Cloud Registration,\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (\nCVPR\n)\n, 2024.(\nCCF A\n) [\nPaper\n] [\nCode\n]\nZedong Tang, Fenlong Jiang, Maoguo Gong, Hao Li,\nYue Wu\n, Fan Yu, Zidong Wang, Min Wang, SKFAC: Training Neural Networks with Faster Kronecker-factored Approximate Curvature,\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (\nCVPR\n)\n, 2021.(\nCCF A\n) [\nPaper\n]\nYue Wu\n*\n, Zhigang Gao, Yongzhe Yuan, Can Qin, Tengfei Xiao, Hao Li, Kaiyuan Feng, Wenping Ma, Hybrid Vector-Occupancy Field for Robust Implicit 3D Surface Reconstruction,\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (\nAA