    "homepage_text": "Zhiqiang Xu's Home Page\nHome Page\nResearch Topics\nPublications\nTeaching\nCurriculum Vitae\nZhiqiang Xu\nEmail: xuzq (at) lsec.cc.ac.cn\nMy main research areas are approximation theory, computational harmonic analysis, machine learning, and numerical analysis. In particular, I am interested in spline functions, compressed sensing, interlacing polynomials, neural network functions, and phase retrieval.\nFor more details, please see my\nResearch topics\nand\nPublications\npages.\nUpdated on February 12, 2026"
  },
