    "homepage_text": "Home Page of Yuan Xu\nYuan Xu\nI am a professor in the\nMathematics Department\nat the\nUniversity of Oregon\n.\nYou can view a\npicture\nof me if you have the time.\nResearch\nMy research is in analysis (approximation theory, harmonic analysis, \northogonal polynomials, numerical analysis, special functions). My \ninterest is mostly on higher dimensional problems, such as orthogonal \npolynomials of several variables, cubature formulas, and mutivariable \napproximation.\nPublication\nHere is my\nlist of publications\nwith downloadable links and my\nprofile\nin Google Scholar.\nEditorial Board\nI am on the editorial board of following journals:\nConstructive Approximation\nDolomites Research Notes on Approximation\nJournal of Approximation Theory\nJournal of Fourier Analysis and Applications\nand served on the editorial board of the following journals:\nEast J. on Approximations, 2002-2012\nNumerical Math.: Theory, Methods and Applications, 2007-2016\nNumerical Algorithm, 2009-2024\nProceedings of American Mathematical Society, 2017-2025.\nYuan Xu\nDepartment of Mathematics\nUniversity of Oregon, Eugene OR 97403-1222, U.S.A.\nPhone 541-346-5619\nEmail:\n<\nyuan@uoregon.edu\n>"
  },
