    "homepage_text": "Yan Gao | FSI\nStanford University\nMenu\nClose\nSearch\nYan Gao\nYan Gao\nVisiting Scholar\n616 Serra StreetEncina Hall E301Stanford, CA94305-6055\ngaoyan@stanford.edu\nBiography\nYan Gao joins the Walter H. Shorenstein Asia-Pacific Research Center for the 2017-2018 year as a visiting scholar.  He is the Deputy Director of the Unirule Institute of Economics, China, and will be conducting research on Asia-Pacific innovation, and the development of the Chinese economy and entrepreneurship.  He is available at\ngaoyan@stanford.edu\n."
