    "homepage_text": "Qibin Zhao - Zhao Research Group\nSearch\nZhao\nResearch Group\nWelcome to the Zhao Research Group at Shanghai JiaoTong University. Founded in late 2018 when Dr. Qibin Zhao joined the faculty, our lab was established in autumn 2020 with support from multiple funding sources. We develop scalable methods for fabricating diverse nano- and microstructured materials and explore novel physical mechanisms in miscellaneous soft-matter systems.\nGroup News\nLast updated on\nFeb 7, 2026\n1 min read\nCongratulations to Junjun on passing his PhD Viva!\nNow he can truly relax and enjoy the Chinese New Year.\nLast updated on\nDec 8, 2025\n1 min read\nOur work on colloidal paste is interviewed by MIT Technology Review (China)\nhttps://www.mittrchina.com/news/detail/15598\nLast updated on\nFeb 7, 2026\n1 min read\nFeng's work on colloidal photonic crystal assembly is now accepted by ACS Nano\nWe started working on this since 2020, and much of the work has been done before 2024. It provides a new platform that we can do a lot of interesting things.\nLast updated on\nNov 8, 2025\n1 min read\nXiaokun's work is accepted by Advanced Functional Materials, congratulations!\nA viable route for developing radiative cooling films for space applications.\nLast updated on\nNov 8, 2025\n1 min read\nXinyu's work on ion-conductive photonic crystal films now published by Advanced Functional Materials\nRevealling now possiblities for developing flexible sensors with multiple functions.\nSee all posts\nLatest Preprints\nMeet the team →\nCite\n×\nCopy\nDownload\n\n---\n\nContact | Qibin Zhao - Zhao Research Group\nSearch\nContact\n.\nName\nEmail\nMessage\nDo not fill this field unless you are a bot:\nSend\nzhaoqibin@sjtu.edu.cn\nBuilding D, School of Materials Science and Engineering, Shanghai JiaoTong University, 800 Dongchuan Road, Minhang, Shanghai, 200240\nEnter Building D and turn left\nCite\n×\nCopy\nDownload\n\n---\n\nContact | Qibin Zhao - Zhao Research Group\nSearch\nContact\n.\nName\nEmail\nMessage\nDo not fill this field unless you are a bot:\nSend\nzhaoqibin@sjtu.edu.cn\nBuilding D, School of Materials Science and Engineering, Shanghai JiaoTong University, 800 Dongchuan Road, Minhang, Shanghai, 200240\nEnter Building D and turn left\nCite\n×\nCopy\nDownload\n\n---\n\nContact | Qibin Zhao - Zhao Research Group\nSearch\nContact\n.\nName\nEmail\nMessage\nDo not fill this field unless you are a bot:\nSend\nzhaoqibin@sjtu.edu.cn\nBuilding D, School of Materials Science and Engineering, Shanghai JiaoTong University, 800 Dongchuan Road, Minhang, Shanghai, 200240\nEnter Building D and turn left\nCite\n×\nCopy\nDownload"
  },
