    "homepage_text": "Jingni Xiao's Homepage\nJingni (Jing-Ni) Xiao   肖晶妮\nStarting from 7/1/2022, I am no longer affiliated with Rutgers University. I will be moving to the Department of Mathematics, Drexel University, in Fall 2022.\nThe email address jingni.xiao@rutgers.edu (jx179@math.rutgers.edu, jingni.xiao@math.rutgers.edu) is\nno longer available\n. Please contact me via my personal email account:\nxiaojn dot live dot com\nThank you!\nMy new personal webpage"
