    "homepage_text": "Lei Ji at Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nLei Ji\nSenior Researcher\nAbout\nLei JI is a senior researcher at the Natural Language Computing group of Microsoft Research Asia. Her research focuses are vision and language multimodal learning, pretraining, and knowledge mining and reasoning. She has published papers at the top-tier conferences including ACL/AAAI/IJCAI/ACMMM/KDD/CIKM, patents, and transferred these innovative techniques to Microsoft products as well as other external partners.\nShe graduated from Beijing Institute of Technology University.\nPronouns: She, Her, Hers\nOpens in a new tab\nResearch areas\nArtificial intelligence\nSearch and information retrieval\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on Instagram\nSubscribe to our RSS feed\nShare this page:\nShare on X\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nShare on Reddit\n\n---\n\nLei Ji at Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nLei Ji\nSenior Researcher\nOther\nOpens in a new tab\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on Instagram\nSubscribe to our RSS feed\nShare this page:\nShare on X\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nShare on Reddit\n\n---\n\nLei Ji at Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nLei Ji\nSenior Researcher\nOther\nOpens in a new tab\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on Instagram\nSubscribe to our RSS feed\nShare this page:\nShare on X\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nShare on Reddit\n\n---\n\nLei Ji at Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch