    "homepage_text": "Yifan Hao –\n    \n    Yifan Hao\nYifan\nHao\nabout\nnews\nposts\nrandom\ncontact\n\n---\n\nContact –\n    \n    Yifan Hao\nYifan\nHao\nabout\nnews\nposts\nrandom\ncontact\nContact\nFeel free to reach out!\nphone: 734-747-3266\nemail: yifanh5 [at] illinois.edu\n\n---\n\nContact –\n    \n    Yifan Hao\nYifan\nHao\nabout\nnews\nposts\nrandom\ncontact\nContact\nFeel free to reach out!\nphone: 734-747-3266\nemail: yifanh5 [at] illinois.edu\n\n---\n\nAbout –\n    \n    Yifan Hao\nYifan\nHao\nabout\nnews\nposts\nrandom\ncontact\nYifan Hao\nWelcome to my page! My name is Yifan Hao, a first year master student major in\nComputer Science at University of Illinois at Urbana Champaign\n. I received my BS degree from\nUniversity of Michigan at Ann Arbor\nand\nElectrical & Computer Engineering at SJTU\n. I'm passionate about low level technologies that address performance issues, specifically in interaction between hardware and software (Embedded Design/IoT, OS, Computing System)\nBeyond massive time I devoted to my academic research, I randomly get addicted to games and various sports.\n\n---\n\nAbout –\n    \n    Yifan Hao\nYifan\nHao\nabout\nnews\nposts\nrandom\ncontact\nYifan Hao\nWelcome to my page! My name is Yifan Hao, a first year master student major in\nComputer Science at University of Illinois at Urbana Champaign\n. I received my BS degree from\nUniversity of Michigan at Ann Arbor\nand\nElectrical & Computer Engineering at SJTU\n. I'm passionate about low level technologies that address performance issues, specifically in interaction between hardware and software (Embedded Design/IoT, OS, Computing System)\nBeyond massive time I devoted to my academic research, I randomly get addicted to games and various sports."
  },
