on Multimedia Computing, Communications and Applications\n, 2013,  10(1): Article No.: 1.\nJ. Sang,\nC. Xu\n, Social Influence Analysis and Application on Multimedia Sharing Websites,\nACM Transactions on Multimedia Computing, Communications and Applications\n, 2013,  9(1s): Article No.: 51.\nJ. Sang, T. Mei, Y. Xu, C. Zhao,\nC. Xu\n, S. Li. Interaction Design for Mobile Visual Search.\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia\n, 2013, 15(7): 1665-1676.\nC. Sun, T. Zhang, B.K. Bao,\nC. Xu\n, T. Mei, Discriminative Exemplar Coding for Sign Language Recognition with Kinect,\nIEEE Transactions on Cybernetics\n, 2013, 43(5): 1418-1428.\nJ. Tang, G.Qi, L. Zhang,\nC. Xu\n, Cross-Space Affinity Learning with Its Application to Movie Recommendation.\nIEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering\n, 2013, 25(7): 1510-1519.\nC. Liang,\nC. Xu\n, J. Cheng, W. Min, H. Lu, Script-to-Movie: A Computational Framework for Story Movie Composition.\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia\n, 2013,15(2):401-414.\nT. Zhang, S. Liu,\nC. Xu\n,H. Lu, Mining Semantic Context Information for Intelligent Video Surveillance of Traffic Scenes.\nIEEE Transactions on Industrial Informatics\n, 2013, 9(1):149-160.\nP. Li, M. Wang, J. Cheng,\nC. Xu\n,H. Lu, Spectral Hashing with Semantically Consistent Graph for Image Indexing.\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia\n, 2013, 15(1):141-152.\nB. Bao, G. Liu,\nC. Xu\n, S. Yan, Inductive Robust Principal Component Analysis.\nIEEE Transactions on Image Processing\n, 2012, 21(8): 3794-3800.\nT.Zhang,\nC. Xu\n, G. Zhu, H. Lu, A Generic Framework for Video Annotation via Semi-supervised Learning,\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia\n, 2012, 14(4): 1206-1219.\nX. Xian,\nC. Xu\n, J. Wang, M. Xu, Enhanced 3D Modeling for Landmark Image Classification,\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia\n,  2012, 14(4): 1246-1258.\nJ. Sang,\nC. Xu\n, D. Lu, Learn to Personalized Image Search from the Photo Sharing Websites,\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia\n, 2012, 14(4): 963-974.\nJ. Sang,\nC. Xu\n