    "homepage_text": "Xiatian Zhu\nX. Zhu\nHome\nPublications\nDatasets\nXiatian Zhu\nXiatian Zhu is a Senior Lecturer at the\nSurrey Institute for People-Centred Artificial Intelligence\n, and\nCentre for Vision, Speech and Signal Processing (CVSSP)\n,\nFaculty of Engineering and Physical Sciences\n,\nUniversity of Surrey\n, Guildford, UK.\n\t\t\t\t\t    Proir to that, he was a research scientist at Samsung AI Centre, Cambridge, UK. \n\t\t\t\t\t    He received his Ph.D. from the\nQueen Mary University of London\n.\nHis research interests include computer vision and machine learning.\nEmail:\nxiatian.zhu AT surrey.ac.uk\nGoogle Scholar\nSemantic Scholar\nResearchGate\nDBLP\nThis website is obsolete. Please visit our\nUP Lab\nhomepage.\nRecent Publications [\nFull List\n]\nSOFT: Softmax-free Transformer with Linear Complexity\nJiachen Lu, Jinghan Yao, Junge Zhang, Xiatian Zhu, Hang Xu, Weiguo Gao, Chunjing Xu, Tao Xiang, Li Zhang\nIn Proc.\nNeural Information Processing System\n, virtual, December 2021\n(NeurIPS, spotlight)\n[\nPDF\n]\nLow-Fidelity End-to-End Video Encoder Pre-training for Temporal Action Localization\nMengmeng Xu, Juan-Manuel Perez-Rua, Xiatian Zhu, Bernard Ghanem, Brais Martinez\nIn Proc.\nNeural Information Processing System\n, virtual, December 2021\n(NeurIPS)\n[\nPDF\n]\nFew-shot Action Recognition with Prototype-centered Attentive Learning\nXiatian Zhu, Antoine Toisoul, Juan-Manuel Perez-Rua, Li Zhang, Brais Martinez, Tao Xiang\nIn Proc.\nBritish Machine Vision Conference\n, virtual, November 2021\n(BMVC)\n[\nPDF\n]\nKnowing What, Where and When to Look: Efficient Video Action Modeling with Attention\nJuan-Manuel Perez-Rua, Brais Martinez, Xiatian Zhu, Antoine Toisoul, Victor Escorcia, Tao Xiang\nIn Proc.\nBritish Machine Vision Conference\n, virtual, November 2021\n(BMVC)\n[\nPDF\n]\nFew-Shot Temporal Action Localization with Query Adaptive Transformer\nSauradip Nag, Xiatian Zhu, Tao Xiang\nIn Proc.\nBritish Machine Vision Conference\n, virtual, November 2021\n(BMVC)\n[\nPDF\n]\nSimpler is Better: Few-shot Semantic Segmentation with Classifier Weight Transformer\nZhihe Lu, Sen He, Xiatian Zhu, Li Zhang, Yi-Zhe Song, Tao Xiang\nIn Proc.\nIEEE International Conference on Computer Vision\n, virtual, October 2021\n(ICCV)\n[\nPDF\n]\nBoundary-sensitive Pretraining for Temporal Localization in Videos\nMengmeng Xu, Victor Escorcia, Brais Martínez, Juan-Manuel Perez-Rua, Xiatian Zhu, Li Zhang, Bernard Ghanem, Tao Xiang\nIn Proc.\nIEEE International Conference on Computer Vision\n, virtual, October 2021\n(ICCV)\n[\nPDF\n]\nGlobal Aggregation then Local Distribution for Scene Parsing\nXiangtai Li, Li Zhang, Guangliang Cheng, Kuiyuan Yang, Yunhai Tong, Xiatian Zhu, Tao Xiang\nIEEE Transactions on Image Processing\n, accepted, 2021\n(TIP)\n[\nPDF\n]\nLearning hybrid ranking representation for person re-identification\nGuile Wu, Xiatian Zhu, Shaogang Gong\nPatern Recognition\n, Vol. 121, 108239, January 2022\n(PR)\n[\nPDF\n]\nTowards Uncovering the Intrinsic Data Structures for Unsupervised Domain Adaptation using Structurally Regularized Deep Clustering\nHui Tang, Xiatian Zhu, Ke Chen, Kui Jia, C. L. Philip Chen\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence\n, accepted, 2021\n(TPAMI)\n[\nPDF\n]\nRethinking Semantic Segmentation from a Sequence-to-Sequence Perspective with Transformers\nSixiao Zheng, Jiachen Lu, Hengshuang Zhao, Xiatian Zhu, Zekun Luo, Yabiao Wang, Yanwei Fu, Jianfeng Feng, Tao Xiang, Philip HS Torr, Li Zhang\nIn Proc.\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n, Virtual, June 2021\n(CVPR)\n[\nPDF\n]\n\t\t\t\t[\nCode\n]\n\t\t\t\t[\nProject page\n]\n(second most influential CVPR 2021 paper)\nJoint Bilateral-resolution Identity Modeling for Cross-resolution Person Re-identification\nWei-Shi Zheng, Jincheng Hong, Jiening Jiao, Ancong Wu, Xiatian Zhu, Shaogang Gong, Jiayin Qin, Jian-Huang Lai\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision\n, accepted, 2021\n(IJCV)\n[\nPDF\n]\nIntra-Camera Supervised Person Re-Identification\nXiangping Zhu, Xiatian Zhu, Minxian Li, Pietro Morerio, Vittorio Murino, Shaogang Gong\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision\n, Vol. 129, pp. 1580-1595, February 2021\n(IJCV)\n[\nPDF\n]\nHierarchical Distillation Learning for Scalable Person Search\nWei Li, Shaogang Gong, Xiatian Zhu\nPatern Recognition\n, Vol. 114, 107862, February 2021\n(PR)\n[\nPDF\n]\nMulti-Perspective Cross-Class Domain Adaptation for Open Logo Detection\nHang Su, Shaogang Gong, and Xiatian Zhu\nComputer Vision and Image Understanding\n, Vol. 204, 103156, March 2021\n(CVIU)\n[\nPDF\n]\nWorkshop\nFourth International Workshop on Big Surveillance Data Analysis and Processing\n,\nIEEE INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON MULTIMEDIA AND EXPO (\nICME\n),\n\t\tTaibei, Tanwan, July 2022\nSecond International Workshop on Target Re-identification and Multi-Target Multi-Camera Tracking\n,\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (\nCVPR\n),\n\t\tLong Beach, CA, USA, June 2019"
