    "homepage_text": "Haoxuan Li's Homepage\nNews\nJanuary 2026\nNine papers are accepted by ICLR 2026.\nJanuary 2026\nI will serve as an Area Chair for KDD 2026.\nNovember 2025\nI will serve as an Area Chair for ICML 2026.\nNovember 2025\nTwo papers are accepted by AAAI 2026.\nSeptember 2025\nFifteen papers are accepted by NeurIPS 2025.\nJuly 2025\nI will serve as an Area Chair for ICLR 2026.\nMay 2025\nFive papers are accepted by ICML 2025.\nMarch 2026\nI will serve as an Area Chair for NeurIPS 2025.\nApril 2025\nOne paper is accepted by IJCAI 2025 (Survey Track).\nNovember 2024\nTwo papers are accepted by KDD 2025.\nSeptember 2024\nFive papers are accepted by NeurIPS 2024.\nMay 2024\nFive papers are accepted by ICML 2024.\nMay 2024\nTwo papers are accepted by KDD 2024.\nMarch 2024\nOne paper is accepted by ICDE 2024.\nJanuary 2024\nThree papers are accepted by ICLR 2024.\nDecember 2023\nOne paper is accepted by AAAI 2024.\nSeptember 2023\nThree papers are accepted by NeurIPS 2023.\nSeptember 2023\nOne paper is accepted by ICDM 2023.\nJuly 2023\nOne paper is accepted by ACM MM 2023.\nJune 2023\nOne paper is accepted by RecSys 2023.\nMay 2023\nOne paper is accepted by KDD 2023.\nMay 2023\nTwo paper are accepted by ICML 2023.\nJanuary 2023\nTwo papers are accepted by ICLR 2023.\nJanuary 2023\nOne paper is accepted by WWW 2023.\nDecember 2022\nOne paper is accepted by AAAI 2023.\nMay 2022\nOne paper is accepted by KDD 2022.\nApril 2022\nOne paper is accepted by IJCAI 2022 (Survey Track).\nHaoxuan Li\nPh.D. at Peking University\nCenter for Data Science\nNational Engineering Laboratory for Big Data Analysis and Applications\nSchool of Mathematical Sciences\nBeijing International Center for Mathematical Research\nPeking University\nNo.5 Yiheyuan Road, Beijing, China\nhxli AT stu.pku.edu.cn\n•\nGoogle Scholar\n•\nGitHub\nI pursue my PhD majoring in Data Science at Peking University, where I am fortunate to be advised by Prof.\nXiao-Hua Zhou\n, coadvised by Prof.\nZhouchen Lin\n, I am also a Research Fellow of Tsinghua-UvA Joint Research Center for Logic at Tsinghua University.\n\tBefore that, I am honored to be selected into the 20th\nExperimental Class for Gifted Children\nin Beijing No.8 Middle School, which enables me to finish all grade 6-12 course works in 4 years and entering university at the age of 15.\n\tI have more than 80 publications appeared in top-tier CCF-A conferences such as ICML, NeurIPS, ICLR, SIGKDD, WWW, SIGIR, CVPR, ICDE, and ACL, reported by MIT Technology Review and\nCAAI\n.\n\tMy research interests span from causal machine learning theory, counterfactual fairness, recommender system debiasing, out-of-distribution generalization, and logical reasoning of large language models.\n\tMoreover, I am supported by the\nYoung Scientists Fund of the National Natural Science Foundation of China (¥300,000)\nand\nYoung Elite Scientists Sponsorship Program by CAST - Doctoral Student Special Plan (via CCF)\n.\n\tI have been selected as the\n2024 Peking University Person of the Year\nand\nrepresentative of National Scholarship reported by People's Daily\n. \n\tI have served as the area chair (AC) or program committee (PC) member for top-tier conferences including ICML, NeurIPS, ICLR, SIGKDD, WWW, AAAI, IJCAI, CVPR, ICCV, and the invited reviewer for prestigious journals such as TPAMI, TKDE, TOIS, TKDD, TNNLS, JASA, SCIENCE CHINA Information Sciences, and The Innovation.\nAdvertisements:\n1. Hiring postdocs, PhD students, and research interns in causality and machine learning and information retrieval. Requirements:\n- Strong code ability (Python or C/C++)\n- Determination to do high-quality research or interested in practical applications\nWe provide competitive salary, sufficient funding, and good career opportunities.\nSpecial PhD Opportunity at Tsinghua University:\nIf you are interested in pursuing PhD at Tsinghua-UvA Joint Research Center for Logic with special focus on\nlogical reasoning of LLMs\n. Please drop me an email with your detailed CV.\n2. Our Special Issue of Entropy (JCR=2, CiteScore=4.9) on Causal Inference in Recommender Systems with Prof.\nFuli Feng\nand Prof.\nXu Chen\n:\n- Submission Deadline: July 31, 2025\n-\nSubmission Website\nSelected Publications\nIn the Year of 2026:\npdf\nMAD-Logic: Multi-Agent Debate Enhances Symbolic Translation and Reasoning\nHaocheng Yang, Fengxiang Cheng, Tianjun Yao, Mengyue Yang, Jiajun Chai, Xiaohan Wang, Guojun Yin, Wei Lin, Soummya Kar, Fenrong Liu,\nHaoxuan Li*\nand Yisen Wang\nICLR 2026 (Full, Accepted Rate: 28%)\n*Corresponding Author\npdf\nLogiConBench: Benchmarking Logical Consistencies of LLMs\nZheng Chen, Chuan Zhou, Fengxiang Cheng, Yip Tin Po, Fenrong Liu, Yisen Wang, Jiajun Chai, Xiaohan Wang, Guojun Yin, Wei Lin, Bo Li,\nHaoxuan Li*\nand Zhouchen Lin\nICLR 2026 (Full, Accepted Rate: 28%)\n*Corresponding Author\npdf\nTransformers with Endogenous In-Context Learning: Bias Characterization and Mitigation\nHaotian Wang,\nHaoxuan Li*\n, Hao Zou, Haoang Chi, Yang Shi, Yuanxing Zhang, Wenjing Yang, Xinwang Liu and Zhouchen Lin\nICLR 2026 (Full, Accepted Rate: 28%)\n*Corresponding Author\npdf\nQuadratic Direct Forecast for Training Multi-Step Time-Series Forecast Models\nHao Wang, Licheng Pan, Yuan Lu, Zhichao Chen, Tianqiao Liu, Shuting He, Zhixuan Chu, Qingsong Wen,\nHaoxuan Li*\nand Zhouchen Lin\nICLR 2026 (Full, Accepted Rate: 28%)\n*Corresponding Author\npdf\nDistDF: Time-series Forecasting Needs Joint-Distribution Wasserstein Alignment\nHao Wang, Licheng Pan, Yuan Lu, Zhixuan Chu, Xiaoxi Li, Shuting He, Zhichao Chen,\nHaoxuan Li*\n, Qingsong Wen and Zhouchen Lin\nICLR 2026 (Full, Accepted Rate: 28%)\n*Corresponding Author\npdf\nCausal Discovery in the Wild: A Voting-Theoretic Ensemble Approach\nVy Vo,\nHaoxuan Li\nand Mingming Gong\nICLR 2026 (Full, Accepted Rate: 28%)\npdf\nA Relative Error-Based Evaluation Framework of Heterogeneous Treatment Effect Estimators\nJiayi Guo,\nHaoxuan Li\n, Ye Tian and Peng Wu\nICLR 2026 (Full, Accepted Rate: 28%)\npdf\nFrom Text to Talk: Audio-Language Model Needs Non-Autoregressive Joint Training\nTianqiao Liu, Xueyi Li, Hao Wang,\nHaoxuan Li\n, Zhichao Chen, Weiqi Luo and Zitao Liu\nICLR 2026 (Full, Accepted Rate: 28%)\npdf\nMME-Emotion: A Holistic Evaluation Benchmark for Emotional Intelligence in Multimodal Large Language Models\nFan Zhang, Zebang Cheng, Chong Deng,\nHaoxuan Li\n, Zheng Lian, Qian Chen, Huadai Liu, Wen Wang, YiFan Zhang, Renrui Zhang, Ziyu Guo, Zhihong Zhu, Hao Wu, Haixin Wang, Yefeng Zheng, Xiaojiang Peng, Xian Wu, Kun Wang, Xiangang Li, Jieping Ye and Pheng-Ann Heng\nICLR 2026 (Full, Accepted Rate: 28%)\npdf\nCausal Inference with Complex Treatments: A Survey\nYingrong Wang,\nHaoxuan Li\n, Minqin Zhu, Anpeng Wu, Baohong Li, Keting Yin, Ruoxuan Xiong, Fei Wu and Kun Kuang\nACM Computing Surveys\npdf\nBeyond Similarity: Personalized Federated Recommendation with Composite Aggregation\nHonglei Zhang,\nHaoxuan Li\n, Jundong Chen, Sen Cui, Kunda Yan, Abudukelimu Wuerkaixi, Xin Zhou, Zhiqi Shen and Yidong Li\nACM Transactions on Information Systems (TOIS, CCF-A)\npdf\nUplift Modeling with Delayed Feedback: Identifiability and Algorithms\nChunyuan Zheng, Anpeng Wu, Chuan Zhou, Taojun Hu, Qingying Chen, Hongyi Liu, Chenxi Li, Huiyou Jiang,\nHaoxuan Li*\nand Zhouchen Lin\nAAAI 2026 (Full, Accepted Rate: 17.6%)\n*Corresponding Author\npdf\nTransFR: Transferable Federated Recommendation with Adapter Tuning on Pre-trained Language Models\nHonglei Zhang, Zhiwei Li,\nHaoxuan Li\n, Xin Zhou, Jie Zhang and Yidong Li\nAAAI 2026 (Full, Accepted Rate: 17.6%)\npdf\nBatch-Adaptive Doubly Robust Learning for Debiasing Post-Click Conversion Rate Prediction Under Sparse Data\nHang Pan, Chunyuan Zheng, Wenjie Wang, Jingang Jiang, Xueying Li,\nHaoxuan Li*\nand Fuli Feng\nACM Transactions on Information Systems (TOIS, CCF-A)\n*Corresponding Author\nIn the Year of 2025:\npdf\nCounterfactual Implicit Feedback Modeling\nChuan Zhou, Lina Yao,\nHaoxuan Li*\nand Mingming Gong\nNeurIPS 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 24.52%)\n*Corresponding Author\npdf\nUnveiling Extraneous Sampling Bias with Data Missing-Not-At-Random\nChunyuan Zheng, Haocheng Yang,\nHaoxuan Li*\nand Mengyue Yang\nNeurIPS 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 24.52%)\n*Corresponding Author\npdf\nOLinear: A Linear Model for Time Series Forecasting in Orthogonally Transformed Domain\nWenzhen Yue, Yong Liu,\nHaoxuan Li*\n, Hao Wang, Xianghua Ying, Ruohao Guo, Bowei Xing and Ji Shi\nNeurIPS 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 24.52%)\n*Corresponding Author\npdf\nDecentralized Dynamic Cooperation of Personalized Models for Federated Continual Learning\nDanni Yang, Zhikang Chen, Sen Cui, Mengyue Yang, Ding Li, Abudukelimu Wuerkaixi,\nHaoxuan Li*\n, Jinke Ren and Mingming Gong\nNeurIPS 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 24.52%)\n*Corresponding Author\npdf\nTime-o1: Time-Series Forecasting Needs Transformed Label Alignment\nHao Wang, Licheng Pan, Zhichao Chen, Xu Chen, Qingyang Dai, Lei Wang,\nHaoxuan Li*\nand Zhouchen Lin\nNeurIPS 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 24.52%)\n*Corresponding Author\npdf\nIterative Missing Data Imputation with Model Form Adaptation and Non-Missing Feature Supervision\nHao Wang, Zhengnan Li, Zhichao Chen, Xu Chen, Shuting He, Guangyi Liu,\nHaoxuan Li*\nand Zhouchen Lin\nNeurIPS 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 24.52%)\n*Corresponding Author\npdf\nIPAD: Inverse Prompt for AI Detection - A Robust and Interpretable LLM-Generated Text Detector\nZheng Chen, Yushi Feng, Jisheng Dang, Changyang He, Yue Deng, Hongxi Pu,\nHaoxuan Li*\nand Bo Li\nNeurIPS 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 24.52%)\n*Corresponding Author\npdf\nLearning Counterfactual Outcomes Under Rank Preservation\nPeng Wu,\nHaoxuan Li\n, Chunyuan Zheng, Yan Zeng, Jiawei Chen, Yang Liu, Ruocheng Guo and Kun Zhang\nNeurIPS 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 24.52%)\npdf\nCurious Causality-Seeking Agents Learn Meta Causal World\nZhiyu Zhao,\nHaoxuan Li\n, Haifeng Zhang, Jun Wang, Francesco Faccio, Jürgen Schmidhuber and Mengyue Yang\nNeurIPS 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 24.52%)\npdf\nPruning Spurious Subgraphs for Graph Out-of-Distribtuion Generalization\nTianjun Yao,\nHaoxuan Li\n, Yongqiang Chen, Tongliang Liu, Le Song, Eric P. Xing and Zhiqiang Shen\nNeurIPS 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 24.52%)\npdf\nTowards Accurate Time Series Forecasting via Implicit Decoding\nXinyu Li, Yuchen Luo, Hao Wang,\nHaoxuan Li\n, Liuhua Peng, Feng Liu, Yandong Guo, Kun Zhang and Mingming Gong\nNeurIPS 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 24.52%)\npdf\nDesign-Based Bandits Under Network Interference: Trade-Off Between Regret and Statistical Inference\nZichen Wang, Haoyang Hong, Chuanhao Li,\nHaoxuan Li\n, Zhiheng Zhang and Huazheng Wang\nNeurIPS 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 24.52%)\npdf\nCausal Sufficiency and Necessity Improves Chain-of-Thought Reasoning\nXiangning Yu, Zhuohan Wang, Linyi Yang,\nHaoxuan Li\n, Anjie Liu, Xiao Xue, Jun Wang and Mengyue Yang\nNeurIPS 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 24.52%)\npdf\nBreaking the Gradient Barrier: Unveiling Large Language Models for Strategic Classification\nXinpeng Lv, Haotian Wang, Yunxin Mao, Ke Liang,\nHaoxuan Li\n, Wanrong Huang, Long Lan, Haoang Chi, Huan Chen, Jinxuan Yang, Cyuanlong and Wenjing Yang\nNeurIPS 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 24.52%)\npdf\nMME-VideoOCR: Evaluating OCR-Based Capabilities of Multimodal LLMs in Video Scenarios\nYang Shi, Huanqian Wang, Wulin Xie, Huanyao Zhang, Lijie Zhao, YiFan Zhang, Xinfeng Li, Chaoyou Fu, Zhuoer Wen, Wenting Liu, Zhuoran Zhang, Xinlong Chen, Bohan Zeng, Sihan Yang, Yushuo Guan, Zhang Zhang, Liang Wang,\nHaoxuan Li\n, Zhouchen Lin, Yuanxing Zhang, Pengfei Wan, Haotian Wang and Wenjing Yang\nNeurIPS 2025 Datasets and Benchmarks Track (Full, Accepted Rate: 24.91%)\npdf\nMitigating Spurious Correlations via Counterfactual Contrastive Learning\nFengxiang Cheng, Chuan Zhou, Xiang Li, Alina Leidinger,\nHaoxuan Li\n, Mingming Gong, Fenrong Liu and Robert Van Rooij\nEMNLP 2025 (Findings, Accepted Rate: 39.51%)\npdf\nProximity Matters: Local Proximity Enhanced Balancing for Treatment Effect Estimation\nHao Wang, Zhichao Chen, Zhaoran Liu, Xu Chen,\nHaoxuan Li*\nand Zhouchen Lin\nKDD 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 18.4%)\n*Corresponding Author\npdf\nMitigating Data Imbalance in Time Series Classification Based on Counterfactual Minority Samples Augmentation\nLei Wang, Shanshan Huang, Chunyuan Zheng, Jun Liao, Xiaofei Zhu,\nHaoxuan Li\nand Li Liu\nKDD 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 18.4%)\npdf\nFairness on Principal Stratum: A New Perspective on Counterfactual Fairness\nHaoxuan Li\n, Zeyu Tang, Zhichao Jiang, Zhuangyan Fang, Yue Liu, Zhi Geng and Kun Zhang\nICML 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 26.9%)\npdf\nActive Treatment Effect Estimation via Limited Samples\nZhiheng Zhang, Haoxiang Wang,\nHaoxuan Li*\nand Zhouchen Lin\nICML 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 26.9%)\n*Corresponding Author\npdf\nUnbiased Recommender Learning from Implicit Feedback via Progressive Proximal Transport\nHao Wang, Zhichao Chen, Haotian Wang, Yanchao Tan, Licheng Pan, Tianqiao Liu, Xu Chen,\nHaoxuan Li*\nand Zhouchen Lin\nICML 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 26.9%)\n*Corresponding Author\npdf\nLarge Language Models are Demonstration Pre-Selectors for Themselves\nJiarui Jin, Yuwei Wu,\nHaoxuan Li\n, Xiaoting He, Weinan Zhang, Yiming Yang, Yong Yu, Jun Wang and Mengyue Yang\nICML 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 26.9%)\npdf\nLearning without Isolation: Pathway Protection for Continual Learning\nZhikang Chen, Abudukelimu Wuerkaixi, Sen Cui,\nHaoxuan Li\n, Ding Li, Jingfeng Zhang, Bo Han, Gang Niu, Houfang Liu, Yi Yang, Sifan YANG, Changshui Zhang and Tianling Ren\nICML 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 26.9%)\npdf\nEmpowering LLMs with Logical Reasoning: A Comprehensive Survey\nFengxiang Cheng,\nHaoxuan Li*\n, Fenrong Liu, Robert van Rooij, Kun Zhang and Zhouchen Lin\nIJCAI 2025 (Survey Track, Accepted Rate: 19.6%)\n*Corresponding Author\npdf\nAdaptive Structure Learning with Partial Parameter Sharing for Post-Click Conversion Rate Prediction\nChunyuan Zheng, Hang Pan, Yang Zhang and\nHaoxuan Li*\nSIGIR 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 21.5%)\n*Corresponding Author\npdf\nVisual Representation Learning through Causal Intervention for Controllable Image Editing\nShanshan Huang,\nHaoxuan Li\n, Chunyuan Zheng, Lei Wang, Guorui Liao, Zhili Gong, Huayi Yang and Li Liu\nCVPR 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 2.98%)\n(Highlight)\npdf\nText-Driven Fashion Image Editing with Compositional Concept Learning and Counterfactual Abduction\nShanshan Huang,\nHaoxuan Li\n, Chunyuan Zheng, Mingyuan Ge, Wei Gao, Lei Wang and Li Liu\nCVPR 2025 (Full, Accepted Rate: 22.1%)\npdf\nLearning to Unlearn for Bayesian Personalized Ranking via Influence Function\nJundong Chen, Honglei Zhang,\nHaoxuan Li\nand Yidong Li\nChinese Journal of Electronics (CJE, CCF-T1)\npdf\nDebiased Recommendation via Wasserstein Causal Balancing\nHao Wang, Zhichao Chen, Honglei Zhang, Zhengnan Li, Licheng Pan,\nHaoxuan Li*\nand Mingming Gong\nACM Transactions on Information Systems (TOIS, CCF-A)\n*Corresponding Author\npdf\nCharacterBox: Evaluating the Role-Playing Capabilities of LLMs in Text-Based Virtual Worlds\nLei Wang, Jianxun Lian, Yi Huang, Yanqi Dai,\nHaoxuan Li\n, Xu Chen, Xing Xie and Ji-Rong Wen\nNAACL 2025 (Main Conference)\npdf\nFreDF: Learning to Forecast in the Frequency Domain\nHao Wang, Licheng Pan, Yuan Shen, Zhichao Chen, Degui Yang, Yifei Yang, Sen Zhang, Xinggao Liu,\nHaoxuan Li*\nand Dacheng Tao\nICLR 2025 (Full, Acce...[truncated]"
