    "homepage_text": "Jianhui Sun | Home\nJianhui Sun\nResearch Scientist, Meta\njs9gu AT virginia DOT edu\nBio\nI am a Research Scientist at Meta.\nI was a Ph.D. student in Department of Computer Science at University of Virginia, advised by Prof.\nAidong Zhang\n.\nI obtained my B.S. degree in Mathematics at Fudan University and I was in the PhD program in Department of Statistics at University of Virginia. I spent summers doing internships in Meta and Amazon.\nMy research covers a variety of topics in Machine Learning and Data Mining, including federated learning [\nNeurIPS'23\n,\nNeurIPS'23\n,\nAAAI'24\n], AutoML [\nTKDD'23\n,\nKDD'22\n,\nKDD'21\n], and adversarial attacks [\nKDD'23\n,\nKDD'20\n].\nNews\n[05/2024] One paper on dynamic graph transfer learning accepted to\nICML'24\n.\n[01/2024] One paper on\nGenAI approach for Multi-modal Personalization\naccepted to\nICLR'24\n.\n[12/2023] Attended\nNeurIPS'23\nfor our papers on 1)\nminimax optimization\n2)\nconditional stochastic optimization\n, in federated learning settings, in New Orleans, LA.\n[12/2023] One paper on federated learning accepted to\nAAAI'24\n. See you in Vancouver!\n[11/2023] I will join Meta as a research scientist in Menlo Park, CA.\n[09/2023] Two papers on federated learning accepted to\nNeurIPS'23\n.\n[09/2023] Finished internship at\nAmazon Search\n, Palo Alto, CA as an Applied Scientist Intern working on LLM-empowered product widget title generation.\n[08/2023] Attended\nKDD'23\nand presented our paper on\nadversarial training\nin Long Beach, CA.\n[05/2023] One paper on adversarial training accepted to\nKDD'23\n.\n[02/2023] Attended\nAAAI'23\nfor our paper on model interpretability in Washington, DC.\n[11/2022] Received Copenhaver Charitable Trust Bicentennial Fellowship.\n[10/2022] Attended\nCIKM'22\nfor\nFedGraph\nworkshop in Atlanta, GA\n[09/2022] Finished internship at\nMeta AI\n, Menlo Park, CA as a Research Scientist Intern working on data augmentation of IG Reels ranking models.\n[08/2022] Attended\nKDD'22\nand presented our paper on\nAutoML\nin Washington, DC.\nPublications\n[\nGoogle Scholar\n]\n‡\nindicates equal contribution.\nSelected\nAll\nOn the Role of Server Momentum in Federated Learning\nJianhui Sun\n‡\n,\nXidong Wu\n‡\n,\nHeng Huang\n,\nAidong Zhang\nAAAI'24\n: AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence. 2024.\nPaper\nSolving a Class of Non-Convex Minimax Optimization in Federated Learning\nXidong Wu\n‡\n,\nJianhui Sun\n‡\n,\nZhengmian Hu\n,\nAidong Zhang\n,\nHeng Huang\nNeurIPS'23\n: Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems. 2023.\nPaper\nPoster\nFederated Conditional Stochastic Optimization\nXidong Wu\n‡\n,\nJianhui Sun\n‡\n,\nZhengmian Hu\n,\nJunyi Li\n,\nAidong Zhang\n,\nHeng Huang\nNeurIPS'23\n: Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems. 2023.\nPaper\nPoster\nEnhance Diffusion to Improve Robust Generalization\nJianhui Sun\n,\nSanchit Sinha\n,\nAidong Zhang\nKDD'23\n: ACM SIGKDD International Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining. 2023.\nPaper\nScheduling Hyperparameters to Improve Generalization: From Centralized SGD to Asynchronous SGD\nJianhui Sun\n,\nYing Yang\n,\nGuangxu Xun\n,\nAidong Zhang\nTKDD\n: Transactions on Knowledge Discovery from Data. 2023.\nPaper\nDemystify Hyperparameters for Stochastic Optimization with Transferable Representations\nJianhui Sun\n,\nMengdi Huai\n,\nKishlay Jha\n,\nAidong Zhang\nKDD'22\n: ACM SIGKDD International Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining. 2022.\nPaper\nCode\nA Stagewise Hyperparameter Scheduler to Improve Generalization\nJianhui Sun\n,\nYing Yang\n,\nGuangxu Xun\n,\nAidong Zhang\nKDD'21\n: ACM SIGKDD International Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining. 2021.\nPaper\nVideo\nCode\nMalicious Attacks against Deep Reinforcement Learning Interpretations\nMengdi Huai\n,\nJianhui Sun\n,\nRenqin Cai\n,\nLiuyi Yao\n,\nAidong Zhang\nKDD'20\n: ACM SIGKDD International Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining. 2020.\nBest Paper Runner-up\nPaper\nVideo\nCode\nTowards Unified Multi-Modal Personalization: Large Vision-Language Models for Generative Recommendation and Beyond\nTianxin Wei\n,\nBowen Jin\n,\nRuirui Li\n,\nHansi Zeng\n,\nZhengyang Wang\n,\nJianhui Sun\n,\nQingyu Yin\n,\nHanqing Lu\n,\nSuhang Wang\n,\nJingrui He\n,\nXianfeng Tang\nICLR'24\n: International Conference on Learning Representations. 2024.\nPaper\nOn the Role of Server Momentum in Federated Learning\nJianhui Sun\n‡\n,\nXidong Wu\n‡\n,\nHeng Huang\n,\nAidong Zhang\nAAAI'24\n: AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence. 2024.\nPaper\nSolving a Class of Non-Convex Minimax Optimization in Federated Learning\nXidong Wu\n‡\n,\nJianhui Sun\n‡\n,\nZhengmian Hu\n,\nAidong Zhang\n,\nHeng Huang\nNeurIPS'23\n: Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems. 2023.\nPaper\nPoster\nFederated Conditional Stochastic Optimization\nXidong Wu\n‡\n,\nJianhui Sun\n‡\n,\nZhengmian Hu\n,\nJunyi Li\n,\nAidong Zhang\n,\nHeng Huang\nNeurIPS'23\n: Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems. 2023.\nPaper\nPoster\nEnhance Diffusion to Improve Robust Generalization\nJianhui Sun\n,\nSanchit Sinha\n,\nAidong Zhang\nKDD'23\n: ACM SIGKDD International Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining. 2023.\nPaper\nScheduling Hyperparameters to Improve Generalization: From Centralized SGD to Asynchronous SGD\nJianhui Sun\n,\nYing Yang\n,\nGuangxu Xun\n,\nAidong Zhang\nTKDD\n: Transactions on Knowledge Discovery from Data. 2023.\nPaper\nUnderstanding and Enhancing Robustness of Concept-based Models\nSanchit Sinha\n,\nMengdi Huai\n,\nJianhui Sun\n,\nAidong Zhang\nAAAI'23\n: AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence. 2023.\nPaper\nShifting Episodic Prediction With Online Cognitive Bias Modification: A Randomized Controlled Trial\nJeremy Eberle\n,\nMehdi Boukhechba\n,\nJianhui Sun\n,\nDiheng Zhang\n,\nDan Funk\n,\nLaura Barnes\n,\nBethany Teachman\nClinical Psychological Science. 2023.\nPaper\nCode\nDynamic Transfer Learning across Graphs\nHaohui Wang\