nJames A. Coan\nNeuroImage. 2018.\nPaper\nVitæ\nMeta, CA\nJan 2024 - present\nResearch Scientist\nAmazon Search, CA\nMay 2023 - Sep 2023\nApplied Scientist, Intern\nLLM-empowered Product Widget Title Generation Models\nMeta AI, CA\nMay 2022 - Aug 2022\nResearch Scientist, Intern\nData Augmentation Framework of Instagram Reels Ranking Models\nUniversity of Virginia, VA\nJan 2019 - present\nPh.D. in Computer Science\nResearch Interests: Optimization, Federated Learning, AutoML, and Adversarial ML\nM.S. in Computer Science, Dec 2022\nUniversity of Virginia, VA\nAug 2016 – Jan 2019\nPh.D. Program in Statistics\nResearch Interests: Brain Imaging Data Analysis, Bayesian Modeling\nM.S. in Statistics, May 2018\nNational University of Singapore\nJan-Jun 2015\nExchange Student\nFudan University, Shanghai\n2012 - 2016\nB.S. in Mathematics\nMinor in Economics\nJianhui Sun\ntemplate from\nMartin Saveski"
