    "homepage_text": "Yuan-Chen Guo – ACM SIGGRAPH HISTORY ARCHIVES\nACM SIGGRAPH HISTORY ARCHIVES\nMENU\nConferences\nSIGGRAPH\nSIGGRAPH Asia\nContributors\nSearch for People\nSearch for Exhibitors\nExhibitors\nExhibitors List\nExhibitors: View All\nExhibitor Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nExhibitor Overviews: SIGGRAPH Asia\nExhibitor Talks\nExhibitor View All\nExhibitor Talks Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nExhibitor Talks Overviews: SIGGRAPH Asia\nExhibitor Types\nExperiences\nView All\nACM SIGGRAPH Village\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nSIGGRAPH Asia Overviews\nAppy Hour\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nArt Show\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nSIGGRAPH Asia Overviews\nDAC Overviews\nArt Show Collections\nEntry Types\nDistinguished Artist Award\nBirds of a Feather\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nSIGGRAPH Asia Overviews\nCompetitions\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nSIGGRAPH Asia Overviews\nEntry Types\nOther Competitions\nComputer Animation / Electronic Theater\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nSIGGRAPH Asia Overviews\nEntry Types\nAnimation Awards\nEmerging Technologies\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nSIGGRAPH Asia Overviews\nEntry Types\nGames\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nSIGGRAPH Asia Overviews\nHistory\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nEntry Types\nLabs (Studio) & SA Workshops\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nSIGGRAPH Asia Overviews\nEntry Types\nPerformances\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nEntry Types\nReal-Time Live!\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nSIGGRAPH Asia Overviews\nReal-time Live! Awards\nSIGGRAPH Mobile\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nSIGGRAPH Asia Overviews\nSigKids\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nSpecial Events\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nSIGGRAPH Asia Overviews\nVR Theater\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nSIGGRAPH Asia Overviews\nVR/XR Experiences\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nSIGGRAPH Asia Overviews\nLearning\nView All\nArt Papers and Presentations\nArt Papers and Presentations: Entries\nArt Papers and Presentations Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nArt Papers and Presentation Overviews: SIGGRAPH Asia\nArt Papers and Presentation Types\nAwards: Best Art Paper\nCourses\nCourse: Entries\nCourse Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nCourse Overviews: SIGGRAPH Asia\nEducation\nEducation: Entries\nEducation Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nEducation Overviews: SIGGRAPH Asia\nFrontiers\nFrontiers: Entries\nFrontiers Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nFrontiers Overviews: SIGGRAPH Asia\nFrontier Types\nKeynotes/Featured Speakers\nKeynotes/Featured Speaker Entries\nKeynotes/Featured Speaker Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nKeynotes/Featured Speaker Overviews: SIGGRAPH Asia\nPanels\nPanels: Entries\nPanel Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nPanel Overviews: SIGGRAPH Asia\nPosters\nPosters: Entries\nPoster Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nPoster Overviews: SIGGRAPH Asia\nProduction Sessions\nProduction Sessions: Entries\nProduction Session Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nProduction Session Overviews: SIGGRAPH Asia\nSpecial Sessions\nSpecial Sessions: View All Entries\nSpecial Session Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nSpecial Session Overviews: SIGGRAPH Asia\nRetrospective\nRetrospective Entries\nRetrospective Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nTalks (Sketches)\nTalks (Sketches): Entries\nTalks (Sketches) Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nTalks (Sketches) Overviews: SIGGRAPH Asia\nTechnical Papers\nTechnical Paper: Entries\nTechnical Paper Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nTechnical Paper Overviews: SIGGRAPH Asia\nLearning: Other\nBusiness Symposium\nBusiness Symposium Entries\nBusiness Symposium Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nBusiness Symposium Overviews: SIGGRAPH Asia\nCo-located Events\nCo-located Events: Entries\nCo-located Event Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nCo-located Event Overviews: SIGGRAPH Asia\nDailies\nDailies: Entries\nDailies Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nDiversity, Equity, and Inclusion\nDiversity, Equity, and Inclusion: Entries\nDiversity, Equity & Inclusion Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nDiversity, Equity & Inclusion Overviews: SIGGRAPH Asia\nWeb Graphics\nWeb Graphics Entries\nWeb Graphics Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nPublications\nView All\nAnimation Publications\nAll Animation Publications\nAnimation Booklets\nElectronic Art & Animation\nFilm and Video Show & Electronic Theater Catalogs\nVisual Proceedings\nArt Show Publications\nAll Art Show Publications\nArt Show Catalogs\nElectronic Art & Animation\nLeonardo Art Papers & Art Catalogs\nVisual Proceedings\nComputer Graphics Quarterlies\nConference Program & Information\nAll Conference Program & Information\nAdvance Program\nCall for Participation\nLocator & Exhibitor Guide\nFinal Program & Buyers Guide\nConference-Related Electronic Media\nAll Conference-Related Electronic Media\nAbstracts & Applications CD-ROM\nConference Presentations on DVD\nConference Select\nCourses\nFull Conference\nVisual Proceedings\nExperience Publications\nAll Experience Publications\nConference Abstracts & Applications\nElectronic Art & Animation\nLeonardo\nVisual Proceedings\nLearning Publications\nAll Learning Publications\nConference Abstracts & Applications\nCourse Notes\nLeonardo\nProceedings\nVisual Proceedings\nProceedings\nAll Proceedings\nComputer Graphics Quarterlies\nComputers & Graphics\nTransactions on Graphics\nSIGGRAPHITTI Newsletters\nSIGGRAPH Video Reviews\nAll SVRs\nSVRs: SIGGRAPH\nSVRs: SIGGRAPH Asia\nSlide Sets\nAll Slide Sets\nApplications & Design Technology\nArt Show\nConference\nEducation\nIndustry & Exhibition\nStereo\nTechnical\nAwards\nView All\nACM SIGGRAPH Academy Members\nAwards: SIGGRAPH Organization\nComputer Graphics Achievement Award\nDistinguished Artist Award\nDistinguished Educator Award\nOutstanding Doctoral Dissertation Award\nOutstanding Service Award\nPractitioner Award\nSignificant New Researcher Award\nSteven Anson Coons Award\nAwards: SIGGRAPH Conference\nBest Art Paper\nAwards: Animation Awards\nAnimation Awards: All Entries\nAudience Choice\nBest in Show\nBest Student Project\nJury’s Choice\nEmerging Technologies: View All Awards\nAudience Award\nReal-time Live!: Awards\nAudience Choice\nBest in Show\nCollectibles+\nView All\nBadges & Swipe Cards\nBags & Backpacks\nClothing\nHats & Caps\nMugs & Glasses\nOther SIGGRAPH Swag\nPins & Buttons\nPosters\nPrint Materials\nRibbons\nWrist Bands\nCommunity\nExecutive Committee\nExecutive Committee History\nDigital Arts Community\nLeadership History\nEducation Committee\nSymposium On Innovation, Research & Experiences in Education (SOIREE)\nHistory and Archives Committee\nProfessional and Student Chapters\nChapters History\nSIGGRAPH Pioneers\nConference Chair Interviews\nPioneer Featured Speakers\nIn Memoriam\nOnline Panels\nPioneer Interviews\nRecollections and Misc\nPioneer Leadership History\nAwards Committee\nEarly Career Development\nExternal Relations\nInformation Technology Services\nMembership and Communication\nNominations Committee\nPublications\nSpecialized Conferences\nData View\nData View\nMap View\nSIGGRAPH Collection\nPhysical Location\nInventory\nInventory View All\nMissing Items\nCollectibles\nPublications\nSponsorship\nAbout Us\nSearch\nYuan-Chen Guo\nNext:\nYuan-Chen Guo\n»\n« Previous:\nYuan Zhang\nAbout Yuan-Chen Guo\nAffiliations\nVast\nLocation\nBeijing, China\nBio\nSA 2024:\nYuan-Chen Guo is a research scientist at VAST. He received his PhD degree from Tsinghua University in 2024. His research interests are mainly in 3D reconstruction and 3D generative models. He is also passionate about the open-source community.\nConference Contributions\nExperiences\nReal-Time Live!\nTripo Doodle: The Next-Gen AI 3D Creative Tool\nSIGGRAPH Asia 2024\n[\nReal-Time Live!\n]\nContributor(s):\nSienna Hwang\nMuqing Jia\nYan-Pei Cao\nYuan-Chen Guo\nYangguang Li\nDing Liang\nLearning\nTechnical Papers\nVMesh: Hybrid Volume-Mesh Representation for Efficient View Synthesis\nSIGGRAPH Asia 2023\n[\nTechnical Papers\n]\nPresenter(s):\nYuan-Chen Guo\nYan-Pei Cao\nChen Wang\nYing Shan\nSong-Hai Zhang\nYu He\nChoreoMaster: choreography-oriented music-driven dance synthesis\nSIGGRAPH 2021\n[\nTechnical Papers\n]\nPresenter(s):\nKang Chen\nZhipeng Tand\nJin Lei\nSong-Hai Zhang\nYuan-Chen Guo\nWeidong Zhang\nShi-Min Hu\nOther Information\nRoles\nReal-Time Live Presenter\nTechnical Paper Presenter\nSubmit a Story\nIf you would like to submit a story about this person (please keep it funny, informative and true), please contact us:\nhistoryarchives@siggraph.org\nIf you find errors or omissions on your profile page, please contact us:\nhistoryarchives@siggraph.org\nDid you know you can send us a photo of yourself and a bio and we will post it?  Make sure the photo is at least 1000 x 1000 and send it to the email above along with the bio and we will add it to your page.\nSponsored by:\nAll artwork and text on this site are the exclusive copyrighted works of the artist or author. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED. Any unlawful redistribution or reproduction of images featured on this site without prior express written authorization of the copyright owner is strictly prohibited.\n\n---\n\n“Contact and Friction Simulation for Computer Graphics” by Erleben – ACM SIGGRAPH HISTORY ARCHIVES\nACM SIGGRAPH HISTORY ARCHIVES\nMENU\nConferences\nSIGGRAPH\nSIGGRAPH Asia\nContributors\nSearch for People\nSearch for Exhibitors\nExhibitors\nExhibitors List\nExhibitors: View All\nExhibitor Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nExhibitor Overviews: SIGGRAPH Asia\nExhibitor Talks\nExhibitor View All\nExhibitor Talks Overviews: SIGGRAPH\nExhibitor Talks Overviews: SIGGRAPH Asia\nExhibitor Types\nExperiences\nView All\nACM SIGGRAPH Village\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nSIGGRAPH Asia Overviews\nAppy Hour\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nArt Show\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nSIGGRAPH Asia Overviews\nDAC Overviews\nArt Show Collections\nEntry Types\nDistinguished Artist Award\nBirds of a Feather\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nSIGGRAPH Asia Overviews\nCompetitions\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nSIGGRAPH Asia Overviews\nEntry Types\nOther Competitions\nComputer Animation / Electronic Theater\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nSIGGRAPH Asia Overviews\nEntry Types\nAnimation Awards\nEmerging Technologies\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH Overviews\nSIGGRAPH Asia Overviews\nEntry Types\nGames\nEntries\nSIGGRAPH O