    "homepage_text": "Hao Zhang 张昊 — Homepage\nhao.zhang\nwhoami\nHao Zhang\n张昊\nPhD Candidate @ UIUC · Research Scientist Intern @ World Labs\nEmail\n𝕏\nX\nGitHub\nScholar\n小红书\nWeChat\nzh17603602632\nLatest News\n2026-02-20\n🎉\nRigMo\n(first author) accepted by\nCVPR 2026\n, code and data will be release soon!\n2025-11-14\nI will join\nWorld Labs\nin San Francisco as a Research Scientist Intern starting\nJanuary 2026\n.\n2025-09-18\n🎉\nSP4D\n(first author) accepted by\nNeurIPS 2025\nSpotlight\n!\n2025-06-25\nPhysRig\n(first author) accepted by\nICCV 2025\n!\n2025-06-02\nI joined\nSnap Research\n(NY) as a Research Scientist Intern.\n2025-05-27\nOne paper (first author) accepted by\nTMLR 2025\n!\n2025-02-17\n🏆 Selected as\nMeshy Fellowship 2025 Finalist\n!\n2024-09-16\nWill join\nStability AI\nin Fall 2024.\n2024-05-02\nWill join\nPixocial AI Lab\nin Seattle.\n2024-05-02\nOne paper (first author) accepted by\nICML 2024\n!\n2024-01-16\nOne paper (first author) accepted by\nICLR 2024\n!\n2023-12-08\nOne paper (first author) accepted by\nAAAI 2024\n!\n2023-10-24\nOne paper (first author) accepted by\nWACV 2024\n!\nSelected Publications\nRigMo: Unifying Rig and Motion Learning for Generative Animation\nHao Zhang\n, Jiahao Luo, Bohui Wan, Yizhou Zhao, Zongrui Li, Michael Vasilkovsky, Chaoyang Wang, Jian Wang, Narendra Ahuja, Bing Zhou\nCVPR 2026\nProject\nPaper\nStable Part Diffusion 4D: Multi-View RGB and Kinematic Parts Video Generation\nHao Zhang\n, Chun-Han Yao, Simon Donné, Narendra Ahuja, Varun Jampani\nNeurIPS 2025\nSpotlight\nProject\nPaper\nCode\nLoading...\n🤗 Model\nRGB-Only Supervised Camera Parameter Optimization in Dynamic Scenes\nFang Li,\nHao Zhang\n, and Narendra Ahuja\nNeurIPS 2025\nSpotlight\nPaper\nPhysRig: Differentiable Physics‑Based Skinning and Rigging Framework\nHao Zhang*\n, Haolan Xu*, Chun Feng, Varun Jampani, Narendra Ahuja\nICCV 2025\nProject\nGitHub\nLoading...\nMagicPose4D: Crafting Articulated Models with Appearance and Motion Control\nHao Zhang*\n, Di Chang*, Fang Li, Mohammad Soleymani, Narendra Ahuja\nTMLR 2025\nProject\nGitHub\nLoading...\nS3O: A Dual‑Phase Approach for Reconstructing Dynamic Shape and Skeleton\nHao Zhang\n, Fang Li, Samyak Rawlekar, Narendra Ahuja\nICML 2024\nPaper\nLIMR: Learning Implicit Representation for Reconstructing Articulated Objects\nHao Zhang\n, Fang Li, Samyak Rawlekar, Narendra Ahuja\nICLR 2024\nPaper\nCSL: Class‑Agnostic Structure‑Constrained Learning for Segmentation\nHao Zhang\n, Fang Li, Lu Qi, Ming‑Hsuan Yang, Narendra Ahuja\nAAAI 2024\nPaper\nOpen‑NeRF: Towards Open Vocabulary NeRF Decomposition\nHao Zhang\n, Fang Li, Narendra Ahuja\nWACV 2024\nPaper\nExperience & Education\nWork Experience\nWorld Labs\nResearch Scientist Intern\n2026 Jan – Now\nSnap Research\nResearch Scientist Intern\n2025 Summer – 2025 Dec\nStability AI\nResearch Scientist Intern\n2024 Fall – 2025 Summer\nPIXOCIAL\nAI\nPixocial AI Lab\nResearch Scientist Intern\n2024 Summer\nShanghai AI Lab\nResearch Intern\n2021.10 – 2022.6\nShow More Experience\nEducation\nUniversity of Illinois Urbana‑Champaign\nPh.D. in Computer Vision\n2022–2027 (expected)\nUniversity of Southern California\nM.S. in ECE\n2019–2020\nCUHK, Shenzhen\nVisiting Student\n2021.3 – 2021.10\nCivil Aviation University of China\nB.S. in Telecommunication Engineering\n2014–2018\nMy Beloved Companions\nFifi\nBorn:\n2022-08-14\nWeight:\n6 lbs\nAge:\nLoading...\nTaotao\nBorn:\n2025-02-14\nWeight:\n4 lbs\nAge:\nLoading...\nProfessional Activities\nConference Reviewer\nICLR, NeurIPS, ECCV,\nCVPR, ICML, AAAI, ICCV\nJournal Reviewer\nTIP, TPAMI"
