    "homepage_text": "Zheng Li's Website!\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nZheng Li's Website!\nZheng Li\nAss\nociate\nProfessor\nComputer Sciences\n, School of Business\nStockton University\nGalloway, N\nL\n08205\nPhone: (\n609)-626-3150\nEmail:\nzheng.li\n@\nstockton\n.edu\nOffice:\nC-112\nShort Biography:\nDr. Zheng Li earned his Ph.D. in Computer Science from the Illinois Institute of Technology. Before joining Stockton, he served as an Assistant Professor in the School of Computer Sciences at Western Illinois University in Macomb, Illinois. Prior to his academic career, Dr. Li worked for three years as a full-time software engineer at Alcatel-Lucent.\nZheng's current research interests include Generative AI for Software Engineering Automation, Generative AI in Education, and AI–Hardware Optimization for Edge Computing .\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
  },
