    "homepage_text": "Wenbin Li\nWenbin\nLi\nSenior Lecturer (Assoc. Professor) in Robotics\nDepartment of Computer Science\nUniversity of Bath\nWenbin Li\nis currently a Senior Lecturer (Associate Professor) and leading\nPering Laboratory\n(Perceptual Intelligence Laboratory) affiliated with\nAI&ML\n, and\nVisual Computing\ngroups at the\nUniversity of Bath\n. His research interests lie in the development of general autonomous systems and their applications in manufacturing and professional capture. This may include the research topics in multi-sensory based localization and mapping, dynamic motion capture, as well as uncontrolled scene understanding and fabrication. Those exciting topics are broadly relevant to fields of Robotics, Computer Vision, Graphics and Machine Learning."
  },
