o Zhang, and\nZhijie Deng†\nFindings of\nEMNLP\n, Miami, USA, 2024\nCLLMs: Consistency Large Language Models\nSiqi Kou, Lanxiang Hu, Zhezhi He,\nZhijie Deng†\n, and Hao Zhang\nMLSys Young Professionals Symposium, Santa Clara, USA, 2024\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning\n(ICML)\n, Vienna, Austria, 2024\nOnline Speculative Decoding\nXiaoxuan Liu, Lanxiang Hu, Peter Bailis, Ion Stoica,\nZhijie Deng†\n, Alvin Cheung, and Hao Zhang†\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning\n(ICML)\n, Vienna, Austria, 2024\nDate-Efficient Learning\nWhich Data Attributes Stimulate Math and Code Reasoning? An Investigation via Influence Functions\nSiqi Kou, Qingyuan Tian, Hanwen Xu, Zihao Zeng, and\nZhijie Deng†\nAI for Math\n(AI4Math)\nWorkshop at ICML 2025\nAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems\n(NeurIPS)\n, San Diego, USA, 2025\nNeural Eigenfunctions Are Structured Representation Learners\nZhijie Deng*\n, Jiaxin Shi*, Hao Zhang, Peng Cui, Cewu Lu, and Jun Zhu\nIEEE Transaction on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence\n(TPAMI)\n, 2025\nImproved Operator Learning by Orthogonal Attention\nZipeng Xiao, Zhongkai Hao, Bokai Lin,\nZhijie Deng†\n, and Hang Su†\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning\n(ICML)\n, Vienna, Austria, 2024 (\nSpotlight\n)\nTowards Accelerated Model Training via Bayesian Data Selection\nZhijie Deng*\n, Peng Cui*, and Jun Zhu\nAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems\n(NeurIPS)\n, New Orleans, USA, 2023\nLearning Neural Eigenfunctions for Unsupervised Semantic Segmentation\nZhijie Deng\nand Yucen Luo\nInternational Conference on Computer Vision\n(ICCV)\n, Paris, France, 2023\n[ArXiv]\n[code]\nNeuralEF: Deconstructing Kernels by Deep Neural Networks\nZhijie Deng\n, Jiaxin Shi, and Jun Zhu\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning\n(ICML)\n, Baltimore, USA, 2022\n[ArXiv]\n[code]\n[slides]\nTalks\n自回归-扩散混合模型\n,\nAI TIME\n, 2025.11\n自回归-扩散混合模型\n,\nCSIG青年科学家会议2025扩散模型论坛\n, 2025.09\n自回归-扩散混合式大模型\n,\n机器学习与科学应用大会（CSML2025）\n, 20