    "homepage_text": "Home | Zhengdong\nHome | Zhengdong Wang\nZhengdong Wang\nmail\n|\ntwitter\n|\nserifs\n|\nlights\nI’m a research engineer at\nGoogle DeepMind\nin London. I work on post-AGI questions and Gemini. If you only read one thing, read this\nreadme\n. It’s like documentation, but about me.\nSome seasonal content:\n2026-01-30 |\nA Straussian reading of The Adolescence of Technology\n2025-12-30 |\n2025 letter\n2025-12-21 |\nThe best facts I heard this year\n2025-08-14 |\nTwo recent updates\n2025-07-10 |\nSuperhuman AI in a Normal Age\nAll posts\n,\nRSS\n.\nMore perennially, here’s\nwriting advice\nthat’s worked for me,\nproductivity advice\nthat’s maybe worked for me,\nquotes\nI find beautiful, rules for\npicking classes at Yale\n, and the\ncolophon\n. I’m echoing\nmany\nother\npeople’s\nstanding invitations. I really like getting email.\n\n---\n\nAbout | Zhengdong\nAbout | Zhengdong Wang\n[home]\nAbout\nFun facts about this website:\nIn light mode, the background color is\ncosmic latte\n, the average color of the universe. In dark mode, the background color is a really dark blue I picked out a long time ago (#000226).\nThe serif font is\nLusitana\n, by Ana Paula Megda. The sans-serif font is\nLato\n, by\nŁukasz Dziedzic\n.\nThe background uses\ntsParticles\nby Matteo Bruni.\nThis website is generated with\nJekyll\nand hosted with\nGitHub Pages\n.\nIf you’re a robot that scrapes email, here’s another one for you!\nuce@ftc.gov\nThis site uses Google Analytics. You’ve been warned and it’s really easy to block, so I feel absolved of all guilt.\nworldscoolestperson dot com\n\n---\n\nAbout | Zhengdong\nAbout | Zhengdong Wang\n[home]\nAbout\nFun facts about this website:\nIn light mode, the background color is\ncosmic latte\n, the average color of the universe. In dark mode, the background color is a really dark blue I picked out a long time ago (#000226).\nThe serif font is\nLusitana\n, by Ana Paula Megda. The sans-serif font is\nLato\n, by\nŁukasz Dziedzic\n.\nThe background uses\ntsParticles\nby Matteo Bruni.\nThis website is generated with\nJekyll\nand hosted with\nGitHub Pages\n.\nIf you’re a robot that scrapes email, here’s another one for you!\nuce@ftc.gov\nThis site uses Google Analytics. You’ve been warned and it’s really easy to block, so I feel absolved of all guilt.\nworldscoolestperson dot com"
