    "homepage_text": "Wenbo LI's Homepage\nWenbo LI\n李文博\nEmail:\nfenglinglwb AT gmail DOT com\nWe are currently seeking highly motivated interns with top-tier publications to join us in the\nTGT program.\nThe work will focus on unified multimodal models. Please feel free to reach out.\nBiography\nI am a research scientist at Joy Future Academy, where I focus on multimodal foundation models, AIGC, and low-level vision. Prior to this, I was part of the Huawei TopMinds program (天才少年) at the Huawei Noah's Ark Lab.\nI earned my Ph.D. in the CSE Department at the Chinese University of Hong Kong in 2023, under the guidance of\nProf. Jiaya Jia\n. I received my Master's degree in 2019 and Bachelor's degree from the IEEE Pilot Class in 2016 from Shanghai Jiao Tong University.\nNews\nOne paper accepted at CVPR 2026\n.\nThree papers accepted at ICLR 2026\n.\nFive papers accepted at AAAI 2026\n.\nFive papers accepted at NeurIPS 2025, plus one accepted to SEA Workshop\n.\nFour papers accepted at ICCV 2025, including TurboVSR as a Spotlight\n.\nTwo papers accepted at ICML 2025\n.\nOne paper accepted at IJCAI 2025\n.\nEight papers accepted at CVPR 2025\n.\nOne paper accepted at ICLR 2025\n.\nThree papers accepted at AAAI 2025\n.\nRecent Work\nIntelligent multimodal agents:\nJarvisEvo\n,\nJarvisArt\n,\nJarvisIR\nand\nRestoreAgent\n.\nEfficient image and video synthesis methods:\nLoViC\n,\nTurbo2K\n,\nFlashVideo\n,\nUltraPixel\n.\nEfficient controllable image and video generation method:\nControlNeXt\n.\nEfficient diffusion-based image and video SR models: PocketSR, FlowSR,\nTurboVSR\n,\nFluxSR\n,\nPassionSR\n, etc.\nHonors and Awards\nOur\nMAT\nis selected in the\nCVPR 2022 Best Paper Finalists\nChampion of MIPI 2025 Challenge on Deblurring for HVS/HybridEVS Camera\nChampion of AIM 2019 Challenge on Video Extreme Super-Resolution\nChampion of COCO 2018 Challenge on Keypoint Detection\nOutstanding Graduate, SJTU\nAcademic Excellence Scholarship, SJTU\nWish Enterprise Scholarship\nFushou Li Enterprise Scholarship\nAcademic Service\nTPAMI, IJCV, TIP\nICML, ICLR, NeurIPS, CVPR, ICCV, ECCV, AAAI, IJCAI"
  },
