    "homepage_text": "About Me - Qitong Gao\nSkip to content\nQitong Gao\nAbout Me\nHi! I’m Qitong Gao, currently a\nResearch Scientist\nat\nNetflix\nworking on personalization, recommendation and bandit algorithms. Previously, I obtained PhD degree (with a best dissertation award) from the\nElectrical and Computer Engineering Department\nat\nDuke University\nunder the supervision of\nProf. Miroslav Pajic\n. Prior to this, I obtained Master’s Degree from the Mechanical Engineering Department at Duke University under the supervision of\nProf. Michael M. Zavlanos\n. My research interests span\nReinforcement Learning, Time-Series Analyses\nand\nComputer Vision\n, and their applications in\nRecommender Systems, Healthcare\n,\nAutomated Image Analysis\n,\nRobotics\nand\nCyber-Physical Systems\n.\nOutside of academic, I’d like to participate in some social innovation/consulting program for improving the society around us. I also enjoy traveling around the world because I believe that is the best way to experience different culture and to broaden my horizon. I had been to Switzerland, Germany, Italy, Austria, Greece, Japan, Korea, Thailand…\n\n---\n\nContact - Qitong Gao\nSkip to content\nQitong Gao\nContact\nHi There,\nPlease feel free to get in touch via the form below, I will get back to you as soon as possible.\nQitong Gao\nE-mail:\nqitong.gao@duke.edu\nMail:\n100 Science Dr\n130 Hudson Hall, Box 90300\nDuke University, Durham, NC 27708\n\n---\n\nContact - Qitong Gao\nSkip to content\nQitong Gao\nContact\nHi There,\nPlease feel free to get in touch via the form below, I will get back to you as soon as possible.\nQitong Gao\nE-mail:\nqitong.gao@duke.edu\nMail:\n100 Science Dr\n130 Hudson Hall, Box 90300\nDuke University, Durham, NC 27708"
  },
  "deep_homepage::Ge Gao::https://gao-g.github.io/": {
