    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Ya Zhang | Education Leadership, Research and Technology | Western Michigan University\nSkip to main content\nKeywords\nMain Menu\nClose Menu\nKeywords\nEducational Leadership, Research and Technology\nSkip to content\nDepartment of Educational Leadership Research and Technology\nWestern Michigan University\nKalamazoo MI 49008-5283 USA\n(269) 387-3897\nYa Zhang\nYa Zhang\nAssociate Professor of Evaluation, Measurement and Research\nOffice:\n269-387-3881\nSend an email\nLocation:\n3571 Sangren Hall, Mail Stop 5283\nMailing address:\nDepartment of Educational Leadership, Research, and Technology\nWestern Michigan University\n1903 W Michigan Ave\nKalamazoo MI  49008-5283 USA\nView full size image\nEducation:\nPh.D., Research Methodology, University of Pittsburgh, 2017\nM.A., Research Methodology, University of Pittsburgh, 2015\nM.A., Developmental Psychology, East China Normal University, 2007\nB.S., Biological Science, East China Normal University, 2004\nBio:\nDr. Ya Zhang is an assistant professor of educational leadership, research, and technology at Western Michigan University, specializing in evaluation, measurement and research. She earned her Ph.D. in Research Methodology from University of Pittsburgh. She has two main lines of research in statistical modeling and psychometrics. Her research topics include latent variable modeling, Bayesian estimation, educational data mining, measurement invariance, equating, and mixture IRT modeling."
  },
