al Natural Science Foundation of China (NSFC) -No.11522108\n2014.7—2017.6: Shanghai Science and Technology Commission – No.14QA1400400\n2012.1—2016.12: National Natural Science Foundation of China (NSFC)\nKey Project Grant: 91130004  -  Member (PI – Prof.\nGang Bao\n)\n2011.9—2012.8: Humboldt Research Fellowship for postdoctoral researchers, Germany (Host Institute: WIAS)\n2012.1—2014.12: National Natural Science Foundation of China (NSFC) -No.11101093\n2012.1—2014.12: Ministry of Education of China -No.20110071120001\n2011.4—2014.3: Shanghai Science and Technology Commission – No.11ZR1402800\n2011.10–2013.9: Shanghai Science and Technology Commission — No.11PJ1400800\nAwards:\n2006-2007: Chinese Goverment Award for Outstanding Self-Financed Students Abroad\n2007: Ph.D. in Distinction, University of Linz, Austria\n2010.12:\nMediaV Young Researcher Award\nby\nInternational Conference on Inverse Problems\n, Hongkong\n2011-2012:\nHumboldt Research Fellowship\nfor Postdoctoral Researchers, Germany\n2012.8: Young Research Award by China Society for Industrial and Applied Mathematics (CSIAM)\n2013.7: Plenary speaker of\nApplied Inverse Problems Conference\n, Daejeon, Korea\n2016.1—2018.12: NSFC Excellent Youth Grant -No.11522108\n2017.01—2019.12: Changjiang (Yangtze River) Scholar award：Youth Scholar\n2020.1—2024.12: NSFC Distinguished Youth Grant -No.11925104\nAcademic service:\nEditorial member of\nInverse Problems\n;\nInverse Problems and Imaging\n;\nNumerical Mathematics: Theory, Methods and Applications\n;\nElectronic Research Announcements\n;\nJournal of Numerical Methods and Computer Applications\n(a Chinese Journal)\n​Copyright © 2019 复旦大学版权所有\n沪ICP备:16018209-1\n地址：上海市杨浦区邯郸路220号\n邮编：200433\n手机版\n访问量：\n次\n开通时间：\n.\n.\n最后更新时间：\n.\n."
