    "homepage_text": "Haifeng Sun\nHaifeng Sun\nResearch\nTeaching\nHaifeng Sun\nAssistant Professor \nBeijing University of Posts and Telecommunications\nLinks\nGoogle Scholar\nORCID\nResearch Interests\nI work on artificial intelligent and networking. My major research interests are Natural Language Processing and Computer Networks, especially the intersection of them, such as Distributed NLP, Network Configuration, and Network Modeling.\nI work at NIRC (Wechat:BUPT_NIRC).Welcome to visit us!\nI’m looking for highly self-motivated students to work with me as PhD and/or master students. Candidates who are interested please contact me directly.\nSelected Publications (\nfull list\n)\n[1]\n“Software-defined Network Assimilation: Bridging the Last Mile Towards Centralized Network Configuration Management with NAssim”\n, ACM SIGCOMM 2022 (Best Paper Award)\n[2]\n“Density Cluster based Approach for Controller Placement Problem in Large-scale Software Defined Networkings”\n, Computer Networks, vol. 112, pages. 24-35, 2017\n[3]\n“A Novel Multi-Task Learning Framework for Semi-Supervised Semantic Parsing”\n. IEEE ACM Transactions on Audio Speech and Language Processing 28: 2552-2560 (2020)\n[4]\n“Pattern and Content Controlled Response Generation”\n. Information Processing and Management 58(5): 102605 (2021)\n[5]\n“Adversarial and Domain-Aware BERT for Cross-Domain Sentiment Analysis”\n. ACL 2020: 4019-4028\nResearch\nTeaching"
  },
