alysis [\nCode @ GitHub\n]\nAutoformer\n: A base network backbone for time series forecasting [\nCode @ GitHub\n]\nTransolver\n: A neural PDE solver for physics-based simulation [\nCode @ GitHub\n]\ndepyf\n: A tool for understanding and adapting to PyTorch compiler [\nCode @ GitHub\n]\nTalks\nTowards General World Models: Pre-training, Multi-Modality, and Scalable Architecture\n, CSIAM Big Data and Artificial Intelligence, BDAI 2024 [\nPDF\n]\nA Roadmap to Practical Neural PDE Solvers\n, CSIAM Big Data and Artificial Intelligence, BDAI 2024 [\nPDF\n]\nFoundation Models for Time Series Analysis\n, The Global Artificial Intelligence Technology Conference, GAITC 2023 [\nPDF\n]\nDomain Adaptation: Theory, Algorithms, and Open Library\n, Workshop on Distribution Shifts, NeurIPS 2022 [\nPDF\n]\nTransferability in Deep Learning\n, China Workshop on Machine Learning and Applications, MLA 2022 [\nPDF\n]\nTransfer Learning: Theories, Algorithms, and Open Library\n, Workshop on Federated and Transfer Learning, IJCAI 2021 [\nPDF\n]\nTransfer Learning: Theories and Algorithms\n, Chinese Conference on Data Mining, CCDM 2020 [\nPDF\n]\nSelected Awards\nFrontiers of Science Award, International Congress of Basic Science, 2025\n100 Young Pioneers in AI (AI100), MIT Technology Review China, 2025\nOutstanding Paper Award, World Artificial Intelligence Conference, 2024\nMy Favorite Teacher, Tsinghua University, 2024\nExcellent Faculty, Tsinghua University, 2024\nExcellent Advisor, Tsinghua University, 2023\nHighlighted Area Chair, ICLR 2022\nTest of Time Award, FTL-IJCAI, 2021\nWorld's Top 2% Scientists (by Career), 2024\nHighly Cited Scholar, Elsevier, 2021-2024\nAI2000 Most Influential Scholar Award in Machine Learning, 2021-2023\nFirst Prize, Science and Technology Progress Award, Beijing, 2021\nEarly Career Award, NSFC, China, 2020\nBeijing Nova Talent, Beijing, 2020\nFirst Prize, Technical Invention Award, Ministry of Education, China, 2018\nDistinguished Dissertation Award, China