genome packaging and capsid assembly of bluetongue virus visualized in host cells. Cell. 2024 Apr 25; 187(9):2236-2249.e17.\nXia X, Sung PY, Martynowycz MW,\nGonen T\n, Roy P,\nZhou ZH\n.  PMID: 38614100; PMCID:\nPMC11182334\n.\nView in:\nPubMed\nMentions:\n9\nFields:\nCel\nCell Biology\nTranslation:\nAnimals\nCells\nAtomic structures of a bacteriocin targeting Gram-positive bacteria. Res Sq. 2024 Mar 27.\nCai X, He Y, Yu I, Imani A, Scholl D, Miller JF,\nZhou ZH\n.  PMID: 38586031; PMCID:\nPMC10996793\n.\nView in:\nPubMed\nMentions:\nThe incredible bulk: Human cytomegalovirus tegument architectures uncovered by AI-empowered cryo-EM. Sci Adv. 2024 02 23; 10(8):eadj1640.\nJih J, Liu YT, Liu W,\nZhou ZH\n.  PMID: 38394211; PMCID:\nPMC10889378\n.\nView in:\nPubMed\nMentions:\n3\nFields:\nSci\nScience\nTranslation:\nHumans\nCells\nThe universal suppressor mutation restores membrane budding defects in the HSV-1 nuclear egress complex by stabilizing the oligomeric lattice. PLoS Pathog. 2024 Jan; 20(1):e1011936.\nDraganova EB, Wang H, Wu M, Liao S, Vu A, Gonzalez-Del Pino GL,\nZhou ZH\n, Roller RJ, Heldwein EE.  PMID: 38227586; PMCID:\nPMC10817169\n.\nView in:\nPubMed\nMentions:\n1\nFields:\nMic\nMicrobiology\nTranslation:\nCells\nExosomes from Von Hippel-Lindau-Null Cancer Cells Promote Metastasis in Renal Cell Carcinoma. Int J Mol Sci. 2023 Dec 09; 24(24).\nFlora K, Ishihara M, Zhang Z, Bowen ES, Wu A, Ayoub T, Huang J, Cano-Ruiz C, Jackson M, Reghu K, Ayoub Y,\nZhu Y\n,\nTseng HR\n,\nZhou ZH\n, Hu J, Wu L.  PMID: 38139136; PMCID:\nPMC10743428\n.\nView in:\nPubMed\nMentions:\n5\nFields:\nBio\nBiochemistry\nChe\nChemistry\nMol\nMolecular Biology\nTranslation:\nHumans\nCells\nStructural basis for polyuridine tract recognition by...[truncated]"
