    "homepage_text": "BOWEN SHI - Home\nCreate a free website\nPowered by\nBOWEN SHI\nI am a Ph.D candidate in the Department of Economics at Virginia Tech. I am on the job market in the 2017-2018 academic year and I will be available for interviews at the ASSA Annual Meeting in Philadelphia, USA.\nCurriculum vitae:\nContact information:\nPhone:\n+1 (540)-315-4496\nEmail:\n[email protected]\nAddress:\n3016 Pamplin Hall,\nDepartment of Economics, Virginia Tech\n880 West Campus Drive,\nBlacksburg, VA 24061\nResearch fields:\nNetwork Economics, Game Theory and Mechanism Design, Information Economics.\nPowered by\nCreate your own unique website with customizable templates.\nGet Started\n\n---\n\nContact - BOWEN SHI\nCreate a free website\nPowered by\nBOWEN SHI\n​Phone:\n+1 (540)-315-4496\nEmail:\n[email protected]\nAddress:\n3016 Pamplin Hall,\nDepartment of Economics, Virginia Tech\n880 West Campus Drive,\nBlacksburg, VA 24061\nPowered by\nCreate your own unique website with customizable templates.\nGet Started\n\n---\n\nContact - BOWEN SHI\nCreate a free website\nPowered by\nBOWEN SHI\n​Phone:\n+1 (540)-315-4496\nEmail:\n[email protected]\nAddress:\n3016 Pamplin Hall,\nDepartment of Economics, Virginia Tech\n880 West Campus Drive,\nBlacksburg, VA 24061\nPowered by\nCreate your own unique website with customizable templates.\nGet Started\n\n---\n\nContact - BOWEN SHI\nCreate a free website\nPowered by\nBOWEN SHI\n​Phone:\n+1 (540)-315-4496\nEmail:\n[email protected]\nAddress:\n3016 Pamplin Hall,\nDepartment of Economics, Virginia Tech\n880 West Campus Drive,\nBlacksburg, VA 24061\nPowered by\nCreate your own unique website with customizable templates.\nGet Started"
