and Engineering Summer Camp\nElectrical Engineering Summer Camp\nSupport\nElectrical Engineering and Computer Science Alumni Society\nPenn State Engineering Alumni Society\nPenn State Alumni Association\nGiving\nVolunteer\nMinghui Zhu\nProfessor\nAffiliation(s):\nSchool of Electrical Engineering and Computer Science\nElectrical Engineering\n229 Electrical Engineering West\nmuz16@psu.edu\n814-865-5315\nPersonal or Departmental Website\nResearch Areas:\nControl and Decision Systems; Power and Energy Systems; Security and Privacy\nInterest Areas:\nSystems and control, multi-agent networks, distributed algorithms, robotics\nResearch\nDepartments\nAlumni\nGive\nDirectory\nAbout\nThe School of Electrical Engineering and Computer Science was created in the spring of 2015 to allow greater access to courses offered by both departments for undergraduate and graduate students in exciting collaborative research fields.\nWe offer B.S. degrees in electrical engineering, computer science, computer engineering and data science and graduate degrees (master's degrees and Ph.D.'s) in electrical engineering and computer science and engineering. EECS focuses on the convergence of technologies and disciplines to meet today’s industrial demands.\nPrivacy and Legal Statements\nAccessibility\nUniversity Hotlines\nEmail Webmaster\nSchool of Electrical Engineering and Computer Science\nThe Pennsylvania State University\n207 Electrical Engineering West\nUniversity Park, PA 16802\n814-863-6740\nDepartment of Computer Science and Engineering\n814-865-9505\nDepartment of Electrical Engineering\n814-865-7039\n©2025 The Pennsylvania State University\n\\\nPrivacy and Legal Statements\n\\\nAccessibility\n\\\nContact Webmaster"
