    "homepage_text": "Haobo Wang\nHaobo Wang\nHome\nShort Bio\nProfessional Services\nHome\nHaobo Wang (王 皓波)\nAssistant Professor (PhD Supervisor)\nSchool of Software Technology\nZhejiang University, China\nEmail: wanghaobo AT zju.edu.cn  /\nGoogle Scholar\nMy research interests lie generally in the area of machine learning and data intelligence, including open-world learning algorithms, large language models, and tabular data analysis.\nPublications\n(* Corresponding author.)\nShenzhi Yang, Guangcheng Zhu,\nHaobo Wang*\n, Xing Zheng, Yingfan MA, Zhongqi Chen, Bowen Song, Weiqiang Wang, Junbo Zhao, Gang Chen.\nTraPO: A Semi-Supervised Reinforcement Learning Framework for Boosting LLM Reasoning.\nIn Proceedings of the 14th International Conference on Learning Representations (\nICLR\n)\n, 2026.\nZewei Yu, Lirong Gao, Sheng Guo, Yuke Zhu, Bo Zheng, Junbo Zhao,\nHaobo Wang*\n.\nStop Unnecessary Reflection: Training LRMs for Efficient Reasoning with Adaptive Reflection and Length Coordinated Penalty.\nIn Proceedings of the 14th International Conference on Learning Representations (\nICLR\n)\n, 2026.\nWentao Ye, Jiaqi Hu,\nHaobo Wang*\n, Xinpeng Ti, Zhiqing Xiao, Hao Chen, Liyao Li, Lei Feng, Sai Wu, Junbo Zhao.\nAn Invariant Latent Space Perspective on Language Model Inversion.\nProceedings of the AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (\nAAAI\n)\n, 2026.\nKai Tang, Yixuan Tang, Tianyi Chen, Haokai Xu, Qiqi Luo, Jin Guang Zheng, Zhixin Zhang, Gang Chen,\nHaobo Wang\n.\nGroup-aware Multiscale Ensemble Learning for Test-Time Multimodal Sentiment Analysis.\nProceedings of the AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (\nAAAI\n)\n, 2026.\nZhen Zhu, Yixuan Tang,\nHaobo Wang\n, Gengyu Lyu, Cheng Peng, Yining Sun, Kai Tang, Songhe Feng.\nDual Graph Disambiguation for Multi-Instance Partial-Label Learning.\nProceedings of the AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (\nAAAI\n)\n, 2026.\nLiyao Li, Hao Chen, Jiaming Tian, Wentao Ye, Lirong Gao, Chao Ye, Ningtao Wang, Xing Fu,\nYu Cheng,\nHaobo Wang\n, Gang Chen, Junbo Zhao.\nReinforcement Learning with Verbalized Probabilities for LLM Classification.\nIn Proceedings of the The Web Conference (\nWWW\n)\n, 2024.\nZhiqing Xiao,\nHaobo Wang*\n, Yali Ye, Wentao Ye, Hao Chen, Gang Chen, Junbo Zhao, and Rex Ying.\nLADA: Label Disambiguation and Domain-Aware Learning for Domain Generalization.\nMachine Learning Journal (\nMLJ\n)\n, 2026.\nShenzhi Yang, Junbo Zhao, Sharon Li, Shouqing Yang, Dingyu Yang, Xiaofang Zhang,\nHaobo Wang*\n.\nHarnessing Feature Resonance under Arbitrary Target Alignment for Out-of-Distribution Node Detection.\nAnnual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n)\n, 2025.\nZhifang Zhang, Shuo He,\nHaobo Wang\n, Bingquan Shen, Lei Feng.\nDefending Multimodal Backdoored Models by Repulsive Visual Prompt Tuning.\nAnnual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n)\n, 2025.\nLiyao Li, Chao Ye, Wentao Ye, Yifei Sun, Zhe Jiang,\nHaobo Wang\n, Jiaming Tian,\nYiming Zhang, Ningtao Wang, Xing Fu, Gang Chen, Junbo Zhao.\nTable as a Modality for Large Language Models.\nAnnual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n)\n, 2025.\nMingxuan Xia, Zhijie Jiang,\nHaobo Wang*\n, Junbo Zhao, Tianlei Hu, Gang Chen.\nEnsembling Prompting Strategies for Zero-Shot Hierarchical Text Classification with Large Language Models.\nThe Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (\nEMNLP-Main\n)\n, 2025.\nQi Zhang, Shouqing Yang, Lirong Gao, Hao Chen, Xiaomeng Hu, Jinglei Chen, Jiexiang Wang,\nSheng Guo, Bo Zheng,\nHaobo Wang*\n, Junbo Zhao.\nLeTS: Learning to Think-and-Search via Process-and-Outcome Reward Hybridization.\nThe Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (\nEMNLP-Main\n)\n, 2025.\nKai Tang, Rui Wang, Renyu Zhu, Minmin Lin, Xiao Ding, Tangjie Lv, Changjie Fan, Runze Wu,\nHaobo Wang*\n.\nTowards Transferable Personality Representation Learning based on Triplet Comparisons and Its Applications.\nThe Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (\nEMNLP-Main\n)\n, 2025.\nZhanming Shen, Hao Chen, Yulei Tang, Shaolin Zhu, Wentao Ye, Xiaomeng Hu,\nHaobo Wang\n, Gang Chen, Junbo Zhao.\nCYCLE-INSTRUCT: Fully Seed-Free Instruction Tuning via Dual Self-Training and Cycle Consistency.\nThe Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (\nEMNLP-Main\n)\n, 2025.\nXinpeng Ti, Wentao Ye, Zhifang Zhang, Junbo Zhao, Chang Yao, Lei Feng,\nHaobo Wang*\n.\nTowards Reverse Engineering of Language Models: A Survey.\nThe Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (\nEMNLP-Findings\n)\n, 2025.\nLiyao Li, Jiaming Tian, Hao Chen, Wentao Ye, Chao Ye,\nHaobo Wang\n, NINGTAO WANG, Xing Fu, Gang Chen, Junbo Zhao.\nLongTableBench: Benchmarking Long-Context Table Reasoning across Real-World Formats and Domains.\nThe Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (\nEMNLP-Findings\n)\n, 2025.\nMaosheng Qin, Renyu Zhu, Mingxuan Xia, Chenchenkai, Zhen Zhu, Minmin Lin,\nJunbo Zhao, Lu Xu, Changjie Fan, Runze Wu,\nHaobo Wang*\n.\nCrowdAgent: Multi-Agent Managed Multi-Source Annotation System.\nThe Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (\nEMNLP-Demo\n)\n, 2025.\nMingxuan Xia,\nHaobo Wang*\n, Yixuan Li, Zewei Yu, Jindong Wang, Junbo Zhao, Runze Wu.\nPrompt Candidates, then Distill: A Teacher-Student Framework for LLM-driven Data Annotation.\nAnnual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (\nACL-Main\n)\n, 2025.\nGuangcheng Zhu, Ruixuan Xiao,\nHaobo Wang\n, Zhen Zhu, Gengyu Lyu, Junbo Zhao.\nLarge Margin Representation Learning for Robust Cross-lingual Named Entity Recognition.\nAnnual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (\nACL-Main\n)\n, 2025.\nPengzuo Wu, Yuhang Yang, Guangcheng Zhu, Chao Ye, Hong Gu, Xu Lu, Ruixuan Xiao,\nBowen Bao, Yijing He, Liangyu Zha, Wentao Ye, Junbo Zhao,\nHaobo Wang*\n.\nRealHiTBench: A Comprehensive Realistic Hierarchical