    "homepage_text": "Dr. Xing Xie – Just another Sites @ Georgia Tech site\nSkip to main navigation\nSkip to content\nDr. Xing Xie\nSearch for:\nSearch\nSearch for:\nSearch\nNow in main content\nHome\nOur research centers on the application of innovative materials and devices to address global challenges related to water, energy, food, and health. Our research interests include water treatment and reuse, environmental and biological sample preservation, and energy and resource recovery.\nBack to top"
