    "homepage_text": "Bo Peng (Bo, Peng)'s Homepage\nBo PENG\nProfessor(PhD)\nLab of \n            Image processing and Parallel computing\nDepartment of Computer Science and Technology\nSouthwest Petroleum University\nAddress: Room 515, MingLi Building, Southwest Petroleum University, Chengdu 610000, \n            P.R.China\nEmail:\nbopeng at swpu dot edu dot cn\n[\nNews\n|\nBiography\n|\nResearch  Interests\n|\nSelected Publications\n|\nServices\n|\nStudents\n]\nNews\nApr-1-2025, one paper was accepted by\nIEEE International Joint Conference on Neural Networks(IEEE IJCNN 2025, CCF-C)！\nCongrats to Jiaxun Xu\nMar-24-2025, one paper was accepted by\nPhysics of Fluids(SCI, 中科院二区)！\nCongrats to Wu Lin\nJan-29-2025, one paper was accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Ultrasonics, Ferroelectrics, and Frequency Control(SCI, 中科院二区)！\nCongrats to Wenzhao Han\nOct-14-2024, one paper was accepted by\nIEEE International Conference on Bioinformatics and Biomedicine 2024(IEEE BIBM 2024, CCF-B)！\nCongrats to Xiaofeng Li\nOct-9-2024, one paper was accepted by\nJournal of Petroleum Science and Engineering(SCI, 中科院二区)！\nCongrats to Jiabin Shi\nSep-15-2024, one paper was accepted by\nPhysics of Fluids(SCI, 中科院二区)！\nCongrats to Yuhao Xia\nJuly-24-2024, one paper was accepted by\nIEEE International Conference on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics(IEEE SMC 2024, CCF-C)！\nCongrats to Yihong Zhu\nJuly-5-2024, one paper was accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Ultrasonics, Ferroelectrics, and Frequency Control(SCI, 中科院二区)！\nCongrats to Yuting Zhang\nJune-27-2024, one paper was accepted by\nPhysiological Measurement(SCI, 中科院三区)！\nCongrats to Jiajun Cai\nApr-19-2024, 团队参与的项目\"用于乳腺肿瘤筛查的触诊成像技术研究及应用\"获四川省医学会 医学科技奖二等奖！\nMar-22-2024, one paper was accepted by\nMedical & Biological Engineering & Computing(SCI, 中科院四区)!\nCongrats to Tianqiang Xiang.\nBiography\nBo Peng received his B.E. degree in Computer Science from Southwest Petroleum University (SWPU), Chengdu, China, in 2003, followed by an M.S. in 2007 and a Ph.D. in 2014 from Sichuan University, Chengdu, China. He joined SWPU as a Lecturer in 2007 and currently serves as a Professor of Computer Science. Between 2014 and 2015, he pursued post-doctoral research in the Department of Biomedical Engineering at Michigan Technological University, Houghton, USA, under the supervision of Dr. Jingfeng Jiang (Professor and Graduate Program Director). From 2020 to 2021, he was a Visiting Scholar at the Medical Ultrasound Engineering (MUSE) Lab in the Department of Biomedical Engineering, Tsinghua University School of Medicine, Beijing, China, working with Dr. Jianwen Luo (Chang Jiang Scholar Chair Professor).\n      His research focuses on advancing medical imaging technologies, with expertise in ultrasound elastography, ultrasound localization microscopy, GPU-accelerated computing, and medical image analysis. Recently, he has expanded his work into machine learning, computer vision (with applications in the petroleum industry and aerodynamics), and LLM (Large Language Model) quantification.\nResearch  Interests\n[1]Medical Ultrasound Imaging (Ultrasound Elastography, Ultrasound Localization Microscopy, Vector Flow Imaging, Pulse Wave Velocity, etc.).\n[2]Medical Image Analysis.\n[3]Research on Deep Learning/Machine learning-based Cross-disciplinary Applications.\n[4]GPU-based High-performance Computing.\nSelected Publications\nW. Wang\n, H. Zhang, Y. Li, Y. Wang, Q. Zhang,  G. Ding,  L. Yin, J. Tang and\nB. Peng\n, \"An Automated Heart Shunt Recognition Pipeline Using Deep Neural Networks\", in  J Digit Imaging. Inform. med.(2024).\nhttps://doi.org/10.1007/s10278-024-01047-4\n(SCI,中科院2区,JCR1区)\nS. Wen\n,\nB. Peng\n, X. Wei, J. Luo and J. Jiang, \"Convolutional Neural Network-based Speckle Tracking for Ultrasound Strain Elastography: An Unsupervised Learning Approach,\" in IEEE Transactions on Ultrasonics, Ferroelectrics, and Frequency Control, vol.70, no.5, pp. 354-367, May 2023, doi: 10.1109/TUFFC.2023.3243539. (SCI,中科院2区,JCR1区)\nB. Peng\n,\nY. Wang\n, T. J. Hall and J. Jiang, \"A GPU-Accelerated 3-D Coupled Subsample Estimation Algorithm for Volumetric Breast Strain Elastography,\" in IEEE Transactions on Ultrasonics, Ferroelectrics, and Frequency Control, vol. 64, no. 4, pp. 694-705, April 2017, doi: 10.1109/TUFFC.2017.2661821.(SCI,中科院2区,JCR1区)\nB. Peng\n,\nY. Wang\n, W. Yang, T. Varghese and J. Jiang, \"Relative Elastic Modulus Imaging Using Sector Ultrasound Data for Abdominal Applications: An Evaluation of Strategies and Feasibility,\" in IEEE Transactions on Ultrasonics, Ferroelectrics, and Frequency Control, vol. 63, no. 9, pp. 1432-1440, Sept. 2016, doi: 10.1109/TUFFC.2016.2589270.(SCI,中科院2区,JCR1区)\nY. Wang\n,\nB. Peng\n, J. Jiang, \"Building an open-source simulation platform of acoustic radiation force-based breast elastography,\" Physics in Medicine & Biology, 2017, 62(5): 1949-1969. (SCI,中科院3区,JCR1区)\nB. Peng\n,\nY. Xian\n, Q. Zhang and J. Jiang, \"Neural  Network-based Motion Tracking for Breast Ultrasound Strain Elastography: An Initial Assessment of Performance and Feasibility,\" Ultrasonic Imaging, 2020, 42 (2): 74-91. (SCI,中科院3区,JCR2区)\nB. Peng*\n;\nS. Luo\n; Z. Xu; J. Jiang*; Accelerating 3-D GPU-based Motion Tracking for Ultrasound Strain Elastography Using Sum-Tables: Analysis and Initial Results , Applied Sciences-Basel, 2019, 9(10): 0-1991. (SCI,中科院3区,JCR2区)\nT. Xiang\n, Y. Li, H. Deng,\nB. Peng\net al. \"Teacher-student guided knowledge distillation for unsupervised convolutional neural network-based speckle tracking in ultrasound strain elastography\". Med Biol Eng Comput (2024).\nhttps://doi.org/10.1007/s11517-024-03078-z\n(SCI,中科院4区,JCR2区)\n彭博\n,\n汪强\n，青芮冰，尹立雪，姜劲枫. 基于光线追踪的实时超声模拟与虚拟现实的集成[J]. 系统仿真学报, 2022, 34(11): 2425-2436. (CSCD核心）\nX. Zhang\n, R. Wang, X. Wei, J. Luo and\nB. Peng\n, \"Displacement-based Reconstruction of Elasticity Distribution with Deep Neural Network,\" 2022 IEEE International Ultrasonics Symposium (IUS), Venice, Italy, 2022, pp. 1-5, doi: 10.1109/IUS54386.2022.9958003. (清华大学A类会议)\nH. Zuo\n, J. Zhang, J. Luo, and\nB. Peng\n. \"Phase Constraint Improves Ultrasound Image Quality Reconstructed using Deep Neural Network.\" 2021 IEEE International Ultrasonics Symposium (IUS), pp. 1-4. IEEE, 2021. (清华大学A类会议)\nB. Peng\n,\nY. Xian\nand J. Jiang, \"A Convolution Neural Network-Based Speckle Tracking Method for Ultrasound Elastography,\" 2018 IEEE International Ultrasonics Symposium (IUS), Kobe, Japan, 2018, pp. 206-212, doi: 10.1109/ULTSYM.2018.8580034. (清华大学A类会议)\nY. Deng\n, W. Zhou,\nB. Peng\n, Dong Liang, and Shun’ichi Kaneko. \"Robust Spatial-Temporal Correlation Model for Background Initialization in Severe Scene.\" ICASSP 2021-2021 IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing (ICASSP), pp. 2415-2419. IEEE, 2021. (CCF-B类会议)\nY. Zhao\n, S. Liu, A. Luo and\nB. Peng\n, \"Dual Generative Adversarial Network For Ultrasound Localization Microscopy,\" 2022 IEEE International Conference on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics (SMC), Prague, Czech Republic, 2022, pp. 3125-3130, doi: 10.1109/SMC53654.2022.9945563. (CCF-C类会议)\nS. Wen\n,\nB. Peng\n, H. Jiang, J. Cao, and J. Jiang. \"Augmenting 3D Ultrasound Strain Elastography by combining Bayesian inference with local Polynomial fitting in Region-growing-based Motion Tracking.\" 2021 IEEE International Conference on Image Processing (ICIP), pp. 2963-2967. IEEE, 2021. (CCF-C类会议)\nQ. Wang\n,\nB. Peng\n, Z. Cao, X. Huang and J. Jiang, \"A Real-time Ultrasound Simulator Using Monte-Carlo Path Tracing in Conjunction with Optix Engine,\" 2020 IEEE International Conference on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics (SMC), Toronto, ON, Canada, 2020, pp. 3661-3666, doi: 10.1109/SMC42975.2020.9283057. (CCF-C类会议)\nT. He\n,\nB. Peng\n, P. Chen and J. Jiang, \"Performance Assessment of Motion Tracking Methods in Ultrasound-based Shear Wave Elastography,\" 2020 IEEE International Conference on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics (SMC), Toronto, ON, Canada, 2020, pp. 3643-3648, doi: 10.1109/SMC42975.2020.9283024.(CCF-C类会议)\nB. Peng\n,\nT. Yang\n, T. He and J. Jiang, \"Augmented Region-Growing-Based Motion Tracking Using Bayesian Inference For Quasi-Static Ultrasound Elastography,\" 2020 IEEE International Conference on Image Processing (ICIP), Abu Dhabi, United Arab Emirates, 2020, pp. 2960-2964, doi: 10.1109/ICIP40778.2020.9191296.(CCF-C类会议)\nB. Peng\n,\nX. Huang\n, S. Wang and J. Jiang, \"A Real-Time Medical Ultrasound Simulator Based on a Generative Adversarial Network Model,\" 2019 IEEE International Conference on Image Processing (ICIP), Taipei, Taiwan, 2019, pp. 4629-4633, doi: 10.1109/ICIP.2019.8803570.(CCF-C类会议)\nServices\nReviewer:\nIEEE Transactions on Medical Imaging\nIEEE Transactions on Ultrasonics, Ferroelectrics, and Frequency Control\nPattern Recognition\nMedical Physics\nUltrasonics\nComputational and Mathematical Methods in Medicine\nJournal of Healthcare Engineering\nMedical & Biological Engineering & Computing\nStudents\nTo potential graduate students\n: If you are interested in doing research with me, please drop me an email with your CV.\nGraduated students\nJiajun Cai（graduated in 2025, PhD @重庆大学）\nWenzhao Han（graduated in 2025, PhD @ Nagoya University）\nTianqiang Xiang（graduated in 2025, work @四川银行总行）\nYihong Zhu（graduated in 2025, work @中国空气动力研究与发展中心计算空气动力研究所）\nXiaofeng Li（graduated in 2025, work @绵阳师范学院）\nYuting Zhang（graduated in 2025, work @深圳中科飞测股份有限公司）\nXinyue Zhang（graduated in 2025, work @成都天奥测控技术有限公司）\nZhiyong Chen（graduated in 2025, work @深圳中科飞测科技股份有限公司）\nYuhao Xia（graduated in 2025, work @成都天奥信息科技有限公司）\nXinyu Li（graduated in 2025, co-supervise with Assoc Prof. Shenghua Xie from Sichuan Provincial People's Hospital, work @熊谷加世电器有限公司）\nYaqiong Xiao (graduated in 2024, work @ 中信银行成都软件开发中心)\nYuqi Jiang (graduated in 2024, work @ 西华师范大学网络与信息化管理中心)\nXinyu Li (graduated in 2024, work @ 成都九洲电子信息系统有限公司)\nWeidong Wang (graduated in 2024, work @ 烜翊数智（上海）科技有限公司)\nLizhi Zhang(graduated in 2024, work @ 拜耳医药保健有限公司)\