    "homepage_text": "About Me - Xiaocheng Li\nXiaocheng Li\nImperial College Business School\nLondon, U.K.\nAbout Me\nI am an assistant professor at the analytics and operations group of Imperial College Business School from January 2021.  I received my Ph.D. from Department of Management Science and Engineering at Stanford, advised by Prof. Kay Giesecke, Prof. Markus Pelger, and Prof. Yinyu Ye. Before coming to Stanford, I obtained my B.S. degree from School of Mathematical Sciences at Peking University in 2014.\nMore about my research can be found on my\nresearch page\n.\nEmail:\nxiaochengli.pku at gmail dot com"
