    "homepage_text": "Wei Feng's Homepage\nPersonal Homepage\nPersonal Information\nName：\nFeng Wei\nMail：\nweifeng.ft@foxmail.com\nWork Experiences\n2025~Present：\nNorthwest A&F University;\n2020~2025：\nAssistant Professor, Xi'an Jiaotong University, Xi'an, China;\nEducations\n2010~2014：\nBachelor of Engineering, School of Telecommunication Engineerings, XIdian University, China;\n2014~2020：\nPh. D of Information Security, School of Cyber Engineerings, Xidian University, Xi'an, China;\n2017~2019：\nVisiting Ph. D Student, Aalto University, Espoo, Finland.\nPublications\nFirst-Authored Journal Papers\nAnonymous authentication on trust in pervasive social networking based on group signature\nW Feng\n, Z Yan, H Xie\nIEEE Access\n5, 6236-6246  2017\nLink\nA survey on security, privacy, and trust in mobile crowdsourcing\nW Feng\n, Z Yan, H Zhang, K Zeng, Y Xiao, YT Hou\nIEEE Internet of Things Journal\n5 (4), 2971-2992  2018\nLink\nMCS-Chain: Decentralized and trustworthy mobile crowdsourcing based on blockchain\nW Feng\n, Z Yan\nFuture Generation Computer Systems\n2019\nLink\nBlockchain Based Data Transmission Control for Tactical Data Link\nW Feng\n, Y Li, X Yang, Z Yan, L Chen\nDigital Communications and Networks\n, accepted, 2020\nAnonymous Authentication on Trust in Blockchain-Based Mobile Crowdsourcing\nW Feng\n, Z Yan, LT Yang, QH Zheng\nIEEE Internet of Things Journal\n, accepted, 2020.\nCo-Authored Journal Papers\nAnonymous authentication for trustworthy pervasive social networking\nZ Yan,\nW Feng\n, P Wang\nlink\nIEEE Transactions on Computational Social Systems\n2 (3), 88-98 2015\nA novel scheme of anonymous authentication on trust in Pervasive Social Networking\nZ Yan, P Wang,\nW Feng\nInformation Sciences\n445, 79-96 2018\nEfficient LBS queries with mutual privacy preservation in IoV\nS Liu, A Liu, Z Yan,\nW Feng\nVehicular Communications\n16, 62-71 2019\nPrivacy protection in mobile crowd sensing: a survey\nY Wang, Z Yan,\nW Feng\n, S Liu\nWorld Wide Web\n2