    "homepage_text": "Huan Xiong\n      -  Harbin Institute of Technology\nHarbin Institute of Technology Home\nSearch content at Harbin Institute of Technology\nView Scopus Profile\nHuan Xiong\nProfessor\nSchool of Mathematics\nh-index\n1488\nCitations\n17\nh-index\nCalculated based on number of publications stored in Pure and citations from Scopus\n2016\n2026\nResearch activity per year\nPersonal profile\nExpertise related to UN Sustainable Development Goals\nIn 2015, UN member states agreed to 17 global\nSustainable Development Goals (SDGs)\nto end poverty, protect the planet and ensure prosperity for all. This person’s work contributes towards the following SDG(s):\nSDG 3\nGood Health and Well-being\nSDG 7\nAffordable and Clean Energy\nFingerprint\nDive into the research topics where Huan Xiong is active. These topic labels come from the works of this person. Together they form a unique fingerprint.\n2\nSimilar Profiles\nNeural Network\nComputer Science\n100%\nDifference Operator\nMathematics\n51%\nImage Segmentation\nComputer Science\n44%\nAsymptotic Formula\nMathematics\n44%\nGraph Neural Network\nComputer Science\n41%\nAdversarial Machine Learning\nComputer Science\n33%\nLearning System\nComputer Science\n31%\nStationary Point\nComputer Science\n30%\nView full fingerprint\nCollaborations and top research areas from the last five years\nRecent external collaboration on country/territory level. Dive into details by clicking on the dots or\nSelect a country/territory from the list\nDive into details\nSelect a country/territory to view shared publications and projects\nClose\nSelect a country/territory from the list\nExplore network further\nResearch output\n39\nArticle\n13\nConference contribution\n7\nConference article\n5\nPaper\n3\nMore\n1\nComment/debate\n1\nShort survey\n1\nReview article\nAn efficient algorithm for vertex enumeration of arrangement\nDong, Z., Fan, F.,\nXiong, H.\n& Zeng, T.,\n15 Feb 2026\n,\nIn:\nDiscrete Applied Mathematics.\n380\n,\np. 649-671\n23 p.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nObjective Function\n100%\nHyperplane\n100%\nDesirable Property\n100%\nA self-conjugate partition analog of (t,t+1)-core partitions with distinct parts\nXiong, H.\n& Yang, L.,\nMar 2026\n,\nIn:\nEuropean Journal of Combinatorics.\n133\n, 104322.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nConjugate Partition\n100%\nDescents in the Grand Dyck paths and the Chung-Feller property\nXin, H. &\nXiong, H.\n,\n2026\n,\nIn:\nAustralasian Journal of Combinatorics.\n94\n,\np. 177-194\n18 p.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nFeller's Theorem\n100%\nGeneralized m-Schröder paths and the Chung-Feller property\nXin, H. &\nXiong, H.\n,\n2026\n,\nIn:\nFilomat.\n40\n,\n2\n,\np. 703-719\n17 p.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nLattice Paths\n100%\nVideoExpert: Augmented LLM for Temporal-Sensitive Video Understanding\nZhao, H., Ji, G. P., Yan, R.,\nXiong, H.\n& Li, Z.,\n2026\n, (Accepted/In press)\nIn:\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nLarge Language Model\n100%\nVideo Understanding\n100%\nPattern Languages\n25%\nMultimodal Large Language Models\n25%\nKey Information\n25%\nView all 67 Research outputs"
