    "homepage_text": "Min Lin/\nMin Lin\n:~#\nI am currently a Principal Research Scientist and the Head of Research at the\nSea AI Lab\n.\nMy central research interest is to build\ngeneral learning systems\nthat is capable of learning continuously online once deployed. (no taking it offline, no concept of pretraining, finetuning, epochs or inference, just learn as it interacts with the world.)\n^ The above is hard, I also work on relatively easier ones like:\nAI for Science (Density Functional Theory)\nMachine Learning Systems\n.\nLinks\nGoogle Scholar\n|\nGithub\n|\nLinkedIn\nLatest posts\nOct. 30, 2024\nRichard Sutton talk about continual learning.\nMar. 3, 2024\nPhilosophical bits that I collected over the years for building AI.\nFeb. 23, 2024\nML Systems"
  },
  "deep_homepage::Fan Feng::https://dmcbffeng.github.io/": {
