    "homepage_text": "Fan Feng Personal Website\nFan Feng\nResearch Fellow\nDepartment of Medicine, Vanderbilt University Medical Center\nPh.D. in Bioinformatics, University of Michigan - Ann Arbor\nB.Sc. in Chemical Biology, Peking University\nWelcome! I am Fan Feng, a researcher at Vanderbilt University Medical Center, where I explore the intersection of computational biology, imaging, and machine learning to better understand pancreatic islets and diabetes.\r\n\t\t\t\t\tMy work focuses on extracting meaningful insights from complex multimodal datasets using cutting-edge techniques like multiplexed imaging, spatial analysis, and deep learning.\r\n\t\t\t\t\tBeyond the lab, I am an travel enthusiast and lifelong learner, always curious about new ideas, cultures, and technologies.\r\n\t\t\t\t\tThis site is a space where I share my research, interests, and ongoing journey through science and the world.\nMy Activities\nAbout me →\nFan's Resume\nResearch →\n\"GenomicKB - a knowledge graph for the human genome\"\nResearch →\nExploring pancreatic islets with multiplexed imaging\nTravel →\nUnlocking the world\nResearch →\nCAESAR: predict 3D chromatin structure from epigenomics\nWork →\nHost a workshop at the UN civil society conference\n\n---\n\nActivities | Fan Feng Personal Website\n<\nFan Feng (封凡)\nPh.D. candidate @ University of Michigan\n密歇根大学 博士生\nAlumni @ Peking University\n北京大学 毕业生\n2023\n2022\n2021\nEarlier\nPinned 置顶\nThis page only covers the news about my research work.\n本页只包含和科研工作相关的内容。\n2023\nApr. 2023\nI will give a talk about\nEPCOT\nat the Great Lakes Bioinformatics (GLBIO) conference.\n我将会在GLBIO会议上作报告，主题为\nEPCOT\n。\nApr. 2023\nI will present a poster about\nGenomicKB\nat the Great Lakes Bioinformatics (GLBIO) conference.\n我将会在GLBIO会议上主讲海报，主题为\nGenomicKB\n。\nApr. 2023\nI present the work\nGenomicKB\nat Tools and Technology Seminar in the University of Michigan.\n我在密歇根大学的Tools and Technology Seminar上作了报告，主题为\nGenomicKB\n: a knowledge graph of the human genome。\nJan. 2023\nMy paper\n\"GenomicKB: a knowledge graph for the human genome\"\nis published by Nucleic Acids Research.\n我的第一作者文章\n\"GenomicKB: a knowledge graph for the human genome\"\n被《核酸研究》发表。\n2022\nAug. 2022\nI present the work\n\"Connecting high-resolution 3D chromatin organization with epigenomics\"\nat ISMB 2022 @ Madison, USA.\n我在2022年的ISMB会议上作了报告，主题为\n\"Connecting high-resolution 3D chromatin organization with epigenomics\"\n。\nApr. 2022\nMy paper\n\"Connecting high-resolution 3D chromatin organization with epigenomics\"\nis published by Nature Communications.\n我的第一作者文章\n\"Connecting high-resolution 3D chromatin organization with epigenomics\"\n被《自然-通讯》发表。\n2021\nSep. 2021\nMy paper\n\"3′HS1 CTCF binding site in human β-globin locus regulates fetal hemoglobin expression\"\nis published by Elife.\n我的共同第一作者文章\n\"3′HS1 CTCF binding site in human β-globin locus regulates fetal hemoglobin expression\"\n被《Elife》发表。\nEarlier 更早\nDec. 2019\nI passed the preliminary exam of Department of Computational Medicine and Bioinformatics!\n我通过了DCMB系的博士生资格考试！\n\n---\n\nActivities | Fan Feng Personal Website\n<\nFan Feng (封凡)\nPh.D. candidate @ University of Michigan\n密歇根大学 博士生\nAlumni @ Peking University\n北京大学 毕业生\n2023\n2022\n2021\nEarlier\nPinned 置顶\nThis page only covers the news about my research work.\n本页只包含和科研工作相关的内容。\n2023\nApr. 2023\nI will give a talk about\nEPCOT\nat the Great Lakes Bioinformatics (GLBIO) conference.\n我将会在GLBIO会议上作报告，主题为\nEPCOT\n。\nApr. 2023\nI will present a poster about\nGenomicKB\nat the Great Lakes Bioinformatics (GLBIO) conference.\n我将会在GLBIO会议上主讲海报，主题为\nGenomicKB\n。\nApr. 2023\nI present the work\nGenomicKB\nat Tools and Technology Seminar in the University of Michigan.\n我在密歇根大学的Tools and Technology Seminar上作了报告，主题为\nGenomicKB\n: a knowledge graph of the human genome。\nJan. 2023\nMy paper\n\"GenomicKB: a knowledge graph for the human genome\"\nis published by Nucleic Acids Research.\n我的第一作者文章\n\"GenomicKB: a knowledge graph for the human genome\"\n被《核酸研究》发表。\n2022\nAug. 2022\nI present the work\n\"Connecting high-resolution 3D chromatin organization with epigenomics\"\nat ISMB 2022 @ Madison, USA.\n我在2022年的ISMB会议上作了报告，主题为\n\"Connecting high-resolution 3D chromatin organization with epigenomics\"\n。\nApr. 2022\nMy paper\n\"Connecting high-resolution 3D chromatin organization with epigenomics\"\nis published by Nature Communications.\n我的第一作者文章\n\"Connecting high-resolution 3D chromatin organization with epigenomics\"\n被《自然-通讯》发表。\n2021\nSep. 2021\nMy paper\n\"3′HS1 CTCF binding site in human β-globin locus regulates fetal hemoglobin expression\"\nis published by Elife.\n我的共同第一作者文章\n\"3′HS1 CTCF binding site in human β-globin locus regulates fetal hemoglobin expression\"\n被《Elife》发表。\nEarlier 更早\nDec. 2019\nI passed the preliminary exam of Department of Computational Medicine and Bioinformatics!\n我通过了DCMB系的博士生资格考试！"
  },
