n Liu, Zhixin Shu, Yijun Li, Zhe Lin, Sun-Yuan Kung, Content-Aware GAN Compression, CVPR 2021.\nMulti-Scale Aligned Distillation for Low-Resolution Detection, CVPR 2021.\nKhoi Pham, Kushal Kafle, Zhe Lin, Zhihong Ding, Scott Cohen, Quan Tran, Abhinav Shrivastava, Learning to Predict Visual Attributes in the Wild, CVPR 2021.\nLiqian Ma, Zhe Lin, Connelly Barnes, Alexei Efros, Jingwan Lu, Unselfie: Translating Selfies to Neutral-pose Portraits in the Wild, ECCV 2020.\nShikun Liu, Zhe Lin, Yilin Wang, Jianming Zhang, Edward Johns, Shape Adaptor: A Learnable Resizing Module, ECCV 2020.\nKenan E. Ak, Ning Xu, Zhe Lin, Yilin Wang, Incorporating Reinforced Adversarial Learning in Autoregressive Image Generation, ECCV 2020.\nLu Zhang, Jianming Zhang, Zhe Lin, Radomir Mech, Huchuan Lu, Unsupervised Video Object Segmentation with Joint Hotspot Tracking, ECCV 2020.\nXihui Liu, Zhe Lin, Jianming Zhang, Handong Zhao, Quan Tran, Xiaogang Wang, Hongsheng Li, Open-Edit: Open-Domain Image Manipulation with Open-Vocabulary Instructions, ECCV 2020.\nYu Zeng, Zhe Lin, Jimei Yang, Jianming Zhang, Eli Shechtman, Huchuan Lu, High-Resolution Image Inpainting with Iterative Confidence Feedback and Guided Upsampling, ECCV 2020.\nPing Hu, Fabian Caba Heilbron, Oliver Wang, Zhe Lin, Stan Sclaroff, Federico Perazzi, Temporally Distributed Networks for Fast Video Semantic Segmentation, CVPR 2020.\nChenyun Wu, Zhe Lin, Scott Cohen, Trung Bui, Subhransu Maji, PhraseCut: Language-based Image Segmentation in the Wild, CVPR 2020.\nLijun Wang, Jianming Zhang, Oliver Wang, Zhe Lin, Huchuan Lu, SDC-Depth: Semantic Divide-and-Conquer Network for Monocular Depth Estimation, CVPR 2020.\nKe Xian, Jianming Zhang, Oliver Wang, Long Mai, Zhe Lin, Zhiguo Cao, Structure-Guided Ranking Loss for Single Image Depth Prediction, CVPR 2020.\nZhuowan Li, Quan Tran, Long Mai, Zhe Lin, Alan Yuille, Context-Aware Group Captioning via Self-Attention and Contrastive Features, CVPR 2020.\nZijun Wei, Jianming Zhang, Zhe Lin, Joon-Young Lee, Niranjan Balasubramanian, Minh Hoai, Dimitris Samaras, Learning Visual Emotion Representations from Web Data, CVPR 2020.\nXiaowei Jia, Handong Zhao, Zhe Lin, Ajinkya Kale, Vipin Kumar, Personalized Image Retrieval with Sparse Graph Representation Learning, KDD 2020.\nXuanli He, Quan Hung Tran, Gholamreza Haffari, Walter Chang, Zhe Lin, Trung Bui, Franck Dernoncourt, Nhan Dam, Scene Graph Modification Based on Natural Language Commands, EMNLP 2020.\nJiahui Yu, Zhe Lin, Jimei Yang, Xiaohui Shen, Xin Lu, Thomas Huang, Free-Form Image Inpainting with Gated Convolution, ICCV 2019 (oral).\nJason Kuen, Federico Perazzi, Zhe Lin, Jianming Zhang, Yap-Peng Tan, Scaling Object Detection by Transferring Classification Weights, ICCV 2019 (oral).\nLu Zhang, Zhe Lin, Jianming Zhang, Huchuan Lu, You He, Fast Video Object Segmentation via Dynamic Targeting Network, ICCV 2019.\nYi Zeng, Pingping Zhang, Jianming Zhang, Zhe Lin, Huchuan Lu, Towards High-Resolution Salient Object Detection, ICCV 2019.\nYulun Zhang, Chen Fang, Yilin Wang, Zhaowen Wang, Zhe Lin, Yun Fu, Jimei Yang, Multimodal Style Transfer via Graph Cuts, ICCV 2019.\nXin Ye, Zhe Lin, Joon-Young Lee, Jianming Zhang, Shibin Zheng, Yezhou Yang, GAPLE: Generalizable Approaching Policy LEarning for Robotic Object Searching in Indoor Environment, IROS 2019 and IEEE Robotics and Automation Letters.\nAjinkya Kale, Baldo Faieta, Zhe Lin, Trung Bui, Tracy King, Multi-modal Correlated Tag Propagation For Boosting Image Search Relevance, KDD 2019 DCCL Workshop.\nHao Tan, Franck Dernoncourt, Zhe Lin, Trung Bui, and Mohit Bansal, Modeling Visual Relationships in Language, ACL 2019.\nPranav Aggarwal, Zhe Lin, Baldo Faieta, and Saeid Motiian, Multitask Text-to-Visual Embedding with Titles and Clickthrough Data. Language and Vision Workshop, in conjunction with CVPR 2019.\nSiyuan Qiao, Zhe Lin, Jianming Zhang, and Alan Yuille, Neural Rejuvenation: Improving Deep Network Training by Enhancing Computational Resource Utiliza