    "homepage_text": "Ming-Hsuan Yang's Home Page\nMing-Hsuan Yang\nI work on computer vision and related problems.\nBasic Information\nBrief\n  Biography\nMath Genealogy\nOffice:\nElectrical Engineering and Computer\nScience\nScience and Engineering 2 216\nUniversity of California at Merced\nMerced, CA 95344\nEmail: mhyang at ucmerced dot edu\nPhone: 209-228-4677\nProspective PhD students\nPlease see\nthis\nfor details.\nResearch\nVision and Learning Lab\nJournal\nPapers\nConference\nPapers\nDBLP\nGoogle Scholar\nProfessional Activities\nTeaching\nCourses\nTutorials\nLab Members\nPhD Students\nYu-Ju Tsai\n,\n2022-present (Chancellor's Graduate Fellowship)\nWeijie Lyu\n,\n2023-present\nKuan-Chih Huang\n,\n2023-present\nTiancheng\nShen\n,\n2024-present\nHaobo\nYuan\n,\n2024-present\nHsin-Ying Lee\n,\n2024-present\nFreeman Cheng\n,\n2025-present\nShuo Chen\n,\n2025-present  (Earle\nC. Anthony Fellowship)\nFormer Students/Postdocs\nHsin-Ping Huang\n,\n2020-2025 (Meta Fellowship Finalist). Now with Apple.\nChieh Hubert Lin\n,\n2020-2025 (Snap Fellowship Honorable Mention).\nTiantian Wang\n,\n2018-2025 (Graduate Dean's Dissertation Fellowship).\nLu Qi\n,\n2022-2024\nYi-Wen Chen\n,\n2019-2024 (Fred and Mitzie Ruiz Fellowship and Graduate Dean's\nDissertation Fellowship).\nChun-Han Yao\n,\n2019-2023 (GSOP Fellowship). Now with Stability AI.\nTaihong Xiao\n,\n2018-2023. Now with Google DeepMind.\nXueting Li\n,\nPhD, 2021 (Nvidia Fellowship, Google Fellowship, and EECS Rising\nStars). Now with Nvidia.\nHung-Yu\nTseng\n, PhD, 2021 (Graduate Group Recruitment Fellowship). Now with\nMeta.\nWei-Chih Hung\n, PhD,\n2020. Now with Waymo.\nHsin-Ying\nLee\n, PhD, 2020 (Chancellor's Fellowship). Now with Snap.\nWei-Sheng\n  Lai\n, PhD, 2019 (Snap Fellowship Honorable Mention and Facebook\nFellowship Finalist). Now with Google.\nYijun\n  Li\n, PhD, 2019 (Facebook Fellowship, Adobe\nFellowship, and Snap Fellowship). Now with Adobe.\nSifei\nLiu\n, PhD, 2017 (Baidu Scholarship and EECS Rising Stars). Now with\nNvidia.\nYi-Hsuan\nTsai\n, PhD, 2017 (Graduate\nDean's Dissertation Research Fellowship). Now with Google.\nZhe Hu\n, PhD,\n2015\n(Graduate Dean's Dissertation Research Fellowship). Now with\nApple.\nChih-Yuan\nYang\n, PhD, 2015. Now with Chang Gung University, Taiwan.\nJimei Yang\n,\nPhD, 2015 (Graduate Dean's Dissertation Research\nFellowship). Now with Runway.\nSiddharth Seth\n,\nMS, 2025\nRakesh Jasti\n,\nMS, 2020\nYu-Ding Lu\n,\nMS, 2020\nYu-Ting Chang\n,\nMS, 2020\nNakul Agarwal\n,\nMS, 2019\nHan-Kai Hsu\n,\nMS, 2018\nSimon Safar\n,\nMS, 2014\nZaihong\nShuai\n, MS, 2010\nVisting Students\nJunyi Zhang\n, 2024-2024\nBotao Ye\n, 2023-2023\nXiangyu\n  Xu\n, 2016-2017\nWenqi\nRen\n, 2015-2016\nDong Li\n, 2016-2016\nJinshan\n  Pan\n, 2014-2016\nChao Ma\n, 2013-2015\nYi-Ting\nChen\n, 2014-2015\nRachit Dubey\n,\n2014-2014\nJia-Bin Huang\n, 2009-2009\nFull list\n\n---\n\n��<\u0000p\u0000>\u0000M\u0000i\u0000n\u0000g\u0000-\u0000H\u0000s\u0000u\u0000a\u0000n\u0000 \u0000Y\u0000a\u0000n\u0000g\u0000 \u0000i\u0000s\u0000 \u0000a\u0000 \u0000P\u0000r\u0000o\u0000f\u0000e\u0000s\u0000s\u0000o\u0000r\u0000 \u0000i\u0000n\u0000 \u0000E\u0000l\u0000e\u0000c\u0000t\u0000r\u0000i\u0000c\u0000a\u0000l\u0000 \u0000E\u0000n\u0000g\u0000i\u0000n\u0000e\u0000e\u0000r\u0000i\u0000n\u0000g\u0000 \u0000a\u0000n\u0000d\u0000 \u0000C\u0000o\u0000m\u0000p\u0000u\u0000t\u0000e\u0000r\u0000\n\u0000S\u0000c\u0000i\u0000e\u0000n\u0000c\u0000e\u0000 \u0000a\u0000t\u0000 \u0000U\u0000n\u0000i\u0000v\u0000e\u0000r\u0000s\u0000i\u0000t\u0000y\u0000 \u0000o\u0000f\u0000 \u0000C\u0000a\u0000l\u0000i\u0000f\u0000o\u0000r\u0000n\u0000i\u0000a\u0000,\u0000 \u0000M\u0000e\u0000r\u0000c\u0000e\u0000d\u0000.\u0000 \u0000H\u0000e\u0000 \u0000r\u0000e\u0000c\u0000e\u0000i\u0000v\u0000e\u0000d\u0000 \u0000t\u0000h\u0000e\u0000 \u0000P\u0000h\u0000D\u0000\n\u0000d\u0000e\u0000g\u0000r\u0000e\u0000e\u0000 \u0000i\u0000n\u0000 \u0000c\u0000o\u0000m\u0000p\u0000u\u0000t\u0000e\u0000r\u0000