    "homepage_text": "Qijian ZHANG\n      -  CityUHK Scholars\nCityUHK Scholars Home\nResearcher Login\nLink opens in a new tab\nSearch content at CityUHK Scholars\nDr. Qijian ZHANG, 張琦堅\n(Former)\nh-index\n654\nScopus Citations\n12\nScopus h-index\nCalculated based on number of publications stored in Pure and citations from Scopus\n2020\n2026\nResearch activity per year\nPersonal profile\nAuthor IDs\nORCID iD:\n0000-0003-4723-6136\nGoogle Scholar Profile:\n4NIiTYgAAAAJ\nRelated Links\nPersonal Homepage\nFingerprint\nDive into the research topics where Qijian ZHANG is active. These topic labels come from the works of this person. Together they form a unique fingerprint.\n7\nSimilar Profiles\nPoint Cloud\nComputer Science\n100%\nPerformance Improvement\nComputer Science\n19%\nDeep Learning Method\nComputer Science\n17%\nSalient Object Detection\nComputer Science\n17%\nParameterization Surface\nComputer Science\n17%\nObject Detector\nComputer Science\n13%\nFeature Extraction\nComputer Science\n13%\nImage Geometry\nComputer Science\n12%\nView full fingerprint\nCollaborations from the last five years\nRecent external collaboration based on locations. Dive into details by clicking on the dots or\nSelect a place from the list\nDive into details\nSelect a place to view shared publications and projects\nClose\nSelect a place from the list\nExplore network further\nResearch output\n12\nRGC 21 - Publication in refereed journal\n6\nRGC 32 - Refereed conference paper (with host publication)\nFlexPara: Flexible Neural Surface Parameterization\nZhao, Y.\n,\nZhang, Q.\n,\nHou, J.\n, Xia, J., Wang, W. & He, Y.,\nMar 2026\n,\nIn:\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence.\n48\n,\n3\n,\np. 2772-2789\nResearch output\n:\nJournal Publications and Reviews\n›\nRGC 21 - Publication in refereed journal\n›\npeer-review\nParameterization Surface\n100%\nTopology\n25%\nOptimal Configuration\n25%\nSubnetwork\n25%\nVisual Presentation\n25%\nHuGDiffusion: Generalizable Singl