    "homepage_text": "Xingyi Zhang's Homepage\nJosiah (Xingyi) Zhang\nBuilding 1B, Level 2\nDepartment of Machine Learning\nMohamed bin Zayed University of Artificial Intelligence\nMasdar City, Abu Dhabi, UAE\nEmail\n/\nScholar\n/\nDBLP\n/\nGithub\nBiography\nI am currently a Postdoc Researcher at the\nDepartment of Machine\n                      Learning\n,\nMohamed bin Zayed University of Artificial\n                      Intelligence (MBZUAI)\n, working with\nProf. Le Song\n. I\n                      also work closely with\nHugo (Hui) Li\nat\nGenBio AI\n.\n                      I obtained my Ph.D. at\nthe Department of Systems Engineering\n                      and Engineering Management (SEEM)\n,\nThe Chinese University\n                      of Hong Kong (CUHK)\nin 2024, under the supervion of\nProf. Sibo Wang\n.\n                    Before that, I obtained my B.E. in Computer Science and Technology, B.A. in Japanese from\nDalian University of Technology (DUT)\nin 2019.\nResearch Interests\nI am interested in graph representation learning and AI for Science. More precisely, my research\n                    focuses include:\nSingle-Cell Foundation Model\nGraph Representation Learning\nStructure Design\nAnomaly Detection\nRecommendation\nI am looking for collaboration. Please\nemail me\nif you are\n                  interested :)\nNews\n[Nov 2025] One paper was accepted to AAAI 2026.\n[July 2025] One abstract was accepted to MLCB 2025.\n[June 2025] One paper was accepted to GenBio@ICML 2025.\n[June 2025] One paper was accepted to FM4LS@ICML 2025.\n[May 2025] One paper was accepted to SIGKDD 2025.\n[Mar 2025] Two papers were accepted to GEM@ICLR 2025.\nExperience\nPostdoc Associate\nMBZUAI\nSupervisor:\nProf. Le Song\n2024.12-Present\nResearch Intern\nGenBio AI\n2024.12-Present\nWechat Pay, Wexin Group, Tencent\n2024.8-2024.11\nAI Lab, Technology Engineering Group, Tencent\nMentor:\nDr. Biaobin\n                      Jiang\n2023.12-2024.7\nTencent Rhino-Bird Research Elite Program, Common Data Platform, Interactive Entertainment Group,\n                    Tencent\nMentor:\nDr. Wenqing Lin\n2022.5-2023.1\nPublications & Preprints\n(Authors marked with * contributed equally to the research)\nMultimodal Mixture-of-Experts with Retrieval Augmentation for Protein Active Site Identification\nJiayang Wu\n,\nJiale Zhou\n,\nRubo Wang\n,\nXingyi Zhang\n,\nXun Lin\n,\nTianxu Lv\n,\nLeong Hou U\n,\nYefeng Zheng\n,\nAAAI\n2026 (Oral)\nBenchmarking Foundation Model Representations for Cellular Perturbation Response Prediction\nEuxhen Hasanaj\n,\nElijah Cole\n,\nShahin Mohammadi\n,\nSohan Addagudi\n,\nXingyi Zhang\n,\nLe Song\n,\nEric P. Xing\n,\nGenBio@ICML 2025, FM4LS@ICML 2025, MLCB 2025 (Abstract, Oral)\nBiorxiv\nChi-suqare Spectral Graph Neural Networks for Heterogeneous Graph Anomaly Detection\nXiping Li\n,\nXiangyu Dong\n,\nXingyi Zhang\n,\nKun Xie\n,\nYuanhao Feng\n,\nBo Wang\n,\nGuilin Li\n,\nWuxiong Zeng\n,\nXiujun Shu\n,\nSibo Wang\n,\nSIGKDD\n2025\nPaper\nTowards More Accurate Full-Atom Antibody Co-Design\nJiayang Wu*\n,\nXingyi Zhang\n*,\nXiangyu Dong\n,\nKun Xie\n,\nZiqi Liu\n,\nWensheng Gan\n,\nSibo Wang\n,\nLe Song\nGEM@ICLR 2025\nPaper\nIgSeek: Fast and Accurate Antibody Design via Structure Retrieval\nXingyi Zhang\n,\nKun Xie\n,\nNingqiao Huang\n,\nPeilin Zhao\n,\nWei Liu\n,\nSibo Wang\n,\nKangfei Zhao\n,\nBiaobin Jiang\nGEM@ICLR 2025 (Oral)\nPaper\nSpaceGNN: Multi-Space Graph Neural Network for Node Anomaly Detection with Extremely\n                      Limited Labels\nXiangyu Dong\n,\nXingyi Zhang\n,\nLei Chen\n,\nMingxuan Yuan\n,\nSibo Wang\nICLR 2025\nPaper\n/\nCode\nSmoothGNN: Smoothing-aware GNN for Unsupervised Node Anomaly Detection\nXiangyu Dong\n,\nXingyi Zhang\n,\nYanni Sun\n,\nLei Chen\n,\nMingxuan Yuan\n,\nSibo Wang\nTheWebConf 2025 (Oral)\nPaper\n/\nCode\nRumor Detection on Social Media with Reinforcement Learning-based Key Propagation Graph\n                      Generator\nYusong Zhang*\n,\nKun Xie*\n,\nXingyi Zhang\n,\nXiangyu Dong\n,\nSibo Wang\nTheWebConf 2025\nPaper\nFICOM: An Effective and Scalable Active Learning Framework for GNNs on Semi-supervised\n                      Node Classification\nXingyi Zhang\n*,\nJinchao Huang*\n,\nFangyuan Zhang\n,\nSibo Wang\nVLDBJ 2024\nPaper\nLearning-based Attribute-Augmented Proximity Matrix Factorization for Attributed Network\n                      Embedding\nKun Xie*\n,\nXiangyu Dong*\n,\nYusong Zhang\n,\nXingyi Zhang\n,\nQintian Guo\n,\nSibo Wang\nTKDE 2024\nPaper\nTowards Deeper Understanding of PPR-based Embedding Approaches: A Topological\n                      Perspective\nXingyi Zhang\n,\nZixuan Weng\n,\nSibo Wang\nTheWebConf 2024 (Oral)\nPaper\n/\nCode\nRayleigh Quotient Graph Neural Networks for Graph Anomaly Detection\nXiangyu Dong\n,\nXingyi Zhang\n,\nSibo Wang\nICLR\n2024\nPaper\n/\nCode\nConstrained Social Community Recommendation\nXingyi Zhang\n,\nShuliang Xu\n,\nWenqing Lin\n,\nSibo Wang\nSIGKDD 2023\nPaper\n/\nMedia(Chinese)\nEfficient Tree-SVD for Subset Node Embedding over Large Dynamic Graphs\nXinyu Du\n,\nXingyi Zhang\n,\nSibo Wang\n,\nZengfeng Huang\nSIGMOD 2023\nPaper\n/\nCode\nLearning Based Proximity Matrix Factorization for Node Embedding\nXingyi Zhang\n,\nKun Xie\n,\nSibo Wang\n,\nZengfeng Huang\nSIGKDD 2021\nPaper\n/\nCode\nAcademic Services\nReviewer or subreviewer of\nNeurIPS 2025\nICML 2025\nICLR 2025-2026\nSIGKDD 2021,2023-2026 (SIGKDD 2025 Excellent Reviewer)\nTheWebConf 2021,2024-2026\nICDE 2021,2023-2024\nTKDE 2022-2024\nWSDM 2024-2025\nCIKM 2021-2023\nAAAI 2021,2026\nIJCAI 2023\nDASFAA 2021-2024\nNeurocomputing 2024\nTKDD 2025\nTeaching Assistant of\nENGG1120 Linear Algebra for Engineers 2022-2023, Spring\nFTEC4005 Financial Informatics 2021-2022, Fall\nCSCI2100C Data Structures, 2019-2020, 2020-2021, 2021-2022, Spring\nFTEC4003 Data Mining, 2019-2020, 2020-2021, Fall\nSelected Awards\nStudent Travel Award, SIGKDD, 2023\nRecognition Award of 2022 Tencent Rhino-Bird Research Elite Progr