tion\nDate\nTitle\nYuandong Tian\nMeta\nOct 21, 2024\nTowards a unified framework of Neural and Symbolic Decision Making\nHao Zhang\nUCSD\nSep 27, 2024\nChatbot Arena: Serving and Evaluating LLMs in the Wild\nDanqi Chen\nPrinceton University\nJune 20, 2024\nLess & SimPO\nCorby Rosset\nMicrosoft\nMay 3, 2024\nDirect Nash Optimization: Teaching Language Models to Self-Improve with General Preferences\nGuangxuan Xiao\nMIT\nMar 29, 2024\nStreamLLM & SmoothQuant\nRafael Rafailov\nStanford\nFeb 23, 2024\nDirect Preference Optimization: Your Language Model is Secretly a Reward Model\nTrevor Gale\nStanford/Google\nJan 26, 2024\nMegaBlocks: Efficient Sparse Training with Mixture-of-Experts, Speaker\nXupeng Miao\nCMU\nNov 17, 2023\nSpecInfer: Accelerating Generative LLM Serving with Tree-based Speculative Inference and Token Verification\nTri Dao\nTogether.AI & Princeton Univerisity\nOct 20, 2023\nFlashAttention: Fast and Memory-Efficient Exact Attention with IO-Awareness\nWoosuk Kwon and Zhuohan Li\nUC Berkeley\nSep 22, 2023\nPagedAttention / vLLM\nOpens in a new tab\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on Instagram\nSubscribe to our RSS feed\nShare this page:\nShare on X\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nShare on Reddit\n\n---\n\nShuohang Wang at Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nShuohang Wang\nPrincipal Researcher\nGenAI Invited Talk\nAzure GenAI team (led by Weizhu Chen) organizes LLM talk series to discuss advance on LLM. Please contact Shuohang Wang, shuowa@microsoft.com, if you need more details : ...[truncated]"
