    "homepage_text": "Jiangchao Yao\nJiangchao Yao\nHome\nResearch\nGroup\nPublication\nService\nTeaching\nJoin Us\nHome\nJiangchao Yao\nAssociate Professor\nCooperative Medianet Innovation Center\nShanghai Jiao Tong University, China\nResearch Scientist\nShanghai AI Laboratory, China\nEmail: jiangchao.yao.ml[at]gmail.com\n[\nGoogle Scholar\n] [\nGithub\n]\nNews\nI am looking for Master and PhD candidates in 2027 recruitment,\nand always open for RAs.\nShort Biography\nJiangchao Yao is currently an Associate professor at Cooperative Medianet Innovation Center, Shanghai\n                    Jiao Tong University and a research scientist in Shanghai AI Laboratory. Before taking the faculty job,\n                    he was an algorithm expert in Data Analytics and Intelligence Lab, DAMO Academy, Alibaba Group, and received\n                    the dual PhD degree in Shanghai Jiao Tong University and University of Technology Sydney in 2019. His research mainly focuses on trustworthy\n                    machine learning and reasoning with the applications towards AI4Science. He has more than 100 publications in top-tier conferences and journals (e.g., ICML, NeurIPS, ICLR and TPAMI),\n                    and one monograph about trustworthy machine learning. He is area chairs of ICML, NeurIPS and ICLR, and action editors of Transactions on Machine Learning Research and the journal Neural Networks. He has been selected as a MSRA Startrack Scholar in 2025.\nResearch Interests\nEfficient Foundation Models\nInterdiscipline of Medicine and AI\nGeneralized Imbalanced Learning\nNoise Robust Machine Learning\nJob Experience\nResearch Scientist\n(June, 2022 -- Now)\nShanghai AI Laboratory\nTenure-Track Associate Professor\n(January, 2026 -- Present)\nCooperative Medianet Innovation Center, Shanghai Jiao Tong University\nTenure-Track Assistant Professor\n(April, 2022 -- December, 2025)\nCooperative Medianet Innovation Center, Shanghai Jiao Tong University\nVisiting Scholar\n(May, 2025 -- Aug, 2025)\nMicrosoft Research Asia, Shanghai\nAlgorithm Expert\n(August, 2021 -- March, 2022)\nData Analytics and Intelligence Lab, DAMO Academy, Alibaba Group\nSenior Engineer\n(August, 2019 -- August, 2021)\nData Analytics and Intelligence Lab, DAMO Academy, Alibaba Group\nEducation\nDoctor of Philosophy\n(September, 2019)\nDepartment of Electronic Engineering, Shanghai Jiao Tong University\nSupervised by\nYa Zhang\nDoctor of Philosophy\n(September, 2019)\nFaculty of Engineering and Information Technology, University of Technology Sydney\nSupervised by\nIvor W. Tsang\nBachelor of Engineering\n(June, 2013)\nElite Class, Department of Information Engineering, South China University of Technology"
  },
