    "homepage_text": "Xiaolin Xu\nHome\nGroup\nPapers\nResearch\nSoftware\nTeaching\nService\nXiaolin Xu (徐啸林)\nAssociate Professor\nECE, Northeastern University\nTo prospective students:\nI am seeking highly motivated students with strong research interests in security, privacy-preserving computing, machine learning, computer architecture, FPGA, and IoT. Full financial support will be offered. If you are interested in applying, please review\nthe notes\nand email me with your CV, transcripts, and any other relevant documents.\nWhat's New\n03/2026 One paper accepted for publication in\nFCCM\n’26.\n01/2026 Associate Editor of\nIEEE Transactions on Emerging Topics in Computing\n.\n01/2026 One paper accepted for publication in\nTMLR\n’26.\n11/2025 One paper accepted for publication in\nHOST\n’26.\n10/2025\nNew project supported by Northeast Microelectronic Coalition SCALE Capital Grant Program\n.\n09/2025 Poomrapee joined our group as a visiting undergrad researcher, welcome!\n09/2025 Tengkai joined our group as a PhD student, welcome!\n08/2025\nNew project to advance tiny Vector Symbolic Architectures\n.\n08/2025 One paper accepted for publication in\nRAID\n’25.\n06/2025\nDAC Under-40 Innovators Award\n!\nArchive…\nContact\nEmail:\nOffice: 424 Dana Research Center"
