    "homepage_text": "Xiao-Ming Wu\nXiao-Ming Wu\nXiao-Ming Wu\n伍晓鸣\nPhD Student\nMMLab@NTU\nxiaoming.wu@ntu.edu.sg\n[\nG\no\no\ng\nl\ne\nScholar]\n[GitHub]\nBiography\nI am currently a PhD Student at\nMMLab@NTU\n,\nCollege of Computing and Data Science\nin\nNanyang Technological University, Singapore\n, supervised by Prof.\nChen Change Loy\n.\nI earned my M.Eng. degree in\nSun Yat-sen University\n, advised by Prof.\nWei-Shi Zheng\n, where I develop strong research skills and gain valuable research experience, and also enjoy a wonderful and happy time. Additionally, I was a visiting scholar in\nMacquarie University\nduring my Master‘s time, advised by Prof.\nLongbing Cao\n.\nI obtained my B.Eng. degree in\nShandong University\n. At that time, I had my first attempt on research and cultivated the interest in it, advised by Prof.\nXin-Shun Xu\nand Associate Prof.\nXin Luo\n.\nResearch Interests\nResearch is for curiosity and fun.\nI am interested in\nDeep Learning\n,\nComputer Vision\nand\nEmbodied AI\n.\nNow I am mainly working on\nVision-Language-Action Models (VLA)\n,\nWorld Action Models (WAM)\n, and some related topics, \n        hoping to build general-purpose, language-conditioned\nRobotic Foundation Models\nin the future.\nLoading news...\nPublications\nBelow are my first-author publications or maniscripts.\nNote:\n&\n= equal contribution,\n*\n= corresponding author.\n[Show Full List]\n[Show Selected List]\nLoading Selected Publications...\nLoading Full Publications...\nLoading awards...\nLoading teaching...\nLoading services..."
  },
  "deep_homepage::Chao Dong::https://chaodong.me/": {
