    "homepage_text": "Zhao Song\nSkip to main content\nSearch\nZhao Song\n.,\nAdobe Research\nWebsite\nOpens new tab\nZhao obtained his PhD in 2019 from UT-Austin. From 2019-2021, he was a postdoc at math department at Institute for advanced study. Currently he is a research scientist at Adobe Research.\nProgram Visits\nData Structures and Optimization for Fast Algorithms\n,\nFall 2023\n,\nVisiting Scientist\nFoundations of Data Science\n,\nFall 2018\n,\nVisiting Graduate Student\nlink to homepage\nClose\nlink to homepage\nClose\nSearch"
