    "homepage_text": "Wei Fu, PhD – Wei Fu\nWei Fu, PhD\nUofLprofile\nE-mail\nLinkedIn\nORCID\nGoogle Scholar\nAppointment:\nAssistant professor of health economics in the\nDepartment of Health Management and Systems Sciences\n, University of Louisville (UofL).\nEducation:\nPh.D. in Economics from\nLehigh University\nin 2020.\nPost-Doc trainings:\nPerelman School of Medicine\nat the University of Pennsylvania.\nResearch Field:\nHealth Economics, Applied Microeconometrics.\nYou can find my recent\nCV\nand\nPapers\nhere.\nRecent News\n[09/19/2025]    I will attend the Southeast Health Economics Study Group at UNC Chapel Hill.\n[08/19/2025]    I will attend the Econometric Society World Congress Meeting 2025 in Seoul, Korea.\n[06/20/2025]    I will attend the Western Economic Association International the 100th annual conference in San Francisco\n[03/21/2025]    I will attend the China Economist Society North American Annual Meeting in the University of Michigan.\nNo matching items"
