    "homepage_text": "Zheng Wang's Homepage\nZheng Wang (王正)\nProfessor, National Engineering Research Center for Multimedia Software, School of Computer Science, Wuhan University\nDirector, Computer Experimental Teaching Centre, School of Computer Science, Wuhan University\nRoom South-602, Undergraduate School Building, Wuhan University, Wuhan 430072, China\nwangzwhu(at)whu.edu.cn; wangzwhu(at)gmail.com\nIn 2017, I received my Ph.D. from the\nNational Engineering Research Center for Multimedia Software (国家多媒体软件工程技术研究中心)\n,\nWuhan University (武汉大学)\n. \n    From 2017 to 2020, I worked as a JST CREST Project Researcher (特任研究員) and JSPS Fellowship Researcher (日本学術振興会外国人特別研究員) at the\nNational Institute of Informatics (国立情報学研究所)\n, Japan, under the guidance of\nShin'ichi Satoh\n. \n    From 2020 to 2021, I served as an Assistant Professor at\nThe University of Tokyo (東京大学)\n, where I collaborated with\nToshihiko Yamasaki\nand\nKiyoharu Aizawa\n.\n    I have also participated in several international research visits, including:\nA*STAR\n, Singapore, in 2023, working with\nHongyuan Zhu\nand\nOng Yew Soon\n;\nNExT++, National University of Singapore (NUS)\nin 2024, collaborating with\nTat-Seng Chua\n; and\nNAII, NUS\n, in 2025, working with\nMohan Kankanhalli\n.\nAIM Lab\n|\nMy Group\n|\nResearch Topics\n|\nDatasets/Codes\n|\nGoogle scholar\n|\nDBLP\n|\nBio (Chinese)\nSelected Publications\n(\nGoogle scholar\n)\nMultimedia Content Analysis\nUnified Category and Style Generalization for Instance-Level Sketch Retrieval\n, \n\t\tZ Hu, Z Yang, H Li, Y Zou, F Zhu,\nZ Wang*\n,\nSIGIR\n, 2025\nSubjective Camera: Bridging Human Cognition and Visual Reconstruction through Sequence-Aware Sketch-Guided Diffusion\n, \n\t\tH Chen, D Sun, C Ma, S Wang, K Zhang,\nZ Wang*\n, Z Wang,\nICCV\n, 2025\nYou Think, You ACT: The New Task of Arbitrary Text to Motion Generation\n, \n\t\tR Wang, C Ma, G Li, H Xu, Y Li,\nZ Wang*\n,\nICCV\n, 2025\nCycMuNet+: Cycle-Projected Mutual Learning for Spatial-Temporal Video Super-Resolution\n, \n\t\tM Hu, K Jiang,\nZ Wang*\n, X Bai, R Hu,\nIEEE TPAMI\n, 2023\nBoth Style and Fog Matter: Cumulative Domain Adaptation for Semantic Foggy Scene Understanding\n, \n \t\tX Ma, Z Wang, Y Zhan, Y Zheng,\nZ Wang*\n, D Dai, CW Lin,\nCVPR\n, 2022\nHumanNeRF-SE: A Simple yet Effective Approach to Animate HumanNeRF with Diverse Poses\n, \n \t\tC Ma, YL Liu, Z Wang, W Liu, X Liu,\nZ Wang*\n,\nCVPR\n, 2024\nGood Is Bad: Causality Inspired Cloth-Debiasing for Cloth-Changing Person Re-Identification\n, \n \t\tZ Yang, M Lin, X Zhong, Y Wu,\nZ Wang*\n,\nCVPR\n, 2023\nBeyond Domain Gap: Exploiting Subjectivity in Sketch-Based Person Retrieval\n, \n \t\tK Lin, Z Wang,\nZ Wang*\n, Y Zheng, S Satoh,\nACM MM\n, 2023\nAdversarial Attack\nProjAttacker: A Configurable Physical Adversarial Attack for Face Recognition via Projector\n, \n \t\tY Liu, H Wei, C Jia, R Xiao, W Ruan, X Wei, JT Zhou,\nZ Wang*\n,\nCVPR\n, 2025\nFAB-Attack: Fabric-Aware Adversarial Attacks on Person Detectors under Motion Blur\n, \n \t\tJ Hou, K Zhang, T Yang, C Jia, Q Lin, H Wei,\nZ Wang*\n,\nACM MM\n, 2025\nPhysical Adversarial Attack Meets Computer Vision: A Decade Survey\n, \n \t\tHui Wei, H Tang, X Jia, Z Wang, H Yu, Z Li, S Satoh, LV Gool,\nZ Wang*\n,\nIEEE TPAMI\n, 2024\nRevisiting Adversarial Patches for Designing Camera-Agnostic Attacks against Person Detection\n, \n \t\tH Wei, Z Wang, K Zhang, J Hou, Y Liu, H Tang,\nZ Wang*\n,\nNeurIPS\n, 2024\nHOTCOLD Block: Fooling Thermal Infrared Detectors with a Novel Wearable Design\n, \n\t\t H Wei, Z Wang, X Jia, Y Zheng, H Tang, S Satoh,\nZ Wang*\n,\nAAAI\n, 2023\nHidden Discovery\nBeyond the Individual: Introducing Group Intention Forecasting with SHOT Dataset\n, \n \t\tR Zhang, Y Wang, X Hu, C Mai, W Liu, D Xu, X Zhong,\nZ Wang*\n,\nACM MM\n, 2025\nSegTraj: A Segmented-Trajectory-Aware Spatio-Temporal Graph Convolutional Network for Social Group Detection\n, \n \t\tX Dang, W Liu, X Zhong,\nZ Wang*\n,\nACM MM\n, 2025\nSPAN: Continuous Modeling of Suspicion Progression for Temporal Intention Localization\n, \n \t\tX Hu, Y Wang, R Zhang, Y Li, W Liu,\nZ Wang*\n,\nACM MM\n, 2025\nPredicting the Unseen: A Novel Dataset for Hidden Intention Localization in Pre-abnormal Analysis\n, \n \t\tZ Qi, R Zhang, X Hu, W Liu,\nZ Wang*\n,\nACM MM\n, 2024\nUncovering the Unseen: Discover Hidden Intentions by Micro-Behavior Graph Reasoning\n, \n \t\tZ Zhou, W Liu, D Xu,\nZ Wang*\n, J Zhao,\nACM MM\n, 2023\nGaze- and Spacing-flow Unveil Intentions: Hidden Follower Discovery\n, \n \t\tD Xu, R Hu,\nZ Wang\n, L Luo, D Li, W Zeng,\nACM MM\n, 2022\nProfessional Services\nIEEE Circuits and Systems Society (CAS) Multimedia Systems and Applications Technical Committee (MSA TC) Member\nAssociate Editor:\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision (2025-)\nIEEE Transactions on Image Processing (2024-)\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia (2025-)\nAutonomous Intelligent Systems (2021-)\nSN Computer Science (2021-)\ncomputers (2025-)\nGuest Editor:\nApplied Sciences\nSpecial Issue\nRecent Advances in Image Processing\nElectronics\nSpecial Issue\nMultimedia Content Analysis, Management and Retrieval: Trends and Challenges\nPattern Recognition Letters\nSpecial Issue\nRecent Advances in Deep Learning Model Security\nEntropy\nSpecial Issue\nAdvances in Image Fusion\nWorkshops, Tutorials, and Special sessions:\nICCV 2025 Workshop on Responsible Imaging\nACM MM 2024 Workshop on Multi-modal Misinformation Governance in the Era of Foundation Models\nACM MM 2022 Tutorial on Multimedia Content Understanding in Harsh Environments\nACM MM 2020 Tutorial on Effective and Efficient: Toward Open-world Instance Re-identification\nCVPR 2023 Workshop on The 3rd Anti-UAV Workshop & Challenge\nCVPR 2020 Tutorial on Image Retrieval in the Wild\nIEEE ICME 2025 Special Session on AI4IT: Multimodal Content Analysis, Understanding, and Generation for Intelligent Transportation\nIEEE ICME 2023 Workshop on Seeing Through the Rain (STRAIN): Vision Task Challenges in Real-World Rain Scenes\nIEEE ICME 2021 Special Session on Knowledge-Driven Multi-modal Deep Analysis for Multimedia\nIEEE ICME 2020 Special Session on Graph Neural Networks for Multimedia Representation Learning\nACM ICMR 2024 Workshop on Multimedia Object Re-ID: Advancements, Challenges, and Opportunities\nACM ICMR 2020 Special Session on Human-Centric Cross-modal Retrieval\nFG 2024 Workshop & Challenge SkatingVerse\nICIP 2024 Workshop on AI4IPoT: AI for Image Processing Applications on Traffic: Advancements, Challenges, and Opportunities\nIEEE MIPR 2021 Tutorial on Human-centric Media Understanding: Processing, Generation, Re-identification, and Prediction\nIEEE MIPR 2021 Workshop on Cross Modal Person Reidentification\nArea Chair/SPC: ACM MM 2023/2024/2025, AAAI 2022/2024/2025, IJCAI 2025, ICME 2020/2021\nAwards\n2023, ACM Wuhan Rising Star Award | ACM武汉新星奖\n2020, MEXT Leading Initiative for Excellent Young Researcher (LEADER) | 日本文部科学省卓越研究員\n2019, The Best Young Scholar, Association of Chinese Alumni In Japan | 最優秀青年学者者賞（情報通信部門）\n2018, CSIG Doctoral Dissertation Nomination Award, China Society of Image and Graphics (CSIG) | 中国图象图形学学会优秀博士学位论文提名奖\n2017, ACM Wuhan Doctoral Dissertation Award, Association for Computing Machinery | ACM武汉分会优秀博士论文奖\n2014, Best Paper Award, Pacific-Rim Conference on Multimedia (PCM)\n--------------------------------------------\nLast modified: Nov. 6, 2025.\nZheng Wang"
