oster presentation at Theory and Practice of Differential Privacy (\nTPDP 2018\n)\nCode available\nhere\nImproved Bounds on Minimax Risk of Estimating Missing Mass\n[A] Jayadev Acharya, Yelun Bao, Yuheng Kang, Ziteng Sun\nTalk presentation at\nISIT 2018\n(\nTPC choice session\n, 4% of all submissions)\nTeaching\nECE 4950 (Spring 2019)\n: Machine Learning and Pattern Recognition  (Teaching assistant)\nECE 4200 (Spring 2020)\n: Fundamentals of Machine Learning (Teaching assistant)\nReviewing Service\nConference area chair\n: ICLR, NeurIPS; ALT; ACL;\nConference reviewer\n: ICML; NeurIPS; ICLR; FOCS; COLT; ISIT; ITCS;\nJournal reviewer\n: TIT; TPAMI; JSAIT; JMLR;\nPage generated 2025-11-10 19:16:13 MST, by\njemdoc+MathJax\n."
