torial work (RGC: 61)\n›\nRGC 61 - Journal editor\nACM Transactions on Cyber-Physical Systems (Journal)\nXUE, C. J.\n(Associate Editor)\n2019\n→\n2020\nActivity\n:\nPublication peer-review and editorial work (RGC: 61)\n›\nRGC 61 - Journal editor\nACM Transactions on Embedded Computing Systems (Journal)\nXUE, C. J.\n(Associate Editor)\n2019\n→\n2020\nActivity\n:\nPublication peer-review and editorial work (RGC: 61)\n›\nRGC 61 - Journal editor\nView all 15 activities\nSupervised Students\nJiaxing HAN, 韓嘉興\nDepartment of Computer Science\nPerson:\nDoctor of Philosophy (Student)\nMr. Haibo HU, 胡海波\nDepartment of Computer Science\nPerson:\nDoctor of Philosophy (Student)\nAutonomous Driving\n100%\nSequential Mode\n40%\nPostprocessing\n40%\nMultimodality\n40%\nPhysical Attack\n40%\nJiacheng HUANG\nDepartment of Computer Science\nPerson:\nDoctor of Philosophy (Student)\nParticipatory Design\n100%\nMobile Device\n100%\nGraph Analytics\n100%\nPersistent Memory\n100%\nExperimental Result\n58%\nMiss Lianming HUANG, 黃戀茗\nDepartment of Computer Science\nPerson:\nDoctor of Philosophy (Student)\nYun HUANG, 黃藴\nDepartment of Computer Science\nPerson:\nDoctor of Philosophy (Student)\nInput/Output\n100%\nData Processing\n40%\nSingle Application\n40%\ndata-intensive application\n40%\nPower Efficiency\n40%\nView all 11 researchers"
