    "homepage_text": "About me | Allan Zhou\nAbout me\nI am a research scientist at OpenAI. I was previously at Google DeepMind working on humanoid robotics and world modeling.\nI completed my PhD at Stanford, advised by\nChelsea Finn\n. There, my core research focused on geometric deep learning and nested optimization. I obtained my BS at UC Berkeley, advised by\nAnca Dragan\n.\n\n---\n\nAbout me | Allan Zhou\nAbout me\nI am a research scientist at OpenAI. I was previously at Google DeepMind working on humanoid robotics and world modeling.\nI completed my PhD at Stanford, advised by\nChelsea Finn\n. There, my core research focused on geometric deep learning and nested optimization. I obtained my BS at UC Berkeley, advised by\nAnca Dragan\n."
  },
  "deep_homepage::Yueze Wang::https://yuezewang.github.io/": {
    "homepage": "https://yuezewang.github.io/",
    "all_emails": [],
