    "homepage_text": "黄凯奇-中国科学院大学-UCAS\n[中文]\n[English]\nHonors & Distinctions\nPublications\nResearch Interests\nResearch Grants\nStudents\nResearch Areas\nAcademy Activities\nGeneral\nDr. Huang received his BSc and MSc from Nanjing University of Science Technology, China and obtained his PhD degree from Southeast University. He has worked in National Lab. of Pattern Recognition (NLPR), Institute of Automation, Chinese Academy of Science (CASIA), China since 2004, and he has been an  full professor in NLPR from 2011. He is IEEE Senior member and deputy general secretary of IEEE Beijing Section (2006-2008). Dr. Huang has initiated, set direction and managed successfully many leading-edge research projects, including National Science Foundation of China, National High Technology Research and Development Program(\"863\"Program) of China, and many International collaborative projects. He serves as over forty technique program committee members of international conference. Since 2007, Dr. Huang has been a regular independent expert evaluator and reviewer for National Science Foundation of China (NSFC)) on research grant application and project progress appraisal; he is an executive team member of IEEE SMC Cognitive Computing Committee as well as Associate Editor of IEEE Trans on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics: Systems (TSMC), Pattern Recognition(PR), International Journal of image and graphics (IJIG) and many Guest Editors of journals such as TSMC, Signal Processing, PRL and so on. He has obtained many awards such as CCF&IEEE CS Young Conputer Scientist Award(2016), The Ten Outstanding Young  Scientist of Chinese Academy of Science (2017), The ImageNet Chanllege First Prize in image object localization  task (additional data) (2014), the PASCAL VOC First Prize in Object Detection Task (2010,2011)，\nSecond Prize of National Science and Technology Progress Award\nin 2010. His current research interests include visual surveillance、image understanding, pattern recognition and biological based vision and son on. He has published over 200 papers in the important international journals and conference such as IEEE TIPAMI, T-IP, T-SMC-B, TCSVT, Pattern Recognition (PR), Computer Vision and Image Understanding (CVIU), ICCV, ECCV, CVPR, ICIP, ICPR.\nExperience\nWork Experience\nVisiting Professor  2015-2016,          Oxford University, Department of Science and Engineering\nProfessor Oct. 2011-Present         National Lab. of Pattern Recognition (NLPR), Institute of Automation, Chinese Academy of Science (CASIA),China\nAsso.Prof. Dec. 2005-Oct. 2011      NLPR,CASIA,China\nPostdoc. Mar.2004-Dec.2005          NLPR,CASIA,China\nTeaching Experience\nVideo Processing and Analysis 2016\nVideo Processing and Analysis 2017\nVideo Processing and Analysis 2018\nVideo Processing and Analysis 2019\nVideo Processing and Analysis 2020\nVideo Processing and Analysis 2021\nHonors & Distinctions\nAwards\n1. Beijing Science & Technology Star Award,2008\n2. The 12th China Patent Award (Outstanding Patent – Visual Surveillance), 2010.\n3. Winner in Object Detection, PASCAL VOC 2010.\n4. National Science and Technology Progress Award (Image Understanding for Visual Surveillance), 2011.\n5. Best Student Paper Award (with X. Zhao et al), Asian Conference on Pattern Recognition, 2011.\n6. Winner in Object Detection, PASCAL VOC 2011.\n7. The Elsevier Best Paper Award (with X. Chen et al), Chinese Conference on Pattern Recognition, 2012.\n8. the Excellent Young Scholars Award of National Science Foundation of China (NSFC)，2013\n9. The first outstanding members of Youth Innovation Promotion Association, CAS,2013\n10.Winner in Object Classification task in ImageNet-ILSVRC (additional data),2014\n11.The National Youth Talent Support Program，2015\n12.CCF&IEEE CS Young Conputer Scientist Award, 2016\n13.The Ten Outstanding Young  Scientist Award of Chinese Academy of Science, 2017\n14. Excellent Doctoral Dissertation Award nomination\n，\nChina Society of Image and Graphics\n，\n2018\n15. Second Prize of China Society of Image and Graphics\n，\n2021\nPublications\nPapers\nSome Journal papers\n[1]K.Huang,J Xin,J.Zhang,et al.,\" Intelligent Techonogies of Human-Computer Gaming\", SCIENTIA SINICA Information, 2020,Vol.4,No.50,Pp:540-550\n[2]K.Huang,XT. Chen,Y.Kang,T.Tan,\" Intelligent Visual surveillance:A review\" Chnese Journal of Computers, 2014,Vol.37,No.49, 2015\n[3] K. Huang, C. Wang, D. Tao,\"High-Order Topology Modeling of Visual Words for Image Classification\". IEEE Trans. Image Processing (TIP) 24(11): 3598-3608, 2015\n[4]Kaiqi Huang,Weiqiang.Ren,Tieniu.Tan,\"A Review on Image Object Detection and Classification,\" Chnese Journal of Computers, 37(6),1-18,.2014\n[5]K.Huang,T.Tan,\"Review on Computational Model for Vision\",Pattern Recognition and Artificial Intelligence, 26(10), pp,951-958,2013\n[6] K. Huang, Y.Zhang, T.Tan, \"A Discriminative Model of Motion and Cross Ratio for View-invariant Action Recognition\", IEEE Transactions on Image Processing (TIP), 21(5):2187-2197, 2012\n[7] K. Huang, D.Tao, X.Li, T.Tan,\"Biologically Inspired Features for Scene Classification in Video Surveillance\", IEEE Transactions on Systems, Man and Cybernetics, Part: B. (T-SMC-B), 41(1), pp: 307-313, Feb. 2011.\n[8] K. Huang, D.Tao, X.Li, T.Tan. &ldquo;View Independent Human Behavior Analysis&rdquo;, IEEE Transactions on Systems, Man and Cybernetics, Part: B. (T-SMC-B), vol. 39, no. 4, pp: 1028-1035, August 2009.\n[9] K. Huang, S. Wang, T. Tan, S.J.Maybank,\"Human Behavior Analysis Based on a New Motion Descriptor\", IEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology (T-CSVT).vol.19, no.2, pp:1830-1840, 2009\n[10] K. Huang, L.Wang, T.Tan, S.J.Maybank,\"A Real-time Detecting Tracking Distant Objects System for Night Surveillance\", Pattern Recognition (PR), Volume 41, Issue 1, pp: 432-444, 2008\n(video\n挑战的夜间视频\n)\n[11] K. Huang, T. Tan, \"Vs-Star: a Visual Interpretation System for Visual Surveillance\", Pattern Recognition Letters (PRL), V. 31, Issue 14(15), Pp: 2265-2285, 2010\n[12] K. Huang, Q.Wang, Z.Wu.\"Natural Color Image Enhancement Evaluation Algorithm based on Human Visual System\", Computer Vision and Image Understanding (CVIU), 103, pp: 52-63, 2006.\n[13] K. Huang, Q.Wang, Z.Wu,\"Color Image Denoising with Wavelet Thresholding based on Human Visual System Model\", Signal Processing: Image Communication(SP:IC), Vol. 20 ( 2). pp: 115-127, 2005.\n[14] K. Huang, Q.Wang, Z.Wu,\"Image Enhancement based on the Statistics of Visual Representation\", Image and Vision Computing (IVC), V23, pp:51-57,2005.\n[15]\nL Huang, X Zhao,\nK Huang\n, ”GOT-10k: A Large High-Diversity Benchmark for Generic Object Tracking in the Wild”, IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (TPAMI), 43(5), 1562-1577, 2021\n[16]\nLi Y, J Zhang,\nK Huang,\n“Mixed Supervised Object Detection with Robust Objectness Transfer”, IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (TPAMI), 41(3), 639-653, 2019\n[17] W. Ren,\nK. Huang\n, D. Tao, T. Tan\"Weakly Supervised Large Scale Object Localization with Multiple Instance Learning and Bag Splitting.\" IEEE Trans. Pattern Anal. Mach. Intell (TPAMI). 38(2): 405-416, 2016\n[18] C.Wang,\nK.Huang\n,\" How to use Bag-of -Word model better for Image Classfication\", Image and Vision Computing (IVC), V.38. Pages,65-74,2015\n[19] Y. Cheng, X. Zhao,\nK.Huang\n, T. Tan, \"Semi-supervised learning and feature evaluation for RGBD object recognition\",Computer Vision and Image Understanding(CVIU), Volume 139, October, Pages 149-160,2015\n[20] C. Wang,\nK. Huang\n, W. Ren, J. Zhang, S. Maybank, &ldquo\"Large-Scale Weakly Supervised Object Localization via Latent Category Learning.&ldquo\" IEEE Trans. Image Processing(TIP) 24(4): 1371-1385, 2015\n[21] Z. Zhang, T. Tan,\nK. Huang\n, \"An Extended Grammar System for Learning and Recognizing Complex Visual Events\", IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (T-PAMI), V.33 (2),Pp: 240-255,2011.\n[22] Z. Liu,\nK. Huang\n, T.Tan, \"Cast Shadow Removal Using MRF Based on Hierarchical Information\", IEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology (T-CSVT), 22(1),pp,56-66,2012\nSome Conference papers\n[1] Kangwei Liu, Junge Zhang, Peipei Yang,\nKaiqi Huang\n,\"GRSA: Generalized Range Swap Algorithm for the Efficient Optimization of MRFs\", The IEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2015, pp. 1761-1769\n[2] Yanhua Cheng, Rui Cai, Zhiwei Li, Xin Zhao,\nKaiqi Huang\n, Yong Rui,\"Query Adaptive Similarity Measure for RGB-D Object Recognition\",The IEEEE International Conference on Computer Vision(ICCV), 2015.\n[3] Lianrui Fu, Junge Zhang,\nKaiqi Huang\n,\"Beyond Tree Structure Models： A New Occlusion Aware Graphical Model for Human Pose Estimation\",The IEEEE International Conference on Computer Vision(ICCV), 2015.\n[4]Kangwei Liu, Junge Zhang,\nKaiqi Huang\nand Tieniu Tan, “Deformable Object Matching via Deformation Decomposition based 2D Label MRF”, In IEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR) 2014.\n[5]Chong Wang, Weiqiang Ren,\nKaiqi Huan\ng, Tieniu Tan, \"Weakly Supervised Object Localization with Latent Category Learning,\",ECCV 2014.\n[6] C. Wang, J. Zhang, P. Yang, and\nK. Huang\n, “Robust Object Recognition via Visual Pathway Feedback,” ICPR, 2014（Oral）\n[7] Weihua Chen,Lijun Cao,Xiaotang Cheng, Kaiqi Huang,\" A novel solution for multi-camera object tracking\", ICIP2014,\n(muit-camera tracking database: http://mct.idealtest.org/.)\n[8] Xiaotang Chen, Kaiqi Huang, Tieniu Tan,\" Learning the Three Factors of A Non-Overlapping Multi-Camera Network Topology\",Chinese Conference on Pattern Recognition(CCPR),2012, (\nElsevier Best Paper Awards\n)\n[9]Y.Huang, Kaiqi Huang, T.Tan,\n“\nSalient Coding for Image Classification\n”\n, IEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2011\n，\n[10] J.Zhang, Kaiqi Huang, T.Tan,\n“\nBoosted Local Structured HOG-LBP for Object Localization\n”\n, IEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2011\n，\n[11] Y.Huang, Kaiqi Huang, T.Tan,\n“\nExploring Relations of Visual Codes for Image Classification\n“\n, IEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2011\n，\n[12] X.Zhao,J.Ding,Kaiqi Huang,T.Tan,\"Global and Local Traning for Moving Object Classification in Surceillance Oriented Scene.\",The First Asian Conference on Pattern Recognition (ACPR2011),Nov.2011(\nThe IAPR Best Student Paer Award)\n[13]Min Li, Wei Chen, Kaiqi Huang, Tieniu Tan,\n“\nVisual Tracking via Incremental Self-tuning Particle Filtering on the Affine Group,\n“\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2010.\n[14] Zhang Zhang, Kaiqi Huang, T.Tan. \"Multi-Thread Parsing for Recognizing Complex Events in Videos\", Proc. of the 10th European Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV), 2008\n[15] Yongzhen Huang, Kaiqi Huang, T.Tan. \"Enhanced Biologically Inspired Model\", IEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2008.\n[16] Zhaoxiang Zhang, Min li, Kaiqi Huang, T.Tan. \"Practical Camera Auto-Calibration based on Object Appearance and Motion for Traffic Scene Visual Surveillance \", IEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2008.\n[17]Kaiqi Huang, Ls. Wang, Tieniu Tan\n，\n\"Detecting and Tracking Distant Objects at Night Based on Human Visual System\", the 7th Asian Conference on Computer Vision (ACCV), 822-832. 2006.\n[18]Kaiqi Huang, Qiao Wang, Zhen-yang Wu, \"Color image enhancement and evaluation algorithm based on human visual system\", IEEE Proceedings of the International Conference of Speech, Acoustics, Signal Processing (ICASSP), III:721-724, 2004. (Selected among top 15% papers in Image and Video Coding and Quality category, and received an invitation to submit to IEEE Signal Processing Society journals. (Acceptance rate: 15%*50% = 7.5%)\nPatents\nObtain Over 20 Patents (Inlcuding Chinese and US patent)\nResearch Interests\nVisual analysis, Object Recognition, Multi-camera Tracking, Behavior Analysis\nResearch Grants\n2013-2016  National Science Foundation of China (NSFC) for the Excellent Young Scholars (PI)\n2012-2015 \"Object Recognition based on Topological Cognition Theory\", NSFC(PI)\n2012-2017 \"Multi Camera Tracking for Wild Area\", the National Basic Research Program of China (973 Program)(PI)\n2010-2011 \"Video Analysis for Smart Home\", schroet kommando (SK Corporation), Korea (PI)\n2010-2012 \"Cognitive Mechanism for Object Recognition\", Tsinghua University (PI)\n2008-2011 \"Video Object Recognition based on Visual Perception\", NSFC(PI)\n2008-2009 \"Multi-features fusion for Image Matching and Tracking in Augmented Reality\", the National High Technology Research and Development Program(863)(PI)\n2007-2008 \"Abnormal Behavior Analysis in Video\", Grant from Samsung Corporation, Korea (PI)\n2006-2008 \"Object Detection and Tracking for Night Surveillance Scene\", NSFC (PI)\nStudents\n已指导学生\n陈伟  硕士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n张叶银  硕士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n郑帅  硕士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n高从文  硕士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n吴金晨  硕士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n饶超  硕士研究生  081280-软件工程\n梁宏雨  硕士研究生  430112-计算机技术\n任伟强  博士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n单言虎  博士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n曹黎俊  博士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n王冲  博士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n徐冉  硕士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n付连锐  博士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n刘康伟  博士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n赵炜琪  硕士研究生  085211-计算机技术\n黄文振  硕士研究生  085211-计算机技术\n陈威华  博士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n考月英  博士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n程衍华  博士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n李乔哲  博士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n李党伟  博士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n李德榜  博士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n王裕沛  博士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n李岩  博士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n武慧凯  博士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n黄厚景  博士研究生  081104-模式识别与智能系统\n徐沛  博士研究生  081203-计算机应用技术\n贾健  博士研究生  081203-计算机应用技术\n李梓豪  硕士研究生  085211-计算机技术\n武琪  硕士研究生  085211-计算机技术\n黄文振  博士研究生  081203-计算机应用技术\n刘美月  硕士研究生  085211-计算机技术\n尹志雨  硕士研究生  085211-计算机技术\n胡世宇  博士研究生  081203-计算机应用技术\n马略  硕士研究生  085211-计算机技术