    "homepage_text": "Dr. Fan Yang's hompage\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nDr. Fan Yang's hompage\nWelcome\nI am an assistant professor at\nDepartment of Philosophy and Religious Studies\n,\nUtrecht University\n, The Netherlands\n.\nMy research interests include: theory and applications of\nlogics of dependence and independence\n, intuitionistic logic, etc.\nPrevious positions:\nSeptember 2020 - November 2022, Academy Research Fellow at\nDepartment of Mathematics and Statistics\n,\nUniversity of Helsinki\n, Finland\nDecember 2017 - August 2020, postdoc researcher at\nDepartment of Mathematics and Statistics\n,\nUniversity of Helsinki\n, Finland\nOctober 2015 - November 2017, postdoc researcher at Delft Applied Logic Group,\nDelft University of Technology\n, The Netherlands\nOctober 2014 - September 2015, postdoc researcher at\nDepartment of Philosophy and Religious Studies\n,\nUtrecht University\n, The Netherlands.\nDegrees:\nDoctor of Philosophy\n,\nDepartment of Mathematics and Statistics\n,\nUniversity of Helsinki\n, Finland, 2014 (supervised by Prof.\nJouko Väänänen\n)\nPhD thesis:\nOn Extensions and Variants of Dependence Logic\nMaster of Science\n,\nInstitute for Logic, Language and Computation\n,\nUniversity of Amsterdam\n, The Netherlands, 2008 (supervised by Prof.\nDick de Jongh\n)\nBachelor of Philosophy\n,\nDepartment of Philosophy\n,\nSun Yat-sen University\n, China, 2005\nCONTACT INFORMATION\nEmail\n:\nfan.yang.c (at) gmail.com\n(or f.yang (at) uu.nl,\nfor\nteaching\nor UU related emails)\nMailing Address\n:\nJanskerkhof 13\n3512 BL Utrecht\nThe Netherlands\nVisiting Address\n:\nRoom\n1.09,\nJanskerkhof 13\n, Utrecht\nLinks:\n-\nA resource website for research on dependence logic\n-\nStanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy entry on \"dependence logic\"\n-\nInquisitive Semantics Research Group\n-\nHelsinki Logic Group\n-\nInstitute for Logic, Language and Computation\nLogic seminars:\nTULIPS seminar\n|\nHelsinki Logic Seminar\n|\nLIRa seminar\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\n\n---\n\nDr. Fan Yang's hompage - CV\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nDr. Fan Yang's hompage\nCV\nCV.pdf\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
  },
