    "homepage_text": "Home Research Publications About me Contact | Wenzhuo Huang\nWenzhuo Huang\nPursuing the limits.\nFollow me on\nGitHub\n|\nHome\n|\nResearch\n|\nPublications\n|\nAbout me\n|\nContact\nWelcome to my homepage!\nI am currently a 6th year PhD candidate in Photonics, Electrical and Computer Engineerning at University of California, San Diego. I am working with Prof. Ertugrul Cubukcu in\nNanoengineered Photonics Group\n. Our research motivation is to study light-matter interaction using novel nanoscale devices and sensors.\nNote\nRecent Update: Feb. 2022\nThis page was generated by\nGitHub Pages\n.\n\n---\n\nHome Research Publications About me Contact | Wenzhuo Huang\nWenzhuo Huang\nPursuing the limits.\nFollow me on\nGitHub\n|\nHome\n|\nResearch\n|\nPublications\n|\nAbout me\n|\nContact\nContact\nEmail: huangwz@ucsd.edu\nPhone: +1(858)-281-1046\nLinkedin:\nlinkedin.com/in/huangwz\nAddress: Jacobs Hall, EBU 1, Room 2321, 9500 Gilman Dr. #0407, La Jolla, CA 92093\nThis page was generated by\nGitHub Pages\n.\n\n---\n\nHome Research Publications About me Contact | Wenzhuo Huang\nWenzhuo Huang\nPursuing the limits.\nFollow me on\nGitHub\n|\nHome\n|\nResearch\n|\nPublications\n|\nAbout me\n|\nContact\nContact\nEmail: huangwz@ucsd.edu\nPhone: +1(858)-281-1046\nLinkedin:\nlinkedin.com/in/huangwz\nAddress: Jacobs Hall, EBU 1, Room 2321, 9500 Gilman Dr. #0407, La Jolla, CA 92093\nThis page was generated by\nGitHub Pages\n."
  },
