    "homepage_text": "Runpei Dong\nRunpei Dong\nPhD student,\nComputer Science\n,\nUniversity of Illinois Urbana-Champaign\nEmail\n/\nGoogle Scholar\n/\nGitHub\n/\nDBLP\n/\nLinkedIn\n/\nTwitter\nI am a 2nd year CS PhD student at\n        UIUC, advised by\nProf. Saurabh Gupta\n.\nI got my MS in CS in 2024, where I was jointly trained at\n        Tsinghua University\n        & Xi'an Jiaotong University,\n        under the supervision of\nProf. Andrew Chi-Chih Yao\n.\n        I was fortunate to collaborate closely with\nProf. Kaisheng Ma\n,\nProf. Li Yi\nand\nProf. He Wang\n.\n        I also spent one year at Megvii Research, working on computer vision with\nDr. Xiangyu Zhang\n.\n2022 @ Summer Palace, Beijing\nResearch\nI enjoy working on\nreal-world problems\nthat fascinate me,\n    and I am currently trying to build\nscalable\n,\ngeneralizable\n&\nhuman-centered\nrobotic, vision, and language models / systems.\n    I am enthusiastic about contributing to the research community and I support\nSlow Science\n. I am currently working in several areas:\nRobot Learning\non\nhumanoid robots\nRobotic Foundation Models\nfor\nuseful\n(most importantly),\ngeneralizable\n, and\nautonomous\ncontrol\nOther areas of work recently and in the past include: 1) foundation models (mainly generative vision-language models) and 2) representation learning.\nRecent News\n[2026/02] My close collaborators\nJunyu Zhang (UIUC MSCS)\n,\nZiyan Li (SJTU ACM Class)\n,\nXinyao Li (SJTU ACM Class)\n, and\nPeihao Li (UMich CS)\nare seeking Fall 2026 graduate positions.\n      They are exceptionally talented and hardworking; please consider reaching out to them if you are interested in hiring students!\n[2025/08] Invited online talk on\nAlphaOne\nat NVIDIA.\n[Slides]\n[2025/06] I will be attending RSS 2025 in person in June, see you in Los Angeles!\n[2024/05] Invited talk on 3D foundation models for embodied intelligence at Peking University.\n[2023/11] Honorably selected as\nNeurIPS 2023 Top Reviewer\n.\n[2023/09] Invited talk on multimodal foundation models at IIIS, Tsinghua University and XJTU.\n[2023/04] I will be attending ICLR 2023 in person, see you in Rwanda!\n[2023/03] Invited talk on 3D representation learning at IIIS, Tsinghua University.\nShow more...\nPapers\n(\nshow selected\n/\nshow by date\n)\n*: Equal contribution.\nâ\n: Project leader. See also my\nGoogle Scholar\nprofile for the most recent publications.\nLearning Humanoid End-Effector Control for Open-Vocabulary Visual Loco-Manipulation\nRunpei Dong*\n,\n            Ziyan Li*, Xialin He, Saurabh Gupta\nTech Report, Feb. 2026\nPDF\n/\nProject\n/\nCode (Coming Soon)\nPress:\nQuantum Zeitgeist\nLearning Getting-Up Policies for Real-World Humanoid Robots\nXialin He*,\nRunpei Dong*\n, Zixuan Chen, Saurabh Gupta\nRSS 2025\n/\nPDF\n/\nProject\n/\nCode\n/\nPoster\nPress:\nTech Xplore\nAlphaOne: Reasoning Models Thinking Slow and Fast at Test Time\nJunyu Zhang*,\nRunpei Dong*\n,\n          Han Wang, Xuying Ning, Haoran Geng, Peihao Li, Xialin He, Yutong Bai,\n          Jitendra Malik, Saurabh Gupta, Huan Zhang\nEMNLP 2025 Main\n/\nPDF\n/\nProject\n/\nCode\nPress:\nVenture Beat\nDreamLLM: Synergistic Multimodal Comprehension and Creation\nRunpei Dong*\n, Chunrui Han*, Yuang Peng, Zekun Qi, Zheng Ge, Jinrong Yang, Liang Zhao, Jianjian Sun, Hongyu Zhou, Haoran Wei, Xiangwen Kong, Xiangyu Zhang, Kaisheng Ma, Li Yi\nICLR 2024\n/\nPDF\n/\nProject\n/\nCode\n/\nOpenReview\n/\nPoster\n/\nSlides\nSpotlight Presentation (4.96%)\nShapeLLM: Universal 3D Object Understanding for Embodied Interaction\nZekun Qi,\nRunpei Dong\n†\n, Shaochen Zhang, Haoran Geng, Chunrui Han, Zheng Ge, He Wang, Li Yi, Kaisheng Ma\nECCV 2024\n/\nPDF\n/\nProject\n/\nCode\n/\n3D MM-Vet Benchmark\n/\nData\nAutoencoders as Cross-Modal Teachers: Can Pretrained 2D Image Transformers Help 3D Representation Learning?\nRunpei Dong\n, Zekun Qi, Linfeng Zhang, Junbo Zhang, Jianjian Sun, Zheng Ge, Li Yi, Kaisheng Ma\nICLR 2023\n/\nPDF\n/\nCode\n/\nOpenReview\n/\nPoster\n/\nSlides\nContrast with Reconstruct: Contrastive 3D Representation Learning Guided by Generative Pretraining\nZekun Qi*,\nRunpei Dong*\n, Guofan Fan, Zheng Ge, Xiangyu Zhang, Kaisheng Ma, Li Yi\nICML 2023\n/\nPDF\n/\nCode\n/\nOpenReview\n/\nPoster\n/\nSlides\nFinding the Task-Optimal Low-Bit Sub-Distribution in Deep Neural Networks\nRunpei Dong*\n, Zhanhong Tan*, Mengdi Wu, Linfeng Zhang, Kaisheng Ma\nICML 2022\n/\nPDF\n/\nCode\n/\nSlides\nSpotlight Presentation\n2026\nLearning Humanoid End-Effector Control for Open-Vocabulary Visual Loco-Manipulation\nRunpei Dong*\n,\n            Ziyan Li*, Xialin He, Saurabh Gupta\nTech Report, Feb. 2026\nPDF\n/\nProject\n/\nCode (Coming Soon)\nPress:\nQuantum Zeitgeist\nULTRA: Unified Multimodal Control for Autonomous Humanoid Whole-Body Loco-Manipulation\nXialin He*, Sirui Xu*, Xinyao Li,\nRunpei Dong\n,\n            Liuyu Bian, Yu-Xiong Wang, Liang-Yan Gui\nTech Report, Mar. 2026\nPDF\n/\nProject\n2025\nLearning Getting-Up Policies for Real-World Humanoid Robots\nXialin He*,\nRunpei Dong*\n, Zixuan Chen, Saurabh Gupta\nRSS 2025\n/\nPDF\n/\nProject\n/\nCode\n/\nPoster\nPress:\nTech Xplore\nAlphaOne: Reasoning Models Thinking Slow and Fast at Test Time\nJunyu Zhang*,\nRunpei Dong*\n,\n          Han Wang, Xuying Ning, Haoran Geng, Peihao Li, Xialin He, Yutong Bai,\n          Jitendra Malik, Saurabh Gupta, Huan Zhang\nEMNLP 2025 Main\n/\nPDF\n/\nProject\n/\nCode\nPress:\nVenture Beat\nSoFar: Language-Grounded Orientation Bridges Spatial Reasoning and Object Manipulation\nZekun Qi*, Wenyao Zhang*, Yufei Ding*,\nRunpei Dong\n,\n          Xinqiang Yu, Jingwen Li, Lingyun Xu, Baoyu Li, Xialin He, Guofan Fan, Jiazhao Zhang, Jiawei He, Jiayuan Gu, Xin Jin, Kaisheng Ma, Zhizheng Zhang, He Wang, Li Yi\nNeurIPS 2025\n/\nPDF\n/\nProject\n/\nCode\n/\nData\nSpotlight Presentation (3.19%)\nDreamVLA: A Vision-Language-Action Model Dreamed with Comprehensive World Knowledge\nWenyao Zhang*, Hongsi Liu*, Zekun Qi*, Yunnan Wang*, Xinqiang Yu, Jiazhao Zhang,\nRunpei Dong\n, Jiawei He, He Wang, Zhizheng Zhang, Li Yi, Wenjun Zeng, Xin Jin\nNeurIPS 2025\n/\nPDF\n/\nProject\n/\nCode\n/\nHuggingface\nROSE: Reconstructing Objects, Scenes, and Trajectories from Casual Videos for Robotic Manipulation\nPeihao Li*, Haoran Geng*, Jameson Crate*, Yanbing Han*, Junyi Zhang, Feishi Wang, Charlie Tianyue Cheng,\nRunpei Dong\n, Yen-Jen Wang, Haozhe Lou, Trevor Darrell, Pieter Abbeel, Jitendra Malik\nPDF\n/\nProject\nNeurIPS 2025 @ SpaVLE\n(Best Paper Award)\n,\nCoRL 2025 @ H2R\nPerception in Reflection\nYana Wei*, Liang Zhao*, Kangheng Lin, En Yu, Yuang Peng,\nRunpei Dong\n, Jianjian Sun, Haoran Wei, Zheng Ge, Xiangyu Zhang, Vishal M. Patel\nICML 2025\n/\nPDF\n/\nProject\n/\nCode\nTaming Teacher Forcing for Masked Autoregressive Video Generation\nDeyu Zhou, Quan Sun, Yuang Peng, Kun Yan,\nRunpei Dong\n, Duomin Wang, Zheng Ge, Nan Duan, Xiangyu Zhang, Lionel M. Ni, Heung-Yeung Shum\nCVPR 2025\n/\nPDF\n/\nProject\nPositional Prompt Tuning for Efficient 3D Representation Learning\nShaochen Zhang*, Zekun Qi*,\nRunpei Dong*\n, Xiuxiu Bai, Xing Wei\nACM MM 2025\n/\nPDF\n/\nCode\nDreamBench++: A Human-Aligned Benchmark for Personalized Image Generation\nYuang Peng*, Yuxin Cui*, Haomiao Tang*, Zekun Qi,\nRunpei Dong\n✉\n, Jing Bai, Chunrui Han, Zheng Ge, Xiangyu Zhang, Shu-Tao Xia\nICLR 2025\n/\nPDF\n/\nProject\n/\nCode\n/\nOpenReview\n/\nDreamBench++ Benchmark\n/\nData\n2024\nDreamLLM: Synergistic Multimodal Comprehension and Creation\nRunpei Dong*\n, Chunrui Han*, Yuang Peng, Zekun Qi, Zheng Ge, Jinrong Yang, Liang Zhao, Jianjian Sun, Hongyu Zhou, Haoran Wei, Xiangwen Kong, Xiangyu Zhang, Kaisheng Ma, Li Yi\nICLR 2024\n/\nPDF\n/\nProject\n/\nCode\n/\nOpenReview\n/\nPoster\n/\nSlides\nSpotlight Presentation (4.96%)\nShapeLLM: Universal 3D Object Understanding for Embodied Interaction\nZekun Qi,\nRunpei Dong\n†\n, Shaochen Zhang, Haoran Geng, Chunrui Han, Zheng Ge, He Wang, Li Yi, Kaisheng Ma\nECCV 2024\n/\nPDF\n