  "deep_homepage::Hanwang Zhang::https://dr.ntu.edu.sg/entities/person/Zhang-Hanwang": {
    "homepage": "https://dr.ntu.edu.sg/entities/person/Zhang-Hanwang",
    "all_emails": [
      "library@ntu.edu.sg",
      "hanwangzhang@ntu.edu.sg"
    ],
    "matched_email": "hanwangzhang@ntu.edu.sg",
    "github": null,
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Prof Zhang Hanwang | Academic Profile | DR-NTU | Research | NTU Singapore\nSkip to main content\nLog In\nACADEMIC PROFILE:\nFACULTY\nLoading...\nLoading...\nProf Zhang Hanwang\nProfessor, College of Computing & Data Science\nProvost's Chair in Computer Science\nhanwangzhang@ntu.edu.sg\nWeb Site\nWebsite\nORCID\nKeywords\nComputer Science and Engineering\nElectrical and Electronic Engineering\nInteractive Digital Media\nLanguage & Communication\nMathematics\nBiography\nHanwang Zhang is an Associate Professor at Nanyang Technological University, Singapore. He was a research scientist at the Department of Computer Science, Columbia University, USA and a senior research fellow at the School of Computing, National University of Singapore, Singapore. He has received the B.Eng (Hons.) degree in computer science from Zhejiang University, Hangzhou, China, in 2009, and the Ph.D. degree in computer science from the National University of Singapore in 2014. His research interests include computer vision, multimedia, and social media. Dr. Zhang is the recipient of the Best Demo runner-up award in ACM MM 2012, the Best Student Paper award in ACM MM 2013, and the Best Paper Honorable Mention in ACM SIGIR 2016. He is also the winner of Best Ph.D. Thesis Award of School of Computing, National University of Singapore, 2014.\nResearch Interests\nCurrent Grants"
  },
