    "homepage_text": "Jiarui Jin - Homepage\nJiarui Jin\nHOME\npublication\nPROJECT\nDeadline\nJiarui (Jerry) Jin, 晋嘉睿\nPh.D. at\nApex Lab\nShanghai Jiao Tong University\nShanghai, China\nE:\njinjiarui@xiaohongshu.com\nE:\njinjiarui97@sju.edu.cn\n© Update in June 2025.\nBIOGRAPHY\nJiarui is an algorithm engineer at\nXiaohongshu\n, working on applications of large language models with deep research.\nJiarui earned his\nPh.D.\nat\nApex Data and Knowledge Management Lab\nof\nShanghai Jiao Tong University\nin 2024.\nHis graduate research advisors were\nProf. Yong Yu\n,\nProf. Weinan Zhang\nand\nProf. Jun Wang\n(\nUniversity College London\n).\nPreviously, he was a visiting student researcher at\nArtificial Intelligence Center\n,\nUniversity College\n                        London\n.\n                  He was a research intern or an applied scientist intern at\nAmazon Web\n                        Services Shanghai AI-Labs\n,\nTaobao Live\n,\nAlimama\n,\nDiDi AI-Labs\n, or a quantitative research intern, and closely collaborated with\nChina\n                        Merchants Bank\n.\n                  He earned his B.Eng. from\nYingcai\n                        Honor Class\nof\nUniversity of Electronic Science and\n                        Technology of China\nin\n                  2019.\nActively seeking exceptional\nace interns\n- email me if you are a good fit :P\nRECENT NEWS\n[2025.05] One paper is accepted at SynData4CV-CVPR 2025\n[2025.05] One paper is accepted at ICML 2025\n[2024.11] One paper is accepted at KDD 2025\n[2024.07] One paper is accepted at CIKM 2024\n[2024.05] One paper is accepted at KDD 2024\n[2024.01] One paper is accepted at WWW 2024\n[2023.09] One paper is accepted at NeurIPS 2023\n[2023.08] One paper is accepted at CIKM 2023\n[2023.06] One paper is accepted at TORS\n[2023.01] One paper is accepted at TOIS\n[2022.11] One paper is accepted at AAAI 2023\n[2022.09] One paper is accepted at NeurIPS 2022\n[2022.08] One paper is accepted at CIKM 2022\n[2022.01] Two papers are accepted at ICLR 2022\n[2022.01] Two papers are accepted at WWW 2022\n[2021.08] Our paper wins the best paper award at DLG-KDD 2021\n[2021.06] One paper is accepted at TOIS\n[2021.06] One paper is accepted at DLG-KDD 2021\n[2020.05] One paper is accepted at KDD 2020\n[2020.05] Two papers are accepted at SIGIR 2020"
  },
