    "homepage_text": "Faculty - Web Profile - McCombs School of Business\nNews\nEvents\nDirectory\nGive\nContact\nSelect Page\n< Back to Faculty Directory\nOur website uses cookies. By continuing to browse and interact with our website, you accept that we collect cookies and that you have reviewed and agreed to our Privacy Policy.\nOk\nPrivacy policy\n\n---\n\nBlockchain Contact - McCombs School of Business\nNews\nEvents\nDirectory\nGive\nContact\nSelect Page\nBlockchain Initiative\nContact Us\nGet in touch with our team to learn more about the Blockchain Initiative at McCombs.\nGet in Touch\nThe Blockchain Initiative at Texas McCombs\nEmail\n:\nblockchain@mccombs.utexas.edu\nCall\n:\n512-232-6843\nFollow\nFollow\nVisit\n:\n2110 Speedway\nAustin, TX 78712\nOur website uses cookies. By continuing to browse and interact with our website, you accept that we collect cookies and that you have reviewed and agreed to our Privacy Policy.\nOk\nPrivacy policy\n\n---\n\nBlockchain Contact - McCombs School of Business\nNews\nEvents\nDirectory\nGive\nContact\nSelect Page\nBlockchain Initiative\nContact Us\nGet in touch with our team to learn more about the Blockchain Initiative at McCombs.\nGet in Touch\nThe Blockchain Initiative at Texas McCombs\nEmail\n:\nblockchain@mccombs.utexas.edu\nCall\n:\n512-232-6843\nFollow\nFollow\nVisit\n:\n2110 Speedway\nAustin, TX 78712\nOur website uses cookies. By continuing to browse and interact with our website, you accept that we collect cookies and that you have reviewed and agreed to our Privacy Policy.\nOk\nPrivacy policy\n\n---\n\nCGB: About - McCombs School of Business\nNews\nEvents\nDirectory\nGive\nContact\nSelect Page\nThe Center for Global Business\nAbout the Center for Global Business\nOur community of dedicated board members, alumni, faculty, and staff collaborate to enhance student learning, experience, and career opportunities.\nGet in Touch\nAdvancing Excellence & Getting Results\nSince relaunching in 2019, CGB has tripled enrollment in the IB program at UT with new initiatives, increased support, and enhanced resources for students.\nRead Our Annual Report\nRead More About Our Success\nHear from Our Supporters\nBoard of Advisors\nThe global expertise of these business leaders guides our efforts, contributes to our thought leadership, and supports our students.\nMeet the Board\nAffiliated Faculty\nThe global research and teaching of faculty from across the Forty Acres contributes to UT’s global knowledge base and inspires our students.\nMeet the Affiliated Faculty\nCenter Leadership\nDr. Deirdre Mendez leads a team of dedicated staff who design and implement innovative programs, while guiding and supporting our students.\nConnect on Linkedin\nContact Dr. Mendez\nOur website uses cookies. By continuing to browse and interact with our website, you accept that we collect cookies and that you have reviewed and agreed to our Privacy Policy.\nOk\nPrivacy policy\n\n---\n\nCGB: About - McCombs School of Business\nNews\nEvents\nDirectory\nGive\nContact\nSelect Page\nThe Center for Global Business\nAbout the Center for Global Business\nOur community of dedicated board members, alumni, faculty, and staff collaborate to enhance student learning, experience, and career opportunities.\nGet in Touch\nAdvancing Excellence & Getting Results\nSince relaunching in 2019, CGB has tripled enrollment in the IB program at UT with new initiatives, increased support, and enhanced resources for students.\nRead Our Annual Report\nRead More About Our Success\nHear from Our Supporters\nBoard of Advisors\nThe global expertise of these business leaders guides our efforts, contributes to our thought leadership, and supports our students.\nMeet the Board\nAffiliated Faculty\nThe global research and teaching of faculty from across the Forty Acres contributes to UT’s global knowledge base and inspires our students.\nMeet the Affiliated Faculty\nCenter Leadership\nDr. Deirdre Mendez leads a team of dedicated staff who design and implement innovative programs, while guiding and supporting our students.\nConnect on Linkedin\nContact Dr. Mendez\nOur website uses cookies. By continuing to browse and interact with our website, you accept that we collect cookies and that you have reviewed and agreed to our Privacy Policy.\nOk\nPrivacy policy"
