    "homepage_text": "Jian Li's Homepage\n李建\nLI, Jian\nProfessor,\nInstitute for Interdisciplinary Information Sciences\n(IIIS, headed by Prof.\nAndrew Yao\n)\n, Tsinghua University.\nPublications\n(full list in\nGoogle Scholar\n)\nRecruit (Intern, \r\nPostdoc, Ph.D., Master, Undergrad)\n常年招收人工智能基础理论，人工智能与金融应用方向的实习生\nSome Talks (with slides)\nResearch Group\nResearch Interests\nTheoretical Computer Science\n(\nApproximation \r\n\tAlgorithms\n, Computational Geometry,\nStochastic\nCombinatorial\nOptimization)\nArtificial Intelligence\n(\nTheory \r\n\tof Deep Learning, Theory of LLM,\nML for Tabular/Time \r\n\tseries data\n)\n(\n人工智能与大语言模型理论 \r\n\t知乎专栏\n)\nML and Finance \r\n\t(\n机器学习与量化投资 \r\n\t知乎专栏\n)（由我们组同学维护）\nLarge-scale Data Management and Analytics \r\n\t(\nDatabases\n, \r\n\tCrowdsourcing\n)\nProfessional \r\n\t\tServices\nPC members\n:\nSODA 2026, SODA 2025, TAMC 2023, IJTCS 2022 (PC co-chair),\r\n\t\t\tAAAI 2022 (senior PC), IJCAI 2022 (senior PC),\n全国理论计算机年会 NCTCS 2021\n(PC \r\n\t\t\tco-chair),IJTCS 2021,\nIJTCS \r\n\t\t\t2020\n(PC co-chair),\r\n\t\t\tIJCAI 2021(area chair), AAAI 2021(senior PC), ACML 2021 (senior PC),\r\n\t\t\tIJCAI 2020 (AI-in-Fintech Track),\nTAMC 2020\n,\nICML 2020\n,\nSoCG2020\n,\nAAAI 2020\n,\nFAW \r\n\t\t\t2019\n,\nDASFAA 2019\n, AAAI \r\n\t\t\t18, NIPS17,\nICML17\n(PC reviewer), WAOA17, \r\n\t\t\tAAAI17,\nICML2016\n(PC reviewer),\nICDE2016\n,\nICALP2016\n,\nWAIM2015\n,\nWiOpt2015\n,\nWAIM2015 (proceeding chair)\n,\nChina \r\n\t\t\tTheory Week 2014\n(co-chair),\nWAIM2014\n,\nCOCOON2014\n,\nISAAC2013\n,\nTAMC2013\n,\nCOCOON2013\n,\nCIKM2012\nJournal Editorial Board:\nACM \r\n\t\t\tTransaction on Algorithms (\nTALG\n),\nIJCGA\nTeaching\n2026 Spring, AIQUANT,\nArtificial \r\n\t\t\tIntelligence and Quantitative Finance\n202\n5\nFall,\nAlgorithms\n(undergraduate)\n202\n5\nSpring, ATCS -\nSe\nlected topics in learning, prediction and optimization \r\n\t\t\t(with applications to finance)\n202\n4\nFall,\nAlgorithms\n(undergraduate)\n202\n4\nSpring, ATCS -\nSe\nlected topics in learning, prediction and optimization \r\n\t\t\t(with applications to finance)\n202\n3\nFall, \r\n\t\t\tAlgorithms (undergraduate)\n202\n3\nSpring, ATCS -\nSelected topics in \r\n\t\t\tlearning, prediction and optimization (with applications to finance)\n202\n2\nFall,\nAlgorithms\n(undergraduate)\n202\n2\nSpring, ATCS -\nSelected topics in \r\n\t\t\tlearning, prediction and optimization (with applications to finance)\n202\n1\nFall,\nAlgorithms\n(undergraduate)\n2021 Spring, ATCS -\nSelected topics in \r\n\t\t\tlearning, prediction and optimization (with applications to finance)\n2020 Fall, Algorithms (undergraduate)\n2020 Spring, ATCS -\nSelected topics in \r\n\t\t\tlearning, prediction and optimization (with applications to finance)\n2019 Fall, Algorithms (undergraduate)\n2019 Spring, ATCS -\nSelected topics in \r\n\t\t\tlearning, prediction and optimization (with applications to finance)\n2018 Fall,\nAlgorithms\n(undergraduate)\n2018 Spring, ATCS -\nLearning and \r\n\t\t\tOptimization - theory and practice\n2017 Fall,\nAlgorithms\n(undergraduate)\n2017 Spring ATCS -\nSelected topics in \r\n\t\t\tlearning, prediction and optimization (with applications to finance)\n2016 Fall,\nDeep Learning\n(undergraduate)\n2016 Fall, \r\n\t\t\tAlgorithms (undergraduate)\n2016 Summer,\nDuke-Tsinghua Machine Learning Summer School, Lecturer\n2016 Spring, ATCS -\nLearning and Prediction - theory and practice\n2015 Fall,\nAlgorithms\n(undergraduate)\n2015 Spring,\nATCS - \r\n\t\t\tselected topics in (computational, combinatorial, convex, \r\n\t\t\thigh-dimensional) geometry\n2014 Fall, Algorithms \r\n\t\t\t(undergraduate)\n2014 Spring,\nATCS - Selected topics in convex, \r\ncombinatorial and stochastic optimization\n(graduate)\n2013\nSpring,\nATCS - Stochastic Network Optimization\n(graduate, \r\n\t\t\tco-taught with\nLongbo \r\n\t\t\tHuang\n).\n2012\nFall,\nATCS\n(I am a co-organizer of the course. The first half is taught by\nDominik Scheder\n.