    "homepage_text": "Jiaxiang Dong | Homepage\nJiaxiang Dong\nBeijing, China\ndongjiaxiang1994@163.com\nAbout Me\nI received my Ph.D. degree from\nSchool of Software\n,\nTsinghua University\n, advised by Prof.\nLi Zhang\nand Prof.\nMingsheng Long\n. ​My research focuses on deep time series analysis and self-supervised pre-training of time series. I am committed to advancing research that can be applied to meaningful real-world scenarios.\nPreprints\narXiv\nDeep Time Series Models: A Comprehensive Survey and Benchmark\nYuxuan Wang*, Haixu Wu*,\nJiaxiang Dong*\n, Yong Liu, Mingsheng Long#, Jianmin Wang\narXiv\nCode\nConference Proceedings\nNeurIPS\nDiffusion Tuning: Transferring Diffusion Models via Chain of Forgetting\nJincheng Zhong*, Xingzhuo Guo*,\nJiaxiang Dong\n, Mingsheng Long#\nNeurIPS 2024\n| Neural Information Processing Systems\nPDF\narXiv\nCode\nNeurIPS\nTimeXer: Empowering Transformers for Time Series Forecasting with Exogenous Variables\nYuxuan Wang*, Haixu Wu*,\nJiaxiang Dong\n, Yong Liu, Yunzhong Qiu, Haoran Zhang, Jianmin Wang, Mingsheng Long#\nNeurIPS 2024\n| Neural Information Processing Systems\nPDF\narXiv\nCode\nSlides\nPoster\nICML\nTimeSiam: A Pre-Training Framework for Siamese Time-Series Modeling\nJiaxiang Dong*\n, Haixu Wu*, Yuxuan Wang, Yunzhong Qiu, Li Zhang, Jianmin Wang, Mingsheng Long#\nICML 2024\n| International Conference on Machine Learning\nPDF\narXiv\nCode\nSlides\nPoster\nNeurIPS\nSimMTM: A Simple Pre-Training Framework for Masked Time-Series Modeling\nJiaxiang Dong*\n, Haixu Wu*, Haoran Zhang, Li Zhang, Jianmin Wang, Mingsheng Long#\nNeurIPS 2023\n| Neural Information Processing Systems |\nSpotlight\nPDF\narXiv\nCode\nSlides\nPoster\nICME\nMultibox Sample Selection for Active Object Detection\nJiaxiang Dong\n, Li Zhang#\nICME 2023\n| International Conference on Multimedia and Expo |\nOral\nPDF\nSlides\nSRDS\nPITR: An Efficient Single-Failure Recovery Scheme for PIT-Coded Cloud Storage Systems\nPeng Li,\nJiaxiang Dong\n, Xueda Liu, Gang Wang#, Zhongwei Li, Xiaoguang Liu#\nSRDS 2017\n| Symposium on Reliable Distributed Systems\nPDF\nJournal Articles\nScience China\nMetadata-Informed Transformers for Informative Time Series Forecasting\nJiaxiang Dong*\n, Haixu Wu*#, Yuxuan Wang*, Li Zhang, Jianmin Wang, Mingsheng Long#\nSCIENTIA SINICA Informationis 2025\n(In Chinese)\nPDF\narXiv\nComputer Science\nMechanical Equipment Fault Diagnosis Driven by Knowledge\nJiaxiang Dong\n, Jiyu Zhai, Xin Ma, Leixian Shen, Li Zhang#\nComputer Science 2023\n(In Chinese)\nPDF\nDSE\nVisual Data Analysis with Task-Based Recommendations\nLeixian Shen#, Enya Shen, Zhiwei Tai, Yihao Xu,\nJiaxiang Dong\n, Jianmin Wang\nDSE 2022\n| Data Science and Engineering\nPDF\narXiv\nCode\n* Equal Contribution, # Corresponding Author\nEducation and Experience\n[2020-2025]\nPh.D in Software Engineering,\nSchool of Software\n,\nTsinghua University\n.\n[2019-2020]\nResearch Assistant,\nNational Engineering Research Center for Big Data Software\n.\n[2018-2019]\nSearch Reliability Engineer,\nBaidu Online Network Technology (Beijing) Co.,Ltd\n.\n[2016-2018]\nM.S Computer science and technology,\nCollege of Computer\n,\nNanKai University\n.\n[2012-2016]\nB.S Software Engineering,\nSchool of Software\n,\nTianjin Polytechnic University\n.\nSelected Awards\nComprehensive Excellence Award of Tsinghua, 2023, 2024\nExcellent Thesis Award for Master of Engineering Major in Tianjin (Top 5%), 2019\nOracle Database 10g Administrator Certified Master (OCM), 2015\nOracle Database 10g Administrator Certified Professional (OCP), 2014\nOracle Database SQL Certified Expert, 2014\nAcademic Services\nConference Reviewer\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (ICML), 2025\nNeural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS), 2024\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR), 2023, 2024, 2025\nKnowledge Discovery and Data Mining (KDD), 2023"
