    "homepage_text": "Chunming He\nSearch\nChunming He (何春明)\nGraduate Student\nDuke University\nBiography\nI am a second-year doctoral student at Duke University advised by Prof.\nSina Farsiu\n. Now I work closely with Prof.\nVahid Tarokh\n(NAE member), Dr.\nKai Li\n, Prof.\nYulun Zhang\n, and Prof.\nDeng-Ping Fang\n. Previously, I received my master degree at Tsinghua University under the supervision of Prof.\nXiu Li\nand obtained my bachelor degree at Nanjing University of Posts and Telecommunications under the guidance of Prof.\nHu Zhu\nand Prof.\nGuoxia Xu\n.\nMy research interests revolve around the intersection of low-level vision, concealed object segmentation, medical data analysis, and multi-modal large language model. Specifically, I emphasize the utilization of prior knowledge to augment the robustness and generalization capabilities of computer vision algorithms.\nI’m open to any kinds of collaboration. Please feel free to contact me directly through email.\nWe are looking for research assistants. If interested, please feel free to email me directly and cc Prof.\nSina Farsiu\n. I will review and respond to all applicants!\nEmail:\nchunminghe19990224@gmail.com\nor\nchunming.he@duke.edu\nInterests\nLow-level Vision\nConcealed Object Segmentation\nMedical Data Analysis\nMLLMs\nEducation\nPh.D. in Biomedical Engineering, 2024 - Present\nDuke University\nM.S. in Computer Science, 2021 - 2024\nTsinghua University\nNews\n[June 2025] We are collecting papers about Multimodal Large Language Models in Low-Level Vision (\nRepository\n). Feel free to give us any valuable suggestions!\n[May 2025] One paper accepted to ICML 2025 and one paper accepted to IEEE TPAMI (IF=20.80).\n[Feb. 2025] One paper accepted to IEEE TPAMI (IF=20.80), focusing on\nDiffusion Models in Low-Level Vision\n.\n[Jan. 2025] One paper accepted to ICLR 2025 as a\nSpotlight\n.\n[Dec. 2024] One survey accepted to CAAI AIR, Congrats to\nFengyang\n! This research was reported by\nEureAlert\n! One paper accepted to AAAI 2025, Congrats to\nChenyang\n!\n[Oct. 2024] We are collecting papers about Concealed Object Segmentation (\nSurvey\n,\nRepository\n) and Diffusion Models in Low-Level Vision (\nSurvey\n,\nRepository\n). Feel free to give us any valuable suggestions!\n[Sept. 2024] One paper accepted to NeurIPS 2024 as a\nSpotlight\n, Congrats to\nChengyu\nand\nFengyang\n! One paper accepted to IEEE TCSVT (IF=8.3).\n[July 2024] I received the award of “Pratt-Gardner Fellowship” and “John Chambers Fellowship” at Duke University. One paper accepted to ECCV 2024, Congrats to\nLongxiang\n!\n[June 2024] I graduated from Tsinghua University and received the honor of “Outstanding Graduate of Tsinghua University” (14 in 1140, ranked 2nd) and “Outstanding Master’s Thesis of Tsinghua University”.\n[Jan. 2024] One paper accepted to ICLR 2024.\n[Sept. 2023] One paper accepted to NeurIPS 2023 and one paper accepted to IEEE TNNLS (IF=14.26).\n[July 2023] One paper accepted to ICCV 2023.\n[May 2023] One paper accepted to MICCAI 2023, Congrats to\nLongxiang\n!\n[Feb. 2023] One paper accepted to CVPR 2023.\n[Jan. 2023] One paper accepted to IEEE TNNLS (IF=14.26).\n[Oct. 2022] One paper accepted to IEEE TITS (IF=9.55).\n[Sept. 2022] One paper accepted to MedIA (IF=13.83), Congrats to\nLei Xu\n!\n[Aug. 2022] One paper accepted to IEEE TITS (IF=9.55).\nSelected Publications\nHere is a list of my publications (selected). For full publications, please refer to my\nGoogle Scholar\n.\n( $^†$ equal contribution, * corresponding author)\nSummary: CVPR/ICCV/ECCV/NeurIPS/ICML/ICLR - 8 (2 Spotlight), IEEE Trans./MIA - 8 (2 TPAMI).\n.js-id-important\nSelected\nAll\nJournal\nConference\nUnder Review\nUnfoldIR$:$ Rethinking Deep Unfolding Network in Illumination Degradation Image Restoration\nChunming He\n$^†$, Rihan Zhang$^†$, Fengyang Xiao, Chengyu Fang, Longxiang Tang, Yulun Zhang, Sina Farsiu*\narxiv\n, 2025\nSCALER$:$ SAM-Enhanced Collaborative Learning for Label-Deficient Concealed Object Segmentation\nChunming He\n, Rihan Zhang, Longxiang Tang, Sujie Hu, Kai Li, Sina Farsiu*\narxiv\n, 2025\nIQPFR$:$ An Image Quality Prior for Blind Face Restoration and Beyond\nPeng Hu$^†$,\nChunming He\n$^†$, Lei Xu, Sina Farsiu, Pei Liu, Yulun Zhang, Xiu Li\narxiv\n, 2025\nPDF\nSegment Concealed Objects with Incomplete Supervision\nChunming He\n, Kai Li, Yachao Zhang, Ziyun yang, Youwei Pang, Longxiang Tang, Chengyu Fang, Yulun Zhang, Linghe Kong, Xiu Li, Sina Farsiu.\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence\n(TPAMI)\nPDF\nCode\nRUN$:$ Reversible Unfolding Network for Concealed Object Segmentation\nChunming He\n, Rihan Zhang, Fengyang Xiao, Chengyu Fang, Longxiang Tang, Yulun Zhang, Linghe Kong, Deng-Ping Fan, Kai Li, Sina Farsiu*\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning\n(\nICML\n), 2025\nPDF\nCode\nUniCOS$:$ Extra Modality Helps Segmentor Find Camouflaged Objects Well\nChengyu Fang$^†$,\nChunming He\n$^†$, Longxiang Tang, Yuelin Zhang, Guoxia Xu, Xiu Li*\narxiv\n, 2025\nDiffusion Models in Low-Level Vision$:$ A Survey\nChunming He\n$^†$, Yuqi Shen$^†$, Chengyu Fang$^†$, Fengyang Xiao, Yulun Zhang, Wangmeng Zuo, Zhenhua Guo, Xiu Li*.\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence\n(\nTPAMI\n).\nPDF\nCode\nReti-Diff$:$ Illumination Degradation Image Restoration with Retinex-based Latent Diffusion Model\nChunming He\n$^†$, Chengyu Fang*, Yulun Zhang*, Longxiang Tang, Jinfa Huang, Kai Li, Zhenhua Guo, Xiu Li, Sina Farsiu*\nin International Conference on Learning Representations\n(\nICLR\n), Spotlight, 2025\nPDF\nCode\nA Survey of Camouflaged Object Detection and Beyond\nFengyang Xiao$^†$, Sujie Hu$^†$, Yuqi Shen, Chengyu Fang, Jinfa Huang,\nChunming He\n$^*$, Longxiang Tang, Ziyun Yang, Xiu Li.\nCAAI Artificial Intelligence Research\n(\nCAAI AIR\n), 2024\nPDF\nCode\nReal-world Image Dehazing with Coherence-based Label Generator and Cooperative Unfolding Network\nChengyu Fang$^†$, Fengyang Xiao$^†$,\nChunming He*\n, Yulun Zhang*, Longxiang Tang, Yuelin Zhang, Kai Li, Xiu Li\nin Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems\n(\nNeurIPS\n), Spotlight, 2024\nPDF\nCode\nAIIE$:$ All-Inclusive Image Enhancement via DCT Data Adjustment\nMingye Ju$^†$,\nChunming He\n$^†$, Can Ding, Wenqi Ren, Lin Zhang.\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology\n(\nTCSVT\n), 2024\nStrategic Preys Make Acute Predators$:$ Enhancing Camouflaged Object Detectors by Generating Camouflaged Objects\nChunming He\n, Kai Li*, Yachao Zhang, Yulun Zhang, Zhenhua Guo, Xiu Li*, Martin Danelljan, Fisher Yu\nin International Conference on Learning Representations\n(\nICLR\n), 2024\nPDF\nCode\nWeakly-Supervised Concealed Object Segmentation with SAM-based Pseudo Labeling and Multi-scale Feature Grouping\nChunming He\n$^†$, Kai Li$^†$, Yachao Zhang, Guoxia Xu, Longxiang Tang, Yulun Zhang, Zhenhua Guo, Xiu Li*\nin Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems\n(\nNeurIPS\n), 2023\nPDF\nCode\nDegradation-Resistant Unfolding Network for Heterogeneous Image Fusion\nChunming He\n, Kai Li*, Guoxia Xu, Yulun Zhang, Runze Hu, Zhenhua Guo, Xiu Li*\nin International Conference on Computer Vision\n(\nICCV\n), 2023\nPDF\nCamouflaged Object Detection with Feature Decomposition and Edge Reconstruction\nChunming He\n, Kai Li*, Yachao Zhang, Longxiang Tang, Yulun Zhang, Zhenhua Guo, Xiu Li*\nin IEEE International Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(\nCVPR\n), 2023\nPDF\nCode\nHQG-Net$:$ Unpaired Medical Image Enhancement with High-Quality Guidance\nChunming He\n, Kai Li*, Guoxia Xu, Jiangpeng Yan, Longxiang Tang, Yulun Zhang, Yaowei Wang, Xiu Li*.\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems\n(\nTNNLS\n), 2023\nPDF\nCode\nDM-Fusion$:$ Deep Model-Driven Network for Heterogeneous Image Fusion\nGuoxia Xu$^†$,\nChunming He\n$^†$, Hao Wang*, Hu Zhu, Weiping Ding\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems\n(\nTNNLS\n), 2023\nPDF\nIVF-Net$:$ An Infrared and Visible Data Fusion Deep Network for Traffic Object Enhancement in Intelligent Transportation Systems\nMingye Ju$^†$,\nChunming He\n$^†$, Juping Liu, Bin Kang, Jian Su, Dengyin Zhang\nIEEE Transactions on Intelligent Transportation Systems\n(\nTITS\n), 2022\nPDF\nPcGAN$:$ A Noise Robust Conditional Generative Adversarial Network for One Shot Learning\nLizhen Deng$^†$,\nChunming He\n$^†$, Guoxia Xu, Hu Zhu*, Hao Wang\nIEEE Transactions on Intelligent Transportation Systems\n(\nTITS\n), 2022\nPDF\nSource-Free Domain Adaptive Fundus Image Segmentation with Class-Balanced Mean Teacher\nLongxiang Tang, Kai Li*,\nChunming He\n, Yulun Zhang, Xiu Li*\nin International Conference on Medical Image Computing and Computer Assisted Intervention\n(\nMICCAI\n), 2023\nPDF\nMulti-modal sequence learning for Alzheimer’s disease progression prediction with incomplete variable-length longitudinal data\nLei Xu, Hui Wu,\nChunming He\n, Jun Wang, Changqing Zhang, Feiping Nie, Lei Chen*\nMedical Image Analysis\n(MedIA)\n, 2022\nPDF\nCode\nSelected Awards\nJohn Chambers Fellowship & Pratt-Gardner Fellowship\nDuke University\nJul 2024\nOutstanding Graduate of Tsinghua University & Outstanding Master’s Thesis of Tsinghua University\nTsinghua University\nJun 2024\nNational Scholarship for Graduate Students\nTsinghua University\nOct 2023\nTeaching\nTeaching Assistant for Digital Image Processing\nDuke University\nAug 2025\n              \n              – Dec 2025\nTeaching Assistant for Introduction to the Frontiers of Artificial Intelligence\nTsinghua University\nSep 2023\n              \n              – Jan 2024\nTeaching Assistant for Intelligent Unmanned Delivery in Meituan\nTsinghua University\nSep 2022\n              \n              – Jan 2023\nProfessional Activities\nReviewer for Nature Communications, TPAMI, IJCV, JMLR, TIP, TMI, TIFS, TNNLS, TITS, TMM, TCSVT, PR.\nReviewer for CVPR, ICCV, ECCV, NeurIPS, ICML, ICLR, AAAI, IJCAI, ACM MM, MICCAI, ICME, ICASSP.\nMy Collaborators and Friends\nLei Xu\n,\nFengyang Xiao\n,\nLongxiang Tang\n,\nChengyu Fang\n,\nYue Ma\n,\nZiyun Yang\n,\nTian Ye\n,\nJinfa Huang\n, etc."
