    "homepage_text": "Yuchen Hu\nYuchen Hu\nPostdoctoral Associate\nLIDS@MIT\nYuchen Hu\nHi! I am a Postdoctoral Associate in the MIT Laboratory for Information and Decision Systems, working with with Professors\nStephen Bates\nand\nMartin Wainwright\n. I am interested in a wide range of topics related to causal inference and data-driven decision-making.\nI obtained my PhD in Management Science and Engineering from Stanford University in 2025, where I was fortunate to be advised by Professor\nStefan Wager\n. I will be joining Columbia University as an Assistant Professor in the Department of Industrial Engineering and Operations Research (IEOR) in July 2026.\nResearch\nOptimal Targeting in Dynamic Systems.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[\narxiv\n]\nYuchen Hu\n, Shuangning Li, Stefan Wager.\nSwitchback Experiments under Geometric Mixing.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[\narxiv\n]\nYuchen Hu\n, Stefan Wager.\nEstimating Treatment Effects under Recommender Interference: A Structured Neural Networks Approach.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[\narxiv\n]\nRuohan Zhan, Shichao Han,\nYuchen Hu\n, Zhenling Jiang.\nPreliminary version accepted by\nACM Conference on Economics and Computation (EC)\n, 2024.\nMinimax-Regret Sample Selection in Randomized Experiments.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[\narxiv\n]\nYuchen Hu\n, Henry Zhu, Emma Brunskill, Stefan Wager.\nACM Conference on Economics and Computation (EC)\n, 2024.\nWinner, Decision Analysis Society (DAS) Student Paper Award, 2024.\nAnalysis of the Privacy-Performance Tradeoff of Reference Testing in Forensic Investigative Genetic Genealogy.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[\npaper\n]\nYuchen Hu\n, Lawrence M. Wein.\nJournal of Forensic Sciences\n, 69(5), 2024.\nOff-Policy Evaluation in Partially Observed Markov Decision Processes under Sequential Ignorability.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[\npaper\n,\narxiv\n,\nreplication\n]\nYuchen Hu\n, Stefan Wager.\nAnnals of Statistics\n, 51(4), 2023.\nAverage Direct and Indirect Causal Effects under Interference.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[\npaper\n,\narxiv\n]\nYuchen Hu\n, Shuangning Li, Stefan Wager.\nBiometrika\n, 109(4), 2022.\nComparison of Empirical and Dynamic Models for HIV Viral Load Rebound after Treatment Interruption.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[\npaper\n]\nAnte Bing\n*\n,\nYuchen Hu\n*\n, Melanie Prague, Alison L. Hill, Jonathan Z. Li, Ronald J. Bosch, Victor DeGruttola, Rui Wang.\nStatistical Communications in Infectious Diseases\n, 12(s1), 2020.\nA Flexible Nonlinear Mixed Effects  Model for HIV Viral Load Rebound after Treatment Interruption.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[\npaper\n]\nRui Wang, Ante Bing, Cathy Wang,\nYuchen Hu\n, Ronald J. Bosch, Victor DeGruttola.\nStatistics in Medicine\n, 39(15), 2020.\nImpact of Changes in Chain Restaurant Calories over Time on Obesity Risk.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[\npaper\n]\nSara N. Bleich, Jesse C. Jones-Smith, Marian P. Jarlenski, Julia A. Wolfson, Johannah M. Frelier, Huiru Tao,\nYuchen Hu\n, Anna Zink, Caroline G. Dunn, Mark J. Soto, Bradley J. Herring.\nJournal of General Internal Medicine\n, 35(6), 2020.\nTeaching\nECON293/MGTECON634 Machine Learning and Causal Inference\n, Teaching assistant, Spring 2020-2023.\nMS&E226 Fundamentals of Data Science\n, Teaching assistant, Autumn 2021-2022.\nBST224 Survival Methods in Clinical Research\n, Teaching assistant, Summer 2018-2019.\n© Untitled. All rights reserved.\nDesign:\nHTML5 UP"
  },
