    "homepage_text": "Jianglin Lu-盧江林\nJianglin Lu, Northeastern Unversity\nJianglin (Johnny) Lu   盧江林\nGoogle Scholar\nLinkedIn\nGithub\nWeChat\nSMILE Lab,\nDepartment of ECE,\nCollege of Engineering,\nNortheastern University,\n360 Huntington Avenue, Boston, MA 02115, USA\nEmail:\njianglinlu\nat\noutlook\ndot\ncom\nBiography\nI am a Ph.D. candidate in the\nSMILE Lab\nof the\nDepartment of ECE\n,\nNortheastern University (NEU)\n,\r\n\t\t  under the supervision of\nProf. Yun Raymond Fu\n. \r\n\t\t  I have interned at\nAmazon\n,\nAdobe Research\nand\nTencent Music Entertainment\n.\r\n\t\t  My current research interests primarily focus on\ngenerative AI, multimodal LLMs, vision-language-action models, reinforcement learning, and AI agents\n.\nSelected Publications\nPreprint\nTrajectory Prediction Meets Large Language Models: A Survey.\n[\nPDF\n][\nCode\n]\nYi Xu, Ruining Yang, Yitian Zhang,\nJianglin Lu\n, Mingyuan Zhang, Yizhou Wang, Lili Su, Yun Fu.\narXiv preprint arXiv:2506.03408, 2025.\nConference\nRestore-R1: Efficient Image Restoration Agents via Reinforcement Learning with Multimodal LLM Perceptual Feedback.\n[\nPDF\n][\nCode\n]\n(coming soon)\nJianglin Lu\n, Yuanwei Wu, Ziyi Zhao, Hongcheng Wang, Felix Jimenez, Abrar Majeedi, Yun Fu.\nThe IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (\nCVPR\n) Findings, 2026.\nRef-Adv: Exploring MLLM Visual Reasoning in Referring Expression Tasks.\n[\nPDF\n][\nProject Page\n][[\nCode\n]\nQihua Dong, Yang Kuo, Ju Lin, Handong Zhao, Yitian Zhang, Yizhou Wang, Huimin Zeng,\nJianglin Lu\n, Yun Fu.\nThe Fourteenth International Conference on Learning Representations (\nICLR\n), 2026.\nSeeing Through Words: Controlling Visual Retrieval Quality with Language Models.\n[\nPDF\n][\nCode\n]\nJianglin Lu\n, Simon Jenni, Kushal Kafle, Jing Shi, Handong Zhao, Yun Fu.\nThe Fourteenth International Conference on Learning Representations (\nICLR\n), 2026.\nThe Indra Representation Hypothesis for Multimodal Alignment.\n[\nPDF\n][\nCode\n]\nJianglin Lu\n, Hailing Wang, Kuo Yang, Yitian Zhang, Simon Jenni, Yun Fu.\nThe Thirty-ninth Annual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n), 2025.\nOutlier-Aware Post-Training Quantization for Image Super-Resolution.\n[\nPDF\n][\nCode\n]\nHailing Wang,\nJianglin Lu\n, Yitian Zhang, Yun Fu.\nInternational Conference on Computer Vision (\nICCV\nHighlight\n), 2025.\nRepresentation Potentials of Foundation Models for Multimodal Alignment: A Survey.\n[\nPDF\n][\nCode\n]\nJianglin Lu\n, Hailing Wang, Yi Xu, Yizhou Wang, Kuo Yang, Yun Fu.\n(Cited in the International AI Safety Report 2026)\nThe 2025 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (\nEMNLP\n), 2025.\nUnequal Scientific Recognition in the Age of LLMs.\n[\nPDF\n]\nYixuan Liu, Abel Elekes,\nJianglin Lu\n, Rodrigo Dorantes-Gilardi, Albert-Laszlo Barabasi.\nThe 2025 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (\nEMNLP Findings\n), 2025.\nScale-Free Graph-Language Models.\n[\nPDF\n][\nCode\n]\nJianglin Lu\n, Yixuan Liu, Yitian Zhang, Yun Fu.\nThe Thirteenth International Conference on Learning Representations (\nICLR\n), 2025.\nLatent Graph Inference with Limited Supervision.\n[\nPDF\n][\nProject Page\n][\nCode\n]\nJianglin Lu\n, Yi Xu, Huan Wang, Yue Bai, Yun Fu.\nThe Thirty-seventh Annual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n), 2023.\nProfessional Services\nConference Reviewer: ICML, NeurIPS, ICLR, CVPR, ICCV, ECCV, ACL, EMNLP, AAAI, MM, KDD, AISTATS\nJournal Reviewer: TPAMI, TIP, TKDE, TNNLS, TKDD, PR\nPersonal Links\nAwesome Papers in Machine Learning, Computer Vision, Pattern Recognition, and Data Mining\r\n\t\t\t\t[\nLink\n]\nVision–Language–Action Models\n(coming soon)\nNetwork Quantization\n(coming soon)\nVision–Language Models\nDomain Adaptation\nGraph Neural Networks\nLearning with Noisy Labels\n© Jianglin Lu |\nLast updated: Feb 01, 2026"
