 Zhang, Kaiqi Huang,\nHao Chen\n, Guangkai Yang\n[\nLink\n] [\nLink\n] [\nLink\n]\nAwards & Honors\n2024 Outstanding Merit Student of University of Chinese Academy of Sciences\n(中国科学院大学三好学生标兵)\n2023 Zhu Li Yuehua Excellent Doctoral Student Award of Chinese Academy of Sciences\n(中国科学院朱李月华优秀博士生奖学金)\n2023 CSC Scholarship\n(国家留学基金委奖学金)\n2022, 2023, 2024 Merit Student of University of Chinese Academy of Sciences\n(中国科学院大学三好学生）\n2019 - 2025 Academic Scholarship of University of Chinese Academy of Sciences\n(中国科学院大学学业奖学金）\n2017 Merit Student of Chinese Academy of Sciences\n(中国科学院优秀共青团员）\n2017, 2018 Merit Student of University of Chinese Academy of Sciences\n(中国科学院大学优秀共青团员）\n2017 Third Prize of the National Scholarship\n2018 Second Prize in China Undergraduate Mathematical Contest in Modeling\n2017, 2018 Outstanding Individual of Students’ Association Union\n2018 Third Prize of the “UCAS Cup” Innovation and Entrepreneurship Competition\n2018 Outstanding Volunteer of IEEE UCAS Branch\n2017 Outstanding Member of UCAS National Flag Guard\n2017 Third Prize in the 4th Undergraduate National Flag Raiser Competition\nProfessional Services\nChair\nSession chair for\nAAG 2024\nInvited Talks\n2024.4.16 Invited talk “Calibrating Driving Flow Data through the Integration of Big and Small Data: The Graph Transformer Network Approach” at session\nSpaceTimeAI for Multi-Model Data Fusion\nof\nthe 2024 annual meeting of the American Association of Geographers\n2024.3.19 Invited talk “Spatio-Temporal Data Fusion” at\nSpatial-Temporal Data Analysis and Data Mining (CEGE0042)\n, a core course for MSc Geospatial Science and MSc Spatio-temporal Analytics and Big Data Mining, led by\nDr James Haworth\n2023.9.29 Invited talk “Multi-Agent Deep Reinforcement Learning: Background and Recent Works” at\nSpaceTimeLab, University College London\n2023.9.8 Invited talk “Research Experience Sharing” at\nSchool of Emergency Management Science and Engineering, University of Chinese Academy of Sciences\n2022.8