    "homepage_text": "Kaipeng Zhang\nToogle navigation\nHome\nAbout\nPublications\nEducation\nAcademic Service\nAward\nWork Experience\nKaipeng Zhang\nPrincipal Researcher\nShanda AI Research\nkaipeng.zhang[at]shanda.com\nAbout Me\nI am a principal researcher in Shanda AI Research and a Phd advisor in Shanghai Innovation Institute. I currently focuse on world model and game AI.\nBefore coming to Shanda AI, I was a researcher in Shanghai AI Lab and focused on MLLMs and image/video generation. I received my PhD degree in 2022 from The University of Tokyo, supervised by Prof.\nYoichi Sato\n, M.S. degree in 2018 from National Taiwan University supervised by Prof.\nWinston Hsu\n, and B.E. degree in 2016 from Donghua University. I was a researcher in Shanghai AI Lab and SenseTime. I also did research internships at Microsoft Research Asia, Tencent AI Lab, and MMLAB of SIAT..\nI'm looking scientists, engineers and research interns interested in world models and AI-native games, especially those interested in developing games like Sword Art Online and Log Horizon. Please send me your resume.\nFormer Interns [First-author papers done in internship]\nPhD\nChuanhao Li\n[1 NeurIPS, 1 ICLR]\nYue Yang\n[1 ICML, 1 ICLR, 1 CVPR, 1 ICASSP]\nHao Zhang\n[1 IJCV, 1 TIFS]\nYuqi Lin\n[1 CVPR, 1 ICLR, 1 AAAI]\nYefei He\n[1 ICML, 2 ICCV]\nZhaopan Xu\n[1 ACL Findings, 2 preprints]\nYansheng Qiu\n[2 preprints]\nMaster\nWenshuo Peng\n[1 CVPR, 1 IJCV, 1 AAAI, 1 NAACL Findings]\nZiyao Guo\n[1 ICLR, 1 preprint]\nLirui Zhao\n[1 CVPR, 1 preprint]\nKaining Ying\n[1 ICML]\nPengfei Zhou\n[1 CVPR, 1 NeurIPS, 1 AAAI]\nMing Li\n[1 NeurIPS, 1 preprint]\nBachlor\nTianle Zhang\n[1 NeurIPS]\nYuxuan Xie\n[1 IJCAI]\nTianhua Li\n[1 IJCAI]\nYanqing Liu\n[1 preprint]\nHaoquan Zhang\n[1 preprint]\nShaohen Lin\n[1 preprint]\nCurrent Interns\nUpdating\nRecent Publications (2024, 2025, 2026)\n[Selected Technical Report]\n[World Model]\nYume: An Interactive World Generation Model\n[Video Generation]\nOmniCustom: Sync