    "homepage_text": "Zhihang Fu’s Homepage\nZhihang Fu | 付志航\nAdvanced Algorithm Engineer\nFollow\nHangzhou, China\nAlibaba Cloud\nEmail\nGoogle Scholar\nLinkedIn\n🔆 About Me | 个人简介\nI am currently an Advanced Algorithm Engineer at\nAlibaba Cloud\n. I received my Ph.D degree from\nZhejiang University\nin 2019, advised by\nProf. Yaowu Chen\n. Before that, I got my Bachelor degree from\nChu Kochen College\n, Zhejiang University.\n我目前在阿里云飞天实验室工作，所在团队致力于通义千问的行业实践，推动AI大模型时代行业的智能化升级。我2019年博士毕业于\n浙江大学\n，本科毕业于浙江大学\n竺可桢学院\n。\n🎓️ Reasearch Interest | 研究方向\nI am currently focusing on the application and research on Large Language Models, particularly aiming to better address challenges such as\nknowledge injection, hallucination, and reasoning through post training\n. In terms of the practical implementation of LLM in industry, my team has engaged in various domain-specific practices.\n我当前从事LLM应用算法及研究，致力于通过后训练更好地解决领域知识注入、幻觉、推理等问题。团队在奥运会国际赛事以及国内教育等场景均有行业化落地。\n团队十分欢迎LLM研究及行业应用方向上的\n🎖️优秀实习生和正式员工\n。如果您有兴趣，请随时与我联系。详情请见\nInternship页面\n。\n🔥 News | 动态\nMay-2025\nThe paper\nStruXGPT2\nhas been accepted by\nACL’25\n.\nMay-2025\nThe paper\nROPO\nhas been accepted by\nICML’25\n.\nFeb-2025\nThe paper\nROUTE\nhas been accepted by\nICLR’25\n.\nSep-2024\nThree papers have been accepted by\nNeurIPS’24\n.\nStruXGPT\non LLM Corpus Structurization.\nThinking-Bias\nof LLM behaviors.\nImOOD\non Imbalanced OOD Detection.\nFeb-2024\nHonored as the\nOutstanding Research Mentor\n2024 in Alibaba Cloud.\nCongratulations to my intern\nKai Liu\nfor his excellent achievements!\nJan-2024\nThe paper\nINSIDE\non LLM hallucination has been accepted by\nICLR’24\n.\n📜 Professional Services | 学术服务\nProgramme Committee Member of NeurIPS (2023-2025).\nProgramme Committee Member of ICLR (2023-2024).\nProgramme Committee Member of ICML (2023-2024).\nProgramme Committee Member of CVPR (2024).\nProgramme Committee Member of AAAI (2024).\nProgramme Committee Member of KDD (2023).\nRegular Reviewer of IEEE TCSVT, TIP.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nCV - Zhihang Fu’s Homepage\nZhihang Fu | 付志航\nAdvanced Algorithm Engineer\nFollow\nHangzhou, China\nAlibaba Cloud\nEmail\nGoogle Scholar\nLinkedIn\nCV\nEducation\nPh.D in Version Control Theory, GitHub University, 2018 (expected)\nM.S. in Jekyll, GitHub University, 2014\nB.S. in GitHub, GitHub University, 2012\nWork experience\nSpring 2024: Academic Pages Collaborator\nGithub University\nDuties includes: Updates and improvements to template\nSupervisor: The Users\nFall 2015: Research Assistant\nGithub University\nDuties included: Merging pull requests\nSupervisor: Professor Hub\nSummer 2015: Research Assistant\nGithub University\nDuties included: Tagging issues\nSupervisor: Professor Git"
  },
