/27\nProject\n:\nGrant Research\nMultifunctional Host Materials for High-energy Aqueous Zinc-sulfur Batteries (高比能水系鋅硫電池用多功能宿主材料的研究)\nCHEN, Z.\n(PI) & LIU, Z. (CoPI)\nLU Research Committee\n1/07/25\n→\n30/06/26\nProject\n:\nGrant Research\nView all 4 projects / grants\nResearch output\n67\nJournal Article (refereed)\n10\nReview article\n2\nComment / Debate\n1\nBook Chapter\n1\nMore\n1\nPolicy or Profession paper\nEvolution of host materials for halogen-based batteries\nZHU, H., XU, W., DING, H.,\nCHEN, Z.\n, ZHI, C. & LI, X.,\n7 Jan 2026\n,\nIn:\nMatter.\n9\n,\n1\n,\np. 102529\n102529.\nResearch output\n:\nJournal Publications\n›\nReview article\n›\nOther Review\nMaterials Engineering\n100%\nA parts-per-million scale electrolyte additive for durable aqueous zinc batteries\nWANG, S., WANG, S., WEI, Z., WANG, Y., ZHANG, D.,\nCHEN, Z.\n& ZHI, C.,\n20 Feb 2025\n, (E-pub ahead of print)\nIn:\nNature Communications.\n16\n, 1800.\nResearch output\n:\nJournal Publications\n›\nJournal Article (refereed)\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nElectrolyte Additive\n100%\nZinc\n100%\nHydrogen Bonding\n33%\nRedox Flow Battery\n33%\nPlating\n33%\n84\nLink opens in a new tab\nCitations\n(Scopus)\nAqueous Alkaline Zinc-Iodine Battery with Two-Electron Transfer\nLI, X., LIU, T., LI, P., LIANG, G., HUANG, Z.,\nCHEN, Z.\n, CHEN, A., SU, Y., YANG, L., CAO, D. & ZHI, C.,\n21 Jan 2025\n,\nIn:\nACS Nano.\n19\n,\n2\n,\np. 2900-2908\n9 p.\nResearch output\n:\nJournal Publications\n›\nJournal Article (refereed)\n›\npeer-review\nCathode\n100%\nElectron Transfer\n100%\nEnergy Density\n50%\nHalide\n50%\nRedox Process\n50%\n34\nLink opens in a new tab\nCitations\n(Scopus)\nView all 81 research outputs\nPrizes\nSilver Medal - 5th Asia Exhibition of Innovations and Inventions Hong Kong\nCHEN, Z.\n(Recipient) &\nGUO, Y.\n(Recipient),\nDec 2025\nPrize\n:\nPrize (CDCF)\nsilver medal\n100%\nHong Kong\n100%\nAsia\n100%\nGeneva\n66%\nInternational exhibitions\n33%\nWorld's Top 2% Scientists by Stanford 2025\nCHE