    "homepage_text": "Zhen Liu's homepage\nZhen Liu (刘震)\nSICE, UESTC\nEmail:\nliuzhen03@std.uestc.edu.cn\n[\nGitHub\n]\n[\nGoogle Scholar\n]\nBiography\nZhen Liu received the B.S. and M.S. degrees in the College of Computer Science, Sichuan University (SCU) in 2018 and 2021, supervised by\nProf. Jiancheng Lv\n. He is currently pursuing the Ph.D. degree with the School of Information and Communication Engineering, University of Electronic Science and Technology of China (UESTC), supervised by\nProf. Shuaicheng Liu\nand\nProf. Bing Zeng\n. He was a Researcher with Megvii Research, Megvii Inc, from 2021 to 2024. His research interests include Computer Vision and Computer Graphics.\nExperiences\n2021.07 - 2024.08:\nFull Time Researcher\n, Megvii Research, Megvii Inc.\n2019.11 - 2021.06:\nResearch Intern\n, Megvii Research, Megvii Inc.\n2018.09 - 2021.06:\nM.S.\n, College of Computer Science, Sichuan University (SCU)\n2014.09 - 2018.06:\nB.S.\n, College of Computer Science, Sichuan University (SCU)\nNews\n[11/2025] One paper was accepted by\nAAAI\n2026 as oral presentation\n[11/2025] One paper was accepted by\nTCSVT\n[07/2025] One paper was accepted by\nICCV\n2025\n[12/2024] One paper was accepted by\nAAAI\n2025 as oral presentation\n[11/2024] One paper was accepted by\nTPAMI\nPublications\nRAW-Flow: Advancing RGB-to-RAW Image Reconstruction with Deterministic Latent Flow Matching\nZhen Liu\n*, Diedong Feng*(equal contribution), Hai Jiang, Liaoyuan Zeng, Hao Wang, Chaoyu Feng, Lei Lei, Bing Zeng, Shuaicheng Liu \n\t\tThe 40th AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (\nAAAI\n), 2026. (\nOral Presentation\n)\nSolving Ill-Posed Regions in High Dynamic Range Reconstruction with Uncertainty-Aware Diffusion Models\nZhen Liu\n, Hai Jiang, Haipeng Li, Shuaicheng Liu, Bing Zeng\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology (\nTCSVT\n), 2025.\n\t\t[\nPDF\n]\nLearning to See in the Extremely Dark\nHai Jiang, Binhao Guan,\nZhen Liu\n, Xiaohong Liu, Jian Yu, Zheng Liu, Songchen Han, Shuaicheng Liu\nIEEE International Conference on Computer Vision (\nICCV\n), 2025.\n\t\t[\nPDF\n] [\nCode\n]\nFlowPolicy: Enabling Fast and Robust 3D Flow-based Policy via Consistency Flow Matching for Robot Manipulation\nQinglun Zhang*,\nZhen Liu\n*(equal contribution), Haoqiang Fan, Guanghui Liu, Bing Zeng, Shuaicheng Liu\nThe 39th AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (\nAAAI\n), 2025. (\nOral Presentation\n)\n\t\t[\nPDF\n] [\nCode\n]\nMinimum Latency Deep Online Video Stabilization and its Extensions\nShuaicheng Liu, Zhuofan Zhang,\nZhen Liu\n, Ping Tan, Bing Zeng\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (\nTPAMI\n), 2025.\n\t\t[\nPDF\n]\nImproving Bracket Image Restoration and Enhancement with Flow-guided Alignment and Enhanced Feature Aggregation\nWenjie Lin,\nZhen Liu\n, Chengzhi Jiang, Mingyan Han, Ting Jiang, Shuaicheng Liu\narXiv Preprint, 2024.\n\t\t[\nPDF\n]\nNTIRE 2024 Challenge - BracketIRE\n(\nRunner-up Award\n)\nLow-Light Image Enhancement with Illumination-Aware Gamma Correction and Complete Image Modelling Network\nYinglong Wang*,\nZhen Liu\n*(equal contribution), Jianzhuang Liu, Songcen Xu, Shuaicheng Liu\nIEEE International Conference on Computer Vision (\nICCV\n), 2023.\n\t\t\t\t[\nPDF\n]\nMinimum Latency Deep Online Video Stabilization\nZhuofan Zhang*,\nZhen Liu\n*(equal contribution), Ping Tan, Bing Zeng, Shuaicheng Liu\nInternational Conference on Computer Vision (\nICCV\n), 2023.\n\t\t\t\t[\nPDF\n] [\nCode\n]\nGhost-free High Dynamic Range Imaging with Context-aware Transformer\nZhen Liu\n, Yinglong Wang, Bing Zeng, Shuaicheng Liu\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision (\nECCV\n), 2022.\n\t\t\t\t[\nPDF\n] [\nCode\n] [\nVideo\n]\nNTIRE 2022 Challenge on High Dynamic Range Imaging: Methods and Results\nEduardo Perez-Pellitero, Sibi Catley-Chandar, Richard Shaw, Ales Leonardis, Radu Timofte (and 88 others, including\nZhen Liu\n)\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition Workshops (\nCVPRW\n), 2022.\n\t\t\t\t[\nPDF\n]\nADNet: Attention-guided Deformable Convolutional Network for High Dynamic Range Imaging\nZhen Liu\n, Wenjie Lin, Xinpeng Li, Ting Jiang, Mingyan Han, Haoqiang Fan, Jian Sun, Shuaicheng Liu\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition Workshops (\nCVPRW\n), 2021.\n\t\t\t\t[\nPDF\n] [\nCode\n] [\nVideo\n]\nNTIRE 2021 Challenge - Multi-Frame HDR\n(\nWinner Award\n)\nNTIRE 2021 Challenge on High Dynamic Range Imaging: Dataset, Methods and Results\nEduardo Perez-Pellitero, Sibi Catley-Chandar, Ales Leonardis, Radu Timofte (and 42 others, including\nZhen Liu\n)\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition Workshops (\nCVPRW\n), 2021. \n\t\t\t\t[\nPDF\n]\nAcademic Services\nJournal Reviewer:\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (\nTPAMI\n), 2021 - present\nIEEE Transactions on Image Processing (\nTIP\n), 2022 - present\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision (\nIJCV\n), 2023 - present\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology (\nTCSVT\n), 2024 - present\nIEEE Transactions on Computational Imaging (\nTCI\n), 2023 - present\nIEEE Transactions on Instrumentation & Measurement (\nTIM\n), 2023 - present\nConference Reviewer:\nSIGGRAPH Asia, 2023\nConference on Neural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n), 2023, 2024\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (\nICLR\n), 2024\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (\nCVPR\n), 2023, 2024, 2026\nIEEE International Conference on Computer Vision (\nICCV\n), 2023, 2025\nAssociation for the Advancement of Artificial Intelligence (\nAAAI\n), 2025, 2026\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision (\nECCV\n), 2024\nIEEE Conference on Intelligent Robots and Systems (\nIROS\n), 2022, 2024"
