    "homepage_text": "Lei Shi\nLei Shi\n☰\n×\nProfile\nBio\nResearch\nResearch Interest\nPublication\nPatent\nSoftware\nOngoing Projects\nIndustry\nProjects\nActivity\nPresentations\nServices\nMiscellaneous\nTeaching\nCourses\nGallery\nAI news\nLei Shi\nImage credit to\nRita Lyu\n♥\nWelcome to my homepage!\nI am a\nResearch Scientist\nat Adobe Research, San Jose, CA.\nI obtained my Ph.D. in Berkeley Biostatistics in 2025. I am very fortunate to be advised by\r\nProfessor\nPeng Ding\nand \r\nProfessor\nJingshen Wang\n.\nI obtained my B.S degree from Shiing-Shen Chern Program in School of Mathematical Sciences, Nankai University in 2016.  I completed my undergraduate thesis under the supervision by Professor\nChangliang Zou\n.\nMore links:\nExperience\n01.2025 - 05.2025: External researcher at Airbnb, Inc;\n05.2024 - 11.2024: Internship at Adobe Research;\n06.2023 - 05.2024: Long-term Internship at Genentech;\nAwards\n2024 Google Cloud Platform Credits Award, Gemma 2 Academic Program\n2024 SCI Travel Scholarship, Society for Causal Inference\n2024 JSM Students Travel Award, San Francisco Bay Area Chapter of American Statistical Association\n2024 Winter Workshop on Causal Inference and its Applications, Travel Award\n2023 Outstanding Graduate Student Instructor Award\n2023 ENAR Distinguished Student Paper Award Winner\n2017 - 2019 National Scholarship, Ministry of Education, China\nLast edited  on 2026-03-11 21:48:50 PDT.\nPowered by\njemdoc + new design\n.\n\n---\n\nLei Shi\nLei Shi\n☰\n×\nProfile\nBio\nResearch\nResearch Interest\nPublication\nPatent\nSoftware\nOngoing Projects\nIndustry\nProjects\nActivity\nPresentations\nServices\nMiscellaneous\nTeaching\nCourses\nGallery\nAI news\nContact\nEmail\nBerkeley: leishi\nat\nberkeley\ndot\nedu\nPrivate: leishi1998\nat\ngmail\ndot\ncom\nMail\nLast edited  on February 6\nth\n2026  08:34PM (Time Zone: PST).\nPowered by\njemdoc + new design\n.\n\n---\n\nLei Shi\nLei Shi\n☰\n×\nProfile\nBio\nResearch\nResearch Interest\nPublication\nPatent\nSoftware\nOngoing Projects\nIndustry\nProjects\nActivity\nPresentations\nServices\nMiscellaneous\nTeaching\nCourses\nGallery\nAI news\nContact\nEmail\nBerkeley: leishi\nat\nberkeley\ndot\nedu\nPrivate: leishi1998\nat\ngmail\ndot\ncom\nMail\nLast edited  on February 6\nth\n2026  08:34PM (Time Zone: PST).\nPowered by\njemdoc + new design\n."
