    "homepage_text": "Search\nHe Zhao\nGreetings! This is my research page.\nI’m a Senior Research Scientist in machine learning at\nCSIRO\n(Australia’s national science agency) and an Adjunct Senior Research Fellow at\nMonash University\n. Previously, I obtained my PhD from Monash University and worked as a research fellow there.\nI’m interested in developing machine learning methods (e.g., deep learning, probabilistic methods, LLMs) to address problems in science domains.\nI serve as an Area Chair for NeurIPS and ICLR and I’m in the editorial board of Machine Learning Journal. I’m an IEEE Senior Member from 2026.\nMy\npaper\nwon the\nBest Student Paper Award\nat KDD 2023.\nSelected publications\n[TMLR 2026] HiBaNG: Hierarchical Bayesian Nonparametric Granger Causal Discovery in Low-Data Regimes\nH. Zhao\n, V. Kitsios, T. O’kane, E. V. Bonilla\npaper comming soon\n[IJCV 2026] Near OOD Detection for Vision-Language Prompt Learning with Contrastive Logit Score\nM.C. Jung, J. Dipnall, B. Gabbe,\nH. Zhao\npaper and code comming soon\n[ICLR 2026] Unifying Stable Optimization and Reference Regularization in RLHF\nL. He, Q. Qu,\nH. Zhao\n, S. Wan, D. Wang, L. Yao, T. Liu\npaper and code comming soon\n[ICLR 2026] LLM as an Algorithmist: Enhancing Anomaly Detectors via Programmatic Synthesis\nH. Ye, J. Li,\nH. Zhao\n, M. Zhuge, D. Guo, Y. Chang, H. Zha\npaper and code comming soon\n[ICLR 2026] Imitating the Truth: Attention-aware Truth-Guided Enhancement for Hallucination Mitigation in Large Vision-Language Models\nH. Ren, Z. Wang, Y. Yang,\nH. Zhao\n, F. Tang, D. Guo, Y. Chang\npaper and code comming soon\n[NeurIPS 2025,\nSpotlight, Top 3%\n] LLM Meeting Decision Trees on Tabular Data\nH. Ye, J. Li,\nH. Zhao\n, D. Guo, Y. Chang\nlink\n,\ncode\n[ACL 2025,\nMain Conference\n] Neural Topic Modeling with Large Language Models in the Loop\nX. Yang,\nH. Zhao\n, W. Xu, Y. Qi, J. Lu, D. Phung, L. Du\nlink\n,\ncode\n[ICML 2025,\nOral, Top 1%\n] Rényi Neural Processes\nX. Wang,\nH. Zhao\n, E. V. Bonilla\nlink\n,\ncode\n[TACL 2025,\nPresented at ACL 2025\n] LLM Reading Tea Leaves: Automatically Evaluating Topic Models with Large Language Models\nX. Yang,\nH. Zhao\n, D. Phung, W. Buntine, L. Du\nTransactions of the Association for Computational Linguistics\nlink\n,\ncode\n[CVPR 2025] Balancing Two Classifiers via A Simplex ETF Structure for Model Calibration\nJ. Ni,\nH. Zhao\n, J. Gao, D. Guo, H. Zha\nlink\n[CVPR 2025] FedAWA: Adaptive Optimization of Aggregation Weights in Federated Learning Using Client Vectors\nC. Shi,\nH. Zhao\n, B. Zhang, M. Zhou, D. Guo, Y. Chang\nlink\n,\ncode\n[CVPR 2025] Beyond Words: Augmenting Discriminative Richness via Diffusions in Unsupervised Prompt learning\nH. Ren, F. Tang,\nH. Zhao\n, Z. Wang, D. Guo, Y. Chang\nlink\n[ICLR 2025] DRL: Decomposed Representation Learning for Tabular Anomaly Detection\nH. Ye,\nH. Zhao\n, W. Fan, M. Zhou, D. Guo, Y. Chang\nlink\n[ICLR 2025] FedLWS: Federated Learning with Adaptive Layer-wise Weight Shrinking\nC. Shi, J. Li,\nH. Zhao\n, D. Guo, Y. Chang\nlink\n[ICML 2024] Parameter Estimation in DAGs from Incomplete Data via Optimal Transport\nV. Vo, T. Le, L. T. Vuong,\nH. Zhao\n, E. V. Bonilla, D. Phung\nlink\n,\ncode\n[ICML 2024] Distribution Alignment Optimization through Neural Collapse for Long-tailed Classification\nJ. Gao,\nH. Zhao\n, D. Guo, H. Zha\nlink\n,\ncode\n[ICLR 2024,\nSpotlight, Top 5%\n] PTaRL: Prototype-based Tabular Representation Learning via Space Calibration\nH. Ye, W. Fan, X. Song, S. Zheng,\nH. Zhao\n, D. Guo, Y. Chang\nlink\n,\ncode\n[NeurIPS 2023] Beyond Unimodal: Generalising Neural Processes for Multimodal Uncertainty Estimation\nM.C. Jung,\nH. Zhao\n, J. Dipnall, L. Du\nlink\n,\ncode\n[NeurIPS 2023] NPCL: Neural Processes for Uncertainty-Aware Continual Learning\nS. Jha, D. Gong,\nH. Zhao\n, L. Yao\nlink\n,\ncode\n[NeurIPS 2023] Enhancing Minority Classes by Mixing: An Adaptative Optimal Transport Approach for Long-tailed Classification\nJ. Gao,\nH. Zh