    "homepage_text": "Siyuan Li - Home\nSiyuan Li (李斯源)\nAssociate Professor\nFaculty of Computing\n@Harbin Institute of Technology\nAbout Me\nI am currently an Associate Professor in the Faculty of Computing at\nHarbin Institue of Technology\nand a member in the\nPattern Recognition and Intelligent System Research Center\n. \r\n        Previously, I obtained my Ph.D. in computer science under the supervision of\nProf. Chongjie Zhang\n(张崇洁)  from the \r\n          Institute for Interdisciplinary Information Sciences (IIIS),\nTsinghua University\n. My research interests include\nembodied AI\nand\nmulti-agent learning\n.\nOpenings\nOur lab has active openings for Master, PhD, and Postdoc positions. Interested applicants please contact me through email with your CV, representative papers, and transcripts.\nPublications\n2025\nSafe Planner: Empowering Safety Awareness in Large Pre-Trained Models for Robot Task Planning.\nSiyuan Li\n, Feifan Liu, Lingfei Cui, Jiani Lu, Qinqin Xiao, Xirui Yang, Peng Liu, Kewu Sun#, Zhe Ma, Xun Wang\nAAAI 2025:\nThe Thirty-Ninth AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\nSkillTree: Explainable Skill-Based Deep Reinforcement Learning for Long-Horizon Control Tasks.\nYongyan Wen,\nSiyuan Li\n#, Rongchang Zuo, Lei Yuan, Hangyu Mao, Peng Liu\nAAAI 2025:\nThe Thirty-Ninth AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n2024\nRobust Visual Imitation Learning with Inverse Dynamics Representations.\nSiyuan Li\n*, Xun Wang*, Rongchang Zuo, Kewu Sun, Lingfei Cui, Jishiyu Ding, Peng Liu, Zhe Ma\nAAAI 2024:\nThe Thirty-Eighth AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\nPDF\nIMM: An Imitative Reinforcement Learning Approach with Predictive Representation Learning for Automatic Market Making.\nHui Niu*,\nSiyuan Li\n*, Jiahao Zheng, Zhouchi Lin, Bo An, Jian Li, Jian Guo\nIJCAI 2024:\nThe Thirty-Third International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence\nMacMic: Executing Iceberg Orders via Hierarchical Reinforcement Learning.\nHui Niu*,\nSiyuan Li\n*, Jian Li\nIJCAI 2024:\nThe Thirty-Third International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence\nA Multi-Agent Learning Framework for Mixed-Integer Linear Programming.\nYuchen Jing, Binyan Liang,\nSiyuan Li\n#, Feifan Liu, Wei Zhao, Peng Liu\nINFOR 2024 (JCR-Q1):\nInformation Systems and Operational Research\nJoint Learning of Volume Scheduling and Order Placement Policies for Optimal Order Execution.\nSiyuan Li\n, Hui Niu, Jiani Lu, Peng Liu\nMathematics 2024 (JCR-Q1)\nToward Automatic Market Making: An Imitative Reinforcement Learing Approach with Predictive Representation Learning.\nSiyuan Li\n, Yafei Chen, Hui Niu, Jiahao Zheng, Zhouchi Lin, Jian Li, Jian Guo, Zhen Wang\nTETCI 2024 (JCR-Q1):\nIEEE Transactions on Emerging Topics in Computational Intelligence\n2023\nIOB: integrating optimization transfer and behavior transfer for multi‑policy reuse.\nSiyuan Li\n, Hao Li, Jin Zhang, Zhen Wang, Peng Liu, Chongjie Zhang\nJAAMAS 2023:\nAutonomous Agents and Multi-Agent Systems\nPDF\nLearning to Solve Tasks with Exploring Prior Behaviours.\nRuiqi Zhu,\nSiyuan Li\n, Tianhong Dai, Chongjie Zhang, Oya Celiktutan\nIROS 2023:\nThe 2023 IEEE/RSJ International Conference on Intelligent Robots and Systems\nPDF\nClassifying Ambiguous Identities in Stochastic Games with Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning.\nShijie Han,\nSiyuan Li\n#, Bo An, Wei Zhao, Peng Liu\nJAAMAS 2023:\nAutonomous Agents and Multi-Agent Systems\nPDF\nBehavior Contrastive Learning for Unsupervised Skill Discovery.\nRushuai Yang, Chenjia Bai, Hongyi Guo,\nSiyuan Li\n, Bin Zhao, Zhen Wang, Peng Liu, Xuelong Li\nICML 2023:\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning\nPDF\nFlow to Control: Offline Reinforcement Learning with Lossless Primitive Discovery.\nYiqin Yang, Hao Hu, Wenzhe Li,\nSiyuan Li\n, Jun Yang, Qianchuan Zhao, Chongjie Zhang\nAAAI 2023:\nThe Thirty-Seventh AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\nPDF\n2022 and Before\nCUP: Critic-Guided Policy Reuse.\nJin Zhang,\nSiyuan Li\n, Chongjie Zhang\nNeurIPS 2022 (Spotlight):\nAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems\nPDF\n|\nCode\nMetaTrader: A Reinforcement Learning Approach Integrating Diverse Policies for Portfolio Optimization.\nHui Niu*,\nSiyuan Li\n*, Jian Li\nCIKM 2022:\nThe 31st ACM International Conference on Information and Knowledge Management\nPDF\nActive Hierarchical Exploration with Stable Subgoal Representation Learning.\nSiyuan Li\n, Jin Zhang, Jianhao Wang, Yang Yu, Chongjie Zhang\nICLR 2022:\nThe Tenth International Conference on Learning Representations\nPDF\n|\nVideo\n|\nCode\nOffline Reinforcement Learning with Reverse Model-based Imagination.\nJianhao Wang, Wenzhe Li, Haozhe Jiang, Guangxiang Zhu,\nSiyuan Li\n, Chongjie Zhang\nNeurIPS 2021:\nAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems\nPDF\n|\nVideo\n|\nCode\nLearning Subgoal Representations with Slow Dynamics.\nSiyuan Li\n*, Lulu Zheng*, Jianhao Wang, Chongjie Zhang\nICLR 2021:\nThe Ninth International Conference on Learning Representations\nPDF\n|\nVideo\n|\nCode\nDeep Reinforcement Learning with Hierarchical Structures.\nSiyuan Li\nIJCAI DC 2021:\nThe Thirtieth International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence Doctoral Consortium\nPDF\nHierarchical Reinforcement Learning with Advantage-Based Auxiliary Rewards.\nSiyuan Li\n*, Rui Wang*, Minxue Tang, Chongjie Zhang\nNeurIPS 2019:\nAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems\nPDF\n|\nVideo\n|\nCode\nContext-Aware Policy Reuse.\nSiyuan Li\n, Fangda Gu, Guangxiang Zhu, Chongjie Zhang\nAAMAS 2019 (Oral):\nInternational Conference on Autonomous Agents and MultiAgent Systems\nPDF\n|\nCode\nAn Optimal Online Method of Selecting Source Policies for Reinforcement Learning.\nSiyuan Li\n, Chongjie Zhang\nAAAI 2018 (Spotlight):\nThe Thirty-Second AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\nPDF\nEducation\nPh.D. in Computer Science\nIIIS, Tsinghua University @ Beijing, China, 2017 -- 2022\nDeep Reinforcement Learning\nB.Sc. in Telecommunication Engineering\nBeijing Univers