    "homepage_text": "Zhiyuan's Website\nEnglish\n中文\nHome\nResearch\nTeaching\nNotebooks\nEvents\n©co-designed with copilot\nZhiyuan Chen [陈志远]\nAssistant Professor\nBusiness School, Renmin University of China\nEmail:\nchenzhiyuan@rmbs.ruc.edu.cn\nHello, welcome to my website! I obtained my PhD degree at the\nDepartment of Economics\n,\nPennsylvania State University\n. My supervisors are\nJonathan Eaton\nand\nMark Roberts\n, with\nJingting Fan\nand\nJames Tybout\nas  my committee members.\nMy research fields are industrial organization and macro development. In particular, I am interested in topics on technological change, innovation and industrial policy. I seek to combine accurate micro estimates with meaningful macro implications, with an emphasis on the modelling and methodology development.\nCV\n简历\nScholar\nCNKI\nGitHub\nRecent Updates\n2026-01-20\n中国经济研究专题研究会，主题演讲人 @\n人大经济学院\n2026-01-18\nThe methodology paper proposing a new method of identifying treatment effects on productivity accepted @\nRAND Journal of Economics\n2026-01-01\n国家自然科学基金委专项项目\n“基础研究支撑经济发展数据系统构建与集成”，子课题负责人\n2025-12-30\n人大新闻网报道\nJDE发表论文： “首创机组层面分析框架，破解电力行业碳管制效率难题”\n2025-12-26\nThe paper on applying structural production function estimation and counterfactual analyses to the problem of regulating coal generators forthcoming\n@\nJournal of Development Economics\n2025-12-19\n第二届“香樟书院”学术讲堂，主讲嘉宾\n@\n湖南科技大学商学院\n2025-11-15\n第五届香樟产业经济学论坛，主旨演讲嘉宾\n@\n安徽工业大学\n2025-09-03\nInvited FSS-DECO Seminar\n@\nUniversity of Macau\n2025-08-14\nPresentation at Eaton's Forum hosted by International Economics and Finance Society, China @\n对外经济与贸易大学\n2025-05-19\nInvited Presentation at ISEM Conference: Frontiers of Empirical Research in China @\n首都经济与贸易大学ISEM\n2023-07-02\nChina Financial Research Conference @\n清华五道口\n.\n2021-07-12\n7th International Young Finance Scholars' Conference (virtual)  @\n北大汇丰商学院\n2022-06-22\nPresentation at 2022 Asian Meeting of Econometric Society @\nCHUK-Shenzhen\n访客\n·\n访问"
  },
