    "homepage_text": "Qingwei Lin 林庆维 at Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nQingwei Lin 林庆维\nPartner Research Manager\nAbout\nQingwei Lin （林庆维） is a Partner Research Manager in the DKI (Data Knowledge Intelligence) research area. He is leading a team of researchers working on AI/ML technologies, with innovations in Algorithms, Agents, and LLMs. In Cloud Intelligence area, Qingwei has over 100 publications at top-tier conferences such as Neurips, ICLR, AAAI, ICSE, FSE, OSDI, NSDI, etc., and got Best Research Paper Award at ISSRE and SIGSOFT Distinguished Paper Award at ESEC/FSE. The research technologies have been transferred into multiple Microsoft products, such as Microsoft Azure, Microsoft365, Windows, Bing, etc, and made substantial improvements. Qingwei hosted Microsoft company-wide “Cloud Service Intelligence Summit” as the Chair for 5 consecutive years. He joined Microsoft Research in 2006.\nHis recent publications:\nhttps://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/people/qlin/publications\n林庆维 是微软全球合伙人，首席研究员，首席研究经理。他的研究领域包括人工智能，大模型，云智能，数据智能。\nOpens in a new tab\nResearch areas\nAlgorithms\nArtificial intelligence\nProgramming languages and software engineering\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on Instagram\nSubscribe to our RSS feed\nShare this page:\nShare on X\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nShare on Reddit\n\n---\n\nQingwei Lin 林庆维 at Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nQingwei Lin 林庆维\nPartner Research Manager\nOther\nOpens in a new tab\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on Instagram\nSubscribe to our RSS feed\nShare this page:\nShare on X\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nShare on Reddit\n\n---\n\nQingwei Lin 林庆维 at Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nQingwei Lin 林庆维\nPartner Research Manager\nOther\nOpens in a new tab\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on Instagram\nSubscribe to our RSS feed\nShare this page:\nShare on X\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nShare on Reddit\n\n---\n\nQingwei Lin 林庆维 at Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nQingwei Lin 林庆维\nPartner Research Manager\nOther\nOpens in a new tab\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on Instagram\nSubscribe to our RSS feed\nShare this page:\nShare on X\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nShare on Reddit\n\n---\n\nQingwei Lin 林庆维 at Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nQingwei Lin 林庆维\nPartner Research Manager\nOther\nOpens in a new tab\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on Instagram\nSubscribe to our RSS feed\nShare this page:\nShare on X\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nShare on Reddit\n\n---\n\nQingwei Lin 林庆维 at Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nQingwei Lin 林庆维\nPartner Research Manager\nOther\nOpens in a new tab\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on Instagram\nSubscribe to our RSS feed\nShare this page:\nShare on X\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nShare on Reddit\n\n---\n\nQingwei Lin 林庆维 at Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nQingwei Lin 林庆维\nPartner Research Manager\nOther\nOpens in a ne