C. & Kirchhoff, F.,\n21 Apr 2023\n,\nIn:\niScience.\n26\n,\n4\n, 106395.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nSARS Coronavirus\n100%\nCoronaviridae\n100%\nHumans\n100%\nSevere Acute Respiratory Syndrome\n66%\nIFITM3\n50%\n13\nScopus \n citations\nInterferon antagonists encoded by SARS-CoV-2 at a glance\nLee, J. H.\n, Koepke, L., Kirchhoff, F. & Sparrer, K. M. J.,\nApr 2023\n,\nIn:\nMedical Microbiology and Immunology.\n212\n,\n2\n,\np. 125-131\n7 p.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nReview article\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nInterferon\n100%\nSevere Acute Respiratory Syndrome Coronavirus 2\n100%\nInterferon Type I\n100%\nSARS Coronavirus\n100%\nAntivirus Agent\n57%\n25\nScopus \n citations\nView all 29 Research outputs"
