    "homepage_text": "Xinxin Zuo's Home\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nXinxin Zuo's Home\nXinxin Zuo\nAbout Me\nI am an Assistant Professor in the Department of\nElectrical and Computer Engineering\nat\nConcordia University\n. Prior to joining Concordia, I was a Staff Researcher at Huawei Canada and a Postdoctoral Fellow at the University of Alberta. My research interests lie in machine learning and computer vision, with a recent focus on 3D AIGC, embodied AI, human motion generation, and 3D reconstruction. I currently serve as an Associate Editor for\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia\nand as an Area Chair for\nNeurIPS\n2025 and\nICLR\n2026.\nN\news\nServing as an\nAssociate Editor\nfor\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia(TMM)\nFour papers on Human Motion\nVideo Editing\nUI code\nGaussian Splatting  accepted by\nCVPR'2\n6\nPaper on\nImage Composition\nis accepted by\nICLR\n'2\n6\nServ\ned\nas an Area Chair for\nICLR\n'2\n6\nServed as an Area Chair for\nNeurIPS'25\nPaper on\nPoint Cloud Compeletion\nis accepted by\nNeurIPS\n'25\nPaper on\nSketch to Pose prediction\nis accepted by\nSIGGRAPH Asia\n'25\nPaper on\nText-3D avatar\nis accepted by\nICCV\n'25\nTwo p\napers on\n3D GS inpainting\nObject replacement\nare\naccepted by\nCVPR\n'25\nPaper on\nMotion Synthesis\nis accepted by\nICLR'2\n5\nSelected\nPublication   (\nFull\n)\n3D AIGC\nGenerating Diverse and Natural 3D Human Motions from Text\nChuan Guo\n,\nShihao Zou\n, Xinxin Zuo,\nSen Wang\n,\nWei Ji\n,\nXingyu Li\n,\nLi Cheng\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(CVPR)\n, 2022\nTM2T: Stochastic and Tokenized Modeling for the Reciprocal Generation of 3D Human Motions and Texts\nChuan Guo\n, Xinxin Zuo,\nSen Wang\n,\nLi Cheng\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV)\n, 2022\nAction2video: Generating Videos of Human 3D Actions\nChuan Guo\n, Xinxin Zuo,\nSen Wang\n, Xinshuang Liu,\nShihao Zou\n,\nMinglun Gong\n,\nLi Cheng\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision (IJCV)\n, 2022\nDecorate3D: Text-Driven High-Quality Texture Generation for Mesh Decoration in the Wild\nYanhui Guo, Xinxin Zuo, Peng Dai,\nJuwei Lu\n,\nXiaolin Wu\n,\nLi Cheng\n, Youliang Yan, Songcen Xu and Xiaofei Wu\nNeural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS)\n,\n2\n023\nAvatar Modeling\nDetailed Avatar Recovery from Single Image\nHao Zhu\n, Xinxin Zuo, Haotian Yang,\nSen Wang\n,\nXun Cao\n,\nRuigang Yang\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (TPAMI)\n,\n2022\nSparseFusion: Dynamic Human Avatar Modeling from Sparse RGBD Images\nXinxin Zuo,\nSen Wang\n,\nJiangbin Zheng\n,\nWeiwei Yu\n,\nMinglun Gong\n,\nRuigang Yang\n,\nLi Cheng\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia (TMM)\n, 2021\n3D Human Shape Reconstruction from a Polarization Image\nShihao Zou\n, Xinxin Zuo,\nYiming Qian\n,\nSen Wang\n, Chi Xu,\nMinglun Gong\n,\nLi Cheng\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV)\n, 2020\n3D Object Reconstruction\nObject Wake-up: 3D Object Rigging from a Single Image\nJi Yang\n, Xinxin Zuo,\nSen Wang\n, Zhenbo Yu,\nXingyu Li\n, Bingbing Ni,\nMinglun Gong\n,\nLi Cheng\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV),\n2022\nDetailed Surface Geometry and Albedo Recovery from RGB-D Video Under Natural Illumination\nXinxin Zuo,\nSen Wang\n,\nJiangbin Zheng\n,\nZhigeng Pan\n,\nRuigang Yang\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (TPAMI)\n,\n2020\nInteractive Visual Hull Refinement for Specular and Transparent Object Surface Reconstruction\nXinxin Zuo, Chao Du,\nSen Wang\n,\nJiangbin Zheng\n,\nRuigang Yang\nI\nEEE International Conference on Computer Vision\n(ICCV)\n, 2015\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\n\n---\n\nXinxin Zuo's Home - Curriculum Vitae\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nXinxin Zuo's Home\nCurriculum Vitae\nResearch Interests\nMachine Learning\nComputer Vision\n3D Vision\nComputer Graphics\nWork Experience\n2024.7-present:\nAssistant Professor\n,\nConcordia University,  Montreal,\nCanada\n20\n22.11\n- 202\n4\n.\n7\n:\nStaff Researcher\n, Noah Ark\n's Lab,\nHuawei Canada\n2019.10 -\n2022.10\n: Postdoctoral Fellow, University of Alberta & University of Guelph, Canada  (Advisor: Dr.\nMinglun GONG\nand\nDr.\nLi CHENG\n)\n2018.5 - 2018.8:  Research Intern, AR/VR lab,  Baidu\n2017.5 - 2017.8:  Research Intern, Institute of Deep Learning (IDL),  Baidu\nEducation\n2017 - 2019: Ph.D in Computer Science, University of Kentucky, USA  (Advisor: Dr.\nRuigang YANG\n)\n2012 - 2016: Ph.D Student in Computer Science and Technology, Northwestern Polytechnical University,  China (Advisor: Dr.\nJiangbin ZHENG\n)\n2014 - 2016: Visiting PhD student at Gravity Lab, University of Kentucky, USA  (Advisor: Dr.\nRuigang YANG\n)\n2011 - 2014: Master in Computer Science and Technology, Northwestern Polytechnical University, China (Advisor: Dr.\nJiangbin ZHENG\n)\n2007 - 2011: Bachelor in Computer Science and Technology, Northwestern Polytechnical University, China\nPublications\nSummary: My main research area is in machine learning and computer vision Among the 40+ papers I have co-authored. My Google Scholar Page is at\ngoogle scholar\nHouston H. Zhang, Tao Zhang, Baoze Lin, Yuanqi Xue, Yincheng Zhu, Huan Liu, Li Gu, Linfeng Ye, Ziqiang Wang,\nXinxin Zuo\n, Yang Wang, Yuanhao Yu, Zhixiang Chi. Widget2Code: From Visual Widgets to UI Code via Multimodal LLMs.\nI\nn\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR)\n, 202\n6\n.\nZhihao Shi,\nKejia Yin,\nWeilin Wan, Yuhongze Zhou, Yuanhao Yu,\nXinxin Zuo\n, Qiang Sun, Juwei Lu. CamDirector: Towards Long-Term Coherent Video Trajectory Editing.\nI\nn\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR)\n, 202\n6\n.\nZhengxuan Li, Qinhui Yang, Yiyu Zhuang, Chuan Guo,\nXinxin Zuo\n, Xiao-Xiao Long, Yao Yao, Xun Cao, Qiu Shen, Hao Zhu. Pressure2Motion: Hierarchical Human Motion Reconstruction from Ground Pressure with Text Guidance.\nI\nn\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR)\n, 202\n6.\nHang Zhou,\nXinxin Zuo\n, Sen Wang, Li Cheng\n. PICS: Pairwise Image Compositing with Spatial Interactions.\nIn\nI\nnternational Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR),\n2\n02\n6\n.\nLiang Zhao, Zhixiang Chi, Sen Wang, Yang Wang,\nXinxin Zuo\n. Test-time Adaptation for 3D Human Pose and Shape Estimation. In\nThe 20th IEEE International Conference on Automatic Face and Gesture Recognition\n, 2026.\nLinlian Jiang, Rui Ma, Li Gu, Ziqiang Wang,\nXinxin Zuo\n,\nYang Wang. PointMAC: Meta-Learned Adaptation for Robust Test-Time Point Cloud Completion.\nIn\n202\n5\nConference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS)\n,\n2\n02\n5\n.\nTiantian Wang,\nXinxin Zuo\n, Fangzhou Mu, Jian Wang and Ming-Hsuan Yang.  Towards 4D Human Video Stylization.\nComputer Vision and Image Understanding (CVIU)\n, 2025, 262: 104532.\nLi Wang, Yiyu Zhuang, Yanwen Wang, Xun Cao, Chuan Guo,\nXinxin Zuo\n,\nHao Zhu. Sketech2PoseNet: Efficient and Generalized Sketch to 3D Human Pose Prediction. In\nProceedings of the SIGGRAPH Asia 2025 Conference\n, 2025: 132\n.\nYanwen Wang, Yiyu Zhuang, Jiawei Zhang, Li Wang, Yifei Zeng, Xun Cao,\nXinxin Zuo\n,\nHao Zhu. TeRA : Rethinking Text-guided Realistic 3D Avatar Generation.\nI\nn\nIEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV)\n, 2025: 10686-10697\n.\nZhihao Shi, Dong Huo, Yuhongze Zhou, Yan Min, Juwei Lu,\nXinxin Zuo\n.  IMFine: 3D Inpainting via Geometry-guided Multi-view Refinement.\nI\nn\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR)\n, 202\n5: 26694-‌26703.\nHang Zhou,\nXinxin Zuo\n, Rui Ma, Li Cheng. BOOTPLACE: Bootstrapped Object Placement with Detection Transformers.\nI\nn\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR)\n, 2025: 19294-‌19303.\nYilin Wang, Chuan Guo, Yuxuan Mu, Muhammad Gohar Javed,\nXinxin Zuo\n,\nJuwei Lu\n, Hai Jiang,\nLi Cheng\n.  MotionDreamer: One-to-Many Motion Synthesis wi