nformation Processing Systems (NeurIPS)\n,\n2\n023: 36664-36676.\nKehong Gong, Dongze Lian, Heng Chang, Chuan Guo,  Zihang Jiang,\nXinxin Zuo\n,\nMichael Bi Mi\n,\nXinchao Wang. TM2D: Bimodality Driven 3D Dance Generation via Music-Text Integration. In\nIEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV)\n, 2023: 9942-9952.\nRunlin Huang, Shuyang Wu, Leiping Jie,\nXinxin Zuo\n, Hui Zhang. Siamclim: Text-based Pedestrian Search via Multi-modal Siamese Contrastive Learning. In\nIEEE International Conference on Image Processing (ICIP)\n, 2023\n:\n1800-1804.\nJi Yang*,\nXinxin Zuo\n*,  Sen Wang, Zhenbo Yu, Xingyu Li, Bingbing Ni, Minglun Gong, Li Cheng. Object Wake-up: 3D Object Rigging from a Single Image. In\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV)\n, 2022:\n311–327\n.\nChuan Guo,\nXinxin Zuo\n, Sen Wang, Li Cheng. TM2T: Stochastic and Tokenized Modeling for the Reciprocal Generation of 3D Human Motions and Texts. In\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV)\n, 2022: 580-597.\nHao Zhu,\nXinxin Zuo\n, Haotian Yang, Sen Wang, Xun Cao, Ruigang Yang. Detailed Avatar Recovery from Single Image.\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (TPAMI)\n.\n2022, 44(11): 7363-7379.\nChuan Guo, Shihao Zou,\nXinxin Zuo\n, Sen Wang,\nWei Ji, Xingyu Li, Li Cheng. Generating Diverse and Natural 3D Human Motions from Text. I\nn\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR)\n, 2022\n: 5152-5161.\nChuan Guo,\nXinxin Zuo\n, Sen Wang,  Xinshuang Liu, Shihao Zou, Minglun Gong, Li Cheng. Action2video: Generating Videos of Human 3D Actions.\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision (IJCV)\n, 2022, 130(2) : 285-315.\nJi Yang, Youdong Ma,\nXinxin Zuo\n, Sen Wang, Minglun Gong, Li Cheng. 3D Pose Estimation and Future Motion Prediction from 2D Images.\nPattern Recognition (PR)\n, 2022, 124: 108439.\nXinxin Zuo\n, Sen Wang, Jiangbin Zheng, Weiwei Yu, Minglun Gong, Ruigang Yang and Li Cheng. SparseFusion: Dynamic Human Avatar Modeling f