    "homepage_text": "Zhikai Chen @ LAMDA, NJU-AI\nZhikai Chen @ LAMDA, NJU-AI\néä¹é´\nZhikai Chen\nPh.D. candidate\nLAMDA Group\nDepartment of Artificial Intelligence\nNational Key Laboratory for Novel Software Technology\nNanjing University\n, Nanjing 210023, China\nLaboratory: A201, Unit A, School of Artificial Intelligence, Xianlin Campus of Nanjing University\nemail:\nchenzk{AT}lamda.nju.edu.cn\nBiography\nI am a first-year PhD student of\nDepartment of Artificial Intelligence\nin\nNanjing University\nand a member of\nLAMDA Group\nled by professor\nZhi-Hua Zhou\n, under the supervision of Prof.\nDe-Chuan Zhan\n.\nI received my B.Sc. degree from\nPurdue University\nin June 2021. In the same year, I was admitted to\nthe University of Michigan\nto pursue a M.Sc. degree, which I completed in December 2022.\nI was a member of Huaweiâs Human-Computer Interaction Lab from February to August 2023, and from August 2023 to August 2024, I was part of Huaweiâs Data Value Enablement Lab.\nResearch Interest\nMy research interests include: large language model, human computer interaction."
  },
  "deep_homepage::Wenwei Zhang::https://zwwwayne.github.io/": {
    "homepage": "https://zwwwayne.github.io/",
