 Economic Review\n,\n2012, volume 102, issue 5, pp 1857-1897.\nEpsilon-Equilibria of Perturbed Games [\nlink\n] (with\nMatthew O. Jackson\nand\nTomas Rodriguez Barraquer\n)\nGames and Economic Behavior\n,\n2012, volume 75, issue 1, pp 198-216.\nAuctions with Both Common-Value and Private-Value Bidders [\nlink\n] (with\nYiqing Xing\n)\nEconomics Letters\n,\n2011, volume 111, issue 1, pp 99-103.\nWorking papers:\nA Rational Inattention Theory of Echo Chamber [\npdf\n] (with Lin Hu and\nAnqi Li\n)\nExtended abstract at\nEC 2023\n[\nlink\n]\nDynamic Network Influence: The Art of Strategic Messaging [\npdf\n] (with\nWei Li\n)\nSeeking Relationship Support: Strategic network formation and robust cooperation (with\nDavid Miller\n)\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
