ngyan Zhang, Zhiyuan Liu. Knowledgeable Machine Learning for Natural Language Processing. Communications of the ACM 2021.\n2020\n1. Zhiyuan Liu,\nXu Han\n, Maosong Sun. Knowledge Graph and Deep Learning. Book (In Chinese).\n2.\nXu Han\n, Yuzhuo Bai, Keyue Qiu, Zhiyuan Liu and Maosong Sun. IsOBS: An Information System for Oracle Bone Script. EMNLP 2020. Demo paper.\n3. Xin Lv,\nXu Han\n, Lei Hou, Juanzi Li, Zhiyuan Liu, Wei Zhang, Yichi Zhang, Hao Kong and Suhui Wu. Dynamic Anticipation and Completion for Multi-Hop Reasoning over Sparse Knowledge Graph. EMNLP 2020. Long paper.\n4. Hao Peng, Tianyu Gao,\nXu Han\n, Yankai Lin, Peng Li, Zhiyuan Liu, Maosong Sun and Jie Zhou. Learning from Context or Names? An Empirical Study on Neural Relation Extraction. EMNLP 2020. Long paper.\n5. Xiaozhi Wang, Ziqi Wang,\nXu Han\n, Wangyi Jiang, Rong Han, Zhiyuan Liu, Juanzi Li, Peng Li, Yankai Lin and Jie Zhou. MAVEN: A Massive General Domain Event Detection Dataset. EMNLP 2020. Long paper.\n6. Chaojun Xiao, Yuan Yao, Ruobing Xie,\nXu Han\n, Zhiyuan Liu, Maosong Sun, Fen Lin and Leyu Lin. Denoising Relation Extraction from Document-level Distant Supervision. EMNLP 2020. Short paper.\n7.\nXu Han\n, Tianyu Gao, Yankai Lin, Hao Peng, Yaoliang Yang, Chaojun Xiao, Zhiyuan Liu, Peng Li, Maosong Sun and Jie Zhou. More Data, More Relations, More Context and More Openness: A Review and Outlook for Relation Extraction. AACL 2020. Long paper.\n8. Xiaozhi Wang, Shengyu Jia,\nXu Han\n, Zhiyuan Liu, Juanzi Li, Peng Li and Jie Zhou. Neural Gibbs Sampling for Joint Event Argument Extraction. AACL 2020. Long paper.\n9.\nXu Han\n, Yi Dai, Tianyu Gao, Yankai Lin, Zhiyuan Liu, Peng Li, Maosong Sun and Jie Zhou. Continual Relation Learning via Episodic Memory Activation and Reconsolidation. ACL 2020. Long paper.\n10.   Tianyu Gao,\nXu Han\n, Ruobing Xie, Zhiyuan Liu, Fen Lin, Leyu Lin, Maosong Sun.\n              Neural Snowball for Few-Shot Relation Learning. AAAI 2020. Long paper.\n11.   Bowen Dong, Y