    "homepage_text": "Yuxin Zheng - Homepage\n郑宇欣/Yuxin Zheng\nSenior Engineer in Institude for AI Industry Research, Tsinghua University\nChina\nAIR, Tsinghua University\nEmail\nAbout\nYuxin Zheng (郑宇欣) is a\nSenior Engineer\nin\nInstitude for AI Industry Research(AIR), Tsinghua University\n.\nYuxin Zheng received his master degree in\nZhejiang University\nin 2020. During 2020.4-2023.11, he led a technolgy team in\nIntelligent Vehicle Solution Business Unit (IAS BU) of Huawei Company\n. In 2023, he was awarded Huawei’s highest personal honor (金牌个人奖), thanks to his contribution in advanced autonomous driving solutions, ADS1.0 and ADS2.0, which were widely used on commercial vehicles, such as Avatar Changan (长安阿维塔), M5/M7/M9 AITO (问界). Then, Yuxin Zheng joined\nTsinghua University\nas a senior engineer in AIR and began his new journey in the field of AI.\nHis research interests include\nautonomous driving\nand\nrobotics\n.\nLast updated: 2024.10\nNews\n2023.3, awarded 2022 Huawei Individual Golden Medal Award.\n2020.3, awarded 2020 Zhejiang University Outstanding Graduate Student.\n2017.7, awarded 2017 Shanghai City Outstanding Graduate Student.\nEducation\n2017 - 2020\nMaster's Degree, Control Science and Engineering\nZhejiang University, Hangzhou\n2013 - 2017\nBachelor's Degree, Automation\nChina East University of Science and Technology, Shanghai\nExperience\n2023.12 - now\nSenior Engineer\nInstitude for AI Industry Research, Tsinghua University\n2020.4 - 2023.11\nAutonomous Driving Engineer, Team Leader of Map Group in ADS\nHuawei Company\n2022 Huawei Individual Golden Medal Award\n2019.6 - 2019.9\nSLAM Algorithm Engineer, intership of Map Group\nPony.ai\nPublication\nICRA 2021\nRoadMap: A Light-Weight Semantic Map for Visual Localization towards Autonomous Driving\nTong Qin,\nYuxin Zheng\n, Tongqing Chen, Yilun Chen, and Qing Su. 2021 IEEE International Conference on Robotics and Automation (ICRA)\n[YouTube]\nIET Cyber‐Systems and Robotics\nRGB‐D SLAM with moving object tracking in dynamic\nenvironments\nWeichen Dai, Yu Zhang,\nYuxin Zheng\n, Donglei Sun, and Ping Li. IET Cyber‐Systems and Robotics. 2021. 3(4):281-291\\\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected."
  },
  "deep_homepage::Xiaowen Dong::https://web.media.mit.edu/~xdong/": {
