    "homepage_text": "Welcome to Yi Wang's homepage\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nWelcome to Yi Wang's homepage\nYi Wang\nI am a\nP\nrofessor at the Mathematics Department of Johns Hop\nkins University. My research interest includes\nGeometric Analysis, Fully Nonlinear PDEs, Harmonic Analysis, Machine Learning\n. I am also a member of the Data Science and AI\nInstitute of Johns Hopkins (DSAI). Students interested in Geometric Analysis and AI are welcome to contact me about potential research projects!\nAddress: 3400 N. Charles St.,\nMathematics Department, Johns Hopkins Univ.,\nBaltimore, MD, 21218\nEmail: ywang at math dot jhu dot edu\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
  },
  "deep_homepage::Xiaoyuan Zhang::https://faculty.ustc.edu.cn/zhangxiaoyuan123/en/index.htm": {
