    "homepage_text": "Deqing Sun\nHome\nServices\nPublications\nAwards/Honors\nStudents\nDeqing Sun\nSenior Staff Research Scientist,\nGoogle\nGoogle Inc.\n355 Main Street\nCambridge, MA 02142\nEmail\n/\nBio\n/\nTwitter\n/\nLinkedIn\n/\nScholar\nServices\nProgram Chair for\nICCV 2025\nGuest editor for TPAMI special issue on\nGenerative AI in 3D Vision\nArea Chairs for\nECCV (2018, 2022, 2024)\n,\nICLR 2024\n,\nNeurIPS 2023\n,\nICCV 2023\n,\nCVPR (2019, 2020, 2022, 2023)\n,\nBMVC (2019, 2020)\nCo-organized Workshop/Tutorial on\nAI for Content Creation\nat SIGGRAPH 2018 and CVPR 2019-2023\nCo-organized Workshop on\nWhat is Motion for?\nat ECCV 2022\nCo-organized Workshop on\nWhat is Optical Flow for?\nat ECCV 2018\nGuest editor for CVIU special issue on\nDeep Learning for Image Restoration\nReviewer for\nNational Science Foundation (NSF)\nPublications\nGoogle scholar profile\nKyle Sargent, Zizhang Li, Tanmay Shah, Charles Herrmann, Hong-Xing Yu, Yunzhi Zhang, Eric Ryan Chan, Dmitry Lagun, Li Fei-Fei, Deqing Sun, Jiajun Wu.\nZeroNVS: Zero-Shot 360-Degree View Synthesis from a Single Image.\nCVPR 2024. \n          [\npdf\n]\n          [\nproject page\n]\n          [\ncode\n]\nXiaoyu Zhou, Zhiwei Lin, Xiaojun Shan, Yongtao Wang, Deqing Sun*, Ming-Hsuan Yang*. (*equal contribution)\nDrivingGaussian: Composite Gaussian Splatting for Surrounding Dynamic Autonomous Driving Scenes.\nCVPR 2024. \n          [\npdf\n]\n          [\nproject page\n]\n          [\ncode\n]\nJunyi Zhang, Charles Herrmann, Junhwa Hur, Eric Chen, Varun Jampani, Deqing Sun*, Ming-Hsuan Yang*. (*equal contribution)\nTelling left from right: Identifying geometry-aware semantic correspondence.\nCVPR 2024. \n          [\npdf\n]\n          [\nproject page\n]\n          [\ncode\n]\nAndreas Engelhardt, Amit Raj, Mark Boss, Yunzhi Zhang, Abhishek Kar, Yuanzhen Li, Deqing Sun, Ricardo Martin Brualla, Jonathan T Barron, Hendrik Lensch, Varun Jampani.\nSHINOBI: Shape and Illumination using Neural Object Decomposition via BRDF Optimization In-the-wild.\nCVPR 2024. \n          [\npdf\n]\n          [\nproject page\n]\nMohamed El Banani, Amit Raj, Kevis-Kokitsi Maninis, Abhishek Kar, Yuanzhen Li, Michael Rubinstein, Deqing Sun, Leonidas Guibas, Justin Johnson, Varun Jampani.\nProbing the 3d awareness of visual foundation models.\nCVPR 2024. \n          [\npdf\n]\n          [\ncode\n]\nHong-Xing Yu, Haoyi Duan, Junhwa Hur, Kyle Sargent, Michael Rubinstein, William T Freeman, Forrester Cole, Deqing Sun, Noah Snavely, Jiajun Wu, Charles Herrmann.\nWonderjourney: Going from anywhere to everywhere.\nCVPR 2024. \n          [\npdf\n]\n          [\nproject page\n]\n          [\ncode\n]\nGen Li, Deqing Sun, Laura Sevilla-Lara, Varun Jampani.\nOne-Shot Open Affordance Learning with Foundation Models.\nCVPR 2024. \n          [\npdf\n]\n          [\nproject page\n]\n          [\ncode\n]\nLei Zhong, Yiming Xie, Varun Jampani, Deqing Sun, Huaizu Jiang.\nSMooDi: Stylized Motion Diffusion Model.\nECCV 2024. \n          [\npdf\n]\n          [\nproject page\n]\n          [\ncode\n]\nZehao Zhu, Jiashun Wang, Yuzhe Qin, Deqing Sun, Varun Jampani, Xiaolong Wang.\nContactArt: Learning 3d interaction priors for category-level articulated object and hand poses estimation.\n3DV 2024.\nOral presentation.\n[\npdf\n]\n          [\nproject page\n]\nOmer Bar-Tal, Hila Chefer, Omer Tov, Charles Herrmann, Roni Paiss, Shiran Zada, Ariel Ephrat, Junhwa Hur, Yuanzhen Li, Tomer Michaeli, Oliver Wang, Deqing Sun, Tali Dekel, Inbar Mosseri.\nLumiere: A space-time diffusion model for video generation.\nSIGGRAPH Asia 2024. \n          [\npdf\n]\n          [\nproject page\n]\nXiaoyu Zhou, Xingjian Ran, Yajiao Xiong, Jinlin He, Zhiwei Lin, Yongtao Wang, Deqing Sun, Ming-Hsuan Yang.\nGala3d: Towards text-to-3d complex scene generation via layout-guided generative gaussian splatting.\nICML 2024. \n          [\npdf\n]\n          [\nproject page\n]\n          [\ncode\n]\nXiaogang Peng, Yiming Xie, Zizhao Wu, Varun Jampani, Deqing Sun, Huaizu Jiang.\nHoi-diff: Text-driven synthesis of 3d human-object interactions using diffusion models.\nICLR 2024.\n          [\npdf\n]\n          [\nproject page\n]   \n          [\ncode\n]\nSaurabh Saxena, Charles Herrmann, Junhwa Hur, Abhishek Kar, Mohammad Norouzi, Deqing Sun, David J Fleet.\nThe Surprising Effectiveness of Diffusion Models for Optical Flow and Monocular Depth Estimation.\nNeurIPS 2023.\nOral presentation.\n[\npdf\n]\n          [\nproject page\n]\nJunyi Zhang, Charles Herrmann, Junhwa Hur, Luisa Polania Cabrera, Varun Jampani, Deqing Sun, Ming-Hsuan Yang.\nA Tale of Two Features: Stable Diffusion Complements DINO for Zero-Shot Semantic Correspondence.\nNeurIPS 2023.\n          [\npdf\n]\n          [\nproject page (with code)\n]\nXiaotong Wu, Wei-Sheng Lai, YiChang Shih, Charles Herrmann, Michael Krainin, Deqing Sun,  Chia-Kai Liang.\nEfficient Hybrid Zoom using Camera Fusion on Mobile Phones.\nSIGGRAPH Asia 2023. \n          [\npdf\n]\n          [\nproject page\n]\nKyle Sargent, Jing Yu Koh, Han Zhang, Huiwen Chang, Charles Herrmann, Pratul Srinivasan, Jiajun Wu, Deqing Sun.\nVQ3D: Learning a 3D-Aware Generative Model on ImageNet.\nICCV 2023.\nOral presentation.\nBest Paper Finalist.\n[\npdf\n]\n          [\nproject page\n]\nXiaoyu Zhou, Zhiwei Lin, Xiaojun Shan, Yongtao Wang, Deqing Sun, Ming-Hsuan Yang.\nSAMPLING: Scene-adaptive Hierarchical Multiplane Images Representation for Novel View Synthesis from a Single Image.\nICCV 2023. \n          [\npdf\n]\n          [\nproject page\n]\nHong-Xing Yu, Samir Agarwala, Charles Herrmann, Richard Szeliski, Noah Snavely, Jiajun Wu, Deqing Sun.\nAccidental Light Probes.\nCVPR 2023.\n          [\npdf\n]\n          [\nproject page (with code)\n]\nGen Li, Varun Jampani, Deqing Sun, Laura Sevilla-Lara.\nLOCATE: Localize and Transfer Object Parts for Weakly Supervised Affordance Grounding.\nCVPR 2023.\n          [\npdf\n]\n          [\nproject page (with code)\n]\nHsin-Ping Huang, Charles Herrmann