    "homepage_text": "Jiaxin Yuan | Intensive Research\nJY\nHi💗\nI'm Jiaxin\nWelcome to my webpage:) I'm a 3rd year PhD student at LAMSADE,\nUniversité Paris Dauphine - PSL\n.\n                    My research combines process mining and deep learning, and I'm supervised by\nDaniela Grigori\nand\nHan van der Aa\n.\nContact\nFOCUS\nCurrent Mission\nPredictive Process\nMonitoring.\nMy research is focusing on enhancing predictive process monitoring (PPM) performance by leveraging advanced deep learning techniques. I aim to explore and develop approaches that capture the dynamic nature of business processes most.\nKey Interests\nTime Predictions in PPM\nFair comparisons of PPM\nEmerging Trends in Process Mining\nCutting-edge Deep Learning\nEducational\nJourney.\nAcademic Path\nPhD student in Computer Science\nUniversité Paris Dauphine - PSL, France\nLAMSADE\nM.Sc. Business Informatics\nUniversity of Mannheim, Germany\nPublications\n2025\nEnhancing Predictive Process Monitoring Using Semantic Information\nJiaxin Yuan\n, Daniela Grigori, Han van der Aa\nThis work proposes a novel mechanism to exploit semantic information extracted from event logs using LLMs to improve the performance of outcome-oriented and next activity prediction tasks.\nView Paper\nThe Intensity Outside the Lab\nContent creator\n80,000+ total views\nInstagram\nRed Notebook\nChannels\nOutdoor\nTennis🎾, swimming, ice-skating...\nMusic\nHiphop, indie..."
  },
