    "homepage_text": "Zhuqing Liu\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nZhuqing Liu\nWelcome to my homepage!\nMy name is Zhuqing (Zuki) Liu. I am an Assistant Professor in\nDepartment of Computer Science and Engineering\nat the\nUniversity of North Texas\n.\nImmediate Openings for Ph.D. Students:  Openings for Ph.D. students are available and expected to be filled as early as Spring 2026 or in Fall 2026. If you are interested, please send me your CV/Resume, transcripts, publications (if available) and GRE/TOEFL scores (if available) for consideration.\nEmail:\nZhuqing.Liu@unt.edu\nGoogle Scholar:\nhttps://scholar.google.com/citations?user=7NbxFGYAAAAJ&hl=en\nLinkedin\n:\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/zhuqing-liu-816610155/\nRESEARCH INTERESTS\nFirst-order stochastic optimization for machine learning\nAI Security\nMeta\nL\nearning, Lar\nge\nLa\nn\ng\nuage\nMod\nel\nAcademical Services\nS\nerved as Reviewer for KDD 2025, TMC 2025, NeurIPS 202\n4\n, IEEE Transactions on Signal Processing 2024,\nJSAIT 2023, TNSE 2023,\nINF\nOCOM 2023,\nICML 2022, NeurIPS 2022\n, AAAI 2022\n.\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nReport abuse"
  },
  "deep_homepage::Jia Liu::https://liulab.seas.harvard.edu/": {
    "homepage": "https://liulab.seas.harvard.edu/",
