    "homepage_text": "Yizhi Li\n      -  Research Explorer The University of Manchester\nResearch Explorer The University of Manchester Home\nSearch content at Research Explorer The University of Manchester\nYizhi Li\nMr\nDoctor of Philosophy\n,\nDepartment of Computer Science\nhttps://orcid.org/0000-0002-3932-9706\nPersonal profile\nOverview\nYizhi Li is currently a Computer Science PhD student funded by the University of Manchester, supervised by\nProf. Chenghua Lin\n. He is also a co-founder of the\nMultimodal Art Projection (M-A-P)\nresearch community. I’ve collaborated with\nDr. Jie Fu\nand had a lot of fun. He previously worked as a research assistant at Tsinghua NLP Lab with\nProf. Zhiyuan Liu\n.\nHis research interests include music modelling, fairness in NLP, and general topics of natural language modelling. More can be referred to the\npublication pages\n.\nExpertise related to UN Sustainable Development Goals\nIn 2015, UN member states agreed to 17 global\nSustainable Development Goals (SDGs)\nto end poverty, protect the planet and ensure prosperity for all. This person’s work contributes towards the following SDG(s):\nSDG 7\nAffordable and Clean Energy\nFingerprint\nDive into the research topics where Yizhi Li is active. These topic labels come from the works of this person. Together they form a unique fingerprint.\n6\nSimilar Profiles\nInformation Retrieval\nComputer Science\n100%\nLanguage Modeling\nComputer Science\n60%\nMultimodal Information\nComputer Science\n50%\nBenchmarking\nComputer Science\n50%\nLithium-Ion Batteries\nEngineering\n50%\nEmbedding Space\nComputer Science\n37%\nScientific Domain\nComputer Science\n30%\nResidual Vector\nComputer Science\n25%\nView full fingerprint\nResearch output\n3\nArticle\n3\nPreprint\n2\nConference contribution\n1\nPoster\n1\nMore\n1\nOther contribution\nMERT: Acoustic Music Understanding Model with Large-Scale Self-supervised Training\nLi, Y.\n, Yuan, R., Zhang, G., Ma, Y., Chen, X., Yin, H.,\nLin, C.\n, Ragni, A., Benetos, E., Gyenge, N., Dannenberg, R., Liu, R., Chen, W., Xia, G., Shi, Y., Huang, W., Guo, Y. & Fu, J.,\n16 Jan 2024\n.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to conference\n›\nPoster\n›\npeer-review\nSupervised Learning\n100%\nMusical Knowledge\n100%\nLanguage Modeling\n100%\nState of the Art\n50%\nVector Quantization\n50%\nOmniBench: Towards The Future of Universal Omni-Language Models\nLi, Y.\n, Zhang, G., Ma, Y., Yuan, R., Zhu, K., Guo, H., Liang, Y., Liu, J., Yang, J., Wu, S. & others, C. H.,\n23 Sept 2024\n, (Submitted)\narXiv\n,\np. 1-30\n,\n30 p.\nResearch output\n:\nPreprint/Working paper\n›\nPreprint\nLanguage Modeling\n100%\nMultimodal Large Language Models\n33%\nOpen Source\n16%\nAnnotation\n16%\nTextual Representation\n16%\nSciMMIR: Benchmarking Scientific Multi-modal Information Retrieval\nWu, S.,\nLi, Y.\n, Zhu, K., Zhang, G., Liang, Y., Ma, K., Xiao, C., Zhang, H., Yang, B., Chen, W., Huang, W., Moubayed, N. A., Fu, J. &\nLin, C.\n,\n24 Jan 2024\n,\narXiv\n,\n15 p.\nResearch output\n:\nPreprint/Working paper\n›\nPreprint\nFile\nBenchmarking\n100%\nMultimodal Information\n100%\nInformation Retrieval\n100%\nScientific Domain\n60%\nAnnotation\n20%\n60\nDownloads\n(Pure)\nSearch for Heavy Neutral Leptons in Electron-Positron and Neutral-Pion Final States with the MicroBooNE Detector\nMicroBooNE collaboration\n,\n22 Jan 2024\n,\nIn:\nPhysical Review Letters.\n132\n,\n4\n,\n7 p.\n, 041801.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nHerb: Measuring Hierarchical Regional Bias in Pre-trained Language Models\nLi, Y.\n, Zhang, G., Yang, B.,\nLin, C.\n, Wang, S., Ragni, A. & Fu, J.,\n5 Nov 2022\n,\narXiv\n,\n13 p.\nResearch output\n:\nPreprint/Working paper\n›\nPreprint\nFile\nLanguage Modeling\n100%\nNatural Language Processing\n40%\nMethods Evaluation\n20%\nSocial Class\n20%\n14\nDownloads\n(Pure)\nView all 10 research outputs"
