    "homepage_text": "Home | Tianyu\ntop of page\nThis website was built on Wix. Create yours today.\nGet Started\nTianyu He\nPhD Candidate, McGill University\nContact Information\n﻿\nCell: +1 (514) 576-6717\nEmail:\ntianyu.he@mail.mcgill.ca\nCurriculum vitae [\nPDF\n]\nWelcome to my site!\n​\nI’m a Ph.D. candidate in Economics at McGill University.\n​\nMy research is mainly in Econometrics and Applied Econometrics . I am also interested in Labor economics.\nI will be available for interviews at the EEA in Dec 2020 and   AEA/ASSA in Jan 2021\nbottom of page\n\n---\n\nCV | Tianyu\ntop of page\nThis website was built on Wix. Create yours today.\nGet Started\nTianyu He\nPhD Candidate, McGill University\nbottom of page"
