    "homepage_text": "Xu Yang\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nXu Yang\nXu Yang\nProfessor\nDepartment of Mathematics\nUniversity of California,\nSanta Barbara\nOffice: 6709 South Hall\nFax: (805) 893-2385\nEmail: first last at math dot ucsb dot edu\nEducation:\nPh.D. 2008, University of Wisconsin-Madison\nM.S. 2005, Tsinghua University, China\nB.S. 2003, Tsinghua University, China\nFull CV\n(last updated: J\nanuary\n1st, 202\n5\n)\nEmployment:\nProfessor,\nDepartment of Mathematics\n,\nUniversity of California, Santa Barbara\n, since 7/2020;\nAssociate Professor,\nDepartment of Mathematics\n,\nUniversity of California, Santa Barbara\n, 7/2016--6/2020;\nAssistant Professor,\nDepartment of Mathematics\n,\nUniversity of California, Santa Barbara\n, 7/2012--6/2016;\nAssociate Research Scientist,\nCourant Institute of Mathematical Sciences\n,\nNew York University\n, 9/2010--6/2012;\nPostdoctoral Research Associate,\nProgram in Applied and Computational Mathematics\n,\nPrinceton University\n, 1/2009--8/2010.\nTeaching:\nAll the teaching contents will be only released to the students who have enrolled or been on the waitlist of the class via\nCanvas\n.\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
