    "homepage_text": "CQ\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nCQ\nChen Qiu\nAssistant Professor\nDepartment of Economics\nCornell Univeristy\ncq62@cornell.edu\nCurriculum vitae\nGoogle scholar\nWorking Papers\nApproximate Least-Favorable Distributions and Nearly Optimal Tests via Stochastic Mirror Descent\n(with Andrés Aradillas Fernández, José Blanchet, José Luis Montiel Olea, Jörg Stoye and Lezhi Tan)\nLeave No One Undermined: Policy Targeting with Regret Aversion\n(with Toru Kitagawa and Sokbae Lee)\nε-Minimax Solutions of Statistical Decision Problems\n(with\nAndrés Aradillas Fernández, José Blanchet, José Luis Montiel Olea, Jörg Stoye and Lezhi Tan\n)\nRobust Bayes Treatment Choice with Partial Identification\n(with\nAndrés Aradillas Fernández\n,\nJosé Luis Montiel Olea, Jörg Stoye and Serdil Tinda\n)\nExternally Valid Selection of Experimental Sites via the k-Median Problem\n(with\nJosé Luis Montiel Olea, Brenda Prallon,  Jörg Stoye and Yiwei Sun\n)\nApproximate Minimax Estimation of Average Regression Functionals\n.\nPrevious draft:\nSeptember 2020\nwith\nsupplementary materials\n.\nJMP version\n.\nPublications\nStatistical Decisions and Partial Identification: with Application to  Boundary Discontinuity Design\n(with\nJörg Stoye\n).\nAccepted as invited discussion at Advances in Economics and Econometrics: Thirteenth World Congress\n.\nTreatment Choice with Nonlinear Regret\n(with Toru Kitagawa and Sokbae Lee).\nAccepted at Biometrika.\nDecision Theory for Treatment Choice Problems with Partial Identification\n(with\nJosé Luis Montiel Olea and Jörg Stoye\n).\nAc\ncepted at The Review of Economic Studies.\nCross-Fitted Empirical Likelihood on Semiparametric Models\n.\nThe Econometrics Journal\n, Volume 28, Issue 3, September 2025, Pages 385–405.\nTreatment Choice, Mean Square Regret and Partial Identification\n(with Toru Kitagawa and Sokbae Lee).\nJapanese Economic Review\n, 2023, 74, 573–602.\nReweighted Nonparametric Likelihood Inference for Linear Functionals\n(with Karun Adusumilli and Taisuke Otsu).\nElectronic Journal of Statistics\n, 2023, 17(2), 2810-2848.\nInformation Theoretic Approach to High Dimensional Multiplicative Models: Stochastic Discount Factor and Treatment Effect\n(with Taisuke Otsu),\nQuantitative Economics\n,\n2022, 13(1), 63-94\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
