    "homepage_text": "Homepage for Group of Professor Fei Wang\nHome\nPublications\nGroup Member\nPresentations\nTeaching\nDepartment of Population Health Sciences, Weill Cornell Medicine\n425 E 61 St.\nNew York City, NY 10065\nWang Lab\nWeill Cornell Medicine\nPrincipal Investigator\nFei Wang\nLab Manager\nMohit Sharma\nFaculties\nChang Su\n, Tenure Track Assistant Professor\nChengxi Zang\n, Tenure Track Assistant Professor\nResearch Scientists\nZhenxing Xu\n, Research Associate\nZilong Bai\n, Research Associate\nZhe Huang\n, Postdoc Associate\nHaoyang Li\n, Postdoc Associate\nWeishen Pan\n, Postdoc Associate\nZuoyu Yan\n, Postdoc Associate\nQiannan Zhang\n, Postdoc Associate\nPhD Students\nWenxin Chen, Computer Science\nAlison Ke, Computational Biology\nJaqueline Maasch, NSF Fellow, Computer Science\nSuraj Rajendran, NSF Fellow, Tri-I CBM, Together with Iman Hajirasouliha\nManqi Zhou, Computational Biology\nAlumni\nMatthew Brendel (Now Consultant at ClearView Healthcare Partners)\nChao Che (Now Associate Professor at Dalian University)\nDandi Chen\n(Now PhD Student at Wisconsin-Madison)\nJingyuan Chou\n(Now PhD Student at University of Virginia)\nYujuan Feng (Now Assistant Professor at Beijing University of Technology)\nLi Guo (Now Associate Professor at Dalian Polytech University)\nLifang He\n(Now Assistant Professor at Leihigh University)\nBojian Hou\n(Now Postdoc at UPenn)\nYu Hou\n(Now Research Scientist at University of Minnesota)\nJian Liang (Now at Alibaba)\nYuantong Li\n(Now PhD Student at Purdue University)\nXu Min (Now at IBM China)\nQianqian Xie\n(Now postdoc at Yale)\nJie Xu\n(Now Assistant Professor at University of Florida)\nXingbo Wang\n, Research Scientist at Bosch\nXi Zhang\n(Now Associate Professor at Chinese Academy of Science)\nSendong Zhao\n(Now Assistant Professor at HIT)\nYongjun Zhu\n(Now Assistant Professor at SKKU)\n© Fei Wang"
