    "homepage_text": "Jiaxi Yang, UESTC\nJiaxi Yang\nGoogle Scholar\nEmail: abbottyanginchina@gmail.com\nAbout Me\nWelcome! I am Jiaxi Yang. I am a second-year Ph.D student, majoring in Informatics at the\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPennsylvania State University (\nPSU\n).\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPreviously, I got my master degree in 2024 from\n\t\t\t\t\t\tUniversity of Electronic Science and\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTechnology of China (\nUESTC\n).\nMy research interests broadly lie in\nTrustworthy AI, Federated Learning.\nI\n\t\t\t\t\t\tam also\n\t\t\t\t\t\tinterested in\nIncentive Mechanism Design, Game Theory.\nNews\n[08/2024] Starting my Ph.D at PSU! We are!!\n[06/2024] One paper is accepted by IEEE Internet of Things Journal!\n[06/2024] I am moving to Penn State University as a PhD student!\n[05/2024] I successfully defended my master's thesis!\n[10/2023] One paper is accepted by WCNC 2024!\n[10/2023] Obtaining first-class scholarship at UESTC!\n[06/2023] Our\nposter\nwas presented in CVPR workshop!\n[05/2023] Our paper is accepted by CVPR workshop!\n[09/2022] Starting my research internship at UBC, Tuum est!\n[07/2022] Our paper is accepted by WASA 2022!\nPublications\nFor the complete list, please check my\ngoogle scholar\n.\nEmail me\nif you have any questions about my\n\t\t\t\t\t\tpapers or code, or if you would like to collaborate with me. (* indicates equal contribution)\nBoosting E-commerce Content Diversity: A Graph-based RAG Approach with User\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReviews\nJiaxi Yang\n,\nYiling\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tJia\n.\nCarl Yang\nYi Liang\nLu Lin\nKDD 2025\n[paper]\nUnlearning for Federated Online Learning to Rank: A Reproducibility Study\nYiling Tao\n,\nShuyi Wang\n,\nJiaxi Yang\n,\nGuido Zuccon\n.\nSIGIR 2025 (Reproducibility Paper)\n[paper]\nGMValuator: Similarity-based Data Valuation for Generative Models.\nJiaxi Yang*\n,\nWenlong\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDeng*\n,\nBenlin Liu\n,\nYangsibo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHuang\n,\nJames Zou\n,\nXiaoxiao Li\n.\nICLR 2025\n[paper]\nPortfolio-Based Incentive Mechanism Design for Cross-Device Federated Learning.\nJiaxi Yang\n,\nSheng Cao\n, Cuifang Zhao, Weina Niu, Li-Chuan\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTsai.\nWCNC 2024\n[paper]\nMatching-based Data Valuation for Generative Model.\nJiaxi Yang\n,\nWenlong\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDeng\n,\nBenlin Liu\n,\nYangsibo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHuang\n,\nXiaoxiao Li\n.\nCVPR workshop, 2023\n[paper]\nMulti-dimensional Data Quick Query for Blockchain-based Federated Learning.\nJiaxi Yang\n,\nSheng Cao\n, Peng\n\t\t\t\t\t\tXiangli,\nXiong Li\n,\n\t\t\t\t\t\tXiaosong Zhang.\nWASA 2022\n[paper]\n[video]\nA Survey of Federated Unlearning: A Taxonomy, Challenges and Future Directions.\nYang Zhao*\n,\nJiaxi Yang*\n,\nYiling Tao\n,\nLixu Wang\n,\nXiaoxiao Li\n,\nDusit Niyato\nIn submission\n[paper]\n[github]\nTranDRL: A Transformer-Driven Deep Reinforcement Learning Enabled Prescriptive\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMaintenance Framework.\nYang Zhao\n,\nJiaxi Yang\n,\nWenbo Wang\n,\nHelin Yang\n,\nDusit Niyato\nIEEE Internet of Things Journal (Q1)\n[paper]\nFederated Learning Incentive Mechanism under Buyers' Auction Market.\nJiaxi Yang*\n,\nZihao Guo*\n,\nSheng Cao\n,\nCuifang Zhao\n,\nLi-Chuan\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTsai\n.\nIn submission\n[paper]\nA Survey on Trustworthiness in Foundation Models for Medical Image Analysis\nCongzhen Shi*\n,\nRyan Rezai*\n,\nJiaxi Yang*\n,\nQi Dou\n,\nXiaoxiao Li\n,\nIn submission\n[paper]\nRecent Projects\nHere are my recent exciting projects. For the full list of my projects, please refer to my\n\t\t\t\t\t\tpublications.\nPortfolio-Based Incentive Mechanism Design for Cross-Device Federated\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLearning\nThe paper proposes a new\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tapproach to designing\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tincentive mechanisms for cross-device federated learning (FL) under real-world\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tscenarios, taking into\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taccount the stochastic and hard-to-estimate nature of clients' performance. The\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tproposed FL Incentive\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMechanism is based on Portfolio theory and is the first application of this theory\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tto resolve FL resource\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tallocation problems. To accurately reflect practical FL scenarios, the paper\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tintroduces the Federated Learning\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAgent-Based Model (FL-ABM), which enables a deeper understanding of the factors that\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tinfluence the system's outcomes.\nMatching-based Data Valuation for\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tGenerative Model\nThe paper introduces\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tGenerative Model Valuator (GMValuator),\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ta new approach for data valuation in deep generative models, which have been\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tneglected by existing data valuation methods\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfocused on discriminative models. GMValuator is model-agnostic in generative models,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tprovides a training-free, post-hoc data valuation strategy,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tand is the first work to address the data valuation problem in deep generative\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmodels from a similarity-matching perspective.\nMulti-dimensional\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tData Quick Query for Blockchain-based Federated Learning\nThe paper proposes a novel\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata structure\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcalled MerkleRB-Tree to improve query efficiency for multi-dimensional metadata in\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tblockchain-based\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfederated learning. Selecting suitable participants in FL by storing and querying\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmetadata on blockchain\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcould ensure reliable data owners and improve model quality.\nPatents\nInsurance Compensation Apparatus and Method based on Hybrid Smart Contracts.\nSheng Cao,Qian Zhang,Sixuan Dang, Guanghao Xiong,Haoqu Chen,\nJiaxi Yang\n, Songdeng Niu,\n\t\t\t\t\t\tZifeng Yang.\nCN202110835114.8\nAn Incentive Mechanism Method for Decision-Making .\nSheng Cao, Sixuan Dang, Qian Zhang, Guanghao Xiong,\nJiaxi Yang\n, Haoqu Chen, Songdeng Niu,\n\t\t\t\t\t\tZifeng Yang.\nCN202110835181.X\nScholarships\n[2023] First-class Scholarship at UESTC.\n[2022] Third-class Scholarship at UESTC.\n[2021] First-class Scholarship at UESTC.\n[2021] First-class Scholarship at Jxufe.\n[2020] China National Scholarship,\n(Top 0.2% Nationwide).\n[2020] Learning Model Scholarship.\n[2020] Star of Self-improvement Scholarship.\n[2019] Enterprise Scholarship from Bank of Jiujiang.\n[2019] Merit Student Scholarship.\nRewards\n[2020] National Second Prize in China Computer Federation National Conference on Services\n\t\t\t\t\t\tComputing Software Innovation Competition.\n[2020] Bronze Award in Challenge Cup Competition Jiangxi Province.\n[2020] First Prize in University Student Computer Works Competition of Jiangxi Province.\n[2020] Third Prize in The 15th China Student Electronic Design Competition of Jiangxi Province.\n[2020] Bronze Award in Challenge Cup Competition Jiangxi Province.\n[2019] Third Prize in Jiangxi Province in Huachuang Cup Market Investigation and Analysis\n\t\t\t\t\t\tCompetition.\n[2019] Second Prize in Jiangxi Fujian Zone in iCAN Competition.\n[2019] National Third Prize in 2019 Pan-Pearl River Delta University Student Computer Works\n\t\t\t\t\t\tCompetition.\n[2019] National Third Prize in Chinese University Student Computer Design Competition.\n[2019] First Prize (Special Project award) in University Student Computer Works Competition of\n\t\t\t\t\t\tJiangxi Province.\n[2019] Third Prize in National Final of Lanqiao Cup.\n[2019] Third Prize in Challenge Cup National Undergraduate Curricular Academic Science and\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTechnology Works Contest.\n[2018] Third Prize in University Student Computer Works Competition of Jiangxi Province.\n[2020] National Subject in National University Student Innovation and Entrepreneurship Training\n\t\t\t\t\t\tProgramme (National Level, Finish with Excellent Level).\nAppointment\nTo schedule an appointment with me, please use the following link:\n© Untitled. All rights reserved.\nTemplate:\nXiaoxiao Li's Personal Website"
  },
