    "homepage_text": "Yuan Xie's Homepage\nHome\nNews\nResearch\nPeople\nPublications\nAdvice\nPersonal\nResearch\nProf. Xie'sÂ  research interests include VLSI Design,\r\n\t\tElectronics Design Automation, Computer Architecture, Embedded Systems\r\n\t\tDesign.Â  Specifically, recent research projects he has been involved include\r\n\t\tEDA tools and architectures for 3D IC design,Â  embedded system synthesis, low\r\n\t\tpower and thermal-aware techniques, robust design techniques related to soft\r\n\t\terrors and process variation.Â\nHis research is supported by\nNSF\n,\nDARPA\n,\nSRC\n,\nIBM\n,Â\nThe Technology\r\n\t\tCollaborative\n,\nHonda\n,\nToyota\n,\nQualcomm\n,\nITRI\nCURRENT\r\n\t\tRESEARCH PROJECTS:\n[3DIC: EDA,Architecture and Application for Emerging 3D Integrated Circuits]\n[MAAEMO: Modeling, Architecture and Application for Emerging Memory Technologies]\n[Variation Aware Design\r\n\t\t    Methdologies]\n[Soft Errors Analysis\r\n\t\t    and Mitigation]\n[Low Power and Thermal-Aware\r\n\t\t  Design]\n[Embedded System Synthesis/Design]\nPUBLICATIONS\nThe Pennsylvania State University"
