    "homepage_text": "Pei-Yu Cheng\nSkip to content\nPei-Yu Cheng\nMenu\nAbout\nDr. Pei-Yu Cheng is an associate professor in the Department of Information Management at Tamkang University, Taiwan. He received his Ph.D. in the Department of Engineering Science from National Cheng Kung University in 2020. His main research interests include Education technology, artificial intelligence applications in education, and Learning Analytics.\nResearch Interests:\nEducational Technology, Data Mining & Analytics, Artificial Intelligence Applications, Cybersecurity.\nExperience:\nAssociate Professor\n–\n2024/08 ~ Present\nDepartment of Information Management\nTamkang University, Taiwan\nAssistant Professor\n–\n2021/08 ~ 2024/07\nDepartment of Information Management\nTamkang University, Taiwan\nPostdoctoral Fellow –\n2020/08 ~ 2021/07\nGraduate School of Technological and Vocational Education\nNational Yunlin University of Science and Technology, Taiwan\nAdjunct Assistant Professor –\n2020/09 ~ 2021/07\nDepartment of Information and Learning Technology\nNational University of Tainan, Taiwan\nAdjunct Lecturer –\n2018/09 ~ 2020/06\nNational University of Tainan, Taiwan\nVisiting Scholar –\n2016/08 ~ 2017/08\nDepartment of Learning Technologies\nUniversity of North Texas, USA\nAdjunct Lecturer –\n2015/02 ~ 2015/08\nCTBC Financial Management College, Taiwan\nComputer Teacher –\n2014/09 ~ 2018/06\nSheng li Elementary School, Tainan, Taiwan\nEducation\nPh.D. – Department of Engineering Science, National Cheng Kung University\nContact\nPei-Yu Cheng 鄭培宇\nDepartment of Information Management\nTamkang University\nE-mail:\npeiyu.cheng.tw@gmail.com\n;\npeiyu@gms.tku.edu.tw\n\n---\n\nPei-Yu Cheng\nSkip to content\nPei-Yu Cheng\nMenu\nAbout\nDr. Pei-Yu Cheng is an associate professor in the Department of Information Management at Tamkang University, Taiwan. He received his Ph.D. in the Department of Engineering Science from National Cheng Kung University in 2020. His main research interests include Education technology, artificial intelligence applications in education, and Learning Analytics.\nResearch Interests:\nEducational Technology, Data Mining & Analytics, Artificial Intelligence Applications, Cybersecurity.\nExperience:\nAssociate Professor\n–\n2024/08 ~ Present\nDepartment of Information Management\nTamkang University, Taiwan\nAssistant Professor\n–\n2021/08 ~ 2024/07\nDepartment of Information Management\nTamkang University, Taiwan\nPostdoctoral Fellow –\n2020/08 ~ 2021/07\nGraduate School of Technological and Vocational Education\nNational Yunlin University of Science and Technology, Taiwan\nAdjunct Assistant Professor –\n2020/09 ~ 2021/07\nDepartment of Information and Learning Technology\nNational University of Tainan, Taiwan\nAdjunct Lecturer –\n2018/09 ~ 2020/06\nNational University of Tainan, Taiwan\nVisiting Scholar –\n2016/08 ~ 2017/08\nDepartment of Learning Technologies\nUniversity of North Texas, USA\nAdjunct Lecturer –\n2015/02 ~ 2015/08\nCTBC Financial Management College, Taiwan\nComputer Teacher –\n2014/09 ~ 2018/06\nSheng li Elementary School, Tainan, Taiwan\nEducation\nPh.D. – Department of Engineering Science, National Cheng Kung University\nContact\nPei-Yu Cheng 鄭培宇\nDepartment of Information Management\nTamkang University\nE-mail:\npeiyu.cheng.tw@gmail.com\n;\npeiyu@gms.tku.edu.tw\n\n---\n\nPei-Yu Cheng\nSkip to content\nPei-Yu Cheng\nMenu\nAbout\nDr. Pei-Yu Cheng is an associate professor in the Department of Information Management at Tamkang University, Taiwan. He received his Ph.D. in the Department of Engineering Science from National Cheng Kung University in 2020. His main research interests include Education technology, artificial intelligence applications in education, and Learning Analytics.\nResearch Interests:\nEducational Technology, Data Mining & Analytics, Artificial Intelligence Applications, Cybersecurity.\nExperience:\nAssociate Professor\n–\n2024/08 ~ Present\nDepartment of Information Management\nTamkang University, Taiwan\nAssistant Professor\n–\n2021/08 ~ 2024/07\nDepartment of Information Management\nTamkang University, Taiwan\nPostdoctoral Fellow –\n2020/08 ~ 2021/07\nGraduate School of Technological and Vocational Education\nNational Yunlin University of Science and Technology, Taiwan\nAdjunct Assistant Professor –\n2020/09 ~ 2021/07\nDepartment of Information and Learning Technology\nNational University of Tainan, Taiwan\nAdjunct Lecturer –\n2018/09 ~ 2020/06\nNational University of Tainan, Taiwan\nVisiting Scholar –\n2016/08 ~ 2017/08\nDepartment of Learning Technologies\nUniversity of North Texas, USA\nAdjunct Lecturer –\n2015/02 ~ 2015/08\nCTBC Financial Management College, Taiwan\nComputer Teacher –\n2014/09 ~ 2018/06\nSheng li Elementary School, Tainan, Taiwan\nEducation\nPh.D. – Department of Engineering Science, National Cheng Kung University\nContact\nPei-Yu Cheng 鄭培宇\nDepartment of Information Management\nTamkang University\nE-mail:\npeiyu.cheng.tw@gmail.com\n;\npeiyu@gms.tku.edu.tw"
