    "homepage_text": "Ruiqi Gao\nRuiqi Gao\nI am a Research Scientist at Google DeepMind. I am mainly interested in generative models and representation learning. My recent research focus is to construct powerful generative AI models that can comprehend, generate, and reason with multi-modal data, including natural language, images, videos and 3D. I obtained my Ph.D. from\nUCLA\nadvised by\nSong-Chun Zhu\nand\nYing Nian Wu\n. Prior to that, I received my B.S. degree of Statistics from\nPeking University\n.\nContact:\nruiqimgao at gmail dot com\nPlease check my\nGoogle Scholar\nand\nCV\nfor latest publications and projects."
  },
