    "homepage_text": "Baolin Peng at Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nBaolin Peng\nPrincipal Research Manager\nAbout\nI am a Principal Researcher with the Microsoft Research Deep Learning Group, specializing in developing Large Language Model (LLM)-powered agents. My work is centered on enabling LLMs to think and act, pushing the boundaries of how these models can interact with and adapt to dynamic environments. I received my Ph.D. in Computer Science from The Chinese University of Hong Kong.\nWe are hiring full/part-time research interns. Please drop me an email with your latest CV if you are interested and working on the following topics:\nAgents\nComplex reasoning and planning for LLM\nReinforcement Learning for LLM\nOpens in a new tab\nResearch areas\nArtificial intelligence\nHuman language technologies\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on Instagram\nSubscribe to our RSS feed\nShare this page:\nShare on X\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nShare on Reddit\n\n---\n\nBaolin Peng at Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nBaolin Peng\nPrincipal Research Manager\nOther\nOpens in a new tab\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on Instagram\nSubscribe to our RSS feed\nShare this page:\nShare on X\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nShare on Reddit\n\n---\n\nBaolin Peng at Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nBaolin Peng\nPrincipal Research Manager\nOther\nOpens in a new tab\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on Instagram\nSubscribe to our RSS feed\nShare this page:\nShare on X\nShare on Faceboo