    "homepage_text": "Zebin You\nZebin You (游泽彬)\nPh.D. Candidate\nGaoling School of Artificial Intelligence\nRenmin University of China\nEmail:  yzb1519372367[at]gmail[dot]com\nLinks:\n[Google Scholar]\n[Github]\nAbout Me\nI expect to graduate in June 2027 and am actively seeking opportunities in industry or research positions.\nI am always open to discussions and collaborations—please feel free to reach out.\nI am a fourth-year Ph.D. candidate in the GSAI-ML Group at the Gaoling School of Artificial Intelligence, Renmin University of China, fortunately advised by Prof.\nChongxuan Li\n. His rigor, dedication, and pursuit of excellence have greatly inspired and shaped my academic journey, for which I am deeply grateful.\nMy research interests include\nMultimodal Diffusion Models\n. Recently, I have been particularly interested in\nLarge Language Diffusion Models\nand their applications.\nSelected Papers\nLarge Language Diffusion Models\nShen Nie, Fengqi Zhu,\nZebin You\n, Xiaolu Zhang, Jingyang Ou, Jun Hu, Jun Zhou, Yankai Lin, Ji-Rong Wen, Chongxuan Li\nOral\n, Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems\n(NeurIPS)\n, 2025\nLong Paper Best Paper Award, DeLTa@ICLR 2025\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nDiffusion Models and Semi-Supervised Learners Benefit Mutually with Few Labels\nZebin You\n, Yong Zhong, Fan Bao, Jiacheng Sun, Chongxuan Li, Jun Zhu\nSpotlight\n, Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems\n(NeurIPS)\n, 2023\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nFull Papers\nLLaDA-V: Large Language Diffusion Models with Visual Instruction Tuning\nZebin You\n, Shen Nie, Xiaolu Zhang, Jun Zhou, Zhiwu Lu, Ji-Rong Wen, Chongxuan Li\nComputer Vision and Pattern Recognition Conference\n(CVPR)\n, 2026\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nLLaDA-o: An Effective and Length-Adaptive Omni Diffusion Model\nZebin You\n, Xiaolu Zhang, Jun Zhou, Ji-Rong Wen, Chongxuan Li\nPreprint\n, 2026\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nLLaDA-MoE: A Sparse MoE Diffusion Language Model\nPreprint\n, 2025\n[Paper]\nLarge Language Diffusion Models\nShen Nie, Fengqi Zhu,\nZebin You\n, Xiaolu Zhang, Jingyang Ou, Jun Hu, Jun Zhou, Yankai Lin, Ji-Rong Wen, Chongxuan Li\nOral\n, Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems\n(NeurIPS)\n, 2025\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nEffective and Efficient Masked Image Generation Models\nZebin You\n, Jingyang Ou, Xiaolu Zhang, Jun Hu, Jun Zhou, Chongxuan Li\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning\n(ICML)\n, 2025\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nAdaptive Task Balancing for Visual Instruction Tuning via Inter-Task Contribution and Intra-Task Difficulty\nYanqi Dai, Yong Wang,\nZebin You\n, Dong Jing, Xiangxiang Chu, Zhiwu Lu\nThe Web Conference\n(WWW)\n, 2026\n[Paper]\nAre Images Indistinguishable to Humans Also Indistinguishable to Classifiers?\nZebin You\n, Xinyu Zhang, Hanzhong Guo, Jingdong Wang, Chongxuan Li\nComputer Vision and Pattern Recognition Conference\n(CVPR)\n, 2025\n[Paper]\nDiffusion Models and Semi-Supervised Learners Benefit Mutually with Few Labels\nZebin You\n, Yong Zhong, Fan Bao, Jiacheng Sun, Chongxuan Li, Jun Zhu\nSpotlight\nAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems\n(NeurIPS)\n, 2023\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nPoseCrafter: One-Shot Personalized Video Synthesis Following Flexible Pose Control\nYong Zhong, Min Zhao,\nZebin You\n, Xiaofeng Yu, Changwang Zhang, Chongxuan Li\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision\n(ECCV)\n, 2024\n[Paper]\n[Demo]\nExperience\nResearch Intern\n,\nAnt Group\n, Beijing, China (2024.06 - )\nWorking on Large Language Diffusion Models\nMentor:\nXiaolu Zhang\nResearch Intern\n,\nBaidu VIS\n, Beijing, China (2024.01 - 2024.05)\nWorking on Diffusion Models\nMentor:\nXinyu Zhang\nAcademic Services\nConference Reviewer\nConference reviewer for ICLR, CVPR, ICML, NeurIPS, MM\nJournal Reviewer\nJournal reviewer for TPAMI\n© 2024 Zebin You"
