    "homepage_text": "Home Page | 上线了sxl.cn\nHaozhao Wang\nBio\nWhat are we doing now?\nPapers\nBooks and Chapters\nAwards\nProjects\nService\nContact\n…\nBio\nWhat are we doing now?\nPapers\nBooks and Chapters\nAwards\nProjects\nService\nContact\nHaozhao Wang\nBio\nWhat are we doing now?\nPapers\nBooks and Chapters\nAwards\nProjects\nService\nContact\n…\nBio\nWhat are we doing now?\nPapers\nBooks and Chapters\nAwards\nProjects\nService\nContact\nBio\n2025 - now\n:\nAssistant Professor in School of Computer Science and Technology,\nHuazhong University of Science and Technology.\n2023 - 2024\n:\nResearch Fellow in\nNanyang Technological University (\nNTU) under the supervision of Tianwei Zhang.\n2021 - 2023\n:\nPostDoc at Huazhong University of Science and Technology (HUST) under the supervision of Ruixuan Li and Zhigang Zeng.\n2016 - 2021\n:\nPh.D. in HUST under the supervision of Ruixuan Li.\n2018 - 2021\n:\nResearch Assistant at PolyU in Hongkong for Song Guo.\n2012 - 2016\n:\nB.S. at University of Electronic Science and Technology of China (UESTC).\nWhat are we doing now?\nCollaborative\nIntelligence:\nCollaboration among\nMultiple Agents, Multiple Modalilties, Multiple Users,\nCloud and Edge\nCollaborative Learning among Multiple Parties\nMulti-LLM-Agent\nRAG+LLM\nFederated Learning\nDistributed Learning\nTrustworthy Learning\nCollaborative Intelligence among\nEdge and Cloud\nLearning on\nEdge Devices\nwith\nTiny\nResources\nHeterogeneity\nSmall Memory\nLimited Computing Capacity\nLimited Communication Bandwidth\nFew Data\nPapers\nPreprints\nGuoTianci Huang,\nHaozhao Wang\n*, Junpeng Zhao, Gaosheng Wu, Wenchao Xu, Ruixuan Li.\nContrastGen: A Multi-Agent Contrastive Framework for Hard Retrieval Data Generation and Mining\n.\npreprint 2025.\nShiwei Li, Zhuoqi Hu, Xing Tang,\nHaozhao Wang\n, Shijie Xu, Weihong Luo, Yuhua Li, Xiuqiang He, Ruixuan Li.\nMixed-Precision Embeddings for Large-Scale Recommendation Models\n. arXiv.\nTianzhe Xiao, Yichen Li, Yining Qi,\nHao