    "homepage_text": "Microsoft researchers and engineers working around the world\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nTurning dreams into reality\nDiscover what our researchers around the world have been up to lately.\nPeople\nGet to know Microsoft researchers and engineers who are tackling complex problems across a wide range of disciplines.\nVisit the\nMicrosoft Emeritus Researchers page\nto learn about those who have made significant contributions to the field of computer science during their years at Microsoft and throughout their career.\nOpens in a new tab\nSearch for a person\nShowing: All people\nHamna .\nResearch Fellow\nLearn more\nAshkan Aazami\nSenior Data Scientist\nLearn more\nSoheil Abbasloo\nSenior Researcher\nLearn more\nSara Abdali\nSenior Researcher\nLearn more\nNajeeb G. Abdulhamid\nResearcher\nLearn more\nOmar Abou El-khir\nPrincipal Research Engineering Manager\nLearn more\nRobin Abraham\nPartner General Manager\nLearn more\nTolga Acar\nSecurity Architect\nLearn more\nMahmoud Adada\nPrincipal Engineering Manager\nLearn more\nDeanne Adams\nXbox Researcher\nLearn more\nLogan Adams\nHardware Engineer\nLearn more\nPhilip Adams\nSoftware Engineer\nLearn more\nSam Ade Jacobs\nPrincipal Researcher\nLearn more\nGbola Afonja\nPrincipal Research Product Manager\nLearn more\nSharad Agarwal\nSenior Principal Researcher\nLearn more\nVishesh Agarwal\nSoftware Engineer II\nLearn more\nSahaj Agarwal\nSenior Research Software Engineer\nLearn more\nAshvin Agrawal\nPrincipal Research SDE\nLearn more\nAnkita Agrawal\nData Scientist\nLearn more\nHao Ai\nSenior Data Scientist\nLearn more\nLin Ai\nSenior Applied Scientist\nLearn more\nRobert Aichner\nPrincipal Program Manager\nLearn more\nEmanuele Aiello\nResearcher\nLearn more\nSarah Alamdari\nSenior Applied Scientist\nLearn more\nShow more\nresearcher profiles\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe