    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Yinjun Harold JIA - Academic Homepage\nEN\n中文\nYinjun (Harold) JIA\nPostdoc Researcher\nTsinghua AIR\njiayinjun@air.tsinghua.edu.cn\njiayinjunharold@gmail.com\nAbout\nI am a Postdoctoral Researcher at THU-AIR and a Neuroscience PhD graduate from the IDG/McGovern Institute for Brain Research, Tsinghua University. Driven by a passion for\nAI4Science\n, my research focuses on using unsupervised learning and synthetic data to solve complex pharmaceutical and biological problems. See more about me via\nTimeline\nWork and Education\nPostdoc in AIDD\nInstitute for AI Industry Research (AIR)\nTsinghua University\n2025.02 - Present\nPh.D. in Neuroscience\nIDG/McGovern Institute for Brain Research\nTsinghua University\n2020.09 – 2024.12\nB.S. in Life Sciences\nSchool of Life Sciences\nTsinghua University\n2016.09 – 2020.06\nHigh School\nBeijing National Day School (BNDS)\n2010.09 – 2016.06\nResearch Highlights\nDeep contrastive learning enables genome-wide virtual screening.\nYinjun Jia\n†, Bowen Gao†, Jiaxin Tan†, Jiqing Zheng†, Xin Hong†, Wenyu Zhu, Haichuan Tan, Yuan Xiao, Liping Tan, Hongyi Cai, Yanwen Huang, Zhiheng Deng, Xiangwei Wu, Yue Jin, Yafei Yuan, Jiekang Tian, Wei He, Weiying Ma, Yaqin Zhang, Lei Liu*, Chuangye Yan*, Wei Zhang*, Yanyan Lan* (\nCo-first Author\n)\nScience\n2026\nDemo\nGitHub\nPaper\nManipulating 3D Molecules in a Fixed-Dimensional E(3)-Equivariant Latent Space.\nZitao Chen†,\nYinjun Jia\n†*, Zitong Tian†, Wei-Ying Ma, Yanyan Lan* (\nCo-first and Co-corresponding Author\n)\nNeurIPS\n2025\nGitHub\nPaper\nSelfee, self-supervised features extraction of animal behaviors\nYinjun Jia\n*, Shuaishuai Li, Xuan Guo, Bo Lei, Junqiang Hu, Xiao-Hong Xu, Wei Zhang* (\nCo-corresponding Author\n)\neLife\n2022\nGitHub\nPaper"
  },
  "deep_homepage::Bo Liu::https://ergodicmarkovian.github.io/main/": {
