    "homepage_text": "Xiaoming Liu's MSU homepage\nWelcome !\nHOME\nPUBLICATIONS\nRESEARCH\nTEACHING\nCONTACT\nXiaoming Liu\nAnil K. and Nandita Jain Endowed Professor of Engineering\nMSU Foundation Professor\nDepartment of\nComputer Science and Engineering\nMichigan State\nUniversity\nPh.D., Carnegie Mellon University (2004)\nGoogle\nScholar Page\nResearch\nInterests\nComputer Vision, Pattern Recognition,\nImage and Video Processing, Machine Learning, Human Computer Interface,\nMedical Image Analysis, Multimedia Retrieval. Here is my latest\nCurriculum vitae\n.\nResearch Group\nComputer Vision Laboratory\nHiring\nThere\nare one immediate opening for\npost-doc\nand one opening available for\nPh.D. student\nstarting Fall\n2019. The ideal applicant is\nself-motivated and has\nstrong skills in both mathematics and programming. The post-doc\ncandidate is expected to have a strong publication record in the\ncomputer vision area, and experience on face-related research is preferred. Please email me with your CV if\nyou are interested in the opportunities.\nSelected\nServices\nProgram Chair:\nBTAS 2018\nArea Chair: ICPR 2012, ICB 2013,\nWACV 2014\n,\nAVSS 2014\n,\nFG 2015\n,\nWACV 2016\n,\nICPR 2016\n,\nFG 2017\n,\nCVPR 2017\n,\nICIP 2017\n.\nPublications\nUp-to-date list at\nhttp://cvlab.cse.msu.edu/category/publications.html\nTeaching\nSpring\n2014, 2015, 2016, 2017: CSE 471 Media Processing and Multimedia\nSpring 2013:\nCSE891-006 Computer Vision Seminar\nFall\n2012, 2013,\n2014, 2015: CSE803\nComputer Vision\nContact\nInfo\nEmail:\nliuxm_at_cse.msu.edu\nURL:\nhttp://www.cse.msu.edu/~liuxm\nOffice\nPhone:\n+1 (517) 355-2359\nFax:\n+1 (517) 432-1061\nOffice\nAddress:\nEB 3137\n(MSU Campus Map)\nMailing\nAddress:\nXiaoming Liu\nDepartment of Computer\nScience and Engineering\nMichigan State University\n3115 Engineering\nBuilding,\n428 South Shaw Lane\nEast Lansing, MI 48824\nU.S.A\nBack To Top\nWebsite\ndeisgn by\ncourtesy of Rong Jin CSE,MSU"
  },
  "deep_homepage::Xuming He::https://harrisonlhe.wixsite.com/website": {
