    "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/zhaobozb/",
    "homepage_text": "Welcome to Bo Zhao's Homepage\nBo Zhao\nTechnical Lead, ML/AI\nBank of Montreal AI\nAbout\nI am an AI Technical Lead and Researcher with over 8 years of experience bridging the gap between state-of-the-art AI and regulated, large-scale financial systems. \nI specialize in translating complex research into scalable banking solutions, having led cross-functional teams to deploy award-winning AI products serving over 2 million users.\nMy work is grounded in a deep academic foundation. Before entering the industry, I was a Postdoctoral Research Fellow at\nthe University of British Columbia\nand\nVector Institute\nwith Prof.\nLeonid Sigal\n.\nI obtained my Ph.D. degree from\nSouthwest Jiaotong University\nin 2017, supervised by Prof.\nXiao Wu\n.\nDuring the final two years of my Ph.D., I was visiting the\nLearn­ing and Vi­sion Re­search Group\nat\nNational University of Singapore\n, supervised by Prof.\nJiashi Feng\nand Prof.\nShuicheng Yan\n.\nPublications\nDwNet: Dense Warp-based Network for Pose-guided Human Video Generation\nPolina Zablotskaia, Aliaksandr Siarohin, Leonid Sigal,\nBo Zhao\nBritish Machine Vision Conference (BMVC), 2019\n[\narXiv\n] [\nBibTex\n]\nImage Generation from Layout\nBo Zhao\n, Lili Meng, Weidong Yin, Leonid Sigal\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2019\n[\nCVPR\n] [\nIJCV\n] [\nBibTex\n] [\nCode\n]\nWhere and When to Look? Spatial-temporal Attention for Action Recognition in Videos\nLili Meng,\nBo Zhao\n, Bo Chang, Gao Huang, Frederick Tung, Leonid Sigal\narXiv preprint, 2018\n[\narXiv\n] [\nBibTex\n]\nModular Generative Adversarial Networks\nBo Zhao\n, Bo Chang, Zequn Jie, Leonid Sigal\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV), 2018\n[\narXiv\n] [\nBibTex\n]\nMulti-View Image Generation from a Single-View\nBo Zhao\n, Xiao Wu, Zhi-Qi Cheng, Hao Liu, Zequn Jie, Jiashi Feng\nACM Multimedia (MM), 2018\n[\nPaper\n] [\nBibTex\n]\nInterpretable Multimodal Retrieval for Fashion Products\nLizi Liao, Xiangnan He,\nBo Zhao\n, Chong-Wah Ngo, Tat-Seng Chua\nACM MM, 2018\n[\nPaper\n] [\nBibTex\n]\nLeft-Right Comparative Recurrent Model for Stereo Matching\nZequn Jie, Pengfei Wang, Yonggen Ling,\nBo Zhao\n, Yunchao Wei, Jiashi Feng, Wei Liu\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2018\n[\narXiv\n] [\nBibTex\n]\nSketch Recognition with Deep Visual-Sequential Fusion Model\nJun-Yan He, Xiao Wu, Yu-Gang Jiang,\nBo Zhao\n, Qiang Peng\nACM Multimedia (MM), 2017\n[\nPaper\n] [\nBibTex\n]\nNeural Person Search Machines\nHao Liu, Jiashi Feng, Zequn Jie, Karlekar Jayashree,\nBo Zhao\n, Meibin Qi, Jianguo Jiang, Shuicheng Yan\nInternational Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV), 2017\n[\narXiv\n] [\nBibTex\n]\nMemory-Augmented Attribute Manipulation Networks for Interactive Fashion Search\nBo Zhao\n, Jiashi Feng, Xiao Wu, Shuicheng Yan\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2017\n[\nPaper\n] [\nBibTex\n]\nDiversified Visual Attention Networks for Fine-Grained Object Classification\nBo Zhao\n, Xiao Wu, Jiashi Feng, Qiang Peng, Shuicheng Yan\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia, 2016 (SCI, IF: 2.536)\n[\narXiv\n] [\nBibTex\n]\nA Survey on Deep Learning-Based Fine-Grained Object Classification and Semantic Segmentation\nBo Zhao\n, Jiashi Feng, Xiao Wu, Qiang Peng, Shuicheng Yan\nInternational Journal of Automation and Computing, 2016 (EI)\n[\nPaper\n] [\nBibTex\n]\nClothing Cosegmentation for Shopping Images\nBo Zhao\n, Xiao Wu, Qiang Peng, Shuicheng Yan\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia, 2016 (SCI, IF: 2.536)\n[\nPaper\n] [\nBibTex\n]\nClothing Extraction Using Region-Based Segmentation and Pixel-Level Refinement\nZhaorui Liu, Xiao Wu,\nBo Zhao\n, Qiang Peng\nIEEE International Symposium on Multimedia (ISM), 2014 (EI)\n[\nPaper\n] [\nBibTex\n]\nClothing Extraction by Coarse Region Localization and Fine Foreground/Background Estimation\nXiao Wu,\nBo Zhao\n, Ling-Ling Liang, Qiang Peng\nInternational Conference on Multimedia Modeling (MMM), 2013 (EI)\n[\nPaper\n] [\nBibTex\n]\n© Last updated on Feb. 7th 2026. All rights reserved."
