    "homepage_text": "Zongyue Qin\nZongyue Qin\nCS PhD\nin UCLA\n©\nCopyright ©\nAll rights reserved | This template is made with\nby\nColorlib\nHi!\nI'm Zongyue\nI am a PhD student at\nUCLA CS\n. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMy advisor is\nProf. Yizhou Sun\nI am\nan explorer\nExploring new ideas and trying new things\nDownload CV\nAbout Me\nWho Am I?\nI am currently a PHD student advised by Prof. Yizhou Sun at Computer Science, UCLA. I joined the department in 2020 Fall.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPrior to that, I was an undergraduate student at Yuanpei College, Peking University."
