    "homepage_text": "Staff – University of Copenhagen\nStart\nToggle navigation\nDepartment of Computer Science\nDepartment of Computer Science\nDepartment of Computer Science DIKU\nStaff\nMingzhi Wang\nPhD Fellow\nMachine Learning\nhttps://di.ku.dk/english/research/machine-learning/\nUniversitetsparken 1\nKøbenhavn Ø\nE-mail:\nmingzhi.wang@di.ku.dk\nTelephone: +4535330183\nView research profile and publications\nEmployees in the research sections\nEmployees in the research sections\nAlgorithms and Complexity\nHuman-Centred Computing\nImage Analysis, Computational Modelling, and Geometry\nMachine Learning\nNatural Language Processing\nPioneer AI\nProgramming Languages and Theory of Computation\nSoftware, Data, People, & Society\nDepartment of Computer Science\nUniversity of Copenhagen\nUniversitetsparken 1\nDK-2100 Copenhagen Ø\nContact:\nDepartment of Computer Science\ninfo\n@\ndi\n.\nku\n.\ndk"
