    "homepage_text": "Welcome to Jinhui Xu's Homepage\nJinhui Xu, PhD, Professor\nDepartment\nof Computer Science and Engineering\n,\nState University of New York at Buffalo\n(SUNY Buffalo),\n338 Davis Hall, Buffalo, NY 14260, USA\nPhone: (716) 645-4734\nFax: (716) 645-3464\nEmail:\njinhui\nAT\nbuffalo\nDOT\nedu\nHome\nResearch\nTeaching\nContacts\nUniversity at\nBuffalo (SUNY)\nDept. of Comp. Sci. and Eng.\nDr. Xu\nis\ncurrently a professor\nof  Computer Science and Engineering  at the University\nat Buffalo,  the State University of  New York. He received\nhis BS and MS degrees\nin Computer\nScience from the University of Science and Technology of China (USTC),\nand his PhD degree in Computer Science and Engineering from\nthe University of Notre Dame in 2000.\nDr. Xu works in the fields of Algorithms,\nComputational\nGeometry, Machine Learning, Differential Privacy and\ntheir applications in several applied domains (such as medicine, biology, and networking).\nHis research is about \ndeveloping the most efficient geometric algorithms, machine learning techniques, and differentially private methods for  \na wide range of fundamental problems. In recent years, he has focused on solving high dimensional geometric problems, especially those  from machine learning.\nDr. Xu's research has been supported by National Science Foundation\n(NSF), National Institute of Health (NIH),  NYSTAR, IBM, and\nUniversity at Buffalo. He is the recipient of a number of prestigious awards, such as the SUNY Chancellor's Award for Excellence in Scholarship and Creative Activities (2017), UB Exceptional Scholar: Sustained Achievement Award (2015), UB Excellence in Graduate Mentoring Award (2021), and the NSF \n CAREER Award (2005).\nGraduate\nStudent Recruiting:\nPotential Ph.D. students with\nstrong mathematical\nbackground (including math students) are welcome to apply.\n\n---\n\nWelcome to Jinhui Xu's Homepage\nHome\nResearch\nTeaching\nContacts\nUniversity at Buffalo (SUNY)\nDept. of Comp. Sci. and Eng.\nEmail\nÂ  Â  Â  Â\njinhui\nat\nbuffalo\ndot\nedu\nPostal Address\nÂ  Â  Â  Â  Department of Computer Science and Engineering\nÂ  Â  Â  Â  State University of New York at Buffalo\nÂ  Â  Â  Â  338 Davis Hall\nÂ  Â  Â  Â  Buffalo, NY 14260, USA\nPhone/Fax\nÂ  Â  Â  Â  Phone: Â  (716) 645-4734\nÂ\nÂ  Â  Â  Â  Fax: Â  Â  Â  (716) 645-3464\nÂ\nÂ\n\n---\n\nWelcome to Jinhui Xu's Homepage\nHome\nResearch\nTeaching\nContacts\nUniversity at Buffalo (SUNY)\nDept. of Comp. Sci. and Eng.\nEmail\nÂ  Â  Â  Â\njinhui\nat\nbuffalo\ndot\nedu\nPostal Address\nÂ  Â  Â  Â  Department of Computer Science and Engineering\nÂ  Â  Â  Â  State University of New York at Buffalo\nÂ  Â  Â  Â  338 Davis Hall\nÂ  Â  Â  Â  Buffalo, NY 14260, USA\nPhone/Fax\nÂ  Â  Â  Â  Phone: Â  (716) 645-4734\nÂ\nÂ  Â  Â  Â  Fax: Â  Â  Â  (716) 645-3464\nÂ\nÂ"
