    "homepage_text": "Chengchang Liu (刘程畅)\nChengchang Liu\nPh.D. Candidate@CUHK｜Incoming Assistant Professor@Westlake University\nEmail:\n7liuchengchang@gmail.com\n|\nliuchengchang@westlake.edu.cn\nAbout me\nI am a Ph.D. candidate under supervision of Prof.\nJohn C.S. Lui\n.\nI received a B.S. in Statistics from\nUSTC\nin 2022.\nPreviously, I visited\nCUHK (SZ)\nin 2024, hosted by Prof.\nZhi-Quan (Tom) Luo\n.\nMy research focuses on optimization, as well as its intersection with quantum computing and artificial intelligence.\nI will join\nDepartment of Artificial Intelligence\n, School of Engineering at Westlake University as an Assistant Professor in 2027. Please feel free to drop me an email if you want to work with me.\nSelected Publications (\nGoogle Scholar\n)\nQuantum Speedups for Minimax Optimization and Beyond.\nChengchang Liu\n, Zongqi Wan, Jialin Zhang, Xiaoming Sun, John C.S. Lui.\nNeurIPS, 2025\nSolving Convex-Concave Problems with Õ(ɛ^{-4/7}) Second-Order Oracle Complexity.\nLesi Chen,\nChengchang Liu\n, Luo Luo, Jingzhao Zhang.\nCOLT, 2025\nPartial-Quasi-Newton Methods: Efficient Algorithms for Minimax Optimization Problems with Unbalanced Dimensionality.\nChengchang Liu\n, Shuxian Bi, Luo Luo, John C.S. Lui.\nKDD, 2022\nSelected Awards\nNSFC Basic Research Scheme for Ph.D. Student\nNational Natural Science Foundation of China, 2025-2026.\nMark Fulk Award for the Best Student Paper\nThe 38th Annual Conference on Learning Theory, 2025.\nBest Paper Award Runner-Up\nThe 28th ACM SIGKDD Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining, 2022.\nServices\nConference Reviewer: NeurIPS 2023-25, ICLR 2024-25, AISTATS 2024, ICML 2024-26, AAAI 2025.\nJournal Reviewer: IEEE TPAMI, IEEE TSIPN, Machine Learning."
  },
