    "homepage_text": "Luo Luo\nLuo Luo\nEmail: luoluo (AT) fudan (DOT) edu (DOT) cn\nMy research interests include machine learning, optimization and linear algebra.\nTeaching\nMultivariate Statistical Analysis (2022, 2023, 2024,\n2025\n)\nOptimization Theory (2023, 2024,\n2025\n)\nMultivariate Statistics (2022)\nPreprints\nJianjiang Yu, Weiguo Gao,\nLuo Luo\n.\nExplicit Global Convergence Rates of BFGS without Line Search.\narXiv preprint:2509.22508, 2025.\n[\npdf\n]\nZhuanghua Liu,\nLuo Luo\n.\nStochastic Bilevel Optimization with Heavy-Tailed Noise.\narXiv preprint:2509.14952, 2025.\n[\npdf\n]\nLuo Luo\n, Xue Cui, Tingkai Jia, Cheng Chen.\nDecentralized Stochastic Nonconvex Optimization under the Relaxed Smoothness.\narXiv preprint:2509.08726, 2025.\n[\npdf\n]\nLesi Chen, Chengchang Liu,\nLuo Luo\n, Jingzhao Zhang.\nComputationally Faster Newton Methods by Lazy Evaluations.\narXiv preprint:2501.17488, 2025.\n[\npdf\n]\nChengchang Liu, Cheng Chen,\nLuo Luo\n.\nSymmetric Rank-k Methods.\narXiv preprint:2303.16188, 2023.\n[\npdf\n]\nChengchang Liu,\nLuo Luo\n.\nRegularized Newton Methods for Monotone Variational Inequalities with Hölder Continuous Jacobians.\narXiv preprint:2212.07824, 2022.\n[\npdf\n]\nLuo Luo\n, Yunyan Bai, Lesi Chen, Yuxing Liu, Haishan Ye.\nOn the Complexity of Decentralized Smooth Nonconvex Finite-Sum Optimization.\narXiv preprint:2210.13931, 2022.\n[\npdf\n]\nPublications\nZhiling Zhou, Zhuanghua Liu, Chengchang Liu,\nLuo Luo\n.\nIncremental Gauss–Newton Methods with Superlinear Convergence Rates.\nTo appear in Journal of Optimization Theory and Applications, 2026.\n[\npdf\n]\nHongxu Chen, Ke Wei,\nLuo Luo\n.\nDecentralized Non-Convex Stochastic Optimization with Heterogeneous Variance.\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI), 2026.\nJing Xue, Zhishen Sun, Haishan Ye,\nLuo Luo\n, Xiangyu Chang, Guang Dai.\nPrivacy Leaks by Adversaries: Adversarial Iterations for Membership Inference Attack.\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligenc