      "yifei.zhang.yz2489@yale.edu"
    ],
    "matched_email": null,
    "github": null,
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Yifei Zhang (张逸飞） - Homepage\nYifei Zhang\nIncoming Ph.D. student, School of Public Health, Yale University\nBiostatistics @ Yale\nNew Haven, Connecticut, USA\nEmail\nWelcome to my page!\nMy name is Yifei Zhang. I am  an incoming Ph.D. student at the\nYale School of Public Health\nBiostatistics Department, supervised by\nProf Yize Zhao\n. Before joining Yale, I earned a Master of Science in Statistics and Operations Research from the\nUniversity of North Carolina at Chapel Hill(UNC) STOR Department\n, supervised by Prof\nZhengwu Zhang\n. Prior to that, I obtained a Bachelor of Science degree in Applied Mathematics from the\nUniversity of Liverpool\n.\nMy research interests include high-dimensional data analysis, computational neuroscience, Bayesian data analysis, network analysis, brain connectomics, and machine learning. I am particularly interested in the application of brain connectomics data in deep learning, specifically with diffusion models. Additionally, I have a strong interest in exploring the relationship between Alzheimer’s disease traits and brain connectomics data.\nYou can find my CV here:\nCV\n.\n🔥 News\n2025.04\n:  🎉🎉  I have successfully passed my Master’s thesis defense! Many thanks to Prof Zhengwu Zhang for his careful guidance.\n2025.03\n:  🎉🎉  I am honored to have been admitted to the Yale Biostatistics Program and to join Prof Yize Zhao’s group.\n2024.09\n:  🎉🎉  Excited to join the\nSchool of the Data Science and Society Department\nas a Graduate Teaching Assistant.\n2024.07\n:  🎉🎉  I am honored to participate in the\nEPIC Summer Camp and Workshop\n.\n📝 Publications\n🎖 Honors and Awards\n2024.07\nSDSS Departmental and In-State Tuition Award (Fully Funded MS Student), UNC, US.\n2023.07\nFirst Honor Class Graduate in Applied Mathematics, University of Liverpool, UK.\n📖 Educations\n2025.08 - Present\n, Ph.D. student at Yale School of Public Health, Biostatistics Department, supervised by\nProf Yize Zhao\n.\n2023.08 - 2025.05\n, Master of Science in Statistics and Operations Research from\nUNC STOR Department\n, supervised by\nProf Zhengwu Zhang\n.\n2019.09 - 2023.07\n, Bachelor of Science in Applied Mathematics from\nUniversity of Liverpool\n.\n💬 Invited Talks\n2024\n, “Connecting Questions to Questions: How to Translate Real-World Questions Into Deductible Insights”,\nTCM Conference, Durham, NC, USA\n.\n💻 Internships\n2020.05 - 2020.09\n, China Construction Bank – Data Analyst Intern, Henan, China.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected."
