    "homepage_text": "CV - XiangchaoYan’s HomePage\nXiangchao Yan\nAutonomous Driving & Computer Vision & 3D Transfer Learning\nFollow\nShanghai,China\nResearchGate\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nCV\nEducation\nShanghai Jiao Tong University (SJTU)\nMaster of Intelligent Manufacturing and Information Engineering\nShandong University (SDU)\nBachelor of Mechanical Engineering;\nGPA: 3.52/4.0. Ranking: 1/210\nWork Experience\nShanghai AI Lab\nAutonomous Driving Algorithm Engineer.\nJul. 2022 - Now\nResearch Topic: 3D Transfer learning, Semi-Supervised Learning.\nOpen-Source:\n3DTrans\nInternship\nOPPO\nAlgorithms Engineer Internship.\nJul. 2021 - Aug. 2021\nTopic: Face Recognition Algorithm.\nProject Experience\nPhotometric stereo vision-based defect detection for grease hoods\nMicro-optical components defect detection based on light field microscope imaging\nSemi-Supervised Domain Adaptation for 3D Point Cloud Object Detection\nPublications\nCooperative Light-Field Image Super-Resolution Based on Multi-Modality Embedding and Fusion With Frequency Attention\nBi3D: Bi-domain Active Learning for Cross-domain 3D Object Detection\nSkills\nProgramming Language: C++, Python, Matlab\nScholarship\nChinese National Scholarship\nSJTU Major Award"
