    "homepage_text": "Qilong Wu\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nQilong Wu\nQilong Wu\nPh.D. in Computer Science at UIUC\nWelcome to my webpage! My name is Qilong Wu.\nCurrently, I'm a\nsecond-\nyear\nPh.D.\nin Computer Science at UIUC. I have the honor of being supervised by\nProf. Varun Chandrasekaran\n. Previously, I\ngot my Master of Science (M.S.) in computer science at UIUC\nand my Bachelor of Science (B.S.)\nin Computer Science and Technology (Brain Science and Artificial Intelligence)\nfrom\nKuang Yaming Honors School, Nanjing University\n.\nI was privileged to work as a research assistant in Berkeley Artificial Intelligence Research (BAIR) Lab at UC Berkeley, supervised by Prof. Alberto Sangiovanni-Vincentelli & Dr. Xiangyu Yue in 2021.\nMy research is centered on trustworthy machine learning, which includes multitask learning, transfer learning, and security aspects of machine learning.\n[\nCV\n] [\nGoogle Scholar\n][\nDBLP\n]\nGet in touch at\nqilong3@illinois.edu\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
  },
  "deep_homepage::Seanie Lee::https://seanie12.github.io/": {
