    "homepage_text": "Shichao Sun's Homepage - Homepage\nShichao Sun\n孙世超\nSenior Applied Scientist @ Microsoft\nShanghai, China\nEmail\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\n✨ Hi everyone! I am currently a Senior Applied Scientist at Microsoft. Before that, I spent a year at AWS Shanghai AI Lab as an Applied Scientist, until the lab closed. I earned my Ph.D. (in 2024) from The Hong Kong Polytechnic University, fortunately advised by Prof.\nMaggie Wenjie Li\n. During the final year of my Ph.D. (2023-2024), I enjoyed the privilege of working closely with Assoc. Prof.\nPengfei Liu\nat\nGAIR Lab\n, focusing on advancements in Large Language Models (LLMs). Earlier, I received my Bachelor (in 2017) and Master (in 2020) degrees from Fudan University, mentored by Assoc. Prof.\nZhipeng Xie\n.\n🔥 My research interests span LLM-as-a-Judge, Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), and Agentic AI.\n🚀 I am always open to new collaborations and engaging discussions. Feel free to reach out if you are interested in working together or just want to chat!\n🔔 Last Update on Sep. 2025\n💼 Employments\n2025.09 - Present\n, Senior Applied Scientist, Microsoft.\n2024.09 - 2025.08\n, Applied Scientist, AWS Shanghai AI Lab.\n📖 Educations\n2020.09 - 2024.08\n, Ph.D., The Hong Kong Polytechnic University.\n2017.09 - 2020.01\n, Master, Fudan University.\n2013.09 - 2017.06\n, Bachelor, Fudan University.\n📝 Selected Publications\n(* indicates equal contribution)\nOpenResearcher: Unleashing AI for Accelerated Scientific Research\nYuxiang Zheng*,\nShichao Sun\n*, Lin Qiu, Dongyu Ru, Cheng Jiayang, Xuefeng Li, Jifan Lin, Binjie Wang, Yun Luo, Renjie Pan, Yang Xu, Qingkai Min, Zizhao Zhang, Yiwen Wang, Wenjie Li, Pengfei Liu\nEMNLP Demo, 2024\n|\nPDF\n|\nCode\nThe Critique of Critique\nShichao Sun\n, Junlong Li, Weizhe Yuan, Ruifeng Yuan, Wenjie Li, Pengfei Liu\nACL Findings, 2024\n|\nPDF\n|\nCode\nPrompt Chaining or Stepwise Prompt? Refinement in Text Summarization\nShichao Sun\n, Ruifeng Yuan, Ziqiang Cao, Wenjie Li, Pengfei Liu\nACL Findings, 2024\n|\nPDF\nDissecting Human and LLM Preferences\nJunlong Li, Fan Zhou,\nShichao Sun\n, Yikai Zhang, Hai Zhao, Pengfei Liu\nACL, 2024\n|\nPDF\n|\nCode\n|\nPage\nGenerative Judge for Evaluating Alignment\nJunlong Li,\nShichao Sun\n, Weizhe Yuan, Run-Ze Fan, Hai Zhao, Pengfei Liu\nICLR, 2024\n|\nPDF\n|\nCode\n|\nPage\nDialogue acts enhanced extract–abstract framework for meeting summarization\nShichao Sun\n, Ruifeng Yuan, Wenjie Li, Ziqiang Cao, Sujian Li\nIPM, 2024\n|\nPDF\nContrastive Preference Learning for Neural Machine Translation\nJianfei He,\nShichao Sun\n, Sen Peng, Jie Xu, Xiaohua Jia, Wenjie Li\nNAACL Findings, 2024\n|\nPDF\nAligning Language Models with Human Preferences via a Bayesian Approach\nJiashuo Wang, Haozhao Wang,\nShichao Sun\n, Wenjie Li\nNeurIPS, 2023\n|\nPDF\n|\nCode\nData Selection Curriculum for Abstractive Text Summarization\nShichao Sun\n, Ruifeng Yuan, Jianfei He, Ziqiang Cao, Wenjie Li, Xiaohua Jia\nEMNLP Findings, 2023\n|\nPDF\nSeparating Context and Pattern: Learning Disentangled Sentence Representations for Low-Resource Extractive Summarization\nRuifeng Yuan,\nShichao Sun\n, Zili Wang, Ziqiang Cao, Wenjie Li\nACL Findings, 2023\n|\nPDF\n|\nCode\nImproving Sentence Similarity Estimation for Unsupervised Extractive Summarization\nShichao Sun\n, Ruifeng Yuan, Wenjie Li, Sujian Li\nICASSP, 2023\n|\nPDF\n|\nCode\nRethinking the framework constructed by counterfactual functional model\nChao Wang, Linfang Liu,\nShichao Sun\n, Wei Wang\nApplied Intelligence, 2022\n|\nPDF\nAlleviating Exposure Bias via Contrastive Learning for Abstractive Text Summarization\nShichao Sun\n, Wenjie Li\narXiv, 2021\n|\nPDF\n|\nCode\nA Goal-Driven Tree-Structured Neural Model for Math Word Problems\nZhipeng Xie*,\nShichao Sun\n*\nIJCAI, 2019\n|\nPDF\n|\nCode\nBiLSTM-Based Models for Metaphor Detection\nShichao Sun\n, Zhipeng Xie\nNLPCC, 2017\n|\nPDF\n|\nCode\n🎖 Honors and Awards\nExcellent Graduates in Shanghai, 2020\nNational Scholarship, 2019\nExcellent Student in Fudan University, 2018\nScholarship for Outstanding Students in Fudan University, 2018\nNational Encouragement Scholarship, 2014, 2015, 2016\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected."
