    "homepage_text": "Xinyu Zhang - Homepage\nXinyu Zhang\nTongyi Lab, Alibaba Group\nTrustworthy, Safe, and Culturally Inclusive LLMs; Speech Understanding.\nHangzhou, China\nDBLP\nGoogle Scholar\nORCID\nI’m a researcher at Alibaba’s Tongyi Lab, working on the safety, trustworthinese, and cultural inclusiveness of large language models. In parallel, I study speech understanding, generation and real-time interpretation.\nI earned my Ph.D. in 2024 from Zhejiang University, under the supervision of Prof.\nKui Ren\nand Prof.\nZhongjie Ba\n, with joint guidance from Prof.\nYuan Hong\nat the University of Connecticut. My research focuses on trustworthy AI, aiming to improve the safety, robustness, and privacy of multimodal models.\nI’m always open to collaboration. Feel free to reach out at ixinyuzhang AT gmail.com. We’re also recruiting intern researchers.\n🔥 News\n2026.01\n:  🎉 Introducing open-source\nQwen3-ASR\n: robust, streaming, multilingual ASR.\n2026.01\n:  🎉 Our\nQwen3-TTS\nfamily is now open sourced!\n2025.09\n:  🎉 Our\nQwen3-Live-Translate\nmultimodal simultaneous translation API has been officially released!\n2025.08\n:  🎉 Our paper\nCultureSynth\naccepted at\nEMNLP 2025\n📍 Suzhou, China — see you there!\n2025.06\n:  🎉 Our paper\nPrivacyAsst\nhas been selected as a Popular Article in the\nIEEE TDSC\njournal!\n📝 Publications\nConference & Journal Papers\nEMNLP 2025\nCultureSynth: A Hierarchical Taxonomy-Guided and Retrieval-Augmented Framework for Cultural Question-Answer Synthesis\n,\nXinyu Zhang\n, Pei Zhang, Shuang Luo, Jialong Tang, Yu Wan, Baosong Yang, Fei Huang, 2025.\nCCS 2024\nTop4 Sec\nCertifiable Black-Box Attacks with Randomized Adversarial Examples: Breaking Defenses with Provable Confidence\n, Hanbin Hong,\nXinyu Zhang\n, Binghui Wang, Zhongjie Ba, Yuan Hong, 2024.\nTIFS 2024\nFltracer: Accurate poisoning attack provenance in federated learning\n,\nXinyu Zhang\n, Qingyu Liu, Zhongjie Ba, Yuan Hong, Tianhang Zheng, Feng Lin, Li Lu, Kui Ren, 2024.\nTDSC 2024\nPrivacyasst: Safeguarding user privacy in tool-using large language model agents\n,\nXinyu Zhang\n, Huiyu Xu, Zhongjie Ba, Zhibo Wang, Yuan Hong, Jian Liu, Zhan Qin, Kui Ren, 2024.\nS&P 2024\nTop4 Sec\nText-CRS: A Generalized Certified Robustness Framework against Textual Adversarial Attacks\n,\nXinyu Zhang\n, Hanbin Hong, Yuan Hong, Peng Huang, Binghui Wang, Zhongjie Ba, Kui Ren, 2024.\nTDSC 2021\nAn efficient e2e crowd verifiable e-voting system\n,\nXinyu Zhang\n, Bingsheng Zhang, Aggelos Kiayias, Thomas Zacharias, Kui Ren, 2021.\nCJNIS 2021\n隐私保护的加密流量检测研究\n,\nXinyu Zhang\n, Bingsheng Zhang, Quanrun Meng, Kui Ren, 网络与信息安全学报 2021.\nNDSS 2020\nTop4 Sec\nLearning-based Practical Smartphone Eavesdropping with Built-in Accelerometer\n, Zhongjie Ba, Tianhang Zheng,\nXinyu Zhang\n, Zhan Qin, Baochun Li, Xue Liu, Kui Ren, 2020.\nICDCS 2019\nCFP: Enabling camera fingerprint concealment for privacy-preserving image sharing\n, Zhongjie Ba,\nXinyu Zhang\n, Zhan Qin, Kui Ren, 2019.\nJQSRT 2019\nScattering of an Airy light-sheet by a non-spherical particle using discrete dipole approximation\n,\nXinyu Zhang\n, Yiming Yang, Jiaming Zhang, Renxian Li, 2019.\nTechnical Reports\nQwen3-ASR Technical Report\n, Qwen Team, 2026.\nQwen3-TTS Technical Report\n, Qwen Team, 2026.\nQwen3-Omni Technical Report\n, Qwen Team, 2025.\nQwen3Guard Technical Report\n, Qwen Team, 2025.\nQwen3 Technical Report\n, Qwen Team, 2025.\nQwen2 Technical Report\n, Qwen Team, 2024.\n🏆 Honors and Awards\n2024\n, Excellent Graduate of Zhejiang University (Graduate level)\n2020-2023\n, Excellent Graduate Student, Zhejiang University\n2019\n, Doctoral Freshman Entrance Scholarship, Zhejiang University\n2019\n, Outstanding Graduate of Xidian University (Undergraduate level)\n2018\n, National Scholarship (Undergraduate, Top 1%)\n2018\n, Cybersecurity Scholarship - China Internet Development Foundation\n🎓 Educations\n2019.06 - 2024.12\n, Ph.D., College of Computer Science and Technology, Zhejiang University, Hangzhou.\n2015.09 - 2019.06\n, B.Eng., School of Cyber Engineering (Elite Program), Xidian Univeristy, Xi’an.\n✈️ Internships\n2024.04 – 2024.10\n,\nResearch Intern\n, Tongyi Lab, Alibaba Group, Hangzhou, China\nSupervisor:\nBaosong Yang\nand Pei Zhang\n2022.09 – 2023.08\n,\nVisiting Researcher\n, University of Connecticut (UConn), Storrs, CT, USA\nSupervisor:\nProf.\nHong Yuan\n2018.08 – 2019.01\n,\nVisiting Student Researcher\n, Zhejiang University, Hangzhou, China\nSupervisor:\nProf.\nKui Ren\nand Prof.\nZhan Qin\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected."
