    "homepage_text": "Shitao Tang\nShitao Tang\nPh.D. candidate at Simon Fraser University\nFollow\n8888 University Dr, Burnaby, BC\nEmail\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nI am a research scientist at NVIDIA Research,\nDeep Imagination Group\n. I receive my Ph.D. from Simon Fraser University, supervised by\nProf. Yasutaka Furukawa\n. I also, fortunately, complete my master’s study under the supervision of\nProf. Ping Tan\n. My current research interest is world models.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nCV - Shitao Tang\nShitao Tang\nPh.D. candidate at Simon Fraser University\nFollow\n8888 University Dr, Burnaby, BC\nEmail\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nCV\nEducation\nB.S. in Computer Science, University of Nottingham, Ningbo, China, 2019\nM.S. in Computer Science, Simon Fraser University, 2021\nPh.D in Computer Science, Simon Fraser University, Now\nWork experience\nResearch intern, Alibaba A.I. lab, 2020-2021"
  },
  "deep_homepage::Shiqing Ma::https://people.cs.umass.edu/~shiqingma/": {
