h output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\n2\nLink opens in a new tab\nScopus \n citations\nHazards of Tattoo Procedures Performed by Non-Medical Personnel: Ist Policy Forum of the Korean Dermatological Research Foundation\nKim, D. H., Lee, G. J., Hwang, S.,\nLee, S. H.\n, Sung, H. C., Lee, S. J., Hwang, J. H., Ryoo, Y. W.,\nLee, D. H.\n, Chang, S. E. & Kang, H.,\nDec 2024\n,\nIn:\nKorean Journal of Dermatology.\n62\n,\n10\n,\np. 541-549\n9 p.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nTattooing\n100%\nTattoo\n100%\nCosmetic\n20%\nPublic Health Policy\n20%\nDermis\n20%\nView all 59 Research outputs"
