    "homepage_text": "Helin Wang - Directory@UAlberta.ca\nDirectory\nTheme\nLight\nDark\nAuto (System)\nSearch Within\nualberta.ca\nPeople\nPrograms\nServices\nQuick Links\nEmail & Apps\nBear Tracks\nCanvas\nFind a Person\nMaps\nLibrary\nNews + Events\nFolio\nThe Quad\nNew Trail\nYouAlberta\nEvents\nProspective Students\nCurrent Students\nFaculty + Staff\nAlumni + Friends\nGive to the U of A\nCareers\nIndigenous Initiatives\nAccess, Community + Belonging\nSupport During a Crisis\nHelin Wang\n/Holin Wang/\nHear pronunciation\nPostdoctoral Visitor, Faculty of Science - Biological Sciences\nPersonal Website:\nhttps://www.researchgate.net/profile/Helin-Wang-6\nContact\nOverview\nPublications\nContact\nPostdoctoral Visitor, Faculty of Science - Biological Sciences\nEmail\nhelin3@ualberta.ca\nOverview\nArea of Study / Keywords\nWater Science\nGeomicrobiology\nMicrobial ecology\nFeatured Publications\nMicrobial N2O production and the functional communities regulated by groundwater flow regime\nYaqi Wang,  Helin Wang,  Lin Zhang,  Yu Han,  Ping Li,  Yanxin Wang\nJournal of Hydrology. 2026 April; 669\n10.1016/j.jhydrol.2026.135116\nDenitrification dominates nitrate attenuation and nitrous oxide effluxes under water table fluctuations\nLin Zhang,  Helin Wang,  Xiaohan Liu, Hongbin Zhan,  Uwe Schneidewind , Stefan Krause, Menggui Jin,  Xing Liang, Yanfeng Liu, Ping Li\nJournal of Hazardous Materials. 2025 August; 493\n10.1016/j.jhazmat.2025.138325\nSynergistic interaction between microbial nitrogen fixation and iron reduction in the environment\nPing Li,  Xiaohan Liu,  Keman Bao,  Yaqi Wang,  Helin Wang,  Yanhong Wang,  Zhou Jiang,  Yi Yang,  Songhu Yuan,  Andreas Kappler,  Yanxin Wang\nThe ISME Journal. 2025 January; 19 (1):wraf212\n10.1093/ismejo/wraf212\nGroundwater flow regime shapes nitrogen functional traits by affecting microbial community assembly processes in the subsurface\nHelin Wang,  Ping Li,  Xiaohan Liu,  Yanhong Wang,  Lisa Y. Stein\nScience of The Total Environment. 2024 November;\n10.1016/j.scitotenv.2024.175083\nNitrogen fixation and diazotroph diversity in groundwater systems\nXiaohan Liu,  Ping,  Helin Wang,  Li-Li Han,  Kai Yang,  Yanhong Wang,  Zhou Jiang,  Li Cui,  Shuh-Ji Kao\nThe ISME Journal. 2023 November;\n10.1038/s41396-023-01513-x\nAn overlooked influence of reactive oxygen species on ammonia-oxidizing microbial communities in redox-fluctuating aquifers\nHelin Wang,  Ping Li,  Xiaohan Liu,  Jing Zhang,  Lisa Y. Stein,  Ji-Dong Gu\nWater Research. 2023 April;\n10.1016/j.watres.2023.119734\nTransition of source/sink processes and fate of ammonium in groundwater along with redox gradients\nLi-Li Han,  Helin Wang,  Lianghao Ge,  Min Nina Xu,  Jin-Ming Tang,  Li Luo,  Ping Li,  Shuh-Ji Kao\nWater Research. 2023 March;\n10.1016/j.watres.2023.119600\nDifferent Regulatory Strategies of Arsenite Oxidation by Two Isolated Thermus tengchongensis Strains From Hot Springs\nChangguo Yuan,  Ping Li,  Chun Qing,  Zhu Kou,  Helin Wang\nFrontiers in Microbiology. 2022 March;\n10.3389/fmicb.2022.817891\nLinking microbial community composition to farming pattern in selenium-enriched region: Potential role of microorganisms on Se geochemistry\nYanhong Wang,  Xinyan Shi,  Xianxin Huang,  Chunlei Huang,  Helin Wang,  Hanqin Yin,  Yixian Shao,  Ping Li\nJournal of Environmental Sciences. 2022 February;\n10.1016/j.jes.2021.05.015\nDiversity and arsenic-metabolizing gene clusters of indigenous arsenate-reducing bacteria in high arsenic groundwater of the Hetao Plain, Inner Mongolia\nYanhong Wang,  Dazhun Wei,  Ping Li,  Zhou Jiang,  Han Liu,  Chun Qing,  Helin Wang\nEcotoxicology. 2021 October;\n10.1007/s10646-020-02305-1\nTwo new selenite reducing bacterial isolates from paddy soil and the potential Se biofortification of paddy rice\nChunlei Huang,  Helin Wang,  Xinyan Shi,  Yanhong Wang,  Ping Li,  Hanqin Yin,  Yixian Shao\nEcotoxicology. 2021 September;\n10.1007/s10646-020-02273-6\nEffects of different dissolved organic matter on microbial communities and arsenic mobilization in aquifers\nYanhong Wang,  Guanglong Zhang,  Helin Wang,  Yu Cheng,  Han Liu,  Zhou Jiang,  Ping Li,  Yanxin Wang\nJournal of Hazardous Materials. 2021 June;\n10.1016/j.jhazmat.2021.125146\nMicroorganisms for ammonia/ammonium-oxidization and anammox in high arsenic Holocene-Pleistocene aquifers\nHelin Wang,  Ping Li,  Han Liu,  Tian Tan,  Guang Yang,  Rui Zhang\nInternational Biodeterioration &amp; Biodegradation. 2021 February;\n10.1016/j.ibiod.2020.105136\nArsenic mobilization affected by extracellular polymeric substances (EPS) of the dissimilatory iron reducing bacteria isolated from high arsenic groundwater\nHan Liu,  Ping Li,  Helin Wang,  Chun Qing,  Tian Tan,  Bo Shi,  Guanglong Zhang,  Zhou Jiang,  Yanhong Wang,  Shah Zaib Hasan\nScience of The Total Environment. 2020 September;\n10.1016/j.scitotenv.2020.139501\nArsenic mobilization in a high arsenic groundwater revealed by metagenomic and Geochip analyses\nZhou Jiang,  Ping Li,  Yanhong Wang,  Han Liu,  Dazhun Wei,  Changguo Yuan,  Helin Wang\nScientific Reports. 2019 September;\n10.1038/s41598-019-49365-w\nDiversity and abundance of arsenic methylating microorganisms in high arsenic groundwater from Hetao Plain of Inner Mongolia, China\nYanhong Wang,  Ping Li,  Zhou Jiang,  Han Liu,  Dazhun Wei,  Helin Wang,  Yanxin Wang\nEcotoxicology. 2018 October;\n10.1007/s10646-018-1958-9\nView additional publications\n\n---\n\nDirectory@UAlberta.ca\nDirectory\nTheme\nLight\nDark\nAuto (System)\nSearch Within\nualberta.ca\nPeople\nPrograms\nServices\nQuick Links\nEmail & Apps\nBear Tracks\nCanvas\nFind a Person\nMaps\nLibrary\nNews + Events\nFolio\nThe Quad\nNew Trail\nYouAlberta\nEvents\nProspective Students\nCurrent Students\nFaculty + Staff\nAlumni + Friends\nGive to the U of A\nCareers\nIndigenous Initiatives\nAccess, Community + Belonging\nSupport During a Crisis\nNot Found!\nThe record you attempted to access does not exist.\nSearch\nSearch\nAdvanced search"
