    "homepage_text": "姜海勇-中国科学院大学-UCAS\n[中文]\n[English]\n招生信息\n教育背景\n工作经历\n代表性论文\n基本信息\n姜海勇  男  博导  人工智能学院\n电子邮件： haiyong.jiang@ucas.ac.cn\n通信地址： 中国科学院大学玉泉路校区\n邮政编码：\n研究领域\n主要研究方向为计算机视觉、计算机图形学与深度学习，其主要研究目标为：\n（1）智能化的三维场景理解\n三维场景的感知信息可以服务于机器人交互、无人驾驶、增强现实等重要应用。现有工作主要集中于封闭环境下的场景理解，我们希望\n通过利用数字空间广泛存在的不同模态数据，基于机器学习、深度学习等技术手段，挖掘场景内在的几何或结构信息，促进开放环境下的三维场景语义、实例、关系的理解，从而推进智能化场景感知。\n（2）智能化的三维场景建模\n三维场景建模主要依赖于人工交互，我们旨在探索如何利用场景大数据中内蕴的数据表示，构建智能化的三维场景生成算法，使得三维建模技术更便捷、简单、普适，从而实现大众化三维创作。\n（3）三维数字人\n三维数字人的建模与动画驱动在人体形态分析、服装设计、角色动画等领域具有重要应用。然而现有工作在人体建模的质量、可驱动性上依旧存在诸多问题，我们旨在推进基于通用传感器的三维人体建模，并通过现有数据，实现更便捷、可泛化、易编辑的人体建模、人体动画合成。\n目前，已经在以上研究领域的顶级会议与期刊，包括\nICCV, CVPR, IEEE TVCG, ACM ToG\n等刊物，发表论文多篇。并多次担任ICCV, CVPR, ECCV, ICLR, ICLR, NeurIPS, ACM MM, AAAI, IEEE TVCG, IEEE TMM等领域顶级会议与期刊的审稿人。\n招生信息\n招收硕士生与直博生，欢迎推免生、统考生联系\n招生专业： 计算机图形学；计算机视觉；深度学习；机器学习\n招生方向：\n三维深度学习；\n三维场景的智能感知与理解；数据驱动的三维建模与虚拟数字内容合成；三维数字人的重建与动画驱动\n对学生的期望：\n具备相关领域的基础知识（如数据结构和算法、数学基础、英语表达能力），如有三维视觉或深度学习方向的知识与经历更佳。\n具备良好的逻辑思维和自我驱动能力。\n具备批判精神与自我反省能力。\n对于实习生希望能够实习六个月以上，并具有从事科研工作的热情。\n招生专业\n081203-计算机应用技术081104-模式识别与智能系统\n招生方向\n三维深度学习, 机器学习, 模式识别，计算机视觉计算机视觉计算机图形学\n教育背景\n2012-09--2017-07   中国科学院大学自动化研究所   博士\n工作经历\n工作简历\n2018-04~2020-10,Nanyang Technological University, Singapore, Research Fellow2017-12~2021-01,中国科学院大学人工智能学院, 博士后2014-09~2016-05,KAUST, SA, Research Interns\n代表性论文\n指导学生使用斜体\n加粗\n或下划线高亮，共同一作使用#标注，\n[20]\nYueyang Hu\n,\nHaiyong Jiang\n,\nHaoxuan Song\n,\nJun Xiao, Hao Pan: SegGraph: Leveraging Graphs of SAM Segments for Few-Shot 3D Part Segmentation, NeurIPS 2025 (accepted).\n[19]\nBingchen Yang\n,\nHaiyong Jiang\n, Hao Pan, Jun Xiao, Guosheng Lin, Peter Wonka: PS-CAD: Local Geometry Guidance via Prompting and Selection for CAD Reconstruction, ACM Trans. Graphics 2025.\n[18]\nYidi Li\n, Jun Xiao, Zhengda Lu, Yiqun Wang,\nHaiyong Jiang\n: Empowering Vector Graphics with Consistently Arbitrary Viewing and View-dependent Visibility, CVPR 2025, Highlights.\n[17]\nJichun Zhao\n,\nHaiyong Jiang\n,\nHaoxuan Song\n, Jun Xiao, Dong Gong: D3CTTA: Domain-Dependent Decorrelation for Continual Test-Time Adaption of 3D LiDAR Segmentation, CVPR 2025.\n[16]\nZhenya Tian\n, Jun Xiao, Lupeng Liu,\nHaiyong Jiang\n: Activating Sparse Part Concepts for 3D Class Incremental Learning, CVPR 2025.\n[15]\nTingyu Weng\n,\nJun Xiao, Hao Pan,\nHaiyong Jiang\n: PartCom: Part Composition Learning for 3D Open-Set Recognition, International Journal of Computer Vision 2024.\n[14]\nTingyu Weng\n,\nJun Xiao,\nHaiyong Jiang\n: Decomposing Unknown into Known: Part Concept Learning For 3D Novel Class Discovery, NeurIPS 2023\n[13]\nBingchen Yang\n,\nHaiyong Jiang\n, Hao Pan, Jun Xiao: VectorFloorSeg: Two-Stream Graph Attention Network for Vectorized Roughcast Floorplan Segmentation, CVPR2023 (\nHighlights, Top2.5%\n)\n[12] Haoyu Liu, Jianwei Guo,\nHaiyong Jiang\n, Yanchao Liu, Xiaopeng Zhang, Dong-Ming Yan: Journal of Computer Science and Technology, 2023.\n[11]\nTingyu Weng\n, Jun Xiao, Feilong Yan,\nHaiyong Jiang\n: Context-Aware 3D Point Cloud Semantic Segmentation With Plane Guidance. IEEE TMM 2022 (accepted)\n[10]\nJinhui Luan\n,\nHaiyong Jiang\n, Junqi Diao, Ying Wang, Jun Xiao: MEMformer: Transformer-based 3D Human Motion Estimation from MoCap Markers. SIGGRAPH Asia Posters 2022: 5:1-5:2\n[09]\nHaiyong Jiang\n, Jianfei Cai, Jianmin Zheng, Jun Xiao: Neighborhood-based Neural Implicit Reconstruction from Point Clouds. 3DV 2021: 1259-1268\n[08] Daxuan Ren, Jianmin Zheng, Jianfei Cai, Jiatong Li,\nHaiyong Jiang\n, Zhongang Cai, Junzhe Zhang, Liang Pan, Mingyuan Zhang, Haiyu Zhao, Shuai Yi: CSG-Stump: A Learning Friendly CSG-Like Representation for Interpretable Shape Parsing. ICCV 2021: 12458-12467\n[07] Jianwei Guo,\nHaiyong Jiang\n, Bedrich Benes, Oliver Deussen, Xiaopeng Zhang, Dani Lischinski, Hui Huang: Inverse Procedural Modeling of Branching Structures by Inferring L-Systems. ACM Trans. Graph. 39(5): 155:1-155:13 (2020)\n[06]\nHaiyong Jiang\n, Dong-Ming Yan, Xiaopeng Zhang, Peter Wonka: Selection Expressions for Procedural Modeling. IEEE Trans. Vis. Comput. Graph. 26(4): 1775-1788 (2020)\n[05]\nHaiyong Jiang\n, Feilong Yan, Jianfei Cai, Jianmin Zheng, Jun Xiao: End-to-End 3D Point Cloud Instance Segmentation Without Detection. CVPR 2020: 12793-12802\n[04]\nLixia Ni\n,\nHaiyong Jiang\n, Jianfei Cai, Jianmin Zheng, Haifeng Li, Xu Liu: Unsupervised Dense Light Field Reconstruction with Occlusion Awareness. Comput. Graph. Forum 38(7): 425-436 (2019)\n[03] Yong Zhang#,\nHaiyong Jiang#\n, Baoyuan Wu, Yanbo Fan, Qiang Ji: Context-Aware Feature and Label Fusion for Facial Action Unit Intensity Estimation With Partially Labeled Data. ICCV 2019: 733-742\n[02]\nHaiyong Jiang\n, Jianfei Cai, Jianmin Zheng: Skeleton-Aware 3D Human Shape Reconstruction From Point Clouds. ICCV 2019: 5430-5440\n[01]\nHaiyong Jiang\n, Liangliang Nan, Dong-Ming Yan, Weiming Dong, Xiaopeng Zhang, Peter Wonka: Automatic Constraint Detection for 2D Layout Regularization. IEEE Trans. Vis. Comput. Graph. 22(8): 1933-1944 (2016)\n声明：导师网页信息由导师个人维护，仅代表导师本人。教师系统仅提供信息存储空间服务。\n2013 © 中国科学院大学，网络信息中心."
