    "homepage_text": "Kimin Lee\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nKimin Lee\nContact:\nkiminlee@kaist.ac.kr\n(school)\nkimin@config.inc\n(company)\nKimin Lee\nI am an Assistant Professor at the Graduate School of AI at KAIST and Co-founder of\nConfig\n.\nMy research goal is to develop\nsafe and capable decision-making agents\n. Recently, I have focused on the following topics:\nVision-Language Action Models\n[C51, C69, C70]\nR\neinforcement learning from human feedback [P6, C22, C29, C42, C61]\nAI safety evaluation and benchmark [C57, C59, C64, C65]\nHuman-centric AI [C66]\nPreviously, I was a Research Scientist at Google Research. I completed my postdoctoral training at UC Berkeley\nand my PhD at KAIST\n.\nPublications (C: conference / J: journal / P: preprint / *: equal contribution / ^: equal advising)\n202\n6\n[C71] Improving Motion in Image-to-Video Models via Adaptive Low-Pass Guidance\n[\npdf\n][\nwebsite\n]\nJune Suk Choi, Kyungmin Lee, Sihyun Yu, Yisol Choi, Jinwoo Shin,\nKimin Lee\nConference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR)\n2026\n[C70] Learning Multi-View Spatial Reasoning from Cross-View Relations\nSuchae Jeong*, Jaehwi Song*, Haeone Lee, Hanna Kim, Jian Kim, Dongjun Lee, Dong Kyu Shin, Changyeon Kim, Dongyoon Hahm, Woogyeol Jin, Juheon Choi,\nKimin Lee\nConference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR)\n202\n6\n[C6\n9\n]\nQuality over Quantity: Demonstration Curation via Influence Functions for Data-Centric Robot Learning\nHaeone\nLee, Taywon Min, Junsu Kim, Sinjae Kang, Fangchen Liu, Lerrel Pinto,\nKimin Lee\nInternational Conference on Robotics and Automation (ICRA)\n2026\n[\nC68\n] Learning to generate unit test via adversarial reinforcement learning [\npdf\n]\nDongjun Lee, Changho Hwang,\nKimin Lee\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR)\n202\n6\n[\nC67\n] DEAS: DEtached value learning with Action Sequence for Scalable Offline RL [\npdf\n][\ncode\n]\nChangyeon Kim, Haeone Lee, Younggyo Seo,\nKimin Lee\n^, Yuke Zhu^\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR)\n2026\n[C6\n6\n]\nState Your Intention to Steer Your Attention: An AI Assistant for Intentional Digital Living [\npdf\n][\ncode\n]\nJuheon Choi, Juyoung Lee, Jian Kim, Chanyoung Kim, Taewon Min, W Bradley Knox^, Min Kyung Lee^,\nKimin Lee\n^\nACM Conference on Human Factors in Computing Systems (CHI)\n2026\n[C6\n5\n]\nUnintended Misalignment from Agentic Fine-Tuning: Risks and Mitigation\n[\npdf\n]\nDongyoon Hahm*, Taywon Min*, Woogyeol Jin*\n,\nKimin Lee\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI)\nAI Alignment Track 2026\n[\nC64\n] MobileSafetyBench: Evaluating Safety of Autonomous Agents in Mobile Device Control [\npdf\n][\ncode\n][\nsite\n]\nJuyong Lee*, Dongyoon Hahm*, June Suk Choi*, W. Bradley Knox,\nKimin Lee\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI)\nAI Alignment Track 202\n6\n202\n5\n[C63] Improbable Bigrams Expose Vulnerabilities of Incomplete Tokens in Byte-Level Tokenizers\n[\npdf\n]\nEugene Jang,\nKimin Lee\n, Jin-Woo Chung, Keuntae Park, Seungwon Shin\nConference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (EMNLP)\n202\n5\n(main)\n[\nC62\n] Benchmarking Mobile Device Control Agents across Diverse Configurations [\npdf\n][\nsite\n][\ncode\n]\nJuyong Lee, Taywon Min, Minyong An, Dongyoon Hahm, Haeone Lee, Changyeon Kim,\nKimin Lee\nConference on Lifelong Learning Agents (CoLLAs)\n2025\n[C6\n1\n] Understanding Impact of Human Feedback via Influence Functions [\npdf\n][\ncode\n]\nTaywon Min, Haeone Lee, Yongchan Kwon,\nKimin Lee\nAnnual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (ACL)\n2025 (main)\n[C60] What Really Matters in Many-Shot Attacks? An Empirical Study of Long-Context Vulnerabilities in LLMs [\npdf\n]\nSangyeop Kim, Yohan Lee, Yongwoo Song,\nKimin Lee\nAnnual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (ACL)\n2025 (main)\n[C59]\nEnhancing LLM Agent Safety via Causal Influence Prompting [\npdf\n][\ncode\n]\nDongyoon Hahm, Woogyeol Jin, June Suk Choi, Sungsoo Ahn\n,\nKimin Lee\nAnnual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (ACL)\n2025 (\nfindings\n)\n[C58] Silent Branding Attack: Trigger-free Data Poisoning Attack on Text-to-Image Diffusion Models [\npdf\n][\ncode\n]\nSangwon Jang, June Suk Choi, Jaehyeong Jo,\nKimin Lee\n^, Sung Ju Hwang^\nConference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR)\n2025\n[\nC57\n] When LLMs Go Online: The Emerging Threat of Web-Enabled LLMs [\npdf\n]\nHanna Kim, Minkyoo Song, Seung Ho Na, Seungwon Shin,\nKimin Lee\nUSENIX Security Symposium\n2025\n[C5\n6\n]\nLearning to Contextualize Web Pages for Enhanced Decision Making by LLM Agents [\npdf\n][\ncode\n]\nDongjun Lee, Juyong Lee, Kyuyoung Kim, Jihoon Tack, Jinwoo Shin, Yee Whye Teh,\nKimin Lee\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR)\n2025\n[\nC55\n] Automated Filtering of Human Feedback Data for Aligning Text-to-Image Diffusion Models [\npdf\n][\ncode\n]\nYongjin Yang*, Sihyeon Kim*, Hojung Jung, Sangmin Bae, SangMook Kim, Se-Young Yun^,\nKimin Lee\n^\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR)\n2025\n[C5\n4]\nDiffusionGuard: A Robust Defense Against Malicious Diffusion-based Image Editing [\npdf\n][\ncode\n]\nJune Suk Choi, Kyungmin Lee, Jongheon Jeong, Saining Xie, Jinwoo Shin,\nKimin Lee\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR)\n2025\n[C5\n3\n] Subtask-Aware Visual Reward Learning from Segmented Demonstrations [\npdf\n][\ncode\n]\nChangyeon Kim, Minho Heo, Doohyun Lee, Honglak Lee, Jinwoo Shin, Joseph J Lim,\nKimin Lee\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR)\n2025\n[\nC52\n]\nSpread Preference Annotation: Direct Preference Judgment for Efficient LLM Alignment\n[\npdf\n][\ncode\n]\nDongyoung Kim,\nKimin Lee\n, Jinwoo Shin, Jaehyung Kim\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR)\n2025 as\noral presentation (\n207/11672=1.77%)\n[C5\n1\n] 