    "homepage_text": "Lin Lab\nHome\nResearch\nWho We Are\nPublications\nSong Lin\nEchem For All\nGet In Touch\nOur Work in Electrochemistry & Beyond\nExplore our Research\nLatest Publications\nNo.\n81\nDesymmetrization of\nmeso\n-Pyrrolidines via Oxoammonium-Catalyzed Enantioselective Hydride Transfer\nJ. Am. Chem. Soc.\n2026\nARTICLE ASAP\nNo.\n80\nCutting the cord for high-throughput electrochemistry\nNat. Chem. Eng.\n2026\n,\n3\n, 140.\nNo.\n79\nNi(DQ)\n2\n: A Useful Gateway to Zero-Valent Nickel Complexes\nOrganometallics\n2026\n,\n45\n(4), 385-390.\nNo.\n78\nElectrochemical Activation of α-Carbonyl Alkoxyamines for Direct Nucleophilic Substitution\nOrg. Lett.\n2026\n,\n28\n(6), 1941-1946.\nBrowse More Publications\nMeet the Minds that Shape Our Research Program\nDiscover Who We Are\nOur Highlights\nTeam Teaches Electrochemistry to 9th-10th Graders at EYH Workshop\nSee our Outreach\nCongratulations to Andy for achieving his PhD!\nMeet Our Members\nCongratulations to Song for receiving the 2024 Arthur C. Cope Scholar Award!\nRead Article\nUpcoming Group Meetings\nMon\n09\nTue\n10\nWed\n11\nThu\n12\nFri\n13\nTime\n1:00 pm\nResearch\nSamson\nLiterature\nNayan (topic)\nSee full group meeting schedule\nSee what we’re up to and stay connected\nJoin us on LinkedIn\nDiscover Opportunities with Our Research Group\nGet in Touch\nGroup Meetings\nSitemap\nVisit Cornell\nJoin us on Linkedin\nWeb Accessibility Assistance\nGet In Touch\n© 2025 The Lin Lab. All rights reserved.\nHandcrafted by Vanessa Zhang\n\n---\n\nLin Lab\nHome\nResearch\nWho We Are\nPublications\nSong Lin\nEchem For All\nGet In Touch\nOops!\nThis page was not found, but it looks like\nyou've\nstumbled upon\nCooper's\nlost bone!\nGo Home\n(Drag bone)\nGroup Meetings\nSitemap\nVisit Cornell\nJoin us on Linkedin\nWeb Accessibility Assistance\nGet In Touch\n© 2025 The Lin Lab. All rights reserved.\nHandcrafted by Vanessa Zhang\n\n---\n\nLin Lab\nHome\nResearch\nWho We Are\nPublications\nSong Lin\nEchem For All