    "github": "https://github.com/Microsoft",
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Prof. Bin Shao – AI Scientist | President of Zhongguancun Institute of Artificial Intelligence\nBin Shao (邵斌)\nDr.\nBin\nShao\nis the\nPresident\nof\nZhongguancun Institute of Artificial Intelligence\nand a full professor at\nZhongguancun Academy\n.\n        He received his Ph.D. from\nFudan University\nin 2010 and previously served as a\nsenior principal research manager\nat\nMicrosoft\n            Research AI for Science\n, where he started the\nMicrosoft Graph Engine\nproject and established both\n    the Computational Biology Research Group and Scientific Computing Research Group.\nDr. Shao has authored over fifty influential papers in leading journals such as Nature and its sister\n        journals, as well as premier academic conferences. Recognized for enduring impact, he received the\nICDE\n          10-Year Influential Paper Award\nfrom the International Conference on Data Engineering. His team's\n        seminal breakthroughs in protein dynamics research earned recognition among the\nTop 10 Advances in\n          Chinese Bioinformatics in 2024\n.\nDr. Shao initiated and co-developed pioneering open-source projects, including\nGraph Engine\n- a distributed in-memory\n        graph computing platform,\nAI\n2\nBMD\nprotein dynamics simulation system achieving quantum-chemical\n        accuracy,\nLightAIMD\n- a\n        lightweight ab initio molecular dynamics simulation program, and\nGeomeculus\n-\n        a program for doing geometric algebra and geometric calculus. These contributions have not only advanced\n        scientific research but also accelerated technological progress in their respective fields.\nCurriculum Vitae\nPublications\nTalks"
  },
