    "homepage_text": "Ziqiang Li's homepage\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nZiqiang Li's homepage\nHome page\nWelcome to Ziqiang Li's homepage!\nZiqiang Li is a project assistant professor at Tanaka lab,\nProgram of Computational Intelligence, Graduate School of Engineering, NITech.\nHis main research topics\ninclude, but are not limited to, time-series processing, graph data processing, and reservoir computing.\nContact\nAddress: 02-210B, Gokiso-cho, Showa-ku, Naogya 466-8555, Japan\nMail: ziqiang-li [AT*] nitech.ac.jp\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
