       Fluid.” Energy & Fuels, 2019, 33, 6878-6889.\nQ. Li\nand Y.-S. Jun. “The Apparent Activation Energy and Pre-Exponential Kinetic Factor\n                     for Heterogeneous Calcium Carbonate Nucleation on Quartz.” Communications Chemistry,\n                     2018, 1(1),56.\nPeople\nFaculty\nResearch and Affiliated Faculty\nResearchers and Postdocs\nGraduate Students\nStaff\nPeople\nFaculty\nResearch and Affiliated Faculty\nResearchers and Postdocs\nGraduate Students\nStaff\nTwitter\nlinkedin\nprint\nDepartment of Geosciences\n255 Earth and Space Science Building\nStony Brook, NY 11794-2100\nPhone: (631) 632-8200\nDiscrimination\nSexual Misconduct\nAccessibility Barrier\n©\nAdmin Login\n2025\nStony Brook University\n\n---\n\nQingyun Li | Department of Geosciences\nSkip Navigation\nSearch Text\nSelect Search Scope\nSearch This Site\nJust This Site\nSearch SBU Website\nSBU Website\nSearch\nCollege\nof\nArts and Sciences\nDepartment of Geosciences\nHome\nAbout\nContact Us\nDepartment Leadership\nDirections\nNewsletters\nLong Island Geologists\nDepartment Mineral Collection\nPeople\nFaculty\nResearch and Affiliated Faculty\nResearchers and Postdocs\nGraduate Students\nStaff\nUndergraduate\nPrograms\nCourse Descriptions\nCourse Schedules\nApply Now\nCareers in Geosciences\nGraduate\nPrograms\nCourse Descriptions\nCourse Schedules\nApply Now\nApplicant FAQs\nGraduate Programs Handbook\nResearch\nDepartment Research Areas\nDepartment Labs\nDavid E. King Field Work Award\nDEI\nOutreach\nGeology Open Nights\nGraduates for Education and Outreach (GEO)\nGiving\nTBI...[truncated]"
