    "homepage_text": "Haoyu Wang (王昊钰) - Homepage\nHaoyu Wang (王昊钰)\nA Ph.D. student at Nanyang Technological University\nSingapore\nEmail\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nI am Haoyu Wang, currently a Ph.D. student at College of Computing and Data Science, Nanyang Technological University, Singapore, supervised by\nProf. Bo An\n, and concurrently join the 2050 Research Lab at Skywork AI as an AI Researcher. I received my Bachelor degree of Computer Science and Technology from Beijing University of Posts and Telecommunications in June 2021. My research interest focus on Agentic RL, Multi-Agent System and their applications.\n🔥 News\n2025.04\n:  🎉🎉 Release LLMxMapReduce-V2 in\narxiv\nand\nGithub\n, an extremely-long article generation algorithm for survey writing. You could try it in\nSurveyGO\n!\n📝 Publications\n⌛️ 2025\narxiv preprint\nLLM$\\times$MapReduce-V2: Entropy-Driven Convolutional Test-Time Scaling for Generating Long-Form Articles from Extremely Long Resources\nHaoyu Wang\n, Yujia Fu, Zhu Zhang, Shuo Wang, Zirui Ren, Xiaorong Wang, Zhili Li, Chaoqun He, Bo An, Zhiyuan Liu, Maosong Sun\nACL 2025\nLLM$\\times$MapReduce: An Effective Divide-and-Conquer Framework for Long-Sequence Processing\nZihan Zhou, Chong Li, Xinyi Chen, Yu Chao, Shuo Wang, Zhili Li,\nHaoyu Wang\n, Rongqiao An, Qi Shi, Xu Han, Xiaodong Shi, Zhiyuan Liu, Maosong Sun\n⌛️ 2024\nACL 2024\nUltraLink: An Open-Source Knowledge-Enhanced Multilingual Supervised Fine-tuning Dataset.\nHaoyu Wang\n, Shuo Wang, Yukun Yan, Xujia Wang, Zhiyu Yang, Yuzhuang Xu, Zhenghao Liu, Liner Yang, Ning Ding, Xu Han, Zhiyuan Liu, Maosong Sun\nCCL 2024\nSpanCS: Span-Level Code-Switching for Cross-Lingual Program Synthesis\nQingfu Zhu, Shiqi Zhou, Shuo Wang, Zhiming Zhang,\nHaoyu Wang\n, Qiguang Chen, Wanxiang Che\narxiv preprint\nOMGEval: An Open Multilingual Generative Evaluation Benchmark for Large Language Models\nYang Liu, Meng Xu, Shuo Wang, Liner Yang,\nHaoyu Wang\n, Zhenghao Liu, Cunliang Kong, Yun Chen, Yang Liu, Maosong Sun, Erhong Yang\nWWW 2024\n(Oral)\nFederated Heterogeneous Graph Neural Network for Privacy-preserving Recommendation\nBo Yan, Yang Cao,\nHaoyu Wang\n, Wenchuan Yang, Junping Du, Chuan Shi\n🎖 Honors and Awards\n2025.05\nOutstanding Graduate Award of Beijing University of Posts and Telecommunications\n2024.12\nNational Scholarship (Undergraduate) (Top 1%).\n📖 Educations\n2025.08 - Present\n, Ph.D., College of Computing and Data Science, Nanyang Technological University, supervised by\nProf. Bo An\n.\n2021.09 - 2025.06\n, B.S, School of Computer Science and Technology (National Demonstration Software College), Beijing University of Posts and Telecommunications.\n💻 Internships\n2025.08 - Present\n,\n2050 Research Lab, Skywork AI\n, Singapore.\n2024.04 - 2025.05\n,\nModelBest & OpenBMB\n, China.\n2023.11 - 2024.04\n,\nTHUNLP, Tsinghua University\n, China.\n2023.03 - 2023.12\n,\nGAMMA Lab, BUPT\n, China.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected."
