    "homepage_text": "MG-advisor\nMCG @ USTC\nHome\nAdvisor\nStudents\nPublications\nCourses\nXinmei Tianï¼ç°æ°æ¢)\nassociate profressor, Ph.D. advisor\nDept. of Electronic Engineering and Information Science\nUniversity of Science and Technology of China\nphone:0551-63600281-8023\nemail: xinmei_AT_ustc.edu.cn\noffice location: Room 1203\nResearch Interests\nMultimedia Information Retrieval\nComputer Vision\nMachine Learning\nEducation\n2010: Ph.D. in Signal and Information Processing, University of Science and Technology of China (USTC)\r\nDissertation: Research on Content-based Image Search Reranking. Advisor: Prof. Xiuqing Wu\n2005: B.E. in Communication Engineering, University of Science and Technology of China (USTC)\nResearch Experience\nAssociate Professor, Sep. 2011 ~ Present: Department of Electronic Engineering and Information Science University of Science and Technology of China\nPostdoctoral Researcher, Sep. 2010 ~ Aug. 2011: Department of Computer Science, Texas State University, San Marcos, Texas, USA.\nResearch Assistant Jul. 2009 ~ Feb. 2010: School of Computing Engineering, Nanyang Technological University (NTU), Singapore.\nResearch Assistant Aug. 2008 ~ Dec. 2008 School of Computing, Hong Kong Polytechnic University (PolyU), Hong Kong, P.R. China.\nResearch Internship Dec. 2007 ~ Jul. 2010: Multimedia Computing Group, Microsoft Research Asia (MSRA), Beijing, P.R. China.\nHonor/Awards\nNational Award to Excellent Scientific Output (Natural Science) of Universities and Colleges, 2014\nNomination of National Excellent Doctoral Dissertation, 2013\nThe First Prize of Anhui Province Scientific and Technological Award, 2012.\nExcellent Doctoral Dissertation of Chinese Academy of Sciences, 2012.\nPresidential Award of Chinese Academy of Science, 2010.\nProfessional Activities\nTechnical Program Committee Member of ACM Multimedia 2012, ICMLA 2012, ICME 2013.\nReviewer for ACM MM, ICMRTMM, TSMC, TCSVT, Information Science etc.\nNeurocomputing editorial 