    "homepage_text": "Tong Lu's Homepage\nESC\nAll Results\nSearching...\nNo results found\nClear search\nââ\nNavigate\nâµ\nSelect\nPowered by Hugo Blox\nTong Lu\nPhD candidate\nBeijing Normal University\nAbout\nI am a second year Ph.D. candidate in the School of Artificial Intelligence at Beijing Normal University, Beijing, China.\nI obtained a Bachelor of Science degree from Hebei GEO University and a Master of Engineering degree from Yunnan University.\nNow, I engage in research related to the field of natural language processing.\nEducation\nPhD candidate in Computer Science\n2024-09\nBeijing Normal University\nM.E. in Computer Science\n2021-09\n2024-06\nYunnan University\nB.E. in Computer Science\n2017-09\n2021-06\nHebei GEO University\nInterests\nLarge Language Models\nKnowledge Graph\nRetrieval-Augmented Generation & Agent\nBayesian Network\nVector Indexing & Similarity Search\nDeep Learning\nNews\n[2025.11]\nOur research work is accepted by\nAAAI 2026\n!\n[2024.02]\nOur research work is accepted by\nIJWIS 2024\n!\n[2023.09]\nOur research work is accepted by\nEAI CollaborateCom 2023\n!\nExperience\n[2024.09 - now]\nComputer Science and Technology, PhD candidate in College of Artificial Intelligence,\nBeijing Normal University\n. Supervisor: Dr. Zhichun Wang (\nHomepage\n,\nScholar\n)\n[2021.09-2024.06]\nComputer Science and Technology, M.Eng. in College of Information Science & Engineering,\nYunnan University\n. Supervisor: Dr. Kun Yue (\nHomepage\n,\nScholar\n) and Dr. Liang Duan (\nHomepage\n,\nScholar\n)\n[2017.09-2021.06]\nComputer Science and Technology, B.S. in College of Information Engineering,\nHebei Geo University\n. Supervisor: Dr. Jingmin Zhang (\nHomepage\n)\nRecent Publications\nMore Â»\nTong Lu\n,\nZhichun Wang\n,\nYaoyu Zhou\n,\nYiming Guan\n,\nZhiyong Bai\n,\nJunsheng Du\n(2026).\nSciMKG: A Multimodal Knowledge Graph for Science Education with Text, Image, Video and Audio\n.\n  In\nAAAI 2026 (CCF A)\n.\nPDF\nPost\nPoster\nWebsite\nCode\nDataset\nDemo\nCite\nZhiwei Qi\n,\nTong Lu\n,\nKun Yue\n,\nLiang Duan\n(2024).\nSimilarityÂ SearchÂ onÂ SocialÂ NetworksÂ withÂ IncrementalÂ Graph IndexingÂ basedÂ onÂ ProbabilisticÂ Inference\n.\n  In\nIJWIS 2024\n.\nPDF\nCite\nDOI\nTong Lu\n,\nZhiwei Qi\n,\nKun Yue\n,\nLiang Duan\n(2023).\nProbabilistic Inference Based Incremental Graph Index for Similarity Search on Social Networks\n.\n  In\nEAI CollaborateCom 2023 (CCF C)\n.\nPDF\nSlides\nCite\nDOI\nAwards\n[2024]\n, Yunnan University, Outstanding Masterâs Graduates from Yunnan Province.\n[2024]\n, Yunnan University, Outstanding Masterâs Graduates from Yunnan University.\n[2021 - 2024]\n, Yunnan University, Excellent Commissary in Charge of Studies.\n[2023]\n, Yunnan University, Participation Award in the China Graduate Mathematical Modeling Competition.\n[2022]\n, Yunnan University, First Prize of Academic Scholarship.\n[2022]\n, Yunnan University, Provincial Silver Award of the 8th China College Studentsâ âInternet+â Innovation and Entrepreneurship Competition.\n2021, Yunnan University, Second Prize of Academic Scholarship.\n[2021]\n, Hebei GEO University, Third Prize of Hebei Collegiate Programming Contest.\n[2020]\n, Hebei GEO University, Second Prize of Academic Scholarship.\n[2019-2020]\n, Hebei GEO University, President of English Association.\nAcademic Services\nConference Reviewer\n: WWW 2026, ACM MM 2025, CIKM 2025, AAAI 2026, ICIC 2025, WSDM 2024, DASFAA 2024, NLPCC 2024\nTeaching Assistant\nDatabase Technology, YNU, Spring 2023\nAcknowledgement\nKun Yue\nis my masterâs degree supervisor. He is the Dean of the School of Information Science and Engineering, a Professor and PhD Supervisor, the Chair of the Academic Committee, and the Director of the Yunnan Provincial Key Laboratory of Intelligent Systems and Computing at Yunnan University. Under his tutelage, I achieved significant research achievement (2021.09â2024.06).\nZhiwei Qi\nis a teacher during my master’s degree. He is an associate professor at Yunnan University. With his help, I solved many academic challenges (2021.09 - 2024.06).\nLiang Duan\nis my masterâs degree supervisor. He is an associate professor, PhD Supervisor at Yunnan University. I am grateful for his three years of guidance and assistance (2021.09 - 2024.06).\nJingmin Zhang\nis my undergraduate advisor and the teacher of my Compiler Principles lab course. She is a professor at Hebei GEO University. Under her guidance, I successfully completed my thesis and obtained a Bachelor of Science degree (2020.03 - 2021.06).\nWenyue Sha\nis my junior high school head teacher, English teacher. Now he is the principal of the middle school. With his encouragement and assistance, he laid the foundation for my future learning motivation (2011.09 - 2013.06)."
  },
