of the Thirty-fourth Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS),\nSpotlight(4.07%)\n, Dec 2020.\nTernaryBERT: Distillation-aware Ultra-low Bit BERT\n[\npytorch code\n][\nmindspore code\n]\nWei Zhang*,\nLu Hou*\n, Yichun Yin*, Lifeng Shang, Xiao Chen, Xin Jiang, Qun Liu\nProceedings of the 2020 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (EMNLP), Nov 2020.\nNormalization Helps Training of Quantized LSTM\n[\ncode\n]\nLu Hou\n, Jinhua Zhu, James T. Kwok, Fei Gao, Tao Qin, Tie-yan Liu\nProceedings of the Thirty-third Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS), Vancouver, BC, Canada, Dec 2019.\nAnalysis of Quantized Models\nLu Hou\n, Ruiliang Zhang, James T. Kwok\nProceedings of the Seventh International Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR), New Orleans, Louisinna, USA, May 2019.\nLoss-aware Weight Quantization of Deep Networks\n[\ncode\n]\nLu Hou\n, James T. Kwok\nProceedings of the Sixth International Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR), Vancouver, BC, Canada, Apr 2018.\nLoss-aware Binarization of Deep Networks\n[\ncode\n]\nLu Hou\n, Quanming Yao, James T. Kwok\nProceedings of the Fifth International Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR), Toulon, France, Apr 2017.\nEfficient Learning of Timeseries Shapelets\n[\ncode\n]\nLu Hou\n, James T. Kwok, Jacek M. Zurada\nProceedings of the Thirtieth AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI), pp.1209-1215, Phoenix, AZ, USA, Feb 2016.\nWorking Experience\nExpert & Project Manager, Huawei Noah's Ark Lab, Shenzhen, China, Mar 2023 -  present\nSenior Researcher, Huawei Noah's Ark Lab, Shenzhen, China, Mar 2021 -  Mar 2023\nResearcher, Huawei Noah's Ark Lab, Shenzhen, China, Sep 2019 -  Mar 2021\nResearch Intern, Machine Learning Group,\nMicrosoft Research Asia\n, Beijing, China, Oct 2018 - March 2019\nStudent Intern,\nRobotics Institute, Carnegie Mellon University\n, Pittsburgh, PA, USA, Jun 2013 - Aug 2013\nAwards and Competitions\nACL 2022 Outstanding Paper Award (TOP 8)\nOutstanding Graduate, NUST 2014\nNUST Chancellor Medal (highest student award in NUST), NUST 2013\nChinese National Scholarship, NUST 2012 & 2013\nHonorable Mention in Interdisciplinary Contest in Modeling (ICM) International Contest, 2013\nFirst Place in China Undergraduate Mathematical Contest in Modeling National Contest, 2012\nAcademic Services\nArea Chair:\nNeurIPS 2025\nPC Member/Reviewer:\nICLR 2019-2025, NeurIPS 2018-2025, ICCV 2025, CVPR 2025, ACL 2025, ICML 2018-2022\nJournal Reviewer:\nMachine Learning, Artificial Intelligence, IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence\nSupervised Students\nGuanhua Chen, Assistant Professor @ Southern University of Science and Technology\nWenliang Dai, Research Scientist @ Nvidia\nChaofan Tao, Senior Reasercher @ Huawei Noah's Ark Lab\nMingyang Yi, Assistant Professor of Renmin University of China\nHaoli Bai, Senior Reasercher @ Huawei Noah's Ark Lab\nZhiqi Huang, Multimodal Researcher @ Moonshot AI\nTeaching Experience\nCOMP 5008 Introduction to Social Computing, Teaching Assistant, Spring 2017 & 2018\nCOMP 4641 Social Information Networks Analysis and Engineering, Teaching Assistant, Spring 2017 & 2018\nCOMP 4331 Introduction to Data Mining, Teaching Assistant, Fall 2015, 2016 & 2017\nCOMP 2011 Introduction to Object-Oriented Programming, Teaching Assistant, Spring 2015"
