    "homepage_text": "Nannan Wang | Profile | Xidian University Homepage\nXidian Meeting\nXidian Guide\nAbout\nHelp\nSearch\nHome\nLogin\nControl Panel\nAddBookMark\nNannan Wang's Homepage:\nProfile\nResearch Projects\nPapers\nTeam\nTeaching\nAdmission\nChinese\nProfile\nProfessor\nDr. Nannan Wang\nISN State Key Laboratory, Xidian University\nContact Information\nEmail: nnwang  AT  xidian.edu.cn\nIntroduction\nNannan Wang，Professor. My major research interests focus on computer vision and machine learning, specially for heterogeneous image synthesis and recognition. He have published more than 90 papers on some top-tier journals and conferences such as\nIEEE TPAMI\n,\nIJCV\n,\nIEEE TIP,\nNeurIPS etc.\nHe and his students have obtained the ACM ICIMCS best student paper award (2016). He has been selected as the Young Elite Program from\nCAST\n. He has obtained the excellent PhD. thesis award from\nCAAI\nand Shaanxi Government, the First Class Prize for Science and Technology in Shaanxi Province and so on. I obtained my Ph. D degree from Xidian University under the supervisor of Prof.\nXinbo Gao\n, China. He visited University of Technology, Sydnet from Sep. 2011 to Sep. 2013 under the supervisor of Prof.\nDacheng Tao\n.\nAcademic Service\nJournal Reviewer\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (\nIEEE TPAMI\n)\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (\nIEEE TNNLS\n)\nIEEE Transactions on Image Processing (\nIEEE TIP\n)\nIEEE Transactions on Cybernetics (\nIEEE TC\n)\nIEEE Transactions on Information Forensics and Security (\nIEEE TIFS\n)\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology (\nIEEE TCSVT\n)\nIEEE Transactions on Vehicular Technology (\nIEEE TVT\n)\nIEEE Transactions on Big Data (\nIEEE TBD\n)\nIEEE Access\nACM Transactions on Intelligent Systems and Technology(\nACM TIST\n)\nACM Transactions on Knowledge Discovery from Data (\nACM TKDD\n)\nPattern Recognition (\nPR\n)\nInformation Science (\nINS\n)\nNeurocomputing (\nNEUCOM\n)\nSignal Processing (\nSP\n)\nImage and Vision Computing (\nIVC\n)\nPattern Recognition Letters (\nPRL\n)\nComputational Statistics & Data Analysis (\nCSDA\n)\nComputer Methods and Programs in Biomedicine (\nCMPB\n)\nJournal of Visual Communications and Image Representation (\nJVCIR\n)\nEconomics and Statistics (\nES\n)\nMachine Vision and Applications (\nMVA\n)\nNeural Processing Letters (\nNPL\n)\nPattern Analysis and Applications (\nPAAA\n)\nCognitive Computation (\nCC\n)\nSignal, Image and Video Processing (\nSIVP\n)\nMultimedia Systems (\nMMS\n)\n...\nConference Program Members/Reviewer/Special Session Chair\nAssociation for the Advancement of Artificial Intelligence (AAAI), 2019\nInternational Conference on Data Mining (ICDM), 2018\nInternational Joint Conference on Artifical Intelligence (IJCAI), Stockolm, Sweden\n, 2018.\nAssociation for the Advancement of Artificial Intelligence (AAAI), 2018\nInternational Joint Conference on Artifical Intelligence (IJCAI),\nMelborne\n, Australia, 2017.\nIEEE\nInterneational\nConference on Image Processing (IEEE ICIP), 2017.\nIEEE International Conference on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics (IEEE SMC), 2017\nInternational Conference on Tools and Artificial Intelligence (ICTAI), 2017\nIEEE International Conference on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics, 2016\nInternational Conference on Tools and Artificial Intelligence, San Jose, United States,\nNovember,\n2016\nInternational Conference on Pattern Recognition, Cancun, Mexico,\nDecember,\n2016\nACM International Conference on Multimedia, Brisbane, Australia,\nOctober,\n2015\nInternational Conference on Tools and Artificial Intelligence, Vietri\nsul\nMare, Italy,\nNovember,\n2015\nInternational Conference on Pattern Recognition, Stockholm, Sweden,\nNovember,\n2014\nIEEE International Conference on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics, San Diego, USA,\nOctober,\n2014\nInternational Conference on Tools and Artificial Intelligence, Limassol, Cyprus,\nNovember,\n2014\nInternational Conference on Intelligence Science and Big Data Engineering-GWC, Shanghai, Sep. , 2014\nInternational Conference on Security, Pattern Analysis, and Cybernetics, Wuhan, China,\nOctober,\n2014\nInternational Conference on Tools and Artificial Intelligence, Washington DC, USA,\nNovember,\n2013\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning and Applications, Florida, USA,\nDecember,\n2012\nInternational Conference on Pattern Recognition, Tsukuba, Japan,\nNovember,\n2012\nEuropean Conference on Information Retrieval, Barcelona, Spain,\nApril,\n2012\n...\n版权声明\n未经西安电子科技大学以及个人主页教师本人许可，不得复制、转载和传播本页内容，禁止用于任何商业用途。如需转载请征得主页所有者同意，并附上主页链接！\n更新\nNannan Wang's MessageBoard\nCopyright © 2011-2026 Xidian University  ICP 021284(05016169)　Powered by\nXIDIANNIC\n&\nSEENIC\n\n---\n\nNannan Wang | Profile | Xidian University Homepage\nXidian Meeting\nXidian Guide\nAbout\nHelp\nSearch\nHome\nLogin\nControl Panel\nAddBookMark\nNannan Wang's Homepage:\nProfile\nResearch Projects\nPapers\nTeam\nTeaching\nAdmission\nChinese\nProfile\nProfessor\nDr. Nannan Wang\nISN State Key Laboratory, Xidian University\nContact Information\nEmail: nnwang  AT  xidian.edu.cn\nIntroduction\nNannan Wang，Professor. My major research interests focus on computer vision and machine learning, specially for heterogeneous image synthesis and recognition. He have published more than 90 papers on some top-tier journals and conferences such as\nIEEE TPAMI\n,\nIJCV\n,\nIEEE TIP,\nNeurIPS etc.\nHe and his students have obtained the ACM ICIMCS best student paper award (2016). He has been selected as the Young Elite Program from\nCAST\n. He has obtained the excellent PhD. thesis award from\nCAAI\nand Shaanxi Government, the First Class Prize for Science and Technology in Shaanxi Province and so on. I obtained my Ph. D degree from Xidian University under the supervisor of Prof.\nXinbo Gao\n, China. He visited University of Technology, Sydnet from Sep. 2011 to Sep. 2013 under the supervisor of Prof.\nDacheng Tao