    "homepage_text": "Yuchi Huo\nYuchi Huo éå®é©°\nAssistant Professor\nZhejiang University\nEmail:  eehyc0 at gmail dot com\nAbout me\nI am an assistant professor (hundred-program) at\nState Key Lab of CAD&CG\n,\nZhejiang University\n, learding the rendering group.\nBefore joining ZJU in 2021,I was a researcher professor at\nKAIST\n, advised by\nSung-Eui Yoon\n.\r\n\t\t\t\tEarlier, I received my Ph.D. degree from the CAD&CG State Key Lab of Zhejiang University, advised by Prof.\nHujun Bao\nand Prof.\nRui Wang\n.\nMy research domains include computer graphics, computer vision, machine learning, and computational optics. Recent achievements are presented in Nature Communications, ACM TOG, SIGGRAPH, CVPR, NeurIPS, etc, covering physical rendering, real-time rendering, neural rendering, 3D reconstruction, AIGC, optical neural network, XR, multimodal vision, 3D vision, retrieval, and drones.\nMeanwhile, I am looking for Researcher, Engineer, Postdoc, and Research Intern in Zhejiang Lab and Zhejiang University, aiming at innovation in computer graphics, computer vision, intelligent agent, and optics.\nRecent:\n- We have three papers accepted by AAAI 2026.\n- We have five papers accepted by SIGGRAPH ASIA 2025.\n- I am serving SIGGRAPH Asia Technical Paper Commitee this year.\nSelected Publications\nA\n3\nGS: Arbitrary Artistic Style into Arbitrary 3D Gaussian Splatting\nZhiyuan Fang, Rengan Xie, Xuancheng Jin, Qi Ye, Wei Chen, Wenting Zheng, Rui Wang, Yuchi Huo\nAccepted by ICCV 2025.\npaper /\r\n              project\nIntrinsicControlNet: Cross-distribution Image Generation with Real and Unreal\nJiayuan Lu, Rengan Xie, Zixuan Xie, Zhizhen Wu, Dianbing Xi, Qi Ye, Rui Wang, Hujun Bao, Yuchi Huo\nAccepted by ICCV 2025.\npaper /\r\n              project\nLeveraging Pretrained Diffusion Models for Zero-Shot Part Assembly\nRuiyuan Zhang, Qi Wang, Jiaxiang Liu, Yu Zhang, Yuchi Huo, Chao Wu\nAccepted by IJCAI 2025.\npaper /\r\n              project\nA Fully-statistical Wave Scattering Model for Heterogeneous Surfaces\nZhengze Liu, Yifan Peng, Rui Wang, Yuchi Huo\nAccepted by SIGGRAPH 2025, and to appear in ACM Transactions on Graphics.\npaper /\r\n              project\nStreaming-Aware Neural Monte Carlo Rendering Framework with Unified Denoising-Compression and Client Collaboration\nHangming Fan, Yuchi Huo, Chuankun Zheng, Chonghao Hu, Yazhen Yuan, Rui Wang\nAccepted by SIGGRAPH 2025, and to appear in ACM Transactions on Graphics.\npaper /\r\n              project\nMoFlow: Motion-Guided Flows for Recurrent Rendered Frame Prediction\nZhizhen Wu, Chenyu Zuo, Zhilong Yuan, Yazhen Yuan, Yifan Peng, Guiyang Pu, Rui Wang, Yuchi Huo\nAccepted by ACM Transactions on Graphics, 2025.\npaper /\r\n              project\nDual-Band Feature Fusion for All-Frequency Neural Global Illumination\nShaohua Mo, Chuankun Zheng, Zihao Lin, Dianbing Xi, Qi Ye, Rui Wang, Hujun Bao, Yuchi Huo\nAccepted by SIGGRAPH 2025.\npaper /\r\n              project\nHand-held Object Reconstruction from RGB Video with Dynamic Interaction\nShijian Jiang, Qi Ye, Rengan Xie, Yuchi Huo, Jiming Chen\nProceedings of the Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition Conference (CVPR), 2025.\npaper /\r\n              project\nMIRReS: Inverse Rendering using Multi-Bounce Path Tracing and Reservoir Sampling\nYuxin Dai, Qi Wang, Jingsen Zhu, Dianbing Xi, Yuchi Huo, Chen Qian, Ying He\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR), 2025.\npaper /\r\n              project\nUltra-High Resolution Facial Texture Reconstruction from a Single Image\nHongxiang Huang, Guoyuan An, Jingzhen Lan, Qi Wang, Lingfei Wang, Rui Wang, Yuchi Huo\nComputational Visual Media (CVM), 2025, and to appear in Geometry Models.\nComputational Visual Media Journal (CVMJ), 2025.\npaper /\r\n              project\nLDM:Large Tensorial SDF Model for Textured Mesh Generation\nRengan Xie, Wenting Zheng, Kai Huang, Yizheng Chen, Qi Wang, Qi Ye, Wei Chen, Yuchi Huo\nComputational Visual Media (CVM), 2025, and to appear in Geometry Models.\npaper /\r\n              project\nHRHuman:Modeling HumanAvatars with Triangular Mesh and High-Resolution Textures from Videos\nQifeng Chen, Rengan Xie, Kai Huang, Qi Wang, Wenting Zheng, Rong Li, Yuchi Huo\nComputational Visual Media (CVM), 2025.\npaper /\r\n              project\nNeural Kernel Regression for Consistent Monte Carlo Denoising\nQi Wang, Pengju Qiao, Yuchi Huo, Shiji Zhai, Zixuan Xie, Wei Hua, Hujun Bao, Tao Liu\nACM Transactions on Graphics, ACM SIGGRAPH ASIA 2024.\n.\npaper /\r\n              project\nReN Human: Learning Relightable Neural Implicit Surfaces for Animatable Human Rendering\nRengan Xie, Kai Huang, In-Young Cho, Sen Yang, Wei Chen, Hujun Bao, Wenting Zheng, Rong Li, Yuchi Huo\nACM Transactions on Graphics, ACM SIGGRAPH ASIA 2024.\n.\npaper /\r\n              project\nNeural Global Illumination via Superposed Deformable Feature Fields\nChuankun Zheng, Yuchi Huo, Hongxiang Huang, Hongtao Sheng, Junrong Huang, Rui Tang, Hao Zhu, Rui Wang, Hujun Bao\nIn SIGGRAPH Asia 2024 Conference Papers, Article 24, pp. 1-11. 2024.                .\npaper /\r\n              project\nTPGP: Temporal-Parametric Optimization with Deep Grasp Prior for Dexterous Motion Planning\nLi, Haoming, Ye, Qi*, Huo, Yuchi, Liu, Qingtao, Jiang, Shijian, Zhou, Tao, Li, Xiang, Zhou, Yang, Chen, Jiming\nInternational Conference on Robotics and Automation (ICRA), 2024.\npaper /\r\n              project\nAdaptive Sampling and Reconstruction for Gradient-domain Rendering\nYuzhi Liang, Tao Liu, Yuchi Huo, Rui Wang, Hujun Bao\nComputational Visual Media Journal (CVMJ), 10(5): 885-902, 2024.\npaper /\r\n              project\nLightFormer: Light-oriented Global Neural Rendering in Dynamic Scenes\nHaocheng Ren, Yuchi Huo, Yifan Peng, Hongtao Sheng, Weidong Xue, Hongxiang Huang, Jingzhen Lan, Rui Wang, Hujun Bao\nACM Transactions on Graphics 43(4): 75:1-75:14, 2024. SIGGRAPH 2024.\npaper /\r\n              project\nIn-Hand 3D Object Reconstruction from a Monocular RGB Video\nShijian Jiang, Qi Ye, Rengan Xie, Yuchi Huo, Xiang Li, Yang Zhou, Jiming Chen\nTheThirty-Eighth AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI), 2024.\npaper /\r\n              project\nError-aware Sampling in Adaptive Shells for Neural Surface Reconstruction\nQi Wang, Yuchi Huo, Qi Ye, Rui Wang, Hujun Bao\nInternational Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI), 2024.\npaper /\r\n              project\nToward Weather-Robust 3D Human Body Reconstruction: Millimeter-Wave Radar-Based Dataset, Benchmark, and Multi-Modal Fusion\nAnjun Chen, Xiangyu Wang, Kun Shi, Yuchi Huo, Jiming Chen, Qi Ye\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology (TCSVT), 2024.\npaper /\r\n              project\nReal-Time Polygonal Lighting of Iridescence Effect using Precomputed Monomial-Gaussians\nZhengze Liu, \r\n              Yuchi Huo, \r\n              Yinhui Yang,\r\n              Jie Chen, \r\n              Rui Wang\nComputer Graphic Forum 43(6), 2024. Presented at Eurographics 2024.\npaper /\r\n              project\nFuseSR: Super Resolution for Real-time Rendering through Efficient Multi-resolution Fusion\nZhihua Zhong,\r\n              Jingsen Zhu,\r\n              Yuxin Dai,\r\n              Chuankun Zheng,\r\n              Yuchi Huo,\r\n              Guanlin CHen,\r\n              Hujun Bao,\r\n              Rui Wang\nACM SIGGRAPH Asia\n, 2023\npaper /\r\n\t\t\t        supp /\r\n              video /\r\n              project\nAdaptive Recurrent Frame Prediction with Learnable Motion Vectors\nZhizhen Wu,\r\n              Chenyu Zuo,\r\n              Yuchi Huo,\r\n              Yazhen Yuan,\r\n              Yifan Peng,\r\n              Guiyang Pu,\r\n              Hujun Bao,\r\n              Rui Wang\nACM SIGGRAPH Asia\n, 2023\npaper /\r\n\t\t\t        supp /\r\n              video /\r\n              project\nTopological Verification for Image Retrieval without Fine-tuning\nGuoyuan An, \r\n              Ju-hyeong Seon,\r\n              Inkyu An, \r\n              Yuchi Huo, \r\n              Sung-eui Yoon\nAccepted by Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS)\n, 2023\npaper /\r\n\t\t\t        supp /\r\n              video /\r\n              project\nTowards Content-based Pixel Retrieval in Revisited Oxford and Paris\nGuoyuan An,\r\n              Woo Jae Kim,\r\n              Saelyne Yang,\r\n              Rong Li,\r\n              Yuchi Huo,\r\n              Sungeui Yoon\nThe International Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV)\n, 2023\npaper\n/\ncode\n/\nproject\nSeal-3D: Interactive Pixel-Level Editing for Neural Radiance Fields\nXiangyu Wang,\r\n              Jingsen Zhu,\r\n              Qi Ye,\r\n              Yuchi Huo, \r\n              Yunlong Ran,  \r\n              Zhihua Zhong,\r\n              Jiming Chen\nThe International Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV)\n, 2023\npaper\n/\ncode\n/\nproject\nContact2Grasp: 3D Grasp Synthesis via Hand-Object Contact Constraint\nMing Hao Li,\r\n              Lin Xin Zhuo,\r\n              Yang Zhou,\r\n              Xiang Li,\r\n              Yuchi Huo,\r\n              Jiming Chen,\r\n              Qi Ye\nInternational Joint Conferences on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI)\n, 2023\npaper\n/\r\n              video /\r\n              project\nNeLT: Neural Light Transfer\nChuankun Zheng,\r\n\t\t\t      Yuchi Huo,\r\n            Shaohua Mo,\r\n            Zhizhen Wu,\r\n            Rui Wang, \r\n            Hujun Bao\nACM Transactions on Graphics, ACM SIGGRAPH\n, 2023\npaper\n/\r\n\t\t\t        supp /\r\n              video /\r\n              project\nI\n2\n-SDF: Intrinsic Indoor Scene Reconstruction and Editing via Raytracing in Neural SDFs\nJingsen Zhu, \r\n            Yuchi Huo,\r\n             Qi Ye,\r\n             Fujun Luan, \r\n             Jifan Li, \r\n             Dianbing Xi, \r\n             Lisha Wang,\r\n              Rui Tang, \r\n              Wei Hua, \r\n              Hujun Bao, \r\n              Rui Wang\nThe IEEE/CVF