sia\n, 2022\npaper\n/\ndata\n/\nproject\nMINERVAS: Massive INterior EnviRonments VirtuAl Synthesis\nHaocheng Ren,\r\n\t\t\t  Hao Zhang,\r\n\t\t\t  Jia Zheng,\r\n\t\t\t  Jiaxiang Zheng,\r\n\t\t\t  Rui Tang,\r\n              Yuchi Huo,\r\n              Hujun Bao,\r\n\t\t\t  Rui Wang\nComputer Graphics Forum (CGF), Pacific Graphics\n, 2022\npaper /\r\n\t\t\t        supp /\r\n              video /\r\n              project\nAutomatic Mesh and Shader Level of Detail\nYuzhi Liang,\r\n\t\t\t  Qi Song,\r\n\t\t\t  Rui Wang,\r\n              Yuchi Huo,\r\n              Hujun Bao\nIEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics (TVCG)\nï¼ 2022\npaper\n/\nsupp\n/\nvideo\n/\r\n              project\nShaderTransformer: Predicting Shader Quality via One-shot Embedding for Fast Simplification\nYuchi Huo,\r\n              Shi Li,\r\n\t\t\t        Yazhen Yuan,\r\n\t\t\t        Xu Chen,\r\n              Wenting Zheng,\r\n\t\t\t        Hai Lin,\r\n\t\t\t        Rui Wang,\r\n              Hujun Bao\nACM SIGGRAPH\n, 2022\npaper\n/\r\n\t\t\t        supp /\r\n              video /\r\n              project\nContour-Aware Equipotential Learning for Semantic Segmentation\nXu Yin,\r\n\t\t\t  Dongbo Min,\r\n\t\t\t  Yuchi Huo,\r\n\t\t\t  Sung-Eui Yoon\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia (TMM)\n, 2022\npaper\n/\ncode\n/\nproject\nPowerNet: Learning-based Real-time Power-budget Rendering\nYunjin Zhang,\r\n\t\t\t  Rui Wang,\r\n\t\t\t  Yuchi Huo,\r\n\t\t\t  Wei Hua,\r\n              Hujun Bao\nIEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics (TVCG)\n, 2022\npaper\n/\r\n\t\t\t        supp /\r\n              video /\r\n              project\nReal-time Monte Carlo Denoising with Weight Sharing Kernel Prediction Network\nHangming Fan,\r\n\t\t\t  Rui Wang,\r\n\t\t\t  Yuchi Huo,\r\n              Hujun Bao\nComputer Graphics Forum (CGF), Eurographics Symposium on Rendering\n, 2021\nTop Cited Article\npaper\n/\nvideo\n/\r\n              project\nMulti-resolution Terrain Rendering Using Summed-