    "homepage_text": "API\nProducts\nResources\nApps\nFAQ\nTop Experts\nChrome Extension\nSign in\nJian Zou\nPostdoctoral Associate\nCity of Ithaca, New York, United States\nJoin Prog.AI to see contacts\nJoin Prog.AI to see contacts\nSummary\n👤\nSenior\n🎓\nTop School\nJiaru Zou is a student researcher in Urbana, Illinois, focusing on large language model reasoning, agentic AI, and deep learning. With a decade of experience spanning academia and industry, including roles at Google DeepMind and internships at Amazon and Microsoft, he blends rigorous research with practical software engineering. He is an Economics PhD student at UIUC alongside a Bachelor's in Computer Engineering from UIUC, backed by an exchange program at Zhejiang University, which gives him a unique cross-disciplinary lens on AI for decision-making and economics. His hands-on work ranges from iSAIL Lab and BRL undergraduate research to robotics software and NLP/ML research, underscoring a track record of building and evaluating AI systems at scale. Actively seeking collaboration, he is eager to connect on research initiatives that advance reasoning in AI, agentic capabilities, and real-world deployments.\n10\nyears\nof coding experience\nDoctor of Philosophy - PhD, Economics, Doctor of Philosophy - PhD, Economics at University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign\nBachelor of Science (BS), Economics, Bachelor of Science (BS), Economics at Hunan University\nMaster of Science - MS, Policy Economics, Master of Science - MS, Policy Economics at 美国伊利诺伊大学香槟分校\nGithub contributions (5)\nMore\nJianZou92/StatLearning\nJul 2017 - Mar 2018\nContributions:\n7 pushes, 1 branch in 7 months\nJianZou92/PythonPractice\nJul 2017 - Jul 2017\nContributions:\n19 pushes, 1 branch in 3 days\nFind and Hire Top Developers\nWe’ve analyzed the programming source code of over 60 million software developers on GitHub and scored them by 50,000 skills. Sign-up on Prog,AI to search for software developers.\nRequest Free Trial\nPrivacy Policy\nPrivacy Data Subjects\nTerms of Use\nDo Not Sell My Info\nJian Zou - Postdoctoral Associate"
  },
