    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Yuanyuan Wang (王媛媛)\nYuanyuan Wang (王媛媛)\nPh.D. Student\nMachine Learning and Reasoning (MLR) Group\nSchool of Mathematics and Statistics\nThe University of Melbourne\nAddress: 206 Old Geology Building South, Parkville, VIC, Australia\nEmail: yuanyuanw2 AT student.unimelb.edu.au\nAbout Me\nI’m a final-year Ph.D. candidate in the School of Mathematics and Statistics at the University of Melbourne, \r\nwhere I also completed my Master’s in Data Science. \r\nI’m incredibly fortunate to be advised by a fantastic team:\nMingming Gong\n(principal supervisor),\nWei Huang\n,\nXi Geng\n, \r\nand\nBiwei Huang\n.\nI’m passionate about understanding and reasoning about dynamical systems through the lens of causality—particularly those governed by ODEs and SDEs. \r\nLately, I’ve been fascinated by causal representation learning and diffusion-based generative models.\nFeel free to reach out if you’d like to chat or collaborate!\nPublications\nIdentifiability Analysis of Linear ODE Systems with Hidden Confounders\nY. Wang\n, B. Huang, W. Huang, X. Geng, M. Gong\nNeurIPS 2024\nIdentifiability and Asymptotics in Learning Homogeneous Linear ODE Systems from Discrete Observations\nY. Wang\n, W. Huang, M. Gong, X. Geng, T. Liu, K. Zhang, D. Tao\nJMLR 2024\nGenerator Identification for Linear SDEs with Additive and Multiplicative Noise\nY. Wang\n, X. Geng, W. Huang, B. Huang, M. Gong\nNeurIPS 2023\nHonors and Awards\nResearch Training Program Scholarship, the University of Melbourne, 2021-2025\nDean's Honours List - Faculty of Science, the University of Melbourne, 2021\nAcademic Services\nConference and Journal Reviewer: NeurIPS, ICML, ICLR, UAI, AJCAI, TMLR etc.\nTutoring Role\nMAST90072 - Data and Decision Making, the University of Melbourne\n© Yuanyuan Wang | Last update: May. 2025"
  },
