tudents (MathorCup大学生数学建模挑战赛), 2017\nNational Bronze Award\nChina University Student Computer Design Competition (中国大学生计算机设计大赛), 2017\nNational 2nd Prize (Software Development Track)\nChina University Student Computer Design Competition (中国大学生计算机设计大赛), 2017\nNational 2nd Prize (Game Development Track)\nThe Creative Youth (Challenge Cup): China College Students Entrepreneurship Competition (挑战杯:“创青春”中国大学生创业大赛), 2016\nNational Bronze Award\nThe China Internet+ College Students Innovation and Entrepreneurship Competition (中国“互联网+”大学生创新创业大赛), 2016\nNational Bronze Award\nAcademic Services\n[Top]\nMembership\nIEEE Member\nCCF Member\nProgram Committee Member | Reviewer\nAAAI, NeurIPS, ECML-PKDD, Chinese Journal of Computers, Pattern Recognition, and etc.\nGrant Proposal for The National Science Center, Poland\nResearch Intern\n[Top]\n2025.04-present,\nShanghai Artificial Intelligence Laboratory\n, Shanghai, China\nTasks:\nAI for Life Science\n2025.05-present,\nBiomap Research\n, Beijing, China\nTasks:\nAI for Life Science\n2021.02-2021.06,\nCity University of Hong Kong (CityU)\n, Hong Kong, China\nTasks:\nNeural Machine Translation\n2019.10-2020.03,\nCloudTranslation\n, Xiamen, China\nTasks:\nNeural Machine Translation\n© All Rights Reserved by Jiangbin Zheng."
