    "homepage_text": "Xiaodong Xie @ MIMA\nXiaodong Xie @ MIMA\nXiaodong Xie(xiexiaodong)\nM.S. Student,\nMIMA Group\nDepartment of Software Engineering\nShandong University\n, Shandong 250101, China\nE-mail:\nxiexiaodonger@gmail.com\nCurrently I am a third year graduate student of\nDepartment of Software Engineering\nin\nShandong University\nand a member of\nMIMA Group\n, led by professor\nXin-Shun Xu.\nEdit\nSupervisor\nProfessor\nXin-Shun Xu\n.\nEdit\nBiography\nI received my B.S. degree in Department of Software Engineering in June 2020 from\nShandong University\n. \r\n\t\tIn the same year, I was admitted to study for a M.S. degree in\nShandong University.\nResearch Interest\nI am interested in Machine Learning. Currently I am focusing on the subfields of\nDeep Learning\nand\nVideo anomaly detection.\n.\nPublication\nXiaodongXie\nand .\nTeaching Assistant\nAwards & Honors\nContact MIMA:å±±ä¸çæµåå¸èåè·¯ä¸­æ®µ å±±ä¸å¤§å­¦è½¯ä»¶å­æ ¡åº è½¯ä»¶å­¦é¢ 250101\nCopyright© MIMA"
