    "homepage_text": "Xinyu CAI\n      -  CityUHK Scholars\nCityUHK Scholars Home\nResearcher Login\nLink opens in a new tab\nSearch content at CityUHK Scholars\nXinyu CAI, 蔡新宇\n(Former)\nh-index\n13\nScopus Citations\n2\nScopus h-index\nCalculated based on number of publications stored in Pure and citations from Scopus\n2020\n2023\nResearch activity per year\nPersonal profile\nAuthor IDs\nORCID iD:\n0000-0002-7986-7007\nFingerprint\nDive into the research topics where Xinyu CAI is active. These topic labels come from the works of this person. Together they form a unique fingerprint.\n5\nSimilar Profiles\nRobot\nEngineering\n100%\nAerodynamics\nEngineering\n50%\nInertial Measurement Unit\nEngineering\n30%\nRobotics\nEngineering\n20%\nState Estimation\nEngineering\n10%\nGeneralized Coordinate\nEngineering\n10%\nEquilibrium State\nEngineering\n10%\nRobot System\nEngineering\n10%\nView full fingerprint\nCollaborations from the last five years\nRecent external collaboration based on locations. Dive into details by clicking on the dots or\nSelect a place from the list\nDive into details\nSelect a place to view shared publications and projects\nClose\nSelect a place from the list\nExplore network further\nResearch output\n1\nRGC 32 - Refereed conference paper (with host publication)\n1\nRGC 21 - Publication in refereed journal\nStabilizing Aerodynamic Dampers for Cooperative Transport of a Suspended Payload with Aerial Robots\nDong, K.\n,\nDing, R.\n,\nBai, S.\n,\nCai, X.\n&\nChirarattananon, P.\n,\nSept 2023\n,\nIn:\nAdvanced Intelligent Systems.\n5\n,\n9\n, 2300112.\nResearch output\n:\nJournal Publications and Reviews\n›\nRGC 21 - Publication in refereed journal\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nFile\nRobot\n100%\nAerodynamics\n100%\nHardware Component\n20%\nEquilibrium State\n20%\nOpen Space\n20%\n6\nLink opens in a new tab\nCitations\n(Scopus)\n96\nDownloads (CityUHK Scholars)\nTowards Cooperative Transport of a Suspended Payload via Two Aerial Robots with Inertial Sensing\nXie, H.\n,\nCai, X.\n&\nChirarattananon, P.\n,\nOct 2020\n,\n2020 IEEE/RSJ International Conference on Intelligent Robots and Systems (IROS).\nIEEE\n,\np. 1215-1221\n9341670. (IEEE International Conference on Intelligent Robots and Systems).\nResearch output\n:\nChapters, Conference Papers, Creative and Literary Works\n›\nRGC 32 - Refereed conference paper (with host publication)\n›\npeer-review\nRobot\n100%\nInertial Measurement Unit\n60%\nRobotics\n40%\nExtended Kalman Filter\n20%\nRobot System\n20%\n7\nLink opens in a new tab\nCitations\n(Scopus)\nThesis\nPassive Stability for Cooperative Transport of a Cable-Suspended Payload by Two Aerial Robots\nCAI, X.\n(Author),\nCHIRARATTANANON, P.\n(Supervisor),\n4 Aug 2020\nStudent thesis\n:\nMaster's Thesis"
