    "homepage_text": "Daogao Liu\nDaogao\nLiu\nUW CS theory group\n.\nI am currently a visiting postdoctoral researcher at Google. I received my PhD in Computer Science from the University of Washington in 2024, where I was advised by Prof.\nYin Tat Lee\n. Prior to that, I earned a B.S. in Mathematics and Physics from Tsinghua University in 2020.\nCurrently, I am primarily focused on research in the field of machine learning and theoretical computer science, with a particular emphasis on Differential Privacy, Stochastic Optimization, and Algorithm Design.\nAny comments and questions are super welcomed! Feel free to email me."
  },
