    "homepage_text": "Tong Sun (孙桐) - Homepage\nTong Sun   (孙桐)\nZhejiang Univeristy\nCollege of Computer Science and Technology, Zhejiang University\nHangzhou, China\nEmail\nResearchGate\nLinkedIn\nDBLP\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nORCID\nHi, I’m currently a fourth-year PhD Student in the\nCollege of Computer Science and Technology\nat\nZhejiang University (ZJU)\n, and expected to get the PhD degree in 2027. I’m co-advised by\nProf. Wei Dong (董玮)\nand\nProf. Yi Gao (高艺)\n. I work closely with\nProf. Borui Li (李博睿)\nand\nProf. Jiamei Lv (吕嘉美)\n. Prior to that, I received my B.E. degree from the\nSchool of Electronics and Information Engineering\nin\nHangzhou Dianzi University (HDU)\n, Hangzhou, 2022, advised by\nProf. Long Chen (陈龙)\n.\nI work on\nsystems and security for AIoT\n, with a focus on\nsystem software for confidential computing in IoT\n.\nResearch Overview:\nI’m currently working on the following directions:\nGenerative safe OS with confidential computing support for IoT\n— Toward automatically constructing a secure-by-default OS and toolchain for TEE-enabled IoT devices.\nLLM-assisted secure application development:\nframeworks that help developers build TEE-based secure IoT applications correctly.\n[IPSN’24, dTEE]\nReal-time, cloud–edge–end collaborative confidential AI inference\n— Key techniques for low-latency and privacy-preserving inference on IoT devices with TEE support.\n[CCS’25, TensorShield]\nI used to work on (and still build upon) the following topics:\nDelta compression / differencing algorithms for software updates\nContainer Deduplication:\n[ATC’24, SimEnc]\n,\n[TOS’25, SimEnc+]\nMobile APP updates:\n[TMC’24, sdiff]\n,\n[INFOCOM’24, MDiffPatch]\nE-mail:\n<tongsun 🤯 zju [dot] edu [dot] cn> & <asckw30 🤯 gmail [dot] com>\nOur Lab:\nEmNets research group\n🔥 News\n2025.12:\n🏆 Selected into the China Association for Science and Technology (CAST) Youth Talent Support Program for PhD Students\n中国科协青年科技人才培育工程博士生专项计划\n!\n2025.12:\n🏆 Received funding from the National Natural Science Foundation of China (NSFC) under the Youth Student Basic Research Program\n国家自然科学基金青年学生基础研究项目(博士研究生)\n!\n2025.11:\n😃 Invited to serve on the\nAEC\nof\nUSENIX Security 2026\n.\n2025.08:\n😃 Invited to serve on the\nAEC\nof\nIEEE S&P (Oakland) 2026\n.\n2025.06:\n😃 Invited to serve on the\nShadow PC\nof\nACM EuroSys 2026\n.\n2025.05:\n😃 Invited to serve on the\nAEC\nof\nACM CCS 2025\n.\n2025.05:\n🎉🎉 Our work\nTensorShield\nis\naccepted\nto\nACM CCS 2025\n. Thanks to all collaborators! See you in Taipei.\n2025.05:\n😃 Invited to serve on the\nAEC\nof\nUSENIX FAST 2026\n.\n2025.05:\n😃 Invited to serve on the\nTPC\nof\nIEEE DIKW 2025\n.\n2025.05:\n😃 Invited to be the reviewer of\nInternational Journal of Data Science and Analytics\n.\n2025.04:\n😃 Invited to serve on the\nAEC\nof\nUSENIX OSDI 2025\nand\nUSENIX ATC 2025\n.\n2025.03:\n🎉🎉 Our work\nSimEnc\nis selected as one of the\nBest Storage Related Papers (3/77≈3.9%)\nof USENIX ATC'24 for fast-track publication in\nACM Transactions on Storage\n. Thanks to all collaborators!\n2025.02:\n😃 Invited to be the reviewer of\nThe Journal of Supercomputing\n.\n2024.11:\n🏆 Received the\n2024 National Scholarship\n!\n2024.09:\n😃 Invited to be the reviewer of\nIEEE HPCC 2024\n.\n2024.09:\n😃 Invited to be the reviewer of\nIEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering\n.\n2024.05:\n🎉🎉 Our work\nsdiff\nis\naccepted\nto\nIEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing\n. Thanks to all collaborators!\n2024.05:\n🎉🎉 Our work\nSimEnc\nis\naccepted\nto\nUSENIX ATC 2024\n. Thanks to all collaborators! See you in Santa Clara.\n2024.01:\n🎉🎉 Our work\ndTEE\nis\naccepted\nto\nACM/IEEE IPSN 2024\n. Thanks to all collaborators! See you in Hong Kong.\n2023.12:\n😃 Our work\nMDiffPatch\nis\naccepted\nto\nIEEE INFOCOM 2024\n, congrats to Lewei!\n📝 Publications\n(*Corresponding Author)\n[CCF]\nChina Computer Federation Ranking\n; [TH-CPL]\nTsinghua-Computer Science Preferred List\n; [CORE]\nCORE Conference Ranking\n2025\nACM CCS'25\n[C4]\nTensorShield: Safeguarding On-Device Inference by Shielding Critical DNN Tensors with TEE\nTong Sun\n, Bowen Jiang, Hailong Lin, Borui Li, Yixiao Teng, Yi Gao, and Wei Dong*.\nProceedings of ACM Conference on Computer and Communications Security (CCS), October 13-17, 2025\n.\nAcceptance Rate: Cycle A 12.5% (102 out of 816),  Cycle A AI sec track 11.8% (24 out of 204).\nCCF-A.\nTHCPL-A.\nCORE A*.\n[\npaper\n|\nweb\n|\ncode\n|\nslides\n]\nACM TOS'25\n[J2]\nExploiting Multiple Similarity Spaces for Deduplication of Encrypted Container Images\nTong Sun\n, Bowen Jiang, Borui Li, Jiamei Lv, Yi Gao*, and Wei Dong*.\nACM Transactions on Storage (TOS)\n.\nCCF-A.\nTHCPL-A.\n[\npaper\n|\nweb\n|\ncode\n]\n2024\nIEEE TMC'24\n[J1]\nUnderstanding Differencing Algorithms for Mobile Application Updates\nTong Sun\n, Bowen Jiang, Lewei Jin, Wenzhao Zhang, Yi Gao, Zhendong Li, and Wei Dong*.\nIEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing (TMC)\n.\nIF=9.2(2025), CAS Q1-Top, JCR Q1.\nCCF-A.\nTHCPL-A.\n[\npaper\n|\nweb\n|\ncode\n]\nUSENIX ATC'24\n[C3]\nSimEnc: A High-Performance Similarity-Preserving Encryption Approach for Deduplication of Encrypted Docker Images\nTong Sun\n, Bowen Jiang, Borui Li, Jiamei Lv, Yi Gao*, and Wei Dong*.\nProceedings of the 2024 USENIX Annual Technical Conference (USENIX ATC), Santa Clara, CA, USA. July 10–12\n.\nAcceptance Rate: 15.8% (77 out of 488).\n🏆 Best Storage Related Paper (3/77)\nCCF-A.\nTHCPL-A.\nCORE A.\nBest Storage Related Paper\n[\npaper\n|\nweb\n|\ncode\n|\nslides\n|\nvideo\n]\nACM/IEEE IPSN'24\n[C2]\ndTEE: A Declarative Approach to Secure IoT Applications Using TrustZone\nTong Sun\n, Borui Li, Yixiao Teng, Yi Gao, and Wei Dong*.\nProceedings of the 23rd ACM/IEEE Conference on Information Processing in Sensor Networks (IPSN), Hong Kong, China. May 13-16\n.\nAcceptance Rate: 21.5% (20 out of 93).\nCCF-B.\nTHCPL-A.\nCORE A*.\n[\npaper\n|\nweb\n|\nslides\n]\nIEEE INFOCOM'24\n[C1]\nExploiting Multiple Similarity Spaces for Efficient and Flexible Incremental Update of Mobile Apps\nLewei Jin, Wei Dong*, Bowen Jiang,\nTong Sun\n, and Yi Gao*.\nProceedings of IEEE Conference on Computer Communications (INFOCOM), Vancouver, Canada. May 20-23\n.\nAcceptance Rate: 19.6% (256 out of 1307).\nCCF-A.\nTHCPL-A.\nCORE A*.\n[\npaper\n|\nweb\n]\n🔍 Academic Services\nTechnical Program Committee\n: ACM EuroSys 2026 (Shadow), IEEE DIKW 2025\nProgram Committee for Artifact Evaluation\n: USENIX OSDI 2025, USENIX ATC 2025, USENIX FAST 2026, IEEE S&P 2026, ACM CCS 2025, USENIX Security 2026\nJournal Reviewer\n: IEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering (TKDE), ACM Transactions on Internet of Things (TIOT), The Journal of Supercomputing (TJS), International Journal of Data Science and Analytics (IJDSA), Scientific Reports\nConference Reviewer\n: IEEE HPCC 2024\nExternal Reviewer\n: ICML 2026, ACM Transactions on Privacy and Security (TOPS), IEEE Transactions on Parallel and Distributed Systems (TPDS), ACM TheWebConf/WWW 2024-2026, Chinese Journal of Computers, IEEE MASS 2023-2025\n💰 Grants\nPI, Research on Efficient Confidential Inference for Large Models with Cloud-Edge Collaboration, NSFC Grant No. 625B2167\n国家自然科学基金青年学生基础研究项目(博士研究生)\n, 2026.01~2027.12.\n🎖 Honors and Awards\n2025.12\n:  Youth Talent Support Program for PhD Students (\n中国科协青年科技人才培育工程博士生专项计划\n), China Association for Science and Technology, 2025\n2025.10\n:  Best Presentation Award, 21st PhD Innovation Forum, College of Computer Science, Zhejiang University (浙江大学计算机学院博士生创新论坛最佳讲者), 2025\n2025.10\n:  Outstanding Graduate Student Scholarship, Outstanding Graduate Student Cadre at Zhejiang University (浙江大学优秀研究生，优秀研究生干部), 2025\n2024.11\n:\nNational Scholarship\n(Award Rate: ～0.2% nation-wide)\n(\n国家奖学金\n), Ministry of Education, China, 2024\n2024.11\n:  Outstanding Graduate Student Scholarship, Merit Graduate Student Award, and Outstanding Graduate Student Cadre at Zhejiang University (浙江大学优秀研究生，五好研究生，优秀研究生干部), 2024\n2024.08\n:  One of the Three\nBest Storage Related Papers\nin USENIX ATC 2024\n2023.11\n:  Outstanding Graduate Student Scholarship, Merit Graduate Student Award, and Outstanding Graduate Student Cadre at Zhejiang University (浙江大学优秀研究生，五好研究生，优秀研究生干部)，2023\n2022.06\n:  Zhejiang Province\nOutstanding Graduate Award\n(\n浙江省优秀毕业生\n)\n2022.06\n:  Hangzhou Dianzi University Outstanding Graduate Award (杭州电子科技大学优秀毕业生)\n2021.11\n:\nNational Scholarship\n(Award Rate: ～0.2% nation-wide)\n(\n国家奖学金\n), Ministry of Education, China, 2021\n2021.07\n:\n1st Prize\nin the “10th Zhejiang Province Undergraduate Smart Car Contest” (第十届浙江省大学生智能汽车竞赛一等奖, 教育部全国大学生A类学科竞赛)\n2021.05\n:\nMeritorious Winner\nin the “Mathematical Contest In Modeling (MCM/ICM 2021)” (美国大学生数学建模竞赛M奖)\n2020.10\n:\n2nd Prize\nin the “2020 Zhejiang Province Undergraduate Electronic Design Contest” (浙江省电子设计竞赛二等奖, 教育部全国大学生A类学科竞赛)\n2020.08\n:\n1st Prize\nin the “15th National Undergraduate Smart Car Contest” (第十五届全国大学生智能汽车竞赛一等奖, 教育部全国大学生A类学科竞赛) |\n[video]\n2020.07\n:\n1st Prize\nin the “9th Zhejiang Province Undergraduate Smart Car Contest” (第九届浙江省大学生智能汽车竞赛一等奖, 教育部全国大学生A类学科竞赛)\n2020.11\n:\nZhejiang Province Government Scholarship\n(Award Rate: ～3% province-wide)\n(\n浙江省政府奖学金\n), 2020\n2019.11\n:\nZhejiang Province Government Scholarship\n(Award Rate: ～3% province-wide)\n(\n浙江省政府奖学金\n), 2019\n📖 Educations\n2022.06 - Now\n, Zhejiang University\nPh.D. Candidate in Computer Science\n2018.09 - 2022.06\n, Hangzhou Dianzi University\nB.E. in Electronic and Information Engineering\n💬 Invited Talks\n2024.07\n, [USENIX ATC’24 - Security 1 Session] SimEnc: A High-Performance Similarity-Preserving Encryption Approach for Deduplication of Encrypted Docker Images, Santa Clara, USA. |\n[video]\n2024.05\n, [ACM/IEEE IPSN’24 - Privacy/Security Session] dTEE: A Declarative Approach to Secure IoT Applications Using TrustZone, Hong Kong, China.\n🧱 Patents\nZhendong Li, Wei Dong, Lewei Jin,\nTong Sun\n, Jia Chang. 数据更新的方法、装置、设备及计算机可读存储介质[P]. 中国专利: CN2023108756139. 2025.01.14. (已公开)\nWei Dong, Bowen Jiang, Yi Gao,\nTong Sun\n. 一种面向容器仓库中加密镜像的文件去重方法和装置[P]. 中国专利: CN2024103753035. 2024.06.11. (已公开)\n💻 Internships\n2022.09 - 2023.11\n, Huawei. “Over-The-Air Differencing Algorithm Optimization Technology(差分OTA优化技术)”,\nExcellent Completion(优秀结题)\n.\n📞 Contact\n✉️ <tongsun 🤯 zju [dot] edu [dot] cn> & <asckw30 🤯 gmail [dot] com>\n💬 WeChat ID: suntong30\n🏠 Room 301, Zetong Building, Yuquan Campus, Zhejiang University, Hangzhou, China.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected."
