    "homepage_text": "Chengzhi's homepage\nChengzhi Cao\n曹成志\nUniversity of Science and Technology of China\nEmail:\nchengzhicao88@gmail.com\nAddress:\n443 Huangshan Road, Hefei, China\nBiography\nI am currently studying for a  master's degree in department of automation,\nUniversity of Science and Technology of China (USTC)\n, advised by\nXueyang Fu\nand\nZheng-jun Zha\n.\nMy research interests focus on computer vision, especially behavior modeling, logic learning and low-level vision (deblurring, super-resolution and deraining).\nI’m open to any kinds of collaboration. Please feel free to contact me directly through email.\nNews\n[07/2024] One paper accepted by\nIJCV\n[01/2024] One paper accepted by\nICLR\n2024\n[11/2023] One paper accepted by\nTNNLS\n[09/2023] One paper accepted by\nNeurIPS\n2023\n[03/2023] Two papers accepted by\nCVPR\n2023\n[06/2022] One paper accepted by\nACM MM\n2022\n[04/2022] One paper accepted by\nIJCAI\n2022 (\nOral\n)\nPublications\n(^ denotes equal contribution, * denotes corresponding authors)\nEnhancing Human-AI Collaboration Through Logic-Guided Reasoning\n[\npdf\n]\n  [\ncode\n]\n  [\nproject page\n]\nChengzhi Cao\n, Yinghao Fu, Ruimao Zhang, Shuang Li*\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations\n(ICLR\nAccept\n)\nDiscovering Intrinsic Spatial-Temporal Logic Rules to Explain Human Actions\n[\npdf\n]\n  [\ncode\n]\n  [\nproject page\n]\n  [\nvideo\n]\n  [\nslides\n]\n  [\nposter\n]\nChengzhi Cao\n, Chao Yang, Ruimao Zhang, Shuang Li*\nConference on Neural Information Processing Systems\n(NeurIPS\nAccept\n)\nEvent-guided Person Re-Identification via Sparse-Dense Complementary Learning\n[\npdf\n]\n   [\ncode\n]\n   [\nproject page\n]\n   [\nvideo\n]\n   [\nslides\n]\n   [\nposter\n]\nChengzhi Cao\n, Xueyang Fu*, Hongjian Liu, Yukun Huang, Kunyu Wang, Jiebo Luo, Zheng-jun Zha\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(CVPR\nAccept\n)\nEvent-guided Video Restoration with Spiking-Convolutional Architecture\n[\npdf\n]  \n  [\ncode\n]\n  [\nproject page\n]\nChengzhi Cao\n, Xueyang Fu*, Yurui Zhu, Zhijing Sun, Zheng-jun Zha\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems\n(TNNLS\nAccept, IF=10.4\n)\nEvent-driven Video Deblurring via Spatio-Temporal Relation-Aware Network\n[\npdf\n]\n      [\ncode\n]\n      [\nproject page\n]\n      [\nvideo\n]\n      [\nslides\n]\n      [\nposter\n]\nChengzhi Cao\n, Xueyang Fu*, Yurui Zhu, Gege Shi, Zheng-jun Zha\nInternational Joint Conferences on Artificial Intelligence Organization\n(IJCAI\nOral paper, Acceptance Rate < 3.75%\n)\nEvent-Driven Heterogeneous Network for Video Deraining\n[\npdf\n]\n    [\ncode\n]\n    [\nproject page\n]\nChengzhi Cao\n, Senyan Xu, Fanrui Zhang, Kunyu Wang, Zheng-Jun Zha\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision\n(IJCV\nAccept\n)\nTowards Generalized UAV Object Detection: A Novel Perspective from Frequency Domain Disentanglement\n[\npdf\n]\nKunyu Wang, Xueyang Fu, Chengjie Ge,\nChengzhi Cao\n, Zheng-Jun Zha\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision\n(IJCV\nAccept\n)\nGeneralized UAV Object Detection via Frequency Domain Disentanglement\n[\npdf\n]\nKunyu Wang, Xueyang Fu*, Hongjian Liu, Yukun Huang,\nChengzhi Cao\n, Gege Shi, Zheng-jun Zha\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(CVPR\nAccept\n)\nSingle Image Shadow Detection via Complementary Mechanism\n[\npdf\n]\n    [\ncode\n]\nYurui Zhu, Xueyang Fu*,\nChengzhi Cao\n, Xi Wang, Qibin Sun, Zheng-jun Zha\nProceedings of the 30th ACM International Conference on Multimedia\n(ACM MM\nAccept\n)\nAlleviating Spatial Misalignment and Motion Interference for UAV-based Video Recognition\n[\npdf\n]\nGege Shi, Xueyang Fu*,\nChengzhi Cao\n, Zheng-jun Zha\nProceedings of the 31st ACM International Conference on Multimedia\n(ACM MM\nAccept\n)\nNeuromorphic Event Signal-Driven Network for Video De-raining\n[\npdf\n]\nChengjie Ge, Xueyang Fu*, Peng He, Kunyu Wang,\nChengzhi Cao\n, Zheng-jun Zha\nProceedings of the AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n(AAAI\nAccept\n)\nCompetitions\nThird Prize\nCVPR Workshop MIPI-challenge\non RGBW Joint Fusion and Denoise\nThird Prize\nCVPR Workshop NTIRE 2023\n- HR Depth from Images of Specular and Transparent Surfaces\nInternship\n2021.2 - 2021.6\nTencent Music Entertainment\nAlgorithms Engineer\nTopic: video super-resolution, video deblurring, object detection\nAdvisors: Prof.\nKwok Wai Hung\nand\nSimon Lui\n2021.6 - 2021.11\nBaidu Cognitive Computing Lab (CCL)\nResearch Assistant\nTopic: behavior modelling, physical simulator\nAdvisors: Dr. Weifu Wang\nAwards\nNational Scholarship (top1%, highest scholarship from Ministry of Education of China)  2018\nNational Scholarship (top1%, highest scholarship from Ministry of Education of China)  2019\nNational Scholarship (top1%, highest scholarship from Ministry of Education of China)  2020\nNational Scholarship (top1%, highest scholarship from Ministry of Education of China)  2023\nTop Undergraduate Student Award (highest honor of undergraduates, only 10 winners)  2021\nOutstanding Member of Student Union (top 5%)  2021\nOutstanding Graduate (top 5%)  2024\nProfessional Services\nConference PC/Reviewers\n:\nIEEE International Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV)\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR)\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR)\nProceedings of ACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACM MM)\nChinese Patents\n一种基于立体图建模的事件驱动视频超分辨率方法. 发明专利（专利号：ZL 202210245281.1）\n一种基于事件数据驱动的视频去模糊方法. 发明专利（专利号：ZL 202210124768.4）\nTeaching\nUniversity of Science and Technology of China\n210707.01: Artificial Intelligence Theory\nAutumn 2022 with\nZheng-jun Zha\n,\nZhiwei Xiong\nand\nZilei Wang\nMiscellaneous\nI love body building, running, basketball, swimming, traveling and so much more.\nI am the holder of the university's men's 1000m and 1500m record.\nTest of physical strength\nI became a long-distance runner in our university team since my freshman year and won a lot of championships!\nI am also the founder of our university’s orienteering club and orienteering team!\n1st Place\n, University Race Competition Men's 800m\n2018\n1st Place\n, University Race Competition Men's 1500m\n2018\n1st Place\n, Department Race Competition Men's 800m\n2018\n1st Place\n, Department Race Competition Men's 1500m\n2018\n1st Place\n, University Race Competition Men's 800m\n2019\n1st Place\n, University Race Competition Men's 1500m\n2019\n1st Place\n, University Race Competition Men's 3000m\n2019\n1st Place\n, Department Race Competition Men's 800m\n2019\n1st Place\n, Department Race Competition Men's 1500m\n2019\n1st Place\n, University Race Competition Men's 800m\n2020\n1st Place\n, University Race Competition Men's 1500m\n2020\n1st Place\n, Department Race Competition Men's 800m\n2020\n1st Place\n, Department Race Competition Men's 1500m\n2020\nI am also an extreme sports enthusiast, especially\nParkour\n.\nI am open to engaging in any discussions about life, films, research, and more. Don't hesitate to get in touch!\n© Chengzhi Cao | Last updated: Mar. 2024."
