    "homepage_text": "Xiaolong Ma – The University of Arizona\nSkip to content\nXiaolong Ma – The University of Arizona\nXiaolong Ma – The University of Arizona\nContact information\n:\nECE building, room 559.\nPhone\n: (520) 621-2412\nEmail\n: xiaolongma@arizona.edu\nFaculty website\nXiaolong Ma is an assistant professor in the\nDepartment of Electrical and Computer Engineering\n@\nThe University of Arizona\n. He received his Ph.D. degree in Computer Engineering from Northeastern University (NEU), Boston in 2022, supervised by Professor\nYanzhi Wang\n.\nHis research interests include:\nScalable and efficient AI system\nTrustworthy and privacy-preserving machine learning\nComputer Vision (CV) and Large Language Models (LLMs)\nAlgorithm, optimization\nUseful links:\nGoogle Scholar\n,\nDBLP\nI am always looking for highly-motivated PhDs / masters / interns to work in the area of Efficient AI. If you are interested in joining my group, please send me your CV and transcripts.\nProfessional Experience\n08/2025 – present\n@ The University of Arizona, Tucson, AZ\nAssistant Professor\n08/2022 – 08/2025\n@ Clemson University, Clemson, SC\nAssistant Professor\nNews\n02/2026, [\nPaper\n] One paper accepted in CVPR 2026.\n01/2026, [\nPaper\n] Two papers are accepted in ICLR 2026.\n09/2025, [\nCommittee\n] Xiaolong will serve as AC for CPAL 2026.\n09/2025, [\nPaper\n] Two papers are accepted in NeurIPS 2025.\n09/2025, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted in NeurIPS Workshop on Regulatable ML.\n08/2025, [\nCommittee\n] Xiaolong will serve as SPC for AAAI 2026.\n08/2025, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted in CCS 2025.\n08/2025, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted in EMNLP 2025.\n08/2025, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted in CIKM 2025.\n07/2025, [\nGrant\n] We are awarded $400K for\nAdversarial Robust Wireless Systems\n. Thanks NSF!\n07/2025, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted in ECAI 2025.\n06/2025, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted in Intelligent Systems with Applications.\n06/2025, [\nPaper\n] Two papers are accepted in ICCV 2025.\n06/2025, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted in CFAgentic@ICML’25.\n12/2024, [\nPanel\n] Xiaolong serves as a panelist for the NSF.\n10/2024, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted in IEEE S&P (Oakland).\n09/2024, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted in SenSys 2024.\n07/2024, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted in ECCV 2024.\n06/2024, [\nGrant\n] Xiaolong receives $300K as\nlead PI\nfor\nSustainable Computing\n. Thanks NSF!\n06/2024, [\nGrant\n] We are awarded $640K\nadditional funding\nfor AI-Enabled Drone Swarms. Thanks NASA!\n05/2024, [\nPaper\n] Two papers are accepted in ICML 2024.\n04/2024, [\nGrant\n] Honored to receive Faculty Enhancement Fund from ECE department!\n01/2024, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted in ICLR 2024.\n11/2023, [\nCommittee\n] Xiaolong will serve as TPC member of DAC 2024.\n11/2023, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted in CPAL 2024.\n09/2023, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted in NeurIPS 2023.\n08/2023, [\nGrant\n] We are awarded $900K for\nHarmonious Federated Intelligence\n. Thanks NSF!\n07/2023, [\nGrant\n] We are awarded $600K for AI-Enabled Drone Swarms. Thanks NASA!\n04/2023, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted in IJCAI 2023 (acceptance rate:\n15%\n).\n02/2023, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted with\nspotlight presentation\nat the ICLR SNN workshop.\n02/2023, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted as\nhighlight paper\n(top 2.5%) in CVPR 2023.\n01/2023, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted in ICLR 2023.\n12/2022, [\nPanel\n] Xiaolong serves as a panelist at NSF panel.\n11/2022, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted in AAAI 2023.\n07/2022, [\nPaper\n] Two papers are accepted in ECCV 2022.\n05/2022, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted in ICML 2022.\n04/2022, [\nCommittee\n] Xiaolong serves as committee member of NeurIPS 2022.\n03/2022, [\nPaper\n] one paper is accepted in CVPR 2022.\n03/2022, [\nCommittee\n] Xiaolong serves as committee member of ECCV 2022.\n02/2022, [\nCommittee\n] Xiaolong serves as committee member of ICML 2022.\n01/2022, [\nCommittee\n] Xiaolong serves as committee member of CVPR 2022.\n01/2022, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted in ICLR 2022.\n11/2021, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted in FPGA 2022.\n09/2021, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted with\nSpotlight Presentation\nin NeurIPS 2021.\n09/2021, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted in NeurIPS 2021.\n09/2021, [\nCommittee\n] Xiaolong will serve as program committee member of AAAI 2021.\n06/2021, [\nPaper\n] One paper is in proceeding of the IJCAI 2021 demonstration track.\n05/2021, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted by TPAMI (Impact Factor 17.861).\n05/2021, [\nPaper\n] One paper is accepted by ICML 2021.\n05/2021, [\nPaper\n]\nBest Paper Award\nin the ICLR 2021 workshop of Hardware-Aware Efficient Training of Deep Learning Models.\n04/2021, [\nPaper\n] one paper is accepted as\nContributed Article\nin the Communications of the ACM (CACM)\n...\nMore news\nResearch Sponsors:\nXiaolong Ma - The University of Arizona\nSign up\nLog in\nCopy shortlink\nReport this content\nManage subscriptions\nLoading Comments...\nWrite a Comment...\nEmail (Required)\nName (Required)\nWebsite\n\n---\n\nPeople – Xiaolong Ma – The University of Arizona\nSkip to content\nXiaolong Ma – The University of Arizona\nPeople\nCurrent Ph.D. Students\nGen Li, Research Assistant, 2022-2027 (expected)\nM.S.  Computer Science, University of Delaware\nB.S.  Software Engineering, Wuhan Institute of Technology\nJie Ji, Research Assistant, 2023-2028 (expected)\nM.S.  Applied Mathematics, Northeastern University\nB.S.  Statistics, Tongji University\nHossein Rajoli Nowdeh, Research Assistant, Co-Advised with Dr. Fatemeh Afghah (main adviser)\nKaiyuan Deng, Research Assistant, 2024-2029 (expected)\nB.S. Electrical & Computer Engineering, University of Electronic Science and Technology of China\nShare this:\nShare on X (Opens in new window)\nX\nShare on Facebook (Opens in new window)\nFacebook\nLike\nLoading...\nXiaolong Ma - The University of Arizona\nSi