    "homepage_text": "Kisailus Biomimetics & Nanostructured Materials Lab\nTaifeng Wang\nEmail\nAbout\nTaifeng Wang is a first year Ph.D. student in the department of Material Science and Engineering. He is interested in synthesis and characterization of photocatalyst. Taifeng received a B.S. in Material Science and Engineering from Zhejiang University of Technology, China in 2016.\nResearch\nReserach project"
