    "homepage_text": "Hanxiao’s Homepage\nHanxiao Liu\nMountain View, CA\nREADME    —\n—\nI’m training large models at Microsoft AI, and previously at\nInflection\n.\nPrior to that I was a Staff Research Scientist at\nGoogle Brain\n.\nI also worked at\nDeepMind\nand\nCitadel\n.\nI received my Ph.D. from\nCarnegie Mellon University\nand B.E. from\nTsinghua\nUniversity\n.\nLast compiled on Wednesday 3\nrd\nApril, 2024\nby\nTeX4ht\n.\nCopyright 2024\nHanxiao Liu. All Rights Reserved."
  },
