    "homepage_text": "Yudong Li, Ph.D.\nYudong Li\nResearch Engineer\nNational Renewable Energy Laboratory\nAbout Me\nDr. Yudong Li is a Research Engineering at the National Renewable Energy Laboratory. His research interests includes machine learning, machine vision, high performance computing, and computational modeling of various physical-chemical interactions. He leads a team of engineers to develop and deploy various software solutions to real-world material/chemical processing problems for industry partners.\nDownload CV\nInterests\nArtificial Intelligence\nComputer Vision\nHigh Performance Computing\nEducation\nMS Computer Science\nGeorgia Institute of Technology\nPhd Material Science and Engineering\nthe University of Alabama\nExperience\nResearch Engineer\nNational Renewable Energy Laboratory\nJanuary 2023 –\nPresent\nResponsibilities include:\nWrite grant proposals to secure goverment and industrial funding. Establish close collaborations with industry partners.\nMentor young graduates/interns in research and development.\nLeading a team of software engineers to develop Machine Vision based webapps for image analysis and deploying on internal Kubernetes server.\nLeading the development of Machine learning models to solve chemial engineering problems where physics based model is not available.\nDeveloping high performance computational fluid dynamics codes with stiff ODE/PDE systems for fluid-chemical reaction simulations.\nPostdoctoral Researcher\nNational Renewable Energy Laboratory\nOctober 2019 –\nDecember 2022\nResponsibilities include:\nDeveloped maching learning pipelines with open source software stacks.\nDeveloped various physics based models in C++ to simulation different chemical reaction systems and fluid flow behviors.\nEducation\nMS Computer Science\nGeorgia Institute of Technology\nSeptember 2023 –\nAugust 2025\nPhd Material Science and Engineering\nthe University of Alabama\nAugust 2014 –\nMay 2019\nSkills & Hobbies\nTechnical Skills\nC/C++/Python/Java\nMachine Vision\nMachine Learning\nHobbies\nHiking\nSkiing\nPhotography\nLanguages\n100%\nEnglish\n100%\nChinese"
  },
  "deep_homepage::Yujiao Shi::https://yujiaoshi.github.io/": {
    "homepage": "https://yujiaoshi.github.io/",
    "all_emails": [
