hms.\nWeian Li\nProfile\nweian_li\n2021-2023\nResearch Interests: Mechanism Design, Game Theory, Auction, Operations Research and Optimization\nXiaogang Li\nProfile\nXiaogang_li\nRoom 107, Courtyard No.5, Jingyuan\nResearch Interests: Quantum Simulation, Quantum Algorithm, Quantum Measurement (weak measurement) and PT-Symmetry Theory.\nHaoyu Sun\nProfile\nhaoyusun\nRoom 107, Courtyard No.5, Jingyuan\nResearch Interests: Quantum Computation, Quantum Dynamics and AI for Science, etc.\nBujiao Wu\nProfile\nbujiaowu@gmail.com\n2021-2023\nResearch Interests: Quantum Computing, Quantum Algorithms, and Classical Simulation\nYuan Yao\nProfile\nyuan.yao\nRoom 107, Courtyard No.5, Jingyuan\nResearch Interests: Quantum Information, Quantum Error Correcrion Codes, Quantum Optics and Automated Design of Optical Quantum Circuits\nYumeng Zeng\nProfile\nyumengzeng\nRoom 107, Courtyard No.5, Jingyuan\nResearch Interests: Quantum Computing, Quantum Algorithms, Quantum Dynamics\nTing Zhang\nProfile\ntingtingzhang\nRoom 107, Courtyard No.5, Jingyuan\nResearch Interests: quantum optics, quantum information, and experimental tests of quantum foundations\nXiaoming Zhang\nProfile\nxmzhang93\n2021-2023\nResearch Interests: Quantum Computation, Quantum Control\nQian Zuo\nProfile\nzuoqian\n2022-2024\nResearch Interests: Quantum Computing, Quantum-inspired Cassical Algorithm, Quantum Machine Learning and Randomized Algorithms.\nVisiting Scholars\nComing soon!\n2020-07-07\nStaff\nYunli Yang (Cecca)\nAdministrative Assistant to Directors\n+86 (0)10 6275-7835\nyunli.yang\nRoom 203, Courtyard No.5, Jingyuan\nRui Li\nAdministrative Assistant of Foreign Affairs\n+86 (0)10 6275-7835\nli.rui\nRoom 203, Courtyard No.5, Jingyuan\nShuang Wu (Ada)\nAdministrative Assistant of Economics and Computation\n+86 (0)10 6276-1029\ns.wu\nRoom 207, Courtyard No.5, Jingyuan\nYiliang Liu\nAI Engineer\nquantumliu\nRoom 207, Courtyard No.5, Jingyuan"
