    "homepage_text": "Yin Zhang @ UTCS\nYin Zhang (章寅)\nAssociate Professor\nDepartment of Computer Science\nThe University of Texas at Austin\n2317 Speedway, Stop D9500\nAustin, TX 78712-1757, USA\nOffice: Gates 6.808\nCampus mail: Computer Science D9500\nTel: +1 (512) 232-7496 (\nOffice\n)\nFax: +1 (512) 471-8885\nE-mail:\nyzhang@cs.utexas.edu\nCurriculum Vitae\n(\npdf\n)\n|\nGoogle Scholar\nResearch\n|\nPapers\n|\nTalks\n|\nPatents\n|\nTeaching\n|\nAwards\n|\nServices\n|\nMiscellanea\nWelcome to my home page! I am an Associate Professor in the\nDepartment of Computer Science\nat\nThe University of Texas at Austin\n.\nI received my Ph.D. in\nComputer\nScience\nfrom\nCornell\nUniversity\nin 2001. Between 2001-2004, I was a researcher at\nAT&T Labs-Research\n. Here is\nmy\nCurriculum Vitae\n(\npdf\n).\nResearch\nMy research interests span several areas of\ncomputer networks\n, including\nnetwork management\n,\nnetwork measurement\n,\nnetwork security\n,\nwireless optimization\n,\noverlay routing and multihoming\n,\nand\nnetwork algorithms\n.\nPreviously I also worked on\nWeb performance\n,\ncongestion control\n,\netc.\nPapers\n(or\nby subject\n)\nTalks\nPatents\nGoogle Scholar\nSelected Publications\nViceROI: Catching Click-Spam in Search Ad Networks\n(CCS\n  2013) (Coming soon!)\nMeasuring and\n    Fingerprinting ClickSpam in Online Ad Networks\n(SIGCOMM 2012)\n    (\nPS\n)\n    (\nSlides\n)\nTabulation Based\n    5-independent Hashing with Applications to Linear Probing and\n    Second Moment Estimation\n(SICOMP 2012)\n    (\nPS\n)\nClustered Embedding of\n    Massive Social Networks\n(SIGMETRICS 2012)\n    (\nPS\n)\n    (\nPPT\n)\nSpatio-Temporal Compressive\n    Sensing and Internet Traffic Matrices (Extended Version)\n(ToN\n    2012) (\nPS\n)\nRapid Detection of\n    Maintenance Induced Changes in Service Performance\n(CoNEXT\n    2011) (\nPS\n)\nBest Paper Award\nQ-score: Proactive Service\n    Quality Assessment in a Large IPTV System\n(IMC 2011)\n    (\nPS\n)\nCRMA: Collision-Resistant Multiple Access\n(MobiCom 2011) (\nPS\n)\nModel-driven Optimization of\n    Opportunistic Routing\n(SIGMETRICS 2011)\n    (\nPS\n)\nSecure Friend Discovery in\n    Mobile Social Networks\n(INFOCOM 2011)\n    (\nPS\n)\nEnabling High-Bandwidth\n    Vehicular Content Distribution\n(CoNEXT 2010)\n    (\nPS\n)\nExploiting Temporal\n    Stability and Low-Rank Structure for Localization in Mobile\n    Networks\n(MobiCom 2010) (\nPS\n)\nDetecting the Performance\n    Impact of Upgrades in Large Operational Networks\n(SIGCOMM\n    2010) (\nPS\n)\nR3: Resilient Routing\n    Reconfiguration\n(SIGCOMM 2010) (\nPS\n)\nTabulation Based 5-Universal\n    Hashing and Linear Probing\n(ALENEX 2010) (\nPS\n)\nScalable Proximity Estimation and\n    Link Prediction in Online Social Networks\n(IMC 2009) (\nPS\n)\nSpatio-Temporal Compressive\n    Sensing and Internet Traffic Matrices\n(SIGCOMM 2009) (\nPS\n)\n    (\nSlides\n)\n    (\nPPT\n)\nPlease\nemail me\nif you want to get a copy of my Matlab implementation for SRSVD.\nTowards Automated Performance\n    Diagnosis in a Large IPTV Network\n(SIGCOMM 2009)\n    (\nPS\n)\n    (\nSlides\n)\n    (\nPPT\n)\nTroubleshooting Chronic\n    Conditions in Large IP Networks\n(CoNEXT 2008)\n    (\nPS\n)\n    (\nSlides\n)\n    (\nPPT\n)\nNetwork Imprecision: A New\n    Consistency Metric for Scalable Monitoring\n(OSDI 2008) (\nPS\n)\nPredictable Performance\n    Optimization for Wireless Networks\n(SIGCOMM 2008)\n(\nPS\n)\nA General Model of\n    Wireless Interference\n(MobiCom 2007) (\nPS\n)\nSTAR: Self-Tuning Aggregation\n    for Scalable Monitoring\n(VLDB 2007) (\nPS\n)\ndFence: Transparent\n    Network-based Denial of Service Mitigation\n(NSDI 2007) (\nPS\n) (\nHTML\n) (\nSlides\n) (\nPPT\n)\nCOPE: Traffic Engineering in\n    Dynamic Networks\n(SIGCOMM 2006) (\nPS\n)\n    (\nSlides\n)\n    (\nPPT\n)\nNetQuest: A Flexible\n    Framework for Large-Scale Network Measurement\n(SIGMETRICS\n    2006) (\nPS\n)\njournal version\n(ToN 2009)\n    (\nPS\n)\nNetwork Anomography\n(IMC 2005) (\nPS\n) (\nHTML\n)\n    (\nSlides\n)\n    (\nPPT\n)\nEstimating Point-to-Point and\n    Point-to-Multipoint Traffic Matrices: An Information-Theoretic\n    Approach\n(ToN 2005) (\nPS\n)\nOnline Identification of\n    Hierarchical Heavy Hitters: Algorithms, Evaluation, and\n    Applications\n(IMC 2004) (\nPS\n)\n    (\nSlides\n)\n    (\nPPT\n)\nOptimizing Cost and Performance\n    for Multihoming\n(SIGCOMM 2004) (\nPS\n)\nTabulation Based 4-Universal\n    Hashing with Applications to Second Moment Estimation\n(SODA\n    2004) (\nPS\n)\nSketch-based Change Detection:\n    Methods, Evaluation, and Applications\n(IMC 2003) (\nPS\n)\n    (\nSlides\n)\n    (\nPPT\n)\nAn Information-Theoretic Approach\n    to Traffic Matrix Estimation\n(SIGCOMM 2003) (\nPS\n)\nOn Selfish Routing in\n    Internet-like Environments\n(SIGCOMM 2003) (\nPS\n)\njournal version\n(ToN 2006) (\nPS\n)\n    (\nSlides\n)\n    (\nPPT\n)\nFast Accurate Computation of\n    Large-Scale IP Traffic Matrices from Link Loads\n(SIGMETRICS\n    2003) (\nPS\n)\n    (\nSlides\n)\n    (\nPPT\n).\nACM SIGMETRICS Test of Time Award\nOn the Characteristics and\n    Origins of Internet Flow Rates\n(SIGCOMM 2002) (\nPS\n)\n    (\nSlides\n)\n    (\nPPT\n)\nBGP Routing Stability of Popular\n    Destinations\n(IMW 2002) (\nPS\n)\nOn the Constancy of\n    Internet Path Properties\n(IMW 2001) (\nPS\n)\n    (\nSlides\n)\n    (\nPPT\n)\nOn the Use and Performance of\n    Content Distribution Networks\n(IMW 2001) (\nPS\n)\n    (\nSlides\n)\n    (\nPPT\n)\nDetecting Backdoors\n(USENIX Security 2000) (\nHTML\n) (\nPS\n)\n    (\nSlides\n)\n    (\nPPT\n).\nBest Student Paper Award\nDetecting Stepping\n    Stones\n(USENIX Security 2000) (\nHTML\n) (\nPS\n)\n    (\nSlides\n)\n    (\nPPT\n)\nThe Stationarity of Internet\n    Path Properties: Routing, Loss, and Throughput\n(ACIRI\n    Technical Report) (\nPS\n)\nTeaching\nCS356: Computer Networks [Fall 2007, Spring 2010, Spring 2011]\nCS386M: Communication Networks [Fall 2005, Spring 2007, Spring\n  2008, Fall 2008, Fall 2009, Fall 2010]\nCS378: Advanced Computer Networks [Spring 2009]\nCS378: Network Measurement and Intrusion Detection [Fall 2006]\nCS395T: Advanced Topics in Computer Networks [Spring 2006]\nCS395T: Network Measurement and Inference [Spring 2005]\nNote to graduate program applicants\nAwards\nIEEE Fellow, 2015.  (Citation: for contributions to computer\n  network measurement and management)\nACM SIGMETRICS Test of Time Award, 2013.\nBest Paper Award, ACM CoNEXT Conference, 2011.\nNational Science Foundation Faculty Early Career Award, 2006.\nResearch Excellence Award, AT&T Labs-Research, 2001.\nBest Student Paper Award, USENIX Security Symposium, 2000.\nGold Medal, 33rd International Mathematical Olympiad (IMO), 1992.\nFirst Prize (full mark), Chinese High School Mathematics Competition, 1991.\nProfessional Services\nOrganization Committee Member:\n2012:\n       IEEE ICNP (TPC Co-Chair)\n2009:\nACM ANCS\n(Publicity Chair)\n2008:\nACM SIGCOMM\n(Publicity Chair)\n2005:\nLSNI\n(Organization and TPC Co-chair)\nProgram Committee Member:\n2011:\nACM SIGCOMM\n,\nIEEE INFOCOM\n,\nIEEE ICNP\n,\nCOMSNETS\n,\nITC\n2010:\nACM SIGCOMM\n,\nIEEE INFOCOM\n,\nIEEE ICNP\n,\nPAM\n2009:\nACM SIGCOMM\n,\nACM CoNEXT\n,\nIEEE INFOCOM\n,\nIEEE ICNP\n,\nCOMSNETS\n2008:\nIEEE INFOCOM\n,\nIEEE ICNP\n,\nACM/USENIX IMC\n,\nACM ANCS\n,\nANM\n,\nSecureComm\n2007:\nACM SIGCOMM\n,\nACM ANCS\n,\nACM/USENIX IMC\n,\nMineNet\n,\nINM\n,\nIWQoS\n,\nWWW\n,\nIM\n2006:\nACM SIGCOMM\n,\nACM SIGMETRICS\n,\nIEEE INFOCOM\n,\nIEEE ICDCS\n,\nINM\n2005:\nIEEE INFOCOM\n,\nACM/USENIX IMC\n,\nLSNI\n2004:\nACM SIGCOMM\n,\nIEEE INFOCOM\nMiscellanea\n6 months of Abilene traffic\nmatrices\nthat I collected. See\nreadme.txt\nfor more\ninformation. See also\nthe totem traffic\nmatrix datasets\n.\nLast Modified: $Date: 2014/11/27 06:21:14 $"
