    "homepage_text": "Zhaoyang Zhang's Website\nZhaoyang Zhang\nPh.D. Student in Computer Graphics\nYale University\nAbout Me\nI am Zhaoyang Zhang, a 4th year Ph.D. student at Yale University advised by Prof.\nJulie Dorsey\n. I am affiliated with the\nYale Computer Graphics Group\n. Before joining Yale, I obtained my B.Eng. at University of Chinese Academy of Sciences, with highest honor. My undergrad research was advised by Prof.\nLin Gao\n.\nMy research specializes in generative models for computer graphics, with a focus on developing geometrically consistent methods for digital content creation, spanning 3D scenes, videos, and beyond. I am fortunate to have interned at\nApple\n in 2025 and\nAdobe\n🔺 in 2024.\n✉️\nEmail\n: zhaoyang dot zhang at yale dot edu\nDownload CV\nEducation\nPh.D. in Computer Science\nYale University\nM.Phil. in Computer Science\nYale University\nM.S. in Computer Science\nYale University\nB.Eng. in Computer Science and Technology\nUniversity of Chinese Academy of Sciences\nHigh School\nNanjing Foreign Language School\nInterests\nComputer Graphics\n3D Computer Vision\nScene/Video Generation\nMultimodal Large Language Models (MLLMs)\nPublications\nZhaoyang Zhang\nWork partially done during internship at Adobe Research\n,\nYannick Hold-Geoffroy\n,\nMiloš Hašan\n,\nZiwen Chen\n,\nFujun Luan\n,\nJulie Dorsey\n,\nYiwei Hu\n(2025).\nGenerating 360 Video is What You Need For a 3D Scene\n.\nIn\nSIGGRAPGH Asia 2025\n.\nPDF\nProject\nCite\nDOI\nMengqi (Mandy) Xia\n,\nZhaoyang Zhang\n,\nSumit Chaturvedi\n,\nYutong Yi\n,\nRundong Wu\n,\nHolly Rushmeier\n,\nJulie Dorsey\n(2025).\nPredicting Fabric Appearance Through Thread Scattering and Inversion\n.\nIn\nSIGGRAPH 2025\n.\nPDF\nProject\nCite\nDOI\nVadim Ezhov\nEqual contribution\n,\nHyoungseob Park\nEqual contribution\n,\nZhaoyang Zhang\nEqual contribution\n,\nRishi Upadhyay\n,\nHoward Zhang\n,\nChethan Chinder Chandrappa\n,\nAchuta Kadambi\n,\nYunhao Ba\n,\nJulie Dorsey\n,\nAlex Wong\n(2024).\nAll-day Depth Completion\n.\nIn\nIROS 2024\n.\nPDF\nCite\nZhaoyang Zhang\n,\nJunliang Chen\n,\nHongbo Fu\n,\nJianjun Zhao\n,\nShu-Yu Chen\n,\nLin Gao\n(2024).\nText2Face: Text-Based Face Generation With Geometry and Appearance Control\n.\nIn\nTVCG\n.\nPDF\nVideo\nCite\nDOI\nExperience\nResearch Intern\nApple \nMay 2025 –\nAugust 2025\nResearch Intern\nAdobe🔺\nMay 2024 –\nMay 2025\nEducation\nPh.D. in Computer Science\nYale University\nJuly 2022 –\nAugust 2028\nM.Phil. in Computer Science\nYale University\nJuly 2022 –\nAugust 2025\nM.S. in Computer Science\nYale University\nJuly 2022 –\nAugust 2024\nB.Eng. in Computer Science and Technology\nUniversity of Chinese Academy of Sciences\nAugust 2018 –\nJune 2022\nHigh School\nNanjing Foreign Language School\nSeptember 2012 –\nJune 2018"
  },
