    "homepage_text": "æ¸åå¤§å­¦ Xuefei Ning--Home--Home\nCN\nXuefei Ning\nAssistant researcher\nE-Mail:\na2826da3bbbb356729fc7c4bd7ed5465163d940485944e88671d7e756efb10a133d9ef7c6c94b3f3628490ea9d8c6747cc401bdaa6aa0f2f2659d36e364555d2d3619b407726a29b143ab429de78f34c596e876d8bd1e8156ce42452ecf02afd22c077c9de3c72ededa4f537ece59ed25f8781092a8c8c9f68102f3f49f0ecbb\nEducation Level:\nWith Certificate of Graduation for Doctorate Study\nDegree:\nDoctoral degree\nProfessional Title:\nAssistant researcher\nStatus:\nEmployed\nAlma Mater:\næ¸åå¤§å­¦\nProfile\nXuefei Ning\nResearch-Track Assistant Professor\nShe got Ph.D. from the Dept. of Electronic Engineering in Tsinghua University in 2021. Her main research focus is deep learning methods.\nHomepage:\nhttps://nics-effalg.com/\nEducation Background\n2016.9\n                -> 2021.10\nDoctoral Degree in Engineering\nElectronic Science and Techonology\n  Tsinghua University\n2012.9\n                -> 2016.6\nBachelor's Degree in Engineering\nElectronic Science and Techonology\n  Tsinghua University\nPositions & Employments\n2024.3 ->Now\nï¼Electronic Engineeringï¼    Tsinghua University\nResearch Focus\nEfficient Deep Learning\nCourses\nno content\nResearch Group\nNICS-EFC EffAlg\nAll rights reserved. Department of electronic engineering, Tsinghua University Address: Tsinghua University, Haidian District, Beijing, 100084\nClick:\nTimes\nOpen time:\n.\n.\nThe Last Update Time:\n.\n."
