    "homepage_text": "Yu Li - Home\nYu Li (李昱)\nPrincipal Researcher\nInternational Digital Economy Academy (IDEA)\nGuangdong-HongKong-Macau Greater Bay Area\nShenzhen, China\nI am currently a Principal Researcher at IDEA, where I lead two research groups: one focusing on AI-Generated Content and the other exploring\n                    AI for Science. I am passionate about building AI systems for content generation and scientific discovery.\nProfessional Services\n(Lead) Area Chair\nCVPR 2023-2026, ECCV 2024\nNeurIPS 2023-2025, ICML 2025-2026, ICLR 2025\nAdjunct Faculty\nAdjunct Professor at SCUT\nAdjunct Associate Professor at CUHK(SZ)\nProgram Chair / Organizer\n1-4th PBDL Workshop (in conjunction with ICCV'17-21, CVPR'24)\nGuest Editor\nIJCV Special Issue on Physics Based Vision meets Deep Learning\nRecent News\n2025.11\nLooking for self-motivated interns! Check\nRecruit\npage.\n2025.11\nWe have anounced\nMozi\n: AI-Driven Drug Discovery Engine.\n2025.11\nWe have anounced\nLuban\n: AI Audio & Video Editing and Generation Platform.\n2025.09\nTwo papers accepted to\nNeurIPS 2025\n.\n2025.07\nTwo papers accepted to\nICCV 2025\n.\nSelected Publications\nComputer Vision\nAI for Science\nDiffSHEG: A Diffusion-Based Approach for Real-Time Speech-driven Holistic 3D Expression\n                            and Gesture Generation\nJunming Chen, Yunfei Liu, Jianan Wang, Ailing Zeng,\nYu Li\n, Qifeng Chen\nCVPR 2024\nWebsite\nDWPose: Effective Whole-body Pose Estimation with Two-stages Distillation\nZhendong Yang, Ailing Zeng, Chun Yuan,\nYu Li\nICCV 2023, CV4Metaverse Workshop\nCode\nOSX: One-Stage 3D Whole-Body Mesh Recovery with Component Aware Transformer\nJing Lin, Ailing Zeng, Haoqian Wang, Lei Zhang,\nYu Li\nCVPR 2023\nTop 1 on AGORA\nProject\nCT^2: Colorization Transformer via Color Tokens\nShuchen Weng, Jimeng Sun,\nYu Li\n, Si Li, Boxin Shi\nECCV 2022\nOral\nCode\nPDF\nHybrid Warping Fusion for Video Frame Interpolation\nYu Li*\n, Ye Zhu*, Ruoteng Li, Xintao Wang, Yue Luo, Ying Shan\nIJCV 2022\nLink\nTeViT: Temporally Efficient Vision Transformer for Video Instance Segmentation\nShusheng Yang, Xinggang Wang,\nYu Li\n, Yuxin Fang, Jiemin Fang, Wenyu Liu, Xun Zhao, Ying\n                            Shan\nCVPR 2022\nOral\nCode\nPDF\nQueryInst: Instances as Queries\nYuxin Fang*, Shusheng Yang*, Xinggang Wang,\nYu Li\n, Chen Fang, Ying Shan, Bin Feng, Wenyu\n                            Liu\nICCV 2021\nCode\nPDF\nDemo\nGFP-GAN: Towards Real-World Blind Face Restoration with Generative Facial Prior\nXintao Wang,\nYu Li\n, Honglun Zhang, Ying Shan\nCVPR 2021\nCode\nPDF\nWebsite\nLearning Temporal Consistency for Low Light Video Enhancement from Single Images\nFan Zhang,\nYu Li\n, Shaodi You, Ying Fu\nCVPR 2021\nCode\nPDF\nFast Video Object Segmentation using the Global Context Module\nYu Li\n*, Zhuoran Shen*, Ying Shan\nECCV 2020\nPDF\nUnsupervised Learning for Intrinsic Image Decomposition from a Single Image\nYunfei Liu,\nYu Li\n, Shaodi You, Feng Lu\nCVPR 2020\nPDF\nMutually Guided Image Filtering\nXiaojie Guo,\nYu Li\n, Jiayi Ma, Haibin Ling\nACM MM 2017 & T-PAMI 2018\nLink\nLIME: Low-light Image Enhancement via Illumination Map Estimation\nXiaojie Guo,\nYu Li\n, Haibin Ling\nT-IP 2016\nLink\nPatchMatch Filter: Edge-Aware Filtering Meets Randomized Search for Correspondence Field\n                            Estimation\nJiangbo Lu,\nYu Li\n, Hongsheng Yang, Dongbo Min, Weiyong Eng, Minh N. Do\nT-PAMI 2016\nLink\nFast Guided Global Interpolation for Depth and Motion\nYu Li\n, Dongbo Min, Minh N. Do, Jiangbo Lu\nECCV 2016\nSpotlight\nProject\nSPM-BP: Sped-up PatchMatch Belief Propagation for Continuous MRFs\nYu Li\n, Dongbo Min, Michael S. Brown, Minh N. Do, Jiangbo Lu\nICCV 2015\nOral\nProject\nSingle Image Layer Separation using Relative Smoothness\nYu Li\n, Michael S. Brown\nCVPR 2014\nOral\nPDF\nCode\nHierarchical affinity landscape navigation through learning a shared pocket-ligand space\nBin Feng, Zijing Liu, Hao Li, Mingjun 