    "homepage_text": "Haoyu Guo | Lab of Atomic of Solid State Physics (LASSP)\nSkip to main content\nSearch:\nSubmit search\nSearch filters\nSearch\nThis site\nSearch\nCornell\nLaboratory of\nAtomic and Solid State Physics\nMain Menu\nToggle Search Form\nHaoyu Guo\nKIC Postdoctoral Fellow (2023-pres)\nPronouns: he/him\nResearch\nI study Condensed Matter Theory. I am a member of\nChao-Ming Jian\n's research group.\nEducational Background\nPh.D. in Physics, Harvard University, 2023\nB.Sc. in Physics & Mathematics, Massachusetts Institute of Technology, 2018\nContact\nhg488@cornell.edu\nKavli Instite Profile\nSocial media links forHaoyu Guo\nLinkedIn\n615 Clark Hall\nLASSP Associations\nResearch Areas\nKavli Institute at Cornell for Nanoscale Science\nTheoretical Condensed Matter Physics\nLab Groups\nChao-Ming Jian Group"
