    "homepage_text": "Baochang Zhang\n      -  Beihang University\nBeihang University Home\nEnglish\n中文\nSearch content at Beihang University\nView Scopus Profile\nBaochang Zhang\nSchool of Artificial Intelligence(Institute of Artificial Intelligence)\nh-index\n12568\nCitations\n55\nh-index\nCalculated based on number of publications stored in Pure and citations from Scopus\n1999                 …\n2026\nResearch activity per year\nPersonal profile\nExpertise related to UN Sustainable Development Goals\nIn 2015, UN member states agreed to 17 global\nSustainable Development Goals (SDGs)\nto end poverty, protect the planet and ensure prosperity for all. This person’s work contributes towards the following SDG(s):\nSDG 3\nGood Health and Well-being\nSDG 7\nAffordable and Clean Energy\nSDG 15\nLife on Land\nFingerprint\nDive into the research topics where Baochang Zhang is active. These topic labels come from the works of this person. Together they form a unique fingerprint.\n12\nSimilar Profiles\nConvolutional Neural Network\nComputer Science\n100%\nExperimental Result\nComputer Science\n47%\nDeep Learning Method\nComputer Science\n42%\nObject Detection\nComputer Science\n39%\nUnmanned Aerial Vehicle\nComputer Science\n38%\nNeural Network\nComputer Science\n35%\nNeural Architecture Search\nComputer Science\n32%\nConvolutional Network\nComputer Science\n31%\nView full fingerprint\nCollaborations and top research areas from the last five years\nRecent external collaboration on country/territory level. Dive into details by clicking on the dots or\nSelect a country/territory from the list\nDive into details\nSelect a country/territory to view shared publications and projects\nClose\nSelect a country/territory from the list\nExplore network further\nResearch output\n175\nConference contribution\n167\nArticle\n16\nConference article\n6\nPaper\n13\nMore\n5\nReview article\n3\nChapter\n3\nEditorial\n2\nBook\nNoise-Robust tiny object localization with flows\nSun, H., Yang, L., Chen, R., Gu, K.,\nZhang, B.\n, Yao, A. &\nCao, X.\n,\nJul 2026\n,\nIn:\nPattern Recognition.\n175\n, 113041.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nAnnotation\n100%\nArtificial Intelligence\n100%\nObject Detection\n100%\nGuided Optimization\n100%\nPerformance Gap\n100%\n3D Reconstruction based on multi-view stereo in the deep learning era: a survey and comparison of methods\nSong, B., Wu, B.,\nXiao, J.\n,\nHu, X.\n, Shi, J. &\nZhang, B.\n,\nDec 2025\n,\nIn:\nVisual Computer.\n41\n,\n15\n,\np. 12765-12810\n46 p.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nReview article\n›\npeer-review\n3d Reconstruction\n100%\nDeep Learning Method\n100%\nMobile Application\n33%\nFeature Extraction\n33%\nDrone\n33%\n1\nLink opens in a new tab\nScopus \n citations\nA Multi-Stage Progressive Network for Hyperspectral Image Demosaicing and Denoising\nXiong, Z., Li, W., Wang, H.,\nZhang, B.\n& Fowler, J. E.,\n2025\n,\nIn:\nIEEE Transactions on Computational Imaging.\n11\n,\np. 1-10\n10 p.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nDemosaicing\n100%\nExtensive Collection\n14%\nRecent Literature\n14%\n4\nLink opens in a new tab\nScopus \n citations\nAsymptotic Unbiased Sample Sampling to Speed Up Sharpness-Aware Minimization\nDeng, J., Pang, J.,\nZhang, B.\n& Guo, G.,\n11 Apr 2025\n,\nIn:\nProceedings of the AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence.\n39\n,\n15\n,\np. 16208-16216\n9 p.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nConference article\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nSpeed-up\n100%\nPose Estimation\n100%\nAsymptotics\n100%\nComputational Cost\n50%\nComputational Efficiency\n50%\nCalibrated gradient descent of convolutional neural networks for embodied visual recognition\nWang, Z., Xu, S., Zhuo, L.,\nZhang, B.\n, Li, Y., Wang, Z. & Guo, G.,\nJul 2025\n,\nIn:\nImage and Vision Computing.\n160\n, 105568.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nUnbiased Estimator\n100%\nVie