    "homepage_text": "Yushi Bai\nYushi Bai 白雨石\nI am a Fourth-year Ph.D. student at Tsinghua University, advised by Prof.\nJuanzi Li\n. I reveived my B.E. in\nYao class\nfrom Tsinghua University in 2022. I have been very fortunate to work with Prof.\nJie Tang\n, Prof.\nZhiyuan Liu\n, Prof.\nJure Leskovec\n, and Prof.\nAriel Procaccia\n.\nEmail\n/\nGoogle Scholar\n/\nGithub\n/\nNews\n/\nSelected Publications\n/\nExperience\n/\nHonors & Awards\nNews\n[2026.02]\nGLM-5 is released! Checkout the technical report\nhere\n. I am one of the core contributors, responsible for the new model arch (DSA), improvements, and RL adaptation.\n[2026.01]\nAwarded the first\nTencent Project Up Scholarship\n(15 recipients in total).\n[2026.01]\nLongWriter-Zero\naccepted to ICLR 2026 as Oral presentation!\n[2025.09]\nTwo papers accepted to NeurIPS 2025, including one Spotlight!\n[2025.05]\nThree papers including LongBench v2 accepted to ACL 2025! See you in Vienna!\nSelected Publications\nMy research interests primarily lie in large language models (LLMs), covering long-context LLM, LLM evaluation and safety, and multimodality. Recently, I have been focusing on designing more efficient and comprehensive LLM architectures that push beyond traditional architectures, particularly in long-context and agentic scenarios. Below are some of my lead works (see my\nGoogle Scholar\nfor a complete list).\nLong-Context LLM\n(6)\nLLM Evaluation & Safety\n(5)\nMultimodal\n(5)\nKnowledge Graph Reasoning\n(3)\nFair Division\n(2)\nLong-Context LLM\nLongWriter-Zero: Mastering Ultra-Long Text Generation via Reinforcement Learning\nYuhao Wu*,\nYushi Bai*\n,\n                      Zhiqiang Hu, Roy Ka-Wei Lee, Juanzi Li\nICLR 2026\n[\npaper\n]\n                      [\ncode\n]\nOral presentation (Top 5%)\nLongBench v2: Towards Deeper Understanding and Reasoning on Realistic Long-context Multitasks\nYushi Bai*\n,\n                      Shangqing Tu*, Jiajie Zhang, Hao Peng, Xiaozhi Wang, Xin Lv, Shulin Cao, Jiazheng Xu, Lei Hou, Yuxiao Dong, Jie Tang, Juanzi Li\nACL 2025\n[\npaper\n]\n                      [\nwebsite\n]\n                      [\ncode\n]\nTop-15 Influential paper at ACL 25\nLongWriter: Unleashing 10,000+ Word Generation from Long Context LLMs\nYushi Bai\n,\n                      Jiajie Zhang, Xin Lv, Linzhi Zheng, Siqi Zhu, Lei Hou, Yuxiao Dong, Jie Tang, Juanzi Li\nICLR 2025\n[\npaper\n]\n                      [\ncode\n]\nLongCite: Enabling LLMs to Generate Fine-grained Citations in Long-context QA\nJiajie Zhang,\nYushi Bai\n, Xin Lv, Wanjun Gu, Danqing Liu, Minhao Zou, Shulin Cao, Lei Hou, Yuxiao Dong, Ling Feng, Juanzi Li\nEMNLP 2025\n[\npaper\n]\n                      [\ncode\n]\nLongAlign: A Recipe for Long Context Alignment of Large Language Models\nYushi Bai\n,\n                      Xin Lv, Jiajie Zhang, Yuze He, Ji Qi, Lei Hou, Jie Tang, Yuxiao Dong, Juanzi Li\nEMNLP 2024\n[\npaper\n]\n                      [\ncode\n]\nLongBench: A Bilingual, Multitask Benchmark for Long Context Understanding\nYushi Bai\n,\n                      Xin Lv, Jiajie Zhang, Hongchang Lyu, Jiankai Tang, Zhidian Huang, Zhengxiao Du, Xiao Liu, Aohan Zeng, Lei Hou, Yuxiao Dong, Jie Tang, Juanzi Li\nACL 2024\n[\npaper\n]\n                      [\ncode\n]\nTop-2 Influential paper at ACL 24\nLLM Evaluation & Safety\nAutomating dataset updates towards reliable and timely evaluation of large language models\nJiahao Ying*, Yixin Cao*,\nYushi Bai\n, Qianru Sun, Bo Wang, Wei Tang, Zhaojun Ding, Yizhe Yang, Xuanjing Huang, Shuicheng Yan\nNeurIPS 2024\n[\npaper\n]\n                      [\nwebsite\n]\nPrivacyMind: Large Language Models Can Be Contextual Privacy Protection Learners\nYijia Xiao, Yiqiao Jin,\nYushi Bai\n, Yue Wu, Xianjun Yang, Xiao Luo, Wenchao Yu, Xujiang Zhao, Yanchi Liu, Quanquan Gu, Haifeng Chen, Wei Wang, Wei Cheng\nEMNLP 2024\n[\npaper\n]\n                      [\ncode\n]\nWaterBench: Towards Holistic Evaluation of Watermarks for Large Language Models\nShangqing Tu*, Yuliang Sun*,\nYushi Bai\n, Jifan Yu, Lei Hou, Juanzi Li\nACL 2024\n[\npaper\n]\n                      [\ncode\n]\nKoLA: Carefully Benchmarking World Knowledge of Large Language Models\nJifan Yu*, Xiaozhi Wang*, Shangqing Tu*, ...\nYushi Bai\n, ...\n                      Bin Xu, Jie Tang, Juanzi Li\nICLR 2024\n[\npaper\n]\n                      [\nwebsite\n]\nBenchmarking Foundation Models with Language-Model-as-an-Examiner\nYushi Bai*\n,\n                      Jiahao Ying*, Yixin Cao, Xin Lv, Yuze He, Xiaozhi Wang, Jifan Yu, Kaisheng Zeng, Yijia Xiao, Haozhe Lyu, Jiayin Zhang, Juanzi Li, Lei Hou\nNeurIPS 2023\n[\npaper\n]\n                      [\nwebsite\n]\nMultimodal\nMMGeoLM: Hard Negative Contrastive Learning for Fine-Grained Geometric Understanding in Large Multimodal Models\nKai Sun*,\nYushi Bai*\n, Zhen Yang, Jiajie Zhang, Ji Qi, Lei Hou, Juanzi Li\narxiv\n[\npaper\n]\n                      [\ncode\n]\nQuicksviewer: An LMM for Efficient Video Understanding via Reinforced Compression of Video Cubes\nJi Qi, Yuan Yao,\nYushi Bai\n, Bin Xu, Juanzi Li, Zhiyuan Liu, Tat-Seng Chua\narxiv\n[\npaper\n]\n                      [\nwebsite\n]\nT^3Bench: Benchmarking Current Progress in Text-to-3D Generation\nYuze He*,\nYushi Bai*\n, Matthieu Lin, Wang Zhao, Yubin Hu, Jenny Sheng, Ran Yi, Juanzi Li, Yong-Jin Liu\narxiv\n[\npaper\n]\n                      [\nwebsite\n]\nCogCoM: A Visual Language Model with Chain-of-Manipulations Reasoning\nJi Qi, Ming Ding, Weihan Wang,\nYushi Bai\n, Qingsong Lv, Wenyi Hong, Bin Xu, Lei Hou, Juanzi Li, Yuxiao Dong, Jie Tang\nICLR 2025\n[\npaper\n]\n                      [\ncode\n]\nMM-MATH: Advancing Multimodal Math Evaluation with Process Evaluation and Fine-grained Classification\nKai Sun*,\nYushi Bai*\n, Ji Qi, Lei Hou, Juanzi Li\nEMNLP 2024\n[\npaper\n]\n                      [\ncode\n]\nKnowledge Graph Reasoning\nAnswering Complex Logical Queries on Knowledge Graphs via Query Computation Tree Optimization\nYushi Bai\n,\n                      Xin Lv, Juanzi Li, Lei Hou\nICML 2023\n[\npaper\n]\n                      [\ncode\n]\nSQUIRE: A Sequence-to-sequence Framework for Multi-hop Knowledge Graph Reasoning\nYushi Bai\n,\n                      Xin Lv, Juanzi Li, Lei Hou, Yincen Qu, Zelin Dai, Feiyu Xiong\nEMNLP 2022 (Oral)\n[\npaper\n]\n                      [\ncode\n]\nModeling heterogeneous hierarchies with relation-specific hyperbolic cones\nYushi Bai*\n,\n                      Rex Ying*, Hongyu Ren, Jure Leskovec\nNeurIPS 2021\n[\npaper\n]\n                      [\ncode\n]\nFair Division\nEnvy-free and pareto-optimal allocations for agents with asymmetric random valuations\nYushi Bai\n,\n                      Paul Gölz\nIJCAI 2022\n[\npaper\n]\nFair allocations for smoothed utilities\nYushi Bai\n,\n                      Uriel Feige, Paul Gölz, Ariel Procaccia\nACM EC 2022\n[\npaper\n]\nExperience\nTsinghua University\n2022.08 - Present\nPh.D student in Computer Science and Technology\nAdvisor: Prof.\nJuanzi Li\nHarvard University\n2021.02-2021.09\nVisiting Research Student\nAdvisor: Prof.\nAriel Procaccia\nStanford University\n2020.06-2020.10\nVisiting Research Student\nAdvisor: Prof.\nJure Leskovec\nTsinghua University\n2018.08 - 2022.07\nB.Eng. in Yao Class\nHonors & Awards\nNational Scholarship, 2024\nOutstanding Undergraduate in Beijing, 2022\nYao Award, 2021\nTsinghua Comprehensive Excellence Scholarship, 2019, 2020, 2021, 2023\nTemplate adapted from\nJon Barron\n."
