    "homepage_text": "Junjie Li | South Dakota State University\nSkip to main content\nWeather Alert\nSDSU Weather Alert\nA severe weather report indicates potential impact to South Dakota State University. The campus is closed from Saturday at 9 p.m. until 7 a.m. Monday. Normal business operations on Monday. Essential personnel only when closed.\nAdditional information and updates can be found at\nUniversity Status\n.\nSearch\nFilter by Topic\nBlog\nEvent\nNews\nProfile\nProgram\nClose Search Box\nJunjie Li\nPostdoctoral\nEmail\n605-688-4511\nMailing Address:\nWecota Hall 219\nGeography & Geospatial Sciences-Box 0506\nUniversity Station\nBrookings, SD 57007\nOffice Location:\nWecota Hall\nRoom \n            219\nView Location\nBack to Directory\nAssociated Areas\nGeospatial Sciences Center of Excellence\nVisit Us\nCome Meet Your Future\nMeet the people that will help shape your future and define your college experience! Learn more about your academic interests with some of our world-class faculty.\nApply Today\nPlan Your Visit\nRequest Info\nSearch\nFilter by Topic\nBlog\nEvent\nNews\nProfile\nProgram\nSearch\nApply Today"
