    "homepage_text": "Zhengchao's personal website\nZhengchao Wan\nAbout me\nWelcome to my personal website. I'm an assistant professor in the\nDepartment of Mathematics\nat the University of Missouri.\nBefore joining Mizzou, I was an\nEnCORE\nPostdoc Fellow at the\nHalιcιoğlu Data Science Institute,\nUniversity of California San Diego\n, working with\nGal Mishne\nand\nYusu Wang\n.\nI obtained my PhD in Mathematics from\nthe Ohio State University\nunder the supervision of\nFacundo Mémoli\n. I earned my Bachelor's degree in Mathematics at\nPeking University\nin 2016.\nHere is my current\nCV\n.\nNews & Events\nNovember 22–24, 2025:\nHosting a TDA Conference @ University of Missouri soon.\nDetails\n.\nNSF Award:\nReceived NSF grant\nDMS 2502083\nfrom the\nMathematical Foundations of Artificial Intelligence (MFAI)\nprogram.\nContacts\nEmail:\nzwan[at]missouri.edu.\nAddress:\nOffice 308, Mathematical Sciences Bldg, 810 Rollins St, Columbia, MO 65201"
  },
