    "homepage_text": "YAN, Da -- Home Page\nHome\nResearch Interests\nPublications\nTeaching\nYAN, Da\n[\nDBLP\n] [\nGoogle Scholar\n] [\nCV\n]\n[\nResearchGate\n] [\nYouTube Channel\n]\nAssociate Professor\nLuddy Hall, Room 3032\nDepartment of Computer Science\nLuddy School of\nInformatics, Computing, and Engineering\nIndiana University Bloomington\nEmail: yanda@iu.edu\nBiography\nI am an Associate Professor in the\nDepartment of Computer Sciences\nof the\nLuddy School of\nInformatics, Computing, and Engineering (SICE)\nat\nIndiana University Bloomington\n. I received my Ph.D. degree in Computer Science from\nthe Hong Kong University of Science and Technology\nin 2014, and I received my B.S. degree in Computer Science from\nFudan University\nin Shanghai in 2009. I am a\nDOE Early Career Research Program (ECRP)\nawardee in 2023, and the sole winner of the  Hong Kong 2015 Young Scientist Award in Physical/Mathematical Science. My research interests include parallel and distributed systems for big data analytics, data management, data mining and machine learning. See\nhere\nfor more information about my research\nI am currently looking for Ph.D. students interested in research on big data systems, data mining and machine learning.\nThe students will be\nfully funded\n. Please feel free to contact me, and please include your\nCV\nand\ntranscripts\nfor all degrees.\nStudent Recruitment Video:\nYouTube\n,\nBilibili\nStudents\n•  Akhlaque Ahmad [Assistant Scientist, 2024-now]\n•\nGuimu Guo\n[PhD, 2017-2022], Alabama EPSCoR Graduate Research Scholar Program (GRSP) Awardee; First Employment: Assistant Professor at Rowan University\n•\nJalal Khalil\n[PhD, 2019-2023]; First Employment: Assistant Professor at St. Cloud State University\n•  Mirza Tanzim Sami [PhD, 2020-2023], Alabama EPSCoR Graduate Research Scholar Program (GRSP) Awardee; First Employment: Deka Research & Development\n•  Abdullateef Almudaifer [PhD, 2020-2024]; First Employment: Assistant Professor at Taibah University\n•  Saugat Adhikari [PhD, 2021-now], UAB Blazer Fellowship Awardee\n•  Lyuheng Yuan [PhD, 2021-now], UAB Blazer Fellowship Awardee\n•  Naman Nimbale [PhD, 2024-now]\n•  Bhadhan Joy [MSDS, 2020-2023]\n•  Md Mashiur Rahman Chowdhury [MSCS, 2017-2019], UAB Blazer Fellowship Awardee\n•  Wenwen Qu [Summer Intern in 2019, from ECNU]\n•  Tianyi Miao [Summer Intern in 2018, from Indian Springs School, now at UPenn]\n•  Weida Tan [MSCS, RA in 2016-2017, now at Fledging (Founder)]\nAwards and Grants\n•  HPDC 2025 Best Paper Award\n•  SIGMOD 2025 Distinguished Reviewer Award\n•  SIGSPATIAL 2025 Best Demo Runner-Up Award\n•  IEEE PacificVis 2025 Honorable Mention\n•  2024-2025 Luddy Faculty Fellow Award ($25,000)\n•  ICDE 2024 Best Demo Runner-Up Award\n•  DOE Early Career Research Program (ECRP) Award in 2023\n•\nNSF CRII Award #1755464\n•\nNSF RII Track-4 Award #2229394\n•\nHong Kong 2015 Young Scientist Award in Physical/Mathematical Science\n(Sole Winner)\n•\nNSF OAC-Core Award #2106461\n, PI [\nnews\n]\n•\nAlabama Research and Development Enhancement Fund (ARDEF) 2020 Round (to Improve Alabamaâs Mobility Planning)\n, PI [\nnews\n]\n•  Winner of the Radiance Technologies Innovation Bowl ($25,000) [\nnews\n]\n•  South Big Data Hubâs S.E.E.D.S Program, Small SEEDs Award ($10,000), in 2022\n•\nNSF SaTC EDU Award #1723250\n, Co-PI\n•  Senior Member of ACM\n•  Senior Member of IEEE\n•\nSouth BD Hub Azure for Research Award\n•  Kevin and Joann Reilly Faculty Award (2020@UAB)\n•  Google Cloud COVID-19 Research Credit (2020)\n•\nICDE 2013 Student Travel Award\n•\nDASFAA 2011 Best Paper Award\n•  SCSK Corporation Scholarship\n•  Fudan Excellent Graduate\n•  Fudan Excellent Student\nSelected Conference Review\n•  SIGMOD 2019, 2020, 2021, 2024, 2025\n•  VLDB 2018 Research Track, VLDB 2021 Demonstration Track\n•  KDD 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024, 2025\n•  CVPR 2024, 2025, 2026\n•  ICCV 2025\n•  ICML 2024\n•  NeurIPS 2023, 2024, 2025\n•  ICDE 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2025, 2026\n•  ACL Rolling Review (ARR) 2024, 2025\n•  ICLR 2024, 2025\n•  AAAI 2021, 2023, 2024, 2025, 2026\n•  IJCAI 2017, 2021 (SPC), 2022, 2023, 2024, 2025 (SPC)\n•  SIGSPATIAL 2025 (Publicity Chair)\n•  SIGIR 2023, 2024\n•  IPDPS 2024\n•  SSTD 2021 (\nWebmaster\n), 2023, 2025\n•  DASFAA 2026 (Senior PC)\n•  International Workshop on Data Mining in Bioinformatics (BIOKDD)\n2018\n,\n2019\n,\n2020\n[\nvideo\n],\n2021\n,\n2022\n,\n2023\n,\n2024\nwith SIGKDD, Leading Program Co-Chair\n•  International Workshop on Data Management Opportunities in Bringing LLMs with Graph Data (LLM+Graph)\n2025\nwith VLDB, Program Co-Chair\n•  SDM 2022\n•  CIKM 2021, 2022\n•  PAKDD 2020, 2021, 2022 (Applied Research Track), 2026 (Senior PC)\n•  IEEE BigData 2021\n•  Workshop on Data Mining in Biomedical Informatics and Healthcare (DMBIH) 2019 (Co-Organizer), 2020 with ICDM\n•  ICPP 2018, 2022\nSelected Journal Review\n•  ACM Transactions on Database Systems (TODS)\n•  The VLDB Journal\n•  IEEE Transactions on Parallel and Distributed Systems (TPDS)\n•  IEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering (TKDE)\n•  ACM Computing Surveys (CSUR)\n•  IEEE/ACM Transactions on Computational Biology and Bioinformatics (TCBB), Guest Editor for BIOKDD SI (since 2018)\n•  BMC Bioinformatics, Guest Editor for MCBIOS 2019 SI\nIndustrial Collaborations\nMiscellaneous: [\nInvited Talks\n], [\nBlogs\n]"
