& Chen, Q.,\nJul 2024\n,\nSIGGRAPH '24: ACM SIGGRAPH 2024 Conference Papers.\nAssociation for Computing Machinery\n, 16. (Proceedings - SIGGRAPH Conference Papers).\nResearch output\n:\nChapters, Conference Papers, Creative and Literary Works\n›\nRGC 32 - Refereed conference paper (with host publication)\n›\npeer-review\nExperimental Result\n100%\nHuman Language\n100%\n8\nLink opens in a new tab\nCitations\n(Scopus)\nDeFLOCNet: Deep Image Editing via Flexible Low-level Controls\nLiu, H.,\nWan, Z.\n, Huang, W.,\nSong, Y.\n, Han, X.,\nLiao, J.\n, Jiang, B. & Liu, W.,\n2021\n,\nProceedings\n- 2021 IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition:\nCVPR 2021\n.\nIEEE\n,\np. 10760-10769\n10 p.\n(Proceedings of the IEEE Computer Society Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition).\nResearch output\n:\nChapters, Conference Papers, Creative and Literary Works\n›\nRGC 32 - Refereed conference paper (with host publication)\n›\npeer-review\nConvolutional Neural Network\n100%\nImage Editing\n100%\nVisual Content\n33%\nFeature Space\n33%\nContent Creation\n33%\n37\nLink opens in a new tab\nCitations\n(Scopus)\nPD-GAN: Probabilistic Diverse GAN for Image Inpainting\nLiu, H.,\nWan, Z.\n, Huang, W.,\nSong, Y.\n, Han, X. &\nLiao, J.\n,\n2021\n,\nProceedings\n- 2021 IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition:\nCVPR 2021\n.\nIEEE\n,\np. 9367-9376\n10 p.\n(Proceedings of the IEEE Computer Society Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition).\nResearch output\n:\nChapters, Conference Papers, Creative and Literary Works\n›\nRGC 32 - Refereed conference paper (with host publication)\n›\npeer-review\nRestored Image\n100%\nImage Inpainting\n100%\nRandom Noise\n100%\nProbability Theory\n66%\nImage Restoration\n50%\n247\nLink opens in a new tab\nCitations\n(Scopus)\nDeformable Object Tracking With Gated Fusion\nLiu, W.,\nSong, Y.\n, Chen, D., He, S., Yu, Y., Yan, T.,\nHancke, G. P.\n&\nLau, R. W. H.\n,\nAug 2019\n,\nIn:\nIEEE Transactions