f. Forensics Secur. 20: 854-870\n, 2025.\nLan Zhang, Xinben Gao,\nYaliang Li\n, Yunhao Liu.\nFunctionality and Data Stealing by Pseudo-Client Attack and Target Defenses in Split Learning\n. IEEE Trans. Dependable Secur. Comput. 22(1): 84-100\n, 2025.\n2024\nJiamu Bai, Daoyuan Chen, Bingchen Qian, Liuyi Yao,\nYaliang Li\n.\nFederated Fine-tuning of Large Language Models under Heterogeneous Tasks and Client Resources\n.\nNeural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS), 202\n4.\nMingyuan Fan, Xiaodan Li, Cen Chen, Wenmeng Zhou,\nYaliang Li\n.\nTransferability Bound Theory: Exploring Relationship between Adversarial Transferability and Flatness\n.\nNeural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS), 2024.\nThe team of Data-Juicer.\nMulti-modal Data Processing for Foundation Models: Practical Guidances and Use Cases\n. In Proceedings of the SIGKDD International Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining (KDD), tutorial, 2024.\nhttps://modelscope.github.io/data-juicer/_static/tutorial_kdd24.html\nWeirui Kuang, Bingchen Qian, Zitao Li, Daoyuan Chen, Dawei Gao, Xuchen Pan, Yuexiang Xie,\nYaliang Li\n, Bolin Ding, Jingren Zhou.\nFederatedScope-LLM: A Comprehensive Package for Fine-tuning Large Language Models in Federated Learning\n. In Proceedings of the SIGKDD International Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining (KDD), 2024.\nFeijie Wu, Zitao Li,\nYaliang Li\n, Bolin Ding, Jing Gao.\nFedBiOT: LLM Local Fine-tuning in Federated Learning without Full Model\n. In Proceedings of the SIGKDD International Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining (KDD), 2024.\nFangyuan Zhao, Zitao Li, Xuebin Ren, Bolin Ding, Shusen Yang,\nYaliang Li\n.\nVertiMRF: Differentially Private Vertical Federated Data Synthesis\n. In Proceedings of the SIGKDD International Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining (KDD), 2024.\nZhenqing Ling, Daoyuan Chen, Liuyi Yao,\nYaliang Li\n, Ying Shen.\nOn the Convergence of Zeroth-Order Federated Tuning for Large Language Models\n. 