    "homepage_text": "Rui Dai\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nRui Dai\nHello, I am\nRui Dai\nSenior Research Support Director\nWharton Research Data Services (WRDS)\nThe Wharton School, University of Pennsylvania\nOffice Phone: +1(215)7464612 | Email:\nrdai@wharton.upenn.edu\n3819 Chestnut Street Philadelphia PA, 19104\nAdjunct Research Professor\nChinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen\nCurriculum Vitae\n|\nGoogle Scholar\n|\nLinkedIn\nMy teaching note is\n[here]\nand GitHub Page is\n[here]\nWorking Papers\nMarket Efficiency in the Age of Machine Learning\n, with Leonidas Barbopoulos, Tālis Putniņš,  and\nAnthony Saunders\nWinner of the 2021-2022 NYU Yuki Arai Faculty Research Prize in Finance\nOn AFA 2022 and EFA 2021 Program\nOutsourcing Climate Change\nwith Rui Duan,\nHao Liang and Lilian Ng\nFeatured in\nPRI Academic Blog\nFeatured in\nBNP Paribas Asset Management Investment Insights\nOn EFA2022, FIRS 2022, ABFER 2021\nand PRI Academic Network 2021 Program\nPublications\nRevealing or Concealing? The Competitive Landscape of Bad News Disclosure\nwith Duan and Ng\n,\nJournal of Corporate Finance\n,\nForthcoming\nOn CICF 2019 Program\nInnovating Green: Competition Meets Regulation\nwith Duan and Ng,\nM\nanagement Science\n,\nForthcoming\nOn NFA 2021 and CICF 2021 Program\nGlobal Zombies\n, with Altman and Wang\n,\nJournal of International Business Studies\n, March 2024\nFeatured in\nTurnaround Time Podcast from TMA NYC\nFeatured in\nBloomberg News\nOn CICF 2022 Program\nGlobal Supply Chains and Voluntary Disclosure\nwith\nDai,\nNg,\nand\nPeng\n,\nJournal of Business Finance & Accounting\n,\nDecember 2023\nOn AFAANZ 2021 (\nWinner of  B\nest Paper Award in Financial Accounting)\nDissemination, Publication, and Impact of Finance Research: When Novelty Meets Conventionality\n, with Donohue, Drechsler, and Jiang,\nRevi\new of Finance\n, Volume 27, Issue 1, February 2023, Pages 79–141\nInteractive Online Appendix (\nWeb\n)\nSelected data fields (\nCorpus\n).\nReview of Finance\nLatex Template (including\nrf.bst\n)\nA Summary in Chinese (\nWeb\n)\nShort Sellers' Attention\nw\nith Ng, and Zaiats,\nJournal of Corporate Finance,\nVolume 72,\nFebruary 2022\nSocially Responsible Corporate Customers\nwith\nLiang and Ng,\nJournal of Financial Economics,\nVolume 142, Issue 2, November 2021\nWinner of the 2019 Moskowitz Prize in Socially Responsible Investing\nWinner of the Mirae Asset Daewoo Co., Ltd. Outstanding Paper Award, 13th International Conference on Asia-Pacific Financial Markets 2018\nFeatured in\nColumbia Law School’s Blue Sky Blog\nInternational Lending: The Role of Lender’s Home Country\nwith Beyhaghi, Saunders and Wald,\nJournal of Money, Credit and Banking\n, Volume 53, September 2021\nData:\nDealscan Borrower to Worldscope crosswalk table (\nWRDS\n)\nDo Short Sellers Anticipate Late Filings?\nwith\nLi\n,\nZaiats and Zhao\n,\nJournal of Corporate Finance,\nVolume\n69\n,\nAugust\n2021\nHedge Funds in M&A Deals: Is There Exploitation of Private Information?\nwith Massoud, Nandy and Saunders,\nJournal of Corporate Finance\n, Volume 47, December 2017\nOther Publications\nForm 10-Q Itemization\n,\nwith Zhang, Du, Sun, Donohue, in Proceedings of the 30th ACM International Conference on Information and Knowledge Management (2021)\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
