    "homepage_text": "Yuwei Yang\n      -  Vrije Universiteit Brussel\nVrije Universiteit Brussel Home\nHelp & FAQ\nLink opens in a new tab\nEnglish\nNederlands\nSearch content at Vrije Universiteit Brussel\nContact expert\nView Scopus Profile\nYuwei Yang\nDoctoral scholarship\n,\nBasic (bio-) Medical Sciences\nLiver Cell Biology\nPhD\n,\nFaculty of Medicine and Pharmacy\nhttps://orcid.org/0000-0002-1847-5464\nLaarbeeklaan 103\n1090\nBrussels\nBelgium\nPleinlaan 2\n1050\nBrussel\nBelgium\nh-index\n127\nCitations\n7\nh-index\nCalculated based on number of publications stored in Pure and citations from Scopus\n2021\n2025\nResearch activity per year\nPersonal profile\nExpertise\nStem cell, iPSCs\nFlemish discipline codes in use since 2023\nStem cell biology\nFingerprint\nDive into the research topics where Yuwei Yang is active. These topic labels come from the works of this person. Together they form a unique fingerprint.\n6\nSimilar Profiles\nHeterotopic Ossification\nPharmacology, Toxicology and Pharmaceutical Science\n100%\nProtein Kinase B\nPharmacology, Toxicology and Pharmaceutical Science\n50%\nWound Dressings\nPharmacology, Toxicology and Pharmaceutical Science\n50%\nLiver Fibrosis\nPharmacology, Toxicology and Pharmaceutical Science\n50%\nCornea Injury\nPharmacology, Toxicology and Pharmaceutical Science\n50%\nScar Formation\nPharmacology, Toxicology and Pharmaceutical Science\n50%\nTendinitis\nPharmacology, Toxicology and Pharmaceutical Science\n50%\nImmune Response\nImmunology and Microbiology\n50%\nView full fingerprint\nCollaborations and top research areas from the last five years\nRecent external collaboration on country/territory level. Dive into details by clicking on the dots or\nSelect a country/territory from the list\nDive into details\nSelect a country/territory to view shared publications and projects\nClose\nSelect a country/territory from the list\nExplore network further\nResearch output\n9\nArticle\n1\nPoster\nModelling Monocyte recruitment a