    "homepage_text": "Zhishuai Guo's Homepage\nZhishuai Guo (郭志帅)\nAssistant Professor\nDepartment of Computer Science\nNorthern Illinois University\nDeKalb, IL\nzguo [at] niu.edu\nI am an Assistant Professor at Northern Illinois University. I got my Ph.D. degree at Texas A&M University, advised by\nProf. Tianbao Yang\n. \nHere is my\n[Google Scholar Profile]\n.\nFully funded positions avaiable for PhDs. Interested students \n  please send me an email with your CV, graduate and/or undergraduate transcripts, as well as a writing sample if applicable. Research opportunities are also available for Master's and undergraduate students.\nResearch Interest\nFederated Learning, Machine Learning, Optimization, Computer Vision.\nPublications (Full List at\n[Google Scholar]\n)\nCommunication-Efficient Federated AUC Maximization with Cyclic Client Participation\n[Paper]\nUmesh Vangapally, Wenhan Wu, Chen Chen,\nZhishuai Guo\nTransactions on Machine Learning Research, 2026.\nUniSTFormer: Unified Spatio-Temporal Lightweight Transformer for Efficient Skeleton-Based Action Recognition\n[Paper]\nWenhan Wu,\nZhishuai Guo\n, Chen Chen, Aidong Lu\nInternational Conference on Acoustics, Speech, and Signal Processing (ICASSP), 2026.\nFrequency-Semantic Enhanced Variational Autoencoder for Zero-Shot Skeleton-based Action Recognition\n[Paper]\nWenhan Wu,\nZhishuai Guo\n, Chen Chen, Hongfei Xue, Aidong Lu\nIn International Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV), 2025.\nBAGELS: Benchmarking the Automated Generation and Extraction of Limitations from Scholarly Text\n[Paper]\nIbrahim Al Azher, Miftahul Jannat Mokarrama,\nZhishuai Guo\n, Sagnik Ray Choudhury, Hamed Alhoori\nIn Findings of the Association for Computational Linguistics: EMNLP, 2025.\nCommunication-Efficient Federated Group Distributionally Robust Optimization\n[Paper]\nZhishuai Guo\n, Tianbao Yang\narXiv preprint arXiv:2410.06369\nIn Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS), 2024.\nUnified Convergence Analysis for Adaptive Optimization with Moving Average Estimator\n[Paper]\nZhishuai Guo\n, Yi Xu, Wotao Yin, Rong Jin, Tianbao Yang\narXiv preprint arXiv:2104.14840\nMachine Learning.\nFeDXL: Provable Federated Learning for Deep X-Risk Optimization\n[Paper]\nZhishuai Guo\n, Rong Jin, Jiebo Luo, Tianbao Yang\nIn International Conference on Machine Learning (ICML), 2023\nBlockwise Stochastic Variance-Reduced Methods with Parallel Speedup for Multi-Block Bilevel Optimization\n[Paper]\nQuanqi Hu, Zi-Hao Qiu,\nZhishuai Guo\n, Lijun Zhang, Tianbao Yang\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (ICML), 2023\nFast Objective and Duality Gap Convergence for Nonconvex-Strongly-Concave Min-Max Problems with PL Condition\n[Paper]\nZhishuai Guo\n, Yan Yan, Zhuoning Yuan, Tianbao Yang\nJournal of Machine Learning Research.\nCompositional Training for End-to-End Deep AUC Maximization\n[Paper]\nZhuoning Yuan,\nZhishuai Guo\n, Nitesh Chawla, Tianbao Yang\nIn International Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR), 2022\n(Spotlight)\nA Novel Convergence Analysis for Algorithms of the Adam Family\n[Short Version]\n[Full Version]\nZhishuai Guo\n, Yi Xu, Wotao Yin, Rong Jin, Tianbao Yang\nIn NeurIPS Workshop on Optimization for Machine Learning (OPT), 2021\nAn Online Method for Deep Distributionally Robust Optimization\n[Paper]\nQi Qi*,\nZhishuai Guo*\n, Yi Xu, Rong Jin, Tianbao Yang (*Equal Contribution)\nIn Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS), 2021\nFederated Deep AUC Maximization for Heterogeneous Data with a Constant Communication Complexity\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nZhuoning Yuan*,\nZhishuai Guo*\n, Yi Xu, Yiming Ying, Tianbao Yang (*Equal Contribution)\nIn International Conference on Machine Learning (ICML), 2021\nAccelerating Deep Learning with Millions of Classes\n[Paper]\nZhuoning Yuan,\nZhishuai Guo\n, Xiaotian Yu, Xiaoyu Wang, Tianbao Yang\nIn European Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV), 2020\nCommunication-Efficient Distributed Stochastic AUC Maximization with Deep Neural Networks\n[Paper]\n[Code]\nZhishuai Guo\n, Mingrui Liu, Zhuoning Yuan, Li Shen, Wei Liu, Tianbao Yang\nIn International Conference on Machine Learning (ICML), 2020\nA New Local Density for Density Peak Clustering\n[Paper]\nZhishuai Guo\n, Tianyi Huang, Zhiling Cai, William Zhu\nIn Pacific-Asia Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining (PAKDD), 2018\nPreprints\nRandomized Stochastic Variance-Reduced Methods for Stochastic Bilevel Optimization\n[Paper]\nZhishuai Guo\n, Quanqi Hu, Lijun Zhang, Tianbao Yang\narXiv preprint arXiv:2105.02266\nEducation\nPh.D. in Computer Science\n, Texas A&M University\nM.S. in Computer Science\n, The University of Iowa\nB.S. in Computer Science\n, University of Electronic Science and Technology of China\nTeaching\nCSCI:644: Applied Machine Learning, Fall 2025\n.\nCSCI:340: Data Structure and Algorithm Analysis, Spring 2026, Spring 2025\n.\nCSCI:644: Applied Machine Learning, Fall 2024\n.\nIndustry Experience\nMeta\n, Software Engineer Intern, June 2022 - Aug 2022.\nAmazon\n, Applied Scientist Intern, June 2021 - Aug 2021."
