    "homepage_text": "Jian Yin's Homepage\nSearch\nJian Yin 尹建\nWelcome to Jian Yin's Home Page\nBiography\nJian Yin currently works as a Senior Engineer at Bigo, focusing on Computer Vision.\n\n            He received the master's degree in computer technology at\nCentral South University (CSU)\nin 2022, under the supervision of Professor\nXiaoheng Deng\nin\nWireless Communications and Mobile Computing (WCMC)\nlaboratory, School of Computer Science and Engineering (SCSE).\n\n            He received the bachelor's degree in computer science and technology at\nCentral South University of Forestry and Technology (CSUFT)\nas an \"Outstanding Graduate\" in 2019, under the supervision of Professor\nZhufang Kuang\nin\nACM\nlaboratory, School of Computer and Information Engineering (SCIE).\nHis research interests include but not limited to:\nComputer Vision\nComputer Graphics\nDeep Learning\nReinforcement Learning\nExperience\nSenior Engineer\nBIGO\nJul 2022 –\n            \n              Present\nBeiJing, China\nWorking Field: Video Enhancement\nAI Algorithm Engineer\nOPPO\nJun 2021 –\n            \n              Aug 2021\nShenZhen, China\nWorking Field: Image quality assessment\nAutonomous Driving Algorithm Engineer\nHorizon Robotics\nNov 2018 –\n\n              Feb 2019\nBeiJing, China\nWorking Field: Target Detection\nEducation\nMaster of Engineering\nCentral South University\nAug 2019 –\n\n              Jun 2022\nChangSha, China\nBachelor Degree of Engineering\nCentral South University of Forestry and Technology\nAug 2015 –\n\n              Jun 2019\nChangSha, China\nPublications\nMEC-Based Dynamic Controller Placement in SD-IoV: A Deep Reinforcement Learning Approach\nAccepted by IEEE Transactions on Vehicular Technology (TVT)\nBo Li, Xiaoheng Deng, Xuechen Chen, Yiqin Deng,\nJian Yin\nPDF\nCite\nIntelligent delay-aware partial computing task offloading for multi-user industrial internet of things through edge computing\nAccepted by IEEE Internet of Things Journal (IoTJ)\nXiaoheng Deng,\nJian Yin\n, Peiyuan Guan, Neal N. Xiong, Lan Zhang, Shahid Mumtaz\nPDF\nCite\nHonors and Awards\nOutstanding Paper\nof Hunan Postgraduate Innovation Forum, 2022\nSecond Prize\nof the Aircraft Innovation Competition of Central South University, 2020\nOutstanding Graduate\nof Central South University of Forestry and Technology, 2019\nHonorable Mention\nof Mathematical Contest in Modeling, 2018\nBronze Medal\nof ACM-ICPC China Shanghai Metropolitan Invitational Contest, 2018\nBronze Medal\nof ACM-ICPC Asian Regional Contest, 2017\nSecond Prize\nof the 13th Hunan Computer Programming Contest, 2017\nSecond Prize\nof China Collegiate Computing Contest (CCCC), 2017\nFirst Prize\nof Computer Programming Contest of Central South University of Forestry and Technology, 2015\nCite\n×\nCopy\nDownload"
