    "homepage_text": "Heyang Zhao\nEmail\nTwitter\nGoogle Scholar\nAbout Me\nHi there! I am a fourth-year PhD student in\nComputer Science department at UCLA\n, \n                where I am fortunate to be advised by\nProf. Quanquan Gu\n. Previously, I was\n                an undergrad in\nYao class, Tsinghua University\n.\nMy research interest lies in the foundation of machine learning, especially\n                sequential decision-making models, including bandits and reinforcement learning. \n                I am also interested in the application of these models in real world problems.\nEducation\nSep 2022 - Present\nUniversity of California, Los Angeles\nPhD in Computer Science\nSep 2018 - Jun 2022\nTsinghua University\nB.E in Computer Science and Technology\nPublications"
