  "deep_homepage::Xiaokui Xiao::https://www.comp.nus.edu.sg/~xiaoxk/": {
    "homepage": "https://www.comp.nus.edu.sg/~xiaoxk/",
    "all_emails": [],
    "matched_email": null,
    "github": null,
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Xiaokui XIAO's Homepage\nHome\nPublications\n                / Code\nResearch Group\nHonors\nServices\nContact\nXiaokui\n                XIAO\nCOM 1, #03-25\nSchool of Computing\nNational University of Singapore\n13 Computing Drive\nSingapore 117417\nEmail:\nBio\nI am a professor and Deputy Head (Research and\n            Graduate Matters) at the Department of Computer Science, National\n            University of Singapore (NUS). I obtained a PhD in Computer Science\n            from the Chinese University of Hong Kong in 2008. Before joining NUS\n            in 2018, I was an associate professor at the Nanyang Technological\n            University, Singapore.\nI am an IEEE Fellow and an ACM Distinguished Member. I received the\n            2024 ACM SIGMOD Test of Time Award, the 2022 ACM SIGMOD Research\n            Highlight Award, and the VLDB 2021 Best Research Paper Award. I am a\n            trustee of the VLDB Endowment (2022-present).\nMy Google Scholar profile:\nResearch Interests\nMy research focuses on data\n              management and analysis, with special interests in two topics:\nPrivacy-preserving data management.\nRecent interests: differential privacy, privacy in large\n                    language models (LLMs)\nAlgorithms and systems for large data\n                analysis.\nRecent interests: social network analysis,\n                  large data analysis with LLMs\nNews\nI am looking for research assistants,\n            PhD students, and postdocs. Please send me your CV if you are\n            interested."
  },
