    "homepage_text": "Yige Li | Professor Sharon-Lise Normand\nSkip to main content\narrow_circle_down\nProfessor Sharon-Lise Normand\nS. James Adelstein Professor of Health Care Policy\nmenu\nclose\nMenu\nSearch\nSearch\nsearch\nProfessor Sharon-Lise Normand\nS. James Adelstein Professor of Health Care Policy\nYige Li\nResearch Fellow in Health Care Policy, Harvard Medical School\nemail\nYige_Li@hcp.med.harvard.edu\nStudy Team\nMethods - Elderly Schizophrenia\nSLN team"
