    "homepage_text": "Yunfan Li\nYunfan\nLi\nSichuan University\n. Chengdu, China.\nRoom B316, Colledge of Computer Science,\nSichuan University, Wangjiang Campus, 610065\nHi! My name is Yunfan Li (李云帆). I received my Ph.D. degree in 2025 from the College of Computer Science, Sichuan University, Chengdu, China, under the supervision of Professor Peng\n[Website]\n. Currently, I am a postdoctoral researcher at the College of Computer Science, Sichuan University. My research interests include clustering, unsupervised learning, and AI for Science.\nNews\nSep 19, 2025\nOne paper was accepted by the 39th Annual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems as Spotlight\n[NeurIPS-25]\n, which will take place on Dec 10-15, 2024, San Diego Convention Center, California, United States.\nJun 26, 2025\nOne paper was accepted by the International Conference on Computer Vision 2025\n[ICCV-25]\n, which will take place on Oct 19 – 23th, 2025, Honolulu, Hawai’i, United States.\nJun 16, 2025\nI have been invited to be a Reviewer for Pattern Recognition\n[PR]\n.\nApr 29, 2025\nOne paper was accepted by the 32nd International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n[IJCAI-25]\n, which will take place on August 16-22, 2025, Montreal.\nFeb 7, 2025\nI was invited to present a talk at the AI for Life Science Seminar\n[AI4LifeScience]\n, which will take place on February 23, 2025, in UESTC, Chengdu, China.\nJan 31, 2025\nOne paper was accepted by Nature Communications\n[NatComm-25]\n, 2025.\nSep 26, 2024\nOne paper was accepted by the 38th Annual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems\n[NeurIPS-24]\n, which will take place on Dec 10-15, 2024, Vancouver Convention Center, Vancouver, Canada.\nJul 3, 2024\nI have been invited to be a Reviewer for IEEE Transactions on Image Processing\n[TIP]\n.\nMay 2, 2024\nOne paper was accepted by the 41st International Conference on Machine Learning as Oral\n[ICML-24]\n, which will take place on July 21-27, 2024, Messe Wien Exhibition Congress Center, Vienna, Austria.\nApr 14, 2024\nI have been invited to be a PC member for the 32nd ACM Multimedia Conference\n[ACMMM-24]\n, which will take place on October 28-November 1, 2024, Melbourne, Australia.\nMar 13, 2024\nOne paper was accepted by IEEE Conference on Multimedia Expo\n[ICME-24]\n, which will take place on July 15-19, 2024, Niagra Falls, Canada.\nFeb 28, 2024\nOne paper was accepted by IEEE Transactions on Image Processing\n[TIP-24]\n, 2024.\nJan 17, 2024\nI have been invited to be a PC member for the European Conference on Computer Vision\n[ECCV-24]\n, which will take place on September 29-October 4, 2024, MiCo Milano, Milan, Italy.\nJan 16, 2024\nOne paper was accepted by the 12th International Conference on Learning Representations\n[ICLR-24]\n, which will take place on May 7-11, 2024, Messe Wien Exhibition and Congress Center, Vienna, Austria.\nDec 1, 2023\nHonored to win Gold Prize (Ranked 6/1097) in NeurIPS 2023 Competion - Single-Cell Perturbations\n[Link]\n.\nNov 27, 2023\nI have been invited to be a Reviewer for IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence\n[TPAMI]\n.\nNov 23, 2023\nHonored to win the Sichuan University Tecent Scholarship (Special Grade).\nOct 19, 2023\nI have been invited to be a Reviewer for BMC Bioinformatics\n[BMCBioinform]\n.\nSep 12, 2023\nI have been invited to be a PC member for the International Conference on Pattern Recognition\n[ICPR-24]\n, which will take place on December 1-5, 2024, Kolkata, India.\nSep 8, 2023\nOne paper was accepted by Nature Communications\n[NatComm-23]\n, 2023.\nApr 20, 2023\nOne paper was accepted by the 32nd International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n[IJCAI-23]\n, which will take place on Augest 19-25, 2023, Macao, S.A.R.\nSelected Publications\n2025\nNatComm\nMetaQ: fast, scalable and accurate metacell inference via single-cell quantization\nYunfan Li\n, Hancong Li, Yijie Lin, Dan Zhang, Dezhong Peng, Xiting Liu, Jie Xie, Peng Hu, Lu Chen, Han Luo, and  others\nNature Communications\n, 2025\nBib\nPDF\nCode\n@article\n{\nLi_NatComm2025_MetaQ\n,\ntitle\n=\n{MetaQ: fast, scalable and accurate metacell inference via single-cell quantization}\n,\nauthor\n=\n{Li, Yunfan and Li, Hancong and Lin, Yijie and Zhang, Dan and Peng, Dezhong and Liu, Xiting and Xie, Jie and Hu, Peng and Chen, Lu and Luo, Han and others}\n,\njournal\n=\n{Nature Communications}\n,\nvolume\n=\n{16}\n,\nnumber\n=\n{1}\n,\npages\n=\n{1205}\n,\nyear\n=\n{2025}\n,\npublisher\n=\n{Nature Publishing Group UK London}\n,\n}\n2024\nICML\nImage Clustering with External Guidance\nYunfan Li\n, Peng Hu, Dezhong Peng, Jiancheng Lv, Jianping Fan, and Xi Peng\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (Oral)\n, 2024\nBib\nPDF\nCode\n@article\n{\nLi_ICML2024_TAC\n,\ntitle\n=\n{Image Clustering with External Guidance}\n,\nauthor\n=\n{Li, Yunfan and Hu, Peng and Peng, Dezhong and Lv, Jiancheng and Fan, Jianping and Peng, Xi}\n,\njournal\n=\n{International Conference on Machine Learning (Oral)}\n,\nyear\n=\n{2024}\n,\n}\n2023\nNatComm\nscBridge embraces cell heterogeneity in single-cell RNA-seq and ATAC-seq data integration\nYunfan Li*\n, Dan Zhang*, Mouxing Yang, Dezhong Peng, Jun Yu, Yu Liu, Jiancheng Lv, Lu Chen, and Xi Peng\nNature Communications\n, 2023\nBib\nPDF\nCode\n@article\n{\nLi_NatComm2023_scBridge\n,\ntitle\n=\n{scBridge embraces cell heterogeneity in single-cell RNA-seq and ATAC-seq data integration}\n,\nauthor\n=\n{Li*, Yunfan and Zhang*, Dan and Yang, Mouxing and Peng, Dezhong and Yu, Jun and Liu, Yu and Lv, Jiancheng and Chen, Lu and Peng, Xi}\n,\njournal\n=\n{Nature Communications}\n,\nvolume\n=\n{14}\n,\nnumber\n=\n{1}\n,\npages\n=\n{6045}\n,\nyear\n=\n{2023}\n,\npublisher\n=\n{Nature Publishing Group UK London}\n,\n}\n2021\nAAAI\nContrastive Clustering\nYunfan Li\n, Peng Hu, Zitao Liu, Dezhong Peng, Joey Tianyi Zhou, and Xi Peng\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n, 2021\nBib\nPDF\nCode\n@article\n{\nLi_AAAI2021_CC\n,\ntitle\n=