PRCV)\nInternational Conference on Pattern Recognition (ICPR)\nInternational Conference on Image and Graphics (ICIG)\nInternational Conference on Artificial Intelligence (CICAI)\nJournal Reviewer\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence\nIEEE Transactions on Image Processing\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems\nIEEE Transactions on Systems, Man and Cybernetics: Systems\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology\nIEEE Transactions on Emerging Topics in Computing\nChinese Journal of Computers (计算机学报)\nIEEE/CAA Journal of Automatica Sinica（自动化学报）\nPattern Recognition\nIntelligent Computing\nNeural Networks\nBMC Bioinformatics\nEngineering Applications of Artificial Intelligence\nCAAI Transactions on Intelligence Technology\n​IET Computer Vision\nMachine Vision and Applications\nEngineering Applications of Artificial Intelligence\nScientific Report\nIEEE Access\nSN Computer Science\nSN Machine Learning\nTalks\n2025 AI for Life Science Seminar\n2021 VALSE Workshop: Unsupervised Learning"
