    "homepage_text": "Bo Jin\n      -  the University of Groningen research portal\nthe University of Groningen research portal Home\nHelp & FAQ\nLink opens in a new tab\nEnglish\nNederlands\nSearch content at the University of Groningen research portal\nView Scopus Profile\nBo Jin, M\nExterne medewerker\n,\nFaculty of Science and Engineering\n,\nDiscrete Technology and Production Automation\nPhone\n+31 50 363 4484\nEmail\nB.Jin\nrug\nnl\nNijenborgh4\n9747 AG\nGroningen\nNetherlands\nFingerprint\nDive into the research topics where Bo Jin is active. These topic labels come from the works of this person. Together they form a unique fingerprint.\n1\nSimilar Profiles\nLinear Systems\nComputer Science\n100%\nDistributed Model\nComputer Science\n100%\nPredictive Model\nMathematics\n100%\nLinear System\nMathematics\n100%\nCoordination Game\nComputer Science\n50%\nGlobal Constraint\nComputer Science\n50%\nErgodicity\nMathematics\n50%\nPredictive Control for Linear Systems\nKeyphrases\n50%\nView full fingerprint\nResearch output\n2\nArticle\n1\nConference contribution\n1\nAbstract\nControl using Q-learning for networked coordination games\nJin, B.\n&\nCao, M.\n,\n2022\n,\nASCC 2022 - 2022 13th Asian Control Conference, Proceedings.\nInstitute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers Inc.\n,\np. 941-946\n6 p.\n(ASCC 2022 - 2022 13th Asian Control Conference, Proceedings).\nResearch output\n:\nChapter in Book/Report/Conference proceeding\n›\nConference contribution\n›\nAcademic\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nFile\nErgodicity\n100%\nCoordination Game\n100%\nErgodicity Condition\n100%\nCoordination Bias\n100%\nDecision Making\n100%\n153\nDownloads\n(Pure)\nDistributed Model Predictive Control and Optimization for Linear Systems With Global Constraints and Time-Varying Communication\nJin, B.\n, Li, H., Yan, W. &\nCao, M.\n,\n1-Jul-2021\n,\nIn:\nIEEE Transactions on Automatic Control.\n66\n,\n7\n,\np. 3393-3400\n8 p.\n, 9186330.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\nAcademic\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nFile\nLinear Systems\n100%\nDistributed Model\n100%\nGlobal Constraint\n100%\nLinear System\n100%\nPredictive Model\n100%\n37\nCitations\n(Scopus)\n452\nDownloads\n(Pure)\nDistributed model predictive control for linear systems under communication noise: Algorithm, theory and implementation\nLi, H.,\nJin, B.\n& Yan, W.,\nMar-2021\n,\nIn:\nAutomatica.\n125\n,\n11 p.\n, 109422.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\nAcademic\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nFile\nLinear System\n100%\nPredictive Model\n100%\nLinear Systems\n100%\nDistributed Model\n100%\nPredictive Control for Linear Systems\n100%\n45\nCitations\n(Scopus)\n248\nDownloads\n(Pure)\nDistributed Model Predictive Control for Linear Systems Under Time-varying Communication\nJin, B.\n&\nCao, M.\n,\n2020\n,\np. 92\n.\n1 p.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to conference\n›\nAbstract\n›\nAcademic"
