    "homepage_text": "Dr. Xiaodong Yang – Mechanical and Aerospace Engineering\nSkip to content\nDr. Xiaodong Yang\nProfessor/Associate Chair of Graduate Affairs,\nMechanical and Aerospace Engineering\nDirector,\nNanoscale Optics Laboratory\nEmail:\nyangxia@mst.edu\nTel:\n573-341-6273\nBiography\nDr. Xiaodong Yang joined the Missouri S&T faculty in 2011. He earned a bachelor of science degree in mechanical engineering from University of Science and Technology of China in 2000 and a master’s degree in physics from the Chinese Academy of Sciences in 2003. He earned a Ph.D. in mechanical engineering from Columbia University in 2009.\nHis interdisciplinary research focuses on the physics and applications of photonics, plasmonics and optical metamaterials based on engineered optical nanostructures used for nanoelectromechanical systems, optical sensing, optical communication and solar and thermal energy harvesting.\nDisciplines\nAerospace Engineering and Mechanical Engineering\nResearch Interests\nOptical materials and devices in nanophotonics and plasmonics, Physics and applications of optical metamaterials, Nanoscale optomechanics, optical nanoelectromechanical systems (NEMS), Integrated optofluidic devices and optical sensors, Photon management for solar/thermal energy harvesting, and Optical device micro-/nano-fabrication\nEducation\n2009 – Ph.D. in Mechanical Engineering,\nColumbia University\n2003 – M.S. in Physics,\nChinese Academy of Sciences\n2000 – B.S. in Mechanical Engineering,\nUniversity of Science and Technology of China\nclose menu\nclose search\nSearch\nSearch Site\n\n---\n\nContact – Dr. Xiaodong Yang\nSkip to content\nContact\nI would like to hear from you. Please send me a message by filling out the form below and I will get back to you shortly.\nName\n*\nFirst\nLast\n*\nLast\nEmail\n*\nSubject\n*\nMessage\n*\nIf you are human, leave this field blank.\nThis form is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google\nPrivacy Policy\nand\nTerms of Service\napply.\nSubmit\nDirect Contact\nDr. Xiaodong Yang\n573-341-6273\nyangxia@mst.edu\nclose menu\nclose search\nSearch\nSearch Site\n\n---\n\nContact – Dr. Xiaodong Yang\nSkip to content\nContact\nI would like to hear from you. Please send me a message by filling out the form below and I will get back to you shortly.\nName\n*\nFirst\nLast\n*\nLast\nEmail\n*\nSubject\n*\nMessage\n*\nIf you are human, leave this field blank.\nThis form is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google\nPrivacy Policy\nand\nTerms of Service\napply.\nSubmit\nDirect Contact\nDr. Xiaodong Yang\n573-341-6273\nyangxia@mst.edu\nclose menu\nclose search\nSearch\nSearch Site"
