    "homepage_text": "Jin Liu's Personal Page\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nJin Liu's Personal Page\nWelcome to my page!\nMy research focuses on International Trade and Industrial Organization, with an emphasis on firm decisions in trade and innovation and how they interact with policies.\nI am an Assistant Professor in the Department of Economist at Penn, where I joined in July 2025. Prior to joining Penn, I was an IES Postdoctoral Fellow at Princeton University during the 2024\n–2025 academic year. I received my Ph.D. in Economics from NYU in 2024.\nYou can find my CV\nhere\n. I can be reached at\njinliu52@upenn.edu\n.\nYou can also find my work on\nGoogle Scholar\nand\nVoxDev\n.\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
  },
