    "homepage_text": "Hsin-Ying Lee's Homepage\nHsin-Ying Lee\nResearcher\nhsinyinglee.business [at] gmail.com\nI am currently working on the intersection of AI, 3D, and architectural design.\nI was a research scientist in the Creative Vision team at Snap Research from 2020 to 2025.\nMy research focuses on Computer Vision and Machine Learning, particularly in 2D/3D/4D generation and manipulation.\nNews\nlibrary_books\n02/2025: Three papers are accepted to\nCVPR 2025 (1 highlight)\nlibrary_books\n01/2025: Four papers are accepted to\nICLR 2025\nlibrary_books\n09/2024: One papers is accepted to\nNeurIPS 2024\nlibrary_books\n05/2024: One paper is accepted to\nECCV 2024\nlibrary_books\n02/2024: Four papers are accepted to\nCVPR 2024 (1 spotlight)\nlibrary_books\n12/2023: One papers is accepted to\nICLR 2024\nlibrary_books\n09/2023: One paper is accepted to\nSIGGRAPH Asia 2023\nlibrary_books\n07/2023: Two papers are accepted to\nICCV 2023\nlibrary_books\n04/2023: One paper is accepted to\nICML 2023\nlibrary_books\n02/2023: Five papers are accepted to\nCVPR 2023 (1 highlight)\nlibrary_books\n01/2023: One paper is accepted to\nICLR 2023 (oral)\nlibrary_books\n07/2022: Three papers are accepted to\nECCV 2022\nlibrary_books\n12/2021: Two papers are accepted to\nCVPR 2022\nlibrary_books\n12/2021: One paper is accepted to\nICLR 2022\nlibrary_books\n07/2020:\nJoining Snap Research!\nlibrary_books\n07/2020: Four papers are accepted to\nECCV 2020 (1 spotlight)\nlibrary_books\n12/2019: One paper is accepted to\nICLR 2020 (spotlight)\nlibrary_books\n12/2019: One paper is accepted to\nIJCV 2019\nlibrary_books\n09/2019: One paper is accepted to\nNeurIPS 2019\nlibrary_books\n05/2019:\nGoogle Internship, MTV\nlibrary_books\n04/2019: One paper is accepted to\nICIP 2019\nlibrary_books\n02/2019: One paper is accepted to\nCVPR 2019\nlibrary_books\n12/2018:\nGoogle Internship, SNV\nlibrary_books\n07/2018: Two papers are accepted to\nECCV 2018 (1 oral)\nlibrary_books\n05/2018:\nNvidia Internship, Santa Clara\n&nbspAudio-Visual Modeling\nlibrary_books\n07/2017: One paper is accepted to\nICCV 2017\nlibrary_books\n05/2017:\nGoogle Internship, MTV\n&nbspVideo Highlights / Video Summarization\nlibrary_books\n08/2016: Start my PhD at\nUC Merced\nPublications\nAll\nImage\nVideo\n3D/4D\nOthers\nEducation\nPh.D.\nin EECS, University of California, Merced, California, USA\nSep. 2016 - May. 2020\nM.S.\nin Electrical Engineering, University of Southern California, Los Angeles, California, USA\nSep. 2015 - Aug. 2016\nB.S.\nin Electrical Engineering, National Taiwan University, Taipei, Taiwan\nSep. 2010 - Jun. 2014"
