    "homepage_text": "Welcome to Dr. Meikang Qiu's Home Page\nDr.  Meikang Qiu\nProfessor (Volunteer Adjunct)\nACM Distinguished Member\nIEEE Senior member\nDepartment of Computer Science\nPace University\nMain Campus: 1 Pace Plaza, Manhattan, New York City, NY 10038, USA\nPh.D.\r\n  advisor, rm 307, Goldstein Academic\nCenter,\n861\nBedford Road, Pleasantville, NY\r\n  10570, USA\nEmail:\nqiumeikang@gmail.com\nCyber Security and AI, Machine\r\n  Learning, Big Data, Smart Computing, Cloud Computing, IoT, CPS, and E\nmbedded\nS\nystems, etc.\nCALL\r\n  FOR PAPERS\nLead\r\n  Editor,\nIEEE\r\n  Transactions on Computers (CCF A),\nspecial\r\n  Issue on \nSecurity and\r\n  Privacy of Deep Learning as a Service Computing Systems\n, submission:\r\n  11/1/2020-11/15/2020\nLead\r\n  Editor,\nIEEE\r\n  Internet of Things Journal (IoT-J),\nspecial\r\n  Issue on \nRobustness and Efficiency in the Convergence of\r\n  Artificial Intelligence and IoT\n,\r\n  deadline 04/15/2020\nLead\r\n  Editor,\nIEEE\r\n  Transactions on\nIndustrial Informatics\n(TII),\nspecial Issue on \nEmerging\r\n  Privacy and Security Issues brought by Artificial Intelligence in Industrial\r\n  Informatics\n, deadline\r\n  05/31/2019\nLead\r\n  Editor,\nIEEE Transactions on\r\n  Dependable and Secure Computing (TDSC),\nSpecial\r\n  issue on Social Network Security\n, deadline 07/01/2018\nLead\r\n  Editor\n,\nIEEE Transactions on\r\n  Sustainable Computing (TSUSC),\nspecial Issue on \nSecure Sustainable\r\n  Green Smart Computing\n, deadline 02/15/2017\nLead\r\n  Editor\n,\nIEEE Transactions on Cloud\r\n  Computing (TCC),\nSpecial issue on\nSecurity and Privacy Protection of Clouds\n.\n2016\nAssociate\r\n  Editor:\n-\nIEEE Transactions on Computer,\n-\nIEEE Transactions on Cloud Computing\nCFP:\nSmartCom\n2020\n(\nSubmission\n: 11/15/2020, Paris, France)\nCFP: KSEM 2021\n(\nSubmission\n: 03/15/2021, New York, USA)\nCFP: IEEE ISPA\r\n  2021\n(\nSubmission\n: 06/01/2021, New York, USA)\nEducation\nPh.D\n.\nComputer Science\nUniversity of Texas at Dallas\nM.S.\nComputer Science\nUniversity of Texas at Dallas\nM.E.\nEngineering\nShanghai\r\nJiao\nT\nong University\nB.E.\nEngineering\nShanghai Jiao\nT\nong University\nOnly the educated are free -- EPICTETUS, Discourses\nWorking Experiences\nI\r\nhave about ten years working experiences related to high technologies,\r\nincluding:\nChinese Helicopter Research\r\n     & Development Institute\nRayes\nElectronic and Tele-communication Group Company\nIBM HSPC -- The largest IBM\r\n     joint venture in China\n\"If the enemy leaves a\r\ndoor open, you must rush in\"--Sun Tzu, the nine situations (65)\nResearch Interests\nCyber\r\n     Security\nand\nPrivacy\nMachine Learning/Deep\r\n     Reinforcement Learning\nBig Data and Data Analytic\nCloud Computing/Edge\r\n     Computing\nIoT and Cyber Physical\r\n     Systems\nSmart Computing\nTelehealth System\nEmbedded Systems and Mobile\r\n     Systems\nSmart Grid and Real-Time\r\n     Monitoring\nHardware/Software Codesign\nParallel and Multi-Core\r\n     Computing\nHeterogeneous Sensor Network\nMobile Interface Browsing\nLow Energy Design\nSelected\r\nPublications\nI have published 560+\r\npeer reviewed journal and conference papers (280+ journal papers and 280+\r\nconference papers) in recent years, including\nIEEE Systems Journal 2018 Best Paper\r\nAward,\nIEEE TCSC 2016 Most Influential\r\nJournal Paper Award, ACM Transactions on Design Automation of Electronic\r\nSystems (TODAES) 2011 Best Paper Award\n, 3\nHot Paper (top 0.1%)\nand 20+\nHighly Cited\r\nPapers\nfrom Web of Science, 6\nMost Downloaded Papers\n,\n20+\nIEEE international conference\nBest Paper Awards\nand\nBest Student Paper Awards\n.\nBooks\nM. Qiu\nand\r\n     H. Qiu, Research and Technical Writing for Science & Engineering,\nChapman & Hall/CRC\n, 2020\nC. Li and\nM. Qiu\n,\nReinforcement Learning\nfor Cyber\r\n     Physical SystemsWith Cybersecurity Case Studies,\nChapman & Hall/CRC\n, 2018\nM. Qiu\nand\r\n     K. Gai,\nMobile Cloud Computing, Model, Implementation, and\r\n     Security, ISBN: 978-1-4987-9603-3, published by\nChapman & Hall/CRC\n, 2017\nM. Qiu\n, W. Dai, and K. Gai, Mobile\r\n     Applications Development with Android, Technologies and Algorithms, ISBN:\r\n     978-1-4987-6186-4\n, Chapman &\r\n     Hall/CRC\n, 2016.\nM. Qiu\nand\nJ. Li\n,\nReal-Time\r\n     Embedded Systems: Optimization,\nSynthesis\n, and\r\n     Networking\n,\nISBN: 978-1-4398-1760-5\n,\nPublished by\nChapman & Hall/CR\nC\n, 201\n1\nM.\nQiu\nand\nE. H.-M. Sha, Heterogeneous\r\n     Parallel Embedded Systems: Time and Power Optimization\n,\nISBN: 978-3-639-09619-4\n, Published by VDM-Verlag, Produced in\r\n     USA by Lightning Source Inc.\n, 2008\nJournal\r\nPapers\nM.\r\n     Qiu\nand E. H.-M. Sha,\nCost\r\n     Minimization while Satisfying Hard/Soft Timing Constraints for\r\n     Heterogeneous Embedded Systems\n,\nin\nACM\nTransactions on Design Automation of Electronic Systems (TODAES),\nVol. 14, No.2, Article 25, pp.\r\n     1-30, Apr. 2009\nWon\nACM\r\nTransactions on Design Automation of Electronic Systems (TODAES) 2011 Best\r\nPaper Award\nThe Award\r\nrecognized the best paper published in the ACM Transactions on Design\r\nAutomation of Electronic Systems in the time window from the April 2008 issue\r\nto the January 2011 issue.\nY\n.\nZhang,\nM.\nQiu,\nC.-W.\nTsai,\nM\nM\n.\nHassan\n,\nA.\nAlamri\n,\n\nHealth-CPS: Healthcare Cyber Physical\nSystem Assisted by Cloud and Big Data\n\n，\nIEEE System Journal\n, 2015\n(\nHighly Cited Paper 2017 to 2019, Web of Science, Best Paper Award\r\n     of 2018\n)\nH. Qiu,\nM. Qiu\n, Z. Lu,\r\n     Selective encryption on ECG data in body sensor network based on\r\n     supervised machine learning.\nInformation\nFusion\n,\n55\n:\r\n     59-67 (2020)\nH. Qiu,\nM. Qiu\n, Z. Lu, and\r\n     G. Memmi, An Efficient Data Fusion Trust System in V2X Heterogeneous\r\n     Networks,\nInformation Fusion\n,\nVol. 50, No.1,\npp:\r\n     212-220, 2019\nM. Qiu\n, W. Dai, et al. Loop Parallelism\r\n     Maximization for Multimedia DSP in Mobile Vehicular Clouds,\nIEEE Transactions on Cloud Computing\n,\r\n     Vol.\n7, No. 1\n, pp. 250-258, 2019\nR. Lu, X. Jin, S. Zhang,\nM. Qiu\n,\nand\nX.\nWu, A\r\n     Study on Big-Knowledge and its Engineering issues.\nIEEE Transactions on Knowledge and\r\n     Data Engineering\n, Vol. 31, No. 9, pp. 1630-1644, Sep. 2019\nH. Qiu,\nM. Qiu\n, and R. Lu,\r\n     Secure V2X Communication Network based on Intelligent PKI and Edge\r\n     Computing, accepted by\nIEEE Networks\n, 2019\nH. Qiu,\nM. Qiu\n, Z. Lu, and\r\n     G. Memmi, Intelligent V2X Communication Technologies for Secure Mobile\r\n     Edge-based\nIIoI\n, accepted by\nIEEE Networks\n,\r\n     2019\nJ. Li,\nM. Qiu\n, Z. Ming,\r\n     G. Quan, X. Qin, and Z. Gu\n,\nOnline Optimization\r\n     for Scheduling\nPreemptable tasks on\r\n     IaaS Cloud systems,\nJournal of Parallel\r\n     and Distributed Computing (JPDC)\n, Vol. 72, No. 5, pp. 666-677, May 2012 (\nRanked\n1st of Top 25\r\n     Hottest Articles of JPDC 2012\n,\nMost\r\n     Downloaded Paper of JPDC in 2012\n, Highly Cited Paper 2018-2019\n)\nM. Qiu\n, Z. Ming, J. Li, K. Gai, and Z.\r\n     Zong, Phase-Change Memory Optimization for Green Cloud with Genetic\r\n     Algorithm,\nIEEE Transactions on\r\n     Computers\n, Vol. 64, No. 12, pp. 3528-3540, 2015 (\nHot paper, Highly Cited Paper, Web of Science, 2017-2019, Most\r\n     Influential Journal Paper Award, IEEE TCSC 2016)\nY. Li, W. Dai. Z. Ming, and\nM. Qiu\n, Privacy Protection for Preventing Data Over-Collection in\r\n     Smart City,\nIEEE Transactions on\r\n     Computers\n, Vol. 65,\nNo. 5\n, pp. 1339  1350, May 2016 (\nHighly Cited Paper 2017 to 2018, Web\r\n     of Science\n)\nM. Qiu\n, Z. Chen, Z. Ming, X. Qiu, and J.\r\n     Niu, Energy-Aware Data Allocation for Mobile Cloud\nSystems,\nIEEE System Journal\n, Vol.\r\n     11, No. 2 pp. 813-822, 2017\n(\nHighly Cited Paper 2017,\r\n     Web of Science\n)\nM. Qiu\n, Z. Ming, J. Niu, X. Qin, L.\r\n     Zhang, and L. T. Yang, \nSecurity-Aware Optimization for Ubiquitous Computing\r\n     Systems with SEAT Graph Approach\n,\nJournal of Computer and System Sciences (JCSS), Elsevier.\nVol.\r\n     79, No. 5, pp. 518  529, 2013. (\nHighly\r\n     Cited Research\nAward for 2013\r\n     to 2017\n)\nK. Gai,\nM. Qiu,\nH.\r\n     Zhao, L. Tao, and Z. Zong, Dynamic Energy-Aware Cloudlet-based Mobile\r\n     Cloud Computing Model for Green Computing,\nJournal of Network and Computer Applications (JNCA, SI Green\r\n     Computing, Elsevier), Vol. 59, No. 1, pp. 46-54,\n2016\n. (Highly cited paper 2017 to 2019,\r\n     Hottest Paper of JNCA 2016, Best Paper Award of JNCA 2018)\nK. Gai and\nM. Qiu\n, Blend\r\n     Arithmetic Operations on Tensor-based Fully Homomorphic Encryption Over Real\r\n     Numbers\n, IEEE Transactions on Industrial Informatics\n, 14(8):\r\n     3590-3598 (2018) (\nHighly Cited Paper 2019\n)\nM. Qiu\n, K. Gai, B.\nM. Thuraisingham, L. Tao, H. Zhao,\r\n     Proactive user-centric secure data scheme using attribute-based semantic\r\n     access controls for mobile clouds in financial industry.\nFuture\r\n     Generation Comp. Syst\n. 80: 421-429 (2018) (\nHighly Cited Paper 2018\r\n     and 2019\n)\nM. Qiu\n(with\nJ.\nLiu,\nJ.\nWan,\nB.\nZeng,\nQ.\nWang,\nH.\nSong ) A Scalable\nand\nQuick-response\nSoftware\nDefine\nVehicular\nNetwork\nAssisted\nby\nMobile-edge\nComputing,\nIEEE\nCommunication\nMagazine\n,\nVol. 55, No. 7,\npp. 94-100, July 2017\n(\nHighly Cited Paper 2019)\nM. Qiu\n, Z. Chen, J. Niu, Z. Zong, G.\r\n     Quan, X. Qin, and L.T. Yang, Data Allocation for Hybrid Memory with\r\n     Genetic Algorithm,\nIEEE\r\n     Transactions on\nEmerging Topics on Computing\n, Vol.\r\n     3, No. 4, pp. 544-555\n,\n2015\nJ. Wang,\nM. Qiu\n, and B. Guo, PhaseReconfigurable Shuffle Optimization\r\n     for Hadoop MapReduce\n,\nIEEE\nTransactions on Cloud Computing\n,\r\n     2015\nL. Hu,\nM. Qiu\n, J. Song, M. Hossain, and A.\nGhoneim\n,\r\n     Software Defined Healthcare Networks,\nIEEE Wireless Communication,\nVol. 22, No. 6, pp. 67-75,\n2015\n.\nY. Li, M. Chen, W.\nDai\nand\nM. Qiu\n, Energy-Aware Dynamic Task\r\n     Scheduling for Smartphones in Mobile Cloud Computing,\nIEEE System Journal\n, 2015\nA. Chavan, M. Alghamdi, X. Jiang,\r\n     Xiao. Qiu,\nM. Qiu\n, M. Jiang, J.\r\n     Zhang, TIGER: Thermal-Aware File Assignment in Storage Clusters,\nIEEE Transactions on Parallel and\r\n     Distributed Computing\n, Vol. 27, No. 2, pp. 558-573, 2016.\nM. Qiu\n, J.\r\n     Wang, Z. Ming, and Y. Xiang, Enabling Cloud Computing in Emergency\r\n     Management Systems: Design and Optimization, accepted by\nIEEE Cloud Computing Magazine\n,\nSpecial Issue on Cloud-based Smart\r\n     Evacuation Systems for Emergency Management.\n2014\nJ. Niu, C. Liu, Y. Gao,\nand\nM. Qiu\n,\n\nEnergy\r\n     Efficient Task Assignment with Guaranteed Probability Satisfying Timing\r\n     Constraints for Embedded Systems\n,\nIEEE\nTrans\nactions\non\r\n     Parallel and Distributed Computing (TPDC)\n,\nVol. 25, No. 8, pp. 2043-2052, Aug.\n20\n14\nY. Guo, Q.\nZhuge\n, J. Hu, J. Yu,\nM. Qiu\n, and E. H.-M. Sha,\n\nOptimal Data\r\n     Placement and Duplication for Embedded Multi-Core Systems with Scratch Pad\r\n     Memory\n,\nIEEE Transactions on Computer-Aided\r\n     Design of Integrated Circuits and Systems (TCAD),\nVol. 32, No. 6, pp.809-817, 2013\nJ. Li,\nM. Qiu\n,\nJ. Niu,\r\n     L. Yang, Y. Zhu, and Z. Ming,\nThermal-Aware\r\n     Task Scheduling in 3D Chip Multiprocessor with Real-Time Constrained\r\n     Workloads\n,\nin\nACM\nTran\nsactions\non\nEmbedded Computing Systems\n(T\nECS\n),\nVol. 12, No.2, Article 24, pp. 1-22,\r\n     Feb. 2013\nH. Huang, V.\nChaturvedi,\nG. Quan, J. Fan, and\nM. Qiu\n,\n\nThroughput Maximization for\r\n     Periodic Real-Time Systems under the\nMaximal Temperature\r\n     Constraint\n,\nACM\nTrans\nactions\non\nEmbedded Computing Systems\n(T\nECS\n)\n,\nVol. 13, No. 2s, Article 70, Jan. 2014\nC. Li,\nM. Chen,\nM. Qiu\n,\nA. Vasilakos, and J. Park,\nA RF4CE-based Remote Controller with\nInteractive Graphical User Interface\r\n     Applied to Home Automation System\n, in\nACM Transactions on Embedded Computing Systems (TECS),\nVol. 12, No.2, Article 30, pp. 1-19,\r\n     Feb. 2013\nM. Qiu\n,\nE\n.\nKhisamutdinov\n,\nZ. Zhao, C. Pan, J. Choi, N.\nLeontis\n,\nand\r\n     Peixuan Guo, \nRNA\r\n     Nanotechnology for Computer Design and in vivo Computation\n,\nPhilosophical Transactions of Royal Society A\n,\nSep\n,\n20\n13\nM. Qiu\n, (with\nM. Liu, S. Zhang, Z. Fan), H∞ State Estimation for\r\n     Discrete-Time Chaotic Systems Based on a Unified Model,\nin\nIEEE\r\n     Transactions on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics: Part B: Cybernetics\n,,\r\n     Vol. 42, No. 4, pp. 1053-1063, Aug. 2012\nM. Qiu\n,\n(with\nX. Zhu,\r\n     X. Qin)\n,\nQoS-Aware Fault-Tolerant Scheduling for Real-Time\r\n     Tasks on Heterogeneous Clusters\n, in\nIEEE\r\n     Transactions on Computer\ns\r\n     (TOC),\nVol. 60, No.\n6, pp.\r\n     800-812, Jun.\n2011\nM. Qiu,\nW. Gao,\r\n     M. Chen, J. Niu, and L. Zhang,\nEnergy Efficient Security Algorithm for Power Grid\r\n     Wide Area Monitoring System\n,\nin\nIEEE Transactions on Smart Grid,\nVol. 2,\r\n     No. 4, pp. 715-723, Nov. 2011\nM. Qiu\n, L. T. Yang,\nZ. Shao, and E. H.-M. Sha,\nDynamic and Leakage Energy Minimization with Soft Real-Time\r\n     Loop Scheduling and Voltage Assignment\n,\nin\nIEEE\r\n     Transactions on Very Large Scale Integration Systems (TVLSI)\n,\nVol. 18, No. 3, pp. 501-504, Mar. 2010\nH. Su,\nM. Qiu\n, and H.\r\n     Wang, \nSecure Wireless Communication System for Smart Grid\r\n     with Rechargeable Electric Vehicles\n,\nIEEE Communication Magazine\n, Vol. 50, No. 8, pp.62-68, Aug.\r\n     2012\n.\nM. Qiu\n, H. Su, M. Chen, Z. Ming, and L.\r\n     T. Yang, \nBalance of Security Strength and Energy for a PMU\r\n     Monitoring System in Smart Grid\n,\nIEEE\r\n     Communication Magazine\n, Vol. 50, No. 5, pp.142-149, May 2012\nM. Nijim, X. Qin,\nM. Qiu\n,\r\n     and K. Li, An adaptive energy-conserving strategy for parallel disk\r\n     systems, in\nFuture Generation\r\n     Computer Systems: The Int'l Journal of Grid Computing,\nVol.\r\n     29, pp. 196-207, 2013\nM. Qiu\n,  Z. Jia,\r\n     C.\nXue\n, Z. Shao and E. H.-M. Sha,\nVoltage Assignment with Guaranteed Probability\r\n     Satisfying Timing Constraint for Real-time\nMultiproceesor\nDSP,\nin\nJournal\r\n     of VLSI Signal Processing Systems (JSPS)\n, Vol. 46, No. 1, pp. 55-73,\r\n     Jan. 2007\nJ. Li, Z. Ming,\nM. Qiu,\nG. Quan, X. Qin, and T. Chen,\nResource\r\n     Allocation Robustness in Multi-Core Embedded Systems with Inaccurate\r\n     Information\n, in\nJournal of\r\n     System Architecture (JSA),\nElsevier\n,\npublished online, Apr\n.\r\n     2011.\nM. Qiu\n,   (with\r\n     Z. Shao, C.\nXue\n, Q.\nZhuge\n,\r\n       B. Xiao and E. H.-M. Sha),\nSecurity Protection and Checking for Embedded System\r\n     Integration Against Buffer Overflow Attacks via Hardware/Software\nin\nIEEE Transactions on Computers\n(TOC),\nvol. 55, no. 4, pp. 443-453, Apr. 2006\nF. Hu, S. Lakdawala, Q. Hao\r\n     and\nM. Qiu\n,\nLow-Power, Low-cost Sensor Hardware Interface for\r\n     Wireless Telecardiology Data Pre-Processing,\nin\nIEEE\r\n     Transactions on Information Technology in Biomedicine,\nVol. 13, No. 4,\npp. 656-663, Jul. 2009\nM. Qiu\n,   M. Guo,\r\n     M. Liu, C.\nXue\n, L. T. Yang, and E. H.-M. Sha,\nLoop Scheduling and Bank Type Assignment for Heterogeneous\r\n     Multi-Bank Memory\n, in\nJournal of Parallel and\r\n     Distributed Computing (JPDC)\nVol. 69, No. 3, pp 546-558, Mar. 2009\nM. Qiu\n,   E.\r\n     H.-M. Sha, M. Liu, M. Lin, S. Hua and L. T. Yang,\nEnergy Minimization with Loop Fusion and\r\n     Multi-Functional-Unit Scheduling for Multidimensional DSP,\nin\nJourn...[truncated]