    "homepage_text": "Ke Liang - Homepage\nAbout\nNews\nPublications\nServices\nKe Liang\nAssistant Professor\nPRMI Group\nCollege of Computer Science and Technology\nNational University of Defense Technology (NUDT)\nEmail:\nliangke200694@126.com\nliangke200694@gmail.com\nAddress:\nDeya Road, Changsha, Hunan Province, P.R. China.\n[\nGitHub\n][\nGoogle Scholar\n][\nDBLP\n][\nWeChat\n]\nAbout Me:\nKe Liang received the Ph.D. degree from\nNational University of Defense Technology (NUDT)\nadvised by\nProf. Xinwang Liu\n.\n\tPrior to joining NUDT, he was advised by\nProf. Sharon Huang\nas a Research Support and a PhD student at College of Information Sciences and Technology in\nPennsylvania State University (PSU)\nfor 2 years from 2020.\n\tMeanwhile, he received Master of Science degree under the supervision of\nProf. Gang Tan\nmajored in Computer Science and Engneering at PSU. Before that, he got his bachelor's degree at\nBeihang University (BUAA)\n. Track records for all have been proven excellent.\nResearch Interests:\nGraph Learning, Knowledge Representation and Reasoning, Multi-view Clustering\nNews:\n[\n2026.02\n]\nHonor to serve as the Area Chair for\nACM MM 2026\n.\n[\n2026.02\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering (IEEE T-KDE)\n.\n[\n2026.02\n]\nAwarded 2025 Chinese Association for Artificial Intelligence (CAAI) Outstanding Doctoral Dissertation.\n[\n2026.01\n]\nHonor to serve as the Area Chair for\nIJCNN 2026\n.\n[\n2026.01\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nTheWebConf 2026\n.\n[\n2026.01\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nArtificial Intelligence (AIJ)\n.\n[\n2025.12\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (IEEE T-PAMI)\n.\n[\n2025.11\n]\nHonor to serve as the Area Chair for\nICML 2026\n.\n[\n2025.11\n]\nHonor to serve as the Area Chair for\nICASSP 2026\n.\n[\n2025.11\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Computational Biology and Bioinformatics (IEEE T-CBB)\n.\n[\n2025.11\n]\nSeven papers have been accepted by\nAAAI 2026\n.\n[\n2025.10\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (IEEE T-NNLS)\n.\n[\n2025.09\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (IEEE T-NNLS)\n.\n[\n2025.09\n]\nAwarded 2025 CCF Scientific and Technological Achievement Award\nFirst Prize\nin Natural Science.\n[\n2025.09\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (IEEE T-PAMI)\n.\n[\n2025.09\n]\nThree papers have been accepted by\nNeurIPS 2025\n.\n[\n2025.09\n]\nHonor to serve as the Associate Editor in the Editorial Board for\nPattern Recognition\n.\n[\n2025.09\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering (IEEE T-KDE)\n.\n[\n2025.09\n]\nHonor to serve as the Area Chair for\nICLR 2025\n.\n[\n2025.09\n]\nHonor to serve as the Area Chair for\nCVPR 2025\n.\n[\n2025.08\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nThe Chinese Journal of Computers\n.\n[\n2025.08\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nEMNLP 2025 Main Track\n.\n[\n2025.08\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (IEEE T-PAMI)\n.\n[\n2025.07\n]\nOur Survey (IEEE T-PAMI 2024) paper is featured as a\nESI Highly Cited Paper\n.\n[\n2025.07\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (IEEE T-NNLS)\n.\n[\n2025.07\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering (IEEE T-KDE)\n.\n[\n2025.07\n]\nTwo papers have been accepted by\nACM MM 2025\n.\n[\n2025.06\n]\nAwarded the Outstanding Poster Award @\nThe 1st CCF-AI China Graph Machine Learning\n.\n[\n2025.06\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (IEEE T-NNLS)\n.\n[\n2025.06\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (IEEE T-PAMI)\n.\n[\n2025.06\n]\nHonor to serve as the Area Chair for\nIEEE DSAA 2025\n.\n[\n2025.06\n]\nAwarded the Outstanding Graduates of Hunan Province.\n[\n2025.06\n]\nHonor to serve as the Area Editor in the Editorial Board for\nInformation Fusion\n.\n[\n2025.05\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Image Processing (IEEE T-IP)\n.\n[\n2025.05\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nKDD 2025\n.\n[\n2025.05\n]\nFive paper has been accepted by\nICML 2025\n.\n[\n2025.04\n]\nTwo paper has been accepted by\nIJCAI 2025\n.\n[\n2025.04\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nExpert Systems With Applications (ESWA)\n.\n[\n2025.03\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia (IEEE T-MM)\n.\n[\n2025.03\n]\nOur Survey (IEEE T-PAMI 2024) paper is featured as a\nESI Hot Paper\n.\n[\n2025.03\n]\nOur S2T (IEEE T-NNLS 2024) paper is featured as a\nESI Highly Cited Paper\n.\n[\n2025.03\n]\nHonor to serve as the Area Chair for\nACM MM 2025\n.\n[\n2025.02\n]\nThree papers have been accepted by\nCVPR 2025\n.\n[\n2025.01\n]\nHonor to serve as the Area Chair for Applied Data Science Track of\nECML-PKDD 2025\n.\n[\n2025.01\n]\nHonor to serve as the Session Co-Chair for\nACAIT 2025\n.\n[\n2024.12\n]\nAwarded the Outstanding Graduates of NUDT (Only 5 Ph.D. Students in Total).\n[\n2024.12\n]\nHonor to serve as the Senior Program Committee Member for\nIJCAI 2025\n.\n[\n2024.12\n]\nHonor to serve as the Area Chair for\nIJCNN 2025\n.\n[\n2024.12\n]\nTwo papers have been accepted by\nAAAI 2025\n.\n[\n2024.12\n]\nAwarded China National Scholarship.\n[\n2024.11\n]\nSuccessfully passed Ph.D. dissertation defense titled\nResearch on Graph Representation Learning Methods for Knowledge Graph Reasoning\n[moments]\n\".\n[\n2024.10\n]\nTalk on \"\nStructural Knowledge Representation and Reasoning\n\" PhD. Workshop, The 7th Chinese Conference on Pattern Recognition and Computer Vision PRCV 2024.\n[\n2024.10\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering (IEEE T-KDE)\n.\n[\n2024.09\n]\nTwo papers have been accepted by\nNeurIPS 2024\n.\n[\n2024.09\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nBriefings in Bioinformatics (BIB)\n.\n[\n2024.09\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering (IEEE T-KDE)\n.\n[\n2024.08\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia (IEEE T-MM)\n.\n[\n2024.07\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nVLDB 2024: PhD Workshop\n.\n[\n2024.07\n]\nTwo papers have been accepted by\nACM MM 2024\n.\n[\n2024.07\n]\nOur KGE-SymCL (IEEE T-KDE 2023) paper is featured as a\nESI Highly Cited Paper\n.\n[\n2024.06\n]\nTalk on \"\nBetter Learning from Graph Structures: Research on Representation Learning for Knowledge Graph Reasoning\n\" 26th MLNLP 2024 Academic Workshop, Online, Organized by MLNLP.\n[\n2024.06\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (IEEE T-PAMI)\n.\n[\n2024.05\n]\nAwarded the\nSecond Prize of Outstanding College Student Academic Show\nCCF Young Elite Forum (YEF) 2024\n.\n[\n2024.05\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Fuzzy Systems (IEEE T-FS)\n.\n[\n2024.04\n]\nTalk on \"\nTemporal Graph Clustering\n\" Temporal Graph Reading Group, Online, Organized by McGill University & Mila.\n[\n2024.04\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (IEEE T-NNLS)\n.\n[\n2024.03\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nICME 2024\n.\n[\n2024.02\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nBriefings in Bioinformatics (BIB)\n.\n[\n2024.02\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nCVPR 2024\n.\n[\n2024.02\n]\nAwarded the Annual Advanced Student Award of the School.\n[\n2024.01\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nICLR 2024\n.\n[\n2024.01\n]\nOne paper has been accepted by\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (IEEE T-NNLS)\n.\n[\n2023.12\n]\nTwo papers have been accepted by\nAAAI 2