Embedding\nWenzheng Jiang,\nKe Liang*\n, Wenke Huang, Xiongtao Zhang, Zhenxing Xu, Guancheng Wan, Cheston Tan, Flint Xiaofeng Fan, Ji Wang.\nThe Web Conference 2026 (WWW 26).\n[Paper]\n2025\nT-PAMI\nFrom Concrete to Abstract: Multi-view Clustering on Relational Knowledge\nKe Liang\n, Lingyuan Meng, Hao Li, Jun Wang, Long Lan, Miaomiao Li, Xinwang Liu, Huaimin Wang.\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (IEEE T-PAMI).\n[Paper]\nT-MM\nMGKsite: Multi-Modal Knowledge-Driven Site Selection via Intra and Inter-Modal Graph Fusion\nKe Liang\n, Lingyuan Meng, Hao Li, Meng Liu, Siwei Wang, Sihang Zhou, Xinwang Liu, Kunlun He.\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia (IEEE T-MM).\n[Paper]\nT-IP\nEyes on Islanded Nodes: Better Reasoning via Structure Augmentation and Feature Co-Training on Bi-level Knowledge Graphs\nHao Li,\nKe Liang*\n, Wenjing Yang, Lingyuan Meng, Yaohua Wang, Sihang Zhou, Xinwang Liu.\nIEEE Transactions on Image Processing (IEEE T-IP).\n[Paper]\nT-NNLS\nKnowledge Graph Reasoning Based on Information Enhancement and Subgraph Alignment\nMiaomiao Li,\nKe Liang*\n, Yuping Lai, Xinwang Liu.\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (IEEE T-NNLS).\n[Paper]\nNeurIPS\nSAINT: Sequence-Aware Integration for Spatial Transcriptomics Multi-View Clustering\nZeyu Zhu,\nKe Liang*\n, Lingyuan Meng, Meng Liu, Suyuan Liu, Renxiang Guan, Miaomiao Li, Wanwei Liu, Xinwang Liu.\nThe Thirty-Ninth Annual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS 25).\n[Paper]\nICML\nFlow Matching for Denoised Social Recommendation\nYinxuan Huang,\nKe Liang*\n, Jingao Xu, Zhuofan Dong, Xiaodong Qu, Yue Han, Wang Tianxiang, Bin Zhou, Ye Wang.\nThe 42nd International Conference on Machine Learning (ICML 2025).\n[Paper]\nIJCAI\nFS-KEN: Few-shot Knowledge Graph Reasoning by Adversarial Negative Enhancing\nLingyuan Meng,\nKe Liang*\n, Zeyu Zhu, Xinwang Liu.\nThe 34th International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI 25).\n[Paper]\nACM MM