    "homepage_text": "Home - Liu Group - The University of Chicago\nHit enter to search or ESC to close\nThe University of Chicago\nLiu Group\nWelcome to Liu Group! We are an interdisciplinary research group in the Pritzker School of Molecular Engineering at the University of Chicago. Our research focuses on design and synthesis of functional materials as well as development of advanced tools to address the challenges in water-energy nexus.\nWe have two postdoc openings. Please send your CV to chongliu_AT_uchicago.edu\nJoin Us\nOur Research\nGroup Photo\nGroup photo taken on May 30 2025 at Main Quad\nOpenings\nPostdoctoral Researchers\nThe Liu Group is currently seeking motivated and talented scientists and engineers to join the group immediately\n. Candidates with backgrounds in Materials Science, Chemical Engineering, Chemistry, Physics, and other related fields are encouraged to apply.\nDesirable research experience:\nBattery/Electrocatalysis (solid state chemistry)\nSynchrotron characterization\nSemiconductor or 2D materials\nDevice Fabrication\nPlease send your CV to\nchongliu_AT_uchicago.edu\nGraduate Students\nProspective graduate students from U Chicago’s graduate programs are welcome to join our group.\nOur Research\nWe study and solve issues in energy, environment, and health.\nLearn More\nChong Liu Office:\n5640 South Ellis Avenue, ERC 387\nChicago, IL 60637\n[email protected]\nLab Address:\nKovler Lab\n910 E 58th St, Chicago, IL 60637\nCopyright © Liu Group. All rights reserved.\nHome\nResearch\nPublications\nTeam\nContact Us\nLiu Group"
  },
  "deep_homepage::Jue Wang::https://juewang.me/": {
