    "homepage_text": "Zichuan Liu\nZichuan Liu  | 刘子川\nHi! I am with Apple AIML. I completed my master at\nNanjing University\n,\n                \t supervised by Prof.\nChunlin Chen\n, and I am privileged to work closely with Dr.\nWei Cheng\nand A/Prof.\nDongsheng Luo\n, et.al.\nI have also spent time at\nMicrosoft Research\n, advised by Dr.\nLei Song\nand managed by Dr.\nJiang Bian\n.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBefore that, I was a research intern at\nDAMO Academy\nof Alibaba Group, \n                \t advised by Dr.\nQingsong Wen\n. \n                \t Previously, I completed my B.S. in Computer Science at\nWuhan University of Technology\n,  working with A/Prof.\nRui Zhang\n.\nMy research interests focus on Reinforcement Learning, eXplainable Artificial Intelligence, and Trustworthy LLMs,  \n                \t especially with applications in multiple sequences, offline models, and dynamic environments, allowing them to explicitly adapt to non-stationary task distributions in real-world. For your information, please see my\nresearch statement\n.\nEmail\n/\nCV\n/\nGoogle Scholar\n/\nGithub\n/\nTwitter\n/\nLinkedin\nInvited Talk\n\"Perturbation-based Techniques for Explaining Sequence Predictions\", April, 2024. See\nThis Slide\n.\n\"Interpretable and Efficient Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning\", February, 2024. See\nThis Slide\n.\nResearch\nExperience\nApple AIML\n2025.07 - Present\nMachine Learning Engineer\n, Full-Time.\nMilestones: TODO\nMicrosoft Research Asia\n2024.10 - 2025.06\nResearch Intern\nat Industry Innovation Center\nMilestones:\nICLR'25\n, Arxiv'25a, Arxiv'25b.\nResearch Advisor: Dr.\nLei Song\n, working closely with Dr.\nWei Cheng\nMicrosoft Research Asia\n2023.11 - 2024.05\nResearch Intern\nat Machine Learning Group\nMilestones:\nICML'24a\n,\nICML'24b\n,\nNeurIPS'24\n,\nArXiv'24\n,\nCoG'24\nResearch Advisor: Dr.\nLei Song\nand Dr.\nJiang Bian\nAlibaba DAMO Academy\n&\nAlibaba Cloud\n2023.06 - 2023.11\nResearch Intern\nMilestones:\nICLR'24\n,\nCIKM'24\nResearch Advisor: Dr.\nQingsong Wen\nNanjing University\n2022.09 - Present\nM.S. in Electronic Engineering\nMilestones:\nICML'23\n,\nTPAMI'25\n,\nArXiv'23\nGPA: 89.38/100, Supervisor: Prof.\nChunlin Chen\nWuhan University of Technology\n2018.09 - 2022.06\nB.S. in Computer Science\nMilestones:\nIEEE TNSE\n,\nSIGSPATIAL'21\nGPA: 91.10/100, Advisor: A/Prof.\nRui Zhang\nService\nReviewer, Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS), Position and DataBase Track, 2025.\nReviewer, International Conference on Machine Learning  (ICML), Main and Position Track, 2025.\nReviewer, International Conference on Artificial Intelligence and Statistics  (AISTATS), 2025.\nReviewer, International Conference on Learning Representations  (ICLR), 2025.\nReviewer, Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS), 2024.\nReviewer, IEEE Transactions on Network Science and Engineering (TNSE), 2022.\nExternal reviewer, International Conference on Artificial Neural Networks (ICANN), 2022.\nExternal reviewer, IEEE Transactions on Computational Social Systems (TCSS), 2022.\nWebsite template from\nJon Barron\n.   Last updated: July, 2025"
  },
