  "deep_homepage::Dingli Yu::https://dingliyu.net/": {
    "homepage": "https://dingliyu.net/",
    "all_emails": [
      "dingliy@cs.princeton",
      "dingliyu@gmail.com",
      "leo.dingliyu@gmail.com",
      "blog@wordpress.com"
    ],
    "matched_email": null,
    "github": null,
    "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/dingli-yu-3b5b01143/",
    "homepage_text": "Dingli Yu\nSkip to content\nView menu\nView sidebar\nDingli Yu\nFacebook\nLinkedIn\nSearch\nSearch for:\nDingli Yu\nMember of Technical Staff at OpenAI\nEmail: leo [dot] dingliyu [at] gmail [dot] com\n[\nGoogle Scholar\n]\nAbout\nI am a researcher at OpenAI, working on large language model research and development, with a focus on synthetic data generation.\nPreviously, I worked as a researcher at Microsoft where I participated in the development of Phi-4. I completed my Ph.D.\nof\nComputer Science\nat\nPrinceton University, supervised by\nSanjeev Arora\n. We worked at the intersects of deep learning theory and practices, including optimization and evaluation of large models.\nBefore that, I was a\nYao Class\nstudent studying Computer Science at\nInstitute for Interdisciplinary Information Science\n, Tsinghua University.\nI participated in algorithmic programming competitions during high school and college, and won gold medals at the IOI and the ACM-ICPC World Finals.\nPublications\nNews\nI joined\nOpenAI\nin Feb. 2025.\nThree\npapers accepted by\nNeurIPS 2024\n!\nDepth-µP\nand\nSkill-Mix\nare accepted by\nICLR 2024\n!\nWe release\nSkill-Mix\n, a new type of evaluation of LLMs on their capability to\ncombine\nbasic\nskills\n. (See\nthe demo here\n.) Skill-Mix resists\ndata contaminations\nand can detect “\ncramming for leaderboard\n“! We also find GPT-4 is\nbeyond “stochastic parrot”\nbehavior based on its good performance on Skill-Mix!\nTensor Program VI is\nhere\n! Our new parametrization, Depth-µP, can scale up networks to\ninfinite depth!\nYou also get\nhyperparameter transfer\nfor free, meaning using Depth-µP,\noptimal hyperparameters in a shallow network also work for a deep network.\nDingli Yu\nSign up\nLog in\nCopy shortlink\nReport this content\nManage subscriptions\n\n---\n\nContact | Dingli Yu\nSkip to content\nView menu\nView sidebar\nDingli Yu\nFacebook\nLinkedIn\nSearch\nSearch for:\nContact\nThis is a contact page with some basic contact information and a contact form.\n← Back\nThank you for your response. ✨\nName\n(required)\nEmail\n(required)\nWebsite\nComment\n(required)\nSubmit\nΔ\nLike\nLoading...\nDingli Yu\nSign up\nLog in\nCopy shortlink\nReport this content\nManage subscriptions\n%d\n\n---\n\nContact | Dingli Yu\nSkip to content\nView menu\nView sidebar\nDingli Yu\nFacebook\nLinkedIn\nSearch\nSearch for:\nContact\nThis is a contact page with some basic contact information and a contact form.\n← Back\nThank you for your response. ✨\nName\n(required)\nEmail\n(required)\nWebsite\nComment\n(required)\nSubmit\nΔ\nLike\nLoading...\nDingli Yu\nSign up\nLog in\nCopy shortlink\nReport this content\nManage subscriptions\n%d\n\n---\n\nAbout | Dingli Yu\nSkip to content\nView menu\nView sidebar\nDingli Yu\nFacebook\nLinkedIn\nSearch\nSearch for:\nAbout\nSend me an email:\ndingliy [at] cs [dot] princeton [dot] edu\nLeo.DingliYu [at] gmail [dot] com\nLike\nLoading...\nDingli Yu\nSign up\nLog in\nCopy shortlink\nReport this content\nManage subscriptions\n%d\n\n---\n\nAbout | Dingli Yu\nSkip to content\nView menu\nView sidebar\nDingli Yu\nFacebook\nLinkedIn\nSearch\nSearch for:\nAbout\nSend me an email:\ndingliy [at] cs [dot] princeton [dot] edu\nLeo.DingliYu [at] gmail [dot] com\nLike\nLoading...\nDingli Yu\nSign up\nLog in\nCopy shortlink\nReport this content\nManage subscriptions\n%d\n\n---\n\nAbout | Dingli Yu\nSkip to content\nView menu\nView sidebar\nDingli Yu\nFacebook\nLinkedIn\nSearch\nSearch for:\nAbout\nSend me an email:\ndingliy [at] cs [dot] princeton [dot] edu\nLeo.DingliYu [at] gmail [dot] com\nLike\nLoading...\nDingli Yu\nSign up\nLog in\nCopy shortlink\nReport this content\nManage subscriptions\n%d\n\n---\n\nCV | Dingli Yu\nSkip to content\nView menu\nView sidebar\nDingli Yu\nFacebook\nLinkedIn\nSearch\nSearch for:\nNovember 26, 2017\nby\nleodingliyu\nCV\nLeave a comment\nCV\nLeave a comment\nCancel reply\nΔ\nComment\nDingli Yu\nSign up\nLog in\nCopy shortlink\nReport this content\nManage subscriptions\n\n---\n\nCV | Dingli Yu\nSkip to content\nView menu\nView sidebar\nDingli Yu\nFacebook\nLinkedIn\nSearch\nSearch for:\nNovember 26, 2017\nby\nleodingliyu\nCV\nLeave a comment\nCV\nLeave a comment\nCancel reply\nΔ\nComment\nDingli Yu\nSign up\nLog in\nCopy shortlink\nReport this content\nManage subscriptions"
