    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Shuhui Wang's Homepage - Full Professor at Institute of Computing Technology, Chinese Academy of Sciences\nShuhui Wang's Homepage\nFull Professor at Institute of Computing Technology, Chinese Academy of Sciences\n0%\nWelcome to Shuhui Wang's Homepage!\nPosted on\n2023-03-21\nEdited on\n2023-04-03\nWelcome\nShuhui Wang is a professor in the Institute of Computing Technology, Chinese Academy of Sciences. He received his bachelor degree from Tsinghua University in 2006 and Ph.D degree from the Institute of Computing Technology, Chinese Academy of Sciences. He has authored or coauthored more than 80 academic papers in prestigious international journals, such as TPAMI, TIP, TKDE, TMM and top-level international conferences, such as NeurIPS, CVPR, ICCV, ECCV, ACMMM, SIGMOD, VLDB. He is the reviewer of various international journals and conferences. He has served as area chair for ACM Multimedia many times and participanted in the organization of many international conferences.\nHis research areas include cross-media analytics and trustable machine learning.\nInternship and Graduate Students (both Ph.D. and Master) Opening\n: If you are interested in doing research on\ncross-media analytics, trustable machine learning and computer vision\n, please send detailed CV to me.\nRecent News\nNEW\n2023.03\n: One paper is accepted by IEEE TPAMI. Congratulations to all!\nNEW\n2022.07\n: Five papers are accepted by ACM MM’22. Congratulations!\n2022.06\n: One paper is accepted by ECCV’22. Congratulations to all!\n2022.03\n: Three papers are accepted by CVPR’22. Congratulations to all!\nEducation\n2006.09 – 2012.07, Ph.D. in Computer Application, Institute of Computing Technology, Chinese Academy of Sciences\n2002.09 – 2006.07, B.S. in Electronic Engeering, Tsinghua University\nWork Experience\n2020.09 – present, Institute of Computing Technology, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Professor\n2015.09 – 2020.09, Institute of Computing Technology, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Associate Professor\n2014.10 – 2015.09, Institute of Computing Technology, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Assistant Professor\n2012.08 – 2014.10, Institute of Computing Technology, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Post-Doctoral Fellow\nTable of Contents\nOverview\nShuhui Wang\nFull Professor,\nInstitute of Computing Technology, Chinese Academy of Sciences\nEmail:wangshuhui AT ict.ac.cn\nE-Mail\nDBLP\nGoogleScholar"
  },
  "deep_homepage::Anqi Liu::https://anqiliu-ai.github.io/": {
    "homepage": "https://anqiliu-ai.github.io/",
