    "homepage_text": "Namhoon Lee\nNamhoon Lee\nnamhoon.lee [at] postech.ac.kr\nI am an Associate Professor of\nCSE\nand\nAI\nat\nPOSTECH\nwhere I lead the\nComputational Optimization Lab\n.\n            Previously, I received my PhD from\nOxford University\n.\nI am interested in optimization for large-scale machine learning.\nProspective students:\nPlease check the\nhiring page\nfor more information.\nNews\nMar 2026\nSelected for the \"Early-Career Researcher Infrastructure Support\" Program (Advanced Infrastructure Track).\n            We have secured 500 million KRW to establish cutting-edge research facilities, fostering global research excellence and expanding shared infrastructure opportunities."
