    "homepage_text": "Wenxuan Wang\nHOME\nPUBLICATION\nTEAM\nABOUT\nBACK TO TOP\nWenxuan Wang 王文轩\nAssistant Professor in Computer Science@Renmin University of China\nI am extremely outgoing. Please feel free to reach me at:\nEmail\n:\njwxwang@gmail.com\n|\nGoogle Scholar\n|\nLinkedin\n| \n                    |\nGitHub\n|\nTwitter\n｜\nI am an assistant professor in the Computer Science Department at Renmin University of China (\nRUC\n). My research interest lies in the\nLarge Language Models, Multimodal Large Models, and LLM Agents\n.\nBefore joining Renmin University of China, I was a PostDoc Fellow at Hong Kong University of Science and Technology (\nHKUST\n), working with Prof.\nShuai Wang\n. I obtained my Ph.D. from the Chinese University of Hong Kong (\nCUHK\n) in 2024, advised by Prof.\nMichael R. Lyu\n. I obtained my B.Sc. from Huazhong University of Science and Technology (\nHUST\n).\nI was a research intern at\nTencent AI Lab\n, working closely with Dr.\nWenxiang Jiao\nand Dr.\nZhaopeng Tu\n, and a visiting Ph.D. student at\nUCLA\n, working with Prof.\nNanyun Violet Peng\n.\nNews\n[Jan. 2026]\nTwo papers are accepted to\nICLR'26\n!\n[Dec. 2025]\nOne paper is accepted to\nUSENIX Security'26\n!\n[Dec. 2025]\nOne paper is accepted to\nICSE'26\n!\n[Nov. 2025]\nThree papers are accepted to\nAAAI'26\n, with one selected as an\nOral\n!\n[Sep. 2025]\nFive papers are accepted to\nNeurIPS'25\n, with one selected as an\nSpotlight\n!\n[Sep. 2025]\nOne papers is accepted to\nSP'25\n!\n[Aug. 2025]\nFive papers are accepted to\nEMNLP'25\n, with one nominated\nBest Paper Award\nand one\nOral\n!\n[Aug. 2025]\nTwo papers are accepted to\nASE'25\n!\n[Jun. 2025]\nOne paper is accepted to\nACM MM'25\nand selected as an\nORAL\n!\n[May. 2025]\nFive papers are accepted to\nACL'25\n!\n[May. 2025]\nOne paper is accepted to\nKDD'25\n!\n[May. 2025]\nOne paper is accepted to\nICML'25\n!\n[Mar. 2025]\nOne paper is accepted to\nFSE'25\n!\n[Jan. 2025]\nOne paper is accepted to\nICLR'25\n!\n---- show more ----\n[Sep. 2024]\nOne paper is accepted to\nNeurIPS'24\n!\n[Sep. 2024]\nTwo papers are accepted to\nEMNLP'24\n!\n[Jul. 2024]\nOne paper is accepted to\nACMMM'24\nand selected as an\nORAL\n!\n[May. 2024]\nOne paper is accepted to\nACL'24\n!\n[Jan. 2024]\nTwo papers are accepted to\nICLR'24\n! Our\nPsychoBench\nwill have an\nORAL\npresentation.\n[Dec. 2023]\nOne paper is accepted to\nFSE'23\n!\n[Oct. 2023]\nOne paper is accepted to\nFindings of EMNLP'23\n!\n[Jul. 2023]\nOne paper is accepted to\nISSTA'23\n!\n[Jul. 2023]\nOne paper is accepted to\nASE'23\n!\n[Feb. 2023]\nOne paper is accepted to\nCVPR'23\n!\n[Dec. 2022]\nOne paper is accepted to\nICSE'23\n!\n[Sep. 2022]\nWe win the first place in\nWMT'22: Large-Scale Machine Translation Evaluation for African Languages\n!\n[May. 2022]\nOne paper is accepted to\nACL'22\n!\n[Apr. 2022]\nOne paper is accepted to\nISSTA'22\n!\nTeaching\nTeaching Assistant\nof AIST1001: Introduction to Artificial Intelligence.\nContact\nRoom 205A\nWing Building of Science and Technology\nRenmin University of China\nBeijing, P. R. China\nWebsite design\n:\n✩\n\n---\n\nWenxuan Wang\nHOME\nPUBLICATION\nTEAM\nABOUT\nBACK TO TOP\nWenxuan Wang 王文轩\nAssistant Professor in Computer Science@Renmin University of China\nI am extremely outgoing. Please feel free to reach me at:\nEmail\n:\njwxwang@gmail.com\nI enjoy sports, travel, and music.\nSports\nI play sports. I have played for the school sports team since I was 7 years old.\nI won the championship with my excellent teammates in Beijing 101 Middle School (high school), Huazhong University of Science and Technology (undergrad), and Hong Kong University Basketball League (PhD).\nMusic\nI am a big fan of JJ Lin (林俊杰). I used to be a fan of MayDay (五月天).\n\n---\n\nWenxuan Wang\nHOME\nPUBLICATION\nTEAM\nABOUT\nBACK TO TOP\nWenxuan Wang 王文轩\nAssistant Professor in Computer Science@Renmin University of China\nI am extremely outgoing. Please feel free to reach me at:\nEmail\n:\njwxwang@gmail.com\nI enjoy sports, travel, and music.\nSports\nI play sports. I have played for the school sports team since I was 7 years old.\nI won the championship with my excellent teammates in Beijing 101 Middle School (high school), Huazhong University of Science and Technology (undergrad), and Hong Kong University Basketball League (PhD).\nMusic\nI am a big fan of JJ Lin (林俊杰). I used to be a fan of MayDay (五月天)."
  },
