    "homepage_text": "Mingquan Ye\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nMingquan Ye\nEmail: mingquanleaf at gmail.com\nI am a postdoctoral researcher at UCSC, hosted by Prof. Vaggos Chatziafratis. I received my Ph.D. from UIC under the supervision of Prof. Xiaorui Sun. My research interests are in theoretical computer science, with a focus on graph algorithms, combinatorial optimization, and spectral graph theory.\nPublication\nO(\\log n)-Approximation Algorithms for Bipartiteness Ratio\nwith Tasuku Soma, Yuichi Yoshida\nIPCO 2026\nEfficient Asynchronize Stochastic Gradient Algorithm with Structured Data\nwith Zhizhou Sha, Zhao Song\nICLR 2025 FPI Workshop\nEfficient Alternating Minimization with Applications to Weighted Low Rank Approximation\nwith Zhao Song, Junze Yin, Lichen Zhang\nICLR 2025\nHigh-Accuracy Multicommodity Flows via Iterative Refinement\nwith Li Chen\nICALP 2024\nA Nearly-Optimal Bound for Fast Regression with \\ell_\\infty Guarantee\nwith Zhao Song, Junze Yin, Lichen Zhang\nICML 2023\nUniversally-Optimal Distributed Shortest Paths and Transshipment via Graph-Based\n\\ell_\n1-Oblivious Routing\nwith Goramoz Goranci, Bernhard Haeupler, Xiaorui Sun, Goran Zuzic\nSODA 2022\nMinor Sparsifiers and the Distributed Laplacian Paradigm\nwith Sebastian Forster, Gramoz Goranci, Yang P. Liu, Richard Peng, Xiaorui Sun\nFOCS 2021\nOn Geometric Alignment in Low Doubling Dimension\nHu Ding, Mingquan Ye\nAAAI 2019\nOnline Visual Tracking via Coupled Object-Context Dictionary\nMingquan Ye, Hong Chang, Xilin Chen\nBMVC 2015\nService\nReviewer: SODA 2021, ESA 2022, ESA 2023, NeurIPS 2023, SODA 2024, ITCS 2024, ICLR 2024, ICML 2024, ICALP 2024, FOCS 2024, ESA 2024, SODA 2025, ICLR 2025\nPC Member: AAAI 2025\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nReport abuse"
  },
