Automation Letters\n(RA-L)\n2022\nInternational Conference on Intelligent Robots and Systems\n(IROS)\n2022\n[\nproject\n]\n[\npaper\n]\n[\ncode\n]\n[\nvideo\n]\n[\nslides\n]\nDexMV: Imitation Learning for Dexterous Manipulation from Human Videos\nYuzhe Qin*\n, Yueh-Hua Wu*, Shaowei Liu, Hanwen Jiang, Ruihan Yang,\n                  Yang Fu, Xiaolong Wang\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision\n(ECCV)\n2022\n[\nproject\n]\n[\npaper\n]\n[\ncode\n]\n[\nvideo\n]\nVision-Guided Quadrupedal Locomotion in the Wild with Multi-Modal Delay Randomization\nChieko Sarah Imai*, Minghao Zhang*, Yuchen Zhang*, Marcin Kierebiński,\nRuihan Yang,\nYuzhe Qin\n, Xiaolong Wang\nInternational Conference on Intelligent Robots and Systems\n(IROS)\n2022\n[\nproject\n]\n[\npaper\n]\n[\ncode\n]\n[\nvideo\n]\nO2O-Afford: Annotation-Free Large-Scale Object-Object Affordance Learning\nKaichun Mo,\nYuzhe Qin\n, Fanbo Xiang, Hao Su and Leonidas J.\n                  Guibas\nConference of Robot Learning\n(CoRL)\n2021\n[\nproject\n]\n[\npaper\n]\n[\ncode\n]\n[\nvideo\n]\nOCRTOC: A Cloud-Based Competition and Benchmark for Robotic\n                    Grasping and Manipulation\nZiyuan Liu, Wei Liu,\nYuzhe Qin\n, Fanbo Xiang, Songyan Xin, Maximo A\n                  Roa,\nBerk Calli, Hao Su, Yu Sun, Ping Tan\nIEEE Robotics and Automation Letters\n(RA-L)\n2021\n[\nwebsite\n]\n[\npaper\n]\n[\ncode\n]\n[\nvideo\n]\nCAPTRA: CAtegory-level Pose Tracking for Rigid and Articulated Objects from Point\n                    Clouds\nYijia Weng*, He Wang*, Qiang Zhou,\nYuzhe Qin\n, Yueqi Duan, Qingnan\n                  Fan,\nBaoquan Chen, Hao Su, Leonidas J. Guibas\nInternational Conference on Computer Vision\n(ICCV)\n2021\n(Oral)\n[\nproject\n]\n[\npaper\n]\n[\ncode\n]\n[\nvideo\n]\nSAPIEN: A SimulAted Part-based Interactive ENvironment\nFanbo Xiang,\nYuzhe Qin\n,\n                  Kaichun Mo, Yikuan Xia, Hao Zhu, Fangchen Liu, Minghua Liu,\nHanxiao Jiang,\n                  Yifu Yuan, He Wang, Li Yi, Angel X.Chang, Leonidas J. Guibas and Hao Su\nConference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(CVPR)\n2020\n(Oral)\n[\nproject\n]\n[\npaper\n]\n[\ncode\n]\n[\nvideo\n]\nComposing Task-Agnostic Policies with Deep Reinforcement Learning\nAhmed Qureshi, Jacob Johnson,\nYuzhe Qin\n,\n                  Taylor Henderson, Byron Boots, Michael Yip\nInternational Conference of Learning Representation\n(ICLR)\n2020\n[\nproject\n]\n[\npaper\n]\n[\ncode\n]\nS4G: Amodal Single-view Single-Shot SE(3) Grasp Detection in\n                    Cluttered Scenes\nYuzhe Qin*\n,\n                  Rui Chen*, Hao Zhu, Meng Song, Jing Xu, Hao Su\nConference of Robot Learning\n(CoRL)\n2019\n[\nproject\n]\n[\npaper\n]\n[\ncode\n]\n[\nvideo\n]\nWork Experience\nCo-Founder, Dexmate\n2024 - Now\nResearch Intern, NVIDIA\n06/12/2022 - 02/10/2023\nAI Resident, Google X\n05/15/2020 - 09/24/2020\nProfessional Activities\nWorkshop Organizer:\n3rd Workshop on Dexterous Manipulation:\n                Learning and Control with Diverse Data\n@RSS 2025\nLearning Robot Fine and Dexterous Manipulation:\n                  Perception and Control  Workshop\n@CoRL 2024\n2nd Workshop on Dexterous Manipulation:\n                Design, Perception and Control\n@RSS 2024\nLearning\n                  Dexterous Manipulation Workshop\n@RSS 2023\nTutorial Organizer:\nBuilding and Working in Environments for Embodied AI\n@CVPR 2022\nChallenge Organizer:\nOpen Cloud Robot Table Organization Challenge\n                  (OCRTOC)\n@IROS 2020, @ICRA 2021\nJournal Reviewer: IJRR, T-RO, RA-L, T-PAMI, JMLR, PRL\nConference Reviewer:\nRobotics: RSS, CoRL, ICRA, IROS\nComputer Vision: CVPR, ICCV, ECCV\nMachine Learning: ICLR, ICML, NeurIPS, AAAI\nOthers: SIGGRAPH, 3DV"
