    "homepage_text": "Zongqi Wan\nZongqi Wan\nHome\nResearch\nTeaching\nCollaborators\nNotes\nZongqi Wan\nAssistant Professor,\nSchool of Computing and Information Technology,\nGreat Bay University\nSongshan Lake, Dongguan, Guangdong Province, China\nemail:\nAbout Me\nI am an Assistant Professor at the School of Computing and Information Technology, Great Bay University. Previously, I received my Ph.D. from the Institute of Computing Technology, Chinese Academy of Sciences. (Under the supervision of Prof. Jialin Zhang and Prof. Xiaoming Sun.) \r\n\tBefore that, I received a B.Sc. from the Hua Loo-Keng class at Shandong University, majoring in applied mathematics. I am interested in several directions of theoretical computer science and machine learning, including bandit theory, submodular maximization, and mechanism design.\n招生信息\n我担任2026年秋季入学的大湾区大学-南方科技大学硕士生联培项目的导师，详情请关注https://www.gbu.edu.cn/detail/article/1532\nNews\n[Oct., 2025] A paper is accepted by SODA 2026.\n[Sep., 2025] A paper is accepted by NeurIPS 2025.\n[May, 2025] Completed my PhD thesis defense, I will join the\nGreat Bay University\nas an Assistant Professor in late July.\n[May, 2025]\nA paper\nis accepted by Theoretical Computer Science\n[Jan., 2025]\nA paper\nis accepted by ICLR 2025.\n[July, 2024] Back to Beijing\n[April, 2024]\nA paper\nis accepted by EC 2024.\n[Mar, 2024] I am visiting\nProf. John C.S. Lui\nat Chinese University of Hong Kong.\n[April, 2023] A paper is accepted by ICML 2023.\nPage generated by\njemdoc+MathJax\n."
  },
  "deep_homepage::Fengxiang He::https://fengxianghe.github.io/": {
    "homepage": "https://fengxianghe.github.io/",
