    "homepage_text": "﻿\nXipeng Qiu\nXipeng Qiu\nProfessor, School of Computer Science, Fudan University\nHome\n|\nStudents\n|\nSelected Publications\n|\n中文\nLink\nEmail\nGithub\nWeibo\nZhihu\nContact\nBuilding 2X, No. 2005 Songhu Road,Shanghai, China\nAbout Me\nXipeng Qiu is a professor at the School of Computer Science, Fudan University. He received his B.S. and Ph.D. degrees from Fudan University. His research interests include natural language processing and deep learning. He has published more than 60 top journal/conference papers (e.g., TACL, TKDE, T-ALS, ACL, EMNLP, IJCAI, AAAI, ICCV). \n\t\t\t\t\t\tHe also leads the development of [\nGitHub\n] \t[\nGoogle Code\n] and\nFastNLP\n[\nGitHub\n].\nAwards\nYoung Talent Program of China Association for Science and Technology, 2015\nAdversarial Multi-Criteria Learning for Chinese Word Segmentation\n, ACL 2017 Outstanding Paper Award\nHow to Fine-Tune BERT for Text Classification?\n, CCL 2019 Best Paper Award\nAminer \"Most Influential Scholar Award Honorable Mention\", 2020\nProfessional Activity\nPC/SPC\nACL (2014, 2015,2016,2017,2018,2019), EMNLP (2012, 2013, 2014,2015,2017,2020)\nAAAI (2019,2020), IJCAI (2015,2016,2018,2019,2020)\nArea Chair\nACL (2020), EMNLP (2019), AACL (2020)\nCCL (2018,2019), CCKS (2016,2017), NLPCC-ICCPOL (2016)\nPC Chair\nIALP (2019)\nCourses\nCompilers\n, for UG students\nNeural Networks and Deep Learning\n, for PG students\nText Management and Analysis\n, for UG students"
  },
