 Zhou, Tao Gui, Zuxuan Wu, Xipeng Qiu, Qi Zhang, Xuanjing Huang, Yu-Gang Jiang, Di Wang, Shunyu Yao. CL-bench: A Benchmark for Context Learning. arXiv:2602.03587, 2026.\nTalks\nIntelligent Social Media Mining Based on Deep Learning\nJune 06, 2021\nInvited Talk at 2021 Global Artificial Intelligence Technology Conference 'Development and Challenges' Intelligent Media Special Forum, Hangzhou, China\n基于深度学习的智能社会媒体挖掘\nJune 06, 2021\nInvited Talk at 2021年全球人工智能技术大会 “发展与挑战”智能媒体专题论坛, 杭州，中国\nRobustness Issues in Information Extraction\nJune 02, 2022\nInvited talk at Beijing Zhiyuan Conference Natural Language Processing Forum, Beijing, China\n信息提取的鲁棒性问题\nJune 02, 2022\nInvited talk at 北京智源大会自然语言处理论坛, 北京, 中国\nIncorporating Dynamic Structures into Pre-trained Language Models\nJuly 22, 2022\nInvited Talk at Workshop on Dynamic Neural Networks, International Conference on Machine Learning, Baltimore, USA\nInterpretability Analysis of Artificial Intelligence - A Case Study in Natural Language Processing\nJuly 22, 2022\nInvited Talk at 2022 China Multimedia Conference, Guiyang, China\n人工智能的的可解释性分析–以自然语言处理为例\nJuly 22, 2022\nInvited Talk at 2022年中国多媒体大会, 贵阳，中国\nNatural Language Processing and Representation Learning\nNovember 02, 2022\nInvited Talk at Frontier Forum on Intelligent Education, East China Normal University, Shanghai\n自然语言处理与表示学习\nNovember 02, 2022\n特邀报告 at 智能教育前沿论坛, 华东师范大学,上海\nTeaching\nNatural Language Processing"
