    "homepage_text": "Zhiliang Peng\nZhiliang Peng\nPh.D. candidate\nRoom 330, Academy 2 Building\nSchool of Electronic, Electrical and Communication Engineering\nUniversity of Chinese Academy of Sciences\nBeijing, China, 101408.\nEmail:\npengzhiliang19@mails.ucas.ac.cn\n;\nGithub:\nhttps://github.com/pengzhiliang\n;\nGoogle scholar:\nhttps://scholar.google.com\nBiography\nI am a Ph.D. candidate of\nPRISDL\nin the\nSchool of Electronic, Electrical and Communication Engineering\n,\nUniversity of Chinese Academy of Sciences\n, \n    advised by\nProf. Qixiang Ye\n. \n    I got a B.E. degree in Huazhong University of Science and Technology, Wuhan in June 2019.\nPresently, I am an intern at Microsoft Research, working with\nDr. Li Dong\n.\nMy research interests include computer vision and deep learning, specifically for representation learning.\nPublications\n*\nZhiliang Peng\n, *Wenhui Wang, *Li Dong, Yaru Hao, Shaohan Huang, Shuming Ma, Furu Wei\nKosmos-2: Grounding Multimodal Large Language Models to the World\n[\nPaper\n]\n          [\nDemo\n]\n          [\nCode\n]\n*Wei Huang, *\nZhiliang Peng\n, Li Dong, Furu Wei, Jianbin Jiao, Qixiang Ye\nGeneric-to-Specific Distillation of Masked Autoencoders\nProceedings of the IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition, 2023\n[\nPaper\n]\n          [\nCode\n]\nZhiliang Peng\n, Zonghao Guo, Wei Huang, Yaowei Wang, Lingxi Xie, Jianbin Jiao, Qixiang Ye\nConformer: Local features coupling global representations for visual recognition and detection\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence, 2023\n[\nPaper\n]\n          [\nCode\n]\nZhiliang Peng\n, Li Dong, Hangbo Bao, Qixiang Ye, Furu Wei\nA Unified View of Masked Image Modeling\nTransactions on Machine Learning Research, 2023\n[\nPaper\n]\n          [\nCode\n]\nHongyu Wang, Shuming Ma, Shaohan Huang, Li Dong, Wenhui Wang,\nZhiliang Peng\n, Yu Wu, Payal Bajaj, Saksham Singhal, Alon Benhaim, Barun Patra, Zhun Liu, Vishrav Chaudhary, Xia Song, Furu Wei\nFoundation Transformers\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning, 2023\n[\narXiv preprint\n]\nWenhui Wang, Hangbo Bao, Li Dong, Johan Bjorck,\nZhiliang Peng\n, Qiang Liu, Kriti Aggarwal, Owais Khan Mohammed, Saksham Singhal, Subhojit Som, Furu Wei\nImage as a Foreign Language: BEiT Pretraining for All Vision and Vision-Language Tasks\nProceedings of the IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition, 2023\n[\nPaper\n]\n          [\nCode\n]\nZhiliang Peng\n, Li Dong, Hangbo Bao, Qixiang Ye, Furu Wei\nBEiT v2: Masked Image Modeling with Vector-Quantized Visual Tokenizers\n[\narXiv preprint\n]\n          [\nCode\n]\nXiaosong Zhang, Feng Liu,\nZhiliang Peng\n, Zonghao Guo, Fang Wan, Xiangyang Ji, Qixiang Ye\nIntegral Migrating Pre-trained Transformer Encoder-decoders for Visual Object Detection\n[\narXiv preprint\n]\nZhiliang Peng\n, Wei Huang, Shanzhi Gu, Lingxi Xie, Yaowei Wang, Jianbin Jiao, Qixiang Ye\nConformer: Local features coupling global representations for visual recognition\nProceedings of the IEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision, 2021\n[\nPaper\n]\n          [\nCode\n]\nWei Gao, Fang Wan, Xingjia Pan,\nZhiliang Peng\n, Qi Tian, Zhenjun Han, Bolei Zhou, Qixiang Ye\nTS-CAM: Token Semantic Coupled Attention Map for Weakly Supervised Object Localization\nProceedings of the IEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision, 2021\n[\nPaper\n]\n          [\nCode\n]\nZhiliang Peng\n, Wei Huang, Zonghao Guo, Xiaosong Zhang, Jianbin Jiao, Qixiang Ye\nLong-tailed Distribution Adaptation\nProceedings of the 29th ACM International Conference on Multimedia, 2021\n[\nPaper\n]\n          [\nCode\n]\nGithub Statistics\nStatistics"
