    "homepage_text": "Peng Wang's Homepage\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nPeng Wang's Homepage\nI currently work at Microsoft (Redmond\n, WA\n) as a Data Scientist.\nBefore joined Microsoft, I got my Ph.D. degree from Indiana University Bloomington. I was honored to be advised by\nProf. XiaoFeng Wang\n. My research interests focused on data-driven security (ML and NLP), anti-fraud/abuse, mobile security, web security and dynamic/static code analysis.\nPeng Wang (王鹏)\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\n\n---\n\nPeng Wang's Homepage - Contact\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nPeng Wang's Homepage\nContact\nEmail\n:  pengwang11 AT gmail DOT com\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\n\n---\n\nPeng Wang's Homepage - Contact\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nPeng Wang's Homepage\nContact\nEmail\n:  pengwang11 AT gmail DOT com\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
