    "homepage_text": "Yixuan Wang - Homepage\nYixuan Wang\nHarbin Institute of Technology\nPhD student at HIT-SCIR\nHarbin, China\nEmail\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nHello😊, I am a 1st-year PhD student in Research Center for Social Computing and Interactive Robotics (SCIR), at Harbin Institute of Technology (HIT, China).\nMy advisor is Prof.\nWanxiang Che\n.\nPreviously, my primary research interests were centered on deep learning for natural language generation (NLG), such as grammatical error correction. Recently, I have shifted my focus to studying efficient inference for large language models, particularly in the area of speculative decoding.\nMy main research interest is\nefficient LLMs\n, including inference acceleration and synthetic data.\nIf you are interested in my research or potential collaborations, please feel free to reach out to me at\nyixuanwang@ir.hit.edu.cn\n.\nIf you like the template of this homepage, welcome to star and fork Yi Ren’s open-sourced template version\nAcadHomepage\n.\n🔥 News\n2026.01\n:  🎉🎉 Our\nProxyAttn\nis accepted by ICLR 2026.\n2025.11\n:  🎉🎉 Our\nJudge Q\nand\nCAMERA\nare accepted by AAAI 2026.\n2025.08\n:  🎉🎉 Our\nLookAhead Q-Cache\n(Main) is accepted by EMNLP 2025.\n2025.05\n:  🎉🎉 Our\nToken Recycling\n(Main) and\nTagEvol\n(Findings) are accepted by ACL 2025.\n2024.09\n:  🎉🎉 Our\nMake-Some-Noise\nis accepted by EMNLP 2024.\n2024.09\n:  🎉🎉 Celebrate the birth of the homepage.\n📝 Publications\n🚀\nSpeculative Decoding\nThink Before You Accept: Semantic Reflective Verification for Faster Speculative Decoding\n,\nYixuan Wang\n, Yijun Liu, Shiyu Ji, Yuzhuang Xu, Yang Xu, Qingfu Zhu, Wanxiang Che.\nTurning Trash into Treasure: Accelerating Inference of Large Language Models with Token Recycling\n, Xianzhen Luo,\nYixuan Wang\n, Qingfu Zhu, Zhiming Zhang, Xuanyu Zhang, Qing Yang, Dongliang Xu, Wanxiang Che.\n[\ncode\n]\nMake Some Noise: Unlocking Language Model Parallel Inference Capability through Noisy Training\n,\nYixuan Wang\n*, Xianzhen Luo*, Fuxuan Wei, Yijun Liu, Qingfu Zhu, Xuanyu Zhang, Qing Yang, Dongliang Xu, Wanxiang Che.\n[\ncode\n]\n⚡️\nKV Cache Compression\nCommonKV: Compressing KV Cache with Cross-layer Parameter Sharing\n,\nYixuan Wang\n*, Haoyu Qiao*, Lujun Li, Qingfu Zhu, Wanxiang Che.\n[\ncode\n]\nJudge Q: Trainable Queries for Optimized Information Retention in KV Cache Eviction\n, Yijun Liu,\nYixuan Wang\n, Yuzhuang Xu, Shiyu Ji, Yang Xu, Qingfu Zhu, Wanxiang Che.\nLookahead Q-Cache: Achieving More Consistent KV Cache Eviction via Pseudo Query\n,\nYixuan Wang\n*, Shiyu Ji*, Yijun Liu, Yuzhuang Xu, Yang Xu, Qingfu Zhu, Wanxiang Che.\n[\ncode\n]\n👀\nEfficient Attention\nProxyAttn: Guided Sparse Attention via Representative Heads\n,\nYixuan Wang\n, Huang He, Siqi Bao, Hua Wu, Haifeng Wang, Qingfu Zhu, Wanxiang Che.\n[\ncode\n]\n📊\nData Augmentation\nTag-Evol: Achieving Efficient Instruction Evolving via Tag Injection\n,\nYixuan Wang\n*, Shiqi Zhou*, Chuanzhe Guo, Qingfu Zhu.\n[\ncode\n]\nImproving Grammatical Error Correction via Contextual Data Augmentation\n,\nYixuan Wang\n, Baoxin Wang, Yijun Liu, Qingfu Zhu, Dayong Wu, Wanxiang Che.\n[\ncode\n]\n🖊\nGrammatical Error Correction\nLM-Combiner: A Contextual Rewriting Model for Chinese Grammatical Error Correction\n,\nYixuan Wang\n, Baoxin Wang, Yijun Liu, Dayong Wu, Wanxiang Che.\n[\ncode\n]\nAdaptive Unsupervised Self training for Disfluency Detection\n, Zhongyuan Wang,\nYixuan Wang\n, Shaolei Wang, Wanxiang Che.\n[\ncode\n]\n🎖 Honors and Awards\nThe Prize of First Class for the Wu Wenjun Science and Technology Award\n(吴文俊人工智能科技进步一等奖), 2024\nNational Scholarship\n, 2023\nAcademic Scholarship, First Class 2022\nPeople’s Scholarship (2018, 2019, 2020)\n1st place\nin Chinese Essay Fluency Evaluation, CCL2023\n📖 Educations\n2022.09 - Now\n, Master-Phd Student, Harbin Institute of Technology, Harbin.\n2018.09 - 2022.06\n, Undergraduate, Harbin Institute of Technology, Harbin.\n💻 Internships\n2025.06 - Present\n, Baidu, China.\n2023.06 - 2023.09\n, Joint Laboratory of HIT and iFLYTEK Research (HFL), China.\n🌍 Visitors\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected.\n\n---\n\nRedirecting…\nRedirecting…\nClick here if you are not redirected."
  },
