    "homepage_text": "Xueyang Fu | USTC\nXueyang Fu\n傅雪阳\nPh.D.\nUniversity of Science and Technology of China, Anhui, China\nxyfu@ustc.edu.cn\nI am a professor with the\nDepartment of Automation\n,\nUSTC (中国科学技术大学)\n.\nIn 2018, I received my Ph.D. in Signal and Information Processing from\nXiamen University (厦门大学)\n, advised by\nProf. Xinghao Ding (丁兴号 教授)\nat\nSmartDSP Lab\n.\nFrom Dec. 2016 to Dec. 2017, I was a visiting Ph.D. student, sponsored by the\nChina Scholarship Council\n, at\nColumbia University\n, working there with\nProf. John Paisley\n.\nMy research interest includes Computer Vision and Machine Learning.\nSelected Publications\n(\nfull list\n)\n:\nGoogle Scholar Profile\n( 15,000+ citations, h-index 52 )\nAE or Youth Editorial Board:\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (\nTNNLS\n), 2026.01. - present\nMachine Intelligence Research (\nMIR\n), 2026.01. - present\nJournal of Intelligent Computing and Networking (\nJICN\n), 2025.11. - present\nRemote Sensing,\nSpecial Issue: Hyperspectral Image Analysis via Advanced Deep Learning and Computer Vision\n, 2025.12. - 2026.06.\nArea Chair or Senior Program Committee:\nAAAI  2021 - 2026\nICLR   2026\nIJCAI   2026\nICME  2026\nPRCV  2023 - 2025\nCo-authors and friends:\nProf. Yue Huang\nProf. Delu Zeng\nProf. Peixian Zhuang\nProf. Xiangyong Cao\nDr. Liyan Sun\nProf. Zhiwen Fan\nVisitors:"
  },
  "deep_homepage::Song Han::https://hanlab.mit.edu/songhan": {
    "homepage": "https://hanlab.mit.edu/songhan",
