    "homepage_text": "Hongwei Qin's Homepage\nHongwei Qin (Dr.red)\nPh.D.\nCurriculum Vitae\nE-Mail:\nqhw12@Tsinghua is closed, please do NOT email me\nHomepage:\nhttp://qinhongwei.com\nEducation\nPh.D.\nSep. 2012 - June 2017, \n  Department of Automation, Tsinghua University, Beijing, China\nB.Eng.\nOct. 2008 - July 2012, Department of Automation, Tsinghua University, Beijing, \n  China\nResearch Interests\nDeep Learning for Computational Photography and Visual Recognition\nAutoML, ISP, Image and Video Understanding, including Image Denoising, Super-Resolution, Image Enhancement, Face Detection, Object Detection, Visual Tracking, Action Recognition, as well as AutoML for these vision applications, such as Quantization, Neural Architecture Search\nPublications\n[0]. Wei Gao, Yi Wei, Quanquan Li,\nHongwei Qin\n, Wanli Ouyang, Junjie Yan. Pruning with Hints: An Efficient Framework for Model Acceleration. (Tech Report, 2018).\nPaper\n[1]. Yi Wei, Xinyu Pan,\nHongwei Qin\n, Wanli Ouyang, Junjie Yan. Quantization Mimic: Towards Very Tiny CNN for Object Detection. (ECCV 2018).\nPaper\n[2]. Congrui Hetang,\nHongwei Qin\n, Shaohui Liu, Junjie Yan. Impression Network for Video Object Detection. (Arxiv Tech Report, 2017).\nPaper\n[3]. Mask-FCN. rejected by ICCV 2017. So we choose to keep it private until we make enough money using this tech\n[4]. Zekun Hao, Yu Liu,\nHongwei Qin\n, Junjie Yan, Xiu Li, Xiaolin Hu.  Scale-Aware Face Detection. In CVPR, 2017, Honolulu, USA.\nPaper\n[5].\nHongwei Qin\n,  Junjie Yan, Xiu Li, Xiaolin Hu.  Joint Training of Cascaded CNN for Face Detection. In CVPR, 2016, Las Vegas, USA.\nPaper\n[6].\nHongwei Qin\n, Xiu Li, Yangang  Wang, Yongbing  Zhang, Qionghai Dai.  DEPT: Depth Estimation by Parameter Transfer with a Lightweight Model for Single Still Images. IEEE Trans. on CSVT, 2016.\nPaper\n[7].\nHongwei  Qin\n, Xiu Li, Jian Liang, Yigang Peng, Changshui Zhang.  DeepFish: Accurate Underwater Live Fish Recognition with a Deep Architecture. Neurocomputing, 2015.\nProject\n,\nPaper\n[8].  Xiu Li,\nHongwei Qin\n,  Yangang  Wang, Yongbing  Zhang, Qionghai Dai.  DEPT: Depth Estimation by Parameter Transfer for Single Still Images. In ACCV,  Nov. 2014, Singapore.\nPaper\n[9].\nHongwei  Qin\n, Yigang Peng, Xiu Li. Foreground  Extraction of Underwater Videos via Sparse and Low-Rank Matrix Decomposition.  In ICPR Workshop on Computer Vision  for Analysis of Underwater Imagery,  Aug. 2014,  Stockholm, Sweden. [Oral Presentation]\nPaper\n[10].\nHongwei  Qin\net al.\nVisualizations of iPhone5s Topic Trends on Twitter and Weibo. 2013.\nVisualization Demo\n,\nTechnical Report\nAcademic Activities\nReviewer: IJCV, ECCV, CVPR, ICCV, WACV, BMVC, ACCV\nVisitor: The Intelligent Modelling & Analysis  Research Group, The University of Nottingham, UK. Invited by Prof. Uwe Aickelin. Jul.-Aug., 2011\nVisitor: Web Science DTC, University of Southampton, UK. Invited by Prof. Wendy Hall. Nov., 2013\nIntern:\nSenseTime\n. Object Detection Team, Research Center. From Summer, 2015 to Summer 2017. I spent a long and happy time doing research on face detection.\nFormer Interns\nZekun Hao, Undergraduate@Beihang, now PhD@Cornell\nCongrui Hetang, Undergraduate@Beihang, now Master@CMU\nZhen Dong, Undergraduate@Peking University, now PhD@Berkeley\nHonors and Awards\nNational Ph.D. Fellowship, 2014\nLinks\nHomepage\nGoogle Scholar Citations\nTsinghua University\nCurriculum Vitae"
