    "homepage_text": "Hui Liu\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nHui Liu\nHui Liu\nWelcome to my website. I'm a PhD Candidate in Economics, University of Toronto.\nMy\nresearch interests are in\nIndustr\nia\nl Organization, Applied Microeconomics and Econometrics\n.\nMy current research focuses on demand estimation of products with varying availabilities. Unlike existing literature relying on observable information about product availabilities, I choose to recover unobserved product availabilities from firms' profit maximization conditions.\nI am happy to announce that I will be joining the Ma Yinchu School of Economics at Tianjin University as an assistant professor this Fall.\nEmail: yihui.liu@mail.utoronto.ca\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\n\n---\n\nHui Liu - Contact\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nHui Liu\nContact\nEmail:\nyihui.liu@mail.utoronto.ca\nDepartment of Economics, University of Toronto\n150 St. George Street, Toronto, ON, Canada, M5S 3G7\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\n\n---\n\nHui Liu - Contact\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nHui Liu\nContact\nEmail:\nyihui.liu@mail.utoronto.ca\nDepartment of Economics, University of Toronto\n150 St. George Street, Toronto, ON, Canada, M5S 3G7\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\n\n---\n\nHui Liu - CV\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nHui Liu\nCV\nYou can find my CV by clicking on the following link:\nHui Liu CV\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
  },
