or for Binding-aware 3D Molecule Diffusion Models,\nICLR 2024\n.\n[20]\nQiqi Bao, Zheng Hui, Rui Zhu, Peiran Ren, Xuansong Xie, and\nWenming Yang\n*: Improving Diffusion-Based Image Restoration with Error Contraction and Error Correction,\nAAAI 2024\n.\n[21]\nZhilin Huang, Ling Yang, Zaixi Zhang, Xiangxin Zhou, Yu Bao, Xiawu Zheng, Yuwei Yang, Yu Wang,\nWenming Yang\n*: Binding-Adaptive Diffusion Models for Structure-Based Drug Design,\nAAAI 2024\n.\n[22]\nPengyang Zhao\n,\nYizhuo Song\n,\nSiqi Wang\n,\nJing-Hao Xue\n,\nShuping Zhao\n,\nQingmin Liao\n,\nWenming Yang\n*: VPCFormer: A transformer-based multi-view finger vein recognition model and a new benchmark,\nPattern Recognition(PR).\n148\n: 110170 (2024).\n[23]\nYanjun Liu,\nWenming Yang*\n, Qingmin Liao,\nDiffVein: A Unified Diffusion Network for Finger Vein Segmentation and Authentication\n,\nIEEE Trans. on Circuits Systems & Video Technology(IEEE TCSVT).\n34(12): 12977-12990 (2024).\n[24]\nSiqi Wang, Yehu Shen,\nWenming Yang\n*, Touchless Finger Vein and Fingerprint Verification via Exploiting Attention-Based Cross-Domain Fusion,\nIEEE Trans. on Circuits Systems & Video Technology(IEEE TCSVT)\n, (2024) Early Access.\n[25]\nPengyang Zhao, Shuping Zhao, Jing-Hao Xue,\nWenming Yang\n*, Qingmin Liao: The neglected background cues can facilitate finger vein recognition,\nPattern Recognition(PR)\n. 136: 109199 (2023).\n[26]\nYiyun Chen, Yunmeng Liu, Mingliang Chen, Zirui Wang\n，\nWenming Yang\n*\n，\nQingmin Liao: Blind JPEG Compression Artifacts Removal by Integrating Channel Regulation with Exit Strategy,\nIEEE Trans. on Multimedia(IEEE TMM)\n, 25(11):7274-7286 (2023).\n[27]\nHai Wang,\nWenming Yang\n*, Qingmin Liao, Jie Zhou: Bi-RSTU: Bidirectional Recurrent Upsampling Network for Space-Time Video Super-Resolution,\nIEEE Trans. on Multimedia(IEEE TMM)\n, 25(6): 4742-4751(2023).\n[28]\nYizhuo Song, Pengyang Zhao,\nWenming Yang\n*, Qingmin Liao, Jie Zhou: EIFNet: An Explicit and Implicit Feature Fusion Network for Finger Vein Verification,\nIEEE Trans. on Circuits Systems & Video Technol(IEEE TCSVT)\n, 33(5): 2520-2532 (2023)\n[29]\nBin Xia, Yapeng Tian, Yulun Zhang, Yucheng Hang,\nWenming Yang\n*, Qingmin Liao :Meta-Learning-Based Degradation Representation for Blind Super-Resolution.\nIEEE Trans. on Image Processing(IEEE TIP)\n, 32: 3383-3396 (2023)\n[30]\nYi Chen, Yang Dong, Lu Si,\nWenming Yang*\n, Shan Du, Xuewu Tian, Chao Li, Qingmin Liao, Hui Ma: Dual Polarization Modality Fusion Network for Assisting Pathological Diagnosis.\nIEEE Trans. on Medical Imaging(IEEE TMI)\n, 42(1): 304-316 (2023)\n[31]\nBin Xia, Jingwen He, Yulun Zhang, Yitong Wang, Yapeng Tian,\nWenming Yang*\n, Luc Van Gool: Structured Sparsity Learning for Efficient Video Super-Resolution,\nCVPR 2023\n.\n[32]\nBin Xia, Yulun Zhang, Yitong Wang, Yapeng Tian,\nWenming Yang*\n, Radu Timofte, Luc Van Gool: Basic Binary Convolution Unit for Binarized Image Restoration Network,\nICLR 2023.\n[33]\nBin Xia, Yulun Zhang, Yitong Wang, Yapeng Tian,\nWenming Yang*\n, Radu Timofte, Luc Van Gool: Knowledge Distillation based Degradation Estimation for Blind Super-Resolution,\nICLR 2023.\n[34]\nRuofan Zhang, Jinjin Gu, Haoyu Chen, Chao Dong, Yulun Zhang,\nWenming Yang*\n: Crafting Training Degradation Distribution for the Accuracy-Generalization Trade-off in Real-World Super-Resolution,\nICML 2023\n.\n[35]\nYingfan Tao, Jingna Sun, Hao Yang, Li Chen,\nWenming Yang\n*, Daniel Du, Min Zheng, Local and Global Logit Adjustments for Long-Tailed Learning,\nICCV 2023\n.\n[36]\nBin Xia, Yulun Zhang , Shiyin Wang, Yitong Wang, Xinglong Wu, Yapeng Tian,\nWenming Yang*\n, Luc Van Gool: DiffIR: Efficient Diffusion Model for Image Restoration,\nICCV 2023.\n[37]\nYue Lv, Jinxi Xiang, Jun Zhang,\nWenming Yang*\n, Xiao Han, Wei Yang: Dynamic Low-Rank Instance Adaptation for Universal Neural Image Compression,\nACM MM 2023\n.\n[38]\nXiuzhe Wu, Pengfei Hu, Yang Wu, Xiaoyang Lyu, Yan-Pei Cao, Ying Shan,\nWenming Yang\n, Zhongqian Sun, Xiaojuan Qi: Speech2Lip: High-fidelity Speech to Lip Generation by Learning from a Short Video,\nICCV 2023\n.\n[39]\nQiqi Bao; Yunmeng Liu; Bowen Gang;\nWenming Yang*\n; Qingmin Liao, SCTANet: A Spatial Attention-Guided CNN-Transformer Aggregation Network for Deep Face Image Super-Resolution,\nIEEE Trans. on Multimedia(IEEE TMM)\n, 25(1)\n:\n8554-8565(2023).\n[40]\nYizhuo Song; Pengyang Zhao; Siqi Wang; Qingmin Liao;\nWenming Yang*\n. Study of 3D Finger Vein Biometrics on Imaging Device Design and Multi-View Verification.\nIEEE Trans. Circuits Systems & Video Technology(IEEE TCSVT)\n, 34(4): 3043-3048(2023).\n[41]\nWenhao Li, Hong Liu*, Runwei Ding, Mengyuan Liu, Pichao Wang,\nWenming Yang\n: Exploiting Temporal Contexts with Strided Transformer for 3D Human Pose Estimation,\nIEEE Trans. on Multimedia(IEEE TMM)\n, 25(1): 1282-1293 (2023).\n[42]\nQiqi Bao , Yunmeng Liu , Bowen Gang ,\nWenming Yang*\n, Qingmin Liao:S2Net: Shadow Mask-Based Semantic-Aware Network for Single-Image Shadow Removal,\nIEEE Trans. on Consumer Electronics(IEEE TCE)\n, 68(3): 209-220 (2022)\n[43]\nPengyang Zhao , Shuping Zhao , Luyang Chen,\nWenming Yang*\n, Qingmin Liao:Exploiting Multiperspective Driven Hierarchical Content-Aware Network for Finger Vein Verification.\nIEEE Trans. Circuits Systems & Video Technology(IEEE TCSVT)\n, 32(11): 7938-7950 (2022).\n[44]\nYingfan Tao , Wenxian Zheng,\nWenming Yang*\n, Guijin Wang , Qingmin Liao: Frontal-Centers Guided Face: Boosting Face Recognition by Learning Pose-Invariant Features,\nIEEE Trans. on Information & Forensics Security(IEEE TIFS)\n, 17(6): 2272-2283 (2022).\n[45...[truncated]"
