    "homepage_text": "Jiahao Yang â Research Associate\nRESEARCH ASSOCIATE Â· UNIVERSITY OF BATH\nJiahao\nYang\nMultimodal interaction Â· Embodied intelligence Â· Autonomous experimentation\nABOUT ME\nPROJECTS\nABOUT\nResearch Focus\nI am a Research Associate at the\nInstitute for Digital Security and Behavior\n,\n        University of Bath. My research explores multimodal interaction and embodied intelligence,\n        and leverages large-scale unstructured data to investigate digital and offline security challenges.\nPosition\nResearch Associate\nInstitution\nUniversity of Bath\nDepartment\nInstitute for Digital Security and Behavior\nResearch Interests\nMultimodal Interaction\nGesture, speech, and facial expression in communication\nEmbodied Intelligence\nHow bodily and sensory experience shapes cognition and interaction\nAutonomous Experimentation\nExploring technologies that enable large-scale behavioral studies\nData & Security\nUsing large-scale unstructured data to explore digital and offline security\nPUBLICATIONS\nResearch Output\nNo publications yet.\nPROJECTS\nRecent Work\nNo projects yet.\nWHERE YOU CAN FIND ME\nUpcoming Events\nNo upcoming events.\nBLOG / NEWS\nLatest Updates\nNo posts yet.\nCONTACT\nGet In Touch\nEMAIL\njy2154@bath.ac.uk\nINSTITUTION\nInstitute for Digital Security and Behaviour\nGOOGLE SCHOLAR\nProfile â\nGITHUB\n@JH-Eric-Yang â"
  },
