    "homepage_text": "Yuxin Zhang – Generative AI Researcher\nYuxin Zhang\nResearcher of Generative AI\nByteDance\nyuxin.zhazel [at] gmail [dot] com\nGoogle Scholar\n|\nGitHub\nAbout Me\nI recently joined\nByteDance\nas a Researcher of Generative AI. Previously, I received my Ph.D. in Computer Science from the National Laboratory of Pattern Recognition,\nInstitute of Automation, Chinese Academy of Sciences\n, advised by Prof. Changsheng Xu and Prof. Weiming Dong. I obtained my B.S. in Automation from\nTsinghua University\nin 2020.\nMy research sits at the intersection of\nComputer Vision\nand\nComputer Graphics\n, focusing on building interactive, interpretable, and creative generative models. Currently, I work on\nGenerative AI\n,\nMultimedia\n, and\nComputational Art\n.\nNews\n2025.05\n🎉\nMotionCrafter: Plug-and-Play Motion Guidance for Diffusion Models\naccepted to\nIEEE TVCG\n[Code]\n2025.04\n🎉\nB4M: Breaking Low-Rank Adapter for Making Content-Style Customization\naccepted to\nACM TOG\n[Code]\n2025.01\n🎉\nIP-Prompter: Training-Free Theme-Specific Image Generation via Dynamic Visual Prompting\naccepted to\nACM SIGGRAPH 2025\n[Code]\nWork Experience\nByteDance\nResearcher of Generative AI\nJuly 2025 – Present\nPublications\nIP-Prompter: Training-Free Theme-Specific Image Generation via Dynamic Visual Prompting\nY Zhang, M Luo, W Dong, X Yang, H Huang, C Ma, O Deussen, TY Lee, CS Xu\nSIGGRAPH 2025\n[Code]\nMotionCrafter: Plug-and-Play Motion Guidance for Diffusion Models\nY Zhang, W Dong, F Tang, N Huang, H Huang, C Ma, C Xu\nIEEE TVCG\n[Code]\nInversion-Based Style Transfer With Diffusion Models\nY Zhang, N Huang, F Tang, H Huang, C Ma, W Dong, C Xu\nCVPR 2023\n[Code]\nDomain Enhanced Arbitrary Image Style Transfer via Contrastive Learning\nY Zhang, F Tang, W Dong, H Huang, C Ma, TY Lee, C Xu\nSIGGRAPH 2022\n[Code]\nProSpect: Prompt Spectrum for Attribute-Aware Personalization of Diffusion Models\nY Zhang, W Dong, F Tang, N Huang, H Huang, C Ma, TY Lee, O Deussen, C Xu\nSIGGRAPH Asia 2023 / ACM TOG\n[Code]\nA Unified Arbitrary Style Transfer Framework via Adaptive Contrastive Learning\nY Zhang, F Tang, W Dong, H Huang, C Ma, TY Lee, C Xu\nACM TOG\n[Code]\nLumiSculpt: A Consistency Lighting Control Network for Video Generation\nY Zhang, D Zheng, B Gong, J Chen, M Yang, W Dong, C Xu\narXiv\nPortrait Map Art Generation by Asymmetric Image-to-Image Translation\nY Zhang, F Tang, W Dong, TNH Le, C Xu, TY Lee\nLeonardo"
