    "homepage_text": "J. Sohn\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nJ. Sohn\nJy-yong Sohn (손지용)\nAssistant Professor,\nDepartment of Applied Statistics,\nYonsei University\nWebsite:\nitml.yonsei.ac.kr\nEmail:\njysohn1108@gmail.com\nPlease visit my\nlatest website\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\n\n---\n\nJ. Sohn - Contact\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nJ. Sohn\nAddress:\n1550 Engineering Dr, Madison, WI 53706\nUnited States of America\nOffice:\n+1-(608)-960-0576\nEmail:\njysohn1108@gmail.com\nsohn9@wisc.edu\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\n\n---\n\nJ. Sohn - Contact\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nJ. Sohn\nAddress:\n1550 Engineering Dr, Madison, WI 53706\nUnited States of America\nOffice:\n+1-(608)-960-0576\nEmail:\njysohn1108@gmail.com\nsohn9@wisc.edu\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
