nnifer Waljee\n†\n,\nJenna Wiens\n†\npaper\ncode\nDemocratizing EHR Analyses with FIDDLE - A Flexible Data-Driven Preprocessing Pipeline for Structured Clinical Data\nJournal of the American Medical Informatics Association, 2020\nShengpu Tang\n,\nParmida Davarmanesh\n,\nYanmeng Song\n,\nMichael W. Sjoding\n,\nDanai Koutra\n,\nJenna Wiens\npaper\ncode\ntalk\nposter\nClinician-in-the-loop Decision Making: Reinforcement Learning with Near-Optimal Set-Valued Policies\nICML 2020\nShengpu Tang\n,\nAditya Modi\n,\nMichael W. Sjoding\n,\nJenna Wiens\npaper\npaper (arXiv)\ncode\nwebsite\nvideo\nvideo\nEvaluating a Widely Implemented Proprietary Deterioration Index Model Among Hospitalized COVID-19 Patients\nAnnals of the American Thoracic Society, 2021\nKarandeep Singh\n,\nThomas S. Valley\n,\nShengpu Tang\n,\nBenjamin Y. Li\n,\nFahad Kamran\n,\nMichael W. Sjoding\n,\nJenna Wiens\n,\nErkin Otles\n,\nJohn P. Donnelly\n,\nMelissa Y. Wei\n,\nJonathon P. McBride\n,\nJie Cao\n,\nCarleen Penoza\n,\nJohn Z. Ayanian\n,\nBrahmajee K. Nallamothu\npaper\ncode\nPredicting Acute Graft-versus-Host Disease Using Machine Learning and Longitudinal Vital Sign Data from Electronic Health Records\nJCO Clinical Cancer Informatics, 2020\nShengpu Tang\n,\nGrant T. Chappell\n,\nAmanda Mazzoli\n,\nMuneesh Tewari\n,\nSung Won Choi\n*\n,\nJenna Wiens\n*\npaper\ncode\nRelaxed Parameter Sharing: Effectively Modeling Time-Varying Relationships in Clinical Time-Series\nMLHC 2019\nJeeheh Oh\n*\n,\nJiaxuan Wang\n*\n,\nShengpu Tang\n,\nMichael W. Sjoding\n,\nJenna Wiens\npaper\npaper (arXiv)\ncode\nslides\nposter\nA BioHackathon on the challenges of aging: Rapid need-finding and solution modeling in a student-led event\nan 8-hour “BioHackathon” of brainstorming to tackle current challenges with “Aging”\nShengpu Tang\n,\nEt Al\npreprint\nPortfolio\n*\nAll\nGames\nVideos\nSet Sail\nCampus Movie Fest 2019\nSet Sail (part 2)\nCampus Movie Fest 2019\nFreshWalk\nEECS598-AdvDataMining@UM (Winter'19)\npandas\nContri