  "deep_homepage::Sizhe Wei::https://sizhewei.github.io/": {
    "homepage": "https://sizhewei.github.io/",
    "all_emails": [],
    "matched_email": null,
    "github": "https://github.com/SizheWei",
    "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/sizhewei/",
    "homepage_text": "Sizhe Wei\nSizhe Wei\nPh.D. Student in Robotics\nGeorgia Institute of Technology\nI'm a 2nd-year Ph.D. student in Robotics at\nGeorgia Institute of Technology\n,\n                        advised by\nProf. Lu Gan\n.\nBefore joining GaTech, I got my M.S. and B.Eng. degrees from\nShanghai Jiao Tong University (SJTU)\nin 2024 & 2021, respectively, working with\nProf. Ya Zhang\nand\nProf. Siheng Chen\n.\nMy research focuses on reinforcement learning for legged robots, including humanoid and quadruped robots, with an emphasis on locomotion and loco-manipulation. \n                        I'm also interested in developing morphologically equivariant learning architectures to improve sample efficiency, accelerate training, and enhance generalization across robot embodiments.\nSeeking Summer 2026 Internship Opportunities\nI am actively seeking\nSummer 2026 Research Internship opportunities\nin\nloco-manipulation\n,\nreinforcement learning (RL)\n,\nvision-language-action models (VLA)\n, or related areas in robotics.\nI have strong experience in reinforcement learning for legged robots, along with a solid foundation in machine learning, computer vision, and robotics. I also have hands-on real-world deployment experience on quadruped robots (Unitree Go2 and Go1) and humanoid robots (Unitree G1).\nIf my background aligns with your team's work, feel free to reach out. I'd be happy to connect!\nNews\nPublications\n*\nindicates equal contribution.\n†\nindicates co-advising. First-author or co-first-author works are highlighted.\nEducation\nGeorgia Institute of Technology\nPh.D. Student in Robotics\n2024 - Present\nShanghai Jiao Tong University\nM.S. in Information and Communication Engineering\n2021 - 2024\nB.Eng. in Information Engineering\n2017 - 2021\nServices\nJournal Reviewer:\nTR-O (2026-), RA-L (2023-)\nConference Reviewer:\nNeurIPS (2025) , CoRL (2025) , ICRA (2026)\nWorkshop Reviewer:\n4DV@CVPR (2025)\n, RoboLetics@ICRA (2025)"
  },
