    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Canzhe Zhao (赵 灿哲)\nHome\nAbout me\nPublications\nExperiences\nTalks\nHonors\nMisc.\nCanzhe Zhao (赵 灿哲)\nCanzhe Zhao\n, Ph.D. Student in Computer Science\nJohn Hopcroft Center for Computer Science\nDepartment of Computer Science & Engineering\nShanghai Jiao Tong University\n[\nGoogle Scholar\n][\nDBLP\n][\nCurriculem Vitae\n]\nAbout me\nI am a final-year Ph.D. student in computer science at\nShanghai Jiao Tong University\n, where I am fortunate to be advised by\nProf. Shuai Li\n. I received a B.Eng. in software engineering from\nShandong University\nin 2021.\nEducation\nPh.D. Student in Computer Science,\nShanghai Jiao Tong University\n, Sept. 2021 - present\nB.Eng. in Software Engineering,\nShandong University\n, Sept. 2017 - Jun. 2021\nHigh School Student,\nHenan Experimental High School\n,  Sept. 2014 - Jun. 2017\nResearch Interests\nI am broadly interested in learning theory, with a particular focus on sequential decision-making problems, including\nOnline Learning\nReinforcement Learning\nLearning in Games\nContact\nE-mail:\ncanzhezhao\n[@] sjtu [DOT] edu [DOT] cn\nAddress: 800 Dongchuan RD. Minhang District, Shanghai, China\nPage generated 2025-10-20 12:00:55 +08, by\njemdoc\n."
  },
  "deep_homepage::Kefan Dong::https://kfdong.github.io/": {
