    "homepage_text": "*\nWe use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, personalize content and analyze our traffic.\nBy clicking “OK,” you consent to our use of cookies.\nPrivacy Statement & GDPR\nOK\nSkip to main content\nEmbry-Riddle Home\n×\nMenu\nFind by Name\nFind by College\nFind by Department\nMenu\nHomepage\nFind Faculty By:\nName\nCollege\nDepartment\nHao Peng\nTitle\nAssistant Professor\nEmail\nHao.Peng@erau.edu\nEmail\nDepartment\nAerospace Engineering Department\nCollege\nCollege of Engineering\nExternal Links\nThe views expressed on faculty and external web pages are those of the author and do not necessarily represent those of Embry-Riddle Aeronautical University.\nALPENGLOW Lab website\nGoogle Scholar\nEducation\nPh.D. - Doctor of Philosophy in Flight Vehicle Design,\nBeihang University\nCurrently Teaching\nAE 544\n:\nAnalytical Dynamics\nAE 800\n:\nDissertation\nAE 313\n:\nSpace Mechanics\nAERO 313HON\n:\nSpace Mechanics\nAERO 313\n:\nSpace Mechanics\nAE 699\n:\nSpecial Topics in A/Space Engr\n\n---\n\n*\nWe use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, personalize content and analyze our traffic.\nBy clicking “OK,” you consent to our use of cookies.\nPrivacy Statement & GDPR\nOK\nSkip to main content\nEmbry-Riddle Home\n×\nMenu\nFind by Name\nFind by College\nFind by Department\nMenu\nHomepage\nFind Faculty By:\nName\nCollege\nDepartment\nNo Results Found\n\n---\n\n*\nWe use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, personalize content and analyze our traffic.\nBy clicking “OK,” you consent to our use of cookies.\nPrivacy Statement & GDPR\nOK\nSkip to main content\nEmbry-Riddle Home\n×\nMenu\nFind by Name\nFind by College\nFind by Department\nMenu\nHomepage\nFind Faculty By:\nName\nCollege\nDepartment\nNo Results Found\n\n---\n\n*\nWe use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, personalize content and analyze our traffic.\nBy clicking “OK,” you consent to our use of cookies.\nPrivacy Statement & GDPR\nOK\nSkip to main content\nEmbry